/* 雅思词根联想 3539 个词条的例句（第四十七次优化），按词条编号 i 存，并进 IELTS_RICH（rich() 先查它）。
   e/t 例句和译文（书上的，书上没有的补写，见 src/ielts_root/Lxx.tsv 的备注）；r 记（书上的词根、联想记忆）；
   c 搭配；d 派生；y 同义；f 反义。 */
window.IELTS_RICH=window.IELTS_RICH||{};Object.assign(window.IELTS_RICH,{
20001:{"w":"delve","e":"Thomas Hardy is delving into matters we all recognise because they are common to humanity.","t":"托马斯·哈代正在**探究**的是我们都能辨识的事物，因为它们是人类所共有的。","r":"联想记忆：埋在书架（shelves）里整天钻研（delve）"},
20002:{"w":"exact","e":"What is the exact amount left in your savings account?","t":"你储蓄账户上的**准确**余额是多少？","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+act（做）→做出精确的结果→精确的；准确的","d":"exactly（adv. 正确地；完全地）"},
20003:{"w":"elicit","e":"The students then were randomly assigned to watch a video clip eliciting either humour, contentment, or neutral feelings.","t":"然后，学生们被随机分配观看一段视频，这些视频要么**激发**幽默感、满足感，要么不激发情感变化。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+lic（诱骗）+it→诱骗到外面来→诱出，引出","c":"elicit no response 没有得到回应"},
20004:{"w":"traditional","e":"Rosewood is a pure example of a traditional country house of this part of England.","t":"红木建筑是英格兰这个地区**传统**乡间住宅的一个典型代表。","c":"traditional view 传统观点；traditional belief 传统信条；traditional industry 传统工业；traditional method 传统方法"},
20005:{"w":"lack","e":"Martin can't afford the book due to lack of money.","t":"由于**缺**钱，马丁买不起这本书。","c":"lack of 缺乏，没有；lack（for） nothing 什么都不缺"},
20006:{"w":"regent","e":"George acted as a regent when the present king was a child.","t":"当现任国王还是孩子时，乔治担任**摄政王**。","r":"词根记忆：reg（国王）+ent（表人）→摄政者"},
20007:{"w":"burgeon","e":"To serve the burgeoning tourist industry, an array of professionals has emerged.","t":"为了满足**日益繁荣**的旅游业的发展需求，一大批专业人员已经出现了。","r":"词根记忆：burg（=bud，花蕾）+eon→像花蕾一样成长→迅速成长"},
20008:{"w":"argue","e":"The study argues that the type of action needed against passive smoking should be similar to that being taken against other diseases.","t":"该研究**认为**人们需要采取类似防范其他疾病的行动来防范被动吸烟。","r":"发音记忆：“阿Q”→阿Q喜欢和人争论→争论","c":"argue sb. into/out of doing 说服某人做/不做某事；argue for赞成，要求；argue about 议论…；argue over 辩论/争论…","d":"arguably（adv. 可论证地，可辩解地）"},
20009:{"w":"barely","e":"Rainfall barely penetrates the soil in this area.","t":"在该地区，降雨**很少**渗入土壤。"},
20010:{"w":"hierarchy","e":"It is likely that all uniforms make symbolic sense, namely, denoting a hierarchy.","t":"很可能所有的制服都具有象征意义，即体现了穿衣人的**等级**。"},
20011:{"w":"guidance","e":"We will solicit guidance and aid from legal experts.","t":"我们将向法律专家寻求**指导**和帮助。","r":"联想记忆：guid(e)（指引，指导）+ance（表名词）→指引，指导","c":"guidance system 向导系统；moral guidance 精神指导"},
20012:{"w":"easy-going","e":"The interviews don't tell you if applicants are easy-going or hate smoking or whatever.","t":"从面试中你看不出求职者是否**随和**或者讨厌吸烟之类的。"},
20013:{"w":"electrical","e":"The small battery-powered gadget can deliver subliminal electrical pulses to the skin.","t":"这种小的电池驱动装置可以向皮肤传达微小的**电**脉冲。","c":"electrical fault 电气故障","d":"electrically（adv. 电力地）"},
20014:{"w":"electronic","e":"Computers make up the so-called electronic media.","t":"所谓的**电子**媒介是由计算机构成的。","r":"来自electric（adj. 电的）"},
20015:{"w":"philosophy","e":"Try your best to succeed—that's my philosophy.","t":"竭尽全力，取得成功——这就是我的**人生哲学**。","r":"词根记忆：philo（爱）+soph（智慧）+y（表名词）→爱智慧的学问→哲学；哲理","d":"philosopher（n. 哲学家，哲人）"},
20016:{"w":"chronic","e":"Jim suffers from chronic back pain after the car-wreck.","t":"车祸后吉姆**一直**受背痛的折磨。","r":"词根记忆：chron（时间）+ic（…的）→长时间的→（疾病）慢性的","c":"chronic problem 长期的问题；chronic smoker 积习难改的烟民；chronic disease 慢性疾病；chronic war 持久战","y":"inveterate（adj. 根深蒂固的；成癖的）"},
20017:{"w":"desirable","e":"Selecting the right person for the job involves more than identifying the essential or desirable range of skills.","t":"为一份工作选择合适的人选，不能只看此人是否拥有胜任这份工作的基本技能和**理想的**专长。","r":"来自desire（v. 渴望）"},
20018:{"w":"consortium","e":"The consortium that won the contract for the island opted for an aggressive approach.","t":"赢得这座岛屿（开发）合同的**财团**采取了一种野蛮的开发方式。","r":"联想记忆：consort（陪伴，结交）+ium→结交组成团体→社团，协会"},
20019:{"w":"buckle","e":"Buildings, pipes and roads tend to buckle and crack because of the movement of the earth.","t":"由于地壳的运动，建筑物、地下管道以及道路等往往会**变形**甚至破裂。","r":"联想记忆：扣紧（buckle）雄鹿（buck），防止挣脱"},
20020:{"w":"curry","e":"Which kind of curry do you like, mild or peppery?","t":"你喜欢哪种**咖喱**，微辣的还是辛辣的？","c":"curry powder 咖喱粉"},
20021:{"w":"subliminal","e":"How we look sends all sorts of subliminal messages to other people.","t":"我们的外表向其他人传达了各种**潜在**的信息。","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+limin（=limen，最小限度的神经刺激）+al（…的）→下意识的，潜意识的","d":"subliminally（adv. 下意识地，潜意识地）"},
20022:{"w":"chamber","e":"In the brood chamber below, the bees will stash honey to eat later.","t":"在**蜂巢**的下部，蜜蜂会贮藏蜂蜜，以供日后食用。"},
20023:{"w":"frequent","e":"Frequent failures did not affect his morale.","t":"**屡屡**失败并未让他泄气。","r":"词根记忆：frequ（频繁，频率）+ent（具有…性质的）→频繁的；常见的","d":"frequently（adv. 常常，频繁地）"},
20024:{"w":"prosperous","e":"My grandfather once was a prosperous British businessman.","t":"我祖父曾是一名**成功**的英国商人。","c":"a prosperous city 一座繁华的都市"},
20025:{"w":"purpose","e":"Bob was absent from school on purpose.","t":"鲍勃**故意**逃学了。","c":"on purpose 故意地，有意地；with the purpose of 为了；statement of purpose 目的陈述"},
20026:{"w":"variety","e":"The places we will visit offer a variety of shopping.","t":"我们将参观的地方可提供**各种**购物活动。","r":"词根记忆：vari（变化）+ety（表状态）→有很多变化→品种；变化","c":"a variety of 许多"},
20027:{"w":"immigration","e":"There will be stricter controls on immigration into the country.","t":"以后要**移民**到这个国家会面临更严格的管制。","r":"词根记忆：im（向内）+migr（迁移）+ation（表行为）→向内迁移→移居（入境）","c":"immigration law 移民法；immigration controls 移民管制；immigration application 移民申请"},
20028:{"w":"natural","e":"It's natural for an old man of his age to be so calm.","t":"处于他这般年纪的老人如此镇静是很**自然**的。","c":"natural disaster 自然灾害；natural scenery 自然景观"},
20029:{"w":"bet","e":"Anyway I bet there are some things you didn't know about bananas.","t":"不管怎样，我**敢说**对于香蕉，你肯定有不知道的地方。","c":"bet on 打赌；赌博；bet with sb. 和…打赌"},
20030:{"w":"consumer","e":"Many consumers feel that government and business have taken on the environmental agenda.","t":"许多**消费者**认为政府和商家已经将环保提上了日程。","d":"consumerism（n. 消费主义）"},
20031:{"w":"physician","e":"The physician said smoking was harmful to my health.","t":"那位**医生**说吸烟对我的健康有害。","r":"词根记忆：physic（医学）+ian（表人）→医师"},
20032:{"w":"equal","e":"These four firms had equal levels of productivity.","t":"这四家公司的生产力水平**不相上下**。","d":"equality（n. 同等，平等）；equally（adv. 平等地，相等地）"},
20033:{"w":"resort","e":"The east coast resorts are only a short twenty-minute drive from here.","t":"从这儿开车去东海岸的**度假胜地**只需短短20分钟。","r":"联想记忆：报告（report）上级，紧急求助（resort）"},
20034:{"w":"leadership","e":"Last week we talked about the most effective ways of leading meetings, and the advantages and disadvantages of different leadership styles.","t":"上周，我们讨论了主持会议最有效的方法以及不同**主持**风格的利弊。","r":"联想记忆：leader（领导者）+ship（表身份）→领导，领导层"},
20035:{"w":"equity","e":"The equity of the committee's decision was accepted by everyone.","t":"委员会所做决定的**公正性**得到了大家的一致认可。","r":"词根记忆：equi（相等）+ty（表状态）→等价交换→公平，公正"},
20036:{"w":"excavate","e":"Some large species of dung beetles originating from France excavate tunnels to a depth of approximately 30 cm below the dung pat.","t":"一些源自法国的大型蜣螂品种会在粪堆下**挖**一条大约30厘米深的隧道。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+cav（洞）+ate（使…）→挖出洞→挖掘，开凿"},
20037:{"w":"nuclear","e":"France derives three quarters of its electricity from nuclear power.","t":"法国四分之三的电来自**核**能。","r":"联想记忆：nu+clear（清除）→清除核危机→核能的"},
20038:{"w":"mutual","e":"They soon discovered a mutual interest in music.","t":"很快，他们发现他们对音乐有着**共同**的兴趣。","r":"词根记忆：mut（改变）+ual（有…性质的）→穷则思变，共同发展→相互的；共同的","c":"mutual understanding 相互理解；the principle of equality and mutual benefit 平等互惠的原则"},
20039:{"w":"density","e":"The house has some high-density insulation materials in the roof.","t":"房子的屋顶采用了一些高**密度**的绝缘材料。","c":"population density 人口密度；the density of settlement 居住密度"},
20040:{"w":"massive","e":"In Tokyo builders are planning a massive underground city to be begun in the next decade.","t":"在东京，建筑者们正计划在接下来的十年里建造一个**大型**地下城。"},
20041:{"w":"congratulate","e":"I wanted to congratulate you all on having passed the exam.","t":"大家都通过了考试，我向你们**表示祝贺**。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+grat（令人高兴的）+ulate→同喜同贺→祝贺"},
20042:{"w":"companion","e":"Tom was my only Chinese companion during my stay in Switzerland.","t":"汤姆是我在瑞士期间唯一的中国**伙伴**。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+pan（面包）+ion→共享面包的人→共事者；同伴，伙伴"},
20043:{"w":"rig","e":"The defeated candidate claimed that the election was rigged.","t":"落选的候选者称选举被人**操纵**了。","r":"联想记忆：挖（dig）个洞把器械（rig）藏起来"},
20044:{"w":"input","e":"The intensity of farming in the rich world should decline, and the use of chemical inputs will diminish.","t":"富裕国家应该降低农业生产的密度，这样化学**药品**的使用将会减少。","r":"来自词组put in（投入；输入）"},
20045:{"w":"merely","e":"You don't have to be present. Merely send a letter of explanation.","t":"你不一定非出席不可，**只要**寄封信去说明一下就可以了。"},
20046:{"w":"impart","e":"He told me not to impart it to anyone without his own permission.","t":"他告诉我，未经他本人允许不可以把此事**透露**给任何人。","c":"impart knowledge 传授知识"},
20047:{"w":"forfeit","e":"He forfeited his driving licence because he drove after drinking.","t":"他因酒后驾车**被没收**了驾照。","r":"联想记忆：for（因为）+feit（看作词根fect，做）→因为做错事，所以被处罚→罚款"},
20048:{"w":"counteract","e":"Antacid will counteract the excess acid in your stomach.","t":"解酸剂会**中和**胃里过剩的酸。","r":"联想记忆：counter（相反）+act（动作）→做相反的动作→抵消"},
20049:{"w":"ventilation","e":"In the noisiest areas mechanical ventilation will have to be installed in the exterior walls.","t":"在噪音最大的区域，必须在外墙安装机械**通风设备**。","r":"来自ventilate（vt. 使通风）","c":"rooms with good ventilation 通风良好的房间；ventilation system 通风系统"},
20050:{"w":"intermediate","e":"Students who have reached an intermediate level benefit from learning general English skills.","t":"那些英语水平达到**中级**的学生从英语综合技能学习中受益匪浅。","r":"词根记忆：inter（在…之间）+medi（中间）+ate（具有…的）→中间的"},
20051:{"w":"eternal","e":"The supersession of the old by the new is a general, eternal and inviolable law of the universe.","t":"新旧更迭是宇宙间普遍的、**永恒**的、不可违背的规律。","r":"联想记忆：外部（external）世界是永恒的（eternal）诱惑","y":"endless（adj. 无止境的）；everlasting（adj. 永恒的，持久的）；permanent（adj. 永久的，持久的）","f":"momentary（adj. 瞬间的，刹那的）；temporary（adj. 暂时的）"},
20052:{"w":"invasion","e":"The freedom from foreign invasion enables a country to develop its natural resources steadily.","t":"不受外来**侵略**可以使一国的自然资源得到稳定的开发。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+vas（走）+ion（表动作）→走进来→入侵，侵略"},
20053:{"w":"nevertheless","e":"He was tired. Nevertheless he kept on working.","t":"他累了，**不过**他仍然继续工作。"},
20054:{"w":"celebrate","e":"The architectural style celebrated scientific and engineering achievements by openly parading the sophisticated techniques used in construction.","t":"该建筑风格通过公开展示建筑中使用的先进技术来**歌颂**科学和工程方面的成就。","d":"celebration（n. 庆祝，庆典）"},
20055:{"w":"inspiring","e":"King was an inspiring tutor.","t":"金是一位**激励人心**的导师。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+spir（呼吸）+ing（令人…的）→使呼吸的→鼓舞人心的","c":"an inspiring story 一个激励人心的故事"},
20056:{"w":"attendance","e":"I do not think there is a need to take class attendance every day at universities.","t":"我认为在大学里没必要每天**点名**。","r":"来自attend（v. 出席；照顾，护理）","c":"take attendance 点名；attendance record 考勤记录"},
20057:{"w":"optional","e":"Is geography an optional course, or does everyone have to learn it?","t":"地理是**选修**课吗，还是每个人都必须学习它？","r":"联想记忆：option（选择）+al→可选择的","c":"an optional course 一门选修课","d":"option（n. 选择；选择权）"},
20058:{"w":"heal","e":"The wound took months to heal.","t":"这个伤口花了几个月才**愈合**。"},
20059:{"w":"enable","e":"The bank service enables you to withdraw cash from your account at any time.","t":"这种银行服务**使你能**随时从账户中取钱。","r":"词根记忆：en（使…）+able（能够的）→使能够，使成为可能","c":"enable sb. to do sth. 使…能够做…"},
20060:{"w":"dismantle","e":"Most people have been forced to dismantle their individualistic homes and return to more conventional lifestyles.","t":"大多数人被迫**拆除**了他们极具个性的房子，回归更加传统的生活方式。","r":"联想记忆：dis（去掉）+mantle（覆盖）→拆除；废除"},
20061:{"w":"wage","e":"In this company, wages are paid at the end of every month.","t":"这家公司每到月末发**工资**。"},
20062:{"w":"landscape","e":"The landscape on the altiplano is the most beautiful I've ever seen.","t":"高原上的**风景**是我所见过的最美的景色。"},
20063:{"w":"emotion","e":"Doing sports can be a good way to release suppressed emotion.","t":"做运动是一个释放压抑**情绪**的好方法。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+mot（动）+ion（表状态）→心里释放出的东西→感情；情绪"},
20064:{"w":"commonwealth","e":"George was a scientist at the Commonwealth Scientific and Industrial Research Organisation at that time.","t":"那时乔治是（澳大利亚）**联邦**科学与工业研究组织的一名科学家。","r":"组合词：common（共同的）+wealth（财富）→共创财富→联合体"},
20065:{"w":"newsletter","e":"There's David West who has volunteered to be the club secretary, and one of the many jobs he will have is to send out newsletters to you regularly.","t":"那位就是戴维·韦斯特，他自愿做俱乐部秘书，他有许多工作，其中之一就是定期给你们分发**时事通讯**。","r":"组合词：news（消息，新闻）+letter（文字）→时事通讯"},
20066:{"w":"periodical","e":"The professor's paper has been issued in the latest periodical.","t":"教授的论文已经发表在最新的一期**期刊**上。","r":"来自period（n. 时期，周期）","d":"periodically（adv. 周期地；定期地，按时地）","y":"journal（n. 定期刊物，杂志）；magazine（n. 杂志，期刊）"},
20067:{"w":"receptionist","e":"The patient goes to a receptionist and asks her about his disease.","t":"那个病人走向**接待员**，向她询问他的病情。"},
20068:{"w":"security","e":"Such insurance plan can offer your families financial security in the event of the loss of properties.","t":"这种保险计划可以在你失去财产的情况下向你的家人提供经济**保障**。","r":"来自secure（v. 保护，使安全；获得）","c":"security check 安全检查；job security 工作保障"},
20069:{"w":"clip","e":"It is said that the U.S. produces 300 million aluminium paper clips each day.","t":"据说美国每天生产三亿个铝制**回形针**。","c":"clip on 用夹子夹住","y":"clutch（v. 抓住）"},
20070:{"w":"apace","e":"The research went on apace.","t":"研究进展**迅速**。"},
20071:{"w":"yield","e":"Higher yields have been achieved by increased irrigation and better crop breeding.","t":"已通过增加灌溉和提高育种质量实现了**产量**的增长。","c":"yield up 放纵；yield to 向…屈服；boost crop yield 提高作物产量"},
20072:{"w":"fair","e":"This part of the island is warmer than the southern half, but it wouldn't be fair to say that the southern half is cold.","t":"小岛的这部分区域比它的南部区域暖和，但是因此说南部冷是不**合理**的。","d":"unfair（adj. 不公平的）"},
20073:{"w":"grunt","e":"Long before the first caveman slumped down beside the fire and grunted news that there were plenty of wildebeest over yonder, our ancestors had learnt the value of sending out scouts to investigate the unknown.","t":"早在第一个穴居人倚在火堆旁，**咕哝着说出**那边有许多牛羚的消息之前，我们的祖先就已经知晓派出侦察员探索未知领域的重要性。"},
20074:{"w":"regional","e":"Our group won the regional championship.","t":"我们小组赢得了**地区**冠军。","c":"regional accent 地方口音"},
20075:{"w":"secure","e":"The person won his eighth Olympic gold medal, and secured his place in history.","t":"那个人赢得了他的第八块奥运会金牌，**巩固**了其历史地位。","r":"联想记忆：se（看作see，看）+cure（治愈）→亲眼看到治愈，确定其是安全的→安全的；可靠的","c":"be secure from interruption 不受打扰","d":"securely（adv. 安全地；安心地）；security（n. 安全，保障）；securable（adj. 可得到的）"},
20076:{"w":"preserve","e":"As a doctor, my profession is to preserve life, and to prevent disease from developing.","t":"身为一名医生，我的职责是**保护**生命以及阻止疾病恶化。","r":"词根记忆：pre（预先）+serv（保持）+e→预先保留→维持；保存","c":"preserve one's eyesight 保护视力","d":"preservative（n. 防腐剂）"},
20077:{"w":"reject","e":"They are cheap because they are rejects.","t":"它们是**不合格品**，所以便宜。","r":"词根记忆：re（回）+ject（扔）→扔回来→拒绝"},
20078:{"w":"code","e":"What is the postal code for Black Street?","t":"布莱克街的**邮编**是多少？","c":"an error code 一条错误代码；break a code 破译密码"},
20079:{"w":"seek","e":"They sought in vain for somewhere to shelter.","t":"他们怎么也**找**不到藏身之处。"},
20080:{"w":"item","e":"You should pay for each item the doctor has prescribed.","t":"你需要为医生列出的各**项**处方付款。","c":"single item 单件物品"},
20081:{"w":"effort","e":"Henry has put a lot of effort into communicating with new friends.","t":"亨利非常**努力**地与新朋友进行交流。","c":"make an/every effort 努力，尽力"},
20082:{"w":"point","e":"A: I'd like to give a lecture. What do you think? B: Well, short and to the point.","t":"A: 我想做个演讲。你认为如何？B: 唔，注意要简短且紧扣**主题**。","c":"come to the point 说到要点，扼要地说；on the point of 即将…的时候；point out 指出","d":"pointed（adj. 有尖的；犀利的）；pointer（n. 提示；指"},
20083:{"w":"review","e":"Before going to bed, please review the day's classes.","t":"睡觉前，请**复习**一下白天的课程内容。","r":"联想记忆：re（重新，再）+view（看）→回顾；复习","d":"reviewer（n. 评论家）"},
20084:{"w":"fabrication","e":"The paper is a pure fabrication.","t":"这篇论文纯粹是**无稽之谈**。","c":"metal fabrication 金属预制件"},
20085:{"w":"series","e":"This series of lectures is organized by the Students' Union.","t":"这**一系列**演讲由学生会组织。","r":"联想记忆：电视连续剧可用TV serial或TV series表示","c":"a series of 一系列，一连串"},
20086:{"w":"variation","e":"Variations and combinations of these two hat shapes formed the basis of the pupil's final designs.","t":"这两种帽子外形的**改变**和相互融合构成了那个小学生最终设计的基础。","r":"词根记忆：vari（变化）+ation（表状态）→变化，变动；变异"},
20087:{"w":"margin","e":"I've made some suggestions in the margins.","t":"我在**页边空白**处写了一些建议。","r":"联想记忆：mar（看作mark，记号）+gin→记号常标记于书页空白处→页边空白","c":"by a small margin 以极小优势"},
20088:{"w":"distraction","e":"There are a lot of distractions at home.","t":"家里有很多**让人分心的事**。"},
20089:{"w":"complicate","e":"This problem was complicated beyond all reason.","t":"这个问题被毫无道理地**复杂化**了。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+plic（重叠）+ate（使…）→一再重叠→使变复杂","c":"complicate matters 使事情复杂化；complicate the business 使生意难做"},
20090:{"w":"tram","e":"I am watching for my tram because sometimes it comes early.","t":"我正留意我要坐的那班**有轨电车**，因为它有时候会早到。","c":"tram tour 有轨电车游览"},
20091:{"w":"maturity","e":"Almost all the fertilized eggs will hatch out into chicks which will in turn reach maturity.","t":"几乎所有受精蛋都会孵出幼鸟，然后幼鸟会慢慢**长大**。","c":"at maturity 成熟；full maturity 完全成熟"},
20092:{"w":"download","e":"Did they download the song from the Internet?","t":"他们从网上**下载**的这首歌吗？"},
20093:{"w":"refer","e":"In his speech, Martin referred to education reform several times.","t":"马丁在他的演讲中几次**提到**教育改革的问题。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+fer（带来）→一再带来→提到，谈及","c":"refer to 参考，查阅；涉及，提到；refer to...as 把…称作，把…当作"},
20094:{"w":"interview","e":"We will talk about how applicants are put through a short interview.","t":"我们将讨论求职者如何进行简短的**面试**。","r":"联想记忆：inter（相互）+view（看）→接见；面试","c":"personal interview 私人会晤；have an interview with sb. 会见某人；job interview 求职面试；group interview 集体面试"},
20095:{"w":"extent","e":"That old race track in the sport centre is nearly six miles in extent.","t":"体育中心的旧跑道将近六英里**长**。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+tent（伸展）→伸展出的距离→范围；长度","c":"to some extent 在某种程度上"},
20096:{"w":"stint","e":"The students were each given a stint of three chapters to read before the next seminar.","t":"下次研讨课之前，每个学生都分到了三章的阅读**定量**。","r":"联想记忆：定量（stint）支取染发剂（tint）"},
20097:{"w":"evacuate","e":"The hotel's fire officer will instruct you in how to evacuate the building if a fire breaks out.","t":"旅馆的消防人员会告诉你们万一着火该如何**撤离**。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+vacu（空）+ate（使…）→空出去→疏散；撤离","d":"evacuation（n. 撤退，撤离）","y":"remove（vt. 移动；开除）；depart（v. 离开）"},
20098:{"w":"embankment","e":"It was the Tilburg architect Jo Hurkmans who hit on the idea of making use of noise embankments on main roads.","t":"正是蒂尔堡的建筑师约·胡尔克曼斯灵机一动，想到在主干道上使用防噪音**路基**的办法。","r":"联想记忆：em（使…）+bank（岸）+ment→使有堤岸→筑堤"},
20099:{"w":"squash","e":"The new gym has got an ice rink and a sports hall for squash, badminton, volleyball and several other indoor sports.","t":"新体育馆设有溜冰场和一个可以打**壁球**、羽毛球、排球和进行其他室内运动的运动大厅。","r":"联想记忆：squ（看作squeeze，挤）+ash（灰）→挤成灰→挤压"},
20100:{"w":"federation","e":"A study by the European Federation for Transport found that car transport is seven times as costly as rail travel.","t":"欧洲运输**联盟**的一项研究发现，汽车运输所需的费用是铁路运输费用的七倍。","r":"来自federal（adj. 联邦的）"},
20101:{"w":"surge","e":"Magma had surged into the volcano from the Earth's mantle.","t":"岩浆从地幔流出，**涌入**火山。","r":"联想记忆：s+urge（急迫的）→水流湍急→波动，涌动；洋","y":"throng（v. 成群地移动，拥塞）；gush（v. 涌出）；rise（n./v. 上升，增加）"},
20102:{"w":"physical","e":"The Physical Fitness Instructor's course is offered as a six-month course.","t":"该**健身**教练的课程为期六个月。","c":"physical examination 体检；physical endurance 身体的忍耐力；physical exercise 体育锻炼"},
20103:{"w":"justify","e":"To justify this claim, the arguer provided a lot of evidence.","t":"为了**证明**这个主张是正当的，论证者提供了许多证据。","r":"词根记忆：just（正确）+ify（使…）→证明…为正当的；为…辩护"},
20104:{"w":"cooperation","e":"The President's visit has promoted the cooperation between the two countries.","t":"那位总统的访问促进了两国间的**合作**。"},
20105:{"w":"score","e":"The composition was scored with corrections in red ink.","t":"这篇作文用红笔修正过并**打了分**。","r":"联想记忆：分，分（score），考试的核心（core）","c":"low score 低分"},
20106:{"w":"persuade","e":"I had tried my best to persuade Bob to join the club.","t":"我竭尽全力**说服**鲍勃加入俱乐部。","c":"persuade sb. to do sth. 劝说某人做…；persuade sb. into/out of sth. 劝说某人做/不做…"},
20107:{"w":"migration","e":"The migration patterns of animals are related to the number of the kind of animal.","t":"动物的**迁徙**方式与其种群的数量相关。","r":"来自migrate（v. 迁移）","c":"language migration 语言迁移"},
20108:{"w":"overweight","e":"Being overweight is a reason why back pain becomes worse.","t":"**超重**负荷是导致背部疼痛加剧的一个原因。","c":"overweight baggage 超重行李"},
20109:{"w":"stamp","e":"You'll have to get this card stamped and then you come back here with it and pay your union fee.","t":"你先拿这张卡去**盖章**，然后拿着它返回这里交会费。","c":"stamp tax 印花税；stamp collecting 集邮；commemorative stamp 纪念邮票；visa stamp 签证章"},
20110:{"w":"whistle","e":"This is where you whistle so the key holder will open the door for you.","t":"你在这里**吹口哨**，这样看门人就会给你开门。","r":"联想记忆：w+hist（嘘）+le→嘘的一声→吹口哨；口哨"},
20111:{"w":"detective","e":"The detective tailed the man.","t":"**侦探**盯上了那名男子。"},
20112:{"w":"occupy","e":"Any individual in any situation occupies a role in relation to other people.","t":"任何个体，无论处于何种环境下，都**扮演**着与他人相关联的某种角色。","r":"联想记忆：发生（occur）了大事，敌人占领（occupy）了该市"},
20113:{"w":"ceremony","e":"The graduation ceremony in many universities is an important occasion.","t":"在很多大学，毕业**典礼**都是重要的场合。","r":"联想记忆：cere（蜡）+mony（看作money，钱）→为办典礼花钱去买蜡→典礼"},
20114:{"w":"diagnose","e":"Lupus can be difficult to diagnose because symptoms vary from person to person.","t":"狼疮很难**诊断**，因为其症状因人而异。","r":"词根记忆：dia（穿过）+gnos（知道）+e→穿过（表象）从而知道（病情）→诊断；判断"},
20115:{"w":"denote","e":"The uniforms denoted a hierarchy.","t":"这些制服**体现**了一种等级关系。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+not（标记）+e→做标记→表示；指示","y":"signify（v. 表示，意味）；indicate（v. 指出；显示）；mean（v. 意味，用意）"},
20116:{"w":"chink","e":"Closer inspection revealed a chink of sky-light through the window.","t":"走近点儿看就会发现有**一缕**自然光透过窗户射入。","r":"联想记忆：chin（看作china，瓷器）+k（口）→瓷器有缺口→裂口"},
20117:{"w":"iris","e":"Systems using fingerprints, hands, voices, irises, retinas and faces are already on the market.","t":"使用指纹、手掌、声音、**虹膜**、视网膜以及面部进行识别的系统都已上市。","r":"本身为词根，意为“彩虹；虹膜”"},
20118:{"w":"resource","e":"How these countries can advance their economies without destroying their natural resources is a burning question.","t":"如何既发展经济又不破坏自然**资源**是这些国家面临的一个迫在眉睫的问题。","r":"联想记忆：re（再，又）+source（源泉）→可再用的源泉→资源","c":"human resources 人力资源；productive resources 生产资料；teaching resources 教学资源；resource management 资源管理"},
20119:{"w":"entire","e":"Hughes claims that in the twenty-first century, consumers will be encouraged to think more about the entire history of the products and services they buy.","t":"休斯声称，21世纪消费者将受到鼓励多考虑他们所购买的产品和服务的**整个**历史。","r":"词根记忆：en（进入…之中）+tir（拉）+e→拉进去，不留在外的→全部的，整个的","d":"entirely（adv. 完全地，一概地）"},
20120:{"w":"epitomise","e":"Indeed, in many respects the Siriono epitomise the popular conception of life in Amazonia.","t":"的确，西里奥诺人的生活在很多方面**集中体现**了亚马孙河流域普遍的生活理念。","r":"词根记忆：epi（在…后面）+tom（切割）+ise（使…）→在书后面切割出要点→概括"},
20121:{"w":"summit","e":"A gigantic explosion tore much of the volcano's summit to fragments.","t":"巨大的爆炸几乎将火山**山顶**全部炸成碎片。"},
20122:{"w":"ensure","e":"How can you ensure that your diet contains enough of the vitamins you need?","t":"你怎样才能**确保**你的饮食中包含了自己所需的足量的维生素呢？","r":"联想记忆：en（使…）+sure（确定的）→使确定→确保，"},
20123:{"w":"odour","e":"Some people are known as odour-blind.","t":"一些人闻不到**气味**。"},
20124:{"w":"accurate","e":"The forecast was soon proved accurate.","t":"不久，预言就被证明是**正确**的。","d":"accuracy（n. 正确度；精确性）；inaccurate（adj. 错误的，不准确的）"},
20125:{"w":"superior","e":"Researchers found that a word without a picture is superior to a word plus a picture in terms of reading efficiency.","t":"研究人员发现，就阅读效率而言，不配图画的文字比配有图画的文字的阅读效率**更高**。","r":"词根记忆：super（上）+ior→上级的","c":"superior to 比…好的，超过…的"},
20126:{"w":"tender","e":"Chicken is tender and delicious.","t":"鸡肉肉**嫩**味美。","r":"联想记忆：婴儿太脆弱（tender），需悉心照料（tend）"},
20127:{"w":"willing","e":"Would you be willing to attend any of our promotions?","t":"你**愿意**参加我们的任何一个宣传活动吗？","d":"willingness（n. 自发；愿意）"},
20128:{"w":"perform","e":"Why did the divers perform worse in colder conditions?","t":"为什么在较冷的条件下潜水者会**表现**得差些呢？","r":"联想记忆：per（每）+form（形式）→表演是各种艺术形式的综合→表演，演出","c":"perform on 演奏","d":"outperform（v. 做得比…好）"},
20129:{"w":"seep","e":"Some parts of Australia are dry because rainwater seeps quickly through sandy soils and into the rock below.","t":"澳大利亚的一些地区非常干燥，因为雨水很快**渗过**砂土，进入下面的岩石层。","r":"联想记忆：深（deep）层渗漏（seep）"},
20130:{"w":"delinquency","e":"Network is becoming the hotbed of juvenile delinquency.","t":"网络正成为青少年**犯罪**的温床。","r":"来自delinquent（adj. 有违法倾向的）","c":"juvenile delinquency 青少年犯罪"},
20131:{"w":"deliberate","e":"Wilson has a slow, deliberate way of acting.","t":"威尔逊动作缓慢而**谨慎**。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+liber（考虑）+ate（具有…的）→多加考虑的→深思熟虑的","y":"ponder（v. 沉思，考虑）","f":"hasty（adj. 匆忙的，草率的）"},
20132:{"w":"implication","e":"What would be the implications if humanity were to understand, with precision, the genetic constitution?","t":"如果人类准确破译了基因的构成，那将**意味着**什么呢？","r":"词根记忆：im（加以…）+plic（重叠）+ation（表状态）→（说话）加以重叠→含意；暗示","c":"political implication 政治含意","y":"involvement（n. 包含；连累）"},
20133:{"w":"opponent","e":"The American Medical Association represents about half of all U.S. doctors and is a strong opponent of smoking.","t":"美国医学协会代表着全美一半左右的医生，这一机构强烈**反对**吸烟。","r":"词根记忆：op（反）+pon（放）+ent（表人）→放在反面→对手，敌手"},
20134:{"w":"sponsor","e":"He is the main sponsor of the conference.","t":"他是这次会议的主要**发起者**。","r":"联想记忆：spons（看作spoon，勺子）+or（表人）→揭勺而起者→发起者"},
20135:{"w":"decisive","e":"Automobiles and televisions have the most decisive influences on people's habits.","t":"汽车和电视对人们的生活习惯最具**决定性**的影响。","r":"来自decide（v. 决定）"},
20136:{"w":"substantial","e":"The smoke experienced daily by many people is enough to produce substantial adverse effects on the heart and lungs.","t":"很多人日常所吸入的（香烟）烟雾就足以对他们的心脏和肺产生**巨大**的副作用。","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+stant（站）+ial（…的）→站在下面的→实质的","d":"substantially（adv. 充分地；可观地；实质上）"},
20137:{"w":"questionnaire","e":"They did a lot of research using questionnaires.","t":"他们借助**调查问卷**进行了大量研究。","y":"questionary（n. 调查表，问卷）"},
20138:{"w":"viewpoint","e":"They held obstinately to the purely military viewpoint.","t":"他们顽固地坚持纯粹的军事**观点**。","r":"组合词：view（见解）+point（点）→观点"},
20139:{"w":"routine","e":"Physical fitness instructors prepare routines of exercises to suit the individual client's age and level of fitness.","t":"健身教练根据每位顾客的年龄及健康状况为他们量身打造锻炼**计划**。"},
20140:{"w":"nurture","e":"We need to seek and nurture new talents.","t":"我们需要发掘和**培养**新人才。","r":"联想记忆：大自然（nature）滋养（nurture）着万物","y":"nourish（vt. 养育，喂养）；cultivate（vt. 培育；培养）；foster（v. 养育；培养）"},
20141:{"w":"slight","e":"I had a slight headache this morning.","t":"今天早上我**有点**头疼。","r":"联想记忆：s+light（轻的）→轻微的","c":"a slight girl 一个苗条的女孩","d":"slightly（adv. 些微地）"},
20142:{"w":"genetic","e":"Genetic inheritance determines a baby's characteristics.","t":"**遗传**基因决定了婴儿的特征。","r":"联想记忆：gene（基因）+tic→基因的→遗传的","c":"genetic code 遗传密码；genetic engineering 基因工程；genetic makeup 基因组成","d":"genetical（adj. 遗传的；起源的）","y":"hereditary（adj. 遗传的）；inherited（adj. 遗传的）；congenital（adj. 先天的，天生的）"},
20143:{"w":"similarly","e":"All students in this school wear similarly unconventionally-cut suits.","t":"这所学校所有的学生都穿着剪裁新颖、款式**相同**的服装。"},
20144:{"w":"juggle","e":"Many university students have to juggle part-time jobs with their studies and family responsibilities.","t":"许多大学生不得不**同时应付**兼职工作、学业和家庭责任。","c":"juggle sth.（with sth.） 尽力同时应付（两项或更多的重要工作或活动）"},
20145:{"w":"leak","e":"If there were a gas leak in this room, the average person would notice fairly quickly.","t":"如果这个房间发生煤气**泄漏**，一般人很快就会察觉到。","r":"联想记忆：湖（lake）面上的船漏出（leak）很多油"},
20146:{"w":"literature","e":"Jane taught English literature at my old high school.","t":"简在我的中学母校教英国**文学**。","r":"词根记忆：liter（文字）+ature（与行为有关之物）→文学（作品）；文献"},
20147:{"w":"suffer","e":"They all suffer from chronic back pain.","t":"他们都**患有**慢性背部疼痛。","r":"词根记忆：suf（下）+fer（带来）→带到下面→遭受，忍受"},
20148:{"w":"impede","e":"The lack of a common language can severely impede progress.","t":"缺少一种通用语言会严重**阻碍**进程。","r":"词根记忆：im（进入）+ped（脚）+e→把脚放进去→阻碍，妨碍"},
20149:{"w":"spring","e":"He was born in the spring of 1995.","t":"他出生于1995年**春天**。","r":"联想记忆：sp+ring（铃声）→泉水叮咚似铃声→泉","c":"spring up 跳起来"},
20150:{"w":"biological","e":"Scientists are doing research to find the biological effects of radiation.","t":"科学家正在进行研究，想发现辐射的**生物**效应。"},
20151:{"w":"deduce","e":"They cannot deduce very much from these simple figures.","t":"他们无法从这些简单的数据中**推断**出很多东西。","r":"词根记忆：de（向下）+duc（引导）+e→向下引出→演绎，推断"},
20152:{"w":"doctorate","e":"After getting his doctorate last year, he decided to continue that research.","t":"去年取得**博士学位**后，他决定继续那项研究。"},
20153:{"w":"absolute","e":"There is no absolute standard for beauty.","t":"美没有**绝对**的标准。","r":"词根记忆：ab（表加强）+solut（松开）+e→完全松开→完全的，绝对的，纯粹的","c":"absolute trust 绝对信任；absolute zero 绝对零度"},
20154:{"w":"theoretical","e":"In the first year students take theoretical courses.","t":"第一年，学生学习**理论**课。","c":"theoretical background 理论背景","d":"theoretically（adv. 理论上）"},
20155:{"w":"internship","e":"During internship, John came into contact with society.","t":"**实习**期间，约翰开始接触社会。"},
20156:{"w":"slender","e":"Many families are still living on slender earnings.","t":"许多家庭仍然靠**微薄**的收入度日。","r":"联想记忆：并非所有女孩子都得性格温柔（tender）身材纤细（slender）","d":"slenderness（n. 苗条，纤细）"},
20157:{"w":"respondent","e":"Our respondents are both men and women, but the women were just slightly in the majority.","t":"我们的**调查对象**包括男性和女性，但女性在数量上略占上风。"},
20158:{"w":"surroundings","e":"Those who could afford to live in more pleasant surroundings moved out.","t":"那些支付得起更舒适的**环境**的人都搬了出去。","c":"working surroundings 工作环境"},
20159:{"w":"couple","e":"There are a couple of books I'd like you to look at.","t":"有**几**本书我想让你看一下。","c":"a couple of 两个；几个"},
20160:{"w":"voluntary","e":"I decided to join a voluntary organization and was sent to Ecuador to carry out land surveys.","t":"我决定加入一个**志愿**者组织，并且被派往厄瓜多尔执行土地测量任务。","r":"词根记忆：volunt（意愿）+ary（…的）→出于自身意愿的→自愿的","d":"voluntarily（adv. 自愿地，自动地，主动地）"},
20161:{"w":"submarine","e":"Residual heat in the submarine would disappear very quickly in these Arctic waters.","t":"在北极水域，**潜水艇**里的余热会迅速消失。","r":"联想记忆：sub（下）+marine（海洋的；船舶的）→在海底航行的→潜水艇","c":"submarine cable 海底电缆","y":"underwater（adj. 水面下的）；submerged（adj. 在水下的）"},
20162:{"w":"commercial","e":"The research findings report commercial rather than political trends.","t":"这些研究结果反映了**商业**趋势而非政治趋势。","r":"联想记忆：commerc(e)（商业）+ial（…的）→商业的","c":"commercial intercourse 通商，贸易往来；commercial venture商业投资；commercial television 商业电视台；commercial centre 商业中心"},
20163:{"w":"notion","e":"The emergence of a new style of architecture reflects more idealistic notions for the future.","t":"一种新建筑风格的出现反映了关于未来的更理想主义的**观念**。","r":"词根记忆：not（知道）+ion（表状态）→观念；想法"},
20164:{"w":"lavatory","e":"Could you tell me the way to the lavatory, please?","t":"请问去**盥洗室**怎么走？","r":"词根记忆：lav（洗）+atory（表地点）→盥洗室"},
20165:{"w":"niche","e":"In the developed world, the device is aimed at niche markets where tap water is unavailable—for camping, on boats, or for the military, for instance.","t":"在发达国家，该设备的目标市场是无自来水可用的**小众**市场，例如用于露营、乘船或军队。","r":"联想记忆：nice（好）中间加h→比nice还多一点，更好更合适→合宜的小环境"},
20166:{"w":"fold","e":"He decided to fold up Phoebe's massage table.","t":"他决定把菲比的按摩桌**折叠**起来。"},
20167:{"w":"instrument","e":"We use questionnaires as our main research instrument.","t":"我们将问卷调查作为主要的研究**手段**。","c":"strategic instruments 战略工具；measuring instruments 测量工具；musical instruments 乐器"},
20168:{"w":"simplify","e":"These self-help books are designed for people who want to simplify their lives.","t":"这些自助书籍是为那些想**简化**生活的人设计的。"},
20169:{"w":"irritation","e":"Tom couldn't hide his irritation that he failed the exam.","t":"汤姆无法掩饰自己因考试不及格而产生的**恼怒**情绪。","r":"来自irritate（vt. 激怒；刺激）"},
20170:{"w":"compulsory","e":"These counselling sessions are compulsory for all students.","t":"所有学生都**必须**学习这些咨询课。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+puls（推）+ory（…的）→共同推进的→义务的；必修的","c":"compulsory education 义务教育；compulsory subject 必修课","y":"mandatory（adj. 命令的，强制的）；enforced（adj. 强迫的）"},
20171:{"w":"expense","e":"I am sure you will be concerned about expenses such as books and uniforms when your child starts studying.","t":"我敢肯定，当你的孩子开始上学时，你会关心书本、制服等**花费**。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+pens（花费）+e→花费；消费","c":"at the expense of 以…为代价；at one's expense 由…负担费用；public expense 公共开支；fixed expense 固定支出；optional expense 选择性支出；miscellaneous expense 杂费","d":"expensive（adj. 昂贵的，花钱多的）"},
20172:{"w":"muddle","e":"I'm in such a muddle that I completely forgot to do my homework.","t":"我真**糊涂**，竟把家庭作业完全抛到了脑后。","r":"联想记忆：mud（泥）+dle→把泥弄得到处都是→混乱"},
20173:{"w":"originate","e":"According to my research, this type of banana actually originated in China.","t":"根据我的研究，事实上，这种香蕉**起源**于中国。","r":"联想记忆：origin（起源，产生）+ate（表动词）→起源，发生","c":"originate in/from 起源于，由…引起/产生","d":"origination（n. 起源）；originator（n. 发起者，发明人）；originative（adj. 有创作力的）"},
20174:{"w":"induce","e":"Nothing would induce me to change my idea.","t":"任何事都不能**使**我改变主意。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+duc（引导）+e→引进去→引诱；引起","c":"induce sb. to do sth. 引诱某人做某事；drug-induced coma 药物引起的昏迷","d":"inducement（n. 引诱；劝诱）；inducible（adj. 可诱导的，可诱发的）"},
20175:{"w":"exchange","e":"Are you one of the exchange students?","t":"你是**交换**生之一吗？","c":"in exchange for 交换；stock exchange 证券交易（所）；part exchange 部分抵价交易；exchange rate 汇率"},
20176:{"w":"atomic","e":"Atomic energy powers the submarine.","t":"**原子**能给潜艇提供动力。"},
20177:{"w":"disharmony","e":"The disharmony of a person-environment mismatch is likely to result in low job satisfaction.","t":"人与工作环境的**不和谐**很可能会导致工作满意度低。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+harmony（一致，协调）→不一致；不和谐"},
20178:{"w":"cosset","e":"Tom is one who cossets his health.","t":"汤姆是个**悉心保养**身体的人。","r":"联想记忆：cos（看作cost，花费）+set（固定）→每天固定花一大笔钱为某人买礼物→宠爱，溺爱"},
20179:{"w":"unique","e":"Biometric security systems operate by storing a digitised record of some unique human features.","t":"生物测定安全系统通过储存某些**独特**的人类特征的数字化记录来运行。","r":"词根记忆：uni（单一）+que（有…特点的）→唯一的","c":"unique style 独特的风格；unique copy 珍本，孤本"},
20180:{"w":"disagree","e":"They disagreed about love.","t":"他们对爱情**持有不同的看法**。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+agree（同意；一致）→不同意；不一致","c":"disagree with sb./sth. 不同意；不一致；disagree about/on sth.对…持不同看法","d":"disagreement（n. 争执，不和）"},
20181:{"w":"silt","e":"Volcanic ash silted up the Columbia River 35 miles away.","t":"火山灰使35英里外的哥伦比亚河**淤塞**了。","r":"联想记忆：坐（sit）于淤泥（silt）而不染"},
20182:{"w":"inclusive","e":"The fully inclusive fee for the trip to that country will be higher in summer vacation.","t":"暑假去那个国家旅行的**全部**费用会高一些。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+clus（关闭）+ive（有…性质的）→向内关闭的→包括一切费用在内的；包容广阔的","c":"fully inclusive 完全包括在内的","d":"inclusively（adv. 全部）；include（v. 包含，包括）"},
20183:{"w":"reservation","e":"I was advised to make a reservation in advance for the seats.","t":"别人建议我提前**预订**座位。","r":"来自reserve（vt. 保留）","c":"an airline reservation 预订航班；make a reservation 预订；confirm a reservation 确认预订；cancel one's reservation 取消预订"},
20184:{"w":"transcript","e":"The professor was reading the transcript of the interview.","t":"教授正在看面试的**文字记录**。"},
20185:{"w":"include","e":"Sports administrators' duties include booking playing fields with local councils.","t":"体育管理员的职责**包括**向地方委员会预订比赛场馆。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+clud（关闭）+e→关进来→包括，包含","c":"be included in 被包括在…里面","f":"exclude（v. 把…排除在外）"},
20186:{"w":"reasonable","e":"I think you'll find the methods very reasonable.","t":"我认为你会觉得这些方法很**合理**。","r":"联想记忆：reason（道理）+able（能…的）→能讲理的→通情达理的","c":"at reasonable prices 以公道的价格","d":"unreasonable（adj. 不合理的）"},
20187:{"w":"abode","e":"I do not dare to linger in that gloom-hidden abode.","t":"我不敢在那个隐没于黑暗中的**房屋**里逗留。","c":"right of abode 居住权；fixed abode 固定住所；permanent abode 永久住所"},
20188:{"w":"gadget","e":"We have tried out some of the latest gadgets on show.","t":"我们试用了展出的一些最新的**小玩意**。","r":"联想记忆：gad（尖头棒）+get（得到）→好不容易得到的尖头棒是他钟爱的小玩意→小玩意","c":"kitchen gadgets 厨房小用具","d":"gadgetry（n. 小器具，小装置）"},
20189:{"w":"emergency","e":"If it's an emergency, you can phone at any time.","t":"如果发生**紧急情况**，你可以随时来电。","r":"联想记忆：emerge（出现）+(e)ncy→突然出现→紧急情况，突发事件","c":"emergency funding 应急基金；emergency contact person 紧急联系人；emergency shelter 应急避难所"},
20190:{"w":"legacy","e":"Mary received this house as a legacy from her uncle.","t":"玛丽从她叔叔那**继承**了这栋房子。","r":"词根记忆：leg（收集）+acy（表名词）→去世前收集的东西→遗产"},
20191:{"w":"leisure","e":"Some people believe that children's leisure activities must be educational, otherwise they are a complete waste of time.","t":"一些人认为，孩子们的**休闲**活动必须具有教育意义，否则纯粹是浪费时间。"},
20192:{"w":"overlap","e":"Our jobs overlap slightly, which causes difficulties.","t":"我们的工作略有**重叠**，所以有时引起一些困难。","r":"联想记忆：over（在…上）+lap（大腿）→把一条腿放在另一条腿上→（使）部分重叠"},
20193:{"w":"counterpart","e":"Researchers say that when women apply for positions they tend to be better qualified than their male counterparts.","t":"研究人员声称，女性在申请职位时往往比男性**竞争者**更具实力。","r":"组合词：counter（相反）+part（部分）→配对物"},
20194:{"w":"tune","e":"Engines of old cars were tuned to reduce the exhausts they emitted.","t":"老式汽车的发动机得到了**调整**，以减少废气排放量。","r":"联想记忆：转动（turn）旋钮调音（tune）"},
20195:{"w":"strike","e":"The strike quickly spread to other states.","t":"**罢工**很快波及了其他州。"},
20196:{"w":"ambiguous","e":"Thinking in categories enables us to categorise phenomena that are essentially ambiguous.","t":"分类思考能使我们对一些本质上**含糊不清**的现象进行分类。","r":"词根记忆：amb（周围）+ig（走）+uous（有…性质的）→在周围走动的→模棱两可的"},
20197:{"w":"represent","e":"The discovery of the reaction principle represents one of the great milestones in the history of scientific thought.","t":"在科学思想史上，反应原理的发现**是**一座伟大的丰碑。","r":"联想记忆：re+present（出席）→代表出席→代表","d":"representative（adj. 有代表性的 n. 代表）"},
20198:{"w":"vanish","e":"Topsoil in certain countries is vanishing faster and faster.","t":"在某些国家，地表土**流失**的速度越来越快。","r":"词根记忆：van（空）+ish（使…）→使变空白→不复存在"},
20199:{"w":"mechanism","e":"Tom replaced the button mechanism in the machine.","t":"汤姆换掉了机器上的按钮**装置**。"},
20200:{"w":"dispute","e":"When participants get into disputes with each other, it's time for the facilitator to take on the role of \"friction manager\".","t":"当与会者发生**争执**时，会议干事就要担起“摩擦消除者”的角色。","r":"词根记忆：dis（不）+put（认为）+e→认为不是→争论，争吵","c":"in dispute 在争论中，未决的；beyond dispute 毫无争议，不容争辩；dispute over 就…争论；dispute with 与…争论/争执"},
20201:{"w":"standard","e":"We'll continue to fight for a decent standard of living for our members.","t":"我们将继续为使我们的成员获得较高的生活**水平**而努力。","c":"standard of education 教育标准；better standard of living 更高的生活水平；up to standard 合格"},
20202:{"w":"typical","e":"The typical farm in the North is a small, family-run concern, producing mainly wool and timber for the market.","t":"北部的**典型**农场规模小且由家庭经营，主要生产市场上所需的羊毛及木材。","r":"联想记忆：typ(e)（典型）+ical（…的）→典型的","d":"typically（adv. 典型地）"},
20203:{"w":"strengthen","e":"The conference will strengthen linkages between the two countries.","t":"本次会议将**加强**两国的联系。","r":"联想记忆：strength（力量）+en（使…）→（使）有力量→加强，巩固"},
20204:{"w":"workaholic","e":"Many people criticised this workaholic economy.","t":"很多人批评这种**工作狂**经济。","r":"联想记忆：work（工作）+aholic（着迷于…的，上瘾的）→工作狂"},
20205:{"w":"unaware","e":"He was unaware of my entry into the room.","t":"他**没意识到**我已经走进了房间。","r":"联想记忆：un（不，没有）+aware（意识到的）→未意识到的"},
20206:{"w":"erosion","e":"Often dams are built to protect the area from soil erosion and to serve as permanent sources of water.","t":"人们建造水坝常常是为了防止水土**流失**，并将水坝（所在地）作为永久的水源。","c":"soil erosion 土壤侵蚀；coastal erosion 海岸侵蚀","y":"corrosion（n. 侵蚀，腐蚀）；deterioration（n. 退化，恶"},
20207:{"w":"exclusively","e":"In open-cut operations, the land is used exclusively for mining, but land rehabilitation measures generally progress with the mine's development.","t":"在露天开采时，土地**仅限**采矿使用，但土地复原措施的实行通常与采矿的进度保持一致。"},
20208:{"w":"pronounceable","e":"We wonder if there is a way to generate random but pronounceable passwords.","t":"我们想知道是否有一种方法能够产生**可读**的随机密码。","r":"联想记忆：pronounce（发音）+able（能…的）→可发音的"},
20209:{"w":"ion","e":"The ion propulsion system was first activated.","t":"**离子**推进系统首先被激活。","d":"ionizer（n. 负离子发生器）"},
20210:{"w":"bare","e":"Certain plants can cause irritation if you touch them with bare skin.","t":"某些植物直接接触**裸露的**皮肤时，会引起皮肤过敏。"},
20211:{"w":"intercept","e":"Large merchant ships would approach the destination port and, just like today, be intercepted by a number of towboats that would drag them to the quay.","t":"就像今天一样，大型商船会靠近目的港，并被多艘拖船**拦截**，将它们拖到码头。","r":"词根记忆：inter（在…中间）+cept（拿）→中途拿下→拦截"},
20212:{"w":"hose","e":"The water entered through a hose to the machine.","t":"水通过**软管**流入机器。","r":"联想记忆：要想玫瑰花（rose）开，需用软管（hose）来浇水"},
20213:{"w":"internal","e":"The theory lacks internal consistency.","t":"这种理论缺乏**内在**统一性。","c":"internal organ 内脏；internal clock 生物钟；internal trade 国内贸易"},
20214:{"w":"cruise","e":"The famous Crocodile Cruise leaves at 11 a.m. each day.","t":"著名的“鳄鱼”号**巡游艇**每天上午11点出航。"},
20215:{"w":"illusion","e":"He will be presenting his show of magic illusion and mystery at 9:30.","t":"他将在9点30分表演神秘**魔幻**节目。","r":"联想记忆：il（不，无）+lus（看作lust，光）+ion（表名词）→看到根本没有的光→幻觉，假象","y":"mirage（n. 幻景，幻想）"},
20216:{"w":"shave","e":"How do you shave your beard so clean?","t":"你是怎样把胡须**刮**得那么干净的？","r":"联想记忆：不要在阴暗处（shade）修面（shave）"},
20217:{"w":"pierce","e":"The bullet pierced the police officer's vest.","t":"子弹**打穿**了警官的防弹衣。","r":"联想记忆：r从一片（piece）中穿过→刺穿"},
20218:{"w":"incredible","e":"The facts have been distorted to an incredible degree.","t":"事实已被歪曲到**不可信**的地步了。","r":"词根记忆：in（不）+cred（相信）+ible（能…的）→不可信的"},
20219:{"w":"vertebrate","e":"Even without further expansion they could save around 2,000 species of endangered land vertebrates.","t":"即使没有更大规模的扩展，他们仍能拯救大约2,000种濒危陆生**脊椎动物**。","r":"来自vertebra（n. 脊椎骨）","c":"vertebrate animal 脊椎动物"},
20220:{"w":"industrious","e":"Li Ming used to be such an industrious student that he usually got the first grade.","t":"李明过去学习非常**勤奋**，总是排名年级第一。"},
20221:{"w":"intestine","e":"Food passes from the stomach to the small intestine and from there to the large intestine.","t":"食物从胃里先到小**肠**，然后经过小肠到大肠。","r":"联想记忆：in（向内）+test（检查）+ine→对身体内部进行检查→肠"},
20222:{"w":"outpost","e":"There is a remote outpost in the most northern part of the town.","t":"小镇的最北端有一处偏僻的**哨站**。","r":"组合词：out（外面的）+post（柱；岗位）→靠外的岗位→前哨（站）"},
20223:{"w":"general","e":"The book on the desk is a general one.","t":"课桌上的那本书很**普通**。","r":"词根记忆：gener（产生）+al（…的）→产生一切的→普遍的","c":"in general 通常，大体上；general science 大众科学","d":"generalization（n. 归纳，概括）"},
20224:{"w":"bother","e":"I'm sorry to bother you so early, Mrs Smith.","t":"史密斯女士，很抱歉这么早就来**打扰**您。","c":"bother sb. about/with sth. 用…打扰…；bother to do sth. 费心做某事"},
20225:{"w":"consignment","e":"We are glad to hear of the post office's making a consignment of bikes.","t":"听说邮局可以**托运**自行车，我们很高兴。","c":"on consignment 以寄售方式；a large consignment of grain 托运大批粮食；consignment store 寄售店"},
20226:{"w":"administrator","e":"For sports administrators we provide a four-month certificate course.","t":"对于体育**管理人员**，我们提供为期四个月的证书课程。"},
20227:{"w":"convention","e":"The city's convention center is also a famous landmark in the country.","t":"该市的**会议**中心也是这个国家的一个著名地标。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+vent（来）+ion（表状态）→大家共同来到一起→大会，会议","c":"social conventions 社会习俗","d":"conventional（adj. 习惯的，常规的；符合习俗的）；conventionally（adv. 按照惯例地）；unconventional（adj. 非传统的）"},
20228:{"w":"organic","e":"Many synthetic polymers are organic compounds.","t":"很多合成聚合物都是**有机**化合物。","c":"organic being 有机体；organic food 有机食品；organic fiber有机纤维"},
20229:{"w":"trapeze","e":"The brothers' trapeze act is unique.","t":"那对兄弟的**高空秋千**表演独一无二。","r":"联想记忆：trap（陷阱）+eze（看作eye，眼睛）→乱吊秋千，陷阱无眼→高空秋千"},
20230:{"w":"intersection","e":"The intersections of these streets with Main Street will not be affected.","t":"这些道路与主干道的**交叉口**将不会受到影响。","r":"词根记忆：inter（在…之间）+sect（切）+ion（表物）→从中间切开→道路交叉口，十字路口","y":"crossroad（n. 十字路口）"},
20231:{"w":"concept","e":"The concept of health holds different meanings for different people and groups.","t":"健康**观念**因人和群体的不同而不同。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+cept（拿）→牢牢拿住的→概念"},
20232:{"w":"cardiovascular","e":"People who smoke cigarettes are continually damaging their cardiovascular system.","t":"吸烟者在不断地损害自身的**心血管**系统。","c":"cardiovascular disease 心血管疾病"},
20233:{"w":"humble","e":"They do not wish to return to the humble post-war era.","t":"他们不希望回到那**可怜**的战后年代。","r":"词根记忆：hum（地）+ble→接近地面的→谦逊的；卑贱的","c":"a man of humble origin 一个出身寒微的人"},
20234:{"w":"lecture","e":"I am giving you the lectures on environmental noise this term.","t":"这个学期由我来给你们上环境噪声**课**。","r":"词根记忆：lect（讲）+ure→演讲，讲课","d":"lecturer（n. 讲师）"},
20235:{"w":"counter","e":"The government's plans run counter to agreed European policy on this issue.","t":"政府的计划与欧洲在该问题上的既定政策**相悖**。","r":"联想记忆：与count（v. 计算）一起记","c":"under the counter（商品销售）秘密地，暗地里，非法地"},
20236:{"w":"brass","e":"A brass knocker was fixed on the door.","t":"门上装了一个**黄铜**门环。","r":"联想记忆：敲击黄铜器（brass），声音低沉（bass）","c":"brass band 军乐队；as bold as brass 大模大样地，粗鲁无礼环。"},
20237:{"w":"fauna","e":"They tried their best to protect native flora and fauna.","t":"他们竭尽全力来保护当地的**动**植物。","r":"来自Faunus（潘纳斯，罗马神话中的动物之神）","c":"land and marine faunas 陆地和海洋动物区系"},
20238:{"w":"expel","e":"John has been expelled from the firm and is operating on his own.","t":"约翰被那家公司**开除**了，现在自己单干。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+pel（推）→推出去→把…开除；驱逐"},
20239:{"w":"equator","e":"The equator divides the earth into two hemispheres.","t":"**赤道**把地球划分为两个半球。","r":"联想记忆：equa（看作equal，相等的）+tor→几乎把地球等分的线→赤道"},
20240:{"w":"divisional","e":"Each branch has a divisional head.","t":"每个分部都有**部门**领导。"},
20241:{"w":"invest","e":"Supermarkets are able to invest millions of pounds in powerful computers which tell them what sells best.","t":"超市可**投资**数百万英镑用于购买功能强大的计算机，这些计算机能告诉他们什么最畅销。","c":"invest in the stock market 投资股票市场","d":"investment（n. 投资，投入）；investor（n. 投资者）"},
20242:{"w":"essay","e":"You have to complete a 3,000-word essay on the topic.","t":"你需要就该主题写一篇3,000字的**文章**。"},
20243:{"w":"dedicate","e":"We have come to dedicate a portion of that field as a final resting place for those who gave their lives here.","t":"我们已经**贡献出**那片土地的一部分，作为那些在此献出了生命的人们的安息之地。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+dic（说）+ate（表动词）→把（书、戏剧等作品）献给…","c":"dedicate oneself to 献身于","y":"devote（vt. 投入于，献身于）"},
20244:{"w":"astrology","e":"Although astrology is popular in magazines, most scientists argue that the positions of stars cannot predict human behaviour.","t":"尽管**占星学**在杂志上很受欢迎，但大多数科学家认为星体的位置无法预测人类的行为。","r":"词根记忆：astro（星星）+logy（…学）→占星学"},
20245:{"w":"attain","e":"Sustainable development is to attain a perpetual balance between population, economic growth and the environment.","t":"可持续发展就是要**实现**人口、经济增长和环境三者之间的永久平衡。","r":"词根记忆：at（表加强）+tain（拿住）→稳稳拿住→达到；获得；完成"},
20246:{"w":"ambition","e":"Bob's ambition was to study medicine.","t":"鲍勃**有志于**学医。","r":"词根记忆：amb（周围）+it（行走）+ion（表名词）→在周围走动→野心","c":"fulfill one's ambition 实现抱负"},
20247:{"w":"range","e":"We'd like to produce the equipment with a range of sizes.","t":"我们想生产大小规格**不同**的设备。","c":"a wide range of 一系列；range between...and... 范围在…与…之间不等；range from...to... 从…延伸到…；（在一定程度或范围内）变动，变化","d":"ranger（n. 护林员）"},
20248:{"w":"ultimate","e":"For early explorers, it was the ultimate survival contest.","t":"对于早期探险家来说，这是**终极**生存竞赛。","r":"词根记忆：ultim（最后）+ate（有…性质的）→最后的，最终的","c":"the ultimate authority 最高当局；the ultimate principle 基本原理；in ultimate 到最后，结果","d":"ultimately（adv. 最后，终于）"},
20249:{"w":"counsellor","e":"Paula Clayburg is the chief counsellor at Liverpool's famous pain clinic.","t":"保拉·克莱伯格是利物浦一家著名止痛诊所的首席**顾问**。"},
20250:{"w":"flap","e":"Mike bent the flap of an envelope over and stuck it with glue.","t":"迈克把信封的**封口**折过来用胶水黏好。","r":"联想记忆：f（看作fly，飞）+lap（拍打）→拍动","c":"flap wings 振动翅膀；get in a flap over sth. 因某事而激动/不","y":"agitation（n. 骚动，不安）；commotion（n. 骚动，动乱）；flutter（v. 振翼；飘动）"},
20251:{"w":"wastage","e":"Quality control cuts wastage and saves time.","t":"质量管理既降低**损耗**又节省时间。","r":"联想记忆：wast(e)（浪费，消耗）+age（表集体名词）→消耗量；损耗"},
20252:{"w":"dub","e":"Indeed, some scientists even suggest we should think of each species and its microbes as a single unit, dubbed a \"holobiont\".","t":"事实上，一些科学家甚至认为我们应将每个物种及其微生物视为一体，**称之为**“共生功能体”。"},
20253:{"w":"device","e":"A wide range of pollution control devices is in place at most modern mines.","t":"大多数现代矿井都配备了大量的污染控制**设备**。","r":"词根记忆：de（向下）+vic（看）+e→用于向下观看的（东西）→装置","c":"marketing device 营销手段；leave sb. to their own devices 听任某人自行其是，对某人不加干涉"},
20254:{"w":"regulate","e":"More than 300 dams regulate river flows around the country.","t":"有300多座大坝**控制**着全国的河水流量。","r":"词根记忆：reg（国王）+ul+ate（做）→国王做的主要工作就是管制→管制","c":"regulate the traffic 管制交通；regulate one's spending 控制开支","d":"regulation（n. 规章；管理）"},
20255:{"w":"mould","e":"A mould might prove to be a successful antibody to bacterial infection.","t":"某种**霉**可能会被证明是细菌感染的有效抗体。","c":"mould one's character 塑造性格"},
20256:{"w":"potential","e":"After the final interview, potential recruits were divided into three categories.","t":"经过最后一轮面试，**有可能**被录用的人被分成三类。","r":"词根记忆：pot（能力）+ent+ial（具有…的）→潜在的；可能的；潜能","c":"potential customer/client 潜在顾客/客户；potential threat 潜在威胁；potential ability 潜能"},
20257:{"w":"discretion","e":"The services that the bank will offer you will depend on your individual circumstances and on the discretion of the bank manager involved.","t":"银行提供给你的服务将取决于你的个人情况和相关银行经理的**判断力**。","r":"来自discreet（adj. 小心的，谨慎的）","c":"act at one's discretion 自行决断；with discretion 慎重地，审慎地"},
20258:{"w":"ambitious","e":"The Human Genome Project is the most ambitious scientific project since the Apollo programme, which landed a man on the moon.","t":"人类基因工程是继阿波罗登月计划后最具**雄心**的科学项目。","r":"词根记忆：amb（周围）+it（行走）+ious（多…的）→四处多走动的→有野心的"},
20259:{"w":"brief","e":"The lecture is a brief history of civil engineering development.","t":"这次的讲座内容是土木工程发展的**简**史。","c":"in brief 简单地说，简言之；a brief of …的摘要；brief introduction 简短的介绍"},
20260:{"w":"clamour","e":"The clamour from the backyard drew us out of the house.","t":"后院的**喧哗**把我们引出了房子。","r":"词根记忆：clam（叫喊）+our→吵闹，喧哗"},
20261:{"w":"substitute","e":"It is better for a company to employ more workers because people are available to substitute for absent staff.","t":"对公司来说，多雇用一些员工大有好处，因为有足够的人手去**替代**缺勤人员。","c":"substitute for 代替"},
20262:{"w":"striking","e":"The most striking quality of satiric literature is its freshness.","t":"讽刺文学最**显著**的特征是它的新颖性。"},
20263:{"w":"pirate","e":"Anybody can pirate our music and software without proper laws.","t":"如果没有适当的法规出台，任何人都可以**盗用**我们的音乐和软件。","r":"联想记忆：和private（adj. 私人的；秘密的）一起记"},
20264:{"w":"attest","e":"Nevertheless, the horse had great ritual and economic significance during the Bronze and Iron Ages, as attested by its depictions on jewellery and other metal objects.","t":"然而，在青铜时代和铁器时代，马匹有很重要的仪式意义和经济意义，这一点可以通过珠宝和其他金属物品的描绘得到**证明**。","r":"词根记忆：at+test（证据）→用证据证明→证明，证实"},
20265:{"w":"minimise","e":"The adoption of clean energy will help minimise air pollution.","t":"采用清洁能源有助于将空气污染**降到最低程度**。","r":"词根记忆：minim（小量）+ise（使…）→最小化"},
20266:{"w":"imaginative","e":"Hypotheses are imaginative and inspirational in character, and are adventures of the mind.","t":"臆测让人充满**想象**与灵感，它是思想的冒险。","r":"来自imagine（v. 想象）"},
20267:{"w":"profit","e":"Some firms are even downsizing as their profits climb.","t":"一些公司甚至在**利润**上升时还裁员。","c":"pursue maximum profit 追求最大利润；net profit 纯利润；profit from... 从…中受益","d":"profitable（adj. 有利润的；有益的）"},
20268:{"w":"decrepit","e":"Our aim is to remove the heaviest-polluting, most-decrepit vehicles from the roads.","t":"我们的目标是清除公路上污染最严重、最**破旧**的车辆。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+crepit（爆裂）→破裂不堪→破旧的","d":"decrepitude（n. 衰老，老朽；破旧）"},
20269:{"w":"ignorant","e":"She is very ignorant about her own job.","t":"她非常**不了解**自己的工作。","y":"stupid（adj. 愚蠢的，迟钝的）；retarded（adj. 弱智的，迟钝的）"},
20270:{"w":"mastery","e":"A frequent change of roles is the training requisite for a mastery of the actor's art.","t":"频繁地转换角色是**掌握**表演技能的必要训练。","r":"联想记忆：master（精通）+y→精通，熟练"},
20271:{"w":"forecast","e":"The economic report forecast a sharp drop in unemployment for the next year.","t":"据经济报告**预测**，来年的失业人数将明显减少。","r":"联想记忆：fore（前面）+cast（扔）→预先扔下→预报；预测；预想","c":"weather forecast 天气预报"},
20272:{"w":"precision","e":"The manufacturers exercise much attention and precision in producing their products.","t":"在产品的生产过程中，制造商们倾注了大量心血，非常注重产品的**精密性**。","c":"precision instruments 精密仪器"},
20273:{"w":"representative","e":"Your examiner is a Student Union representative.","t":"你的主考官是学生会**代表**。","c":"sales representative 销售代表"},
20274:{"w":"quote","e":"The student quotes a paragraph from the classical literature Macbeth.","t":"那名学生**引用**了经典文学作品《麦克白》中的一段话。","r":"词根记忆：quot（数目）+e→引用，引述","c":"quote from 引用自…","d":"quotation（n. 引文；报价）"},
20275:{"w":"comparative","e":"Tom is living in comparative comfort.","t":"汤姆现在过得**比较**舒服。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+par（相等）+ative（有…性质的）→差不多的→相当的","c":"comparative advantage 相对优势；comparative validity 相对合法性","d":"comparatively（adv. 相对地；相当地）"},
20276:{"w":"recruit","e":"You are among the two hundred staff recruited to help look after the old.","t":"你是被**招聘**来帮忙照顾老年人的200名员工之一。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+cruit（=cres，成长）→一再使成长壮大→招收（新成员）","c":"recruit method 招聘方法","d":"recruitment（n. 招聘；吸收新成员）；recruiter（n. 征兵人员；为学校招生的人）"},
20277:{"w":"gloss","e":"The kitchen ware can be polished to a gloss.","t":"那些厨房用具能被擦得**闪闪发亮**。","r":"可能来自glow（v. 闪光）；注意不要和gross（adj. 总的，粗略的）相混"},
20278:{"w":"committee","e":"The committee's decisions are often determined by the members' vote.","t":"**委员会**的决议常常由委员投票决定。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+mitt（=mit，送）+ee（表人）→共同发送指令的人→委员会","d":"subcommittee〔（n.（大委员会内的）小组委员会〕"},
20279:{"w":"exile","e":"The former President was exiled for more than twenty years.","t":"前总统被**流放**了二十多年。","r":"联想记忆：ex（出）+il（看作sil，跳跃）+e→跳出去→放逐，流放","c":"in exile 流放中；drive sb. into exile 流放某人","y":"expel（vt. 驱逐，开除）；banish（vt. 流放，驱逐）"},
20280:{"w":"reverse","e":"Small rooms aren't quite cheap in reverse.","t":"小房间**反而**不是很便宜。","r":"词根记忆：re（相反）+vers（转）+e→反转→颠倒","c":"in reverse 顺序相反，反向；in reverse order 以颠倒的次序","d":"reversal（n. 颠倒，倒转）；reversible（adj. 可反转的，可逆的）","y":"revoke（vt. 撤销，撤回）；invert（vt. 使颠倒；使转化）；converse（n. 相反的事物 adj. 相反的，颠倒的）"},
20281:{"w":"finance","e":"Opponents of smoking financed this study.","t":"反对吸烟的人士为这一研究**提供了资金**。","r":"词根记忆：fin（结束）+ance（表状况）→财务情况","c":"college of finance and economics 财经学院；raise finance for为…提供更多资金；to finance education 支付教育费用","d":"financial（adj. 财政的，金融的）；financially（adv. 财政上，金融上）"},
20282:{"w":"resign","e":"The minister was forced to resign in 2019.","t":"2019年，该部长被迫**辞职**。","r":"联想记忆：re（回）+sign（签名）→要回签名→辞职；放弃","d":"resignation（n. 辞职）"},
20283:{"w":"preparation","e":"The team has been training hard in preparation for the big game.","t":"为**备战**这场重要比赛，队伍一直在坚苦训练。"},
20284:{"w":"thrive","e":"Those societies thrived there for more than 1,000 years before the arrival of Europeans.","t":"在欧洲人到来之前，那些社会已经**繁荣**了一千多年。","r":"联想记忆：th+rive(r)（河）→古时有河的地方大多是文明的发源地→兴旺，繁荣"},
20285:{"w":"judgment","e":"The lawyer is a man of good judgment.","t":"那位律师具有出色的**判断力**。"},
20286:{"w":"outward","e":"The scientist warned the local population against being deceived by the volcano's outward calm.","t":"科学家警告当地居民不要被这座火山**表面**的平静所欺骗。"},
20287:{"w":"consequently","e":"Mr. Foster has never been to China. Consequently he knows very little about it.","t":"福斯特先生从未到过中国，**所以**对中国知之甚少。"},
20288:{"w":"entertain","e":"The spectators go to be entertained rather than out of loyalty to a team.","t":"观众去观看体育比赛与其说是忠于某支球队，还不如说是为了**娱乐**。","r":"词根记忆：enter（进入）+tain（拿住）→拿着东西进入→招待","c":"entertain sb. with sth. 以…娱乐某人；以…招待某人","d":"entertainment（n. 娱乐；招待）"},
20289:{"w":"withstand","e":"A desert animal can withstand high body temperatures.","t":"生活在沙漠中的动物可以**忍受**较高的体温。","r":"联想记忆：with（与…在一起）+stand（站）→武警官兵手拉手站在一起抵挡洪流→抵挡"},
20290:{"w":"anthropologist","e":"The lecturer is an anthropologist.","t":"演讲者是位**人类学家**。","r":"词根记忆：anthrop（人类）+olog(y)（…学）+ist（表人）→研究人类学的人→人类学家"},
20291:{"w":"comb","e":"These temporary hive extensions contain frames of empty comb for the bees to fill with honey.","t":"这些临时扩充的蜂箱里有用来让蜜蜂贮存蜂蜜的空**蜂巢**。","c":"comb through sth. 彻底搜寻"},
20292:{"w":"suitably","e":"Based on the soil requirements, the land is suitably fertilised.","t":"根据土壤的条件，土地被**适当**施肥。"},
20293:{"w":"pinpoint","e":"The latest research pinpoints for the first time a molecular mechanism in plants that reacts to temperature—often triggering the buds of spring we long to see at the end of winter.","t":"最新的研究首次**确定**了植物中对温度做出反应的分子机制，常常会触发我们在冬天结束时渴望看到的春之萌芽。","r":"组合词：pin（钉，针）+point（点，尖端）→精准定位"},
20294:{"w":"pulley","e":"The lifting device is a rope and pulley system.","t":"这种起重装置是由缆索和**滑轮**组成的。","r":"联想记忆：pull（拉）+ey→滑轮；滑车"},
20295:{"w":"privilege","e":"Education is not a privilege of some people but a right of all citizens.","t":"受教育不是某些人的**特权**，而是所有公民的权利。","r":"词根记忆：privi（=priv，单个）+leg（法律）+e→法律上的独享权利→特权","d":"privileged（adj. 有特权的）"},
20296:{"w":"infrastructure","e":"How does the port change a city's infrastructure?","t":"港口如何改变一个城市的**基础结构**？","r":"词根记忆：infra（下）+struct（建造）+ure（行为有关的物）→建在下面的结构→基础结构"},
20297:{"w":"allocate","e":"The world-wide coal industry allocates extensive resources to researching and developing new technologies.","t":"全球的煤炭业为新技术的研发**提供**了广泛的资源。","r":"词根记忆：al（表加强）+loc（地方）+ate（做）→不断往地方送→分配；分派","d":"allocation（n. 分配；安置）"},
20298:{"w":"qualification","e":"You can select someone—even a friend—who has the qualifications, degrees and certificates.","t":"你可以选有**资格**、学位和证书的人，甚至可以是朋友。","r":"来自qualify（v. 合格，具备资格）","c":"qualification test 资格考试；minimum qualification 最低资格"},
20299:{"w":"expand","e":"The goal of university should be to expand the minds of students.","t":"大学的目标应该是**开阔**学生的视野。","r":"词根记忆：ex（向外）+pand（展开）→向外展开→（使）膨胀，（使）扩张","c":"expand one's knowledge 扩大知识面；expand one's horizon 拓宽视野","d":"expanding（adj. 扩大的）；expansion（n. 扩张，膨胀）；expanse（n. 宽广空间）"},
20300:{"w":"trap","e":"The parents were a bit concerned about the side bar of the baby chair, because they felt babies could trap their fingers in it.","t":"父母有点担心这个婴儿座椅的侧板，因为他们觉得侧板会**夹住**婴儿的手指。","c":"fall into a trap 陷入圈套；debt trap 负债困境"},
20301:{"w":"intern","e":"Helen worked as an intern in that hospital last year.","t":"海伦去年在那家医院**实习**。","r":"联想记忆：与internal（adj. 内部的）一起记"},
20302:{"w":"repaint","e":"The first thing people will see when they go in is that the foyer has been repainted gold.","t":"人们走进来首先就会看到门廊被**重新漆**成了金色。","c":"repaint the wall 重新刷墙"},
20303:{"w":"specialist","e":"The professor is one of the world's leading specialists in the field.","t":"这位教授是该领域内的顶级**专家**。","r":"联想记忆：special（专门的）+ist（从事某职业的人）→专家","c":"specialist knowledge 专业知识","d":"special（adj. 特别的；专门的；附加的，额外的）；specialization（n. 专门化，特殊化）；specialized（adj. 专门的；专业的；专科的）"},
20304:{"w":"migratory","e":"There are lots of birds in this national forest park, both resident and migratory.","t":"这个国家森林公园里有很多鸟，有留鸟也有**候鸟**。","r":"词根记忆：migr（迁移）+atory（有…性质的）→迁徙的；流动的","c":"migratory birds 候鸟"},
20305:{"w":"inlet","e":"There are a thousand little inlets and backwaters all through here.","t":"这里共有上千个小**水湾**和死水潭。","r":"联想记忆：in（进入）+let（让）→让…进入的地方→入口"},
20306:{"w":"nutrition","e":"Females are more conscious of food nutrition.","t":"女性更关注食品**营养**。","r":"词根记忆：nutri（滋养）+tion→营养；营养学","c":"food nutrition 食品营养；good nutrition 营养丰富；nutrition science 营养学","d":"nutritional（adj. 营养的）；nutritionist（n. 营养学家）；nutritionally（adv. 在营养上）；nutritious（adj. 有营养成分的，营养的）；malnutrition（n. 营养不良）","y":"nourishment（n. 营养；营养品）；sustenance（n. 食物，营养物）"},
20307:{"w":"censor","e":"Should films and television be censored or should we be free to choose what we see?","t":"电影和电视应该接受**审查**还是应该由我们自由选择去看什么？","r":"词根记忆：cens（审查）+or（表人）→审查员","d":"censorship（n. 审查制度）"},
20308:{"w":"widespread","e":"The use of friction to make fire was also widespread in Europe.","t":"摩擦生火的办法在欧洲也**广为流传**。","r":"组合词：wide（宽广的）+spread（传播，分布）→分布广的","c":"widespread vegetables 广泛种植的蔬菜"},
20309:{"w":"hazard","e":"Traffic pollution is a major health hazard.","t":"交通污染是主要的健康**公害**。","r":"发音记忆：“害死的”→危险","c":"safety/health hazard 安全/健康隐患","d":"hazardous（adj. 危险的，冒险的）"},
20310:{"w":"rear","e":"Mary's office is next to the rear entrance.","t":"玛丽的办公室挨着**后**门。","c":"at/in the rear of 在…的后面；rear sb. on sth.（用…）喂养"},
20311:{"w":"shareholder","e":"Shareholders voted at the annual meeting to approve the company's plan to invest more in renewable energy.","t":"**股东**们在年会上投票批准了公司加大可再生能源投资的计划。","r":"组合词：share（分享；股票）+holder（持有者）→股票持"},
20312:{"w":"bid","e":"Those willing to extend the validity of their bid shall be neither required nor permitted to modify it.","t":"那些愿意延长其**投标**有效期的投标人，不需要也不允许修改其投标。","r":"发音记忆：“必得”→抱着必得的态度出价→出价；投标"},
20313:{"w":"alight","e":"The earliest peoples probably stored fire by keeping slow burning logs alight or by carrying charcoal in pots.","t":"最原始人类保存火种的方法可能是让缓慢燃烧的原木保持**不灭**，或是将木炭装进罐子里。","r":"联想记忆：a+light（点燃）→燃烧着的","c":"set alight 使…燃烧；alight on/upon（偶然）想到，注意到"},
20314:{"w":"credit","e":"Most historians credit the Chinese with the discovery of gun powder.","t":"大多数历史学家**认为是**中国人发明了火药。","r":"词根记忆：cred（相信）+it→信任，相信","c":"payment by credit card 信用卡支付；give...credit for... 因…而称赞…；credit limit 信贷限额；on credit 赊账","d":"discredit（vt. 使丧失信誉，使怀疑）"},
20315:{"w":"shrewd","e":"This politician was passionate and shrewd.","t":"这位政治家富有激情又不失**精明**。","r":"发音记忆：“熟的”→对某事很熟，因此反应灵敏→机灵的","c":"a shrewd businessman 一个精明的商人","y":"smart（adj. 聪明的）；keen（adj. 敏锐的，聪明的）","f":"dull（adj. 迟钝的）"},
20316:{"w":"desert","e":"The new estates around the city often proved to be windswept deserts because they lacked essential social facilities and services.","t":"城市周边新建的住宅区因缺少基本的社区服务和设施，常常沦落为只有冷风飕飕吹过的**荒凉之地**。","r":"词根记忆：de（去掉）+sert（加入）→不加入→舍弃"},
20317:{"w":"conclude","e":"They concluded that the children were incapable of deductive reasoning.","t":"他们**得出结论**：儿童没有推理能力。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+clud（关闭）+e→强行关闭→推断出；作结论","c":"conclude with 以…作结论；to conclude 最后"},
20318:{"w":"explosive","e":"The bomb was packed with several pounds of explosive.","t":"这枚炸弹装有几磅**炸药**。","c":"explosive device 引爆装置"},
20319:{"w":"inherent","e":"Women have an inherent love of beauty.","t":"女人**天生**爱美。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+her（黏附）+ent（具有…性质的）→骨子里带来的→生来就有的","y":"natural（adj. 天生的，本能的）；inborn（adj. 天生的）；innate（adj. 与生俱来的）"},
20320:{"w":"world-wide","e":"The use of artificial fertilizers world-wide increased by 40 percent per unit of farmed land between the mid 1970s and late 1980s.","t":"从20世纪70年代中期到80年代末，在**全世界范围内**每单位耕地的人造化肥使用量增长了40％。"},
20321:{"w":"grope","e":"The man groped for the light switch in the dark room.","t":"男子在黑洞洞的屋里**摸索**着寻找电灯开关。","r":"联想记忆：g+rope（绳子）→抓住绳子向前走→（暗中）摸索"},
20322:{"w":"lever","e":"He levered a box open to reveal an antique vase.","t":"他**撬开**箱子，里面露出一个古董花瓶。","r":"词根记忆：lev（举起）+er（表物）→举起（重物）的物→杠杆","y":"tool（n. 工具，手段）；means（n. 方法，手段，工具）"},
20323:{"w":"ethical","e":"The behavior is not strictly ethical.","t":"严格来讲，这种行为是不**道德**的。","c":"ethical standards 道德标准；ethical problems 道德问题"},
20324:{"w":"improvement","e":"His oral English is good, but there's still room for some improvement.","t":"他的英语口语不错，但是还有**提升**的空间。","c":"improvement in 在…方面有改进/好转"},
20325:{"w":"vacant","e":"A vacant room is very difficult to find in this district after nine o'clock.","t":"九点之后，很难在这个区找到**空**房间。","r":"词根记忆：vac（空）+ant（…的）→未占用的","c":"vacant position 空缺职位；vacant seat 空位；vacant expression 茫然的表情","d":"vacancy（n. 空处；空缺）；vacate〔vt. 腾出，空出；离（职），退（位）〕"},
20326:{"w":"truant","e":"Jason has been truanting three days this week.","t":"贾森本周**逃**了三天课。"},
20327:{"w":"scandal","e":"The scandal destroyed the government's image completely.","t":"这件**丑闻**完全毁了政府的形象。","r":"联想记忆：scan（扫描）+dal→扫描时事，揭露丑闻→丑事，丑闻","c":"financial scandal 财政丑闻","d":"scandalize〔vt. 使（某人）愤慨或震惊〕；scandalous（adj.出丑的，可耻的；诽谤的）"},
20328:{"w":"latent","e":"He still has latent force to develop in study and research.","t":"在学习和研究方面，他仍有**潜力**可挖。","r":"联想记忆：lat（看作late，后面的）+ent（具有…性质的）→后面的→潜在的，潜伏的","c":"latent capital 潜在资本；latent infection 潜伏性传染病；latent period 潜伏期"},
20329:{"w":"tenant","e":"The furniture was left by the former tenant.","t":"这些家具是上个**房客**留下来的。","r":"联想记忆：ten（十）+ant（蚂蚁）→十只蚂蚁来住店，虽小也是客→房客","c":"a sitting tenant 一位老房客","y":"lodger（n. 投宿者）；leaseholder（n. 承租人）"},
20330:{"w":"psychiatric","e":"Jim suffered from a psychiatric disorder.","t":"吉姆**精神**紊乱。"},
20331:{"w":"bolster","e":"To protect airports near the sea, the coastline is being bolstered with twelve kilometres of sea defences.","t":"为了保护近海的机场，海岸线上**支起**了12千米长的沿海防护栏。"},
20332:{"w":"immigrant","e":"This immigrant's citizenship was revoked because he had concealed his criminal record.","t":"这位**移民**因为隐瞒了犯罪记录而被取消了国籍。","r":"词根记忆：im（向内）+migr（迁移）+ant（表人）→向内迁移的人→移民；侨民"},
20333:{"w":"sequence","e":"Scientists were able to analyse the sequence of events.","t":"科学家能够分析事件发生的**先后顺序**。","r":"词根记忆：sequ（跟随）+ence（表状态）→顺序，次序"},
20334:{"w":"ecosystem","e":"One tool for assessing the impact of forestry on the ecosystem is population viability analysis (PVA).","t":"种群生存能力分析是评定林业对**生态系统**影响的一种方法。","r":"词根记忆：eco（生态）+system（系统）→生态系统","c":"balanced ecosystem 平衡的生态系统"},
20335:{"w":"concern","e":"What most concerns me is I'm still not doing very well on my homework.","t":"最让我**担心**的是我现在还不能很好地完成家庭作业。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+cern（搞清）→需要搞清楚→关心；关注；词根记忆：trans（转移）+fer（带来）→转移；调动","c":"as/so far as...be concerned 就…来说；be concerned with 涉及，有关；concern with/about 关心…；transfer property to sb. 把财产转让给某人；transfer from...to...从…转换成…；bank transfer 银行转账","d":"concerned（adj. 担心的，忧虑的；关注的，感兴趣的）；concerning（prep. 关于，涉及）transfer* [trænsˈfɜː(r)] [ˈtrænsfɜː(r)] v. 搬，转移；调动，转学；转让，过户；转车，换乘n. 转移；调动；转车，换乘；transference（n. 转移；转让）；transferable（adj. 可转移的）"},
20336:{"w":"exotic","e":"Their exotic apparel sets them apart from the locals.","t":"**奇异的**服装将他们与当地人区分开来。","c":"exotic experience 异国体验","y":"foreign（adj. 外国的，外来的）","f":"native（adj. 本国的，本地的）；indigenous（adj. 本土的）"},
20337:{"w":"evaporate","e":"He thought water could evaporate quickly in sandy soils.","t":"他认为水在砂土中会很快**蒸发**。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+vapor（蒸汽）+ate（使…）→使蒸汽出去→蒸发","d":"evaporation（n. 蒸发；消失）","y":"vanish（vi. 消失）；vaporize〔v.（使）蒸发〕"},
20338:{"w":"destiny","e":"Mark was conscious that music was not his destiny.","t":"马克意识到音乐并不是他的**最终归宿**。","d":"destined（adj. 命中注定的）"},
20339:{"w":"hide","e":"It is improbable that there is a planet hidden behind the sun.","t":"在太阳的背后不可能**藏**着一颗行星。"},
20340:{"w":"former","e":"The world's food production will move from Western Europe to the former communist countries and parts of the developing world.","t":"世界粮食生产将从西欧转移到**前**社会主义国家和一些发展中国家。","r":"联想记忆：form（形成）+er（表人或物）→已形成的东西→前者","d":"formerly（adv. 从前，以前）"},
20341:{"w":"awful","e":"The food at the restaurant was awful.","t":"这家饭店的食物很**糟糕**。"},
20342:{"w":"sore","e":"He's had so many colds and sore throats recently.","t":"他最近常常感冒，嗓子也经常**痛**。"},
20343:{"w":"virtually","e":"There is virtually no evidence to support his argument.","t":"**几乎**没有任何证据可以支持他的论点。"},
20344:{"w":"tangibly","e":"This improvement, while not tangibly measurable, has increased the ability of management.","t":"这一进步，虽然没法**具体**衡量，但是提高了管理能力。","r":"词根记忆：tang（接触）+ibl（=ible，可…的）+y→可触摸地"},
20345:{"w":"windscreen","e":"You must attach it to the front windscreen of your car.","t":"你必须把它贴在汽车前面的**挡风玻璃**上。","r":"组合词：wind（风）+screen（屏，遮蔽物）→挡风玻璃"},
20346:{"w":"decent","e":"You can't get anything decent under $15.","t":"花不到15美金不可能买到**像样**的东西。"},
20347:{"w":"alluvial","e":"The seabed here consisted of alluvial silt and mud deposits.","t":"此地的海床由**冲积**到这里的细沙和沉积的淤泥构成。","c":"alluvial gold 冲积砂金"},
20348:{"w":"slum","e":"Such rapid and uncontrolled growth helped to turn parts of cities into slums.","t":"这种快速而无节制的增长使城市的某些地区变成了**贫民窟**。"},
20349:{"w":"distill","e":"The vacuum distillation unit distills heavy and light gas oils.","t":"真空蒸馏装置**精炼出**重柴油和轻柴油。"},
20350:{"w":"economical","e":"The government set some policies to help meet the demand for more economical use of land.","t":"政府制定了一些政策，以满足更为**经济**地利用土地的需要。","d":"economically（adv. 节约地；经济上）"},
20351:{"w":"medication","e":"The doctor writes what medication you need on the prescription.","t":"医生在处方上写了你需要吃的**药**。","r":"词根记忆：med（治疗）+ication→药；药物","c":"be on medication for sth. 因…而吃药"},
20352:{"w":"target","e":"Everyone should have a target in mind for the first year of college life.","t":"每个人在大学生活的第一年都应该有个**目标**。","r":"联想记忆：tar（音似：它）+get（得到）→我的目标是得到它→目标","c":"target sth. at/on sb./sth. 把…作为…的目标"},
20353:{"w":"independent","e":"Mary was an independent-minded student.","t":"玛丽是个有**独立**见解的学生。","c":"be independent of 独立于，不受…约束","d":"independently（adv. 独立地）"},
20354:{"w":"radius","e":"Some local carpenters could only accept jobs in a three-kilometer radius.","t":"当地的一些木匠只能接受**方圆**三千米内的工作。","r":"词根记忆：radi（光线）+us→半径就像是从同一点散发出的许多光线→半径","c":"with a twenty-meter radius 半径是20米","y":"range（n. 幅度，范围）；parameter（n. [常pl.] 界限，范围）"},
20355:{"w":"fossil","e":"Fuel produced from crop residues is rarely competitive with fossil fuels at the present time.","t":"由农作物残渣制成的燃料目前还不具备与**矿物**燃料竞争的实力。"},
20356:{"w":"shade","e":"Dark colours give an aura of authority while lighter pastel shades suggest approachability.","t":"深色调给人一种权威的感觉，而清淡柔和的**色调**使人感到亲切。"},
20357:{"w":"wean","e":"It is hard to wean children off picture books when pictures have played a major part throughout their reading experiences.","t":"当图画在孩子们的阅读中扮演着主要角色时，很难让他们**戒掉**图画书，去阅读不带图画的书籍。"},
20358:{"w":"comprise","e":"The hotel comprises 82 one-bedroom apartments and 12 suites.","t":"这家酒店**有**82间单人床位的公寓和12间套房。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+pris（抓）+e→（包括）抓住的东西→包含","c":"be comprised in 归入…"},
20359:{"w":"stable","e":"The society will remain stable over the long term.","t":"社会将保持长期**稳定**。","r":"联想记忆：那张破旧的桌子（table）居然很稳（stable）"},
20360:{"w":"disappointing","e":"The students find the exhibition disappointing.","t":"学生们觉得这个展览**令人失望**。","r":"来自disappoint（v. 失望）","d":"disappointment（n. 失望）"},
20361:{"w":"delta","e":"River deltas are difficult places for map makers.","t":"河流**三角洲**地带是让地图绘制者感到头疼的地方。","c":"the Nile Delta 尼罗河三角洲"},
20362:{"w":"urban","e":"The concentration of vehicles makes air quality in urban areas unpleasant.","t":"汽车大量集中在**市**区，使得这里的空气污浊不堪。","c":"urban areas 城市地区；urban residents 城市居民","d":"urbanisation（n. 都市化）"},
20363:{"w":"compliment","e":"Thank you for your compliments.","t":"谢谢你的**称赞**。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+pli（装满）+ment（表行为）→一起满足某人的愿望→赞美"},
20364:{"w":"execution","e":"The manager had failed in the execution of her duty.","t":"经理未能**履行**职责。","r":"来自execute（v. 执行）","d":"executioner（n. 行刑者）"},
20365:{"w":"reign","e":"Leo is an ambitious man, who wants to reign over the country.","t":"里奥是一个有野心的人，他想要**统治**整个国家。","r":"联想记忆：和foreign（adj. 外国的）一起记忆","c":"reign over 统治"},
20366:{"w":"heritage","e":"The highland games are part of Scotland's cultural heritage.","t":"高地竞技是苏格兰文化**遗产**的一部分。","r":"词根记忆：herit（继承）+age（表集体名词）→遗产；传统","c":"cultural heritage 文化遗产","y":"legacy（n. 遗产，遗留之物，遗赠物）；inheritance（n. 遗产，继承物；遗赠）"},
20367:{"w":"appropriate","e":"Personality questionnaires are used by many companies to put people in appropriate areas of work.","t":"很多公司通过性格测试的方式把员工安排到**合适的**工作岗位上。","r":"词根记忆：ap（表加强）+propri（拥有）+ate（使…）→强行拥有（公物）→占有，挪用","c":"be appropriate to 适于；appropriate sth. for 拨出（款项）供…之用"},
20368:{"w":"annual","e":"All students at the college are entitled to become members of the Sports Centre for an annual fee of $200.","t":"在校大学生只需交200美元的**年**费，就可以成为运动中心的会员。","r":"词根记忆：annu（年）+al（…的）→每年的，年度的","c":"annual report 年度报告；annual rainfall 年降雨量；annual budget 年度预算；annual income 年收入","d":"annually（adv. 一年一次，每年）"},
20369:{"w":"depict","e":"The photographs depicted vivid scenes of a young girl's life.","t":"这些照片栩栩如生地**描绘**出一个年轻女孩的生活。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+pict（描绘）→描绘，描述","d":"depiction（n. 描绘，描述）","y":"describe（v. 描写，描述）；represent（vt. 表现，描绘）；picture（vt. 画，描绘）"},
20370:{"w":"literacy","e":"There is a great concern in many nations about declining standards of literacy in schools.","t":"学校**文化教育**标准的降低令许多国家十分担心。","r":"词根记忆：liter（文字）+acy（表状态）→有文化","d":"illiteracy（n. 文盲）"},
20371:{"w":"calculate","e":"It has been calculated that 17 percent of lung cancer cases can be attributed to high levels of exposure to second-hand tobacco smoke.","t":"据**统计**，有17%的肺癌是由于长期处于二手烟环境而引起的。","r":"词根记忆：calcul（计算）+ate→计算；推测","c":"be calculated to do sth. 旨在做某事，故意做某事；calculated crime 有预谋的犯罪"},
20372:{"w":"luxury","e":"He saved some money for luxuries such as fine paintings.","t":"他积攒了一些钱，想买一些精品油画之类的**奢侈品**。","r":"词根记忆：lux（明亮的）+ury→光彩的→奢侈（品）；奢华的","c":"live in luxury / lead a life of luxury 过奢侈的生活","d":"luxuriant（adj. 繁茂的；肥沃的）"},
20373:{"w":"purchase","e":"If you'd like to purchase any of George's books or other souvenirs, leave the house by the side entrance.","t":"如果你想**购买**乔治的书或其他纪念品，请从房子的侧门离开。","r":"联想记忆：pur+chase（追逐）→为得到紧俏的商品而竞相追逐→购买","c":"purchase from 从…处购买","d":"purchaser（n. 购买者，采购人）"},
20374:{"w":"constant","e":"We need to have a constant supply of bikes to tourists.","t":"我们需要**不断地**向游客提供自行车。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+stant（站）→一直站着→坚定的，永恒的，忠实的","c":"constant temperature 恒温；constant speed 恒定速度；constant value 不变价值","d":"constantly（adv. 不变地；不断地）；constancy（n. 恒定不变）"},
20375:{"w":"dormancy","e":"That huge volcano erupted after one hundred years of dormancy.","t":"在长达一百年的**休眠**之后，那座巨大的火山又喷发了。","r":"词根记忆：dorm（睡）+ancy（表状态）→休眠；催眠状态；冬眠"},
20376:{"w":"particular","e":"Does the course have anything in particular?","t":"这门课程有什么**特殊**之处吗？","r":"词根记忆：part（部分）+icular（属于…的）→只属于部分的→特别的","c":"in particular 特别，尤其","d":"particularity（n. 特性；特殊性）；particularly（adv. 特别，尤其）"},
20377:{"w":"subscription","e":"A statue in his memory was erected by public subscription.","t":"由公众**捐资**建起一座纪念他的雕像。"},
20378:{"w":"pitch","e":"The little device can give off a high pitched noise when you whistle.","t":"当你吹口哨时，这个小装置就会发出**尖锐**刺耳的声音。","c":"football/rugby pitch 足球/橄榄球场地；on the pitch 在场上比赛；off the pitch 在场下","d":"pitcher（n. 投球手；大水壶）"},
20379:{"w":"entitle","e":"As a member of the museum you would be entitled to use the members' lounge for refreshments.","t":"作为博物馆的会员，你**有权**在会员休息室内享用茶点。","r":"联想记忆：en（使…）+title（题目，标题）→使有题目或标题→给（书、文章等）题名","c":"be entitled to 有权…，有资格…"},
20380:{"w":"shutter","e":"In 1889 an improved model with a new shutter design was introduced, and it was called the No. 2 Kodak camera.","t":"1889年推出的“柯达二号”是一款装有新型**快门**的改良型相机。","r":"来自shut（v. 关闭）"},
20381:{"w":"demolish","e":"Many of the buildings which were poorly designed and constructed have been demolished.","t":"许多设计和建造粗糙的建筑物都被**拆除**了。","r":"词根记忆：de（表相反）+mol（堆）+ish（使…）→使不成堆→破坏；拆除"},
20382:{"w":"durable","e":"The table shows the consumer durables (telephone, refrigerator, etc.) owned in Britain from 1972 to 1983.","t":"该表格显示了从1972年到1983年英国**耐用**消费品（如电话、电冰箱等）的拥有情况。","r":"词根记忆：dur（持久）+able（可…的）→持久的；耐用的","c":"durable peace 持久的和平","d":"durability（n. 耐久性；耐用性）"},
20383:{"w":"cope","e":"Books are available to help employees cope with stress.","t":"书籍有助于员工**应对**压力。","c":"cope with 处理；应付"},
20384:{"w":"circulation","e":"Nicotine and other toxins in cigarette will affect blood circulation throughout the body.","t":"香烟中的尼古丁和其他毒素会影响人体内的血液**循环**。","r":"来自circulate（v. 循环，流通）","y":"flow（n. 流动）"},
20385:{"w":"tradition","e":"Individuals often find it hard to escape from the role that cultural traditions have defined for them.","t":"人们经常发现难以摆脱文化**传统**给自己限定的角色。","d":"traditional（adj. 传统的；惯例的）；traditionally（adv. 传统地；惯例地）"},
20386:{"w":"benefit","e":"Increased leisure time would benefit two-career households.","t":"增加休息时间会使双职工家庭**受益**。","r":"词根记忆：bene（好）+fit（做）→益处，好处","c":"benefit from/by 从…得益，受益于；material benefit 物质利益；for the benefit of 为了…的利益（或好处）；social benefits 社会效益"},
20387:{"w":"decay","e":"The wooden bridge was unsafe due to decay.","t":"这座木桥**腐烂**了，不安全。","r":"联想记忆：骗（decoy）人变坏（decay）","c":"dental decay 龋齿"},
20388:{"w":"distribution","e":"A society can achieve a fair distribution of resources only under conditions of economic growth.","t":"只有在经济增长的前提下，社会才可能对资源进行公平**分配**。","c":"distribution channel 分配渠道"},
20389:{"w":"defect","e":"Foetuses can be tested for genetic defects while in the womb.","t":"胎儿还在子宫里时就可以通过检查看其是否存在基因**缺陷**。","r":"词根记忆：de（毁）+fect（做）→做坏了→缺点，不足之处","d":"defective（adj. 有缺点的；不完全的）"},
20390:{"w":"oppose","e":"Some environmentalists have opposed economic development of any kind.","t":"一些环保主义者**反对**任何形式的经济发展。","r":"词根记忆：op（逆）+pos（放）+e→反着放→反对，反抗","c":"be opposed to 反对…；oppose oneself to 反对…"},
20391:{"w":"statistics","e":"I'm quite interested in statistics about the schools in the different zones.","t":"我对不同区域的学校的**统计资料**很感兴趣。"},
20392:{"w":"stuffy","e":"We've installed air conditioning, so it won't get so hot and stuffy.","t":"我们安装了空调，因此不会太**闷**热。","r":"联想记忆：stuff（塞满）+y→塞得满满当当的，很闷→不透气的"},
20393:{"w":"approximately","e":"The next bus will come in approximately five minutes.","t":"下一班公交车**大约**会在五分钟后到达。"},
20394:{"w":"excusable","e":"Absent-mindedness is an excusable human weakness.","t":"心不在焉是人的一种**可以原谅的**缺点。","r":"来自excuse（n./vt. 原谅）","c":"an excusable mistake 一个可原谅的错误"},
20395:{"w":"propose","e":"I understand that Bob is familiar with Manchester Park and propose letting him show you around.","t":"我知道鲍勃对曼彻斯特公园很熟，**建议**让他带你去逛逛。","r":"词根记忆：pro（在前）+pos（放）+e→在前面放出→行动之前指出→建议，提议","d":"proposal（n. 提案；建议）"},
20396:{"w":"ornament","e":"The exhibition wall is covered with paintings and ornaments.","t":"这面展示墙上挂满了油画和**装饰物**。","r":"词根记忆：orna（=orn，装饰）+ment（表具体物）→装饰物","c":"for ornament 以作装饰；be ornamented with sth. 用…装饰","d":"ornamental（adj. 装饰性的，装饰用的）；ornamenter（n.装饰者）"},
20397:{"w":"energetic","e":"I don't like doing energetic exercises in the evening.","t":"我不喜欢在晚上做**剧烈**运动。","r":"来自energy（n. 精神，活力）","c":"an energetic person 一个精力旺盛的人"},
20398:{"w":"atmospheric","e":"The main reason for atmospheric pollution is the increase of carbon dioxide emissions.","t":"**大气**污染的主要原因是二氧化碳排放量的增加。","c":"atmospheric pressure 大气压；atmospheric conditions 大气状况"},
20399:{"w":"cooperative","e":"The members in the club are very cooperative.","t":"这个俱乐部的成员都非常**配合**。","c":"cooperative enterprises 合作企业；make a cooperative effort共同努力","d":"uncooperative（adj. 不合作的，不配合的）；cooperate（vi.合作，配合）；cooperation（n. 合作，协作）"},
20400:{"w":"corrode","e":"Acid rain can corrode metal and stone work.","t":"酸雨能**腐蚀**金属制品和石头制品。","r":"词根记忆：cor（表加强）+rod（咬）+e→不断侵咬，使其腐坏→腐蚀；侵蚀"},
20401:{"w":"honour","e":"The planet was for a time called Herschel in honour of its discoverer.","t":"为了**纪念**这颗行星的发现者，它一度被称为赫舍尔星。"},
20402:{"w":"dislodge","e":"The bear used a tree branch on multiple occasions to dislodge a piece of meat hung out of his reach.","t":"熊多次用树枝**取下**挂在自己够不着的地方的肉。"},
20403:{"w":"soluble","e":"Fat soluble vitamins can be stored for quite some time in the body.","t":"**能溶于**脂肪的维生素可在体内储存很久。","r":"词根记忆：solu（松开）+ble（=ible，可…的）→可松解的→可溶的；可解决的","c":"soluble material 可溶性物质","y":"resoluble（adj. 可解决的；可分解的）","f":"unsolvable（adj. 不能溶解的；无法解决的）"},
20404:{"w":"administration","e":"The administration office is opposite the car park on the left.","t":"**管理**办公室在停车场对面的左边。","r":"联想记忆：ad+ministr（看作minister，部长）+ation→部长的工作→管理；行政"},
20405:{"w":"environment","e":"The one kind of subsidy whose removal appeared to have been bad for the environment was the subsidy to manage soil erosion.","t":"取消对土地流失管理部门的补助金给**环境**带来了不利影响。","c":"working/learning environment 工作/学习环境；political environment 政治环境","d":"environmental（adj. 环境的）"},
20406:{"w":"licence","e":"They all have gone through a very tough training period to get a special taxi driving licence.","t":"他们都经历了一段非常严格的训练才获得了专门的出租车驾驶**执照**。","c":"driving licence 驾驶执照；grant a licence 批准许可证"},
20407:{"w":"underline","e":"You can underline new words encountered in your reading.","t":"你可以在阅读中遇到的新单词下面**画线**做标记。","r":"组合词：under（在…下）+line（画线）→在…下面画线→画线于…之下；强调"},
20408:{"w":"activate","e":"Nicotine in cigarette smoke activates small blood cells that increase the likelihood of blood clots, thereby affecting blood circulation throughout the body.","t":"香烟中的尼古丁会**激活**小的血细胞，这些血细胞增加了血栓的可能性，从而影响体内的血液循环。","r":"词根记忆：act（做）+iv+ate（使…）→使活跃→激活","d":"activator（n. 催化剂）"},
20409:{"w":"major","e":"In Mexico city, vehicle pollution is a major health hazard.","t":"在墨西哥城，交通污染是人们健康的一个**主要**威胁。","r":"词根记忆：maj（大）+or→较大的→主要的"},
20410:{"w":"specific","e":"Do you have any specific studying goals for this year?","t":"今年你有**具体的**学习目标吗？","d":"specifically（adv. 特定地；明确地）"},
20411:{"w":"objective","e":"The objective of the Human Genome Project is simple to state.","t":"人类基因工程的**目标**很容易说明。","c":"strategic objective 战略目标；achieve the objective 达到目的；be objective about sth. 客观看待某事；objective reality 客观事实"},
20412:{"w":"concentrate","e":"The Ancient Greeks used lenses or concave mirrors to concentrate the sun's rays.","t":"古希腊人利用透镜或凹面镜来**聚集**太阳光。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+centr（中心）+ate（使…）→使…成为中心→集中，聚集","c":"concentrate on 集中精力于，全神贯注于","d":"concentration（n. 集中，聚集）"},
20413:{"w":"conflict","e":"Friction management means handling conflicts in a positive and constructive manner.","t":"摩擦管理就是指用一种积极的、有建设性的方式来处理**冲突**。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+flict（打击）→两边打斗→冲突","c":"come into conflict with sb. 与某人起冲突"},
20414:{"w":"antidote","e":"Researchers could not say for sure which medicine might be a successful antidote to bacterial infection.","t":"研究人员不能确定哪种药可以有效地**治疗**细菌感染。","r":"词根记忆：anti（抗）+dote（=dose，药剂）→抗（毒）药→解毒药","c":"antidote to …的解毒剂"},
20415:{"w":"discover","e":"Scientists are working to discover the links between the weather and people's moods and performance.","t":"科学家正致力于通过研究来**发现**天气和人的情绪、行为之间的联系。","d":"discovery（n. 发现）"},
20416:{"w":"necessarily","e":"As an international student you'll not necessarily be eligible for all the facilities offered to resident students.","t":"作为国际学生，你不**一定**有资格享受当地学生享有的所有便利。"},
20417:{"w":"turret","e":"From the castle turret, people could oversee this beautiful river.","t":"从城堡的**塔楼**上，人们可以俯瞰这条美丽的河流。"},
20418:{"w":"continent","e":"Australia is a dry continent, second only to Antarctic in its lack of rainfall.","t":"澳大利亚是一片干燥的**大陆**，降水量之少仅次于南极洲，位居世界第二。","d":"continental（adj. 欧洲大陆的 n. 欧洲人）"},
20419:{"w":"elastic","e":"The ropes are made of elastic fabrics.","t":"这些绳子是由**弹性**纤维制成的。","r":"联想记忆：e（出）+last（延长）+ic（…的）→可延长的→有弹性的；灵活的"},
20420:{"w":"enhance","e":"Organisations provide a range of opportunities for women to enhance their skills.","t":"一些组织为妇女提供大量**提高**她们技能的机会。","c":"enhance one's reputation 提高声誉；enhance one's confidence增强信心；enhance the ability 提高能力"},
20421:{"w":"demonstration","e":"Thousands of people took part in the demonstration.","t":"数千人参加了**示威游行**。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+monstr（显示）+ation（表行为）→论证；显示"},
20422:{"w":"interrupt","e":"A: How does your headache affect your daily life? B: It has interrupted my work.","t":"A: 头痛对你的日常生活有什么影响？B: 它**妨碍**到了我工作。","r":"词根记忆：inter（在…之间）+rupt（断裂）→在中间断裂→中断，中止；打断，打扰","c":"interrupt the work 打扰工作","d":"interruption（n. 打扰，打断）"},
20423:{"w":"redundant","e":"Jill was unlucky to be made redundant from her job.","t":"吉尔不幸**被解雇**。","r":"词根记忆：red（=re，回）+und（波动）+ant（…的）→回流的→多余的，过剩的；累赘的","d":"redundancy（n. 裁员；过多，过剩）","y":"superfluous（adj. 多余的，过剩的）；excessive（adj. 过多的；过分的）","f":"indispensable（adj. 不可或缺的）；scanty（adj. 不够的，贫乏的）"},
20424:{"w":"mishandle","e":"In our experience some types of exercise are easily mishandled and can lead to more harm than good.","t":"根据我们的经验，一些锻炼很容易**操作不当**，进而弊大于利。","c":"mishandled baggage 错运行李"},
20425:{"w":"amend","e":"The tutor told his student to amend the final edition of his paper and hand it in next Monday.","t":"导师让他的学生再**修改**一下论文终稿，下周一上交。","r":"词根记忆：a（表加强）+mend（修理）→修正"},
20426:{"w":"suppression","e":"The government's violent suppression of the protests was widely criticised by international human rights groups.","t":"政府对抗议活动的暴力**镇压**受到了国际人权组织的广泛批评。","r":"来自suppress（vt. 镇压，抑制）","c":"fire suppression system 灭火系统"},
20427:{"w":"mainly","e":"The weather is mainly cold and wet in England.","t":"英格兰的天气以阴冷**为主**。"},
20428:{"w":"property","e":"Malleability is a physical property.","t":"延展性是（物质的）一个物理**特性**。","r":"联想记忆：proper（固有的）+ty（表物）→固有物→财产，所有物","c":"intellectual property 知识产权；assignment of property 产权转让；lost property 失物招领"},
20429:{"w":"naked","e":"The luminaries that can be seen by our naked eyes are quite a small part of the universe.","t":"我们**肉**眼所能看到的天体仅仅是宇宙中很小的一部分。"},
20430:{"w":"feature","e":"Asymmetry is a common feature of the human body.","t":"不对称是人体的一个普遍**特征**。","r":"联想记忆：我的未来（future）由我主演（feature）","c":"distinguishing feature 显著特色"},
20431:{"w":"lens","e":"Lenses can be used to concentrate the sun's rays.","t":"**透镜**可用来聚集太阳光。","r":"联想记忆：借（lend）你透镜（lens）用用"},
20432:{"w":"coordinator","e":"He worked in the government as an economic development coordinator.","t":"他在政府工作，是一名经济发展**协调员**。","r":"来自coordinate（v. 调整；整理）"},
20433:{"w":"nourish","e":"All the children were well nourished and in good physical condition.","t":"所有这些孩子都**营养**良好，身体健康。","d":"nourishing（adj. 有营养的）","y":"nurture（vt. 抚育，教养）；foster（v. 培养，培育）"},
20434:{"w":"crisp","e":"The answers from the soldiers are crisp and assured.","t":"士兵们的回答**干脆**而肯定。","r":"发音记忆：该词的发音就像咬薯片的声音"},
20435:{"w":"guilty","e":"The information can lead to the conviction of any person guilty of placing metal pieces in products.","t":"这些信息可以将那些**犯有**把金属片放入产品中之罪的人绳之以法。","c":"be guilty of doing sth. 因做某事而内疚；因做某事而获罪"},
20436:{"w":"smuggle","e":"Then, in 1770, a Frenchman named Pierre Poivre successfully smuggled nutmeg plants to safety in Mauritius, an island off the coast of Africa.","t":"后来，在1770年，一个名叫皮埃尔·普瓦夫尔的法国人成功地将肉豆蔻植株**走私**到了毛里求斯——一座离非洲海岸不远的岛屿上的安全之处。","r":"联想记忆：不断进行反对走私（smuggle）的斗争（struggle）"},
20437:{"w":"flourish","e":"Research in Britain has shown the \"green consumers\" continue to flourish as a significant group amongst shoppers.","t":"英国的调查表明，作为购物人群重要组成部分的“绿色消费者”仍然很**活跃**。","r":"词根记忆：flour（花）+ish（使…）→像花一样绽放→繁荣；茂盛","c":"with a flourish 兴旺；in full flourish 盛极一时"},
20438:{"w":"reserve","e":"We reserved the room a week ago.","t":"我们一星期前就**预订**了这个房间。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+serv（保持）+e→预订；保留","d":"reservation（n. 预订；保留）"},
20439:{"w":"dimensional","e":"In a similar way, a three-dimensional truss can be built up of tetrahedra.","t":"采用类似的方法，三**维**托架可以由四面体构成。","c":"three-dimensional image 三维图像"},
20440:{"w":"gravel","e":"There is a gravel path from my home to school.","t":"从我家去学校有一条**沙砾**小路。","r":"词根记忆：grav（重）+el（表物）→沙砾"},
20441:{"w":"insulation","e":"The good insulation will reduce heating loss.","t":"良好的**隔热**会减少热损失。","c":"insulation layer 绝缘层；acoustic insulation 隔音；thermal insulation 隔热"},
20442:{"w":"improvise","e":"Whereas medieval builders improvised and adapted construction through their intimate knowledge of materials and personal experience of the conditions on a site, building designs are now conceived and stored in media technologies that detach the designer from the physical and social realities they are creating.","t":"中世纪的建筑师通过对材料的深入了解和对场地环境的亲身体验，**即兴创作**和改造了建筑，而现在的建筑设计主要通过媒体技术构思和存储，这就使得设计师与他们所创造的实体和社会现实相分离。","r":"词根记忆：im（不）+pro（在…前面）+vis（看）+e→没有预先看过→即兴创作","d":"improvisation（n. 即席创作；即兴作品）"},
20443:{"w":"hesitation","e":"Tom bought the house immediately without hesitation.","t":"汤姆毫不**犹豫**，当即买下了这幢房子。","c":"without hesitation 毫不犹豫；have no hesitation in doing sth.做某事时没有犹豫"},
20444:{"w":"undermine","e":"The constant failure was starting to undermine my confidence.","t":"接连的失败开始**削弱**我的自信心。","r":"组合词：under（下面）+mine（挖）→在下面挖→削弱；破坏","c":"undermine one's position 削弱某人的地位；undermine one's credibility 破坏某人的信用","d":"underminer（n. 暗中破坏者）","y":"weaken〔v. 削弱；（使）变弱〕","f":"strengthen（vt. 加强，巩固）；intensify（v. 增强）；reinforce（vt. 加强，加固）"},
20445:{"w":"eliminate","e":"Job descriptions eliminate role ambiguity for managers.","t":"职位描述**消除**了经理们对角色认识的模糊不清。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+limin（限制）+ate（使…）→消除对事物的限制→消灭，消除","c":"eliminate poverty 消除贫困；eliminate crime 消除犯罪"},
20446:{"w":"exclude","e":"Thick curtains help to exclude street noises.","t":"厚窗帘有助于**阻挡**街上的噪音。","r":"词根记忆：ex（外）+clud（关闭）+e→关在外面→把…排斥在外","c":"exclude sth. from sth. 把…排除在…之外"},
20447:{"w":"laundry","e":"You should pay a laundry fee which covers the cleaning of bed linens and towels.","t":"你必须支付包括清洗床上用品和毛巾在内的所有**洗衣**费用。","r":"词根记忆：lau（洗）+nd+ry（表地点）→洗衣房","c":"do the laundry 洗衣"},
20448:{"w":"apparently","e":"Apparently, a caretaker government seemed not to be potent.","t":"**看来**，临时政府似乎无法胜任工作。"},
20449:{"w":"gelatin","e":"Gelatin dry plates are used in the film-making industry.","t":"**明胶**干燥后制成的底版被用于电影制造业。"},
20450:{"w":"stimulate","e":"Why don't we try massaging the feet to stimulate blood flow?","t":"我们为什么不试试按摩双足来**促进**血液循环呢？"},
20451:{"w":"fuel","e":"Such fuels produce far less carbon dioxide than coal or oil.","t":"这些**燃料**所产生的二氧化碳要比煤和石油产生的少得多。","c":"solid fuel 固体燃料；nuclear fuel 核燃料；add fuel to the fire/flame 火上浇油"},
20452:{"w":"operational","e":"We need some advanced operational staff.","t":"我们需要一些高级**操作**人员。","r":"来自operate（v. 操作；运转）"},
20453:{"w":"image","e":"Their images were always dry and dusty.","t":"他们总是一副不修边幅、蓬头垢面的**形象**。"},
20454:{"w":"distribute","e":"The port of the city draws to it raw materials and distributes them in many other forms.","t":"城市港口的功能主要在于集中原材料，然后通过其他形式把它们**分送**出去。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+tribut（给予）+e→分开给予→分发，分送","c":"distribute sth. equally 平均分配；distribute expenses 分配经费","d":"distribution（n. 分配；分布）"},
20455:{"w":"intend","e":"I intend to prove to you why those people were mistaken.","t":"我**要**证明给你看为什么那些人错了。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+tend（伸展）→使（想法）伸展→想要，打算","d":"unintended（adj. 无意的；没有计划的）"},
20456:{"w":"empirical","e":"Amazingly, there is virtually no empirical evidence to support the use of illustrations in teaching reading.","t":"令人惊讶的是，事实上并没有**实验性**证据可以证明图表在阅读教学中的作用。","f":"theoretical（adj. 理论的）"},
20457:{"w":"probation","e":"I was just a servant who was on probation.","t":"我只是一个处于**试用期**的仆人。","r":"词根记忆：prob（证明）+ation（表行为）→证明是否可以胜任→试用期","d":"probationary（adj. 试用的，实习中的）"},
20458:{"w":"depression","e":"The economic depression of the 1930s and the Second World War prevented the advanced ideas from being widely realized.","t":"20世纪30年代的经济**萧条**和第二次世界大战阻碍了先进思想的传播，使其不能得到广泛认识。","r":"来自depress（vt. 使消沉，使沮丧）","c":"the Great Depression 大萧条；economic depression 经济萧条"},
20459:{"w":"proximity","e":"I chose the flat for its proximity to my company.","t":"我选这个公寓是因为它离我们公司**近**。","r":"词根记忆：proxim（接近）+ity（表状况）→接近，邻近；亲近","c":"proximity to 邻近，亲近；in close proximity 非常接近","y":"vicinity（n. 邻近，附近）","f":"distance（n. 远离，远隔）"},
20460:{"w":"attention","e":"One problem that deserves attention now is the severe climate.","t":"现在，恶劣的气候是需要引起人们**关注**的一个问题。","r":"词根记忆：at（表加强）+tent（伸展）+ion（表状态）→（听得）伸长了脖子→注意（力）","c":"attract/draw（one's） attention to 吸引注意力，令（某人）注意某事物；divert attention from 转移注意力；pay attention to 注意；catch the attention of 引起…的注意"},
20461:{"w":"factual","e":"The task is intended to test your skills of skimming for factual information.","t":"该任务旨在测试你略读**事实**信息的能力。","r":"联想记忆：fact（事实）+ual→事实的；真实的"},
20462:{"w":"acclaim","e":"There's lots to see and to do, including the internationally-acclaimed climbing wall built on the site of the old aquarium.","t":"这里有很多可看的和可玩的，其中包括那个建在水族馆旧址上**享誉**世界的攀岩墙。","r":"词根记忆：ac（表加强）+claim（呼喊）→一再呼喊→向…欢呼，为…喝彩","c":"win worldwide acclaim 赢得广泛的赞誉；receive great acclaim 备受赞扬","d":"acclaimed（adj. 受欢呼的，受称赞的）"},
20463:{"w":"carry","e":"We advised the students to carry either euros or dollars.","t":"我们建议学生**带**欧元或美元。","c":"carry off 夺去；carry on 继续下去，坚持下去；carry out 贯彻，实现；carry...through 成功完成，顺利实现"},
20464:{"w":"devastate","e":"The writer had been devastated by the death of his seven-year-old elder daughter.","t":"作者因七岁的大女儿夭折而**崩溃**了。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+vast（广阔的）+ate（使…）→使大面积摧毁→破坏","c":"be devastated by 被…破坏"},
20465:{"w":"response","e":"The news provoked an angry response.","t":"这条消息引起了人们的愤怒**反应**。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+spons（承诺）+e→回答；反应","c":"response for... 对…负责，是造成…的原因；in response to 答复，响应；适应","d":"responsive（adj. 反应积极的）"},
20466:{"w":"dull","e":"We all think his tutorial topic is dull.","t":"我们都认为他的辅导主题令人**乏味**。","r":"联想记忆：和充实的（full）相反的是乏味的（dull）"},
20467:{"w":"basis","e":"Water transport means cheap access, the chief basis of all port economies.","t":"水路运输意味着运费低廉，这也是建立所有港口经济的主要**基础**。","c":"on the basis of 根据…，在…的基础上"},
20468:{"w":"tropical","e":"Tropical rainforests are home to more than half of the world's plant and animal species.","t":"**热带**雨林是世界上一半以上动植物物种的栖息地。","r":"词根记忆：trop（转）+ical（…的）→热得令人晕头转向→热带的；炎热的","c":"tropical condition 热带环境；tropical disease 热带病；tropical rainforest 热带雨林；tropical marine climate 热带海洋气候"},
20469:{"w":"rumour","e":"The rumour soon gained currency.","t":"**谣言**很快就流传开了。","r":"发音记忆：“辱骂”→谣言往往比辱骂更伤人→谣言"},
20470:{"w":"endeavour","e":"I wished the result of my endeavours to be respectable.","t":"我希望我**努力**的结果能得到尊重。","r":"联想记忆：end（尽头）+eav（看作eager，热情）+our（我们的）→用尽了我们的热情→努力，尽力","c":"endeavour to do sth. 努力做某事"},
20471:{"w":"address","e":"In the marketing course we address all these commercial issues.","t":"在营销课上，我们**讨论**所有这些商业问题。","c":"address a letter 给信写上地址；address sb. 向…致词"},
20472:{"w":"payment","e":"You may spread your payments over a longer period.","t":"你可以将你的**支付**期顺延得更长。"},
20473:{"w":"superb","e":"The mountains of the central island provide superb ski facilities in winter.","t":"岛屿中部的山脉为冬天滑雪提供了**绝佳的**场地。","c":"superb advertisements 精彩的广告"},
20474:{"w":"intention","e":"We all listened carefully as the director outlined his intentions.","t":"我们都认真聆听了导演对他的**意图**的概述。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+tent（伸展）+ion→向内伸展→意图，目的"},
20475:{"w":"demonstrate","e":"Crick and Watson demonstrated the structure of the DNA molecule in their academic papers.","t":"克里克和沃森在他们的学术论文中**论证**了DNA的分子结构。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+monstr（显示）+ate→加强显示→论证；说明","c":"demonstrate one's ability 显示自己的能力","d":"demonstration（n. 示范，表演）","y":"display（v. 展览；显示）；illustrate（vt. 举例说明，阐明）；show（v. 说明，显示）"},
20476:{"w":"agenda","e":"Blueprinting a meeting involves creating an agenda and clarifying rules for the meeting.","t":"起草会议计划包括制定会议**议程**和明确会议章程。","r":"词根记忆：ag（做）+enda（表名词复数）→做的事情→议程"},
20477:{"w":"illuminate","e":"The street was illuminated by fireworks.","t":"这条街被焰火**照得通明**。","r":"词根记忆：il（进入）+lumin（光）+ate（使…）→进入光明→照亮；启发","y":"illustrate（v. 举例说明，阐明）；demonstrate（v. 说明；证"},
20478:{"w":"slim","e":"I like her slim and pretty hands so much.","t":"我非常喜欢她那双**纤细**美丽的手。","r":"联想记忆：手机的sim卡通常很薄（slim）","y":"slender（adj. 苗条的，纤细的）"},
20479:{"w":"warrant","e":"The situation scarcely warrants them being dismissed.","t":"这种情况很难**证明**解雇他们是正当的。"},
20480:{"w":"optimism","e":"The document does seem to be based on an unrealistic optimism.","t":"这一文献似乎是建立在一种不现实的**乐观主义**的基础之上。","r":"词根记忆：optim（最好）+ism（…主义）→乐观主义","f":"pessimism（n. 悲观；悲观主义）"},
20481:{"w":"rank","e":"How did Kant rank the senses?","t":"康德如何对感觉进行**分类**？","r":"联想记忆：银行（bank）拥有不同社会阶层（rank）的客户"},
20482:{"w":"dimension","e":"Good health is a major resource for social, economic and personal development and an important dimension of quality of life.","t":"健康是社会、经济和个人发展的重要源泉，同时也是体现生活质量的一个重要**方面**。","r":"词根记忆：di（分开）+mens（测量）+ion（表状态）→测量→尺寸；面积","d":"dimensional（adj. 空间的）"},
20483:{"w":"avail","e":"Avail yourself of every opportunity to enrich your knowledge.","t":"**利用**每一个机会丰富自己的知识。","r":"词根记忆：a（表加强）+vail（价值）→对…有价值→有帮助，有益"},
20484:{"w":"block","e":"New residential blocks are to be completed in three months.","t":"新的住宅**区**预计三个月后完工。","c":"office blocks 办公大楼；block of flats 公寓楼","d":"blockage（n. 障碍物）"},
20485:{"w":"administrative","e":"Jack used to work in an administrative position.","t":"杰克曾就职于**行政**岗位。"},
20486:{"w":"frustrating","e":"I find it frustrating to have so few teaching resources.","t":"我发现教学资源太少，这真**令人沮丧**。"},
20487:{"w":"resistant","e":"A balanced diet helps us create a resistant body to disease.","t":"均衡的饮食可以帮助我们对疾病产生**抵抗力**。","c":"be resistant to 对…有抵抗力；acid resistant 抗酸的","d":"quake-resistant（adj. 抗震的）；wind-resistant（adj. 挡风的）"},
20488:{"w":"overdue","e":"The landlord is not very pleased because the rent is overdue.","t":"因为房租**过期未付**，房东不是很高兴。","r":"组合词：over（超过）+due（预期的）→超过期限的→逾期的"},
20489:{"w":"impressive","e":"I think this figure is especially impressive.","t":"我认为这个数字尤其**令人印象深刻**。","r":"来自impress（vt. 给…以深刻印象）","c":"the most impressive place 给人印象最深的地方","d":"impressively（adv. 令人难忘地）"},
20490:{"w":"analysis","e":"Further analysis of the experimental result is needed.","t":"试验结果需要进行进一步**分析**。","r":"词根记忆：ana（在旁边）+lys（分解）+is（表情况）→向两旁分开→分析，分解","c":"self analysis 自我分析；intelligence analysis 情报分析"},
20491:{"w":"verdict","e":"The judge will announce the court verdict tomorrow.","t":"法官明天将宣布法院的**裁定**。","r":"词根记忆：ver（真实）+dict（说）→说出事实→裁定；判断","c":"reach a verdict 作出裁定","y":"opinion（n. 主张，判断）；judgment（n. 判断；看法）"},
20492:{"w":"refresher","e":"I'd like to enquire about the refresher courses that you run.","t":"我想咨询一下您开办的**进修**课程的情况。","c":"refresher course 进修课程；refresher leave 进修假期"},
20493:{"w":"blaze","e":"The fires blaze fiercely on the plain.","t":"大火在草原上**熊熊燃烧**。","r":"联想记忆：复仇的火焰（blaze）烧得正旺，人们谴责（blame）不断"},
20494:{"w":"misjudge","e":"Politicians have misjudged the public mood.","t":"政客们对公众的情绪**判断失误**。","r":"联想记忆：mis（错）+judge（判断）→判断错误"},
20495:{"w":"pregnant","e":"The tablets are not given to children under 12 years of age or pregnant or breastfeeding women.","t":"12岁以下的儿童以及处于**妊娠期**或哺乳期的妇女禁用此药。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+gn（=gen，出生）+ant（…的）→在出生之前的→怀孕的","c":"get pregnant 怀孕"},
20496:{"w":"unyielding","e":"Mary was unyielding in her opposition to the plan.","t":"玛丽**坚决**反对这一计划。","r":"联想记忆：un（不）+yielding（屈从的，易弯曲的）→顽强的；坚固的"},
20497:{"w":"exterior","e":"All exterior doors in this especially noisy pocket will have to be solid wood core doors with hinges.","t":"在这个特别吵闹的地区，所有**通向外面的**门都必须是带铰链的坚固木芯门。","r":"联想记忆：金玉其外（exterior），败絮其中（interior）","c":"an exterior policy 对外政策"},
20498:{"w":"approve","e":"You can begin making purchases immediately after your application is approved.","t":"你的申请得到**批准**后，马上就可以购买了。","r":"联想记忆：ap+prove（证实）→经过证实才能批准→批准，同意","c":"approve of 同意…"},
20499:{"w":"client","e":"Physical fitness instructors prepare exercise routines to suit the individual client's age and level of fitness.","t":"健身教练会根据每一位**学员**的年龄和健康层次安排他（或她）的常规训练。"},
20500:{"w":"vernacular","e":"This vernacular language has never really been studied before.","t":"这种**方言**从未被真正研究过。","r":"发音记忆：“我奶哭了”→离乡多年，我奶奶一听到熟悉的乡音就激动地哭了→方言","c":"vernacular dwellings 民居；an incomprehensible vernacular 无法理解的方言"},
20501:{"w":"compare","e":"How are the expectations of today's school leavers different compared with those of the previous generation?","t":"与上一届**相比**，现在毕业生的期望有何不同？","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+par（相等）+e→放在一起看看是否相等→对比","c":"compare to 比喻成…；compare with 与…比较","d":"comparable（adj. 可比较的）；comparison（n. 比较，对"},
20502:{"w":"transparent","e":"Clear, tough, transparent and flexible, the new film not only made the rollfilm camera fully practical, but provided the raw material for the introduction of cinematography.","t":"这种新胶卷清晰、强韧、**透明**，还有弹性，不仅使卷式胶卷相机特别实用，也为电影摄影艺术的出现提供了原料。","r":"联想记忆：trans（越过）+parent（双亲）→父母之间没有什么可隐瞒的→透明的","d":"transparency（n. 透明性，透明）"},
20503:{"w":"deputy","e":"If you have any question, you may ask my deputy.","t":"如果有任何问题，可以咨询我的**代理人**。","r":"联想记忆：de+puty（看作duty，责任）→应负责任的人→代理人"},
20504:{"w":"fraud","e":"The votes are invalidated because of voter fraud.","t":"选民的**欺骗行为**使得这些选票都作废了。","c":"soccer fraud 假球，黑哨"},
20505:{"w":"bind","e":"The laws must bind everyone, high and low, or they are not laws at all.","t":"法律必须**约束**所有人，不论贵贱，否则根本就不能算是法律。","r":"发音记忆：“绑的”→捆绑"},
20506:{"w":"fragrance","e":"The rose sends out strong fragrance.","t":"玫瑰散发出浓郁的**香味**。","r":"联想记忆：frag（打碎）+rance（看作France，法国）→从法国买回来的香水瓶被打碎，芳香四溢→芳香；香水","y":"scent（n. 香味，香气）；perfume（n. 香味；香水）","f":"stink（n. 臭味，恶臭）；stench（n. 臭气，恶臭）"},
20507:{"w":"acute","e":"Dogs have very acute hearing.","t":"狗的听觉很**灵敏**。"},
20508:{"w":"ubiquitous","e":"Internet bars were ubiquitous those days.","t":"那段时间网吧很**普遍**。","r":"词根记忆：ubi（=where）+qu（=any）+itous→anywhere→普遍存在的"},
20509:{"w":"formulate","e":"She cannot formulate her idea in a few words.","t":"她无法用几句话**阐明**自己的思想。","r":"词根记忆：form（形式）+ul+ate（使…）→使具备形式→系统阐述"},
20510:{"w":"collate","e":"Customers' comments are collated regularly to identify opportunities for improvement.","t":"顾客的意见会被定期**核对**，以确保公司能在适当的时机进行改进。","r":"词根记忆：col（共同）+lat（放）+e→放到一起看→对照；核对"},
20511:{"w":"infer","e":"I infer from your letter that you have not made up your mind yet.","t":"我从你的信中**推断**出你还没下定决心。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+fer（带来）→带进（意义）→推断，猜想"},
20512:{"w":"fiction","e":"Suddenly, the stuff of science fiction doesn't seem so fanciful anymore.","t":"这些科幻**小说**似乎突然就不再那么让人充满幻想了。","c":"science fiction 科幻小说"},
20513:{"w":"ability","e":"Classes are organised according to ability level.","t":"根据**能力**水平进行分班。","c":"have the ability to do sth. 有做…的能力"},
20514:{"w":"sector","e":"Nowadays more women are being employed in the business sector.","t":"现在，就职于商业**部门**的女性越来越多。"},
20515:{"w":"creep","e":"I crept upstairs so as not to wake up other tenants.","t":"我**悄悄地爬**上楼，以免吵醒其他房客。","r":"联想记忆：兔子偷懒睡觉（sleep）时乌龟继续缓慢行进（creep）","c":"creep in/into 开始发生；creep out of 从某地悄悄出来","d":"creeping（adj. 逐渐发生的）"},
20516:{"w":"casual","e":"Helen occasionally wears casual clothes during classes.","t":"海伦有时候在课上穿**便**装。","r":"联想记忆：平常（usual）时候可以穿非正式的（casual）服装","c":"casual meeting 邂逅；casual worker 临时工；casual clothes 便装","d":"casualness（n. 偶然性）"},
20517:{"w":"interpretation","e":"My interpretation of the drama was rather superficial.","t":"我对戏剧的**理解**相当肤浅。"},
20518:{"w":"trimester","e":"The academic year is divided into three trimesters.","t":"一学年分为三**学期**。"},
20519:{"w":"consensus","e":"The general consensus is that the reform is a good thing.","t":"改革是件好事，这是**共识**。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+sens（感觉）+us→感觉相同→共识","c":"value consensus 价值共识","y":"unanimity（n. 全体一致）"},
20520:{"w":"redevelopment","e":"Now, the theatre is reopening soon after its three-year redevelopment.","t":"经过三年的**重建**，现在这家剧场很快就要重新开放了。","c":"downtown redevelopment 市区重建；economic redevelopment经济重建"},
20521:{"w":"auditorium","e":"Will the audience find any difference in the auditorium?","t":"观众们会发现这个**礼堂**有什么不同吗？","r":"词根记忆：audit（听）+orium（表场所）→听（讲座等）的地方→礼堂","c":"school auditorium 学校礼堂"},
20522:{"w":"condition","e":"The research ignored the social and environmental conditions affecting health.","t":"这一研究忽略了影响人类健康的社会环境和自然**环境**。","c":"indoor conditions 室内环境；out of condition 情况不好；on（the） condition that 以…为条件"},
20523:{"w":"narrator","e":"Peter worked as a narrator in the company.","t":"彼得在该公司做**解说员**。"},
20524:{"w":"furnish","e":"You can get free advice on furnishing your home from the interior designer.","t":"你可以从室内设计师那儿免费获得关于家居**装潢**的建议。","r":"联想记忆：fur（皮毛）+nish→供应皮毛→提供","c":"furnish sth. with sth. 用…布置…","d":"unfurnished（adj. 无家具的）"},
20525:{"w":"stabilise","e":"The patient's condition has now stabilised.","t":"现在病人的情况已经**稳定**下来了。","r":"来自stable（adj. 稳定的）","d":"stability〔n. 稳定（性）；稳固（性）〕"},
20526:{"w":"incoming","e":"Telephones in this hall can only be used to call out; they will not receive incoming calls.","t":"大厅里的电话只能打出，而不能接听外面**打进来的**电话。"},
20527:{"w":"alignment","e":"If your bed doesn't give enough support, back muscles and ligaments will work all night trying to correct spinal alignment, so you wake up with a tired aching back.","t":"如果你的床不能给你足够的支撑，背部肌肉和韧带便会整晚工作以**校直**脊椎，因此在第二天醒来时你就会觉得腰酸背痛。","r":"联想记忆：a+lign（看作line，线）+ment→排成直线"},
20528:{"w":"boot","e":"You'd better take along a good pair of hiking boots if you want to take advantage of the wonderful trails in the mountains.","t":"如果想要领略在山中徒步旅行的惊险刺激，你最好带上一双好点儿的户外**长靴**。","r":"联想记忆：足（foot）蹬长靴（boot）"},
20529:{"w":"acid","e":"DNA is the short form of deoxyribonucleic acid.","t":"DNA是脱氧核糖核**酸**的缩写形式。"},
20530:{"w":"booming","e":"The booming tourism industry has created thousands of new jobs in the coastal region over the past decade.","t":"过去十年间，**迅速发展的**旅游业在沿海地区创造了数千个新的就业岗位。","r":"来自boom（n./vi. 繁荣）","c":"booming economy 蓬勃发展的经济"},
20531:{"w":"definite","e":"I have no definite plans for my future.","t":"我对未来并没有**明确的**规划。","r":"词根记忆：de+fin（范围）+ite（有…性质的）→划定界限的→明确的，肯定的"},
20532:{"w":"deem","e":"The WHO deems that a city with more than ten million inhabitants has exceeded the healthy level.","t":"世界卫生组织**认为**，人口在一千万以上的城市已经超过了健康标准的要求。","r":"联想记忆：和seem（v. 似乎）一起记","y":"assume（vt. 假定，设想）；consider（v. 认为）；believe（v. 认为，想）"},
20533:{"w":"reorient","e":"Our students are reoriented towards social development.","t":"我们的学生要被培养成**适应**社会发展的类型。","r":"联想记忆：re（重新）+orient（确定方向）→重新定位"},
20534:{"w":"reckon","e":"Did you reckon in the cost of these raw materials?","t":"你把买这些原材料的费用**算进去**了吗？","r":"词根记忆：reck（注意，留心）+on→估计；测算","c":"reckon in 把…算在内；reckon without 未把…考虑在内"},
20535:{"w":"tutorial","e":"I think you should be ready for today's tutorial on \"how to find a good job\".","t":"我认为你已经为今天的**辅导课**“如何找到好工作”做好了准备。"},
20536:{"w":"reference","e":"The teachers will not give the range of reference books.","t":"老师们不会给出**参考**书的范围。","r":"来自refer（v. 提及）","c":"with/in reference to 关于；reference source 参考源；reference letter 推荐信；reference book 参考书"},
20537:{"w":"sledge","e":"Supplies were brought to us on large sledges from a ship fifteen kilometers away.","t":"供给品是从15公里外的船上用大**雪橇**拉来的。"},
20538:{"w":"exaggerate","e":"The witness exaggerated the seriousness of the accident.","t":"目击者**夸大**了事故的严重性。","r":"词根记忆：ex（表加强）+agger（堆积）+ate（使…）→越堆越高→夸大，夸张","d":"exaggeration（n. 夸张）；exaggerated（adj. 夸张的；故作姿态的）"},
20539:{"w":"restriction","e":"There's an open ticket which doesn't have any restrictions on time.","t":"有一种不定期客票，对时间没有任何**限制**。","c":"speed restriction 速度限制；impose restriction on 对…进行限制"},
20540:{"w":"abandon","e":"She and her tribe had to abandon their lands and retreat to Canada.","t":"她和她的部落被迫**放弃**了土地，退到加拿大。","r":"联想记忆：a+band（乐队）+on→乐队解散，放弃演出→放弃","d":"abandonment（n. 放弃，遗弃）"},
20541:{"w":"terrify","e":"Uniforms for the military were originally intended to impress and even terrify the enemy.","t":"穿着军装的最初目的是为了给敌人留下深刻印象甚至是将他们**吓退**。"},
20542:{"w":"priority","e":"The film stars went onto the stage according to priority of their appearance in the film.","t":"影星们按照他们在影片中出现的**先后顺序**依次上台。","c":"give priority to 给…优先权，优先考虑；time priority 时间先后顺序"},
20543:{"w":"habitat","e":"They have focused their research on habitats they believe have escaped human influence.","t":"他们已将研究重心放在他们认为不受人类影响的物种**栖息地**上。","r":"词根记忆：habit（居住）+at→住的地方→栖息地，住处","c":"natural habitat 自然保护区"},
20544:{"w":"encourage","e":"To encourage the bees to produce as much honey as possible, the beekeepers open the hives and stack extra boxes on top.","t":"为了**促使**蜜蜂尽可能多地产蜜，养蜂人打开蜂箱，在上面加放了一些盒子。","r":"联想记忆：en（使…）+courage（精神）→使有精神→鼓励","c":"encourage sb. to do sth. 鼓励某人做某事"},
20545:{"w":"celebrity","e":"The lecture will be given by a sports celebrity.","t":"这场讲座将由一位体育**名人**主讲。"},
20546:{"w":"significance","e":"The real significance of the first Kodak camera was that it was backed up by a developing and printing service.","t":"第一代柯达相机的真正**意义**在于它可以连接冲洗和打印设备。","d":"significant（adj. 重要的，有意义的）；significantly（adv.重大地；明显地）"},
20547:{"w":"magnetic","e":"The electric and magnetic fields are formed due to a passing wave oscillating at a regular frequency.","t":"电场和**磁**场是由振波以固定频率振荡而形成的。","c":"magnetic field 磁场；magnetic needle 磁针"},
20548:{"w":"slippery","e":"How damp and slippery the ground is!","t":"地面又湿又**滑**！","r":"联想记忆：slipp（=slip，滑）+ery→滑的"},
20549:{"w":"graphic","e":"The graphic record shows three waves are arriving.","t":"**图表**记录显示有三股浪潮正在靠近。","r":"词根记忆：graph（画）+ic（…的）→绘画的，图表的","y":"lifelike（adj. 逼真的，栩栩如生的）；vivid（adj. 逼真的）；pictorial（adj. 绘画的；用图片表示的）","f":"vague（adj. 含糊的，模糊的）；obscure（adj. 模糊的；费解的）"},
20550:{"w":"provided","e":"I'll buy the cup, provided that the price is right.","t":"**倘若**价格合适，我就买这个杯子。"},
20551:{"w":"examine","e":"He examined the work of other researchers.","t":"他**检查**了其他研究人员的工作。","d":"examiner（n. 检查员；考官）；examination（n. 考试；检"},
20552:{"w":"opportunity","e":"The film gave them an opportunity to let their imaginations run wild.","t":"电影给了他们一个放任想象力纵情驰骋的**机会**。","r":"联想记忆：opportun(e)（合适的，适当的）+ity→合适的时机→机会，时机","c":"take the opportunity to do sth./of doing sth. 趁机做…，借机做…"},
20553:{"w":"distinguish","e":"A port must be distinguished from a harbour. Harbour is a physical concept, and port is an economic concept.","t":"必须**分清**港口和海港的区别，海港是一个物理概念，港口是一个经济概念。","r":"词根记忆：di（分开）+sting（刺）+uish→将刺挑出来→区别，辨别","c":"distinguish between 辨别，弄清；distinguish...from... 把…与…区别开；distinguish oneself 使自己脱颖而出","y":"discern（v. 洞悉，辨别）；dignify（vt. 使尊荣，使高贵）"},
20554:{"w":"blanket","e":"It is so strange that this hotel does not provide sheets, blankets, or towels.","t":"这家旅馆不提供被单、**毯子**和毛巾，真是奇怪。","r":"联想记忆：blank（空的）+et（放在词尾表小物件）→毯子铺在一小块空地上→毯子"},
20555:{"w":"arrogance","e":"His arrogance impressed us most unfavourably.","t":"他的**傲慢**态度给我们留下了极坏的印象。","r":"词根记忆：ar（表加强）+rog（要求）+ance（表状态）→一再地要求→傲慢，自大"},
20556:{"w":"era","e":"Dallas is a very wealthy city in Texas which has grown up in an era when cars were considered essential to move about.","t":"达拉斯是得克萨斯州一个非常富裕的城市，兴起于汽车成为基本交通工具的**时代**。","r":"联想记忆：反过来拼写are（是）"},
20557:{"w":"stimulus","e":"The bright light is a stimulus to the eyes.","t":"强光会**刺激**眼睛。","r":"词根记忆：stimul（刺激）+us→刺激（物），促进（因素）"},
20558:{"w":"roam","e":"If we go back ten thousand years ago we would find that there were lions roaming vast sections of the globe.","t":"如果我们回到一万年前，就会发现地球上的大部分地方都有狮子**出没**。","r":"联想记忆：晚饭后，他在院子的狭小空间（room）里漫步（roam）","c":"roam over/around/about 闲逛，徘徊"},
20559:{"w":"comparison","e":"We generally think of Africa as being a very hot and dry place, but it is not in comparison with Australia.","t":"通常我们认为非洲炎热干燥，但它与澳大利亚没法**比**。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+par（相等）+ison→放在一起看看是否相等→比较，对比","c":"by comparison 比较起来；make a comparison 进行对比；fair comparison 公平比较；in comparison 比较起来"},
20560:{"w":"publicity","e":"The company launched a publicity campaign on a large scale.","t":"这家公司发起了一场大规模的**宣传**活动。","r":"联想记忆：产品可凭借其独特性（peculiarity），不用宣传（publicity）也能大为流行（popularity）","c":"seek publicity 想出风头","d":"public（adj. 公众的；公共的；公开的 n. 公众，民众）；publicly（adv. 公然地；舆论上地）；publicize〔vt. 宣传（尤指通过广告）〕"},
20561:{"w":"depend","e":"A: How much do the trips cost? B: Between five and fifteen pounds a head, depending on distance.","t":"A: 旅行费是多少？B: 每个人5到15磅不等，**取决于**距离。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+pend（悬挂）→挂在…上面→依靠，依赖","c":"depend on/upon 取决于","d":"dependable（adj. 可信赖的）；dependence（n. 依赖）；dependent（adj. 依赖的；取决于…的）"},
20562:{"w":"composition","e":"There are many grammar errors in your composition.","t":"你的**作文**中有很多语法错误。","c":"composition of …的组成"},
20563:{"w":"architecture","e":"The trend in architecture now favours smaller-scale building design.","t":"现在**建筑设计**的流行趋势是小户型。","d":"architectural（adj. 建筑的）"},
20564:{"w":"hurdle","e":"It's still so hard for women to even get on to short lists—there are so many hurdles and barriers.","t":"对于女性来说，想要进入最后的候选名单仍然很难，可谓是**障碍**重重。"},
20565:{"w":"teamwork","e":"An important part of teamwork is having trust in your colleagues' ability.","t":"**团队协作**重要的一点就是要相信同事的能力。"},
20566:{"w":"damp","e":"The ground is very damp in the rainforest.","t":"热带雨林的地面非常**潮湿**。","r":"联想记忆：dam（水坝）+p→水坝上很潮湿→潮湿的","c":"damp course 防潮层"},
20567:{"w":"staff","e":"Managers estimate staff productivity in terms of their working hours.","t":"经理通过**职员**的工作时间来评估他们的生产效率。","r":"联想记忆：与stuff（n. 材料）一起记","c":"office staff 办公室文员；teaching staff 教职员工"},
20568:{"w":"symbol","e":"The sounds of boat whistles and the moving tides are symbols of a port city.","t":"汽笛声和海浪声是港口城市的**象征**。","d":"symbolic（adj. 象征的；符号的）"},
20569:{"w":"apt","e":"Artists are apt at revealing the inner world of human beings.","t":"艺术家们**善于**表现人类的内心世界。","r":"本身为词根，意为“适应；能力”"},
20570:{"w":"homogeneous","e":"Uniforms can project the image of a company and unite the workforce into a homogeneous unit.","t":"工装能展示一个公司的形象，并使公司内部的员工凝聚为一个**统一的**整体。","r":"词根记忆：homo（同类的）+gen（种族）+eous（有…性质的）→同种类的","c":"homogeneous light 单色光，均匀光；homogeneous mixture相同成分组成的混合物","y":"identical（adj. 相同的，相等的）；kindred（adj. 同类的，类似的）；uniform（adj. 相同的，一致的）","f":"heterogeneous（adj. 异类的，不同的）；dissimilar（adj. 不同的，相异的）"},
20571:{"w":"conserve","e":"People living in the desert have a special way to conserve water.","t":"生活在沙漠里的人有一种特别的**储**水方法。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+serv（保持）+e→保持住→保存，储存；节约","d":"conservative（adj. 保守的）"},
20572:{"w":"spasm","e":"The patient shudders with a sudden spasm.","t":"病人突然**抽搐**，全身发抖。","r":"联想记忆：掉入深坑（chasm）突发痉挛（spasm）","c":"facial spasm 面部痉挛；muscle spasm 肌肉痉挛"},
20573:{"w":"invisible","e":"Could there be another planet there, essentially similar to our own, but always invisible?","t":"那里会不会有另一颗星球和我们的星球很相似，但我们却一直**看不见**呢？","r":"词根记忆：in（不）+vis（看）+ible（可…的）→看不见的，无形的"},
20574:{"w":"devote","e":"The local newspapers were mainly devoted to regional news and gossip.","t":"当地报纸主要**报道**地方新闻和小道消息。","r":"联想记忆：de+vote（投票）→把票全投给那个候选者→将…奉献给","c":"devote oneself to 专注于…；devote sth. to sth. 把…用于…","d":"devotion（n. 奉献；忠诚）"},
20575:{"w":"illustrate","e":"The diagram illustrates the information provided in paragraphs B-F of the reading.","t":"该图**说明**了阅读材料中B~F段出现的信息。","r":"词根记忆：il（进入）+lustr（光）+ate→进入光明→阐明","c":"illustrate the point 举例说明要点","d":"illustrator（n. 插图画家）"},
20576:{"w":"terrace","e":"A terrace of five homes is under way beside my house.","t":"我的房子旁边正在建造一幢能够居住五户的**连排房**。","r":"词根记忆：terr（土地）+ace（表实物名词）→一层梯田；一排并列的房子"},
20577:{"w":"dynamic","e":"The market is so dynamic that the figures change almost every two weeks.","t":"这个市场很**活跃**，数据几乎每两周就会发生改变。","r":"词根记忆：dynam（力量）+ic（…的）→力量的→动力的；活跃的","y":"active（adj. 积极的，活动的，活跃的）","f":"static（adj. 静态的，静止的）"},
20578:{"w":"throughout","e":"There will be bus services to the university throughout the weekend.","t":"**整个**周末都有公交车去这所大学。"},
20579:{"w":"smart","e":"Most computer criminals are smart enough to cover their crimes.","t":"大多数计算机犯罪分子都很**聪明**，能掩盖自己的罪行。"},
20580:{"w":"criticise","e":"Citizens have the right to criticise the government.","t":"公民有权利**批评**政府。"},
20581:{"w":"hunch","e":"Younger school-aged children read stories on smartphones; older kids don't read at all, but hunch over video games.","t":"较小的学龄儿童通过智能手机阅读故事；大一点的孩子根本不读书，而是喜欢**弓着背**玩电子游戏。","d":"hunched（adj. 缩头弓身的）"},
20582:{"w":"hinterland","e":"A port is a centre of land-sea exchange which requires good access to a hinterland.","t":"港口是海陆交易的中心，它需要与**内陆**有着便利的通道。","r":"组合词：hinter（=hinder，后面的）+land（土地）→内地，腹地，内陆"},
20583:{"w":"traverse","e":"Other items could have been used by hunters traversing the high mountain passes of Oppland: all-purpose items like tools, skis, and horse tack.","t":"**穿越**奥普兰高山隘口的猎人还可能使用其他物品：工具、滑雪板和马具等通用物品。","r":"词根记忆：tra（穿过）+vers（转）+e→穿越；穿过"},
20584:{"w":"positive","e":"Customer comments, both positive and negative, are recorded by staff.","t":"对于顾客的意见，无论是**肯定的**还是否定的，都由职员予以记录。","r":"词根记忆：posit（放）+ive（…的）→放在那里的→肯定的","c":"positive role 积极作用；positive example 正面的榜样；positive number 正数"},
20585:{"w":"assistant","e":"The employees felt that their assistant manager was closer to them than the manager.","t":"和经理相比，员工们感觉**助理**经理与他们更亲近。"},
20586:{"w":"obligation","e":"Every government has the right and obligation to run its own internal affairs well.","t":"每一任政府都有管理好国家内政的权利和**职责**。","r":"词根记忆：ob（表加强）+lig（捆绑）+ation（表状态）→用力捆绑→义务，职责"},
20587:{"w":"liberty","e":"You have liberty to use all the library facilities.","t":"你们可以**随意**使用图书馆里的所有设施。","c":"take liberties with sth.（尤指对书）任意改动；at liberty to do sth. 有权做…"},
20588:{"w":"pesticide","e":"The main factors that could be contributing to the decline of the species include acid rain and the spread of the pesticide residues.","t":"导致这个物种灭绝的主要因素包括酸雨和**农药**残留物的扩散。","r":"词根记忆：pesti（=pest，害虫）+cid（杀）+e→杀害虫的东西→杀虫剂"},
20589:{"w":"poll","e":"The team is conducting a poll among freshmen.","t":"这个小组正在新生中进行一次**民意调查**。","r":"联想记忆：大选（poll）费用（toll）上涨幅度惊人","c":"public opinion poll 民意调查；conduct a poll on 对…进行调查","d":"polling（n. 投票）"},
20590:{"w":"refundable","e":"The deposit on the house is refundable.","t":"这个房子的押金是**可以退还的**。"},
20591:{"w":"homesick","e":"I was homesick at first and missed my family.","t":"起初，我**思乡**心切，想念我的家人。","r":"组合词：home（家）+sick（病的）→想家想到生病→思乡的"},
20592:{"w":"compassionate","e":"We should try our best to create a more compassionate society.","t":"我们应该竭尽全力营造一个更**富有同情心**的社会。","c":"compassionate attitude 热诚的态度；compassionate leave 照顾性准假（一般指丧假）"},
20593:{"w":"orientate","e":"The course at this university has a vocational focus on preparing its graduates for work, so students are orientated towards employment.","t":"这所大学的课程以职业为中心，注重毕业生工作之前的准备工作，因此将学生**朝着**就业方向培养。"},
20594:{"w":"insight","e":"The application of our new insights into the Amazonian past would change present policies on development in the region.","t":"我们对亚马孙地区的过去有了新的**了解**，这会改变目前我们针对这一地区的开发政策。","r":"联想记忆：in（向内）+sight（眼光）→眼光深入→洞察力","d":"insightful（adj. 富有洞察力的）"},
20595:{"w":"resist","e":"Bugs and weeds will begin to resist poisons.","t":"害虫和野草会开始产生**抗**药性。","r":"词根记忆：re（相反）+sist（站立）→站在对立面→抵抗","d":"resistance（n. 抵抗；阻力）；resistant（adj. 抵抗的；耐…的）"},
20596:{"w":"glide","e":"The pilot managed to glide down to a safe landing.","t":"飞行员成功地使飞机向下**滑行**并安全着陆。","r":"联想记忆：和slide（n./v. 滑动）一起记","y":"slide（n./v. 滑动，下滑）；slip（v. 滑倒；溜走）"},
20597:{"w":"casualty","e":"The major casualty of cutting down forests on a large scale has been the environment.","t":"大规模森林砍伐的最大**受害者**是环境。","r":"词根记忆：cas（降临）+ual+ty（表情况）→（突然）降临→伤亡事故","y":"victim（n. 受害人）"},
20598:{"w":"belief","e":"The belief that rain and murky weather make people more unhappy is borne out by a study in Belgium.","t":"人们**相信**雨天和阴沉的天气会让人更加忧郁，这种想法已被比利时的一项研究所证实。"},
20599:{"w":"concentration","e":"This concentration of vehicles makes air quality in urban areas unpleasant and sometimes dangerous to breathe.","t":"交通工具的**集中**造成城市地区空气质量的恶劣，有时甚至不宜呼吸。"},
20600:{"w":"tug","e":"The fisherman tugged the small boat out of the water.","t":"渔民用力把小船**拖**到岸上。","r":"发音记忆：“探戈”→跳探戈时脚步拖拉要有力→用力拖（或拉）"},
20601:{"w":"proceed","e":"Our work is proceeding slowly.","t":"我们的工作**进程**缓慢。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+ceed（行走）→进行；前进"},
20602:{"w":"status","e":"The chart shows the amount of leisure time enjoyed by men and women of different employment status.","t":"这张图表显示了不同职业**身份**的男性和女性享有多少闲暇时间。","r":"联想记忆：stat（看作state，声明）+us（我们）→声明我们是谁→身份","c":"marital status 婚姻状况"},
20603:{"w":"document","e":"In the English-speaking scientific world, surveys of books and documents consulted in libraries and other information agencies have shown that very little foreign-language material is ever consulted.","t":"在以讲英语为主的科学界里，调查显示，科学家们几乎不参考图书馆及其他信息机构中的非英语书籍和**文献**。"},
20604:{"w":"hostile","e":"The luxuriant forests of Amazonia seem ageless, unconquerable, a habitat totally hostile to human civilization.","t":"茂密的亚马孙丛林似乎是永恒的、无法征服的，是一个完全**不利于**人类文明存在的地方。","r":"联想记忆：host（主人）+ile→鸿门宴的主人→不友善的"},
20605:{"w":"intervene","e":"The bank intervened with a large dollar purchase.","t":"那家银行以大量购进美元的方式来进行**干预**。","r":"词根记忆：inter（在…之间）+ven（来）+e→来到中间→干涉，干扰","y":"interfere（vi. 介入，干涉，干扰）；interpose（vt. 置于…之间，介入）"},
20606:{"w":"promote","e":"The band has gone on tour to promote their new album.","t":"这个乐队已开始巡回**宣传**他们的新唱片。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+mot（动）+e→向前动→促进","c":"promote mutual understanding 促进相互理解；promote the sale of sth. 促销；promote cultural communication 增进文化交流"},
20607:{"w":"bump","e":"The policeman ran after the thief, bumping against people in his hurry.","t":"那个警察追赶小偷，匆忙中**撞到**了人。","r":"发音记忆：该词的发音类似物体碰撞的声音","c":"bump against/into 碰到；bump along/down 颠簸着前进","d":"bumper〔n.（车辆）保险杠，缓冲器 adj. 特大的；丰盛的〕；bumpy〔adj. 崎岖不平的；颠簸的〕"},
20608:{"w":"reunion","e":"All the members of the club gathered to have a reunion dinner last weekend.","t":"上周末，这个俱乐部的所有成员进行了一次**聚**餐。","r":"联想记忆：re（再，又）+union（联合，结合）→重聚，团聚","c":"annual reunion 年度聚会；family reunion 家庭聚会"},
20609:{"w":"digestive","e":"The professor introduced the feeding habits and digestive systems of starfish.","t":"教授介绍了海星摄取食物的习惯以及它们的**消化**系统。","r":"词根记忆：di（分开）+gest（带来）+ive（有…性质的）→带下去→消化的","c":"digestive tract 消化道"},
20610:{"w":"homestay","e":"A: I've heard that you want to move into a homestay family. Is that correct? B: Yes, that's right.","t":"A: 我听说你想搬入一个**寄宿**家庭，是吗？B: 是的。","c":"homestay family 寄宿家庭"},
20611:{"w":"commit","e":"The drivers refused to commit themselves to the traffic accident.","t":"司机们拒绝**承担**这起交通事故的责任。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+mit（送）→送交→把…交托给，提交","c":"commit crimes 犯罪；commit suicide 自杀；commit oneself to使自己承担","d":"committed（adj. 尽心尽力的；坚信的）；commitment（n.承诺，保证；献身；承担义务）；committee（n. 委员会）"},
20612:{"w":"practically","e":"There is evidence that the reaction principle was applied practically well before the rocket was invented.","t":"有证据证明，反作用原理在火箭发明前就得到了很好的**实际**应用。"},
20613:{"w":"acrobat","e":"They are acrobats with the Albanian State Circus.","t":"他们是阿尔巴尼亚国家马戏团的**杂技演员**。","r":"词根记忆：acro（高点）+bat（打）→在高处表演打斗→杂技演员"},
20614:{"w":"revenue","e":"A new strategy for pricing known as \"revenue management\" is now being used by many large companies.","t":"现在许多大公司都采用一项名为“**收入**管理”的新定价策略。","r":"词根记忆：re（回）+ven（来）+ue→回来的东西→收入","c":"anticipated revenue 预期收入；financial revenue 财政收入；tax revenue 税收"},
20615:{"w":"nickel","e":"Nickel can be used to make batteries.","t":"**镍**可以用来制造电池。","r":"发音记忆：“你抠”→连五分钱都舍不得给→五分镍币"},
20616:{"w":"limp","e":"Some of you may come from cultures that accept limp handshakes as normal.","t":"你们当中有些人的文化习俗可能认为**无力的**握手很正常。","r":"联想记忆：和limb（n. 肢；翼）一起记"},
20617:{"w":"spit","e":"Don't spit at random.","t":"不要随地**吐痰**。","r":"联想记忆：s+pit（坑）→往坑里吐痰→吐痰","c":"spit out 吐出"},
20618:{"w":"irregularity","e":"To date, the most widely used commercial biometric system is the handkey, a type of hand scanner which reads the unique shape, size and irregularities of people's hands.","t":"迄今为止，在商业生物测定系统中应用最广泛的是掌形识别仪，这是一种读取人们手掌独有的形状、大小和**不规则性**的手掌扫描仪。"},
20619:{"w":"breeze","e":"The systems mix light, sounds, breezes and scents to stimulate people who spend long periods below ground.","t":"该系统综合了光线、声音、**微风**和香味来刺激长期待在地下的人。","r":"联想记忆：和风（breeze）吹化了冰冻（freeze）的河流"},
20620:{"w":"avenue","e":"They explored every avenue to cure cancer.","t":"他们寻找各种**方法**来治疗癌症。"},
20621:{"w":"magnify","e":"This microscope can magnify an object 100,000 times.","t":"这个显微镜可将物体**放大**10万倍。","r":"词根记忆：magn（大）+ify（使…）→使…大→放大，扩大"},
20622:{"w":"hive","e":"For the three-week long bloom, beekeepers can hire out their hives for $32 each.","t":"在长达三周的花期里，养蜂人可以将他们的**蜂箱**以每个32美元的价格租出去。","r":"联想记忆：生活（live）忙，建蜂房（hive）"},
20623:{"w":"oxide","e":"The greenhouse effect is a natural phenomenon due to the presence of greenhouse gases—water vapour, carbon dioxide and nitrous oxide—in the atmosphere.","t":"温室效应是一种由大气中的水蒸气、二氧化碳和一**氧化**二氮这些温室气体形成的自然现象。"},
20624:{"w":"foremost","e":"First and foremost, I suppose, is the popularity of the event in global terms.","t":"我认为，首先也是**最重要的**，是这个活动在全球范围内的受欢迎程度。","r":"组合词：fore（前面）+most（最）→放在最前面的→最重要的"},
20625:{"w":"procedure","e":"I hate these cumbersome administrative procedures.","t":"我讨厌这些麻烦的行政**手续**。","r":"联想记忆：proce(e)d（前进）+ure→程序；过程","c":"regular procedure 正规手续；registration procedure 登记手续；emergency procedure 紧急状况的处理程序；follow accepted procedure 遵循惯用的步骤"},
20626:{"w":"assemble","e":"All components were assembled in the front workshop.","t":"所有部件都是在前面的车间**组装**的。","r":"词根记忆：as（表加强）+sembl（相类似）+e→不断集合类似的东西→集合","d":"assembly（n. 集会；组装）"},
20627:{"w":"plagiarism","e":"I'd like to mention the question of plagiarism in particular.","t":"我想特别提一下**剽窃**问题。","d":"plagiarise（v. 剽窃，抄袭）"},
20628:{"w":"gallop","e":"My sister set off at a gallop this morning.","t":"今天早上我姐姐**匆忙**出发。","r":"联想记忆：汽车加了一加仑（gallon）油，然后飞驰（gallop）而去","c":"at a gallop 以最快速度，急速地"},
20629:{"w":"pledge","e":"The prime minister has pledged today that he will make 250 million dollars available to help the drought-stricken farmers.","t":"总理今天**承诺**将拨2.5亿美元帮助受旱灾影响的农民。","r":"联想记忆：pled（看作plead，恳求）+ge（音似：哥）→哥哥发誓要改邪归正，恳求大家的饶恕→发誓","c":"fulfill one's pledge 履行诺言；make/give a pledge to do sth. 保证做某事"},
20630:{"w":"effective","e":"Which advertisement is the most effective?","t":"哪一种广告最**有效**？","r":"来自effect（n. 影响；效果）","c":"effective measure 有效措施；effective remedy 有效药物","d":"ineffective（adj. 无效的）；effectiveness（n. 效力）；effectively（adv. 有效地）"},
20631:{"w":"appreciate","e":"I deeply appreciate your care, but I'm fine now.","t":"我对你的关心深表**感激**，但是现在我很好。","r":"词根记忆：ap（表加强）+preci（价值）+ate（做）→一再指出价值→赏识，鉴赏","c":"appreciate doing sth. 对…表示感激","d":"appreciation（n. 欣赏；体谅；感激）；appreciative（adj.感谢的；赞赏的）；appreciable（adj. 值得重视的；可感知的）"},
20632:{"w":"deny","e":"If you don't acknowledge the source of your information, you might be denied entry into the university.","t":"如果你不供认信息的来源，你可能会被这所大学**拒**收。","r":"发音记忆：“抵赖”→否认","c":"deny oneself 节制，戒绝，摒弃；deny doing sth. 否认做过某事；deny a charge 否认控告"},
20633:{"w":"union","e":"The speech contest is presided over by the Student Union.","t":"这个演讲比赛是由学生**会**主办的。","r":"词根记忆：uni（一个）+on（表物）→使人都朝着同一个方向走→协会，同盟","c":"the European Union 欧洲联盟；labour union 工会"},
20634:{"w":"responsibility","e":"The company needs a sales manager with responsibility for the North American market.","t":"该公司需要一位**负责**北美市场的销售经理。","r":"来自responsible（adj. 应负责的，有责任的）","c":"perform one's responsibility 履行或行使职责；assume the responsibility 承担责任"},
20635:{"w":"conform","e":"All students must conform to the school rules.","t":"所有的学生都必须**遵守**校规。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+form（形式）→共同的形式→相一致","c":"conform to the customs of society 遵从社会习俗；conform with the regulations 遵守规章制度","y":"adapt（v. 适应）"},
20636:{"w":"handy","e":"To do this work needs handy men.","t":"做这项工作需要些**手巧的**人。"},
20637:{"w":"notify","e":"If the library is not notified and you are 15 minutes late, your time can be given to someone else.","t":"如果你没有**通知**图书馆，那么在你迟到15分钟后，你（预约）的时间就会分配给其他人。","r":"词根记忆：not（知道）+ify（使…）→使人知道→通知，报告"},
20638:{"w":"splendid","e":"She married that rich man not merely because he is rich and has splendid houses.","t":"她嫁给那个富人，并不仅仅是因为他有钱和**豪华的**房子。","r":"词根记忆：splend（发光）+id（具有…性质的）→让人眼前一亮的→壮观的","c":"splendid scene 壮观的场面"},
20639:{"w":"direction","e":"Shall we ask somebody for directions again?","t":"我们还要再找人问一下**路**吗？"},
20640:{"w":"execute","e":"We execute company policy for homeowners.","t":"我们**执行**公司针对业主的政策。","r":"词根记忆：ex（表加强）+ecut（追踪）+e→加强追踪→实施，执行","d":"executive（adj. 执行的；行政的 n. 执行者，主管领导）"},
20641:{"w":"witness","e":"Tom witnessed the accident.","t":"汤姆**目睹**了那起意外事故。"},
20642:{"w":"elbow","e":"His forearms were black and blue from wrist to elbow.","t":"他的小臂从手腕到**肘部**又青又紫。","r":"联想记忆：力在肘（elbow），弓（bow）在手"},
20643:{"w":"limited","e":"Some banks open for a limited time on Saturdays.","t":"一些银行在周六**限**时开放。"},
20644:{"w":"vessel","e":"Sea ports have been transformed by the advent of powered vessels.","t":"机动**船只**的出现改变了海港的外观。"},
20645:{"w":"private","e":"May I ask you a private question?","t":"我能问你一个**私人**问题吗？","r":"词根记忆：priv（单个）+ate（有…性质的）→私人的"},
20646:{"w":"stereo","e":"I've got a fridge and a stereo system which I've just bought from a friend.","t":"我刚从一个朋友那里买了一台冰箱和一套**立体声**音响。","r":"本身为词根，意为“三维的，立体的”","c":"personal stereos 随身听"},
20647:{"w":"soak","e":"We'll get you up to your room and soak your feet, and then you'll be okay.","t":"我们带你到房间里**泡泡**脚，这样你会感觉舒服些。","r":"联想记忆：在肥皂（soap）水中浸泡（soak）"},
20648:{"w":"stout","e":"This machine was completely encased in a stout, iron cylinder.","t":"这台机器被完全置于一个**结实的**铁筒内。","r":"联想记忆：st（=stand，站）+out（出来）→歹徒行凶，壮小伙站出来→强壮的","c":"stout wind 暴风；a stout ship 一艘牢固的船"},
20649:{"w":"greasy","e":"Fish contains a lot of protein, and is not greasy.","t":"鱼肉富含蛋白质且不**油腻**。","r":"联想记忆：greas(e)（油脂）+y（…的）→多脂的"},
20650:{"w":"boast","e":"She is always boasting about how wonderful her children are.","t":"她总是**夸耀**她的孩子们多么出色。","r":"联想记忆：北京的烤鸭（roast duck）值得夸耀（boast）"},
20651:{"w":"swift","e":"Beijing has cheap, swift and effective public transport.","t":"北京的公共交通便宜、**快捷**且高效。"},
20652:{"w":"mitigate","e":"The government introduced new measures to mitigate tensions between local residents and property developers.","t":"政府出台了新措施，以**缓和**当地居民与房地产开发商之间的紧张关系。","r":"词根记忆：miti（小，轻）+gate（做）→轻拿轻放→减轻损失→减轻"},
20653:{"w":"ignorance","e":"Not ignorance, but the ignorance of ignorance, is the death of knowledge.","t":"知识的死亡不是**无知**本身，而是对无知的无知。","r":"词根记忆：i（=im，不）+gnor（知道）+ance（表状态）→什么都不知道→无知","c":"ignorance about 在…方面的无知"},
20654:{"w":"aesthetic","e":"What are utilitarian objects to a Westerner may be prized aesthetic objects in other cultures.","t":"被西方人视为功利性的东西，在其他文化中可能会因其**美学**价值而备受推崇。","r":"词根记忆：aesthet（感觉）+ic（…的）→美感的→美学的"},
20655:{"w":"screen","e":"Everything on the screen interests those children.","t":"那些孩子觉得**屏幕**上的一切都很有趣。"},
20656:{"w":"absent","e":"Why were you absent from my birthday party yesterday?","t":"你昨天怎么**没来**参加我的生日派对呢？","r":"词根记忆：abs（相反）+ent（存在）→不存在→不在场的"},
20657:{"w":"scrape","e":"He scraped the mud off his shoes with the knife.","t":"他用小刀**刮去**鞋上的泥土。","r":"联想记忆：scrap（碎屑）+e→碎屑是被刮下来的→刮"},
20658:{"w":"promotion","e":"Would you be willing to attend any of the special promotions for the new channel?","t":"你愿意参加新频道的任何特别**宣传**活动吗？"},
20659:{"w":"recreation","e":"As you can see, the building you are in now contains this main lounge, the dining room and the recreation room.","t":"如你所见，你现在所在的这幢大楼包括主休息室、餐厅和**娱乐**室。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+cre（做）+ation（表结果）→一再做（放松活动）→娱乐，消遣","c":"recreation area 娱乐休闲区域；open-air/outdoor recreation 户外娱乐活动","d":"recreational（adj. 消遣的，娱乐的）；recreate〔v.（使）得到休养；（使）得到娱乐〕"},
20660:{"w":"specialise","e":"Two years later, we will specialise and take courses in one or two subjects.","t":"两年后，我们将**专攻**一两门学科并学习这些学科的课程。","r":"来自special（adj. 特殊的，专门的）","c":"specialised equipment 专用设备","d":"specialisation（n. 专门化，特殊化）"},
20661:{"w":"magnificent","e":"The garage around the corner contains the magnificent old Rolls-Royce which used to belong to George.","t":"街角的车库里停着一辆**华丽的**老式劳斯莱斯，它曾经是乔治的。","r":"词根记忆：magni（大）+fic（做）+ent（有…性质的）→做得很大的→宏伟的，壮丽的","c":"magnificent performance 出色表演","d":"magnificently（adv. 壮观地；宏伟地）；magnificence（n.壮丽，宏伟；华丽）"},
20662:{"w":"spasmodic","e":"Since the arrival of Europeans, the region experienced a period of spasmodic activity, between 1831 and 1857.","t":"自从欧洲人来到这个地区，在1831到1857年间，它经历了一个**间歇性的**活跃时期。","r":"联想记忆：spasm（痉挛，一阵发作）+odic→痉挛的"},
20663:{"w":"fund","e":"They provide funds for zoos in underdeveloped countries.","t":"他们为不发达国家的动物园提供**资金**。","c":"raise funds 筹集资金；additional/extra fund 额外款项；mutual fund 互助基金"},
20664:{"w":"perceive","e":"While I was examining the small stars, I perceived one that appeared visibly larger than the rest.","t":"我观察那些小星星时，**发现**有一颗明显比其他的大。","r":"词根记忆：per（贯穿）+ceive（拿）→全部拿住→感知，察觉","y":"detect（vt. 察觉，发觉）；comprehend（v. 领会，理解）"},
20665:{"w":"manufacturer","e":"Manufacturers must sell these cleaner cars.","t":"**制造商**必须卖掉这些更清洁的汽车。","r":"词根记忆：manu（手）+fact（做）+ur+er（表人）→用手做事的人→生产者"},
20666:{"w":"specification","e":"The house has been built exactly to our specifications.","t":"房子完全是按照我们的**工程设计书**建造的。","r":"联想记忆：specific（详细的）+ation→详细说明→说明书","c":"the specification of a microwave oven 微波炉说明书","y":"clause（n. 条款）；instruction（n. 指示；用法说明）"},
20667:{"w":"schedule","e":"The lectures are scheduled for Tuesday and Thursday.","t":"讲座**安排**在星期二和星期四。","r":"发音记忆：“筛斗”→古代用筛漏计时→时刻表","c":"ahead of schedule 提前；train/flight schedule 火车/航班时刻表；on schedule 按时，准时；behind schedule 落后于计划进度，晚于规定时间，晚点；be scheduled for 定在某时（进行）"},
20668:{"w":"arrangement","e":"Larger firms appear to be more willing to experiment with flexible working arrangements.","t":"较大型的企业似乎更愿意尝试弹性工作**制**。","c":"course arrangement 课程安排；seat arrangement 座位安排"},
20669:{"w":"destruction","e":"The importation of cheap goods has often contributed to the destruction of local skills and indigenous markets.","t":"进口廉价商品常常会给当地的手工业和本土市场带来**毁灭性**的打击。","r":"词根记忆：de（相反）+struct（建造）+ion（表动作）→不建造→破坏","c":"environmental destruction 环境破坏","y":"ruin（n. 毁灭；崩溃）","f":"establishment（n. 确立，制定）；construction（n. 构筑）"},
20670:{"w":"extinguisher","e":"If you discover a fire, shout \"FIRE\" and activate the nearest fire alarm. Attack the fire with an extinguisher but do not take any risks.","t":"如果发现火情，应大喊“着火了”，并按响离你最近的火警铃。使用**灭火器**去灭火，但不要冒险。","r":"来自extinguish（vt. 熄灭；消灭）"},
20671:{"w":"assume","e":"Ecologists have assumed that tropical ecosystems were shaped entirely by natural forces.","t":"生态学家**设想**热带生态系统完全是由自然的力量形成的。","r":"词根记忆：as（表加强）+sum（拿）+e→拿住→承担（责任）","c":"assume an obligation 承担义务；assume responsibility 承担责任"},
20672:{"w":"proportion","e":"The proportion of the population still speaking this language is small.","t":"还在说这种语言的人口**比例**很小。","r":"联想记忆：pro+portion（部分）→比例；部分","c":"in proportion（to）（与…）成比例；out of proportion to sth. 与某物不成比例；proportion of …的比例；take a small proportion 占少量比例"},
20673:{"w":"forth","e":"From this day forth I will study much harder.","t":"从今**以后**我将更加努力学习。","c":"call forth 使产生，引起；bring forth 提出；set forth 阐明，陈述；and so forth 等等；back and forth 来回地，反复地"},
20674:{"w":"referee","e":"Instead of spending much time refereeing between the two students, I went to the library.","t":"我没有花太多时间**调停**这两名学生，而是去了图书馆。","r":"联想记忆：refer（查阅，咨询）+ee（表人）→有问题时能够咨询的人→调停人；裁判","c":"the referee of a game 一项运动的裁判"},
20675:{"w":"forgo","e":"Jack has to forgo his vacation so as to take a summer English course.","t":"杰克为了参加暑期英语班只好**放弃**他的假期。","r":"联想记忆：for（往，向）+go（走）→走向他处，放弃了目前所在地→放弃"},
20676:{"w":"assistantship","e":"The organization has contributed a lot to the social welfare activities such as assistantship programs.","t":"该组织为社会福利做了很多贡献，比如**助教奖学金**项目。"},
20677:{"w":"conversation","e":"The conversation between the new students touched on many new subjects.","t":"新同学之间的**对话**涉及很多新话题。","r":"来自converse（vi. 交谈，会话）","d":"conversational（adj. 适于交谈的）"},
20678:{"w":"recommendation","e":"The skills of making presentations are on the recommendation of a professor.","t":"这些做报告的技巧是一位教授**推荐**的。","c":"letter of recommendation 推荐信；on one's recommendation 在某人的推荐下"},
20679:{"w":"offset","e":"Prices have risen in order to offset the increased cost of materials.","t":"为**弥补**原料成本的增加而提高了价格。","r":"来自词组set off（抵消）"},
20680:{"w":"siesta","e":"These workers have no time for a siesta in summer.","t":"这些工人在夏天都没有时间**午睡**。"},
20681:{"w":"humanity","e":"The control of fire was the first and perhaps greatest of humanity's steps towards a life-enhancing technology.","t":"**人类**在迈向提高生活质量的技术旅途中，对火的支配是第一步，可能也是最重要的一步。","d":"humanitarian（adj. 博爱的；人道主义的）","y":"humankind（n. 〈总称〉人类）"},
20682:{"w":"intact","e":"She hopes that her honor could remain intact.","t":"她希望自己的名誉依旧能够**无损**。","r":"词根记忆：in（不）+tact（接触）→未经触动的→完整无缺","y":"undamaged（adj. 未损坏的，未毁坏的）；sound（adj. 健全的，完好的）","f":"broken（adj. 破碎的）；shattered（adj. 粉碎的，破坏的）"},
20683:{"w":"stripe","e":"This skirt has a red stripe around the edge.","t":"这条裙子的边上有一圈红色**条纹**。","r":"联想记忆：和strip（n. 条，带）一起记"},
20684:{"w":"mechanical","e":"Practise that and don't stop until it becomes mechanical.","t":"坚持练习，直到习惯成**自然**。","c":"mechanical labour 体力劳动"},
20685:{"w":"junction","e":"The power station was built at the junction of two rivers.","t":"那座发电站建于两河的**交汇处**。","r":"词根记忆：junct（连接）+ion→连接"},
20686:{"w":"detect","e":"The robots can detect unauthorised personnel and alert security staff immediately.","t":"机器人能够**发现**未经允许擅自闯入的人员，并马上向保安人员发出警报。","r":"词根记忆：de（去掉）+tect（盖子）→去掉盖子→发现，察觉","d":"undetected（adj. 未被发现的）"},
20687:{"w":"detour","e":"You can take a detour to get there and avoid Black Street.","t":"你可以**绕道**去那，不走布莱克大街。","r":"词根记忆：de（离开）+tour（转）→转着走→迂回，绕道"},
20688:{"w":"arthritis","e":"Rheumatoid arthritis belongs to the family of autoimmune diseases.","t":"类风湿性**关节炎**属于自体免疫系统类疾病。","r":"词根记忆：arthr（关节）+itis（炎症）→关节炎"},
20689:{"w":"justice","e":"Where might is master, justice is servant.","t":"有强权，就没有**正义**。","r":"词根记忆：just（正义的）+ice（表性质）→正义，公正"},
20690:{"w":"barrier","e":"The language barrier presents itself in stark form to firms who wish to market their products in other countries.","t":"对于那些希望在其他国家销售自己产品的公司来说，语言成了明显的**障碍**。","r":"联想记忆：bar（长条，棒）+rier→栅栏","c":"language barrier 语言障碍；trade barrier 贸易壁垒"},
20691:{"w":"replace","e":"The new fuel is as inefficient as the one they have replaced.","t":"这种新型燃料和被它们**取代**的燃料一样效率低下。","r":"联想记忆：re（重新）+place（位置）→重新定位→代替；更换","d":"replacement（n. 代替；更换；归还）"},
20692:{"w":"diploma","e":"Tim got a diploma at a private college.","t":"蒂姆拿到了一所私立学院的**毕业证书**。","r":"联想记忆：做外交官（diplomat）需要资格证书（diploma）"},
20693:{"w":"cosmic","e":"The surface of Earth contains tons of cosmic dust.","t":"地球表面有大量的**宇宙**尘埃。","r":"词根记忆：cosm（宇宙）+ic（…的）→宇宙的","c":"cosmic dust 宇宙尘埃"},
20694:{"w":"extendable","e":"The visa is for 15 days, extendable to one month.","t":"此签证有效期为15天，**可延期**到一个月。","c":"extendable rod 拉杆；extendable bond 可延长债券"},
20695:{"w":"abundance","e":"At the party, there was food and drink in abundance.","t":"宴会上，食品和饮料供应**充足**。","r":"来自abundant（adj. 丰富的，充裕的）","c":"in abundance 丰富","y":"profusion（n. 丰富）；affluence（n. 富足）；wealth（n.大量）","f":"scarcity（n. 缺乏，不足）；deficiency（n. 缺少）"},
20696:{"w":"supervisor","e":"We have to put ourselves into the role of the manager or supervisor.","t":"我们必须要融入经理或**主管**的角色。"},
20697:{"w":"jumble","e":"Here is a jumble of books and newspaper.","t":"这有一堆**杂乱的**书和报纸。","r":"联想记忆：jum（看作jump，跳）+ble→上蹿下跳，群魔乱舞→混杂","c":"a jumble of 杂乱的一堆…；jumble sale 旧杂物义卖；jumble sth. together/up 使乱堆，使杂乱"},
20698:{"w":"amaze","e":"We are amazed at the perfect symmetry of the building.","t":"我们**惊诧**于这座建筑物完美的对称。"},
20699:{"w":"equip","e":"Underground offices in Japan are equipped with \"virtual\" windows and mirrors.","t":"日本的地下办公室**装有**虚拟的窗户和镜子。","c":"be equipped with 配备有，装备有","d":"equipment（n. 装备）"},
20700:{"w":"permanent","e":"Instead of moving from place to place, the family needed permanent dwellings.","t":"这家人需要一个**长期的**居住地，而不是不断地搬家。","r":"词根记忆：per（贯穿）+man（逗留）+ent（具有…性质的）→始终留在那里→永久的，持久的","c":"permanent address 永久住址","d":"permanency（n. 永存）；permanently（adv. 永久地）"},
20701:{"w":"embed","e":"The traditional idea is deeply embedded in our university.","t":"这个传统的想法在我们的大学里**根深蒂固**。","r":"联想记忆：em（进入…中）+bed（床）→把…放入床中→把…嵌入","c":"be embedded in 植根于","d":"embedment（n. 嵌入）","y":"wedge（vt. 楔入，楔进）；fix（vt. 使固定）"},
20702:{"w":"orientation","e":"Now that everyone knows what team they're in, we'll get on with the orientation programme.","t":"既然每个人都明确了自己所在的小组，我们接着就开始进行**培训**项目。","r":"来自orient（vt. 确定方向）","c":"orientation meeting 情况说明会；orientation course 新生训练；上岗培训课"},
20703:{"w":"deprive","e":"The accident deprived him of his feet.","t":"这场意外事故使他**失去**了双脚。","r":"词根记忆：de（去掉）+priv（单个）+e→从个人身边拿掉→使丧失","c":"deprive sb. of sth. 剥夺某人的某物","y":"remove（vt. 去除；解除）"},
20704:{"w":"dividend","e":"We pay a dividend of 15 percent.","t":"我们所付的**股息**为15%。"},
20705:{"w":"preference","e":"Many people expressed a strong preference for the original plan.","t":"许多人强烈表示**喜欢**原先的计划。","r":"联想记忆：prefer（更喜欢）+ence（表名词）→偏爱的事物"},
20706:{"w":"contract","e":"Both sides should abide by the contract.","t":"双方都应该遵守**合同**。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+tract（拉）→共同拉（回去）→缩小","d":"subcontract（v. 分包，转包）"},
20707:{"w":"uneasy","e":"He was uneasy about the results of the final exams.","t":"他为期末考试成绩**忧心忡忡**。","r":"联想记忆：un（不）+easy（安心的）→不安心的→心神不安的"},
20708:{"w":"automatically","e":"Cars will be automatically controlled by computer in the future.","t":"未来的汽车将由计算机**自动**控制。"},
20709:{"w":"female","e":"A cow produces only one calf a year whereas a female ostrich can lay an egg every other day.","t":"一头奶牛一年只能生一头小牛，而一只**雌**鸵鸟每隔一天就下一个蛋。","r":"联想记忆：fe（音似：非）+male（男子）→非男子→女子"},
20710:{"w":"asset","e":"Organizations should recognize that their employees are a significant part of their financial assets.","t":"公司应该承认员工是其**财产**的重要组成部分。"},
20711:{"w":"athlete","e":"Professional athletes usually follow a strict diet and training plan to stay in top physical condition.","t":"职业**运动员**通常会遵循严格的饮食和训练计划，以保持最佳的身体状态。","c":"professional athlete 职业运动员","d":"athletic（adj. 运动的；运动员的）"},
20712:{"w":"clarity","e":"This article was written with clarity.","t":"这篇文章思路**清晰**。","r":"词根记忆：clar（清楚的）+ity（表性质）→清楚"},
20713:{"w":"swap","e":"Don't swap horses when crossing a stream.","t":"危难之时不宜临阵**换**将。","y":"exchange（vt./n. 交换）；trade（v. 交换）"},
20714:{"w":"sophisticated","e":"Space management is now a highly sophisticated method of manipulating the way we shop to ensure maximum profit.","t":"空间管理现在已成为一种非常**尖端**的技术，它通过控制我们的购物方式来实现利润最大化。","c":"a sophisticated columnist 一名老练的专栏作家","d":"sophistication（n. 精致；复杂）","y":"experienced（adj. 经验丰富的，熟练的）；proficient（adj.精通的，熟练的）；complicated（adj. 复杂的）","f":"unsophisticated（adj. 不懂世故的；单纯的）"},
20715:{"w":"bulk","e":"Ports take advantage of the need for breaking up bulk material.","t":"港口充分利用了分解**大宗**原料的需求。","r":"联想记忆：公牛（bull）总是大批（bulk）地行动"},
20716:{"w":"calibre","e":"They suggest that the calibre of these institutions be carefully examined.","t":"他们建议要仔细调查这些机构的**资质**。"},
20717:{"w":"machinery","e":"The new mayor reformed the machinery of the government.","t":"新市长对市政府**机构**进行了改革。","r":"联想记忆：machine（机器）+ry（表集合名词）→机械","c":"industrial machinery 工业机械"},
20718:{"w":"intimate","e":"The dance studio provides a smaller, more intimate space, which we use for ballet, modern dance and martial arts.","t":"舞蹈室为我们练习芭蕾、现代舞和武术提供了一个更小、更**私密**的空间。","r":"词根记忆：intim（内心的）+ate（有…性质的）→密切的","c":"be intimate with sb. 与某人关系亲密；intimate details 隐私；intimate knowledge of sth. 对…非常了解，熟悉；on intimate terms with sb. 与某人保持亲密关系"},
20719:{"w":"restrict","e":"A student loan is not restricted to those who receive a maintenance grant in this school.","t":"在这所学校，学生贷款并不**限于**那些领生活补助金的学生。","r":"联想记忆：re+strict（严格的）→对人非常严格→限制，约束"},
20720:{"w":"harsh","e":"The report has harsh words for the countries that sold these weapons.","t":"这篇报道**严厉**谴责了出售这些武器的国家。","r":"联想记忆：har（看作hard，坚硬的）+sh→态度强硬的→严厉的","c":"harsh measures 严厉的措施；harsh climate 恶劣的气候"},
20721:{"w":"parliament","e":"The exhibition met with great opposition from Parliament.","t":"这次展览遭到了**国会**的强烈反对。","r":"联想记忆：parlia（看作parle，谈判）+ment→谈判的地方→议会"},
20722:{"w":"remind","e":"The notice reminds students that if they park a motor vehicle on university premises without a valid permit, they will be fined.","t":"这个通知**提醒**学生们：未经允许就在校园里停放机动车会被罚款。","r":"联想记忆：re（又，再）+mind（注意）→使再次注意→提醒","c":"remind sb. of sth. 提醒，使某人想起某事"},
20723:{"w":"deviate","e":"Adjustments to the direction of the tunnel also had to be made whenever builders encountered geological problems or when it deviated from its set path.","t":"每当建筑者遇到地质问题或者隧道**偏离**既定路线时，也必须调整隧道的方向。","r":"词根记忆：de（偏离）+vi（道路）+ate（使）→使偏离道路→（使）偏离","c":"deviate from 背离，偏离","d":"deviation（n. 偏向；偏差，误差）"},
20724:{"w":"aquarium","e":"We are going to take the kids to the new aquarium this weekend.","t":"这周末我们打算带孩子们去新开的**水族馆**。","r":"词根记忆：aqu（水）+arium（表场所）→水族馆"},
20725:{"w":"cell","e":"Scientists are doing cellular research, looking at changes in cells when the body is under stress.","t":"科学家正在进行细胞研究，观察身体在压力下**细胞**内部发生的变化。","c":"blood cells 血细胞","d":"cellular（adj. 细胞的）"},
20726:{"w":"dweller","e":"An underground dweller himself, Carpenter has never paid a heating bill, thanks to solar panels and natural insulation.","t":"作为地下**居住者**，得益于太阳能板和天然的保温条件，卡彭特从未交过取暖费。"},
20727:{"w":"declare","e":"The government declared that the ballots cast were inconclusive.","t":"政府**宣布**这次投票不具有决定性。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+clar（清楚的）+e→说清楚→正式宣布，声明","d":"declaration（n. 宣告，宣言）；declarative（adj. 陈述的）"},
20728:{"w":"graduate","e":"Nowadays, there are not many job opportunities which graduates can look forward to.","t":"现在，本科**毕业生**所能期望的就业机会并不多。","c":"graduate school 研究生院；college graduates 大学毕业生；graduate from 从…毕业"},
20729:{"w":"predict","e":"The United Nations predicts that the global population may stabilise between 8 and 14 billion in the twenty-first century.","t":"联合国**预言**，在21世纪全球人口将稳定在80亿到140亿之间。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+dict（说）→预言"},
20730:{"w":"headquarters","e":"The daily paper is compiled at the editorial headquarters.","t":"日报由编辑部**总部**编纂。","r":"组合词：head（头）+quarters（部分）→总部，总公司"},
20731:{"w":"coverage","e":"We all wait for the live coverage of the results of the bombing trial.","t":"我们都等着看这起爆炸审判结果的现场**报道**。","r":"联想记忆：cover（覆盖）+age（表集体名词）→覆盖范围","y":"scope（n. 范围）"},
20732:{"w":"enforce","e":"Do they enforce that rule?","t":"他们**执行**那条规则了吗？","r":"联想记忆：en（使…）+force（强迫）→强制，迫使","c":"enforce laws 执法","d":"enforcement（n. 实施，执行）"},
20733:{"w":"specialty","e":"Cross-country skiing events are a specialty of cold-weather countries.","t":"越野滑雪赛事是气候寒冷的国家中一道**独特**的风景线。","r":"来自special（adj. 专门的）"},
20734:{"w":"intrinsic","e":"Students should realize the intrinsic value of education.","t":"学生应该认识到教育的**内在**价值。","c":"intrinsic nature 本质","d":"intrinsically（adv. 内在地）","y":"inherent（adj. 内在的，固有的）；essential（adj. 本质的）；innate（adj. 天生的，固有的）","f":"extrinsic（adj. 外来的；外在的）；external（adj. 外面的；外来的）"},
20735:{"w":"cheat","e":"Tour operators try to cheat tourists.","t":"旅行社的工作人员试图**欺骗**游客。"},
20736:{"w":"medical","e":"The injured students required emergent medical attention.","t":"那些受伤的学生急需**医疗**护理。","c":"medical centre 医疗中心；medical science 医学；medical service 医疗服务；family medical history 家族病史"},
20737:{"w":"stick","e":"The pictures on the wall were simply stuck on and so could easily become detached.","t":"墙上的画只是被简单地**固定住**，所以很容易脱落。","c":"be stuck on 被…迷住，特别喜欢；get stuck 上当，受骗；被困住"},
20738:{"w":"realistic","e":"We must be more realistic towards the tough problem.","t":"面对这个棘手的问题，我们应该更**现实**一点。","r":"来自real（adj. 真的，真实的）","d":"unrealistic（adj. 不切实际的）；realistically（adv. 实事求是地；栩栩如生地）"},
20739:{"w":"indifferent","e":"Tina seems to be totally indifferent to the exam result of the higher language course.","t":"蒂娜似乎对高级语言课程的考试结果毫**不关心**。","c":"be indifferent to 对…漠不关心"},
20740:{"w":"retailer","e":"Many retailers are facing their slowest business period during the financial crisis.","t":"在金融危机中，许多**零售商**正处在生意最低迷时期。"},
20741:{"w":"turnover","e":"The company tried its best to decrease the turnover.","t":"公司竭尽全力降低**人事变动率**。","r":"来自词组turn over（营业额达到；翻转；交换）","y":"shift（n. 移动，移位；轮班）"},
20742:{"w":"brand","e":"What brand of cola do you like?","t":"你喜欢喝什么**牌子**的可乐？","c":"name brand 名牌；leading brand 驰名品牌；brand image 品牌形象；co-branded card 联名卡"},
20743:{"w":"accompany","e":"Your enrolment form must be accompanied by the course deposit of $100.","t":"你的登记表和100美元的课程押金必须**一起**上交。","r":"联想记忆：ac（表加强）+company（同伴；陪伴）→陪伴；伴随","c":"accompany training 陪练；accompany a singer 伴唱"},
20744:{"w":"mention","e":"He mentioned in his letter that he might be moving abroad.","t":"他在信中**提到**他可能要移居国外。","c":"not to mention 更不用说；更不必说"},
20745:{"w":"level","e":"The noise levels at the site can reach 45 decibels.","t":"在这种场所，噪声**水平**可达45分贝。","c":"at the level of 在…水平上"},
20746:{"w":"lateral","e":"Not even our closest relatives among the apes possess such decided lateral asymmetry, as zoologists call it.","t":"正如动物学家所认为的那样，即便是和我们有着最近的血缘关系的猿类也不具备这样明显的**侧向**不对称性。","r":"词根记忆：later（侧面）+al（…的）→侧面的","d":"lateralize（vt. 把…移到一侧）"},
20747:{"w":"dense","e":"The airport was closed because of the dense fog.","t":"机场因为**浓**雾而关闭了。","r":"联想记忆：在雨中，感觉（sense）雨丝很密集（dense）"},
20748:{"w":"flash","e":"The air can become slightly positively charged when large thunderclouds are generating the intense electrical fields that cause lightning flashes.","t":"当大团的雷雨云产生了引发**闪电**的强烈电场时，空气会略带正电。","c":"a flash of lightning 一道闪电；a flash in the pan 昙花一现的人物，一时的成功","d":"flashlight（n. 闪光信号灯；手电筒）"},
20749:{"w":"snack","e":"The sandwich shop for quick snacks is nearby.","t":"出售**快餐**的三明治店离这很近。","c":"snack bar 小吃店，快餐店"},
20750:{"w":"marvellous","e":"We'll come to a picture gallery where we've got a marvellous collection of paintings all by Australian artists.","t":"接下来我们会来到一个画廊，这里有**绝好的**画作收藏，全都出自澳大利亚画家之手。","r":"发音记忆：“马虎了事”→凡事马虎了事就不可能取得非凡的成就→非凡的"},
20751:{"w":"export","e":"In Africa, the feathers of ostriches were used for tribal ceremonial dress and they were also exported to Europe and America.","t":"在非洲，鸵鸟毛被用于部落的典礼服饰，同时也**出口**到欧洲和美洲。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+port（运）→把东西运出去→出口","c":"export rebates 出口退税；export finance 出口信贷；export restriction 出口限制"},
20752:{"w":"tribute","e":"The song is a tribute to Roy Orbison.","t":"这首歌是**敬献**给罗伊·奥比森的。","r":"词根记忆：tribut（给予）+e→给予（皇室）的东西→贡品","y":"compliment（n. 称赞，恭维）；praise（n. 赞扬）"},
20753:{"w":"sanitary","e":"People living in the district suffered from appalling sanitary conditions.","t":"住在这一区域的人们要忍受极差的**卫生**条件。","r":"词根记忆：sanit（健康的）+ary（…的）→健康的→清洁的；保健的","c":"sanitary facility 卫生设施；sanitary condition 卫生条件"},
20754:{"w":"submit","e":"After many failures, I submitted to fate.","t":"多次失败后，我向命运**屈服**了。","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+mit（放出）→放在下面→屈从；提交","c":"submit to 递交；屈服"},
20755:{"w":"archive","e":"The museum drew on its archive collection for its exhibition.","t":"博物馆为举办展览使用了收藏的**档案**文件。"},
20756:{"w":"anecdotal","e":"There is only anecdotal evidence of life on Mars.","t":"火星上存在生命仅仅是**传言**。"},
20757:{"w":"shorthand","e":"The book contained some strange shorthand symbols.","t":"这本书上有一些奇怪的**速记**符号。","r":"联想记忆：short（短的）+hand（手）→人手短缺时，也不影响记录的速度→速记"},
20758:{"w":"exceptional","e":"Kate has quite an exceptional music ability.","t":"凯特具有**非凡**的音乐才能。","r":"来自except（prep. 除…之外）","y":"extraordinary（adj. 非凡的，特别的）；outstanding（adj.突出的）；unusual（adj. 不平常的）","f":"ordinary（adj. 平常的，普通的）；common（adj. 普通的）"},
20759:{"w":"rude","e":"Across the room stand three rude and high-backed chairs.","t":"房间的那头放着三把做工**粗糙**的高背椅。","r":"词根记忆：rud（粗糙的）+e→粗鲁的；粗糙的"},
20760:{"w":"resume","e":"He resumed his reading after a nap.","t":"小睡了一会儿后，他**继续**阅读。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+sum（拿）+e→重新拿起→重新开始"},
20761:{"w":"primitive","e":"Studies of primitive societies suggest that the earliest method of making fire was through friction.","t":"对**原始**社会的研究表明，人们最早是通过摩擦生火的。","r":"词根记忆：prim（第一）+itive（…的）→第一时间的→原始的","c":"primitive society 原始社会；primitive measuring method 原始的测量方法"},
20762:{"w":"craft","e":"This region is a diverse agricultural area, rich in historic sites, arts and crafts.","t":"该地区为多种农作物种植带，且具有众多的历史遗址，艺术形式丰富，**手工艺**发达。","r":"联想记忆：c+raft（筏）→筏也就是船→船"},
20763:{"w":"hire","e":"She was hired three years ago.","t":"她是三年前被**录用**的。"},
20764:{"w":"goggles","e":"Racecar drivers all wear goggles when they are in a race.","t":"赛车选手比赛时都佩戴**护目镜**。"},
20765:{"w":"thereby","e":"Mary became an American citizen, thereby gaining the right to vote.","t":"玛丽成了美国公民，**因此**得到了投票权。"},
20766:{"w":"stake","e":"He was eager to return to a more entrepreneurial role in which he had a big financial stake in his own efforts.","t":"他渴望回到更具企业家性质的角色，这样他的努力就跟自己有大的金融**利害关系**。","r":"联想记忆：s+take（带来）→带来赌金→赌金","c":"at stake 在危险中；处于成败关头"},
20767:{"w":"barge","e":"Beekeepers moved beehives on barges along the river to their next destination.","t":"养蜂人用**驳船**载着蜂箱顺流而下，驶往下一个目的地。","r":"发音记忆：“八只”→八只驳船→驳船","c":"barge in 闯入；barge into 与…相撞"},
20768:{"w":"aerobics","e":"This room is used mainly for badminton and aerobics.","t":"这间屋子主要用作羽毛球室和**有氧运动**室。","r":"词根记忆：aero（空气）+b+ics（…活动）→有氧运动"},
20769:{"w":"shrub","e":"The volunteers raked around shrubs and trees to look for the lost children.","t":"志愿者在**灌木**丛和树林里四处寻找迷路的孩子。","r":"联想记忆：sh+rub（擦伤）→灌木擦伤皮肤→灌木","c":"shrub layer 灌木层","y":"bush（n. 矮树丛）；scrub（n. 灌木）"},
20770:{"w":"slat","e":"Try out an orthopaedic mattress or a spring slatted bed which can be beneficial for certain types of back pain.","t":"你可以尝试使用矫形床垫或是**板条**弹簧床，这有助于缓解某些背痛。","r":"联想记忆：和slate（n. 板岩，石板）一起记"},
20771:{"w":"legal","e":"The Union has its own officers who can give advice on legal problems.","t":"该协会拥有自己的人员，负责给**法律**事务提供建议。","r":"词根记忆：leg（法律）+al（…的）→法律的；合法的"},
20772:{"w":"cinematography","e":"The new film provided the raw material for the introduction of cinematography a few years later.","t":"新的电影胶片为几年后**电影摄制艺术**的诞生提供了原材料。"},
20773:{"w":"contribute","e":"Industrial emissions and automobile exhausts contribute to heavy pollution.","t":"工业排放物和汽车尾气共同**造成**了重度污染。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+tribut（给予）+e→共同给出→捐赠，捐助","c":"contribute to 有助于；contributing factor 起作用的因素","d":"contribution（n. 贡献）；contributor（n. 促成因素）；contributory（adj. 促成的）"},
20774:{"w":"imagination","e":"They need to train their powers of imagination.","t":"他们需要训练自己的**想象力**。"},
20775:{"w":"bronchitis","e":"Smoking can cause problems such as pneumonia, bronchitis and influenza.","t":"吸烟能引起肺炎、**支气管炎**和流行性感冒等疾病。","r":"词根记忆：bronch（支气管）+itis（炎症）→支气管炎"},
20776:{"w":"exacerbate","e":"More intensive farming and the abandonment of fallow periods tend to exacerbate soil erosion.","t":"更密集的耕种和取消休耕期会**加剧**土壤的侵蚀。","r":"词根记忆：ex（使…）+acerb（酸）+ate（使…）→使变酸→使恶化"},
20777:{"w":"intrusion","e":"In fact, there are people who dislike any kind of perfume and think it's an intrusion.","t":"实际上，有些人讨厌所有香水的气味，并认为别人使用香水是对自己的**侵犯**。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+trus（冲）+ion（表动作）→冲进去→闯入"},
20778:{"w":"cancel","e":"Could you please call the dentist at 816-25285 and cancel the appointment for me?","t":"你能拨打816-25285帮我**取消**和牙医的预约吗？","c":"cancel out 抵消"},
20779:{"w":"cork","e":"When a volcano erupts, the shattered summit is ejected like a cork from a shaken soda bottle.","t":"火山喷发时，被炸碎的山峰喷射而出，就像是装有苏打水的瓶子经过摇晃，上面的**软木塞**被顶飞出去一样。"},
20780:{"w":"data","e":"You have to spend a bit of time making the data a lot clearer.","t":"你要花一点时间把这些**数据**整理得更清楚些。","r":"联想记忆：数据（data）每日（date）更新"},
20781:{"w":"insufficient","e":"The company's funds for research were insufficient.","t":"那家公司**没有足够**的研究资金。","r":"联想记忆：in（不）+sufficient（充分的）→不足的，不够的","c":"insufficient for 不够做…；不能胜任…"},
20782:{"w":"grocery","e":"I assisted in a grocery store last semester.","t":"上学期，我在一家**杂货**店帮忙。"},
20783:{"w":"humid","e":"Summers in that city are extremely hot and humid.","t":"那个城市的夏天非常炎热**潮湿**。","r":"词根记忆：hum（湿）+id（…的）→潮湿的，湿润的","c":"humid air 潮湿的空气；humid atmosphere 潮湿的大气；humid climate 湿润的气候"},
20784:{"w":"relation","e":"The relation between students and teachers is generally good in this university.","t":"这所大学里师生间的**关系**总体来说很好。","c":"in/with relation to 关系到；have no relation to 与…没有关系；diplomatic relations 外交关系；international relations 国际关系"},
20785:{"w":"confuse","e":"I'm afraid I'm a bit confused by what you said just now.","t":"恐怕我被你刚才说的话弄得有点**糊涂**。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+fus（流）+e→流到一起，混合→混淆；使迷惑","c":"confuse...with 把…和…混淆，把…和…混为一谈","d":"confusion（n. 混淆）；confused（adj. 困惑的）"},
20786:{"w":"correspondence","e":"I have kept correspondence with my former classmates.","t":"我一直和以前的同学保持**通信**。","c":"keep correspondence with sb. 与某人保持通信；commercial correspondence 商业信函"},
20787:{"w":"allocation","e":"People approved the allocation of food to those who need it most.","t":"人们赞成把食物**分给**那些最需要的人。","r":"来自allocate（vt. 分派）"},
20788:{"w":"entertainment","e":"The use of some entertainment can be addictive.","t":"参与一些**娱乐**项目是会上瘾的。","r":"来自entertain（v. 娱乐；招待）","c":"entertainment industry 娱乐产业"},
20789:{"w":"conquer","e":"Many people have made attempts to conquer the peaks of Everest.","t":"许多人都试图**征服**珠穆朗玛峰。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+quer（获得）→征服","c":"conquer your fear 战胜你的恐惧","d":"conqueror（n. 征服者）；conquest（n. 攻取，征服，克服）"},
20790:{"w":"decoration","e":"The restaurant will offer decoration balloons.","t":"餐厅会提供**装饰**气球。","c":"for decoration 用来装饰"},
20791:{"w":"reward","e":"Those employees who never take sick leave think that they should be rewarded.","t":"那些从来不请病假的员工认为他们应该因此得到**奖励**。","r":"联想记忆：re+ward（看作word，话语）→领导再次发话，要给予他奖赏→奖赏"},
20792:{"w":"larva","e":"Once the beetle larvae have finished pupation, the residue is a first-rate source of fertiliser.","t":"一旦甲虫的**幼虫**完成化蛹过程，其残留物就是最好的肥料来源。"},
20793:{"w":"offspring","e":"With one right-handed and one left-handed parent, 15 to 20 percent of the offspring will be left-handed.","t":"如果父母中有一个是左撇子，另一个惯用右手，那么他们的**后代**是左撇子的概率是15%到20%。","r":"联想记忆：off（出来）+spring（春天）→春天出生的→子女，后代"},
20794:{"w":"occasional","e":"There will be occasional congruity between prophecy and fact.","t":"预言与事实**偶尔**会一致。"},
20795:{"w":"crater","e":"After the volcano erupted, lava domes formed inside the new crater, and have periodically burst.","t":"火山喷发后，新形成的**火山口**内部会形成熔岩穹丘，这些熔岩穹丘会周期性地爆发。"},
20796:{"w":"congregate","e":"Reindeer once congregated on these icy patches in the later summer months to escape biting insects.","t":"在夏末的几个月里，驯鹿曾**聚集**在这些冰面上，以躲避昆虫的叮咬。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+greg（集，群）+ate→汇集到一起→聚集"},
20797:{"w":"ensue","e":"If a forest fire cannot be extinguished, devastation is sure to ensue.","t":"如果不能扑灭森林火灾，毁坏一定会**随之发生**。","r":"联想记忆：确定（ensure）的事情就会继而发生（ensue）"},
20798:{"w":"instruct","e":"PE teachers instruct students how to exercise, play sports, and do other recreational activities correctly and safely.","t":"体育老师**指导**学生们如何安全正确地锻炼、做运动以及进行其他娱乐活动。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+struct（建立）→使（知识）建立→教导；指示"},
20799:{"w":"declaration","e":"This declaration seemed to calm the discontented party members somewhat.","t":"这项**声明**似乎让那些心存不满的党派成员稍微平静了点。","r":"来自declare（v. 宣布）"},
20800:{"w":"flexibility","e":"PE teachers help the development of coordination, balance, posture, and flexibility with activities like simple catching and throwing.","t":"体育老师利用简单抓取和投掷等活动帮助学生发展身体的协调性、平衡性以及改善他们的体态和**柔韧性**。","c":"flexibility of mind 头脑的灵活性"},
20801:{"w":"native","e":"All teachers in this school have specialist qualifications in teaching English to foreign students, and are all native speakers.","t":"这所学校所有的老师都具备教外籍学生英语的专业资格，且均为英语**母语**人士。"},
20802:{"w":"significant","e":"Modifications to houses come at a significant cost to the home buyers.","t":"房屋改造对购房人来说是一笔**不菲**的开销。","r":"来自signify（v. 有重要性）；sign（标记）+ify（使…）→重点部分标上记号→有重要性","d":"significantly（adv. 显著地）；insignificant（adj. 不重要的）；significance（n. 意义，含义；重要性，重大）"},
20803:{"w":"loyalty","e":"Trade discounts may be used as a competitive stratagem to secure customer loyalty.","t":"商业折扣可以用作保持顾客**忠诚度**的一种竞争策略。","c":"national loyalty 对国家的忠诚"},
20804:{"w":"conditioner","e":"If your hair is dry in winter, you can use some hair conditioner every day.","t":"如果你的头发在冬天时比较干燥，你可以每天用一些**护发素**。","c":"soil conditioner 土壤调节剂；air conditioner 空调"},
20805:{"w":"reduce","e":"Catastrophes such as fire, flood, drought or epidemic may reduce population sizes to a small fraction of their average level.","t":"火灾、洪水、旱灾或流行病之类的大灾难可能会**降低**人口数量，使其远远低于正常水平。"},
20806:{"w":"controversy","e":"There exists a controversy over the plan for a new teaching building.","t":"建造新教学楼的计划存在**争议**。","r":"词根记忆：contro（相反）+vers（转）+y→因反对而转向另一方→争论，辩论","d":"controversial（adj. 有争议的）"},
20807:{"w":"service","e":"The airline companies want to improve the service.","t":"航空公司想提升**服务**质量。","c":"airline coach service 航空公司汽车服务处；Student Service学生服务中心；door-to-door service 上门服务；service charge 服务费用；interlibrary service 图书馆馆际服务"},
20808:{"w":"dwell","e":"This kind of ground-dwelling herbivore may go extinct within a decade.","t":"这种地**栖**食草动物也许在十年内就会灭绝。","d":"dwelling（n. 住宅，寓所）"},
20809:{"w":"sensation","e":"This discovery would cause not much more sensation than Herschel's discovery of Uranus, in 1781.","t":"这一发现的影响不会比赫歇尔于1781年首次发现天王星时更**轰动**。","r":"词根记忆：sens（感觉）+ation（表状态）→感觉，知觉","c":"cause a great sensation 引起很大轰动；heat sensation 热觉"},
20810:{"w":"scrap","e":"Scrapping farm-price support and protection for coal-mining offers a two-fold bonus: a cleaner environment and a more efficient economy.","t":"**废除**农产品价格补贴和对采煤业的保护有双重好处，可以获得更清洁的环境和更高效的经济。","r":"联想记忆：刮（scrape）下许多碎屑（scrap）","y":"debris（n. 碎片，残骸）；abandon（vt. 放弃；遗弃）"},
20811:{"w":"anxious","e":"He is anxious to enter the competition.","t":"他**急切**希望能加入比赛。"},
20812:{"w":"recipient","e":"This artificial heart recipient will recover in three weeks.","t":"人造心脏**接受者**将在三个星期后康复。","r":"词根记忆：re（相反）+cip（拿）+ient→不主动拿→（被动的）接受者","y":"receiver（n. 接收器；接受者）"},
20813:{"w":"identical","e":"Even among identical twins, one in six pairs will differ in their handedness.","t":"即使是**同卵**双胞胎，平均六对中也会出现一对在使用左右手习惯上不同的双胞胎。","y":"alike（adj. 相似的）；duplicate（adj. 完全相同的）","f":"dissimilar（adj. 不同的，相异的）；distinct（adj. 有区别的，不同的）"},
20814:{"w":"rival","e":"The rival team lost by 12 points in the first round.","t":"第一轮比赛中，**对手**队以12分之差败北。","r":"联想记忆：对手（rival）隔河（river）相望，分外眼红","d":"rivalry（n. 竞争；竞赛；较量）"},
20815:{"w":"tropospheric","e":"Scientists measured tropospheric ozone levels above the city to assess the impact of traffic emissions on air quality.","t":"科学家测量了城市上空**对流层**臭氧的含量，以评估交通排放对空气质量的影响。","c":"tropospheric ozone 对流层臭氧"},
20816:{"w":"attraction","e":"The attraction of single-speed cycles is their simplicity and reliability.","t":"单速自行车**吸引人之处**在于其简单性和可靠性。","c":"tourist attraction 旅游胜地"},
20817:{"w":"earthwork","e":"Some contemporary tribes still live among the earthworks of earlier cultures.","t":"一些现存的部落依然生活在早期文化的**土垒建筑**里。"},
20818:{"w":"surround","e":"For the most part, we breathe in the aromas which surround us without being consciously aware of their importance to us.","t":"大多数时候，我们呼吸着**周围**的香气，却没有意识到它们对我们的重要性。","r":"联想记忆：sur+round（圆）→在圆的外边→围绕；包围","c":"be surrounded by sth. 被…围绕；surround oneself with sth.用…把自己包围住"},
20819:{"w":"impression","e":"Could you tell us something about your first impression of the town when you arrived?","t":"你能不能告诉我当你初到这个小镇时，你的第一**印象**是什么？","r":"联想记忆：impress（印，盖印）+ion→印象；印记","c":"first impression 第一印象"},
20820:{"w":"horrify","e":"I had been horrified by several newspaper reports.","t":"我对几篇新闻报道的内容感到**震惊**。","r":"词根记忆：horr（害怕）+ify（使…）→使恐惧，使惊骇"},
20821:{"w":"introduction","e":"By way of introduction, I shall give you the background of the subject.","t":"通过**介绍**，我将向你讲述该学科的相关背景。","r":"词根记忆：intro（向内）+duc（引导）+tion→介绍；传入，引进"},
20822:{"w":"compact","e":"The bag must be compact and light for easy transport.","t":"这个包必须**小巧**轻便以便于运输。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+pact（系紧）→紧密的","c":"compact car 小型客车；compact narration 简明的叙述","d":"compaction（n. 压紧，紧束的状态）；compactness（n. 紧密）"},
20823:{"w":"enquire","e":"If you have any question, you are welcome to call the Students' Union to enquire.","t":"有任何问题，欢迎致电学生会**询问**。","r":"词根记忆：en（使…）+quir（寻求）+e→询问；查问","d":"enquiry（n. 打听，询问；调查）"},
20824:{"w":"memorandum","e":"The manager circulated a memorandum to all staff outlining the new procedures for booking annual leave.","t":"经理向全体员工分发了一份**备忘录**，概述了申请年假的新流程。","r":"词根记忆：memor（记忆）+andum→辅助记忆的东西→备"},
20825:{"w":"rectangular","e":"In front of the Empire State Building is a long rectangular wading pool.","t":"帝国大厦前面是一个**长方形**的浅水池。","r":"词根记忆：rect（直的）+angul（角）+ar→所有内角都为直角的平行四边形→长方形的"},
20826:{"w":"kidney","e":"The doctor asked Mark whether he had ever suffered from any liver, kidney or heart disease.","t":"医生问马克以前是否得过肝、**肾**或是心脏方面的疾病。"},
20827:{"w":"standpoint","e":"From a completely economical standpoint, the ad is actually more important than the film itself.","t":"单以经济学**观点**看，这则广告实际上比电影本身更重要。","r":"组合词：stand（站立）+point（观点）→立场；观点"},
20828:{"w":"curative","e":"Researchers are investigating whether the plant has any curative effect on common skin conditions.","t":"研究人员正在调查这种植物对常见皮肤病是否有**疗效**。","r":"词根记忆：cur（关心）+ative（有…倾向的）→有疗效的"},
20829:{"w":"predominantly","e":"Tom grew up in the predominantly black, middle-class suburb of this city.","t":"汤姆在这个城市黑人和中产阶级**占多数**的市郊长大。","r":"联想记忆：pre（前）+dominant（统治的）+ly（表副词）→在前面统治→重要地"},
20830:{"w":"clutch","e":"The driver released the clutch to engage the gears and make his car go.","t":"司机松开**离合器**，挂上挡，这样汽车就开动起来了。","r":"联想记忆：和catch（v. 抓住）一起记"},
20831:{"w":"combine","e":"The next step was to combine the holder with a small camera.","t":"下一步是将支架和一台小型相机**连接**起来。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+bi（生命）+ne→联合，结合","c":"combine...with... 把…和…结合起来","d":"combination（n. 结合）"},
20832:{"w":"chart","e":"The first chart shows the reasons why adults decide to study.","t":"第一张**图表**显示成年人决定进行学习的原因。","c":"bar chart 条形图；flow chart 流程图"},
20833:{"w":"asthma","e":"A world-wide rise in asthma over the past four decades is said to be linked with increased air pollution.","t":"据说，在过去的40年里，世界范围内**哮喘病**发病率升高与越来越严重的空气污染有关。"},
20834:{"w":"signature","e":"Corbett ran into the bedroom and scribbled his signature on the notebook.","t":"科比特冲进卧室，在笔记本上潦草地签上了自己的**名字**。","r":"词根记忆：signa（=sign，记号）+ture（表行为）→在文件上做记号→签名"},
20835:{"w":"occasion","e":"It should have been an occasion for rejoicing, but she could not feel any real joy.","t":"原本应该是高兴的**时刻**，她却丝毫未感到真正的快乐。","r":"词根记忆：oc（表加强）+cas（降临）+ion（表动作）→引起"},
20836:{"w":"invaluable","e":"The library's online database proved invaluable to students who were writing their final-year research projects.","t":"事实证明，图书馆的在线数据库对正在写毕业研究课题的学生**极其有用**。","r":"联想记忆：in（无）+valuable（有价值的）→极宝贵的","f":"valueless（adj. 没有价值的）"},
20837:{"w":"recover","e":"After a few days of cough, my roommate began to recover.","t":"咳嗽了几天后，我的室友开始**康复**了。","r":"联想记忆：re（再，又）+cover（包括）→重新获得","c":"recover oneself 使自己振作；recover from 从…中恢复","d":"recovery（n. 恢复；康复；失而复得）"},
20838:{"w":"moderation","e":"In the middle of Health Diet Pyramid we find the things that we can eat in moderation.","t":"我们可以**适量**吃处于健康饮食金字塔中部的食物。","r":"词根记忆：moder（=mod，风度）+ation（表状态）→做事有风度→适度","c":"in moderation 节制"},
20839:{"w":"documentation","e":"When you open a bank account, you should take some documentation with you.","t":"当你去银行开户时，要随身携带一些**证明资料**。"},
20840:{"w":"critical","e":"The strike has been stopped, but the situation is still critical at the moment.","t":"虽然罢工停止了，但是当前形势仍很**危急**。","r":"词根记忆：crit（判断）+ical（…的）→作出判断的→评论的","c":"be critical of 对…吹毛求疵；be of critical importance 至关重要；critical thought 批判性思维；critical point 临界点；critical period危险期","d":"uncritical（adj. 不加批判的）；critically（adv. 危急地；批判地）"},
20841:{"w":"vocational","e":"This is a vocational training institute.","t":"这是一家**职业**培训机构。","r":"来自vocation（n. 职业）"},
20842:{"w":"summary","e":"Tina gave a summary of the activity last night.","t":"蒂娜昨晚给出了活动的**概要**。","r":"词根记忆：summ（加）+ary（表物）→内容总括→摘要，概要","c":"in summary 总之，概括地说","d":"summarise（v. 概括，总结）；summarization（n. 摘要，概要）"},
20843:{"w":"remove","e":"Water soluble vitamins are removed rapidly from the body.","t":"水溶性维生素可以很快**排出**体外。","r":"联想记忆：re+move（移动）→排除","c":"be far removed from sth. 和…差别很大","d":"remover（n. 清除剂；搬家工人，搬家公司）"},
20844:{"w":"bound","e":"Because these courses start every Monday, there's bound to be one that fits in with your academic, personal or professional commitments.","t":"因为这些课程每周一都开，所以**一定**有适合你学习、针对你个人或工作内容的课程。"},
20845:{"w":"trinket","e":"The lady had some trinkets on her dress.","t":"这位女士在衣服上挂了一些**饰品**。"},
20846:{"w":"expire","e":"The lease on this house expires at the end of the year.","t":"这房子租约年底**到期**。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+pir（=spir，呼吸）+e→呼出气→期满","d":"expiry（n. 期满；终结）","y":"run out（到期，失效）"},
20847:{"w":"accessible","e":"He pointed his telescope to every accessible part of the sky and recorded what he saw.","t":"他将望远镜指向天空中所有**可以达到**的地方，并记录下所看到的。"},
20848:{"w":"turbine","e":"Ultraclean coal can be used in advanced power systems such as coal-fired gas turbines.","t":"超纯煤可以用在诸如燃煤的燃气**涡轮机**之类的先进动力系统中。","r":"词根记忆：turb（搅动）+ine（表名词）→涡轮机"},
20849:{"w":"backbone","e":"The Ottawa Charter for Health Promotion outlined in 1986 remains as the backbone of health action today.","t":"1986年起草的《渥太华健康促进宪章》仍是今天健康活动的**支柱**。"},
20850:{"w":"attribute","e":"The global increase in greenhouse gases has been largely attributed to industrial pollution in developed countries.","t":"全球温室气体的增加主要**归咎于**发达国家的工业污染。","r":"词根记忆：at（表加强）+tribut（给予）+e→把…归因于","c":"attribute to 归结于，归功于，因为","y":"ascribe（vt. 归因于，归咎于）；quality（n. 质量；性质）"},
20851:{"w":"magnitude","e":"Stargazers were struck by the uncommon magnitude of the newly discovered comet.","t":"这颗新发现的彗星尤其**亮**，令天文学家们非常吃惊。","r":"词根记忆：magn（大）+itude（表状态）→广大，巨大"},
20852:{"w":"compatible","e":"Accuracy is not always compatible with haste.","t":"准确与匆忙难以**兼容**，忙中难免出错。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+pat（走）+ible（可…的）→可一起走的→兼容的；合得来的","c":"be compatible with 与…相适应/不矛盾"},
20853:{"w":"entrepreneur","e":"The owner of the company is an American entrepreneur.","t":"这家公司的老板是一位美国**企业家**。","r":"词根记忆：entre（在…之中）+pren（抓住）+eur（表人）→抓住商机的人→企业家"},
20854:{"w":"proposal","e":"The school master has accepted proposals to renovate the old schoolhouses.","t":"校长已经接受了翻新旧校舍的**提议**。","r":"来自propose（v. 提议，建议）"},
20855:{"w":"coach","e":"They play just as important a role as the coach in our team.","t":"在我们队里，他们扮演着和**教练**同等重要的角色。"},
20856:{"w":"tramp","e":"Those poor people tramped for miles and miles without finding anywhere to stay.","t":"那些可怜的人**走啊走**，始终找不到栖身之处。"},
20857:{"w":"fatal","e":"The majority of single-gene defects are fatal.","t":"大部分的单基因缺陷都是**致命**的。","r":"来自fate（n. 命运）","c":"a fatal accident 一场致命的事故"},
20858:{"w":"currency","e":"The demand for foreign currency depreciates the real value of local currencies.","t":"对外币的需求降低了当地**货币**的实际价值。","c":"paper currency 纸币"},
20859:{"w":"disapprove","e":"They disapprove of paying farmers who have not cultivated the land.","t":"他们**不赞成**付钱给未耕种土地的农民。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+approve（赞成）→不赞成"},
20860:{"w":"complain","e":"John complains that the resource centre has limited opening hours.","t":"约翰**抱怨**说信息中心的开放时间有限。","r":"联想记忆：com+plain（平淡的）→不要抱怨生活的平淡→抱怨","c":"complain about 抱怨…"},
20861:{"w":"audacious","e":"The audacious proposal was quickly denied by the committee.","t":"这个**冒险的**提议很快就被委员会否决了。","r":"词根记忆：aud（增加）+acious（有…性质的）→让胆量增加的→大胆的","c":"audacious spirit 冒险精神"},
20862:{"w":"disrupt","e":"Work of any company may be disrupted by absence of its employees.","t":"任何一家公司的工作都可能因员工的旷工而**中断**。","r":"词根记忆：dis（表加强）+rupt（断裂）→裂开→使中断","d":"disruption（n. 扰乱；中断）；disruptive（adj. 破坏性的）"},
20863:{"w":"inflation","e":"Inflation reduced the purchasing power of the families.","t":"**通货膨胀**降低了家庭的购买力。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+flat（吹）+ion（表状态）→吹气→通货膨胀；充气"},
20864:{"w":"reinstate","e":"Whaley set up a festival to reinstate a sense of pride in their eco-heritage, and helped local schoolchildren plant thousands of trees.","t":"惠利创办了一个节日，以**恢复**当地人们对其生态遗产的自豪感，并帮助当地学童种植了数千棵树。"},
20865:{"w":"statement","e":"The statement contradicts the views of the writer.","t":"这些**陈述**与作者的观点相反。","r":"来自state（vt. 声明）"},
20866:{"w":"amount","e":"The chart shows the amount spent on six consumer goods in European countries.","t":"这张图表显示了欧洲国家在六种消费品上的**总**花费。","c":"amount of 许多；amount to 总计…"},
20867:{"w":"given","e":"It is often important that you make it clear what your particular role is at a given time.","t":"明确自己在**特定**时间内的特定角色通常很重要。"},
20868:{"w":"advanced","e":"Prehistoric Amazonians developed technology and art that were advanced for their time.","t":"史前亚马孙人创造了当时**先进**的技术和艺术。"},
20869:{"w":"milestone","e":"This theory represents one of the great milestones in the history of scientific thought.","t":"这一理论是科学思想史上一座伟大的**里程碑**。","r":"组合词：mile（英里）+stone（石头）→标记英里数的石头→里程碑"},
20870:{"w":"crank","e":"That gear is connected to a crank which changes the motion.","t":"那个传动装置与一个能改变运动方式的**曲柄**连接在一起。"},
20871:{"w":"lexicographer","e":"The reform has transformed the way lexicographers work.","t":"这种改革改变了**词典编纂者**的工作方式。","r":"词根记忆：lexico（=lexic，词汇）+graph（写）+er（表人）→写词典的人→词典编纂者","d":"lexicographical（adj. 词典编纂的）"},
20872:{"w":"bunch","e":"He picked me a bunch of flowers.","t":"他给我采了一**束**花。","c":"a bunch of 一些"},
20873:{"w":"costume","e":"Mom told me that she had a ballet costume.","t":"妈妈告诉我她有一套芭蕾舞**服**。","r":"联想记忆：cost（花费）+u（你）+me（我）→你我都免不了花钱买服装→成套服装"},
20874:{"w":"scare","e":"The decoy camera can be fixed to the wall to scare off burglars.","t":"可以在墙上安装假摄像头来**吓**走盗贼。"},
20875:{"w":"manipulate","e":"Computers are very efficient at manipulating information.","t":"计算机在**处理**信息方面效率极高。","r":"词根记忆：mani（手）+pul（拉）+ate（表动词）→用手拉→操纵","y":"handle（v. 操作，操纵）；maneuver（v. 操纵）"},
20876:{"w":"juvenile","e":"Juvenile delinquency has increased remarkably in the last decade.","t":"在过去的十年里，**未成年人**犯罪有明显的增加。","r":"词根记忆：juven（年轻）+ile（属于…的）→少年的；幼稚的","y":"childish（adj. 幼稚的）；immature（adj. 不成熟的）；youngster（n. 少年，年轻人）；teenager（n. 青少年）"},
20877:{"w":"phenomenon","e":"The greenhouse effect is a natural phenomenon.","t":"温室效应是一种自然**现象**。","r":"词根记忆：phen（显示）+omen（预兆）+on→显示预兆的→迹象"},
20878:{"w":"freight","e":"Heavy freight could only be carried by water or rail.","t":"大型**货物**只能通过水路或铁路来运输。"},
20879:{"w":"vulnerable","e":"Women are especially vulnerable to back pain because of pregnancy.","t":"由于怀孕，女性尤其**容易**背痛。","r":"词根记忆：vuln（受伤）+er+able（具有…性质的）→易受伤的","c":"be vulnerable to 易受…伤害；vulnerable group 弱势群体","d":"vulnerability（n. 易受攻击；弱点）；vulnerably（adv. 易受伤害地；易受攻击地）","y":"assailable（adj. 可攻击的，易攻击的）","f":"strong（adj. 强壮的，强大的；坚固的）；tough（adj. 强硬的；坚韧的）"},
20880:{"w":"steam","e":"The old train is powered by a steam engine.","t":"老式火车由**蒸汽**机驱动。","c":"steam engine 蒸汽机"},
20881:{"w":"valuable","e":"The province is abundant in valuable minerals.","t":"该省盛产**贵重**的矿物质。","c":"valuable belongings 贵重的财产"},
20882:{"w":"presumably","e":"Presumably consumers have bought such poisonous food.","t":"消费者**很可能**已经购买了这种有毒食品。","r":"来自presumable（adj. 可能的）","d":"presume〔v. 假定（某事）是事实，推测〕"},
20883:{"w":"sanctuary","e":"Despite living in a sanctuary, which makes them safe from hunters, the animals still face a number of problems that threaten their survival.","t":"尽管生活在**保护区**，得以远离猎人，但这些动物仍然面临很多威胁它们生存的问题。","r":"词根记忆：sanctu（=sanct，神圣）+ary（表场所）→神圣的场所→圣堂","c":"bird sanctuary 鸟类保护区；wildlife sanctuary 野生动植物保护区；seek sanctuary 寻找避难所"},
20884:{"w":"request","e":"I'd like to make a request for leave.","t":"我想**请求**离开一下。","r":"联想记忆：re（一再）+quest（寻求）→请求；要求"},
20885:{"w":"dash","e":"I dashed off the letter.","t":"我**急急忙忙**地把信写完了。","r":"联想记忆：d+ash（灰尘）→群马飞奔而过，扬起漫天灰尘→飞奔"},
20886:{"w":"treatment","e":"People were dissatisfied with the treatment of animals at the zoo.","t":"动物园**对待**动物的方式令人不满。","r":"来自treat（vt. 对待；治疗）"},
20887:{"w":"coarse","e":"It's good for you to walk on the coarse sand with bare feet.","t":"光脚在**粗**沙上走动对你有好处。","r":"联想记忆：coar（看作coal，煤炭）+se→煤炭是很粗糙的→粗糙的"},
20888:{"w":"insecure","e":"The trend towards blurring these roles in dress is probably democratic, but it also makes some people very insecure.","t":"淡化服饰角色的趋势或许比较民主，但同时也让一些人觉得很**不安全**。","r":"联想记忆：in（不）+secure（安全的）→不安全的","c":"an insecure investment 一笔不可靠的投资","d":"insecurity（n. 不安全，不安全感）"},
20889:{"w":"linen","e":"All bed linens and towels are clearly embossed with the name of the manufacturer.","t":"所有的**床上用品**和毛巾上都清楚地压印了生产商的名字。","r":"联想记忆：line（绳）+n→亚麻编的绳→亚麻织品"},
20890:{"w":"inspiration","e":"Hypotheses arise from guesswork, or from inspiration.","t":"假说源于人们的猜测或**灵感**。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+spir（呼吸）+ation（表状态）→吸入灵气→灵感","d":"inspirational（adj. 鼓舞人心的；启发灵感的）"},
20891:{"w":"generous","e":"People in disaster-affected areas received generous aid from the government.","t":"受灾地区的人民从政府那里得到了**大量的**救济物资。","r":"词根记忆：gener（产生）+ous（…的）→产生很多的→大量的","c":"a generous gift 一份慷慨的礼物"},
20892:{"w":"cultivate","e":"This banana is the first type to be cultivated here.","t":"这种香蕉是这里最早**种植**的品种。","r":"词根记忆：cult（培养）+iv+ate（使…）→培养"},
20893:{"w":"campaign","e":"Local authorities in London campaigned to be allowed to enforce anti-pollution laws themselves.","t":"伦敦当地政权发起一场要求赋予他们执行反污染法案权力的**运动**。","c":"launch a campaign 发起活动；campaign funds 竞选经费"},
20894:{"w":"disorder","e":"The couple knew through the examination that they would have a baby free from the disorder.","t":"通过检查，这对夫妇知道自己会生一个没有这种**疾病**的健康宝宝。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+order（顺序）→无序→混乱","d":"disorderly（adj. 混乱的，无秩序的）"},
20895:{"w":"spot","e":"You'll spot the cinema right next to the underground station.","t":"你会**发现**这家电影院就在地铁站旁边。","c":"on the spot 当场，在现场；hot spot 热点；scenic spot 景点"},
20896:{"w":"outcome","e":"Some environmentalists worry about this outcome.","t":"一些环境保护主义者对这个**结果**表示担心。","r":"来自词组come out（出来）"},
20897:{"w":"cautious","e":"We should be more cautious not to make any mistakes in our papers.","t":"我们要更加**小心**以避免在试卷上出现任何错误。","r":"词根记忆：cau（小心）+tious（有…性质的）→谨慎的"},
20898:{"w":"aggravate","e":"The pollution problems in the area will be further aggravated by the heavy industry.","t":"重工业的发展将使该地区的污染问题进一步**恶化**。","r":"词根记忆：ag（表加强）+grav（重）+ate（使…）→使…更重→加重，恶化","c":"aggravate poverty 加重贫困；aggravate the situation 使情况恶化","d":"aggravation（n. 恶化，激怒；恼人的事物）","y":"burden（vt. 使担负）；increase（v. 增加）","f":"decrease（v. 减少）；lessen（v. 减少，减轻）"},
20899:{"w":"deception","e":"The young boy didn't have the courage to admit his deception.","t":"那个男孩没有勇气承认他的**欺骗**行为。","r":"词根记忆：de（非）+cept（拿）+ion→不拿来→欺骗","c":"intentional deception 故意的欺骗行为"},
20900:{"w":"sharpen","e":"The course can help the students sharpen their oral skills.","t":"这门课程可以帮助学生们**提高**口语表达能力。","r":"联想记忆：sharp（锋利的）+en（使…）→使变锋利的→削尖；使敏锐","c":"sharpen pencils 削铅笔"},
20901:{"w":"practical","e":"The new invention was very practical.","t":"这项新发明很**实用**。","r":"来自practice（v./n. 实践）","c":"practical experience 实践经验；practical value 实用价值；practical material 实用材料"},
20902:{"w":"pliable","e":"This pair of shoes is made of pliable leather.","t":"这双鞋是用**软**皮做的。","r":"词根记忆：pli（折叠）+able（能…的）→能折叠的→柔韧的"},
20903:{"w":"disposal","e":"The main use of water in most families is washing and waste disposal.","t":"在大多数家庭中，水的主要用途是洗漱和废物**处理**。","r":"来自dispose（v. 处理，处置）","c":"waste disposal 废物处理；at one's disposal 任某人处理，供某人支配"},
20904:{"w":"subsidiary","e":"Ports attract many subsidiaries and independent industries.","t":"港口城市吸引了很多**附属公司**和独立产业。","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+sid（坐）+iary→坐在下面的→次要的；辅助的","c":"subsidiary unit 从属单位；subsidiary company 分公司","y":"subordinate（adj. 次要的；下属的）；affiliate（n. 分支机构）；branch（n. 分支，分部）"},
20905:{"w":"pattern","e":"How do you think the Internet has affected buying patterns in the past few years?","t":"你认为在过去几年内互联网如何影响了购买**模式**？"},
20906:{"w":"terrain","e":"Five speed bicycles are best suited to riding over long distances or hilly terrain.","t":"五档位变速自行车最适用于长途旅行或者崎岖多山的**地形**。","r":"词根记忆：terr（土地）+ain（表物）→地形，地势","y":"landform（n. 地形）"},
20907:{"w":"kneel","e":"Mary knelt down to examine the damage to her car.","t":"玛丽**跪**下来仔细查看汽车的受损情况。"},
20908:{"w":"overwhelm","e":"The village was overwhelmed by the flood.","t":"那个村庄被洪水**淹没**了。","r":"组合词：over（在…上）+whelm（淹没，压倒）→征服","d":"overwhelming（adj. 势不可挡的，压倒性的；巨大的）"},
20909:{"w":"contempt","e":"The officer's tone of voice towards the stowaway was loaded with contempt.","t":"警官对偷渡者说话的语气充满了**轻蔑**。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+tempt（蔑视）→轻视","y":"disdain（n. 轻蔑）"},
20910:{"w":"recognize","e":"Companies should recognize that their employees are a significant part of their financial assets.","t":"公司应该**认识到**雇员是其金融资产的重要组成部分。","r":"词根记忆：re（再）+cogn（知道）+ize（使…）→再次知道→认出；承认","c":"be recognized as 被认为是…"},
20911:{"w":"badge","e":"Are there any marks or badges on your briefcase that make it stand out?","t":"你的公文包上是否有什么记号或**标记**能让它区别于其他公文包？","y":"token（n. 象征；记号）；mark（n. 标志，记号）"},
20912:{"w":"economic","e":"They encouraged farmers to use greater quantities of fertilizers than are needed to get the highest economic crop yield.","t":"他们鼓励农民使用远远超过作物实际所需量的化肥，以获得最高的**经济**作物产量。","c":"economic climate 经济形势，经济气候"},
20913:{"w":"feeble","e":"I felt feeble when I was ill.","t":"我生病的时候感到很**虚弱**。","r":"联想记忆：fee（费用）+ble→需要花钱看病→虚弱的"},
20914:{"w":"virtue","e":"The virtue of job descriptions is that they lessen role ambiguity.","t":"工作描述的**优点**是能减少角色模糊性。","c":"by/in virtue of 凭借，依靠","d":"virtuous（adj. 品行端正的，有道德的）"},
20915:{"w":"suburb","e":"The hotel in Sydney's southern suburbs is the closest to Sydney Airport.","t":"位于悉尼南**郊**的这家酒店是距离悉尼机场最近的酒店。","r":"词根记忆：sub（接近）+urb（城市）→郊区"},
20916:{"w":"pulverise","e":"Pulverised rock will climb as a dust cloud into the atmosphere.","t":"**粉碎**的岩石会像尘雾一样上升到大气中。","r":"词根记忆：pulver（灰尘）+ise（使…）→使成灰尘→粉碎"},
20917:{"w":"fertilise","e":"Mature breeding birds are very expensive—even a fertilised ostrich egg isn't cheap.","t":"这种鸟的成鸟很贵，甚至一个**受精**的鸵鸟蛋都不便宜。","r":"词根记忆：fert（=fer，带来）+ilise→带来果实→使肥沃，使多产","c":"fertilised eggs 受精卵；cross-fertilise 异花受精"},
20918:{"w":"ration","e":"Eggs are on ration during the war.","t":"战争期间，鸡蛋实行**定量供应**。","r":"联想记忆：rat（老鼠）+ion→老鼠在开会，讨论口粮问题→定量口粮","c":"the weekly meat ration 每周的食肉量；be on ration 定量"},
20919:{"w":"attractive","e":"My landlord is a slender attractive woman in her mid-thirties.","t":"我的房东35岁左右，身材苗条，**魅力四射**。","c":"an attractive offer 一份有吸引力的工作；attractive personality有魅力的个性","d":"attractively（adv. 迷人地，有吸引力地）；attractiveness（n. 魅力，吸引力）；unattractive（adj. 不引人注意的）"},
20920:{"w":"conquest","e":"The king completed the conquest of the country.","t":"国王彻底**征服**了那个国家。","c":"military conquest 军事征服"},
20921:{"w":"sophisticate","e":"Susan isn't the sophisticate that her classmates imagine her to be.","t":"苏珊并不像她的同学们想的那样是个**久经世故的人**。"},
20922:{"w":"snap","e":"The heavy snow storm snapped tree branches and power lines.","t":"暴风雪**折断**了树枝和电线。","r":"联想记忆：s+nap（小睡）→上课小睡时被老师抓住了，遭到了训斥→怒声责斥","c":"snap out 厉声说出；snap up 迅速抓住；抢购"},
20923:{"w":"express","e":"The chart on the wall expresses the economic movements differently from the last year.","t":"墙上的这张图表**反映**了经济趋势与去年的不同。","r":"联想记忆：ex（出）+press（挤压）→挤出心里话→表达，表示","d":"expression（n. 表达，表述）；expressive（adj. 表现的，有表现力的）"},
20924:{"w":"identifiable","e":"Each piece of luggage should carry an identifiable label with the owner's name and contact number.","t":"每件行李都应贴有**可辨认的**标签，写明物主的姓名和联系电话。","r":"来自identify（v. 确认，认出）","c":"identifiable characteristics 可识别的特征"},
20925:{"w":"nominal","e":"The bonus to employees is merely a nominal sum.","t":"雇员们只得到了一笔**象征性**的奖金。","r":"词根记忆：nomin（名称）+al（…的）→名义上的","c":"nominal head 名义上的领导；nominal assets 名义资产；nominal fee 很少的费用","d":"nominally（adv. 有名无实地，名义上地）","y":"titular（adj. 有名无实的，名义上的）；minor（adj. 较小的，较少的）","f":"actual（adj. 实际的，真实的）；genuine（adj. 真正的）"},
20926:{"w":"acquire","e":"In the process of evolution, monkeys have not acquired the art of speech.","t":"在进化的过程中，猴子未能**获得**语言能力。","r":"词根记忆：ac（表加强）+quir（获得）+e→获得，取得"},
20927:{"w":"register","e":"You must remember to bring the ID card with you when you come to register.","t":"你来**登记**的时候一定要记得带上身份证。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+gister（带来）→再次带来（新来的学生）→登记","c":"registered capital 注册资本；register a trademark 注册一个商标；register for 登记参加，报名参加；register with 向…登记，给…留下印象；registered mail 挂号信"},
20928:{"w":"extremely","e":"Long hours of hot sunshine and searing winds give Australia an extremely high rate of evaporation.","t":"长时间的烈日曝晒和炙热的风使澳大利亚的蒸发率**极**高。"},
20929:{"w":"rot","e":"Root rot is a serious problem in such a situation.","t":"在这种情况下根部**腐烂**是一个很严重的问题。"},
20930:{"w":"ambulance","e":"There is a car accident, please send an ambulance as soon as possible.","t":"这里发生了一起车祸，请尽快派**救护车**来。","r":"词根记忆：ambul（行走）+ance（表状态）→到处流动的车→救护车"},
20931:{"w":"miserable","e":"Many female patients have completely given up exercise because the pain makes them so miserable.","t":"很多女性病人已经完全放弃了锻炼，因为疼痛让她们极其**痛苦**。","r":"词根记忆：miser（可怜的）+able（能…的）→悲惨的","c":"as miserable as sin 非常悲惨的；a miserable failure 可悲的失败"},
20932:{"w":"continuous","e":"There's a continuous video showing today about the voyages of Captain Cook.","t":"今日将**连续**放映有关库克船长航海的录像。","r":"来自continue（v. 持续）","c":"continuous flow 持续气流；continuous performance cinema 循环场电影院","d":"continuously（adv. 不断地，连续地）"},
20933:{"w":"crack","e":"Viscous lava, accompanied by burning clouds of ash and gas, welled out of the volcano from cracks in its flanks.","t":"黏稠的岩浆夹杂着燃烧的火山灰和气团，从火山侧面的**裂缝**中喷涌而出。","c":"crack up（身体或精神等）崩溃；crack down on 镇压"},
20934:{"w":"ripe","e":"When one banana is ripe, it will give off a gas which then helps all the others to ripen.","t":"当一根香蕉**成熟**了，它便会释放出一种气体催熟其他香蕉。","r":"联想记忆：稻熟（ripe）米（rice）香","d":"ripen（v. 使成熟；成熟）"},
20935:{"w":"vet","e":"Students who want loans are not \"means tested\" or \"credit vetted\".","t":"想要贷款的学生不用接受家庭经济状况调查，也不用接受信用**审查**。","y":"screen（vt./n. 审查，检查）"},
20936:{"w":"resonate","e":"The Stoics also believed the most important foundation for a good and happy life is not money, fame, power or pleasure, but having a disciplined and principled character—something which seems to resonate with many people today.","t":"斯多葛学派也认为，一个美好而幸福的人生最重要的基础不是金钱、名誉、权力或者享乐，而是有纪律性和原则性的性格，这似乎引起今天许多人的**共鸣**。","r":"词根记忆：re（回）+son（声音）+ate（使…）→使产生回声→使共鸣"},
20937:{"w":"divide","e":"All the students will be divided into groups of 12 to 15 students.","t":"所有的学生将被**分成**小组，每组12到15人。","c":"divide into 分成；divide sth. from sth. 把某物和某物分开"},
20938:{"w":"gross","e":"Agriculture and its supporting industries account for around 20% of our Gross National Product.","t":"农业及其辅助产业占我国国民生产**总**值的20%左右。","c":"Gross Domestic Product（GDP） 国内生产总值；Gross National Product（GNP） 国民生产总值"},
20939:{"w":"cloakroom","e":"The cloakroom where you can hang your coat or leave your bags is just behind us here.","t":"**衣帽间**就在我们后面，你可以在那儿挂大衣或放包。","r":"组合词：cloak（披风）+room（房间）→衣帽间"},
20940:{"w":"refusal","e":"The journalists received outright refusal of the foreign spokesman.","t":"记者们遭到了外交发言人的断然**拒绝**。","r":"来自refuse（v. 拒绝）"},
20941:{"w":"coupon","e":"Please fill out the attached coupon.","t":"请把附上的**参赛表**填写好。","r":"联想记忆：co（共同）+upon（在…上）→商家联合在节假日打折的基础上还发放优惠券→优惠券"},
20942:{"w":"tome","e":"They love to pore over weighty tomes.","t":"他们喜欢钻研**巨著**。","r":"联想记忆：大部头书（tome）都放在家里（home）"},
20943:{"w":"toxin","e":"Intake of nicotine encourages activity of other toxins in the blood.","t":"吸入的尼古丁会激活血液中的其他**毒素**。","r":"词根记忆：tox（毒）+in（…素）→毒素，毒质"},
20944:{"w":"simultaneously","e":"Where the mining is underground, the surface area can be simultaneously used for forests, cattle grazing and crop raising.","t":"在地下采矿的**同时**，其表层的土地可以用来造林、放牧和种庄稼。","r":"词根记忆：simult（一样）+aneous（有…特征的）+ly（…地）→同时地"},
20945:{"w":"ridiculous","e":"The fat old man looked ridiculous in his tight pink trousers.","t":"那个胖老头穿着粉色的紧身裤，显得**滑稽可笑**。","r":"词根记忆：rid（笑）+icul+ous（…的）→可笑的"},
20946:{"w":"chip","e":"Electronic chips recorded the presence of a vehicle in a given high traffic area at a given time.","t":"电子**芯片**记录了特定时间内，车辆在某一繁忙路段的通行情况。","r":"联想记忆：大家对炸薯片（fried chips）一定不陌生"},
20947:{"w":"polish","e":"After the axe had been chipped into shape, the workers needed water and sand for grinding and polishing.","t":"在斧子被削成形之后，工人们需要用水和沙子来打磨和**抛光**。","r":"词根记忆：pol（光滑）+ish（使…）→磨光，擦亮","c":"polish one's English 补习英语；polish furniture 抛光家具","d":"polished（adj. 磨光的，擦亮的）"},
20948:{"w":"wonder","e":"Excuse me, I'm wondering if you'd mind answering a few questions?","t":"打扰了，我**想知道**你是否介意回答几个问题？","c":"no wonder 难怪，怪不得"},
20949:{"w":"scholarship","e":"Susan won a scholarship to study at Harvard.","t":"苏珊获得了在哈佛大学学习的**奖学金**。"},
20950:{"w":"familiarise","e":"Read the flow chart to familiarise yourself with the task.","t":"阅读流程图以**熟悉**你自己的任务。","r":"来自familiar（adj. 熟悉的）","c":"familiarise yourself with sth. 使自己熟悉某事物"},
20951:{"w":"expectancy","e":"Smoking will cause a shortened life expectancy.","t":"吸烟会导致**预期**寿命缩短。","c":"life expectancy 平均寿命"},
20952:{"w":"blueprint","e":"The plans for improving the financial system have only reached the blueprint stage so far.","t":"改善金融体系的计划目前尚处于**筹划**阶段。","r":"组合词：blue（蓝）+print（印刷的图）→蓝图"},
20953:{"w":"interplay","e":"Social factors have interplayed with one another over the past hundred years and made the Middle East what it is today.","t":"在过去的一百年间，诸多社会因素**相互影响**，造成了今天中东的局势。","r":"联想记忆：inter（在…之间）+play（担任角色）→相互作用"},
20954:{"w":"convenient","e":"Cars easily surpass trains or buses as a flexible and convenient mode of personal transport.","t":"小汽车轻而易举地就胜过火车及公共汽车，成为一种灵活**便捷**的个人交通工具。","r":"发音记忆：“肯为你的”→肯为你提供方便的→方便的","c":"be convenient for... 对…来说方便；be convenient to do 方便做…"},
20955:{"w":"genuine","e":"Sixteen American states now use biometric fingerprint verification systems to check that people claiming welfare payments are genuine.","t":"现在美国的16个州利用生物指纹识别系统来确保要求领取福利金的人员信息**真实**无误。","r":"词根记忆：gen（出生）+uine→生来就有的→真正的"},
20956:{"w":"attentive","e":"Kate is attentive to her work.","t":"凯特工作很**专心**。"},
20957:{"w":"observation","e":"Can we mail out a questionnaire, or do face-to-face interviews, or maybe even observation?","t":"我们是邮寄调查表，还是面对面采访，亦或是进行**观察**？"},
20958:{"w":"personal","e":"The woman who lost her briefcase gave the policeman some personal details.","t":"丢失公文包的那个妇女向警察提供了一些**个人**信息。","c":"personal loan 个人贷款；personal item 个人物品；personal information 个人信息","d":"personalize（vt. 使人性化，个人化）；personally（adv. 个人地）"},
20959:{"w":"vitality","e":"When you see the Asiatic lion in India, what you sense is enormous vitality.","t":"当你在印度看到亚洲狮时，你能感觉到的就是它们旺盛的**生命力**。","r":"词根记忆：vit（生命）+al+ity（具备某种性质）→生命力，活力","c":"be full of vitality 充满活力；exceptional vitality 精力旺盛"},
20960:{"w":"requirement","e":"The Director of Studies will talk to you about the courses and different requirements for each.","t":"教务主管将和你谈论课程问题以及每门课程的不同**要求**。","r":"来自require（v. 需要，要求）"},
20961:{"w":"advisable","e":"A: Do I have to book the seat in advance? B: Oh, yes, it's advisable.","t":"A: 我必须提前预订座位吗？B: 哦，是的，这样**更好**。","r":"联想记忆：advis(e)（建议，劝告）+able（能…的）→能够听取别人的劝告的→明智的"},
20962:{"w":"bankrupt","e":"The theatre went bankrupt with over ten billion dollars of debt last January.","t":"去年一月份，那家剧院因负债超过一百亿美元而**破产**。","r":"联想记忆：bank（银行）+rupt（打破）→银行里的账户被打破→破产的"},
20963:{"w":"deplete","e":"When local resources became depleted, the tribe moved on.","t":"当地资源濒临**枯竭**时，部落会迁往他处。","r":"词根记忆：de（非）+plet（填满）+e→不满→倒空；（使）枯竭","d":"depletion（n. 消耗；枯竭）"},
20964:{"w":"influence","e":"What factors do you think influence these decisions?","t":"你认为**影响**这些决定的因素有哪些？"},
20965:{"w":"fantasy","e":"Those pleasures were produced through daydreaming and fantasy.","t":"那些快乐是通过白日梦和**想象**产生的。"},
20966:{"w":"tragic","e":"His trip to America is a tragic story.","t":"他的美国之行就是个**悲剧**。","r":"联想记忆：t+rag（破旧衣服）+ic（…的）→穿破旧衣服的→悲惨的"},
20967:{"w":"splint","e":"These kinds of matches were splints coated with sulphur and tipped with potassium chlorate.","t":"这种火柴是由涂上了硫磺、顶部包裹着氯酸钾的**细木梗**制成的。","r":"联想记忆：sp+lint（棉绒）→用棉绒和夹板把病人受伤的腿包扎好→夹板"},
20968:{"w":"foam","e":"The orange juice in its foam overflowed.","t":"橙汁冒着**泡**，溢了出来。","r":"联想记忆：肥皂（soap）产生了很多泡沫（foam）"},
20969:{"w":"occupation","e":"Please state your name, age and occupation on the form.","t":"请在表格里填写姓名、年龄和**职业**。","c":"regular occupation 固定职业"},
20970:{"w":"format","e":"You can use a computer to format your disc.","t":"你可以用计算机将磁盘**格式化**。","r":"联想记忆：form（形式）+at→固定的形式→版式；格式","d":"formation（n. 构成）；formative（adj. 形成的）"},
20971:{"w":"bachelor","e":"Tom is working towards a Bachelor of Social Science degree in the University of Cambridge.","t":"汤姆正在剑桥大学攻读社会学的**学士**学位。","c":"bachelor's degree 学士学位；Bachelor of Arts 文学学士；Bachelor of Science 理学学士"},
20972:{"w":"appointment","e":"If for some reason you cannot keep your appointment, please telephone.","t":"如果由于某种原因不能赴**约**，请您电话告知。","c":"make an appointment 约会"},
20973:{"w":"slope","e":"Steps were taken to evacuate the population. Most campers, hikers and timbercutters left the slopes of the mountain.","t":"已经采取措施疏散人群。大多数露营者、徒步旅行者和伐木工人都离开了**山坡**。","r":"联想记忆：slo（看作slow，慢的）+pe→慢慢地走下斜坡→斜坡"},
20974:{"w":"complex","e":"The new sports complex has everything needed for many different activities.","t":"新建的**综合**体育馆能为多种活动提供所需的一切设施。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+plex（重叠）→复杂的","c":"inferiority complex 自卑感，自卑情结","y":"complicated（adj. 复杂的，难解的）；intricate（adj. 复杂的，错综的）；involved（adj. 棘手的）；knotty（adj. 棘手的，困难多的）","f":"simple（adj. 简单的，简易的）"},
20975:{"w":"overhead","e":"The overhead cable will be harmful to the transport security.","t":"**高架**电缆会危及交通安全。","r":"组合词：over（在…之上）+head（头）→在头顶上，在高处","c":"overhead projector 高射投影仪"},
20976:{"w":"prerequisite","e":"A degree is an essential prerequisite for employment.","t":"学位是就业的**必备条件**。"},
20977:{"w":"population","e":"There is still a large portion of the world population living in poverty.","t":"世界**人口**中还有一大部分生活在贫困之中。","c":"population explosion 人口爆炸；population control 人口控制"},
20978:{"w":"prey","e":"Most animals hunt their prey by means of their eye-sight.","t":"大多数动物靠视力捕捉**猎物**。","r":"联想记忆：兔子天天祈祷（pray）不要成为狼的猎物（prey）","c":"prey on insects 捕食昆虫为生","y":"quarry（n. 猎物）；victim（n. 受害者，牺牲品）；afflict（vt. 使苦恼，折磨）；bother（v. 打扰，麻烦）"},
20979:{"w":"catalogue","e":"It is a new catalogue of the language books in the library.","t":"这是图书馆语言类图书的新**目录**。"},
20980:{"w":"assessment","e":"The teacher made a careful assessment of the exam.","t":"老师对本次考试做了细致的**评估**。","c":"research assessment 研究评估；assessment methods 评估方法"},
20981:{"w":"suggest","e":"There is nothing in the rules of grammar to suggest that ending a sentence with a preposition is wrong.","t":"没有任何语法规则**表明**以介词结束一个句子是错误的。"},
20982:{"w":"screw","e":"He screwed the painting onto the wall.","t":"他**用螺丝钉**把画固定在墙上。","r":"联想记忆：s+crew（一群人）→一群工人在流水线上生产螺丝钉→螺丝（钉）"},
20983:{"w":"enlighten","e":"Would you enlighten me on your plans for the future?","t":"能否给我**讲讲**你未来的计划？","r":"词根记忆：en（进入…之中）+light（光）+en→进入光明→启发；开导"},
20984:{"w":"textile","e":"From the seventeenth century, the company began to export textiles to North America.","t":"从17世纪起，这家公司就开始向北美出口**纺织品**。","r":"联想记忆：text（编织）+ile→编织出的物品→纺织品"},
20985:{"w":"account","e":"Coal is expected to account for almost 27 percent of the world's energy needs.","t":"预计对煤炭的需求将几乎**占**世界能源需求的27%。","r":"联想记忆：ac（表加强）+count（数）→账目需要一数再数→账目","c":"take...into account 考虑…；account for 解释，说明（原因等）；（数量等）占；on account of 因为，由于；give sb. an account of 给某人说明或解释（理由）；not on any account 绝对不"},
20986:{"w":"tutor","e":"Jane tutored this little girl in English.","t":"简给这个小女孩当英文**家教**。","d":"tutorial（n. 指南 adj. 大学导师的）"},
20987:{"w":"hesitate","e":"Mary hesitated before she answered this question because she didn't know what to say.","t":"玛丽在回答这个问题前**犹豫**了一下，因为她不知道要说什么。","r":"词根记忆：hes（黏附）+itate→脚像被黏住了一样→犹豫；不情愿","d":"hesitation（n. 犹豫）"},
20988:{"w":"topsoil","e":"The United States discovered in 1982 that about one-fifth of its farmland was seriously losing topsoil.","t":"美国于1982年发现其约有五分之一的耕地存在极为严重的**表层土**流失现象。","r":"组合词：top（顶部）+soil（土壤）→表层土"},
20989:{"w":"background","e":"The job requires applicants with a business background.","t":"这份工作要求求职者有商业**背景**。","r":"组合词：back（背面的）+ground（范围）→背景","c":"educational/cultural/family background 教育/文化/家庭背景；theoretical background 理论背景；background music 背景音乐"},
20990:{"w":"impossible","e":"This kind of research would be impossible without computers.","t":"没有计算机就**无法**进行这种研究。","r":"联想记忆：电影《碟中谍》就是 Mission Impossible"},
20991:{"w":"surgeon","e":"The surgeon sewed up the wound.","t":"**外科医生**缝合了伤口。","r":"联想记忆：surge（波动）+on→做外科医生，情绪不能太波动→外科医生","c":"dental surgeon 牙医"},
20992:{"w":"promise","e":"The dark clouds promise rain.","t":"乌云密布**预示**有雨。"},
20993:{"w":"thunder","e":"Thunder accompanies lightning.","t":"**雷**电交加。","r":"联想记忆：th+under（在…下）→打雷时切忌躲在树下→雷","d":"thunderstorm（n. 雷暴）；thundercloud（n. 雷雨云）"},
20994:{"w":"delicate","e":"Cowhide can be treated to produce about half a square metre of very delicate leather.","t":"牛皮可以被加工成面积约为0.5平方米且极其**精致**的皮革。"},
20995:{"w":"curriculum","e":"The teacher expects that the curriculum will successfully attract students.","t":"老师希望这种**课程**安排能成功地吸引学生。"},
20996:{"w":"layout","e":"The noise factor will have to be taken into consideration with the layout of the houses.","t":"噪音因素必须被纳入房屋**设计**的考虑范围之内。","r":"来自词组lay out（布置，安排）","c":"layout of an office 办公室布局；layout of a CV 简历的版面设计；product layout of a supermarket 超市的货品摆放"},
20997:{"w":"venture","e":"Allan, a doctoral student in anthropology, ventured deep into the jungle to search for the primitive natives.","t":"艾伦是一名人类学博士生，他**冒险**深入丛林腹地寻找原始土著。","r":"发音记忆：“玩车”→玩车有时需要冒险→冒…的风险","c":"venture into the unknown 闯入未知的领域；venture into/on sth. 冒险做…"},
20998:{"w":"shrink","e":"Employees found their time on the job shrinking to 8 hours daily.","t":"雇员们发现他们的工作时间已经**减少**到每天八小时。","r":"联想记忆：童话故事里，人喝（drink）了巫婆的药水就能收缩（shrink）身体","d":"shrinkage（n. 收缩；收缩程度）"},
20999:{"w":"gland","e":"This type of hormone is only produced in the pineal gland in the brain.","t":"只有脑部的松果**腺**才分泌这类荷尔蒙。"},
21000:{"w":"shortage","e":"The development project was welcomed because of Holland's chronic shortage of land.","t":"由于荷兰土地长期**短缺**，这一开发项目在荷兰大受欢迎。","r":"联想记忆：short（缺乏）+age→不足，缺少","c":"financial shortage 缺钱；shortage of spare time 缺少空闲时间","y":"lack（n. 缺少）；deficiency（n. 不足）"},
21001:{"w":"accreditation","e":"Our school has already reached the standards for the accreditation of colleges.","t":"我们学校已经达到了学院**资格认定**的标准。","r":"来自accredit（vt. 委任，委派）"},
21002:{"w":"stagnant","e":"Because of economic crisis, our company's sales have remained stagnant.","t":"由于经济危机，我们公司的销售额**停滞不前**。","r":"词根记忆：stagn（站立）+ant（…的）→站着不走的→停滞的"},
21003:{"w":"attach","e":"They attached the coupon to the front of the letter.","t":"他们把优惠券**附**在信的正面。","r":"词根记忆：at（表加强）+tach（钉）→牢牢钉上→贴；使附属","c":"attach to 使依恋；把…贴在，附加"},
21004:{"w":"flip","e":"A switch was flipped and the machine began to operate.","t":"**轻弹**开关，机器便开始运作。"},
21005:{"w":"comment","e":"Customers' comments, both positive and negative, are recorded by staff and are collated regularly to identify opportunities for improvement of products.","t":"员工记录来自顾客的正反两方面**意见**，（公司）定期整理核查这些意见，以确定是否能根据意见来提高产品的质量。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+ment（思考）→共同思考并说出各自观点→评论","c":"comment on/about... 评论…","d":"commentator（n. 评论员；讲解员）"},
21006:{"w":"flame","e":"The house was in flames.","t":"房子失**火**了。","r":"词根记忆：flam（燃烧）+e→燃烧"},
21007:{"w":"emphasize","e":"This report emphasizes that cancer is not caused by a single element in cigarette smoke.","t":"这一报告**强调**，癌症并不是由香烟烟雾中的某单一成分导致的。","r":"词根记忆：em（表加强）+phas（说）+ize（表动词）→强调，着重"},
21008:{"w":"foresee","e":"What changes do you foresee in the educational field in the next 50 years?","t":"在未来的50年里，你**预见**教育界会发生什么变化？","r":"词根记忆：fore（预先）+see（看）→预先看到→预见，预知","y":"predict（v. 预言，预测）；foretell（vt. 预言，预示）"},
21009:{"w":"historic","e":"There are a number of historic ships docked in the harbour.","t":"这个港湾停泊了很多**具有历史意义**的船舶。","c":"historic moment 历史性的时刻"},
21010:{"w":"provision","e":"The country has enough provisions of grain for the next several years.","t":"这个国家备有足够的粮食**储备**以供未来几年使用。","r":"来自provide（vt. 供应，提供）","c":"make provision 做好准备，预先采取措施；under the provision of 依据…条款","y":"preparation（n. 准备，预备）；clause（n. 条款）；food（n. 食物）"},
21011:{"w":"president","e":"A lecture will be given by the president of the Union.","t":"该协会**主席**将发表演讲。","d":"presidential（adj. 总统的）"},
21012:{"w":"internist","e":"The professor who teaches us is a respected internist.","t":"教我们的那个教授是一位受人尊敬的**内科医师**。"},
21013:{"w":"reception","e":"The students' dormitory is to the right of the reception desk.","t":"学生宿舍在**接待处**的右边。","r":"词根记忆：re（表加强）+cept（抓）+ion→抓住→接受","c":"reception center/desk 接待处","d":"receptionist（n. 接待员）"},
21014:{"w":"suspend","e":"The party representative suspended the talk with the government.","t":"该党代表**暂停**了和政府的对话。","r":"词根记忆：sus（下）+pend（悬挂）→吊，悬挂","c":"suspend a driving licence 吊销驾照；suspend payment 暂停付款","d":"suspended（adj. 暂停的；缓期的）；suspender（n. [常pl.]吊裤带，背带）"},
21015:{"w":"untrustworthy","e":"Allen should have known better than to lend such a large sum of money to that untrustworthy cousin of his.","t":"艾伦应该知道把这么一大笔钱借给他那**不可靠**的堂兄是不明智的。","r":"组合词：un（不）+trust（信任）+worthy（值得的）→不值得信任的"},
21016:{"w":"prospective","e":"Department heads composed prospective teams using a combination of people from all three categories.","t":"部门领导从现有所有三组人中选出一些人组成**未来**的团队。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+spect（看）+ive（…的）→向前看的→预期的；未来的","c":"prospective damage 预计损失","y":"imminent（adj. 即将来临的）；anticipated（adj. 预期的）"},
21017:{"w":"percentage","e":"What percentage of the workforce was employed in agriculture in this country in the mid 1900s?","t":"在20世纪中期，这个国家从事农业的劳动力在总劳动力中占多大**比例**？","r":"联想记忆：percent（百分比）+age（表集体名词）→百分比，百分率"},
21018:{"w":"clue","e":"If you do not know a word, you can look to the picture in this book for a clue to its meaning.","t":"如果你碰到不认识的单词，可以通过书中的插图找**线索**来推测它的意思。","r":"发音记忆：“刻录”→警方凭一张刻录光盘找到了犯罪分子→线索"},
21019:{"w":"stammer","e":"Left-handed children, forced to use their right hand, often develop a stammer.","t":"本来惯用左手的小孩在被迫改用右手后，通常会患**口吃**。","r":"联想记忆：stamm（看作stamp，邮票）+er→嘴被贴上了邮票→口吃"},
21020:{"w":"swamp","e":"The tsunami swamped the port city.","t":"海啸**吞没**了这座港口城市。","y":"overwhelm（vt. 淹没；压倒）；marsh（n. 湿地，沼泽）"},
21021:{"w":"jealous","e":"Tom is jealous of anyone who talks to his girlfriend.","t":"汤姆对每个和他女友说话的人都心存**妒意**。"},
21022:{"w":"favour","e":"Darkness favoured their escape.","t":"黑暗**有利于**他们逃跑。","r":"发音记忆：“飞吻”→我很喜欢那个小孩子，于是给了她一个飞吻→较喜欢"},
21023:{"w":"fickle","e":"I knew that he was a fickle man, and one you could never rely on.","t":"我知道他是个**反复无常**的人，你绝不能依赖他。"},
21024:{"w":"uphill","e":"We cycled uphill for over an hour.","t":"我们骑自行车爬了一个多小时的**山坡**。"},
21025:{"w":"defence","e":"The defences of the country must be reinforced.","t":"该国的**防御力量**必须加强。","r":"来自defend（v. 防护；辩护）","c":"natural defence mechanisms 先天性防御机制；defence against防御…"},
21026:{"w":"succeed","e":"One Winter Olympics has succeeded another every four years since 1924, with a break only for the Second World War.","t":"从1924年开始冬奥会一届**接着**一届，每四年举办一次，只在二战期间中断过一次。","r":"词根记忆：suc（下）+ceed（行走）→从下面走到上面→成功","c":"succeed in（doing） sth. 在…中取得成功"},
21027:{"w":"gender","e":"The gender gap is being attenuated in modern society.","t":"在现代社会里，**性别**差距正在弱化。","r":"联想记忆：温柔的（tender）性别（gender）","c":"gender equality 男女平等"},
21028:{"w":"consecutive","e":"You should give a clear and consecutive narrative for your report.","t":"你应该就你的报告给出一个清晰、**连贯**的陈述。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+secut（跟随）+ive（…的）→一个接一个的→连续不断的","c":"consecutive days 连续几天；consecutive years 连年","y":"successive（adj. 继承的；连续的）"},
21029:{"w":"diversion","e":"Most water diversion projects are harmful to the fish population.","t":"大多数的水系**改道**工程都会危及鱼群。","r":"词根记忆：di（离开）+vers（转）+ion→转向，转移，转换","c":"create a diversion 转移注意力"},
21030:{"w":"donate","e":"I should also like to say if you do have a bike to donate, it doesn't matter what condition it is in.","t":"我还想说如果你有自行车可以**捐赠**，不管它是什么状况都没关系。","r":"词根记忆：don（给予）+ate（做）→给出去→捐赠，赠送","c":"donate money and materials 捐赠钱和物资","d":"donation（n. 捐款，捐赠物）；donator（n. 捐赠者）","y":"contribute（v. 捐助，捐献）；present（vt. 赠送）"},
21031:{"w":"volume","e":"This liquid was 10 litres in volume.","t":"这一液体的**体积**为十升。","r":"联想记忆：和volute（adj. 螺旋形的；涡形的）一起记"},
21032:{"w":"refund","e":"You can't get a refund if you don't have any invoices.","t":"如果你没有发票就不能获得**退款**。","r":"联想记忆：re（向后）+fund（资金）→给回资金→偿付；退款","c":"full refund 全额偿还；give sb. a refund 给某人退款","d":"refundable（adj. 可偿还的）"},
21033:{"w":"regardless","e":"Regardless of the theory or model that we choose, a reduction in population size decreases the genetic diversity of a population.","t":"**无论**我们选择何种理论或研究样本，人口减少都会降低该种群的基因多样性。","r":"组合词：regard（关心）+less（少）→很少关心→不顾后果地","c":"regardless of 不管"},
21034:{"w":"emboss","e":"The hotel's name was embossed on all the towels.","t":"所有毛巾上都**压印**有旅馆的名字。","r":"联想记忆：em（出）+boss（老板）→那位老板有凸出来的啤酒肚→使…凸出"},
21035:{"w":"internationalist","e":"We established links and access to the internationalist organisations and their resources.","t":"我们与**国际主义者**组织建立了联系，并有权使用他们的资源。","r":"联想记忆：international（国际的）+ist（表人）→国际主义者"},
21036:{"w":"scatter","e":"The farmer scattered the seeds on the field.","t":"农民在地里**播**种。","r":"联想记忆：s+cat（猫）+ter→老鼠一见到猫就四处逃散→散开","c":"scatter...over... 把…撒在…；scatter strength 分散精力"},
21037:{"w":"appetite","e":"My supper by this time was cold, and my appetite was gone.","t":"我的晚餐这时候已经凉了，我也没**胃口**了。","r":"词根记忆：ap（表加强）+pet（寻求）+ite（表物）→一再追求→食欲","c":"appetite for... 对…的食欲；对…的兴趣"},
21038:{"w":"prevail","e":"The use of horses for ploughing still prevails in this area.","t":"在这一地区用马耕地还很**普遍**。","c":"prevail on/upon 说服，劝说"},
21039:{"w":"glossary","e":"You'll find the meaning of the difficult words used on this website in the glossary.","t":"你能在**词汇表**中查到此网页上难词的意思。"},
21040:{"w":"consolidation","e":"The global airline industry was heading towards more consolidation.","t":"全球航空业的**合并**之风日益盛行。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+solid（牢固的）+ation（表状态）→联合在一起使更加牢固→巩固"},
21041:{"w":"mansion","e":"Mary and her family lived in a mansion.","t":"玛丽一家住在一座**大房子**里。","r":"联想记忆：man（人）+sion→有钱人住的地方→宅邸"},
21042:{"w":"goodwill","e":"The manufacturer will lose customers and goodwill if word gets around that the product is unreliable.","t":"一旦产品不可靠的消息传了出去，生产商便会失去顾客及**信誉**。","r":"组合词：good（好的）+will（意愿）→善意"},
21043:{"w":"amass","e":"The monopoly capitalists amassed fabulous wealth during World War II.","t":"二战期间，垄断资本家**大发**横财。","r":"联想记忆：a+mass（大量）→使大量东西汇聚到一起→积聚"},
21044:{"w":"federal","e":"I opened a current account at the Federal Bank.","t":"我在**联邦**银行开了一个活期账户。","r":"联想记忆：FBI（联邦调查局）的F就是federal的缩写"},
21045:{"w":"consideration","e":"After a few moments' consideration, they refused the invitation.","t":"他们**考虑**片刻后，拒绝了邀请。","c":"in consideration of 考虑到…；由于…"},
21046:{"w":"grip","e":"She gripped on to the railing with both hands.","t":"她双手**紧紧抓住**栏杆。","c":"be in the grip of 在…的掌控下","d":"gripping（adj. 引人入胜的）"},
21047:{"w":"galaxy","e":"Scientists intend to discover a sun-like fixed star in remote galaxies.","t":"科学家们试图在遥远的**星系**中找到一颗类似太阳的恒星。"},
21048:{"w":"route","e":"This map shows the route across the mountains.","t":"这张地图上有穿越群山的**路线**。","c":"cycling route 骑自行车游览路线；shipping route 海运航线；air route 空运航线"},
21049:{"w":"deficiency","e":"The short child of tall parents very likely had a hormone deficiency early in life.","t":"父母个子高而孩子个子矮，极可能是孩子幼年时分泌的荷尔蒙**不足**造成的。","r":"词根记忆：de（否定）+fic（做）+iency→做得不够→缺乏","y":"inadequacy（n. 不充分，不足）"},
21050:{"w":"opposite","e":"The classroom is near the main entrance, just opposite the reception desk.","t":"教室位于主入口附近，**正对着**接待处。","d":"opposition（n. 反对）"},
21051:{"w":"sensational","e":"The performance given by the newcomers is a sensational success.","t":"新来者的表演取得了**轰动性的**成功。","c":"sensational discovery 轰动性的发现；sensational headlines 耸人听闻的头条新闻"},
21052:{"w":"participation","e":"The students below 20 years old are not given the right of participation in the ball.","t":"20岁以下的学生不允许**参加**舞会。","r":"来自participate（vi. 参与）"},
21053:{"w":"relief","e":"The relief material was flown to the flood-hit districts.","t":"**救灾**物资被空运至洪灾区。","r":"联想记忆：坚定的信念（belief）是痛苦的缓和剂（relief）","c":"to one's relief 令人感到放心的是"},
21054:{"w":"cultivation","e":"Now, the cultivation of crops and the husbandry of livestock can bring great profit.","t":"如今，**种植**农作物和饲养牲畜能获得丰厚的利润。"},
21055:{"w":"pretension","e":"The woman, having fewer pretensions, is far more willing to learn.","t":"这个女人并没有**自命不凡**，而是非常愿意学习。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+tens（伸展）+ion（表状态）→无限地向前伸展→自负"},
21056:{"w":"harness","e":"The dam stores water for such functions as the irrigation of crops and the harnessing of the force of gravity for the generation of electricity.","t":"大坝的存水可以用来灌溉农作物或**利用**重力来发电等。","r":"联想记忆：har（看作hard，结实的）+ness→马具通常都很结实→马具","c":"harness a river 治理河流；harness nuclear energy 利用核能"},
21057:{"w":"bent","e":"If you are buying a cot, do make sure that any metal present is not rusted or bent in any way.","t":"购买婴儿床的时候，一定要确保床的金属不能生锈或怎么都不会被**弄弯**。","c":"a bent nail 一颗弯曲的钉子；be bent on doing sth. 决意做某事"},
21058:{"w":"stitch","e":"Susan is stitching her old clothes.","t":"苏珊正在**缝**她的旧衣服。","r":"联想记忆：stit（看作sit，坐）+ch→坐在那里做针线活→缝；针脚","c":"drop a stitch（织毛衣时）掉针了；cross stitch 十字绣；back stitch 回针，返针；stitch sth. up 把某物缝合"},
21059:{"w":"manual","e":"You should read the instruction manual carefully before fixing the air-conditioner.","t":"安装空调前你应该仔细阅读指导**手册**。","r":"词根记忆：manu（手）+al（…的）→手工的","c":"manual workers 手工劳动者；manual labour 体力劳动","d":"manually（adv. 用手地，手工地）"},
21060:{"w":"mite","e":"The hives will be replaced because of mites or an ageing or dead queen.","t":"蜂箱会因为**螨虫**或者蜂后的衰老或死亡等情况而被更换。","r":"联想记忆：天上的风筝（kite）像小虫（mite）"},
21061:{"w":"burglar","e":"When you leave the house, make sure the windows and doors are shut, and set the burglar alarm.","t":"当你离开房子时，务必关好门窗，并打开防**盗**报警器。","r":"联想记忆：burg（看作bag，包）+lar→背着大包潜入室内→窃贼","d":"burglary（n. 夜盗行为；夜盗罪）"},
21062:{"w":"scheme","e":"The government has been funding a loans scheme for students in higher education since September 1990.","t":"自1990年9月起，政府就开始为大学生贷款**计划**提供资金。","r":"联想记忆：根据图解（schema）来计划（scheme）行程"},
21063:{"w":"addition","e":"This fruit is a welcome addition to the English diet.","t":"这种**添加**在英式饮食中的水果很受欢迎。","r":"联想记忆：add（加）+ition→加，增加（物）","c":"in addition 另外；in addition to... 除…之外"},
21064:{"w":"sensory","e":"Mr. Roger is a scientist working in the field of sensory perception.","t":"罗杰先生是**感官**知觉领域的一名科学家。","r":"联想记忆：sens(e)（感觉）+ory→感觉的","c":"sensory organ 感觉器官"},
21065:{"w":"materialistic","e":"Modern society is often called materialistic.","t":"现代社会通常被称为是**物质享乐主义**的。","r":"来自material（adj. 物质的）"},
21066:{"w":"detach","e":"The mechanic detached the oil filter.","t":"机修工**拆下**了滤油器。","r":"词根记忆：de（离开）+tach（钉）→把钉上的分开→分离","c":"detach from... 从…分离；拆下；semi-detached house 半独立式住宅","y":"disconnect（vt. 切断，使分离）；separate（v. 分开，分离）","f":"attach（v. 系；附加）"},
21067:{"w":"torrent","e":"As ice and snow melted, they touched off devastating torrents of mud and debris.","t":"冰雪融化引发了破坏力极大的泥石**洪流**。","r":"词根记忆：torr（=torn，转动）+ent（表物）→水流转动不停地前进→洪流"},
21068:{"w":"thirsty","e":"The moisture is absorbed by thirsty plants.","t":"**饥渴**的植物吸收了水分。"},
21069:{"w":"clarify","e":"Talking to students about the requirements of a course helps to clarify what needs to be done.","t":"告诉学生课程要求有助于他们**弄清**自己所需要完成的工作。","r":"词根记忆：clar（清楚的）+ify（使…）→使清楚→澄清","d":"clarification（n. 澄清；阐明）"},
21070:{"w":"inspect","e":"The general inspected the troops.","t":"将军**检阅**了军队。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+spect（看）→向内看→检查，检阅","d":"inspector（n. 检查员）；inspection（n. 检查，视察）"},
21071:{"w":"seam","e":"The sailors couldn't find anything to caulk the seams in the boat.","t":"水手们找不到任何东西来填塞船上的**裂缝**。"},
21072:{"w":"agriculture","e":"Agriculture still employs nearly half of the population in many developing countries, though the share is falling steadily.","t":"在许多发展中国家，**农业**仍然雇用着近一半的人口，尽管这一比例正在稳步下降。","r":"词根记忆：agri（农业）+cult（耕种）+ure（名词后缀）→农业；农学","d":"agricultural（adj. 农业的；农学的）"},
21073:{"w":"microcosm","e":"Malaysia's universities have always been a microcosm of Malaysian society.","t":"马来西亚的大学往往是整个马来西亚社会的**缩影**。","r":"词根记忆：micro（微小）+cosm（世界）→微观世界"},
21074:{"w":"proliferate","e":"If these other quick-growing species of bushes and plants are allowed to proliferate, they harm the eucalyptus in another way, by affecting the composition of the soil, and removing nutrients from it.","t":"如果这些其他快速生长的灌木和植物得以**激增**，它们会以另一种方式损害桉树，影响土壤的成分，并从土壤中迁移养分。","r":"词根记忆：prol(i)（子孙）+fer（带来）+ate→带来子孙后代→繁殖","d":"proliferation（n. 增殖；分芽繁殖）"},
21075:{"w":"surgery","e":"They perform surgery between 9:00 and 11:30 every weekday.","t":"他们在每个工作日的9:00到11:30做**手术**。","c":"heart bypass surgery 心脏搭桥手术"},
21076:{"w":"catastrophe","e":"The flood was a major catastrophe, reducing population sizes in areas involved.","t":"洪水是一场**大灾难**，使受灾地区的人口减少。","r":"词根记忆：cat(a)（向下）+astro（星星）+phe→古人认为星星坠落预示大难临头→大灾难","d":"catastrophic（adj. 悲惨的；灾难性的）","y":"disaster（n. 灾难）"},
21077:{"w":"overwork","e":"He has been overworking for two months, and at last he fell ill in the workplace.","t":"他已经连续**劳累工作**两个月之久，最后病倒在了工作岗位上。"},
21078:{"w":"parental","e":"The government repeatedly stressed its support for parental choice in the selection of a child's school.","t":"政府一再重申其支持**家长**对孩子教育的选择权。"},
21079:{"w":"various","e":"The professor has studied the languages of various countries.","t":"这位教授研究过**多个**国家的语言。"},
21080:{"w":"sediment","e":"There was heavy brown sediment in the bottom of the bottle.","t":"水壶的底部有厚厚的棕色**沉淀物**。","r":"词根记忆：sed（坐）+i+ment（表具体物）→坐下去的东西→沉淀物","d":"sedimentation（n. 沉淀，沉降）；sedimentary（adj. 沉积的，沉积形成的）"},
21081:{"w":"resit","e":"The four students resat the final examinations and passed this time.","t":"这四名学生参加了期末考试**补考**，这次都通过了。","c":"resit the exam 参加补考"},
21082:{"w":"menace","e":"Let's look at some of the reasons why back pain is developing into such a unique menace.","t":"让我们来看一看为什么背疼会演变成一种**威胁**。","r":"联想记忆：men（人）+ace（看作race，赛跑）→和你赛跑的人对你构成了威胁→威胁","c":"a menace to sb./sth. 对…的威胁","y":"threat（n. 威胁，恐吓）；threaten（v. 威胁，恐吓）"},
21083:{"w":"contain","e":"It is traditionally accepted that children's books should contain a few pictures.","t":"从传统意义上来说，人们普遍认为儿童读物中应该**配有**一些插图。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+tain（拿住）→全部拿住→包含","c":"contain oneself 自制","d":"container（n. 容器）"},
21084:{"w":"fasten","e":"The driver must fasten his seat belt before driving.","t":"司机在开车前必须**系好**安全带。","r":"联想记忆：fast（牢固的）+en（使…）→扎牢"},
21085:{"w":"establish","e":"You may have to establish new eating habits in order to keep healthy.","t":"为了保持健康，你需要**养成**一些新的饮食习惯。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+st（站）+abl（能）+ish（使…）→使能够站立出来→建立；确立","c":"establish goals 树立目标；establish relations 建立联系","d":"establishment（n. 建立；确立）"},
21086:{"w":"position","e":"The position of women in society has changed markedly in the last twenty years.","t":"在过去的20年间，妇女的社会**地位**有了显著的改变。","c":"be in a position to do sth. 能够做…，有做…的机会；leave sth./sb. in the position of 使…处于…"},
21087:{"w":"simulate","e":"The experiment simulated a natural environment.","t":"这个试验**模拟**了一种自然环境。","r":"词根记忆：simul（一样）+ate（使…）→做得像真的一样→模仿","y":"imitate（vt. 模仿，效仿）；ape（vt. 模仿）；affect（v. 假装）"},
21088:{"w":"scratch","e":"There is a small scratch on my bag.","t":"我的包上有一道不长的**划痕**。","c":"from scratch 从头做起，从零开始；up to scratch 达到应有的水平"},
21089:{"w":"flexitime","e":"Flexitime is one good method to reduce the number of vehicles traveling together at rush hour.","t":"采用**弹性工作制**是降低交通高峰期车流量的好方法。"},
21090:{"w":"assist","e":"The Student Union is intended to assist in teachers' work.","t":"学生会旨在**协助**老师的工作。","r":"词根记忆：as（表加强）+sist（站立）→站起来帮助别人→帮助，协助","c":"assist with/in 帮助","d":"assistance（n. 协助，帮助）；assistant（n. 助手，助教 adj.助理的，辅助的）"},
21091:{"w":"illegal","e":"The police arrested the old lady for illegal possession of drugs.","t":"警方以**非法**持有毒品为由逮捕了这位老妇人。","r":"联想记忆：il（不，非）+legal（合法的）→不合法的","c":"illegal profit 非法利润；illegal drugs 毒品；illegal activity 非法活动","d":"illegality（n. 非法，违法）；illegally（adv. 不合法地，违法地）"},
21092:{"w":"ultimately","e":"The paper was written, edited, typeset and ultimately printed.","t":"报纸经过编写、编辑、排版，**最后**被印刷出来。","r":"词根记忆：ultim（最后的）+ate+ly→最终地"},
21093:{"w":"sinew","e":"The athletes were so nervous that we could see all their sinews tense.","t":"运动员非常紧张，以致我们能看到他们紧绷的**肌肉**。"},
21094:{"w":"artificial","e":"We use no artificial additives of any kind in our products.","t":"我们的产品绝不含任何**人工**添加剂。","r":"词根记忆：arti（=art，技巧）+fic（做）+ial（…的）→利用技巧制作的→人造的","c":"artificial colour 人工色素，合成色素；artificial intelli-gence人工智能"},
21095:{"w":"veil","e":"They lifted the veil of this ancient tomb.","t":"他们揭开了这座古代陵墓的神秘**面纱**。","r":"联想记忆：邪恶的（evil）人总是试图掩饰（veil）自己"},
21096:{"w":"tend","e":"Women tend to research thoroughly before applying for positions or attending interviews.","t":"在申请职位或是参加面试前，女性**往往**会（对应聘公司及职位）进行全面彻底的了解。"},
21097:{"w":"removal","e":"I saw a removal van outside your house yesterday afternoon.","t":"昨天下午我看见你家屋外停着一辆**搬家**卡车。"},
21098:{"w":"parallel","e":"The expressway is parallel to the railway.","t":"这条高速公路与铁路**平行**。","r":"词根记忆：para（类似）+llel→类似的","c":"parallel to 与…平行；parallel lines 平行线；parallel bars 双杠"},
21099:{"w":"compel","e":"The boss compels workers to spend more time on the job.","t":"老板**强迫**工人花更多的时间在工作上。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+pel（推）→强迫","c":"compel sb. to do sth. 强迫某人做某事"},
21100:{"w":"immediately","e":"You go down to the end of this corridor and turn right. The computer lab is immediately on your right.","t":"走到走廊尽头向右拐，右手边**就**是机房。"},
21101:{"w":"institute","e":"The Language Institute provides student support, welfare and activities services.","t":"语言**学院**为学生提供资助、福利和活动服务。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+stitut（建立）+e→建立，设立","c":"financial institute 金融研究所"},
21102:{"w":"serial","e":"A lot of people complained that American police serials were particularly violent.","t":"许多人抱怨美国的警匪**剧**太暴力了。","r":"联想记忆：连续剧（serial）就是以某个主题为系列（series）的电视剧"},
21103:{"w":"oversee","e":"You must appoint someone to oversee the project.","t":"你得指派某个人**监督**这个项目。","r":"组合词：over（在…之上）+see（看）→监督","c":"oversee the project 监督这个项目"},
21104:{"w":"reinforce","e":"Concrete with steel bars in it is known as reinforced concrete.","t":"水泥中加入钢条就成了我们所知的**钢筋**混凝土。","r":"联想记忆：re（又，再）+in（向内）+force（力量）→再次给予力量→加强"},
21105:{"w":"commitment","e":"This commitment has been clearly defined in the act.","t":"这项法案中明确定义了这一**义务**的内容。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+mit（送）+ment（表行为）→一起送出→委托"},
21106:{"w":"donation","e":"The work of the charity is funded by voluntary donations.","t":"这家慈善机构工作所需资金是人们自愿**捐赠**的。","r":"词根记忆：don（给予）+ation（表行为）→免费给予→捐赠"},
21107:{"w":"curious","e":"Further observation by astronomers revealed two curious facts.","t":"天文学家经过进一步观察发现了两个**奇怪**的现象。","c":"be curious about 对…好奇"},
21108:{"w":"overdraft","e":"Some workers have a huge overdraft to pay off every month.","t":"一些工人每个月都要偿还巨额**透支款**。"},
21109:{"w":"optical","e":"We'll discuss optical fibres and how they could be used in the future to improve optical instruments.","t":"我们将讨论光纤以及将来如何把它们用于改善**光学**仪器等问题。","r":"词根记忆：opt（视力）+ical（…的）→视力的","c":"optical aids 助视器","d":"optic（adj. 眼睛的；视觉的）"},
21110:{"w":"otherwise","e":"It's a ten-minute taxi ride from the station and will cost you £5, otherwise, you can take the bus which runs every hour and a half from the station.","t":"从车站打车（到这）要十分钟，车费是五英镑。**或者**，你还可以乘从车站出发的公共汽车，一个半小时一班。"},
21111:{"w":"possession","e":"It would be a good idea to get some insurance for the furniture and other personal possessions.","t":"给家具和其他一些个人**财产**上保险是一个不错的主意。","c":"in one's possession 被某人占有；in possession of sth. 占有某物"},
21112:{"w":"however","e":"I feel a bit sleepy, however, I keep studying.","t":"我有点困了，**但**我仍坚持学习。"},
21113:{"w":"retail","e":"What sorts of shop do you like best, the department store or the small retails?","t":"你最喜欢哪种商店，百货商场还是小**零售店**？","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+tail（=cut，剪）→一再剪碎了单卖→零售","c":"retail price 零售价；retail trade 零售业；retail shop 零售店","d":"retailer（n. 零售商，零售店）；retailing（n. 零售业）"},
21114:{"w":"cultural","e":"The exhibition showed some cultural relics of the primeval times.","t":"该展览展出了很多原始时期的**文化**遗产。"},
21115:{"w":"solution","e":"It took time to find a solution to the problem.","t":"找到解决该问题的**方法**需要时间。"},
21116:{"w":"morality","e":"Mankind has undergone great improvement in intelligence or morality.","t":"人类无论在智力方面还是在**道德**方面都经历了巨大的进步。","r":"联想记忆：moral（道德的）+ity→道德，美德","c":"public morality 公共道德"},
21117:{"w":"transaction","e":"The teller told me that the computer system was temporarily down, so they couldn't do any transactions.","t":"出纳员告诉我计算机系统临时出故障了，所以他们不能进行任何**交易**。","r":"词根记忆：trans（变换）+action（行动）→交换行动→交易","y":"deal（n. 交易）；exchange（n. 交换；交易）"},
21118:{"w":"twofold","e":"There has been a twofold increase in the number of rare birds in the past decade.","t":"在过去的十年，珍稀鸟类的数量增加了**两倍**。"},
21119:{"w":"embassy","e":"Your visa application is being processed at the UK Embassy.","t":"你的签证正由英国**大使馆**办理。","c":"the American Embassy in Paris 美国驻巴黎大使馆"},
21120:{"w":"remark","e":"Can you remark the differences between the two paintings?","t":"你能**说出**这两幅画的不同之处吗？","r":"联想记忆：re（一再）+mark（做标记）→一再做标记→评论","c":"remark about/on 评论；make a remark on 对…发表评论","d":"remarkable（adj. 显著的，非凡的）"},
21121:{"w":"delay","e":"After a delay of two days, the whole team continued the journey.","t":"**耽搁**了两天后，整个小组继续行进。","r":"联想记忆：de+lay（放下）→放下不管→耽搁"},
21122:{"w":"congress","e":"The congress called on the local governments to reopen schools after the war.","t":"战后，**国会**号召地方政府重开学校。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+gress（行走）→走到一起去开会→大会","c":"the support of Congress 国会的支持；the People's Congress 人民代表大会","d":"congressional（adj. 大会的；国会的）"},
21123:{"w":"germ","e":"The patient had not the strength to throw off the germs that had invaded his immune system.","t":"病人无力摆脱已经侵入其免疫系统的**病菌**。","r":"本身是词根，意为“芽”→微生物；细菌"},
21124:{"w":"fashion","e":"You'll find all sorts of things in the museum: old suitcases, ships' crockery, and classical cabins decorated in the fashion of the day.","t":"在博物馆里你会找到各类东西：陈旧的手提箱、陶制船模型，还有以当时**风格**装饰的古典小屋。","r":"联想记忆：f+ash（灰）+ion→我灰头土脸的，和商场里的时装格格不入→时装；流行款式","d":"fashionable（adj. 时髦的）"},
21125:{"w":"splash","e":"I refreshed myself by splashing cold water on my face.","t":"我往脸上**扑**冷水让自己精神起来。","y":"splatter（v. 飞溅）；sprinkle（v. 喷洒）"},
21126:{"w":"beforehand","e":"The experiment will last for one year. Beforehand, several months are devoted to planning.","t":"试验将持续一年的时间。**在此之前**，要用几个月的时间制订计划。","r":"组合词：before（在…以前）+hand（手）→抢在…之前下手→预先，事先","f":"afterward（adv. 然后，后来）"},
21127:{"w":"filter","e":"Workers find that machines work much better if they change the filters regularly.","t":"工人们发现如果他们定期更换机器里的**过滤器**，机器就会运转得更好。","r":"发音记忆：“非要它”→香烟的滤嘴是非要不可的→过滤器","c":"filter tip（香烟的）滤嘴；filter sth. out 把…滤出"},
21128:{"w":"aspect","e":"A great deal of empirical evidence shows that pictures in a book interfere in a damaging way with all aspects of learning to read.","t":"大量经验表明，书中的插图给学习阅读的各**方面**都造成了不利影响。","r":"词根记忆：a（表加强）+spect（看）→看上去的样子→外表","c":"in all aspects 全面；aspect of …方面"},
21129:{"w":"objection","e":"If no one has any objection against the decision, I'll declare the meeting is closed.","t":"如果没人**反对**这个决议，那么我将宣布会议结束。"},
21130:{"w":"tunnel","e":"The prisoner had escaped by tunnelling.","t":"犯人**挖地道**逃跑了。","r":"联想记忆：海峡（channel）像条长长的地道（tunnel）"},
21131:{"w":"contrast","e":"This white peak contrasts finely with the blue sky.","t":"这座雪白的山峰同蔚蓝的天空**交相辉映**。","r":"词根记忆：contra（相反）+st（站）→反着站→对比；对照","c":"by contrast 对比之下，（与…）相对照；in contrast with/to与…形成对比；contrast A with B 把A与B进行对比"},
21132:{"w":"effect","e":"The report suggests that the smoke experienced by many people in their daily lives is enough to produce substantial adverse effects on a person's heart and lungs.","t":"报告指出，许多人在日常生活中吸入的（香烟）烟雾足以给他们的心脏和肺造成严重的负面**影响**。","r":"词根记忆：ef（=e，表加强）+fect（做）→反复做→效果","c":"carry/bring into effect 使生效，实施；in effect 有效，实际上；take effect 生效，起作用；side effects 副作用；positive effect 积极影响；cause and effect 原因和结果","d":"effective（adj. 有效的）；effectively（adv. 有效地）；effectiveness（n. 有效性）；ineffective（adj. 无效的）"},
21133:{"w":"distance","e":"Underground water can flow very large distances and can be kept in underground reservoirs for a very long time.","t":"地下水可以流经很长的**距离**，并能在地下含水层中储藏相当长时间。","r":"来自distant（adj. 遥远的）"},
21134:{"w":"stem","e":"As the axe cut through the stem, the tree fell.","t":"斧子砍断**树干**时，树倒了下来。","c":"stem from 源于"},
21135:{"w":"normal","e":"The normal noise threshold for private housing is 55 decibels.","t":"私人住宅区**标准**的噪音音量上限为55分贝。","r":"联想记忆：norm（标准，规范）+al→标准的，规范的","c":"normal education 师范教育，正规教育；normal state 标准状态，常态","d":"normally（adv. 正常地，通常地）"},
21136:{"w":"sincere","e":"My respect to you is very sincere.","t":"我对您的尊敬是非常**诚挚**的。","r":"联想记忆：sin（罪）+cere→把罪过一一坦白，态度真诚→真诚的"},
21137:{"w":"summarise","e":"The speaker summarised the important points of her lecture.","t":"演讲者**概括**了她演讲中的重点。","r":"来自summary（n. 总结，概括）"},
21138:{"w":"foetus","e":"Every brain is initially female in its organisation and it only becomes a male brain when the male foetus begins to secrete hormones.","t":"每一个大脑在结构上最初都是雌性的，只有当雄性**胚胎**开始分泌荷尔蒙时才变成雄性。","c":"foetus education 胎教"},
21139:{"w":"merge","e":"Fact and fiction merge together in his latest thriller.","t":"在他最新的惊险小说中，真实和虚构**相互交织**。","r":"词根记忆：merg（沉）+e→沉下→融为一体→结合"},
21140:{"w":"aware","e":"Most ecologists were aware that the areas of Amazonia they were working in had been shaped by human settlement.","t":"大多数生态学家**意识到**他们研究的亚马孙地区已经受到人类居住的影响。","c":"be aware of 意识到…","d":"unaware（adj. 不知道的，未意识到的）；awareness（n. 知道；意识）"},
21141:{"w":"label","e":"I think we should label the lid itself and say that it constitutes twenty-five percent of the total weight.","t":"我认为我们应该在盖子上**贴上标签**，注明盖子本身占总重的25%。","r":"联想记忆：lab（实验室）+el→实验室里的试剂瓶上贴有标签→标签","c":"label as 把…称为"},
21142:{"w":"guarantee","e":"The box is made of stainless steel which is guaranteed for 20 years.","t":"这个盒子是不锈钢的，品质**保证**期限为20年。","r":"联想记忆：guar（看作guard，保卫）+ant（蚂蚁）+ee→蚁后允诺要开展一场保卫战→允诺；保证","c":"guarantee to 保证…；guarantee sb. sth. 保证某人某事"},
21143:{"w":"interrelationship","e":"This study examined the interrelationship between environment and human behaviour.","t":"这项研究考察了环境和人类行为的**相互影响**。"},
21144:{"w":"stationery","e":"They manage the Student Union paper shop, selling magazines and newspapers as well as stationery and sweets.","t":"他们负责管理学生会的报刊亭，销售杂志、报纸，还有**文具**和糖果。"},
21145:{"w":"limestone","e":"The limestone has to be dug out of the mine and transported to the power station.","t":"**石灰石**必须从矿山挖出，然后被运往发电站。","r":"组合词：lime（石灰）+stone（石头）→石灰石，石灰岩"},
21146:{"w":"impulse","e":"Mary bought the dress on impulse.","t":"玛丽一时**冲动**买了这件衣服。","r":"词根记忆：im（使…）+puls（推）+e→冲动","c":"on（the） impulse（of...） 凭（…的）冲动；impulse buying 即兴购买","y":"desire（n. 愿望，欲望）；urge（n. 强烈的欲望，迫切的要求）"},
21147:{"w":"wax","e":"In the extracting room, rotating blades shaved away the wax that covered each cell.","t":"在提取室里，旋转的刀片刮掉覆盖每间蜂房的**蜂蜡**。","c":"candle wax 蜡烛"},
21148:{"w":"incapacitate","e":"The figures show that about a quarter of a million people are incapacitated with back pain every day.","t":"数据显示，每天约有25万人因背痛而**无法正常生活**。","r":"联想记忆：in（无）+capacit(y)（能力）+ate（使…）→使无能力"},
21149:{"w":"appear","e":"It appears that there is a grammar mistake in the composition.","t":"这篇作文**好像**有一处语法错误。","c":"appear to do sth. 似乎要…"},
21150:{"w":"check","e":"The teacher has checked Kate's answers.","t":"老师**检查**了凯特的答案。","d":"checker（n. 检验员，审查员）；check-in（n. 登记；登记处）；check-out（n. 办理退房）；check-up（n. 身体检查）；checklist（n. 清单）；checked（adj. 有格子图案的）"},
21151:{"w":"collect","e":"I've collected maps and other data to prepare a guidebook.","t":"我已**收集**了地图和其他信息准备写本指南。","r":"词根记忆：col（共同）+lect（收集）→收集，搜集","d":"collective（adj. 共同的；集体的）；collection（n. 收藏品）"},
21152:{"w":"attract","e":"We kept the price low to attract more visitors here.","t":"我们保持低价以**吸引**更多的游客前来。","r":"词根记忆：at（表加强）+tract（拉）→不断拉→吸引，招引","c":"attract one's attention 引起某人的注意；attract people's interest 引起人们的兴趣","d":"attraction（n. 吸引；诱惑）；attractant（n. 引诱物）"},
21153:{"w":"describe","e":"The lecturer describes four processes which may contribute to the extinction of a species.","t":"演讲者**描述**了可能导致一个物种灭绝的四个过程。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+scrib（写）+e→着重写→描述","d":"description（n. 描述；类型）"},
21154:{"w":"chunk","e":"Research and development now takes up a sizeable chunk of the military budget.","t":"现在研发经费占军事预算相当大的**一部分**。","r":"发音记忆：“常客”→饭馆的常客占客人总数的很大一部分→相当大的部分"},
21155:{"w":"agency","e":"We establish links and access to the organisation's agencies.","t":"我们同这一组织的**代理机构**建立了联系，能直接进入这些机构。","r":"词根记忆：ag（代理）+ency（表性质）→代理","d":"agent（n. 代理人；代理商）"},
21156:{"w":"blend","e":"The music gradually blended into the city noises.","t":"音乐逐渐和城市的噪音**混杂**在了一起。","c":"blend in 融入；blend with 与…混合"},
21157:{"w":"conceive","e":"These scientific advances can offer a new way to test whether a conceived baby is healthy or not.","t":"这些科学上的进步为检测**孕育**中的婴儿是否健康提供了一种新方法。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+ceive（抓）→大家一起抓（思想）→想出","c":"conceive of 设想；conceive a child 怀孕","y":"think（v. 想，认为）；imagine（v. 想象，设想）"},
21158:{"w":"affect","e":"No activity affects more of the earth's surface than farming.","t":"耕种是对地表**影响**最大的人类活动。","r":"词根记忆：af（表加强）+fect（做）→使人做→影响"},
21159:{"w":"frustrate","e":"This is the place where we frustrated the enemy.","t":"我们就是在此处**挫败**了敌人。"},
21160:{"w":"extend","e":"I extended my tour for another week here.","t":"我把在这里的旅行时间**延长**了一周。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+tend（伸展）→伸展出去→延长"},
21161:{"w":"introduce","e":"We've introduced a simpler price structure.","t":"我们**引进**了一套更简易的价格体系。","c":"introduce a course 介绍一门课程","d":"introduction（n. 介绍；引进；推行）"},
21162:{"w":"advice","e":"I was told to come here for advice about math courses.","t":"有人告诉我到这里来咨询一些关于数学课程的**建议**。","c":"write to sb. for advice 写信给某人征求建议；expert advice 专家意见"},
21163:{"w":"attitude","e":"We've been looking at the attitudes of various social and cultural groups towards the management of their personal finances.","t":"我们一直关注不同的社会和文化群体对个人理财的**看法**。","c":"attitude to/towards 对…的态度"},
21164:{"w":"deliver","e":"The President delivered a televised speech to the whole nation on October 1st.","t":"总统在10月1日向全国**发表**了电视讲话。","r":"联想记忆：de（使…）+liver（看作liber，自由）→使自由→释放","c":"deliver a speech 发表演讲；deliver a judgement 作出判决","d":"delivery（n. 投递，送交）"},
21165:{"w":"course","e":"You can sign up for this training course in advance.","t":"你可以提前报名参加这门培训**课程**。","c":"in the course of 在…过程中，在…期间；of course 当然，自然，无疑；beginning courses 初级课程；basic courses 基础课程；course code 课程编号"},
21166:{"w":"match","e":"Why do people spend their money on a football match?","t":"为什么人们会花钱看足球**赛**呢？","c":"football match 足球赛；man of the match（比赛中的）本场最佳球员；home match 主场比赛；away match 客场比赛；match against/with 与…比赛","d":"matchless（adj. 无比的，无敌的）"},
21167:{"w":"employ","e":"Actually, the person did not do the work himself but rather asked a young Scotsman in his employ to design the system.","t":"实际上那个人没有亲自做这项工作，而是**雇**了一个苏格兰年轻人来设计该系统。","d":"employee（n. 职员，雇员）；employer（n. 雇主）；employment（n. 雇用）；employable（adj. 可利用的）"},
21168:{"w":"pedal","e":"The riders pedaled fast along the rocky road.","t":"车手们在崎岖的路上飞快地**骑着脚踏车**。","r":"词根记忆：ped（脚）+al（表物）→脚踏的东西→踏板"},
21169:{"w":"resident","e":"It's completely free as long as you're a resident here.","t":"只要你是这里的**住户**，就可以完全免费（享受这项服务）。","d":"residence（n. 住处；居住）"},
21170:{"w":"optometrist","e":"Students will have a chance to ask optometrists any questions at the end of the lecture.","t":"讲座结束时，学生们将有机会向**验光师**提问。","r":"词根记忆：opto（=opt，视力）+metr（=meter，测量）+ist（表人）→验光师"},
21171:{"w":"degrade","e":"You should not degrade yourself by telling such a lie.","t":"你不该说这样的谎话来**降低**自己的人格。","r":"联想记忆：de（向下）+grade（级别）→降低级别→降级","d":"degradation（n. 退化，恶化）","y":"demote（vt. 使降级，使降职）；decompose（v. 分解）；abase（vt. 降低）"},
21172:{"w":"particle","e":"This type of smoke contains more, smaller particles and is therefore more likely to be deposited deep in the lungs.","t":"这种烟含有更多更小的**颗粒**，因此更可能沉淀到肺部深处。","r":"联想记忆：part（部分）+icle（看作article，物品）→物品的一部分→极少量"},
21173:{"w":"transport","e":"Better integration of transport systems is highly desirable and made more feasible by modern computers.","t":"人们迫切要求**运输**系统进一步一体化，而现代计算机使这一要求更易实现。","r":"词根记忆：trans（转移）+port（运）→从一地搬到一地→运输，运送","c":"on/by public transport 乘坐公共交通工具；transport costs 运费；free transport 免费交通","d":"transportation（n. 运输；客运）"},
21174:{"w":"prepare","e":"We need two more weeks to prepare the assignment because we have had difficulty obtaining the reference books.","t":"我们还需要两周时间来**准备**作业，因为我们在收集参考书方面遇到了困难。","r":"词根记忆：pre（预先）+par（准备）+e→准备，预备","c":"be prepared for 为…做准备，准备好"},
21175:{"w":"registration","e":"There is a strict management in the registration of a child's birth.","t":"对新生儿的**登记**进行严格管理。"},
21176:{"w":"gorge","e":"After a long journey, he started to gorge himself on cream cakes.","t":"走了很长一段路后，他开始**拼命吃**奶油蛋糕。"},
21177:{"w":"chaos","e":"The house was in chaos after the Christmas party.","t":"圣诞晚会过后，房间**一片狼藉**。","r":"发音记忆：chao（拼音“吵”）+s（音似：死）→吵死啦！→混乱","c":"molecular chaos 分子混沌，分子混沌态","d":"chaotic（adj. 混乱的，无秩序的）"},
21178:{"w":"recreational","e":"Sports facilities are set aside in the corner for the community's recreational use.","t":"角落里设置了运动器材，以供社区居民**娱乐**之用。"},
21179:{"w":"systematic","e":"Experts in chemistry are trying to find a systematic way to destroy the organization.","t":"化学方面的专家正致力于找出**系统**的方法去摧毁该组织。","r":"来自system（n. 系统）"},
21180:{"w":"subtropical","e":"The storm is now retrograding to the southeast, into subtropical latitudes.","t":"暴风雨正在向东南方退去，进入**亚热带**地区。","c":"subtropical climate 亚热带气候"},
21181:{"w":"detract","e":"These buildings were stripped of unnecessary decoration that would detract from their primary purpose.","t":"这些大楼已经去掉了会**削弱**其主要功能的多余装饰。","r":"词根记忆：de（向下）+tract（拉）→向下拉→去掉，减损"},
21182:{"w":"seal","e":"Please seal the envelope and stick an eight-cent stamp on it.","t":"请**封好**信封并贴上一张8分邮票。","r":"联想记忆：sea（海洋）+l（看作love，爱）→海水也不会冲走爱的印迹→印，图章"},
21183:{"w":"depress","e":"The recession has depressed the housing market.","t":"经济衰退导致住房市场**不景气**。","r":"联想记忆：de（向下）+press（挤压）→情绪向下挤压→使沮丧","d":"depression（n. 消沉；萧条）"},
21184:{"w":"scarce","e":"Many natural materials are becoming scarce.","t":"许多天然原料濒临**枯竭**。","r":"联想记忆：scar（伤疤）+ce→有伤疤→美中不足→不足的","c":"scarce metals 稀有金属"},
21185:{"w":"evidence","e":"As an international student you will need to provide evidence that you can fund yourself for however long your course lasts.","t":"作为国际学生，你需要提供**证据**，证明无论课程持续多长时间你都有足够的资金维持学业。","r":"词根记忆：e+vid（看）+ence→所看见的人或物→根据，证据","c":"a piece of evidence 一项证据；in evidence 明显地"},
21186:{"w":"besides","e":"Besides turning floral nectar into honey, these hardworking insects also pollinate crops for farmers.","t":"**除了**将花蜜酿成蜂蜜，这些辛勤的昆虫还给农民的庄稼授粉。"},
21187:{"w":"waterproof","e":"The waterproof match can still work after eight hours in water.","t":"**防水**火柴放在水里八小时后仍能使用。","r":"组合词：water（水）+proof（防…的）→防水的","c":"waterproof fabric 防水布，防雨布"},
21188:{"w":"exclusive","e":"He is part of an exclusive social circle.","t":"他所属的社交圈子很**排外**。"},
21189:{"w":"majority","e":"This treatment is not available in the vast majority of hospitals.","t":"绝**大部分**医院都不提供这种治疗。"},
21190:{"w":"despite","e":"Los Angeles suffers from chronic highway blockages, despite efforts to encourage people to use public transport.","t":"**尽管**当局积极鼓励人们使用公共交通工具，洛杉矶仍然长期存在公路拥堵现象。","c":"despite oneself 尽管（自己）不愿意，不由自主地"},
21191:{"w":"dissolve","e":"None of the forms of carbon dissolves in ordinary solvents, although melted iron does dissolve carbon to a certain extent.","t":"任何状态的碳都不**溶于**普通溶剂，但能在一定程度上溶于铁水。","r":"联想记忆：dis（分开）+solve（解决）→分开解决→溶解；解散，解除","c":"dissolve in 溶解于…"},
21192:{"w":"release","e":"The thief was released on bail.","t":"窃贼交了保释金后**获释**。","c":"release news 发布新闻"},
21193:{"w":"deploy","e":"Resources must be fully deployed to bring about vigorous development in agriculture.","t":"必须充分**利用**资源，以大力发展农业。","r":"联想记忆：de（表加强）+ploy（策略）→运用策略→使用，运用"},
21194:{"w":"original","e":"Their original house was converted into a residential college.","t":"他们**最初**的房子被改建成了一所寄宿学校。","c":"original handwriting 真迹；an original viewpoint 一个全新观点；original play 原创剧"},
21195:{"w":"branch","e":"You may pay your account at branches of the Federal Bank.","t":"你可以在联邦银行的**分行**支付款项。","c":"main branch 主枝；主分支；local branch 本地分店"},
21196:{"w":"chancellor","e":"Harold was the first chancellor of our university.","t":"哈罗德是我们大学的第一任**校长**。","r":"联想记忆：chance（运气）+llor→实力强，运气好，当上了校长→校长"},
21197:{"w":"vertical","e":"The climber managed to find a support on the vertical cliff.","t":"登山者成功地在**陡直**的峭壁上找到了一个支撑点。","c":"vertical line 垂直线"},
21198:{"w":"herbivore","e":"Ground-dwelling herbivores may return within a decade to this area.","t":"地栖**食草动物**可能会在十年内返回这一地区。","r":"词根记忆：herb（草）+i+vor（吃）+e→食草动物"},
21199:{"w":"flat","e":"Flat shoes may cure your back pain.","t":"穿**平底**鞋能治疗背部疼痛。","r":"联想记忆：菜不放盐（salt）味道平平（flat）"},
21200:{"w":"occasionally","e":"In social circumstances, dress has often been used as a role sign to indicate the nature and occasionally the social status of people.","t":"在社交场合下，服饰常常被用作一种角色标记，用来展现个性，**偶尔**也用来显示人的社会地位。"},
21201:{"w":"accommodation","e":"If you are booking accommodation through the school, your course and accommodation deposit will be $200.","t":"如果你通过学校预订**食宿**，你的课程和膳宿押金是200美元。","r":"联想记忆：ac+commod（看作common，普通的）+ation（表状态）→再普通的人都需要住处→住处，膳宿","c":"student accommodation 学生宿舍；accommodation facilities住宿设施"},
21202:{"w":"static","e":"Some people get static in their hair.","t":"有些人的头发会产生**静电**。","r":"词根记忆：stat（站）+ic（…的）→站着不动的→静止的","c":"static electricity 静电；静位觉"},
21203:{"w":"section","e":"Here is the non-smoking section.","t":"这里是禁烟**区**。","r":"词根记忆：sect（切）+ion→从整体切割出来的→部分；部门"},
21204:{"w":"scale","e":"In a recent research, the tropical forest has been depicted as ecologically unfit for large-scale human occupation.","t":"最近的一项调查显示，从生态学角度来看，人们认为热带森林不适合大**规模**人群居住。","c":"on a large scale 大规模地；in scale 成比例，相称；out of scale 不成比例，不相称；scale down 缩小，减少"},
21205:{"w":"constantly","e":"Atlas's teaching methodology is constantly revised as more is discovered about the process of learning a new language.","t":"随着新语言学习过程中有了更多的发现，阿特拉斯的教学法**不断**得以改进。"},
21206:{"w":"ailment","e":"New medical technology will cure more ailments that afflict humanity.","t":"新的医学技术可以治愈更多困扰人类的**疾病**。","r":"联想记忆：a（一个）+il（看作ill，生病的）+ment（表结果）→疾病"},
21207:{"w":"adhere","e":"Our firm has a set of standards which adhere to international requirements.","t":"我们公司拥有一套**符合**国际要求的标准。","r":"词根记忆：ad（表加强）+her（黏附）+e→黏附；遵守","c":"adhere to 坚持；黏附；遵守"},
21208:{"w":"extracurricular","e":"What role do you think extracurricular activities play in education?","t":"你认为**课外**活动在教育中起着怎样的作用？","r":"组合词：extra（额外的）+curricular（课程的）→课外的"},
21209:{"w":"propel","e":"This does not mean that it was immediately used to propel rockets.","t":"这并不意味着它立即就被用来**推进**火箭。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+pel（推）→推进","y":"stimulate（vt. 刺激，激励）；impel（vt. 驱使；推进）"},
21210:{"w":"posture","e":"Back pains can be the result of a bad posture.","t":"背部疼痛可能是不良**姿势**造成的。","r":"词根记忆：post（放）+ure（表名词）→摆放的动作→姿势","c":"a comfortable/relaxed posture 舒适的/轻松的姿势；adopt an aggressive posture on... 对…采取强硬的态度"},
21211:{"w":"overseas","e":"Overseas students may enrol for a course at the college from their home country.","t":"**留学**生可以在本国报名学习大学的课程。","r":"组合词：over（越过）+seas（海）→漂洋过海→海外（的）"},
21212:{"w":"industrialise","e":"These projects are part of a larger plan to industrialise northeastern Iceland.","t":"这些项目只是冰岛东北部**工业化**更大计划中的一部分。","d":"industrialisation（n. 工业化，产业化）"},
21213:{"w":"empire","e":"Isaac's epic stories charted the future of the galactic empire.","t":"伊萨克的史诗故事描绘出了那个超级**帝国**的未来。","r":"联想记忆：一个帝国（empire）需要一个贤明的君主（emperor）"},
21214:{"w":"mechanic","e":"The article gave the readers a summary of the life of a mechanic.","t":"这篇文章向读者简略介绍了一个**机修工**的生活。","r":"词根记忆：mech（机器）+an+ic（表人）→机修工"},
21215:{"w":"fracture","e":"Fractures on tools indicate that a majority of ancient people were right-handed.","t":"从工具上的**裂痕**我们可以看出，大多数古人都是惯用右手的。","r":"词根记忆：fract（打碎）+ure（表状态）→断裂","c":"compound fracture 开放性骨折","y":"crack〔v.（使）破裂；（使）发出爆裂声 n. 裂缝；爆裂声〕；split〔v.（使）分裂，分离 n. 裂口〕"},
21216:{"w":"plummet","e":"However, when a major fast-food company then made the same demands after customer purchases of its hamburgers plummeted, the meat industry complied within weeks.","t":"然而，当一家大型快餐公司在其汉堡包销量**直线下降**后提出了相同的要求时，肉类行业在几周内就遵守了规定。","r":"联想记忆：李子（plum）熟了会垂直落下（plummet）"},
21217:{"w":"glacial","e":"These giant stones are part of an ancient glacial deposit.","t":"这些巨石是古**冰川**沉积物的一部分。","r":"词根记忆：glaci（冰）+al（…的）→冰期的","c":"the glacial period 冰期"},
21218:{"w":"dock","e":"There are a number of historic ships docked in the harbour.","t":"港口**停泊**着很多具有历史价值的船只。"},
21219:{"w":"argument","e":"Support your argument with examples and relevant evidence, please.","t":"请用实例和相关证据来支持你的**论点**。"},
21220:{"w":"chase","e":"The babysitter chased the kids around the yard.","t":"照看孩子的人**追着**孩子满院子地跑。","r":"联想记忆：谁动了我的奶酪（cheese），我就去追赶（chase）谁","c":"chase after 追赶，追逐；追求"},
21221:{"w":"brochure","e":"Please inform us of your trade terms and forward samples and a product brochure.","t":"请告知贵方的交易条款，并寄来货样及产品**小册子**。","r":"发音记忆：“不用求”→有了说明书小册子，就不用求别人了→小册子"},
21222:{"w":"convince","e":"That man tries to convince the employer that any shortcomings he has will not prevent him from doing a good job.","t":"那个男人努力让雇主**相信**，他身上的任何缺点都不会妨碍他做好工作。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+vinc（征服）+e→彻底征服对方→说服","c":"convince sb. to do sth. 说服某人做某事；be convinced of 确信，承认；be convinced that 确信，承认；convince sb. of 使某人承认，使某人信服","d":"unconvinced（adj. 不信服的；不确定的）"},
21223:{"w":"teem","e":"To create new colonies, a healthy hive, teeming with bees, can be separated into two boxes.","t":"为了培育新的蜂群，可以将一个**装满**蜜蜂的健康蜂箱分成两个。","r":"联想记忆：和team（n. 群，队）一起记"},
21224:{"w":"confront","e":"Growth and environmentalism can actually go hand in hand, if politicians have the courage to confront the vested interest that subsidies create.","t":"如果政客们有勇气**面对**财政补助所产生的既得利益，那么经济增长和环境保护实际上可以共同发展。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+front（前额）→面对面→遭遇；面对","c":"confront with 遭遇；面对；be confronted with 面临"},
21225:{"w":"exhibition","e":"The woman's exhibition met with great opposition from Parliament.","t":"女性作品**展览会**遭遇了国会的强烈反对。","c":"education exhibition 教育展"},
21226:{"w":"whereas","e":"Some of the studies show positive results, whereas others do not.","t":"一些研究结果令人满意，其他**则**不然。"},
21227:{"w":"additional","e":"In recent years a number of additional countries have subscribed to the Ottawa Charter.","t":"近几年，**另有**许多国家同意加入《渥太华宪章》。","c":"additional charges 附加费用；additional outlay 额外开支；additional cost 额外费用，新增成本"},
21228:{"w":"overlapping","e":"The two girls of overlapping interests went shopping together.","t":"两个兴趣**有交集**的女孩一起去购物了。"},
21229:{"w":"poultry","e":"The poultry farmers keep ducks as well as chickens.","t":"这些**家禽**养殖户既饲养鸭子也养鸡。","r":"词根记忆：poult（幼禽）+ry（表集合名词）→家禽；禽肉"},
21230:{"w":"pregnancy","e":"They are especially vulnerable because of pregnancy but also because of osteoporosis, which I personally believe to be the major cause of the problem for women.","t":"她们的身体特别容易变得脆弱，一方面是因为**怀孕**，一方面是因为骨质疏松，我个人认为后者是导致这一问题的主要原因。","r":"来自pregnant（adj. 怀孕的）"},
21231:{"w":"confirmation","e":"Hundreds of students are waiting for confirmation of the test results.","t":"数百名学生都在等待着**确认**考试成绩。"},
21232:{"w":"unquote","e":"The President unquoted his quotation with \"have a nice day here\".","t":"总统先生通过“祝你们在这里玩得愉快”来**结束**他的引语。"},
21233:{"w":"embezzlement","e":"The three criminals are arrested for embezzlement of company funds.","t":"这三名罪犯因为**盗用**公司资金而被逮捕。","r":"联想记忆：em+bezzle（看作bezant，金银币）+ment→将金银币据为己有→贪污，盗用"},
21234:{"w":"acrobatic","e":"Jane used to be an acrobatic dancer but three years ago, she started to learn fencing.","t":"简曾经是一名**杂技**舞蹈演员，但是三年前她开始学习击剑。"},
21235:{"w":"numerous","e":"Numerous overseas visitors have come to see how the program works.","t":"**众多**海外游客到这里来观看这个项目是如何运作的。","r":"词根记忆：numer（数）+ous（…的）→数目众多的→众多的"},
21236:{"w":"balcony","e":"From your cabin balcony you'll find that you cannot see anyone else and the only sound you should hear is the birds' singing.","t":"从你小屋的**阳台**看不到任何人，听到的只有鸟鸣。","r":"发音记忆：“白给你”→阳台上的东西都“白给你”→阳台"},
21237:{"w":"postgraduate","e":"I've got a place in a Postgraduate Certificate in Education course starting in September.","t":"我已经参加了9月份开学的教育学**研究生**文凭课程。","c":"postgraduate student 研究生"},
21238:{"w":"well-being","e":"They stated, \"health is a complete state of physical, mental and social well-being and is not merely the absence of disease.\"","t":"他们声称，“健康是集生理、精神和社会**安宁**为一体的完整状态，而不仅仅是不生病。”","r":"组合词：well（好，健康）+being（存在）→安宁；康乐"},
21239:{"w":"prime","e":"He's a prime candidate to captain the team this season.","t":"他是本赛季队长的**最佳**人选。","r":"词根记忆：prim（第一）+e→首要的；最好的"},
21240:{"w":"settle","e":"They are offspring of the first Europeans who settled in China.","t":"他们是最早在中国**定居**的欧洲人的后裔。","r":"联想记忆：set（放置）+tle→放置在一个地方就好像定居了下来→定居，安家","c":"settle down 定居，过安定的生活","d":"settler（n. 移民，殖民者）；settlement（n. 解决；协议；定居点）"},
21241:{"w":"fallow","e":"Overuse of fertilisers may cause farmers to stop rotating crops or leave their land fallow.","t":"过度使用肥料可能会导致农民停止农作物的轮作或让土地**休耕**。","r":"联想记忆：几个伙伴（fellow）一起在休耕的（fallow）田地上玩耍"},
21242:{"w":"troupe","e":"A troupe of dancers from Italy is one of the leading attractions in the festival.","t":"一支来自意大利的舞蹈**队**在节日里最引人注目。","r":"联想记忆：部队（troop）里的一群（group）人组建了一个剧团（troupe）"},
21243:{"w":"premise","e":"His agreement of this investment is based on the premise that all people equally share the risk.","t":"基于所有人平均分担风险的**前提**，他同意了该项投资。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+mis（放）+e→放在前面的东西→前提","c":"the major premise 主要前提","y":"hypothesis（n. 假设）"},
21244:{"w":"discerning","e":"Only the discerning customers can recognize this jade decoration as a high quality product.","t":"只有**眼光敏锐**的顾客才能识别出这件玉饰是高品质产品。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分离）+cern（区别）+ing→能分清楚的→有识别力的"},
21245:{"w":"niggle","e":"Tina wears a frown these days; there must be something niggling her.","t":"蒂娜这些天眉头紧锁，一定是有什么事**困扰**着她。"},
21246:{"w":"prospectus","e":"I picked up a really detailed prospectus for Tom.","t":"我为汤姆挑选了一本内容相当详尽的**说明书**。"},
21247:{"w":"liaise","e":"He had the right to liaise directly with the police while writing the report.","t":"他在写报告的过程中，有权直接与警方**联系**。"},
21248:{"w":"excavation","e":"The new excavations are open to the public this weekend in Shanxi Museum.","t":"新**出土的文物**将于本周末在山西博物馆对公众开放展览。"},
21249:{"w":"continental","e":"The company grew rapidly and has been providing holidays in continental Europe for the last fifteen years.","t":"公司发展迅速，在过去15年里一直为员工提供去欧洲**大陆**度假的机会。"},
21250:{"w":"modernism","e":"Many architects contributed to the development of modernism in the first half of last century.","t":"上世纪上半叶，许多建筑师都为**现代主义**的发展做出了贡献。","d":"modernist（n. 现代主义者，现代人）"},
21251:{"w":"artery","e":"The patient underwent an operation to unblock his coronary artery.","t":"这位病人接受了一次冠状**动脉**疏通手术。","r":"联想记忆：和vein（n. 静脉）一起记"},
21252:{"w":"premium","e":"The coffee we're drinking is premium.","t":"我们喝的是**特级**咖啡。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+m（=em，拿取）+ium（表名词）→提前拿取的东西→保险费","c":"at a premium 稀少"},
21253:{"w":"glamor","e":"Traveling abroad can offer you an opportunity to enjoy the glamor of other countries.","t":"出国旅游能为你提供一个领略异国**风情**的机会。","r":"联想记忆：g+lamor（看作labor，劳动）→劳动人民最有魅力→魅力"},
21254:{"w":"barbecue","e":"Membership gives wide access to activities like basketball and football as well as barbecues and other social functions.","t":"会员可以参加各种活动，诸如打篮球、踢足球、**烧烤**以及其他社交集会。"},
21255:{"w":"material","e":"Glass is the great building material of the future.","t":"玻璃是未来重要的建筑**材料**。"},
21256:{"w":"adapt","e":"All those older buildings in the city have been adapted for present-day use.","t":"城里的旧建筑已经全部经过**改造**，以作今日之用。","r":"词根记忆：ad（表加强）+apt（适应）→使适合；适应","c":"adapt to 适应…；adapt from 根据…改编","d":"adaptable（adj. 能适应的；可修改的）"},
21257:{"w":"gullibly","e":"The tourist finds pleasure in landscapes and gullibly enjoys pseudo-events.","t":"游客从欣赏风景中得到快乐，并且**轻信地**享受模拟活动所带来的乐趣。","r":"来自gullible（adj. 易受骗的）"},
21258:{"w":"sift","e":"We sift through the information carefully to find a clue that will help us.","t":"我们仔细**研究**资料以便找出对我们有帮助的线索。","r":"联想记忆：坐（sit）下来慢慢筛（sift）面粉"},
21259:{"w":"succession","e":"She has won the award for the third year in succession.","t":"这是她**连续**第三年获得此奖项。","r":"词根记忆：suc（下）+cess（行走）+ion→在下面走→连续"},
21260:{"w":"spark","e":"In the Stone Age, tool-makers discovered that chipping flints produced sparks.","t":"在石器时代，工匠们发现敲凿燧石能产生**火花**。","r":"联想记忆：s+park（公园）→公园里燃起火花→火花"},
21261:{"w":"sympathy","e":"This seeming sympathy didn't soothe her distress.","t":"这种表面上的**同情**并不能减轻她的悲痛。","r":"词根记忆：sym（共同）+pathy（感情）→共同的感情→同情"},
21262:{"w":"chill","e":"The group asks for a specially designed camping cool box, which will keep food and drinks chilled.","t":"这个团体在寻求一种设计独特的野营冷藏箱，用以**冷藏**食物和饮料。","r":"联想记忆：c+hill（小山）→山上→高处不胜寒→寒冷"},
21263:{"w":"multinational","e":"When you think of any organization, a family business or a multinational company, they are all fundamentally a group of people working together.","t":"当你想到任何组织、家族企业或**跨国**公司时，从根本上来说他们都是一群在一起工作的人。"},
21264:{"w":"exposure","e":"On the positive side, exposure to such diversity helps encourage creativity which is generally an asset to a company.","t":"从积极的一面来看，**接触**这样的多样性有助于激发创造性，这对公司来说通常都是一笔财富。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+pos（放）+ure→放出来→暴露；显露"},
21265:{"w":"fierce","e":"There is fierce competition in the examination.","t":"考试竞争非常**激烈**。","r":"发音记忆：“飞蛾死”→凶猛的飞蛾扑火而死→凶猛的","c":"fierce loyalty 极度的忠诚"},
21266:{"w":"crime","e":"Without the death penalty our lives are less secure and violent crime will increase.","t":"如果没有死刑，我们的生命会更不安全，暴力**犯罪**活动也将增加。","r":"词根记忆：crim（罪行）+e→罪行；犯罪","c":"campus crime 校园犯罪；crime rate 犯罪率；commit a crime犯罪"},
21267:{"w":"constitute","e":"The lid constitutes twenty-five percent of the can's total weight.","t":"盖子**占**罐子总重的25％。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+stitut（建立）+e→一起建立→设立"},
21268:{"w":"deceive","e":"Mary deceived the interviewer about her past experience.","t":"玛丽在自己的过去经历上对面试官**撒了谎**。","r":"词根记忆：de（非）+ceive（拿）→不拿来→欺骗，蒙骗","c":"deceive oneself 欺骗自己；deceive sb. into doing sth. 骗某人做某事","d":"deceptive（adj. 迷惑的；虚伪的）"},
21269:{"w":"haul","e":"Every spring a beekeeper may move up to flowering fields and haul the hives back to where he starts out in winter.","t":"每年春天，养蜂人都会迁往花地，冬天再将蜂箱**搬运**回来。","r":"联想记忆：他们忙着往礼堂（hall）里搬（haul）东西"},
21270:{"w":"emission","e":"The new fuel can save energy and cut carbon dioxide emissions.","t":"新型燃料可以节约能源，降低二氧化碳的**排放量**。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+miss（送）+ion→送出→（光、热等的）散发","c":"greenhouse gas emission 温室气体排放；zero-emission car 零排放车辆"},
21271:{"w":"procession","e":"The soldiers lined the route of the procession.","t":"士兵们沿**游行**的道路排成一列。","r":"联想记忆：队伍（procession）在行军的过程（process）中遭遇暴风雪"},
21272:{"w":"bistro","e":"The Geneva Bistro is always a popular place in this area.","t":"这家杜松子**酒馆**在这一带很受欢迎。"},
21273:{"w":"crash","e":"The two cars crashed into each other.","t":"两辆汽车猛烈**相撞**。","r":"联想记忆：卡车撞上（crash）路边的一堆垃圾（trash）","c":"crash into 闯入；碰撞"},
21274:{"w":"workforce","e":"The rise in the female workforce in the European Community is a positive trend.","t":"欧共体中女性**劳动人口**的增加是一个积极的趋势。","r":"组合词：work（工作）+force（队伍）→劳动人口"},
21275:{"w":"surpass","e":"His success has surpassed all expectations.","t":"他所取得的成功远远**超过**了预期。","r":"联想记忆：sur+pass（通过）→在上面通过→超过","y":"exceed（vt. 超越，胜过）；surmount（vt. 超越，战胜）"},
21276:{"w":"sociology","e":"In the first semester you'll be taking four subjects: psychology, sociology, history and economics.","t":"第一学期你将学习四门课：心理学、**社会学**、历史学和经济学。","r":"词根记忆：soci（社会）+ology（…学）→社会学"},
21277:{"w":"violent","e":"Although news broadcasts are violent, people felt they shouldn't be banned.","t":"虽然新闻广播言辞**激烈**，但人们还是觉得不应该将其取消。"},
21278:{"w":"frock","e":"WSPU members wear their official uniforms of a white frock decorated with purple, yellow and green accessories.","t":"妇女社会与政治同盟的成员穿着白色的官方制服**裙**，上面配有紫、黄、绿三色配饰。"},
21279:{"w":"epidemic","e":"The government declared that no major epidemic diseases prevailed in this area.","t":"政府宣布该地区没有流行重大的**传染性**疾病。","r":"词根记忆：epi（在…中间）+dem（人民）+ic（…的）→在人民之中的→流行性的","y":"contagious（adj. 传染性的，会感染的）；prevalent（adj.流行的）"},
21280:{"w":"grab","e":"Promotions in the store stand out and grab our attention.","t":"商店里的促销广告非常显眼，**吸引**了我们的视线。","r":"联想记忆：螃蟹（crab）用钳子抓（grab）人","c":"grab at/for sth. 抓住/夺得某物；up for grabs 可供争夺的"},
21281:{"w":"appliance","e":"On Wednesdays, I repair electrical appliances free of charge.","t":"每逢周三，我都给人免费修理**电器**。","r":"联想记忆：appli（看作apply，运用）+ance→可用的东西→用具，器具","c":"household appliances 家用器具"},
21282:{"w":"facility","e":"There are facilities for high-energy particle experiments in our research centre.","t":"我们的研究中心有高能粒子实验**设备**。","r":"词根记忆：fac（做）+ility→辅助人们做事的东西→设备，设施","c":"communication facilities 通信设施"},
21283:{"w":"consolation","e":"The results of this research may be a great consolation to left-handers.","t":"这项研究的结果对惯用左手者来说可能是个极大的**安慰**。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+sol（太阳）+ation（表行为）→带来阳光→安慰；慰问","c":"consolation prize 安慰奖"},
21284:{"w":"unravel","e":"New research is now unravelling the ways in which bacteria aid digestion, regulate our immune systems, eliminate toxins, produce vitamins, affect our behaviour and even combat obesity.","t":"如今新的研究**解释**了细菌是如何帮助消化、调节我们的免疫系统、排除毒素、产生维生素、影响我们的行为，甚至对抗肥胖的。","r":"联想记忆：un（解开）+ravel（纠缠）→解开纠缠→弄清楚→阐明"},
21285:{"w":"texture","e":"This kind of meat has a similar taste and texture to beef.","t":"这种肉的味道和**口感**与牛肉类似。","r":"词根记忆：text（编织）+ure→质地，纹理"},
21286:{"w":"assumption","e":"The assumption has been shown to be incorrect by recent research.","t":"最近的研究证明这一**假设**不正确。"},
21287:{"w":"dissatisfied","e":"They were dissatisfied with the treatment of animals at the London Zoo.","t":"他们对伦敦动物园对待动物的方式表示**不满**。"},
21288:{"w":"simultaneous","e":"Any ceasefire would be simultaneous with the withdrawal of troops.","t":"任何一次的停火都是与撤军**同时发生**的。","r":"词根记忆：simult（一样）+aneous（有…特征的）→（时间）相同的→同时发生的","y":"coinstantaneous（adj. 同时发生的，同时的）"},
21289:{"w":"sundial","e":"Moonlight was frosting the dew, and an old sundial threw a long shadow.","t":"月光把露水照得雪白，一座旧**日晷**投出一道长长的影子。"},
21290:{"w":"toxic","e":"Toxic chemicals were spilled from the factory into the river.","t":"**有毒**的化学物从工厂排放到河里。","d":"toxicity（n. 毒性）","y":"poisonous（adj. 有毒的）；noxious（adj. 有害的，有毒的）"},
21291:{"w":"utilise","e":"I guess the two main things to remember are to identify individual talent and then to utilise it.","t":"我想需要记住的两个主要内容是确认个人天赋，然后再加以**利用**。","r":"词根记忆：util（用）+ise（使…）→利用","d":"utilisation（n. 利用）"},
21292:{"w":"conformity","e":"One of the most important tasks of managers is to consider the needs of the individual on one hand and group cooperation and conformity on the other.","t":"管理者最重要的任务之一是在考虑个人需求的同时还要兼顾团队的合作和**一致性**。"},
21293:{"w":"overrate","e":"Do you think that team player is overrated?","t":"你认为那个队员被**高估**了吗？","r":"组合词：over（超越）+rate（估价）→对…评价过高"},
21294:{"w":"dormant","e":"Mount St. Helens lay dormant for more than a century.","t":"圣海伦斯火山**休眠**了一个多世纪。","c":"dormant volcano 休眠火山；lie dormant 潜伏着"},
21295:{"w":"displace","e":"Each year rain and flooding displace millions of people and result in thousands of deaths.","t":"每年，暴雨和洪水不仅使数百万人**背井离乡**，还会导致数千人丧生。","r":"联想记忆：dis（离开）+place（位置）→使从位置上离开→取代"},
21296:{"w":"embrace","e":"The students tearfully embraced each other on their last day of school.","t":"在校的最后一天，学生们流着泪相互**拥抱**。","r":"词根记忆：em（包围）+brace（臂）→被胳膊包围→拥抱"},
21297:{"w":"engrave","e":"Many researchers now think that these were pictures the wise men engraved of themselves.","t":"现在许多研究者认为这些图像是一些聪明人按自己的样子**刻**上去的。","r":"联想记忆：en+grave（坟墓）→进入坟墓也要记着，真是刻骨铭心→使铭记","c":"be engraved with one's name 刻着某人的名字"},
21298:{"w":"disrespectful","e":"Camping there on one's own may be disrespectful to the people of that culture, and certainly don't make fires, however romantic it may seem.","t":"在那里单独露营可能会**冒犯**当地人，而且不管看起来多浪漫，一定不能生火。"},
21299:{"w":"invade","e":"Portugal was invaded by the French in 1807.","t":"法国人在1807年**入侵**葡萄牙。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+vad（走）+e→未经允许走进来→侵犯，侵入","d":"invader（n. 侵略者）；invasion（n. 入侵，侵略）"},
21300:{"w":"arcade","e":"The most exciting place to visit is the new entertainment complex with a seven-screen cinema, bowling alley and video games arcade.","t":"最值得参观的地方是新娱乐中心，里面有一家配有七个放映厅的电影院，还设有保龄球馆和电子**游戏厅**。"},
21301:{"w":"commentary","e":"This bus company runs all its routes with a vivid commentary in English.","t":"这家公交公司给其各条运营线路都配有生动的英文**解说**。","r":"来自comment（v. 评论）"},
21302:{"w":"recreate","e":"Since very few people will ever experience the Antarctic first-hand, the visitor's centre aims to recreate the atmosphere of the Antarctic.","t":"由于很少有人能够亲自登上南极体验一把，因此游客中心旨在**再现**南极所特有的氛围。"},
21303:{"w":"mock","e":"There's a mock camp site where you can see inside an Antarctic tent and imagine yourself sleeping there.","t":"这里有一个**模拟**的露营地，你可以看到里面有一个南极帐篷，想象一下自己睡在里面的情景。"},
21304:{"w":"territory","e":"We must realize that Antarctic territory belongs to everyone.","t":"我们必须意识到南极的**领土**属于大家。","r":"词根记忆：terr（土地）+it+ory（表地点）→领土；领域","d":"territorial（adj. 领土的）"},
21305:{"w":"prohibit","e":"Smoking is prohibited on most occasions.","t":"大多数场合都**禁止**吸烟。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+hibit（拿）→在前面拿住→禁止，阻止","c":"prohibit sb. from doing sth. 阻止某人做某事","d":"prohibition（n. 禁令）；prohibitive（adj. 禁止的；贵得买不起的）"},
21306:{"w":"shipment","e":"Finally the honey is poured into barrels for shipment.","t":"最终蜂蜜被倒进桶里**运走**。","r":"联想记忆：ship（船运）+ment→装运","y":"cargo（n. 货物）；freight（n. 货物；重载）"},
21307:{"w":"calendar","e":"Their five-year-old son is able to use the calendar to count how many days until his birthday.","t":"他们五岁的儿子能用**日历**数出离他的生日还有多少天。"},
21308:{"w":"magic","e":"There's no real magic in the world.","t":"这世界上没有真正的**魔法**。","r":"联想记忆：mag（看作magnet，磁铁）+ic→像磁铁一样吸引人→魅力"},
21309:{"w":"slip","e":"Tom slipped on the ice and broke his leg.","t":"汤姆在冰上**滑了一跤**，摔断了腿。"},
21310:{"w":"shatter","e":"This event shattered all his previous ideas.","t":"这件事**粉碎**了他以前所有的想法。","r":"发音记忆：“筛它”→（使）破碎"},
21311:{"w":"truce","e":"A truce was declared to allow men to travel to the games in safety.","t":"（政府）宣布了**休战协定**以使人们安全地去参加比赛。","r":"联想记忆：休战协定（truce）确认了战败属实（true）"},
21312:{"w":"discount","e":"For those of you who are up and about early in the morning, we are introducing a 50 percent \"morning discount\" this year.","t":"今年，我们将为你们这些早起的人推出五折的“早间**折扣**”。","r":"联想记忆：dis（分离）+count（计算）→不计算在内的部分→折扣","c":"make a discount 打折；discount store 折扣商店；at a discount打折，不值钱；discount rates 贴现率"},
21313:{"w":"tough","e":"Kangaroo meat is darker in colour and tougher than that of rabbit.","t":"与兔肉相比，袋鼠肉颜色较深且肉质**较老**。","c":"a tough nut 难对付的人，与之打交道有危险的人"},
21314:{"w":"volunteer","e":"Mary volunteered to work as a teacher in West Africa.","t":"玛丽**自愿**去西非做一名教师。","c":"volunteers for Olympic Games 奥运会志愿者","d":"voluntary（adj. 自愿的，志愿的）"},
21315:{"w":"eruption","e":"Geologists forecasted that an eruption of the volcano would take place before the end of the century.","t":"地质学者预测，在本世纪结束之前该火山可能会**喷发**一次。","r":"来自erupt（v. 爆发；喷出）"},
21316:{"w":"pension","e":"Even hourly employees receive benefits—such as pension contributions and medical insurance—that are not tied to the number of hours they work.","t":"即使小时工也享受**养老金**和医疗保险等福利，但这些福利与他们工作的时长没有关系。","r":"词根记忆：pens（花费）+ion（表物）→养老金","c":"live on a pension 靠退休金/抚恤金生活"},
21317:{"w":"assignment","e":"Have you been given any writing assignments yet?","t":"有人给你布置写作**作业**了吗？","r":"来自assign（vt. 指派，分配）"},
21318:{"w":"assign","e":"In that country, more land is assigned to car use than to housing.","t":"那个国家的土地更多地被**指定**为停车之用，而不是建造住宅。","r":"联想记忆：as+sign（签名）→找那个明星签名的任务指派给你了→指派，分配","c":"assign sth. to sb. 给某人指派…"},
21319:{"w":"stainless","e":"It's made of stainless steel which is guaranteed for 50 years.","t":"它由**不锈**钢制成，确保可以使用50年。","r":"联想记忆：stain（污点）+less（没有）→无污点的；不锈的","c":"stainless steel 不锈钢"},
21320:{"w":"hallowed","e":"In ancient Greece, sports games were held on hallowed ground near Mount Olympus every four years.","t":"古希腊人每四年就要在奥林匹斯山附近的**圣**地举行运动会。","r":"联想记忆：hall（大厅）+ow+ed→放在大厅里供奉起来→神圣（化）的"},
21321:{"w":"terminal","e":"There is an ink jet printer attached to each terminal.","t":"每一个**终端**都连接有一台喷墨打印机。","r":"词根记忆：termin（界限）+al（…的）→末端的"},
21322:{"w":"climate","e":"Farmed ostriches don't need African climates.","t":"养殖鸵鸟并不要求一定有非洲的**气候**条件。"},
21323:{"w":"relevance","e":"I'm left-handed myself and I actually didn't see any relevance to my own life when I happened to start reading an article by a sports psychologist called Peter Matthews.","t":"我自己就是左撇子，当我碰巧开始读运动心理学家彼得·马修斯所写的一篇文章时，我实际上并未意识到这与自己的生活有何**联系**。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+lev（举起）+ance→被一再举起→相关性"},
21324:{"w":"reluctant","e":"Although most trainers know how important handedness is, at present they are rather reluctant to make use of the insights scientists like Matthews can give.","t":"尽管多数训练者知道用手习惯的重要性，但是目前他们仍然**不愿**采纳像马修斯这样的科学家的见解。","r":"发音记忆：“瑞拉忐忑”→不情愿的，勉强的"},
21325:{"w":"regularity","e":"Climate change is disrupting the regularity of the seasons.","t":"气候的变化打破季节的**规律性**。","r":"来自regular（adj. 有规律的）"},
21326:{"w":"laterality","e":"His team measured the hand, feet and eyes of 2,611 players and found that there were really three main types of laterality.","t":"他的团队对2,611名演奏者的手脚和眼睛进行了测量，发现真的有三种主要的**偏侧性**类型。"},
21327:{"w":"predominant","e":"Singers have a predominant role in this performance.","t":"歌手在这场表演中担任**主要**角色。","r":"联想记忆：pre（前）+dominant（统治的）→在前面统治的→支配的"},
21328:{"w":"trek","e":"We are organizing a ten-day holiday, from the sixteenth of November, with eight days actual walking, trekking in the Semira Mountains.","t":"我们计划组织一个为期十天的假期旅行，从11月16日开始，其中包括在赛米拉山进行八天的实地步行和**跋涉**。"},
21329:{"w":"daunt","e":"Now, the Semira Mountains are among the highest in the world but you mustn't be too daunted, we will mainly be trekking in the foothills only, although there will be spectacular views even in the foothills.","t":"如今，赛米拉山位于世界最高山脉之列，但你们不必太**胆怯**，我们基本上只在山麓徒步行走，但也能领略壮观的景色。","r":"联想记忆：d（看作devil，魔鬼）+aunt（姨妈）→姨妈被鬼故事吓倒了→使胆怯","d":"daunting（adj. 令人发怵的；使人气馁的）"},
21330:{"w":"itinerary","e":"I will be distributing leaflets at the end where you can find out more information, but just for the moment I'll outline the itinerary, the main high points of the holiday.","t":"最后，我会分发传单，你们可以从中了解更多的信息，但目前我要概述一下**旅行路线**，都是假期的热门景点。","r":"词根记忆：it（走）+iner+ary（表名词）→行走→旅行路线"},
21331:{"w":"acclimatise","e":"After a couple of days to acclimatise yourself, you'll start the trek on day three walking through the enormous Katiba Forest which will take the whole of the day.","t":"前两天让自己**适应环境**，第三天要开始徒步穿越巨大的卡蒂巴森林，这需要一整天的时间。"},
21332:{"w":"forthcoming","e":"This is the list of forthcoming books.","t":"这是**即将**出版的书籍目录。","r":"组合词：forth（往前）+coming（就要来的）→即将到来的"},
21333:{"w":"structure","e":"The biologist is giving a lecture on cellular structures.","t":"那位生物学家正在做一个有关细胞**结构**的讲座。","r":"词根记忆：struct（建造）+ure（表结果）→建筑物","c":"management structure 管理结构；economic structure 经济结"},
21334:{"w":"quantity","e":"This medicine will reduce the quantity of blood flowing through the body.","t":"这种药会减少体内的血流**量**。"},
21335:{"w":"integral","e":"This kind of beetle has become an integral part of the successful management of dairy farms in Australia over the past few decades.","t":"在过去的几十年里，这种甲虫已成为澳大利亚乳牛场成功管理所**必不可少**的一部分。","r":"词根记忆：integr（完整）+al（…的）→完整的，完备的","c":"integral number 整数","y":"essential（adj. 非常重要的）；basic（adj. 基本的，根本的）；fundamental（adj. 根本的，基础的）"},
21336:{"w":"intensive","e":"Intensive English classes are taught in four-week blocks throughout the year.","t":"**强化**英语班全年授课，四周为一期。","r":"来自intense（adj. 强烈的）","c":"intensive training 强化训练；intensive reading 精读"},
21337:{"w":"acknowledge","e":"Plagiarism is taking other people's work without acknowledging it, that is, without saying where it comes from.","t":"剽窃就是引用了人家的作品却不**承认**，即不注明出处。","r":"联想记忆：ac+know（知道）+ledge→大家都知道了，所以不得不承认→承认"},
21338:{"w":"liquor","e":"David got hooked on hard liquor.","t":"戴维喝**烈酒**成瘾。","r":"词根记忆：liqu（液体）+or→烈性酒"},
21339:{"w":"presence","e":"Elliot discovered the presence of five rings encircling the equator of Uranus.","t":"埃利奥特发现**存在**五个光环围绕着天王星赤道。","r":"联想记忆：pre（前）+senc（看作send，送）+e→送到前面→出席"},
21340:{"w":"develop","e":"When a country develops its technology, the traditional skills and ways of life die out.","t":"一个国家在**发展**技术的同时，会造成传统手工艺和原有生活方式的消亡。","d":"development（n. 发展）；undeveloped（adj. 欠发达的）；developing（adj. 发展中的）"},
21341:{"w":"blast","e":"The granite was blasted into boulders no bigger than two metres in diameter.","t":"花岗岩被**炸**成直径不超过两米的大石头。","r":"联想记忆：b+last（最后）→最后一声b→爆炸","c":"have a blast 玩得很开心；a blast of 一阵（风）；at full blast全力以赴地；最大音量地"},
21342:{"w":"greatly","e":"The process of growing bananas was greatly reduced with modern growing methods.","t":"现代种植技术**大大**缩短了香蕉的种植过程。"},
21343:{"w":"sporadically","e":"Rockets had been used sporadically for several hundred years.","t":"在过去的几百年间，火箭被人们**偶尔**使用。"},
21344:{"w":"imitate","e":"Children like to imitate adults.","t":"儿童喜欢**模仿**大人。","r":"词根记忆：imit（相像）+ate（做）→做得相像→模仿"},
21345:{"w":"constitution","e":"Many people are concerned that such an emphasis on humanity's genetic constitution may distort our sense of values.","t":"许多人担心，对人类基因**组成**如此重视可能会歪曲我们的价值观。"},
21346:{"w":"advocate","e":"Some architects advocated the use of masonry in the construction of skyscrapers.","t":"一些建筑师**提倡**采用石工技术建造摩天大楼。","r":"词根记忆：ad（表加强）+voc（叫喊）+ate→一再呼吁→提倡"},
21347:{"w":"maintenance","e":"The school pays for heating and the maintenance of the buildings.","t":"学校负担这些大楼的取暖和**维修**费用。","c":"the maintenance of an automobile 汽车的保养"},
21348:{"w":"spouse","e":"How your child adapts to your divorce is largely dependent on how you and your spouse act.","t":"你的孩子如何适应你的离婚主要取决于你和你**配偶**的行为举止。","r":"联想记忆：sp（看作spend，度过）+ouse（看作house，房子）→在同一间房子里共度人生的人→配偶","y":"mate（n. 配偶）"},
21349:{"w":"expedition","e":"I talked to Charles Owen, the leader of the expedition group, about the trip.","t":"我和**探险**队队长查尔斯·欧文谈了关于出行的事。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+ped（脚）+ition→出行","c":"on an expedition to 去…探险；go/start on an expedition 去远征（探险、考察）；a shopping expedition 外出购物"},
21350:{"w":"incendiary","e":"In the early nineteenth century the British began to experiment with incendiary barrage rockets.","t":"19世纪初，英国就开始试验**燃烧式**扫射火箭。","r":"词根记忆：in+cendi（=cend，发光）+ary（…的）→使燃烧发光→能引起燃烧的；煽动性的","c":"incendiary bomb 燃烧弹"},
21351:{"w":"expansion","e":"Even without further expansion the school could recruit around 2,000 students every year.","t":"即使没有进一步的**扩建**，学校每年仍可招收2,000名学生。","r":"来自expand（v. 扩大，扩张）"},
21352:{"w":"encase","e":"The resin oozed out of the tree and the spider or leaf became encased in it.","t":"树脂从树里渗出来，把蜘蛛或树叶**包**在了里面。","r":"联想记忆：en（进入）+case（容器）→被装入容器中→装入，包住","c":"encase sth. in sth. 将…装入…"},
21353:{"w":"invalid","e":"The judge declared Tom's marriage invalid.","t":"法官宣布汤姆的婚姻**无效**。","r":"词根记忆：in（无）+val（价值）+id（…的）→无价值的→无效的，作废的","c":"invalid characters 无效字符","y":"impotent（adj. 无效的，不起作用的）；unfounded（adj. 无事实根据的）"},
21354:{"w":"unbiased","e":"I wanted to get her unbiased comments on my article.","t":"我想要的是她对我的文章给出**不偏不倚**的评论。","r":"联想记忆：un（无）+biased（有偏见的）→没有偏见的，公正的","c":"unbiased opinions 没有偏见的想法"},
21355:{"w":"postpone","e":"The sports meet was finally postponed because of the bad weather.","t":"由于天气恶劣，运动会最终被**推迟**了。","r":"词根记忆：post（后）+pon（放）+e→放到后面→延迟，延期"},
21356:{"w":"skim","e":"My reading approach is to skim the book first to see what's important and what isn't. It saves hours.","t":"我的阅读方法是先**浏览**全书，看看什么是重点，什么不是，这样会节省很多时间。","r":"联想记忆：一眼掠过（skim），只见皮（skin）毛"},
21357:{"w":"preface","e":"I will not delay you by a long preface.","t":"我的**开场白**不会很长，免得耽误你们的时间。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+face（面）→（书）前边的脸→序言"},
21358:{"w":"retain","e":"The young lady retained her tennis title for the third year.","t":"那个年轻女孩第三年仍**保住**了网球冠军的头衔。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+tain（拿住）→重新拿回→保留；保持"},
21359:{"w":"culminate","e":"My arguments with my mum got worse and worse, and it all culminated in my deciding to give up school.","t":"我和妈妈的争吵越来越严重，最后以我决定辍学而**告终**。","r":"词根记忆：culmin（顶）+ate→达到顶点→（以某种结果）告终；（在某一点）结束","y":"end（v. 结束，终结）；terminate（v. 停止，结束）；top（vt. 达到顶端；结束）"},
21360:{"w":"robotic","e":"Thanks to all of you for coming along today to hear about how the robotic float project is helping with ocean research.","t":"感谢大家今天来听关于**机器人**浮筒工程是如何促进海洋研究的讲座。"},
21361:{"w":"profile","e":"The successful entrepreneur's career is profiled in this month's journal.","t":"这期月刊**概述**了这位成功企业家的工作生涯。","r":"词根记忆：pro（在前）+fil（线条）+e→前面的线条→侧面轮廓","c":"employee profile 雇员简介；keep a high/low profile 保持高/低姿态"},
21362:{"w":"salinity","e":"As the float rises to the surface it collects all sorts of data, most importantly variations in salinity.","t":"当浮筒上升到表面，就会收集各种数据，最重要的是**盐度**的变化。"},
21363:{"w":"aggravation","e":"Carrying heavy boxes can cause aggravation of prior back injuries.","t":"背部受伤时搬重物，会**加重**病情。","c":"leave in aggravation 愤怒地离开；a state of aggravation 愤怒的状态"},
21364:{"w":"incident","e":"The most common type of road rage incident involves personal violence.","t":"公路上因暴怒而发生的**事故**中，最常见的都与个人暴力有关。","d":"incidence（n. 事件；发生率）"},
21365:{"w":"previous","e":"Coffee became cheaper than it had been for the previous years.","t":"咖啡的价格比**前**些年低。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+vi（道路）+ous→更早上路的→以前的","c":"previous to 在…之前"},
21366:{"w":"spice","e":"Variety is the spice of life.","t":"多彩的生活才**有趣**。","r":"联想记忆：香料（spice）是辣的（spicy）"},
21367:{"w":"bore","e":"There is such a wide variety of cultures in this program that it is difficult to get bored.","t":"这次的节目中有很多关于不同文化的知识，因此不太容易使人感到**厌倦**。"},
21368:{"w":"lull","e":"In April a slight lull ensued, but the volcanologists remained pessimistic about this volcano.","t":"四月接着出现了短暂的**平静期**，但是火山学家对此并不乐观。"},
21369:{"w":"betray","e":"If you treat him as a friend, he will treat you well and will never betray you.","t":"如果你把他当作朋友，他就会对你很好而且绝对不会**背叛**你。","c":"betray oneself 原形毕露","y":"reveal（vt. 揭示；暴露）"},
21370:{"w":"underlying","e":"Our understanding of the underlying causes of El Nino events is being confirmed by float data.","t":"浮筒采集到的数据证实了我们对厄尔尼诺现象的**潜在**原因的了解。","r":"组合词：under（在…下）+lying（躺着的）→在下面躺着的→在下面的"},
21371:{"w":"dispiriting","e":"Sometimes even the most expensive hotel can seem empty and dispiriting.","t":"有时甚至最昂贵的酒店也会让人感觉空虚和**沮丧**。","r":"联想记忆：dis（没有）+spirit（精神）+ing→使人没精神的→令人沮丧的"},
21372:{"w":"opulent","e":"The research suggests that even the most opulent, luxurious hotels seem to have underestimated the most basic needs of their customers.","t":"调查显示，即使是最**华丽**、最奢侈的酒店似乎也低估了顾客最根本的需求。","r":"词根记忆：op（财富）+ulent（富有…的）→富裕的"},
21373:{"w":"plush","e":"They investigated the so-called boutique hotels in the heart of downtown business districts, stately mansions located in the depths of beautiful countryside, and plush hotels built at the edge of tropical beaches surrounded by palm trees and idyllic blue ocean.","t":"他们调查了位于城市中心商业区的所谓的精品酒店、坐落在美丽乡村深处的庄严的官邸，以及建在被棕榈树和田园般蓝色海洋环绕的热带沙滩边缘的**豪华**酒店。"},
21374:{"w":"dispense","e":"Those in the business travel industry maintain that these serviced apartments dispense with all the unwanted and expensive hotel services that business travellers don't want.","t":"那些商务旅行行业的人士认为这些服务式公寓**省去**了商务旅行者不需要的昂贵的酒店服务。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+pens（称重）+e→按重量分发→分配","c":"dispense with sb./sth 摒弃，不再使用"},
21375:{"w":"behalf","e":"He made an impassioned speech on behalf of his country.","t":"他**代表**他的国家发表了热情洋溢的演说。","c":"on one's behalf 代表；on behalf of 代表；为了"},
21376:{"w":"initial","e":"Interest will be charged after the initial 60-day interest-free period.","t":"过了**最初**60天的免息期后，就要开始收取利息了。","r":"词根记忆：init（开始）+ial（属于…的）→开始的","c":"the initial stage 初级阶段；initial offerings 原始股；initial payment 首付","d":"initially（adv. 最初，开始）"},
21377:{"w":"govern","e":"The discovery that language can be a barrier to communication is quickly made by all who travel, study, govern or sell.","t":"旅行者、学习者、**管理**人员或销售人员很快就会发现语言可能会成为他们交流的障碍。","d":"government（n. 政府）"},
21378:{"w":"mingle","e":"The waters of the two streams mingled to form one river.","t":"两股溪水**汇**成了一条河流。","r":"联想记忆：和single（adj. 单一的）一起记"},
21379:{"w":"charter","e":"There's the Ticket Shop, where you can get inexpensive charter flights.","t":"那是票务窗口，在那里你可以买到便宜的**包机**航班票。"},
21380:{"w":"formidable","e":"The new coastline is being bolstered with a formidable twelve kilometres of sea defences.","t":"新的海岸线被一条12公里长的**坚固**海防线保护起来。","y":"dreadful（adj. 可怕的，令人畏惧的）；awesome（adj. 使人敬畏的，使人惊惧的）；insurmountable（adj. 不能克服的，不能超越的）","f":"manageable（adj. 能处理的）"},
21381:{"w":"belt","e":"Molten glass travelled over a moving belt of perforated steel oozing through the holes into moulds.","t":"融化的玻璃流过一根移动的带孔钢**带**，通过孔眼滴入模具内。"},
21382:{"w":"relay","e":"The Olympic Games are relayed all round the world.","t":"奥运会实况向全世界**转播**。","r":"联想记忆：re（重新）+lay（放置）→重新放置→转播"},
21383:{"w":"crockery","e":"You'll find all sorts of things in the museums: old suitcases, crockery, first-class cabins decorated in the fashion of the day.","t":"在博物馆里你会看到各式各样的东西：旧衣箱、**陶罐**以及按当时流行风格装修的头等舱。","r":"联想记忆：crock（坛子，瓦罐）+ery→陶器；瓦器"},
21384:{"w":"diversify","e":"Farms have diversified in recent years.","t":"近年来，农业种植开始**多样化**。","d":"diversification（n. 变化，多样化）"},
21385:{"w":"threshold","e":"The normal noise threshold for people is 80 decibels.","t":"80分贝是人类所能忍受的正常噪音**上限**。","r":"联想记忆：thres（看作thread，细线）+hold（拿着）→手里拿根细线站在门口→入门，门槛","c":"be on the threshold of sth. 在…的开端","y":"doorway（n. 门口）；outset（n. 开端，开始）"},
21386:{"w":"vacation","e":"She's going to Florida for vacation.","t":"她要去佛罗里达**度假**。","r":"词根记忆：vac（空）+ation（表状态）→空闲的→假期；休假"},
21387:{"w":"skyscraper","e":"As construction techniques improved, the skyscraper became a reality.","t":"随着建筑技术的进步，建造**摩天大楼**成为现实。","r":"组合词：sky（天）+scrape（摩擦）+er（表人或物）→楼高得可以擦到天→摩天楼"},
21388:{"w":"draft","e":"You must think a great deal before you start writing your draft.","t":"你在开始打**草稿**之前一定要考虑周全。","c":"bank draft 银行汇票；first draft 草案，初稿"},
21389:{"w":"deter","e":"They would be deterred from buying a product if it had been tested on animals.","t":"如果产品在动物身上做过试验，他们就会**打消**购买的念头。","r":"词根记忆：de（使…）+ter（=terr，恐吓）→威慑，吓住"},
21390:{"w":"promising","e":"Other members of the tribe scoured the country for promising fish holes.","t":"这个部落的其他成员在全国范围内寻找**有望**捕到鱼的地方。","r":"联想记忆：promis(e)（承诺）+ing→承诺了的→有希望的","y":"hopeful〔adj.（怀）有希望的〕；bright（adj. 前景光明的，充满希望的）","f":"hopeless（adj. 没有希望的）"},
21391:{"w":"goal","e":"Once you have achieved the first goals, you will move up to a higher level of study.","t":"一旦你达到了最初的**目标**，就可以进行更深层次的研究了。"},
21392:{"w":"crush","e":"Be careful not to crush my glasses in the bag.","t":"小心别把我包里的眼镜给**压碎**了。","r":"联想记忆：碰撞（crash）后被碾碎（crush）","c":"crush a rebellion 压制反抗；crush one's hopes 打破某人的愿望；crush up 粉碎"},
21393:{"w":"stream","e":"The leaves were washed by rain into streams and rivers.","t":"树叶被雨水冲进了**小溪**与河流中。","r":"联想记忆：s+tream（看作dream，梦想）→梦想的河流→溪流"},
21394:{"w":"urgent","e":"His car is in urgent need of repair.","t":"他的汽车**急需**修理。","d":"urgently（adv. 紧急地）"},
21395:{"w":"maximise","e":"Some airlines have cancelled less popular routes in an effort to maximise profits.","t":"为实现利润**最大化**，一些航空公司取消了不太火爆的路线。","r":"词根记忆：max（大）+im+ise（使…）→使增至最大限度→最佳化"},
21396:{"w":"sleek","e":"Not only sleeping and living accommodation, but also a sleek modern kitchen allows guests to cook and entertain if they wish at no additional cost.","t":"如果客人愿意，不仅可以免费住宿，还可以免费在**时尚**厨房中做饭和招待客人。"},
21397:{"w":"entrust","e":"As a hotelier, how do you go about attracting people to give up the security of their own home and entrust themselves to staying in a completely strange place and sleeping in an unfamiliar bed?","t":"作为旅馆经营者，你是如何吸引人们使他们放弃自己家里的安全感，却把自己**托付**给你，让自己待在一个完全陌生的地方并睡在一张不熟悉的床上呢？","r":"联想记忆：en+trust（信任）→十分信任才会委托→委托"},
21398:{"w":"pamper","e":"There is something very powerful in our need to be pampered and looked after; it's almost as if we return to being a baby, when everything was done for us and we felt safe and secure.","t":"我们需要被**纵容**和被照顾的情绪很强烈，当所有事情都为我们做好，我们感到安全无忧的时候，几乎就像回到了婴儿状态。"},
21399:{"w":"veterinarian","e":"The woman wanted to be a veterinarian when she was a little girl, but she became a singer when she grew up.","t":"这个女人小时候想成为一名**兽医**，但她长大后成了一名歌手。"},
21400:{"w":"demolition","e":"Creating the park required the demolition of lots of derelict buildings on the site.","t":"建造公园需要**摧毁**旧址上大量的废弃建筑物。"},
21401:{"w":"derelict","e":"The building has been derelict for many years.","t":"该建筑物已经**废弃**多年。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+re（后）+lict（留下）→留在身后→被抛弃的","c":"derelict land 荒废的土地"},
21402:{"w":"synchronise","e":"There's an indoor arena for gymnastics, a stadium for track and field and a swimming pool for races and synchronised swimming and also diving.","t":"这里有个室内体操馆、一个田径运动场，和一个用于游泳比赛、**花样**游泳和跳水的泳池。","c":"synchronised swimming 花样游泳"},
21403:{"w":"ornamental","e":"If you look out here to the south, you can see a circular ornamental pond.","t":"如果你从这里往外向南看，可以看到一个环形的**装饰性**水池。"},
21404:{"w":"track","e":"The road system here evolved from the goat tracks followed by the early inhabitants.","t":"这里的道路系统是在早期居民所走的羊肠**小道**的基础上发展起来的。"},
21405:{"w":"estuary","e":"This area is in a sheltered part of the estuary.","t":"这一区域处于**河口**的隐蔽处。","r":"联想记忆：est（看作east，东）+uary（看作February，二月）→二月春水向东流，流到河口不回头→河口，河口湾","c":"estuary deposits 河口沉积，港湾沉积"},
21406:{"w":"leaflet","e":"You can find exact information about a patient on the patient information leaflet.","t":"你可以在病人信息**单**中找到有关病人的详细信息。","r":"联想记忆：leaf（树叶）+let（表小东西）→大街上的传单如落叶般铺天盖地→传单"},
21407:{"w":"cascade","e":"The cascade falls over a tall cliff.","t":"**瀑布**从万丈悬崖上倾泻而下。","r":"词根记忆：casc（=cas，落下）+ade（表动作结果）→（水）落下→小瀑布"},
21408:{"w":"irritate","e":"Foul smelling chemicals are often used to irritate the bees and drive them down into the hive's bottom boxes.","t":"气味难闻的化学物质常常被用来**刺激**蜜蜂并把它们赶到蜂箱底部的箱子里。","d":"irritant（n. 刺激物 adj. 刺激性的）；irritating（adj. 恼人的，令人痛苦的）"},
21409:{"w":"hatch","e":"Almost all the eggs in the farm will hatch into chicks.","t":"农场里几乎所有的鸡蛋都会**孵化**成小鸡。","r":"联想记忆：要想赢得比赛（match）得有准备和策划（hatch）","y":"design（vt. 筹划，构思）；devise（vt. 策划，图谋）；scheme（v. 计划，策划）"},
21410:{"w":"commence","e":"Most courses commence at 9 a.m. and run until 3 p.m.","t":"大部分课程上午9点**开始**，下午3点结束。","c":"commence with 由…开始；commence doing sth. 开始做某事","y":"begin（v. 开始）；start（v. 开始）","f":"end（v. 结束）；finish（v. 结束，终止）"},
21411:{"w":"initiative","e":"The major initiative by this car-manufacturing company was to adopt a totally multi-skilled workforce.","t":"这家汽车制造厂采取的主要**措施**是雇用掌握多种技能的工人。","c":"take the initiative 带头，倡导，发起","d":"initiation（n. 开始）"},
21412:{"w":"fruitful","e":"The researchers' hard work has led to some fruitful discoveries.","t":"研究人员经过努力工作，终于有了一些**卓有成效**的发现。","r":"联想记忆：fruit（果实）+ful（=full，满满的）→硕果累累的→多产的"},
21413:{"w":"stationary","e":"It seemed to me that there were almost as many serious problems when cars were stationary as when they were travelling at 90 miles an hour.","t":"对我来讲，车**停止不动**和以每小时90英里的速度行驶出现的严重问题几乎一样多。","r":"联想记忆：station（位置）+ary→总在同一位置的→静止的","c":"a stationary target 一个固定的目标","y":"motionless（adj. 不动的，静止的）；fixed（adj. 固定的）","f":"mobile（adj. 移动的）"},
21414:{"w":"superficial","e":"Those who tend to show off in front of other people are so superficial indeed.","t":"那些喜欢在别人面前炫耀的人实际上相当**肤浅**。","r":"词根记忆：super（上）+fic（做）+ial（…的）→做表面文章→表面的","c":"superficial resemblance 表面上的相似"},
21415:{"w":"crawl","e":"To prevent the queen from crawling up to the top and laying eggs, a screen can be inserted between the brood chamber and the supers.","t":"为了防止蜂王**爬**到顶部产卵，可在蜂箱育卵室和蜂房上层之间插入一块隔板。","r":"联想记忆：c+raw（生疏的）+l→对地形生疏，车要开得慢一点→缓慢行进","c":"be crawling with sth. 挤满，爬满"},
21416:{"w":"rotate","e":"European peasants in the ancient time would insert a wooden drill into a round hole in a stone and rotate it briskly to make fire.","t":"古时，欧洲的农民将木钻插入石头的圆孔中，通过快速**旋转**木钻来取火。","r":"词根记忆：rot（转）+ate（使…）→（使）旋转，转动"},
21417:{"w":"spoil","e":"He wasn't going to let a headache spoil his holidays.","t":"他不想因为头疼而使假期**泡汤**。","r":"联想记忆：破坏（spoil）土地（soil），损人不利己","c":"the spoils of office 利用官职捞取的私利"},
21418:{"w":"flask","e":"After the science experiment, students washed the flasks.","t":"科学实验后，同学们将**烧瓶**清洗干净。","r":"联想记忆：和flash（v. 闪光）一起记"},
21419:{"w":"attend","e":"Students under the age of 16 cannot attend any of the courses offered by the college.","t":"未满16岁的学生不能**学习**本学院的任何课程。","r":"词根记忆：at（表加强）+tend（伸展）→伸长脖子看→专心","d":"attendance（n. 出席；照料）；attention（n. 注意；关心）"},
21420:{"w":"rim","e":"The pattern around the rim of the plate was very beautiful.","t":"那个盘子**边缘**的图案非常漂亮。","r":"联想记忆：打靶（aim）不能打边（rim）"},
21421:{"w":"motivate","e":"Pictures are used to help motivate children to read because they are beautiful and eye-catching.","t":"图片因其美丽和引人注目而被用来**激发**孩子们的阅读兴趣。","c":"motivate sb. to do sth. 激励某人做某事"},
21422:{"w":"patent","e":"Walker never patented his invention.","t":"沃克从未为自己的发明**申请专利**。","c":"patent device 专利设备；apply for a patent 申请专利"},
21423:{"w":"architect","e":"Among mathematicians and architects, left-handers tend to be more common.","t":"在数学家和**建筑师**中，惯用左手者往往更为常见。"},
21424:{"w":"symptom","e":"This disease has some symptoms similar to a cold.","t":"这种病的某些**症状**与感冒的相似。","r":"词根记忆：sym（共同）+pto（掉下）+m→一起掉下来的→症状；征候","c":"symptom for …的症状；late symptoms 迟发症状；clinical symptoms 临床症状；deficiency symptoms 营养缺乏症状"},
21425:{"w":"tremendous","e":"This looseness in molecular structure gives the material tremendous \"formability\".","t":"分子结构如此松散使这种材料**极具**“可塑性”。","r":"词根记忆：trem（颤抖）+end+ous（…的）→非常的，惊人的","y":"enormous（adj. 巨大的，庞大的）；marvelous（adj. 非凡的，惊奇的）","f":"tiny（adj. 微小的）"},
21426:{"w":"destination","e":"The tourists rest there and then go to various destinations.","t":"游客们在那里稍事休息，然后去往不同的**目的地**。","r":"联想记忆：destin（看作destine，预定）+ation→预定的地方→目的地","c":"holiday destination 度假胜地；final destination 最终目的地；arrive at/reach one's destination 到达目的地"},
21427:{"w":"welfare","e":"The office deals with all matters related to student welfare.","t":"该办公室专门处理与学生**福利**相关的各种事务。","r":"联想记忆：wel（看作well，好的）+fare（费用）→让人过上好生活的费用→福利","c":"welfare work 福利事业；welfare state 福利国家；welfare benefits 福利待遇"},
21428:{"w":"envisage","e":"It's just a chance for you to say anything about the equipment and problems you envisage.","t":"这对你来说是个机会，你可以就设备和**想到**的问题谈一谈自己的看法。","r":"词根记忆：en（使…）+vis（看）+age（表行为）→展望","c":"It is envisaged that... 预计…；envisage a bright future 展望美好的未来","y":"imagine（vt. 想象，设想）；fancy（vt. 想象，设想）；envision（vt. 想象；展望）"},
21429:{"w":"binoculars","e":"The park's viewing shelter is a favourite spot for bird watchers who can use it to spy through binoculars.","t":"公园的野鸟观测遮蔽处是鸟类观赏者最喜爱的去处，在那儿他们可以使用**双筒望远镜**来观赏鸟类。","r":"词根记忆：bin(o)（双，两）+ocul（眼睛）+ars→两只眼睛→双筒望远镜"},
21430:{"w":"spoilage","e":"Bitterness, he says, alerts us of toxins in the food, while sourness warns us of spoilage and saltiness signals the presence of minerals.","t":"他说，苦味提醒我们食物中有毒素，酸味提醒我们食品已**变质**，而咸味代表存在矿物质。"},
21431:{"w":"misconception","e":"Some people often have a misconception that keeping in good shape needs to be on a diet or even not to eat anything; in fact this idea is wrong.","t":"有些人经常有种**错误想法**，认为好身材需要节食甚至靠不吃东西来保持，事实上这个想法是错的。"},
21432:{"w":"vegetation","e":"There is more and more vegetation disappearing every year and we can never find it again.","t":"每年都有越来越多的**植物**灭绝，我们永远也找不到它们了。","y":"plant（n. 植物）"},
21433:{"w":"conceptual","e":"There is only a conceptual framework of the play which needs the actors to develop it themselves.","t":"这部戏到现在为止只有一个**概念**框架，需要演员自行发挥。","r":"来自concept（n. 观念，概念）"},
21434:{"w":"modification","e":"Knowledge of the ill effects of tobacco can lead to a modification in smoking behaviour.","t":"了解吸烟对健康的损害能够**改变**人们吸烟的行为。","r":"联想记忆：modifi（看作modify，修改）+cation→修改"},
21435:{"w":"erroneous","e":"It seems that the boy is under the erroneous impression that the pretty girl is in love with him.","t":"看起来这个男孩子是**误**以为那个漂亮女孩爱上他了。","r":"词根记忆：err（错误）+on+eous（…的）→错误的，不正确的"},
21436:{"w":"robust","e":"Some of the misconceptions are erroneous, more robust but also accessible to modification.","t":"一些错误的想法是不正确的，是比较**顽固**的，但是仍然可以进行修改。","d":"robustness（n. 健壮）；robustly（adv. 有活力地；强健地）","y":"sturdy（adj. 强健的）；healthy（adj. 健壮的，健康的）","f":"delicate（adj. 脆弱的）"},
21437:{"w":"immense","e":"The scope of the problem facing the world's cities is immense.","t":"全世界的城市面临**很多**方面的问题。","r":"词根记忆：im（不）+mens（测量）+e→不能测量的→巨大的，广大的","c":"immense improvement 巨大的进步"},
21438:{"w":"baron","e":"The Frenchman Baron Pierre de Coubertin, an educator and scholar, founded the modern Olympics.","t":"法国教育家及学者皮埃尔·德·顾拜旦**男爵**创办了现代奥运会。"},
21439:{"w":"independence","e":"With the independence of much of Asia and Africa after 1945, it was assumed that economic progress would rapidly lead to the disappearance or assimilation of many small-scale societies.","t":"1945年后，随着亚洲和非洲很多国家的**独立**，人们推断经济进步将会很快导致许多小型社会的消失或者被同化。","r":"联想记忆：in（不）+depend（依靠）+ence（表名词）→不依靠别人→独立，自主"},
21440:{"w":"intense","e":"Large thunderclouds generate the intense electrical fields that cause lightning flashes.","t":"巨大的雷雨云产生**极强**的电磁场，从而形成闪电。","r":"联想记忆：in（在…之中）+tense（紧张）→处于紧张之中→紧张的","c":"intense heat 酷热"},
21441:{"w":"withdraw","e":"ATMs are extremely useful as they enable you to withdraw cash from your account whenever you want.","t":"自动取款机非常有用，因为它可以使你随时从账户内**取款**。","c":"withdraw one's promise 收回诺言；a withdrawn letter 一封被撤回的信函；withdraw money from a bank 从银行取钱"},
21442:{"w":"sceptical","e":"People become less sceptical and more optimistic when the weather is sunny.","t":"人们在晴朗的日子里会变得少**猜忌**并且更乐观。"},
21443:{"w":"flicker","e":"The light flickers quite badly and it's giving me headaches.","t":"灯光**闪**得非常厉害，弄得我头疼。","r":"联想记忆：flick（弹）+er→弹指一挥间星光闪烁→闪烁"},
21444:{"w":"cord","e":"This process could be speeded up by wrapping a cord around the drill and pulling on each end.","t":"这个过程可以通过拉缠绕在钻头两端的**线**来加快速度。","c":"power cord 电源线"},
21445:{"w":"lower","e":"The lower end of the valley has become one huge camp site.","t":"这条河谷**下游**的出口处已经变成了一个巨大的营地。"},
21446:{"w":"primary","e":"The primary reason for advertising is to sell more goods.","t":"做广告的**首要**目的是要售出更多的货物。","r":"词根记忆：prim（主要的）+ary（…的）→最初的；首要的","c":"the primary stage of civilization 文明的最初阶段；primary school 小学；primary education 初等教育"},
21447:{"w":"exhaustion","e":"The runner collapsed from exhaustion.","t":"那个奔跑的人因为**极度疲劳**而昏倒了。"},
21448:{"w":"coincide","e":"My religious beliefs don't coincide with yours.","t":"我的宗教信仰与你的不**一致**。","r":"词根记忆：co（共同）+in+cid（降临）+e→使一同降临→同时发生","d":"coincidence（n. 同时发生的事情；一致）","y":"concur（vi. 一致）；agree（v. 与…一致）"},
21449:{"w":"mess","e":"The celebration locale is in a mess.","t":"欢庆场地**一片狼藉**。","c":"make a mess 弄乱，搞砸"},
21450:{"w":"design","e":"Architecture is the art and science of designing buildings and structures.","t":"建筑学是一门**设计**建筑物及其结构的艺术科学。","r":"联想记忆：de+sign（标记）→做标记→设计","d":"designer（n. 设计师）"},
21451:{"w":"insist","e":"We do not insist on any prerequisites for this course.","t":"对于这一课程，我们不**一定需要**什么先决条件。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+sist（站立）→一直站着→坚持","c":"insist on 坚持要求，坚决主张"},
21452:{"w":"crew","e":"The rescue crew is still looking for survivors.","t":"救援**队**仍然在寻找生还者。","r":"联想记忆：和crow（n. 乌鸦）一起记"},
21453:{"w":"geographical","e":"The new geographical report covers a wide range of geographical area.","t":"新的**地理学**报告涵盖了大范围的地理区域。"},
21454:{"w":"indigenous","e":"The emu is indigenous to Australia.","t":"鸸鹋是澳大利亚**土生土长**的鸟类。","r":"词根记忆：indi（内部）+gen（产生）+ous（…的）→内部产生的→本地的","c":"indigenous language 本土语言"},
21455:{"w":"consistent","e":"The survey results are entirely consistent with our earlier research.","t":"调查的结果与我们早期的研究结果完全**一致**。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+sist（站立）+ent（具有…性质的）→站在一起的→一致的"},
21456:{"w":"sympathetic","e":"Lena just needed someone who would lend a sympathetic ear to her.","t":"丽娜只需要有人能**同情地**听她诉诉苦。","r":"词根记忆：sym（共同）+path（感情）+etic（有…性质的）→有着共同感情的→同情的"},
21457:{"w":"personalize","e":"All the towels and cups were personalized with the initial names of the owners.","t":"所有的毛巾和杯子上都**标注**了物主姓名的首字母。"},
21458:{"w":"incompatible","e":"Any new operating system that is incompatible with existing ones has little chance of being used.","t":"任何与现有的操作系统**不兼容**的新操作系统都几乎得不到使用。","r":"联想记忆：in（不）+compatible（兼容的，协调的）→不兼容的，不协调的"},
21459:{"w":"predominate","e":"Red colour predominates in clothes of this brand.","t":"这个品牌的衣服，红色**占据了主流**。","r":"联想记忆：pre+dominate（统治）→处于统治地位→占优势"},
21460:{"w":"complexity","e":"Students in our class are all astonished by the great complexity of this event.","t":"我们班里的所有同学都对这次事件的**复杂性**感到震惊。"},
21461:{"w":"terrestrial","e":"Scientists compared terrestrial animals with marine species to understand how each group adapts to its environment.","t":"科学家们将**陆生**动物与海洋物种进行比较，以了解它们各自如何适应所处的环境。","r":"词根记忆：terr（土地）+estr+ial（…的）→陆地的，陆生的","c":"terrestrial life 地球生物"},
21462:{"w":"commission","e":"He now has a new commission to design a glass sculpture for the headquarters of a pizza company.","t":"他现在有新的**委托事务**，为一家比萨公司的总部大楼设计一件玻璃雕塑。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+miss（送）+ion→送交给某人→委托","c":"in/out of commission 可/不可使用"},
21463:{"w":"beware","e":"There are some venomous snakes to beware of in this area.","t":"该地区有一些毒蛇，要**小心**。","r":"联想记忆：be（使）+ware（音似：歪耳）→使歪耳，侧耳偷听→谨防，当心"},
21464:{"w":"compensation","e":"The company was paid a sum of money by an insurance agent as compensation for its loss in a fire.","t":"那家公司从保险公司那里得到一笔火灾损失**赔偿金**。","c":"make compensation for one's losses 补偿某人的损失"},
21465:{"w":"issue","e":"They care about environmental issues but their concern does not affect their spending habits.","t":"他们关心环境**问题**，但这种关心并没有影响他们的消费习惯。","c":"environmental issues 环境问题；issue a statement 发表声明；issue shares 发行股票；be at issue 是讨论或争议的焦点"},
21466:{"w":"finite","e":"The finite fossil fuel reserves will hinder the development of a country.","t":"**有限**的矿物燃料储备将阻碍一个国家的发展。","r":"词根记忆：fin（范围）+ite（有…性质的）→限定范围的→限定的"},
21467:{"w":"curly","e":"The package was decorated with curly ribbon.","t":"包裹用**卷**丝带装饰了起来。","r":"联想记忆：curl（使卷曲）+y→卷曲的"},
21468:{"w":"redress","e":"The government is taking measures to redress these abuses of power.","t":"政府正采取措施**纠正**这些滥用职权行为。","r":"联想记忆：re（重新）+dress（整理）→重新整理→修正"},
21469:{"w":"swallow","e":"One should never swallow his words.","t":"人们应**坚守诺言**。"},
21470:{"w":"hasty","e":"It is unwise to make a hasty conclusion.","t":"**草率**地得出结论是不明智的。","r":"联想记忆：hast（看作fast，快的）+y→快速完成的→匆忙的","y":"impetuous（adj. 草率的，匆忙的）"},
21471:{"w":"geometry","e":"Reading novels during geometry class is a misuse of your time.","t":"在**几何**课上看小说是滥用你自己的时间。"},
21472:{"w":"stuff","e":"The premium coffee like the stuff we're drinking now is from a type of bean called Arabica.","t":"特级咖啡，就像我们现在喝的**东西**，是由一种叫阿拉比卡的咖啡豆制成的。","c":"stuff...with 填满，塞满；have a stuffed nose 鼻子不通气"},
21473:{"w":"landward","e":"It is landward access, which is productive of goods for export and which demands imports, that is critical.","t":"**近陆**的入口非常重要，它既能够生产出口货物，对进口也有需求。"},
21474:{"w":"vigorous","e":"The small group of the survivors was to become a vigorous, self-sustaining island population.","t":"那一小队幸存者成了**精力充沛**、自力更生的岛上居民。","r":"联想记忆：vigor（活力）+ous→有活力的→朝气蓬勃的","c":"vigorous students 朝气蓬勃的学生"},
21475:{"w":"subordinate","e":"He was always friendly to his subordinates.","t":"他一向对**下属**和蔼可亲。","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+ordin（秩序）+ate→顺序在下→次要的","y":"inferior（adj. 下等的，下级的）；secondary（adj. 次要的，二级的）","f":"superior（adj. 更好的；上级的）"},
21476:{"w":"correspond","e":"This person's characteristics correspond with the witness' description.","t":"这个人的特征与证人的描述**相符**。","r":"词根记忆：cor（共同）+re（回）+spond（约定）→共同约定→相一致；符合","c":"correspond to 符合；相当于；correspond with 相一致；与…通信","d":"correspondence（n. 通信；符合）；corresponding（adj. 相应的）"},
21477:{"w":"farewell","e":"We bid our old friends farewell.","t":"我们向老友们**告别**。","r":"联想记忆：fare（看作far，远）+well（好）→朋友去远方，说些告别话→告别"},
21478:{"w":"adjacent","e":"People living in houses adjacent to the airport are tormented by noise for years.","t":"住在机场**附近**的居民常年受到噪音的折磨。","y":"adjoining（adj. 邻接的）；contiguous（adj. 接近的）","f":"detached（adj. 分开的）；separate（adj. 个别的，单独的）"},
21479:{"w":"charity","e":"I have some things to give to the local charity in a box in the front room.","t":"前厅有个盒子，里面装了些东西，我准备捐给当地的**慈善机构**。","c":"charity donation 慈善捐款；charity hospital 慈善医院"},
21480:{"w":"comedy","e":"I really like to watch some of the old comedy shows.","t":"我真想看一些以前的**喜剧**表演。","r":"联想记忆：大家一起来（come）看喜剧（comedy）","d":"comedian（n. 喜剧演员）"},
21481:{"w":"gorgeous","e":"The garden with azaleas is gorgeous.","t":"花园里杜鹃花盛开，**绚丽多彩**。","r":"联想记忆：gorge（峡谷）+ous→峡谷很美丽→华丽的"},
21482:{"w":"recommend","e":"As treatment for back pain the clinic mainly recommends relaxation therapy.","t":"至于背部疼痛的治疗，诊所主要**推荐**采用放松疗法。","r":"联想记忆：re（一再）+com（共同）+mend（修）→这本书是大家一再修改的成果，强力推荐→推荐","c":"recommend sb. sth. 向某人推荐某物；We recommend that...我们建议…","d":"recommendation（n. 推荐；劝告）"},
21483:{"w":"survive","e":"For most animal species, individuals are less likely to survive and reproduce.","t":"对于大多数动物物种来说，个体似乎不太可能**存活**以及繁衍后代。","r":"词根记忆：sur（上）+viv（生命）+e→活在死亡界限之上→幸免于","d":"survival（n. 生存；幸存）"},
21484:{"w":"grim","e":"We gradually found his laugh grim.","t":"我们渐渐觉得他的笑声**让人讨厌**。","r":"联想记忆：g+rim（边框）→给出条条框框来约束→严厉的；可怕的"},
21485:{"w":"apparatus","e":"This apparatus has been thoroughly tested.","t":"这套**设备**已经过全面测试。","r":"词根记忆：ap（表加强）+par（准备）+atus→准备好用的东西→器械，器具"},
21486:{"w":"dome","e":"The bottom of the can is shaped like a dome to resist the internal pressure.","t":"罐子的底部呈内凹的**圆顶**形，这是为了承受来自罐内的压力。","r":"联想记忆：和home（n. 家）一起记"},
21487:{"w":"formal","e":"They held the first formal international meeting on the subject.","t":"他们就这一主题举行了第一届**正式**的国际会议。","f":"informal（adj. 非正式的）"},
21488:{"w":"explore","e":"Architects began to explore ways of creating buildings using the latest technology.","t":"建筑师开始**探索**利用最新技术来建造房屋的方法。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+plor（喊）+e→喊出来→探索；探究","d":"exploration（n. 探险；探究）；exploratory（adj. 探索的，探测的）"},
21489:{"w":"extension","e":"These temporary hive extensions contained frames of empty comb for the bees to fill with honey.","t":"这些临时**加上去**的蜂箱中放有空的蜂巢结构的架子，用于让蜜蜂存放蜂蜜。","c":"one month extension 延期一个月；the extension of vocabulary词汇的扩展；extension to …的延伸部分"},
21490:{"w":"consist","e":"Each hour consists of 50-minute tuition and a 10-minute break.","t":"每小时的内容**包括**50分钟的讲解和10分钟的休息。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+sist（站立）→站在一起→由…构成","c":"consist of 由…组成，由…构成；consist in 在于，存在于","d":"consistency（n. 一致性，连贯性）；consistent（adj. 一致的；相符的）；consistently（adv. 始终如一地）"},
21491:{"w":"brew","e":"When there is a thunderstorm brewing, some people complain of the air being heavy and of feeling irritable.","t":"当暴风雨**即将来临**，一些人抱怨空气沉闷而且感觉烦躁。","r":"联想记忆：自酿（brew）苦酒，紧皱起眉头（brow）","d":"brewery（n. 啤酒厂）"},
21492:{"w":"sacrifice","e":"Linda's parents made sacrifices so that she could have a good education abroad.","t":"为了让琳达能在国外接受良好的教育，琳达的父母做出了**牺牲**。","r":"词根记忆：sacri（神圣）+fic（做）+e→神圣的做法→牺牲，献祭","d":"sacrificial（adj. 供奉的，献祭的，牺牲品的）"},
21493:{"w":"degenerate","e":"Similarly, although at least some cetaceans have taste buds, the nerves serving these have degenerated or are rudimentary.","t":"同样，尽管至少一些鲸鱼是有味蕾的，但是控制这些味蕾的神经已经**退化**了或者根本就没有充分发展。","r":"词根记忆：de（坏）+gener（产生）+ate→产生坏的（想法）→退化；退化的","d":"degeneration（n. 恶化，退化的过程）","f":"develop（v. 发展，生长）；evolve〔v.（使）发展，（使）进化〕"},
21494:{"w":"intelligent","e":"The most intelligent students do additional reading to supplement the material in the textbook.","t":"最**聪明**的学生通过课外阅读来补充课本的内容。","r":"词根记忆：intel（=inter，在…之间）+lig（选择）+ent（具有…性质的）→知道如何选择→聪明的，理智的","c":"an intelligent reader 一位聪明的读者"},
21495:{"w":"aspiration","e":"A building reflects the ideas and aspirations of the designer and client.","t":"建筑物反映出设计者和客户的理念与**渴望**。","r":"词根记忆：a（表加强）+spir（呼吸）+ation（表状态）→渴望得呼吸急促→强烈的愿望","d":"aspirational（adj. 渴望成功的，有雄心壮志的）"},
21496:{"w":"considerable","e":"The heavy snow blocks the highway, so we have to take considerable detours.","t":"大雪使得公路封锁，所以我们不得不绕道而行，为此多走了**很多**路。","r":"联想记忆：consider（考虑）+able（能…的）→能纳入考虑范围的→值得考虑的"},
21497:{"w":"clumsy","e":"These oversized clumsy cars would slow down traffic.","t":"这些体形硕大而**笨拙**的汽车会减缓交通的速度。"},
21498:{"w":"gleam","e":"The church steeple gleamed in the sunlight.","t":"教堂的尖塔在阳光下**闪闪发光**。","d":"gleaming（adj. 光洁闪亮的）"},
21499:{"w":"fascinate","e":"The very style of the old house fascinates.","t":"这个老房子的风格本身就**令人着迷**。","r":"联想记忆：fasc（看作fast，牢固的）+in（里面的）+ate→牢牢地陷在里边→使着迷","c":"be fascinated by 被…迷住"},
21500:{"w":"supervise","e":"Mary supervises the work of the department.","t":"玛丽**指导**该部门的工作。","r":"词根记忆：super（上）+vis（看）+e→在上面（往下）看→监督，管理；指导","d":"supervisor（n. 主管；督学）；supervision（n. 监督，管理）；supervisory（adj. 管理的，监督的）","y":"administer（vt. 管理）；superintend（vt. 管理，监督）"},
21501:{"w":"evaluate","e":"We evaluated the students' skills on the basis of test results.","t":"我们在考试成绩的基础上对学生的技能进行**评估**。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+valu（价值）+ate→出价→评价，估价"},
21502:{"w":"curiosity","e":"The relentless curiosity of scientific researchers brought the forces of nature to light.","t":"科研人员无尽的**好奇心**是自然力量发现的源泉。","r":"词根记忆：curi（=cur，跑）+osity（表状态）→都跑过来看→好奇心"},
21503:{"w":"residential","e":"Smith House is one of the oldest residential colleges of the university.","t":"史密斯学院是这所大学最古老的**寄宿**学院之一。","c":"residential property 住宅地；residential school 寄宿学校；Asian residential area 亚洲人居住地；residential quarters 住宅小区"},
21504:{"w":"sole","e":"His sole motive was to make her happy.","t":"他**唯一**的动机就是让她高兴。","r":"词根记忆：sol（单独）+e→唯一的","c":"sole parent 单亲","d":"solely（adv. 唯一地；独自地）"},
21505:{"w":"decade","e":"In Tokyo builders are planning a massive underground city to be begun in the next decade.","t":"在东京，建筑师们正计划在今后的**十年**里大规模兴建地下城。","r":"词根记忆：dec（十）+ade→十年，十年期"},
21506:{"w":"survey","e":"A recent survey of staff found that 90 percent welcomed having clothing which reflected the corporate identity.","t":"最近的一项员工**调查**发现，90％的员工欣然接受穿能够反映企业形象的工装。","r":"词根记忆：sur（上）+vey（道路）→在道路上进行勘测→勘测","c":"sample survey 抽样调查；land survey 土地测量；survey of reading habits 阅读习惯调查；geological survey 地质勘测"},
21507:{"w":"fitting","e":"If you want to buy a pair of trousers, a fitting is very necessary.","t":"如果你想买一条裤子，**试穿**非常必要。"},
21508:{"w":"rudimentary","e":"New staff were given only rudimentary training at the beginning of their work.","t":"新员工在工作之初只接受了**最基本**的训练。","r":"词根记忆：rud（天然的）+iment+ary（…的）→天然的状态→初步的；未充分发展的"},
21509:{"w":"courtship","e":"This contact may help to maintain order within a group, and stroking or touching are part of the courtship ritual in most species.","t":"这种接触也许有助于维持一个群体里的秩序，而在大多数物种中，抚摸或接触是**求爱**仪式中的一部分。"},
21510:{"w":"ritual","e":"It is interesting to observe, for instance, some decline in the emphasis given to marriage rituals.","t":"我们发现很有意思的情况，例如，人们对结婚**典礼**的热衷程度在减弱。","r":"联想记忆：rit(e)（典礼，仪式）+ual→典礼，仪式","y":"ceremony（n. 仪式，典礼）；formality（n. 礼节；仪式）"},
21511:{"w":"stereoscopic","e":"The position of the eyes so restricts the field of vision in baleen whales that they probably do not have stereoscopic vision.","t":"由于须鲸眼睛的位置限制了视野，它们可能没有**立体**视觉。"},
21512:{"w":"interface","e":"The new version of the program has a much better user interface than the original.","t":"新版程序比旧版的用户**界面**要好得多。","r":"联想记忆：inter（相互）+face（面）→界面"},
21513:{"w":"preliminary","e":"Although preliminary experimental evidence suggests that their in-air vision is poor, the accuracy with which dolphins leap high to take small fish out of a trainer's hand provides evidence to the contrary.","t":"尽管**先前**的试验证明海豚在空气中的视力很差，但它们可以一跃到空中获取训练者手中的小鱼，这种准确度成为与之前的结论相反的证据。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+limin（门槛）+ary（…的）→入门前的→初步的","c":"without preliminaries 直截了当地；preliminary trial 初步审讯；preliminary remarks 开场白"},
21514:{"w":"turbid","e":"Vision is obviously more useful to species inhabiting clear open waters than to those living in turbid rivers and flooded plains.","t":"显而易见，与那些生活在**浑浊**的小河里和河漫滩里的物种相比，视力对生活在干净清澈水域里的物种更加有用。"},
21515:{"w":"repertoire","e":"The Royal Shakespeare Company also have many modern plays in their repertoire.","t":"英国皇家莎士比亚剧团的**常备剧目**中也有很多现代剧。","r":"词根记忆：re（表加强）+pert（带）+oire→一定要带着的剧目→（剧团等）常备剧目"},
21516:{"w":"monotonous","e":"The play became monotonous after a while.","t":"过了一会儿，这部剧就变得**单调乏味**了。","r":"词根记忆：mono（单个）+ton（声音）+ous（有…性质的）→一个声音的→单调乏味的","c":"monotonous diet 单调乏味的食物"},
21517:{"w":"speculation","e":"Rumours that the two singers are about to marry have been dismissed as pure speculation.","t":"关于那两位歌手要结婚的谣言仅仅是**猜测**，无人再理会。"},
21518:{"w":"resemble","e":"When we tested four totally blind volunteers using the same list, we found that their choices closely resembled those made by the sighted subjects.","t":"当使用同样的表单对四位盲人志愿者进行测试时，我们发现他们的选择与视力正常的实验对象的选择极其**相似**。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+sembl（相像）+e→与…相似，相像","d":"resemblance（n. 相似；相像）"},
21519:{"w":"perspective","e":"We were encouraged to see the issue from a different perspective.","t":"我们受到鼓励，从不同的**视角**来看待这个问题。","r":"词根记忆：per（贯穿）+spect（看）+ive→透过…看→透视法"},
21520:{"w":"rendition","e":"The singer gave a moving rendition of the famous song “You Are Not Alone”.","t":"这位歌手深情**演绎**了一首著名歌曲《你不孤单》。"},
21521:{"w":"metaphorical","e":"The word has a literal as well as a metaphorical meaning.","t":"这个单词有字面意思，也有**隐喻**义。"},
21522:{"w":"interpret","e":"I wanted to discover whether there were differences in how the blind and the sighted interpreted colours.","t":"我希望可以发现失明者与有视力者对颜色的**描述**是否有所不同。","r":"词根记忆：inter（在…之间）+pret→在两种语言之间沟通→口译，翻译"},
21523:{"w":"perimeter","e":"A river runs along one side of the field's perimeter.","t":"小河沿着这块土地**周边**的一边延伸。","r":"词根记忆：peri（周围）+meter（测量）→测量一圈→周长"},
21524:{"w":"jerk","e":"He indicated the bedroom with a jerk of his head.","t":"他用头的**猝然一动**示意了卧室的方向。"},
21525:{"w":"visual","e":"The exhibition of London Museum is largely visual, with a huge number of items on show.","t":"伦敦博物馆的展览以**视觉**展示为主，展出了大量物品。","r":"词根记忆：vis（看）+ual（有…性质的）→视觉的","c":"visual acuity 视敏度；visual aid 直观教具；visual arts 视觉艺术；visual cell 视觉细胞；visual fatigue 视觉疲劳"},
21526:{"w":"horror","e":"He was filled with horror at the sight of the dog.","t":"他看见狗就**不寒而栗**。"},
21527:{"w":"distort","e":"Many people are concerned that an excessive emphasis on humanity's genetic constitution may distort our sense of values.","t":"许多人担心过分强调人类基因构成可能会**扭曲**人类的价值观。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+tort（扭曲）→扭曲"},
21528:{"w":"expose","e":"He has been widely exposed on television to the public.","t":"他经常在电视上向公众**露面**。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+pos（放）+e→放出来→使暴露，揭露","c":"expose oneself（to sth.） 使自己面临、遭受（危险或不快）","d":"exposure（n. 暴露，曝光）"},
21529:{"w":"sponge","e":"He squeezed out water from a sponge.","t":"他拧出了**海绵**里的水。","y":"rinse（vt. 清洗）"},
21530:{"w":"audition","e":"I became a professional singer after I took many auditions.","t":"经过多次**试唱**，我成了一名职业歌手。","r":"词根记忆：audit（听）+ion（表动作）→试听"},
21531:{"w":"reliable","e":"Three speed cycles are simple and reliable to ride around the town.","t":"在城里还是骑三速自行车比较简便和**可靠**。"},
21532:{"w":"abstraction","e":"Logic, rationality and abstraction have their origins in the left hemisphere.","t":"逻辑、推理和**抽象**思维都源自大脑左半球。"},
21533:{"w":"mount","e":"The eruption in May 1980 of Mount St. Helens astounded the world with its violence.","t":"1980年5月，圣海伦斯**山**火山爆发，其威力震惊了世界。","r":"本身为词根，意为“登上”"},
21534:{"w":"announce","e":"In 1989, a team of American and Canadian archaeologists announced that they had found the site of an ancient city.","t":"1989年，一个由美国和加拿大的考古学家组成的考古小组**宣布**，他们发现了一处古城遗址。","d":"announcement（n. 宣告；发布）；announcer（n. 广播员，播报员）"},
21535:{"w":"headline","e":"What sort of national events make headlines in your country?","t":"在贵国，哪种类型的国内事件会成为**头条新闻**呢？","r":"联想记忆：head（头部）+line（行列）→写在文章顶头的内容→大字标题"},
21536:{"w":"collapse","e":"The whole market collapsed, as a matter of fact, and coffee became cheaper than it had been for the previous 25 years.","t":"事实上，（咖啡）市场全盘**崩溃**，咖啡的售价跌到25年来的最低。","r":"联想记忆：col+lapse（滑倒）→一出门就滑倒，真让人崩溃→崩溃"},
21537:{"w":"assistance","e":"The farmers are to receive financial assistance to help see them through the severe drought.","t":"农民们将得到经济**援助**，以帮助他们度过这场严重的旱灾。","r":"联想记忆：assist（援助，帮助）+ance→协助，援助","c":"military assistance 军事援助"},
21538:{"w":"discriminate","e":"We must learn to discriminate right from wrong.","t":"我们必须学会**明辨**是非。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+crimin（区别）+ate→区分（对待）→区别；歧视","y":"distinguish（v. 区别，辨别）"},
21539:{"w":"destructive","e":"The lungs of children who grow up in polluted air offer further evidence of its destructive power.","t":"那些呼吸着污浊空气长大的孩子们的肺部状况进一步证明，污浊空气具有**毁坏性**力量。","r":"词根记忆：de（去掉）+struct（建造）+ive（…的）→破坏（性）的"},
21540:{"w":"authority","e":"Dark colours give an aura of authority while lighter pastel shades suggest approachability.","t":"深色调给人一种**权威**的感觉，而清淡柔和的色调使人感到亲切。","c":"in authority 持有权力；one leading authority 一个极具有权威的人"},
21541:{"w":"mild","e":"The thief just got a mild punishment.","t":"小偷只受到了**轻微**的惩罚。","r":"联想记忆：温柔的（mild）人有时也会有野蛮的（wild）一面"},
21542:{"w":"capacity","e":"Without genetic variability a species lacks the capacity to evolve and cannot adapt to changes in its environment.","t":"如果没有遗传的多样性，物种就会缺乏进化的**能力**，也就不能适应其环境的变化。","r":"词根记忆：cap（拿）+acity（表状态）→能拿住→能力","c":"the capacity of …的容量；the capacity to do/for doing sth.做…的能力"},
21543:{"w":"latitude","e":"Our position is latitude 40 degrees south.","t":"我们的位置是南**纬**40度。","r":"联想记忆：和attitude（n. 态度）一起记","y":"freedom（n. 自由，自主）；liberty（n. 自由，自由权）"},
21544:{"w":"circus","e":"The circus trainer snapped his whip.","t":"**马戏团**驯兽师把鞭子抽得啪啪响。","r":"词根记忆：circ（圆）+us→圆形的地方→环形广场"},
21545:{"w":"grin","e":"Sarah tried several times to catch Philip's eye, but he just grinned at her.","t":"萨拉几次试图吸引菲利普的注意，但他只是对她**咧嘴笑**笑。","r":"联想记忆：gr（看作girl，女孩）+in（里面）→里面的女孩咧嘴笑→咧嘴笑","c":"grin from ear to ear 笑得合不拢嘴"},
21546:{"w":"democratic","e":"The school held a democratic election for student-council officers.","t":"学校进行了一次**民主**选举来挑选学生会成员。","c":"Democratic Party 民主党；democratic reform 民主改革"},
21547:{"w":"install","e":"In the noisiest areas, mechanical ventilation will have to be installed in the exterior walls.","t":"在最喧闹的地区，其外墙上必须**安装**机械通风装置。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+stall（放）→放进→安置；安装","c":"install a drinking machine 安装饮水机"},
21548:{"w":"faculty","e":"Here on this campus we have the faculties of Architecture and Law.","t":"这所大学里设有建筑**学院**和法学院。","c":"mental/intellectual faculty 智力；the faculty of law 法学院"},
21549:{"w":"institution","e":"Such a record will allow you to present your linguistic credentials to academic institutions.","t":"这份记录将允许你将自己的语言证书呈递给学术**机构**。","c":"institution of higher learning 高等院校；educational institution教育机构；supervisory institution 监督机构"},
21550:{"w":"probability","e":"This is a tool for predicting the probability that a species will become extinct in a particular region over a specific period.","t":"这是一种用来预测某一物种在某个特定时期、特定区域灭绝的**可能性**的工具。","r":"来自probable（adj. 可能的）"},
21551:{"w":"bizarre","e":"The story is of certain bizarre interest.","t":"这个故事有一种**怪诞**的趣味。","r":"联想记忆：集市（bazaar）上都是奇形怪状的（bizarre）货物","c":"a bizarre story 一个怪诞的故事","y":"fantastic（adj. 奇异的；荒谬的）；outlandish（adj. 古怪的，奇异的）"},
21552:{"w":"gravity","e":"This increased the arrow's stability by moving the centre of gravity to a position below the rocket.","t":"通过将**重**心移到火箭下方来增加整支箭的稳定性。"},
21553:{"w":"cap","e":"The sand dredged from the waters will be used to provide a two-metre capping layer over the granite platform.","t":"从水里挖出的沙子将被用来覆盖在大理石平台上，该**覆盖**层厚达两米。"},
21554:{"w":"external","e":"The evidence we have suggests that domestic trade was greater than external trade at all periods.","t":"我们掌握的证据表明，无论在哪个时期，国内贸易都要比**对外**贸易发达。","r":"词根记忆：ex（外）+ternal→外面的","c":"external wound 外伤；external pressure 外界压力；external affairs 外交事务；external member 外部构件，套件；external auditor外部审计师"},
21555:{"w":"absurd","e":"Wearing a swimming suit during a snowstorm is absurd.","t":"在暴风雪中穿泳装可真**荒唐**。","y":"ridiculous（adj. 荒谬的，可笑的）"},
21556:{"w":"separate","e":"The solution is not to separate teaching and research, but to recognize that the combination is difficult.","t":"这种解决方案不是要将教学与研究**分离**开，而是承认它们的结合是困难的。","c":"separate bedrooms 单独的卧室"},
21557:{"w":"inclination","e":"Developing photos requires a darkroom and the time and inclination to handle the necessary chemicals.","t":"冲洗照片需要一间暗室、一些时间并且**愿意**接触冲印过程中所必需的一些化学药剂。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+clin（倾斜）+ation（表状态）→倾斜度"},
21558:{"w":"pressure","e":"His father's blood pressure is a little high.","t":"他父亲的血**压**有点高。","r":"联想记忆：press（压）+ure→压力，压强；对…施加压力","c":"under pressure 处于压力之下；put pressure on 给…以压力；atmospheric pressure 大气压；take one's blood pressure 量血压"},
21559:{"w":"conviction","e":"The information led to the conviction of those who were found guilty of treason.","t":"这些资料足以给那些叛国者**定罪**。"},
21560:{"w":"tranquility","e":"Tom and Mary lead a life in the village in search of tranquility.","t":"汤姆和玛丽为追求**宁静**而在乡下生活。","r":"联想记忆：tranquil（宁静的）+ity（表名词）→宁静"},
21561:{"w":"facilitate","e":"The new strategies have facilitated and improved cooperation and communication between management and staff.","t":"新策略**有助于**员工和管理层之间进行更为有效的合作与沟通。","r":"词根记忆：fac（做）+ilit+ate（使…）→使便利，使容易"},
21562:{"w":"grand","e":"the grand ceremonial buildings of Machu Picchu","t":"马丘比丘**宏伟**的仪式性建筑"},
21563:{"w":"installment","e":"Each installment costs $1, and site visitors are given three options.","t":"每**一集**需付费一美元，网站的浏览者可以通过三种方式支付。","c":"in installment 以分期付款的形式；monthly installments 按月还款"},
21564:{"w":"acumen","e":"Sometimes, organizations with sound financial backing, good product ideas and market acumen underperform and fail to meet shareholders' expectations.","t":"有时，拥有雄厚的资金保障、良好的产品理念和对市场**精准把握**的公司却表现不佳，不能达到股东们的期望。","r":"词根记忆：acu（锐利）+men（表抽象名词）→敏锐；精明"},
21565:{"w":"dissertation","e":"What I'd like to do in this session is to give you the opportunity to ask questions on writing the dissertation.","t":"在这节课，我想做的就是给你们机会就写**专题论文**进行提问。","r":"来自dissert（vi. 论述，写论文）"},
21566:{"w":"heap","e":"The heap of boulders does not fill the space perfectly.","t":"**成堆**的大块鹅卵石不能严丝合缝地填充这个空间。","r":"联想记忆：通过大量（heap）量变一跃（leap）发生质变","c":"heaps of 许多，大量；heap sth. on sth. 在…上放很多…"},
21567:{"w":"blame","e":"The British diet could be partially to blame for the increase in back pain.","t":"英式饮食应为背部疼痛的加重承担部分**责任**。","c":"blame sth. on sb./sth. 把…归咎于…；only have yourself to blame 只能怪你自己"},
21568:{"w":"frame","e":"The tall buildings have been made possible by the development of light steel frames and safe passenger lifts.","t":"轻型钢**框架**和安全客梯的改良使得高层建筑的建造成为可能。","c":"picture frame 相框，画框；frame of mind 心态，心绪","d":"framework（n. 结构，机制）"},
21569:{"w":"symbolism","e":"I have been exploring how well blind people understand the symbolism behind shapes such as hearts that do not directly represent their meaning.","t":"我一直在探索盲人对形状（如心形）背后的**象征意义**的理解程度，这些形状并不直接代表它们自身的意义。"},
21570:{"w":"ascribe","e":"The report ascribes the rise in asthma to the increase in air pollution.","t":"该报告将哮喘的增加**归因于**空气污染。","r":"词根记忆：a（表加强）+scrib（写）+e→把…写上去→把…归因于"},
21571:{"w":"abstract","e":"Thus, we concluded that the blind interpret abstract shapes as sighted people do.","t":"于是，我们得出结论：盲人与视力正常者对**抽象**形状的理解是一样的。","r":"词根记忆：abs（离去）+tract（拉）→拉出→提炼","c":"abstract noun 抽象名词；abstract science 抽象科学","d":"abstracted（adj. 抽象的）；abstraction（n. 抽象概念；抽象化状态）"},
21572:{"w":"disruption","e":"The accident on the main road through the highway caused widespread disruption for car drivers.","t":"公路主干道上的事故给汽车司机带来很大**不便**。"},
21573:{"w":"self-esteem","e":"Sam suffers from low self-esteem and it prevents him from pursuing his goals.","t":"山姆的**自信心**不足，这阻碍了他追求自己的目标。"},
21574:{"w":"literate","e":"Though nearly twenty, Sara was barely literate.","t":"尽管快20岁了，萨拉却几乎一点**读写能力**都没有。","r":"词根记忆：liter（文字）+ate（具有…的）→有读写能力的；有文化的"},
21575:{"w":"extinction","e":"It's a mass extinction, and whether we will ever rebound from the loss is difficult to know.","t":"这是大规模的物种**灭绝**，我们是否能从中恢复还是个未知数。","r":"来自extinct（adj. 灭绝的）"},
21576:{"w":"endanger","e":"Navajo is considered endangered despite having 150,000 speakers.","t":"尽管有15万人使用纳瓦霍语，它还是有**濒临灭绝**的危险。","r":"联想记忆：en（使…）+danger（危险）→危及","y":"imperil（vt. 使陷于危险，危及）"},
21577:{"w":"perception","e":"Your perception and mine are different from the perception of someone who speaks French, for instance.","t":"例如，你的**想法**与我的想法跟那些说法语的人的想法是不一样的。","r":"来自perceive（vt. 感知，觉察）","d":"perceptible（adj. 可以感觉到的，看得出来的）；perceptive（adj. 感知的；有理解力的，有识别力的）"},
21578:{"w":"prediction","e":"A growing interest in cultural identity may prevent the direst predictions from coming true.","t":"日益增长的对文化认同的兴趣可能会阻止最可怕的**预言**成真。"},
21579:{"w":"foster","e":"The old couple have fostered over 60 children during the past ten years.","t":"这对老夫妇在过去的十年间**收养**了60多名儿童。","r":"联想记忆：fost（看作fast，快速的）+er→促进；培养","d":"fosterling（n. 养子，养女）；fosterer（n. 养育者）","y":"nurture（vt. 抚育，教养）；cultivate（vt. 教养，培养）"},
21580:{"w":"ancestral","e":"The family lived at Mary's ancestral home.","t":"一家人住在玛丽的**祖**居里。"},
21581:{"w":"rekindle","e":"In New Zealand, classes for children have slowed the erosion of Maori and rekindled interest in the language.","t":"在新西兰，面向孩子们的课程减缓了毛利语的退化，**重新引起**了人们对这种语言的兴趣。","r":"联想记忆：re（重新）+kindle（点燃）→重新点燃"},
21582:{"w":"revival","e":"A written form is essential for this, so the mere possibility of revival has led many speakers of endangered languages to develop systems of writing where none existed before.","t":"书写形式对这（语言的复兴）非常重要，这一线**复兴**的希望促使一些濒临灭绝的语言的使用者开始开发之前没有的书写体系。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+viv（生命）+al（表行为）→生命重现→复活；复兴"},
21583:{"w":"inevitable","e":"A further escalation of the economic crisis now seems inevitable.","t":"如今，经济危机的进一步扩大化**在所难免**。","r":"联想记忆：in（不）+evitable（可避免的）→不可避免的","d":"inevitably（adv. 不可避免地，必然地）"},
21584:{"w":"disenchantment","e":"Disenchantment with orthodox medicine has seen the popularity of alternative therapies in Australia climb steadily during the past 20 years.","t":"过去的20年中，在澳大利亚，人们对传统医学的**失望**促进了替代医学的日益流行。"},
21585:{"w":"acupuncture","e":"Acupuncture is a kind of Chinese method of treating pain and illness using special thin needles.","t":"**针灸**是一种中医疗法，通过使用特殊的细针来治疗病痛。"},
21586:{"w":"loath","e":"We've had a tradition of doctors being fairly powerful and I guess they are pretty loath to allow any pretenders to their position to come into it.","t":"我们的固有观念是医生一定非常强势，我想他们一定非常**不愿意**让任何觊觎者达到他们的地位。","c":"nothing loath 很愿意，很高兴"},
21587:{"w":"orthodox","e":"In many other industrialised countries, orthodox and alternative medicine have worked “hand in glove” for years.","t":"在其他的工业化国家里，**传统**医学与替代医学已经紧密结合多年了。","r":"词根记忆：ortho（正）+dox（观点）→正统观点的→正统的","c":"orthodox views 传统观念","d":"orthodoxy（n. 正统观念）","y":"conventional（adj. 传统的）；customary（adj. 习惯的，惯例的）"},
21588:{"w":"popularity","e":"There is an increasing popularity of organic food these days.","t":"现在有机食品越来越**流行**了。","r":"联想记忆：popular（流行）+ity→流行"},
21589:{"w":"amplify","e":"Let me amplify so that you will understand the overall problem.","t":"让我来**详细解释**一下，这样你就会理解整个问题了。","r":"词根记忆：ampl（大）+ify（使…）→放大","y":"expand（v. 使膨胀；扩张）；increase（v. 增加）","f":"deflate（vt. 放气；使缩小）；shrink（v. 缩小）"},
21590:{"w":"reliance","e":"Long-term reliance on sleeping pills is dangerous.","t":"长期**依赖**安眠药是危险的。","y":"trust（n. 信任，信赖）；dependence（n. 信任，信赖）","f":"distrust（n. 不信任）"},
21591:{"w":"nightmare","e":"Traveling on the bad mountain roads is a nightmare.","t":"在崎岖的山路上旅行真是件**可怕的事**。"},
21592:{"w":"leap","e":"The athlete tensed his muscles for the leap.","t":"运动员绷紧肌肉准备**跳跃**。"},
21593:{"w":"conscious","e":"Deep inside he was conscious that music was not his destiny.","t":"在内心深处，他**知道**音乐并不是自己的归宿。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+sci（知道）+ous（…的）→共同知道的→自觉的；意识到的"},
21594:{"w":"divine","e":"To early man, fire was a divine gift delivered in the form of lightning, forest fire or burning lava.","t":"对早期的人类来说，火是伴随着闪电、森林大火或是燃烧的岩浆而来的**神赐**之物。"},
21595:{"w":"decompose","e":"Earthworms decompose the dung further to provide essential soil nutrients.","t":"蚯蚓将粪便进一步**分解**，给土壤提供了重要的养分。","r":"联想记忆：de（离开）+compose（组成）→把组合在一起的东西分开→分解"},
21596:{"w":"investigate","e":"We must investigate and understand the link between environment and health.","t":"我们必须**研究**并了解环境与健康之间的联系。","r":"联想记忆：invest（投资）+i+gate（大门）→先进行市场调查是通往投资的大门→调查"},
21597:{"w":"underneath","e":"Each of the 900 pillars of this building can be individually jacked up, allowing wedges to be added underneath.","t":"这座建筑的900根柱子都可以分别托起以便**在下面**放入楔子。"},
21598:{"w":"division","e":"The study covered 500 clerical employees in four parallel divisions.","t":"这一研究涉及四个平行**部门**的500名文员。","r":"词根记忆：di（分开）+vis（看）+ion→看出不同→分歧","c":"division of labour 分工","d":"divisional（adj. 分开的）"},
21599:{"w":"gamble","e":"Bob might show up on time, but I wouldn't gamble on it.","t":"鲍勃也许会准时露面，但我不想**冒这个险**。","r":"联想记忆：gamb（看作game，游戏）+le→赌博可不仅仅是小小的游戏→赌博","c":"gamble away 赌博输掉；gambling house 赌场；gamble on把…押在…上；投机；碰运气","y":"bet（v. 打赌，赌博）；wager（v. 打赌；赌博）；stake（vt. 以…打赌，拿…冒险）"},
21600:{"w":"ancient","e":"The ancient Greeks used lenses to concentrate the sun's rays on dry leaves to light fire.","t":"**古**希腊人用透镜将太阳光聚集在干树叶上生火。","r":"发音记忆：“安神的”→那古老的旋律让人心安神宁→古老的","y":"antique（adj. 古老的）","f":"modern（adj. 现代的）"},
21601:{"w":"strand","e":"There are three distinct strands to Sports Studies and you would need to choose fairly early on just which direction you wanted to follow.","t":"运动研究有三个不同的**分支**，你需要尽早确定研究方向。","y":"string（n. 线，细绳）；thread（n. 线，细丝）"},
21602:{"w":"specimen","e":"Anton is observing the specimen with a magnifying glass.","t":"安东正在用放大镜观察这个**标本**。"},
21603:{"w":"motive","e":"The police couldn't find a motive for the murder.","t":"警方未能找出这起谋杀的**动机**。","r":"词根记忆：mot（动）+ive→移动的目的→动机，目的"},
21604:{"w":"furious","e":"The furious workers agitated for a strike.","t":"**愤怒**的工人们鼓动罢工。","y":"irate（adj. 暴怒的，愤怒的）；fierce（adj. 强烈的，狂热的）；turbulent（adj. 汹涌的，狂暴的）","f":"meek（adj. 温顺的，驯服的）；calm（adj. 镇静的，平静的）；unperturbed（adj. 宁静的；泰然自若的）"},
21605:{"w":"alternative","e":"The coal industry should be abandoned in favour of alternative energy sources.","t":"应该用其他的**替代**能源来取代煤炭业。","r":"词根记忆：altern（其他的）+ative（有…性质的）→可供替代的","c":"an alternative lifestyle 另一种生活方式","d":"alternatively（adv. 二选一地）"},
21606:{"w":"access","e":"The students could access the Internet in the library.","t":"学生们可以在图书馆**上**网。","r":"词根记忆：ac（表加强）+cess（行走）→一再向前走→进入","c":"access to 接近/进入…的方法/通路，使用…的权利；have/gain access to 可以获得"},
21607:{"w":"exhilaration","e":"Many astronauts have testified that they experienced the exhilaration of weightlessness.","t":"许多宇航员都证实他们体验到了失重的**兴奋感**。"},
21608:{"w":"inland","e":"Today about 90 per cent of inland freight in the United Kingdom is carried by road.","t":"现在，公路承担了英国约90％的**内陆**运输。"},
21609:{"w":"migrate","e":"About half the nation's 2,000 beekeepers migrate north to find more flowers for their bees.","t":"在这个国家的2,000个养蜂人中，约半数人为给蜜蜂找到更多的花而北**迁**。","r":"词根记忆：migr（迁移）+ate→迁徙；移居","d":"migratory（adj. 迁徙的，流浪的）","y":"emigrate（v. 移居国外）；immigrate（v. 移居入境）"},
21610:{"w":"claim","e":"Many people claim they feel better in negatively charged air.","t":"很多人**称**处在富含负离子的空气中让他们感觉更舒服。","r":"本身为词根，意为“大声呼喊”→要求；声称","c":"lay claim to 对…提出所有权要求；make/put forward a claim to sth. 提出要得到某物；claim to do sth. 声称要做某事"},
21611:{"w":"digest","e":"Chemists were searching for a fat that could be digested more easily by infants.","t":"药剂师们正在寻找一种婴儿能更容易**消化**的脂肪。","r":"词根记忆：di（分开）+gest（带来）→带下去→消化","y":"absorb（vt. 吸收，吸引）；comprehend（v. 领会，理解）"},
21612:{"w":"decipher","e":"The scientists use the techniques to decipher disorder-related genes.","t":"科学家使用这些技术，成功**破解**了与（遗传）紊乱有关的基因。","r":"联想记忆：de（去掉）+cipher（密码）→解开密码→破译"},
21613:{"w":"extraordinary","e":"It's extraordinary that he managed to sleep through the party.","t":"真**想不到**他竟然从聚会一开始一直睡到结束。","r":"组合词：extra（以外的）+ordinary（平常的）→平常之外的→不同寻常的，非凡的"},
21614:{"w":"stale","e":"There was a smell of stale vegetables in the air.","t":"空气中有一股**不新鲜**的蔬菜的味道。","y":"obsolete（adj. 陈旧的，废弃的）"},
21615:{"w":"tan","e":"These shoes are tan, not dark brown.","t":"这些鞋是**棕褐色**的，不是深褐色的。","y":"sunburn（n./v. 晒黑）"},
21616:{"w":"impair","e":"The performance of divers will be impaired if they work in cold water.","t":"如果在冷水中工作，潜水员的工作效率会**降低**。","r":"词根记忆：im（不）+pair（=par，准备）→损害","c":"impair one's health 损害健康","y":"injure（vt. 伤害，损害，损伤）；undermine（vt. 削弱，破坏）","f":"strengthen（v. 加强，巩固）；improve（v. 改进，改善）"},
21617:{"w":"inescapable","e":"The role of governments in environmental management is difficult but inescapable.","t":"政府在环境管理方面担负的任务很艰巨，但这是它们**无法推卸**的。"},
21618:{"w":"adolescent","e":"The adolescent always respects parents who admit their mistakes.","t":"**青少年**往往尊敬能承认错误的父母。","r":"联想记忆：adol（看作adult，成年人）+esc（计算机上退出键）+ent（表人）→好想从成年人退回到青少年→青少年","c":"an adolescent girl 一个妙龄少女"},
21619:{"w":"associate","e":"People always associate noise with headaches, and for most of us excessive noise creates the conditions for a headache.","t":"人们总是把噪音和头痛**联系**在一起，对于我们大多数人来说，过多的噪音是引起头痛的原因。","r":"词根记忆：as（表加强）+soci（社会）+ate（使…）→成为一个社会→使联合","c":"associate with 和…相关，联合；business associate 商业伙伴；associate professor 副教授","y":"combine（v. 结合，联合）；join（v. 加入，结合）"},
21620:{"w":"layer","e":"Between the islands there was a layer of soft mud.","t":"在小岛之间有一**层**软泥。","r":"联想记忆：lay（层面）+er→层，层次"},
21621:{"w":"cable","e":"The street is blocked off because workers are laying telephone cables.","t":"因为工作人员正在铺设电话**线**，所以这条街被封锁了。","r":"联想记忆：他在工作台（table）上夜以继日地研究电缆（cable）","c":"underground cables 地下电缆"},
21622:{"w":"wedge","e":"The window doesn't stay closed unless you wedge it.","t":"这扇窗关不严，除非用楔子**楔上**。","r":"联想记忆：楔子（wedge）的边缘（edge）很尖锐"},
21623:{"w":"historian","e":"Most historians of technology credit the Chinese with the discovery of gunpowder.","t":"大多数技术**历史学家**认为是中国人发明了火药。"},
21624:{"w":"fancy","e":"Maureen tiptoed around the room in her fancy shoes.","t":"莫林穿上她那双**精致**的鞋，踮着脚尖在房间里走来走去。","r":"联想记忆：fan（迷，狂热者）+cy→着迷（的事）→喜欢，想要；爱好"},
21625:{"w":"judicious","e":"Archaeology makes clear that with judicious management selected parts of the region could support more people than anyone thought before.","t":"考古学解释说，利用**明智**的管理方法，所选地区能够养活的人数能比以往任何人所能想象的都多。","r":"词根记忆：judici（判断）+ous（…的）→具有判断力的→明智的；有见识的"},
21626:{"w":"landfill","e":"Sand was driven into the seabed to strengthen it before the landfill was piled on top.","t":"沙子被运到海床，在**垃圾**被堆在海床上之前对其进行加固。","r":"组合词：land（地）+fill（充满）→堆满垃圾的地方→垃圾堆","c":"landfill site 垃圾掩埋地点"},
21627:{"w":"cast","e":"When we finally stop at the centre of an aisle, we pause and take stock, casting our eyes along the length of it.","t":"我们最后到了过道的中间，停下来评估过道的状况，**目测**其长度。","c":"cast iron 铸铁"},
21628:{"w":"uniform","e":"Traditionally uniforms were manufactured to protect the workers.","t":"传统上，生产**制服**的目的是保护工人。","r":"词根记忆：uni（单一）+form（形状）→单一形状的→相同的，一致的","c":"in uniform 穿着制服的","d":"uniformity（n. 同样，一致）"},
21629:{"w":"longitudinal","e":"A longitudinal study of nurses working in two Canadian hospitals examined the reasons why nurses took absence from work.","t":"在对两家加拿大医院的护士进行了**纵向**调查后，他们发现了护士旷工的原因。","r":"联想记忆：和latitudinal（adj. 纬度的）一起记"},
21630:{"w":"disillusion","e":"A better educated and less accepting public has become disillusioned with the experts in general.","t":"受教育水平更高而更为挑剔的公众一般来说对专家已**不再抱有幻想**。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+illusion（幻想）→不要再幻想了，快醒醒吧→使醒悟"},
21631:{"w":"clientele","e":"If they see potential clientele going elsewhere, they might want to be able to offer a similar service.","t":"如果他们看到一位潜在**客户**去了别处，他们应该希望能提供一种相似的服务。"},
21632:{"w":"holistic","e":"Usually, the holistic solutions are required for the environment problems.","t":"通常来说，环境问题需要**整体性**的解决方案。","c":"holistic medicine 整体医学"},
21633:{"w":"exodus","e":"There is a mass exodus of workers from the villages to the towns in this country.","t":"该国有大批工人从乡村**涌向**城市。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+od（道路）+us→走上外出的道路→大批离去"},
21634:{"w":"concur","e":"He concurs that orthodox doctors could learn a lot about bedside manner and advising patients on preventative health from alternative therapists.","t":"他**认同**这种观点：传统医生在对待病人的态度、举止上以及如何给予病人预防保健的建议上可以从替代疗法专家那里学到很多。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+cur（发生）→同时发生"},
21635:{"w":"preventative","e":"It is possible that the police were able to take preventative action and avoid a possible riot.","t":"警察能够采取一些**预防**措施以避免可能发生的暴动，这是可能的。"},
21636:{"w":"complementary","e":"The survey suggested that complementary medicine is probably a better term than alternative medicine.","t":"调查显示，比起替代医学，**辅助性**医学这一术语可能更加恰当。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+ple（满的）+ment+ary（…的）→填满的→互补的；补充的"},
21637:{"w":"adjunct","e":"Alternative medicine appears to be an adjunct, sought in times of disenchantment when conventional medicine seems not to offer the answer.","t":"替代医学似乎变成了一种**附加物**。在传统医学因为无法提供答案而令人倍感失望的时候，人们发现了替代医学。","r":"词根记忆：ad（表加强）+junct（连接）→连在上面的东西→附加物"},
21638:{"w":"simplistic","e":"But a closer inspection reveals this interpretation as too simplistic.","t":"进一步的调查显示，这种解释过于**简单化**了。"},
21639:{"w":"hiccup","e":"We've had a few slight hiccups, but progress has generally been quite steady.","t":"我们遇到过一些小**挫折**，但是总的来说还在稳步前进。"},
21640:{"w":"prowess","e":"He found that the way the cats played had no significant effect on their hunting prowess in later life.","t":"他发现，猫咪的玩耍方式对它日后的捕猎**技能**没有重大的影响。","r":"联想记忆：prow（英勇的）+ess→杰出的才能"},
21641:{"w":"engross","e":"As the number of students grew, it totally engrossed him.","t":"随着学生人数的增多，他**全身心投入**了这项工作。","r":"联想记忆：en（进入）+gross（总的）→全身心进入一种状态→使全神贯注"},
21642:{"w":"tease","e":"I used to get teased about my name until I changed it last year.","t":"在去年我改了名字之前，别人总**笑话**我的名字。","r":"联想记忆：tea（茶）+se→以茶代酒，戏弄别人→揶揄，戏弄","c":"tease sth. out 探讨，深入研究","y":"kid（v. 开玩笑，取笑）；toy（vi. 玩弄）"},
21643:{"w":"exuberant","e":"After the spring rains, the hillside was covered with exuberant vegetation, attracting many birds and insects.","t":"春雨过后，山坡上长满了**繁茂**的草木，吸引了许多鸟类和昆虫。","c":"exuberant imagination 丰富的想象力"},
21644:{"w":"cavort","e":"Playful young animals use around two or three percent of their energy cavorting, and in children that figure can be close to fifteen percent.","t":"动物幼崽会花费2%~3%的精力去**玩**，而小孩子会花去近15%。","r":"发音记忆：“渴望他”→看到他便兴奋得跳跃→跳跃"},
21645:{"w":"socialise","e":"One worry is that kids who spend a lot of time online at home are sometimes unable to socialise properly with other children when they are at school.","t":"一个令人担忧的问题是，在家里花大量时间上网的孩子在上学的时候，有时无法与其他孩子进行适当的**社交**。","c":"socialised medicine 公费医疗制度；socialise with 与…来往"},
21646:{"w":"optimum","e":"The optimum time for playing would depend on when it was most advantageous for the young of a particular species to do so.","t":"玩耍的**最佳**时间取决于何时玩耍对某一特定物种的幼崽最为有利。","r":"词根记忆：optim（最好）+um→最好的","y":"optimal（adj. 最佳的，最理想的）；ideal（adj. 理想的，完美的）"},
21647:{"w":"creative","e":"We give this system to save children the trouble of developing these creative skills.","t":"我们提供这套系统，为孩子们省去了发展这些**创造性**技巧的麻烦。"},
21648:{"w":"molecule","e":"Watson demonstrated the structure of the DNA molecule.","t":"沃森展示了DNA的**分子**结构。","r":"联想记忆：mol（摩尔）+ecule→分子"},
21649:{"w":"fitness","e":"Specific behaviours which were seen to increase risk of disease, such as smoking, lack of fitness and unhealthy eating habits, were targeted.","t":"一些被认为会加大疾病威胁的特定行为成为攻击的目标，如吸烟、缺少**锻炼**和不健康的饮食习惯。","r":"联想记忆：fit（健康的）+ness（表名词）→健康"},
21650:{"w":"regarding","e":"You are allowed to ask questions regarding the fees you are paying.","t":"你们可以**就**自己的付费问题进行提问。","r":"联想记忆：regard（关心）+ing→关于"},
21651:{"w":"contact","e":"For further details, contact Mr. Smith, please.","t":"欲知详情，请与史密斯先生**联系**。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+tact（接触）→接触","c":"contact list 联系人清单；eye contact 目光交流；in contact with sb. 与某人保持联系；come into contact with sb. 接触某人；contact lens 隐形眼镜"},
21652:{"w":"consultant","e":"Marketing consultants have been gathering information about customers' shopping habits.","t":"市场**顾问**一直在收集有关消费者购物习惯的资料。","r":"联想记忆：consult（请教；查阅）+ant（表人）→供咨询的人→顾问","c":"school consultant 校方顾问；legal consultant 司法顾问；study abroad consultant 留学顾问"},
21653:{"w":"secondary","e":"It took us three hours to decide the primary and secondary targets of this term.","t":"我们花了三个小时才确定了这个学期的主要目标和**次要**目标。","r":"联想记忆：来自second（num. 第二）","c":"be secondary to 仅次于…；secondary school 中学","d":"secondarily（adv. 在第二，其次，在第二位）"},
21654:{"w":"fraction","e":"The little boy has done only a fraction of his homework.","t":"那小男孩只做了**一小部分**家庭作业。","r":"词根记忆：fract（破碎）+ion→碎的部分→小部分，片断","c":"a fraction closer 稍微靠近一点；a fraction of 一小部分","d":"fractional（adj. 很少的，微不足道的）"},
21655:{"w":"dictation","e":"If you plan to take examinations, there are dictation and listening comprehension cassettes for you to practise with.","t":"如果你打算参加考试，这里有**听写**和听力理解的录音带可供你练习。"},
21656:{"w":"engage","e":"Try to find humour in life and engage in activities that make you happy.","t":"试着从生活中寻找乐趣，**参与**那些使你快乐的活动。","c":"engage in doing sth. 从事于…"},
21657:{"w":"populate","e":"The dinosaurs used to populate the earth.","t":"恐龙曾经**生活**在地球上。","r":"词根记忆：popul（人民）+ate（使…）→使人民在某处→（大批地）居住于"},
21658:{"w":"merchandising","e":"Their activities of merchandising did not provide sufficient funds for them.","t":"他们的**销售**活动并没有给他们带来足够的资金。"},
21659:{"w":"meteorology","e":"The diagram shows how the Australian Bureau of Meteorology collects up-to-the-minute information on the weather.","t":"该图表显示了澳大利亚**气象**局如何收集最新天气信息。","r":"联想记忆：meteor（流星；大气现象）+ology（…学）→气象学"},
21660:{"w":"dealer","e":"The collector bought antiques from a local dealer.","t":"收藏家从一个当地**商人**那里买了些古董。","r":"联想记忆：deal（交易）+er（表人）→进行交易的人→商人"},
21661:{"w":"authorise","e":"When an authorised user wishes to enter or use the facility, the system scans the person's corresponding characteristics and attempts to match them against those on record.","t":"被**授权**的用户如果想进入或使用这一工具，系统会对其相应的特征进行扫描并与记录里的资料进行核对。","d":"unauthorised（adj. 未经授权的，未批准的）；authoritative（adj. 权威性的；命令式的）"},
21662:{"w":"spectator","e":"The spectators, as well as the participants, of the ancient Olympics were all male.","t":"古代奥林匹克运动会的**观众**和运动员全都是男性。","r":"词根记忆：spect（看）+ator（表人）→观众；旁观者","c":"spectator sport 吸引很多观众的体育项目"},
21663:{"w":"compatriot","e":"In France, Bob bumped into a compatriot from Denver.","t":"鲍勃在法国偶遇了来自丹佛的**同胞**。","r":"联想记忆：他的同伴（companion）跟他是同一个国家的人（compatriot）"},
21664:{"w":"dreadful","e":"He became an orphan after the dreadful disaster.","t":"那场**可怕**的灾难后他就成了孤儿。"},
21665:{"w":"shuttle","e":"The shuttle can carry devices for scientific inquiry.","t":"这架**航天飞机**能携带科学考察装置。","r":"联想记忆：shut（关）+tle→封闭的空间→航天飞机"},
21666:{"w":"entail","e":"The work entailed the processing of accounts and generating of invoices.","t":"这份工作**需要**处理账目和开具发票。","r":"联想记忆：en+tail（尾巴）→被人抓住尾巴→牵涉"},
21667:{"w":"contrary","e":"Contrary to what you might imagine, the size of the cycle is not determined by the size of the wheels, but by the size of the frame.","t":"与你可能想象的**相反**，自行车的大小不是由车轮的尺寸决定的，而是由车架的大小决定的。","r":"词根记忆：contra（相反）+ry（…的）→相反的","c":"to the contrary 反之，正相反；on the contrary反之，正相反；contrary to 与…相反；quite the contrary 恰恰相反；contrary opinions 相反的观点"},
21668:{"w":"alert","e":"Troops in the Philippines have been put on full alert in anticipation of trouble during a planned general strike.","t":"预期在计划的总罢工期间会有麻烦，菲律宾的军队已处于完全**戒备**状态。","r":"联想记忆：Red Alert“红色警戒”，20世纪90年代风靡全球的电脑游戏"},
21669:{"w":"shift","e":"Fishermen protested, and the port was shifted a further five kilometres to the south.","t":"由于渔民的反对，港口又向南**移**了五公里。","r":"联想记忆：电脑键盘上的切换键即Shift键"},
21670:{"w":"mere","e":"Mere denunciation will not solve this great problem.","t":"**仅仅**靠谴责是解决不了这个大问题的。","r":"联想记忆：仅仅（mere）在这儿（here）徘徊是不行的"},
21671:{"w":"monitor","e":"Some worry that governments and industry will be tempted to use the technology to monitor individual behaviour.","t":"有人担心政府和企业会企图利用这项技术来**监控**个人行为。","r":"词根记忆：mon（警告）+itor（表人）→给你警告的人→班长"},
21672:{"w":"derive","e":"France derives three quarters of its electricity from nuclear power.","t":"法国四分之三的电力**来自**核能。","r":"联想记忆：de+rive(r)→黄河流域是中华文明的发源地→起源","c":"derive from 源自"},
21673:{"w":"desire","e":"Many old folks desire to learn English in China.","t":"在中国，很多老年人都**想**学英语。","r":"联想记忆：A Street Car Named Desire 电影《欲望号街车》","c":"a strong desire to do sth. 做…的强烈愿望","d":"desirable（adj. 理想的；可取的）"},
21674:{"w":"minimal","e":"The new couple stayed with their parents, so their expenses were minimal.","t":"这对新婚夫妇和父母住在一起，所以他们的花费**最少**。","r":"词根记忆：min（小）+imal→最小的","f":"maximum（adj. 最大的，最大限度的）"},
21675:{"w":"sketch","e":"He quickly sketched the view from the window.","t":"他很快**勾勒**出了窗外的风景。"},
21676:{"w":"lag","e":"Western banks still lag behind financial institutions in most other regions of the country.","t":"西部地区的银行仍然**落后**于这个国家其他大部分地区的金融机构。","r":"联想记忆：leg（腿）中间的零件e换成a了→腿坏了→走得慢","c":"time lag 时滞，时间间隔；jet lag 时差，时差反应"},
21677:{"w":"trigger","e":"The earthquake triggered an avalanche.","t":"地震**引发**了一场雪崩。","c":"trigger a war 引发战争","y":"stimulus（n. 刺激物）；initiate（vt. 发起，开始）；cause（vt. 引起，导致）"},
21678:{"w":"supplement","e":"A student loan is intended to supplement living costs of students.","t":"学生贷款旨在**补贴**学生的生活费用。","r":"联想记忆：supple（看作supply，补给）+ment→增补，补充","c":"supplement to 对…的补充；vitamin supplements 维生素补充剂"},
21679:{"w":"offend","e":"You should remind yourself not to offend against the customs when you are in the minority region.","t":"当你在少数民族地区的时候，要提醒自己不要**冒犯**当地的风俗。","r":"联想记忆：off（离开）+end（最后）→他感觉被冒犯了，最后离开了→冒犯","d":"offence（n. 犯规；冒犯）；offensive（adj. 冒犯的；攻击性的）"},
21680:{"w":"vivid","e":"The photos depicted vivid scenes of a suffragette's life.","t":"这些照片**生动**地表现了一名妇女参政论者的生活。","r":"词根记忆：viv（生命）+id（…的）→有生命力的→生动的"},
21681:{"w":"enclose","e":"The farmer enclosed his land and kept cattle away from his crops.","t":"农民在田地四周**筑起围栏**，以使牛群远离庄稼。","r":"联想记忆：en（进入）+close（关闭）→关闭在里面→围住","d":"enclosure（n. 围栏；附件）"},
21682:{"w":"dose","e":"Nick injected the dog with a strong dose of morphine.","t":"尼克给狗注射了**一剂**强效吗啡。","r":"联想记忆：玫瑰（rose）对生气中的女孩是一剂（dose）良药"},
21683:{"w":"supply","e":"Underground water sources in Australia supply about 18% of the total water consumption.","t":"澳大利亚用水**供给**的18%来自地下水。","c":"supply sth. to sb. 为某人提供…"},
21684:{"w":"compress","e":"Puffs of compressed air shape the glass.","t":"吹出的**压缩**空气使玻璃成型。","r":"联想记忆：com（表加强）+press（压）→使劲压→压紧；压缩","c":"compress sth. into sth. 把…压缩成…"},
21685:{"w":"interest","e":"Many young people are showing a lot of interest in higher education.","t":"很多年轻人对高等教育很**感兴趣**。"},
21686:{"w":"overcome","e":"I don't believe limited resources and ecological constraints are overcome by personal skills.","t":"我相信个人技术不能**克服**资源有限和生态限制的困难。","r":"来自词组come over（战胜；支配）"},
21687:{"w":"achievement","e":"Winning the national science prize was a remarkable achievement for such a young research team.","t":"对于这样一个年轻的研究团队来说，赢得国家科学奖是一项了不起的**成就**。","r":"来自achieve（v. 达到，完成）","c":"sense of achievement 成就感"},
21688:{"w":"dusk","e":"You can catch a glimpse of some more of the rainforest's wildlife as it comes out at dusk to feed.","t":"**黄昏**时分，当雨林中的野生动物出来觅食时，你能看见更多的野生动物。","r":"联想记忆：她趴在书桌（desk）上看着窗外的黄昏（dusk）"},
21689:{"w":"cease","e":"The music ceased, and the audience broke into applause.","t":"音乐**停**了，观众爆发出热烈的掌声。","r":"联想记忆：c+ease（安逸，安心）→生于忧患，死于安乐→停止，终止"},
21690:{"w":"arable","e":"On the top of the hill, the arable ground has been seeded.","t":"山顶上那片**可耕种**的土地已经播种了。","r":"联想记忆：ar（看作art，技术）+able（能够的）→通过技术认定可耕→可耕作的","c":"arable land 耕地"},
21691:{"w":"congested","e":"Can the world avoid being locked into congested and polluting means of transport?","t":"世界能否避免受**拥挤**而污染的交通方式的困扰？","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+gest（带来）+ed（有…的）→带来很多→拥挤不堪的；充塞的","d":"congestion（n. 拥挤，拥堵）"},
21692:{"w":"split","e":"The party split up into several groups.","t":"这个党派**分裂**成几个集团。","r":"发音记忆：“撕劈了它”→劈开→分裂","c":"split into 分成，分开；split from/with sb. 与某人断绝关系，离开某人"},
21693:{"w":"linger","e":"The children lingered at the zoo until closing time.","t":"动物园关门时孩子们才**恋恋不舍**地离去。"},
21694:{"w":"distinct","e":"Why do humans, alone among all animal species, display a distinct left- or right-handedness?","t":"为什么唯独人类和其他动物不一样，会出现**独特**的惯用左手或右手现象呢？","r":"词根记忆：di+stinct（刺）→刺眼的→明显的","c":"be distinct from 与…截然不同；a distinct minority 明显的少数","d":"distinctive（adj. 独特的）；distinction（n. 差别，不同）"},
21695:{"w":"negotiate","e":"By no means does everyone in the world know English well enough to negotiate in it.","t":"要让世界上每个人的英语都好得可以用它来进行**谈判**是不可能的。"},
21696:{"w":"cruel","e":"The anthropologist concluded that the tribesmen were unusually aggressive and cruel.","t":"人类学家得出结论，这个部落的人侵略成性，无比**凶残**。","r":"发音记忆：“刻肉”→残忍的，残暴的","c":"be cruel to 对…残忍"},
21697:{"w":"womb","e":"Foetuses can be tested while in the womb.","t":"胎儿在**子宫**里的时候可以进行检查。","r":"联想记忆：生命的过程就是从子宫（womb）到坟墓（tomb）"},
21698:{"w":"advantageous","e":"A free trade agreement would be advantageous to both countries.","t":"自由贸易协议对两国都**有益处**。","r":"来自advantage（n. 益处，好处）"},
21699:{"w":"manoeuvre","e":"We will be asked to perform some standard manoeuvres during the driving test.","t":"驾照考试会要求我们做一些标准的**操作**。"},
21700:{"w":"predatory","e":"The eagle is a kind of cruel predatory bird which kills its prey with its claws.","t":"鹰是一种残忍的**食肉**鸟类，它用锋利的爪子捕杀猎物。","r":"联想记忆：predator（掠夺者）+y（有…性质的）→掠夺的"},
21701:{"w":"converse","e":"The converse was also found to be true.","t":"**反之**同样成立。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+vers（转）+e→一起转向→交谈，会谈","d":"conversation（n. 交谈，谈话）"},
21702:{"w":"context","e":"You can guess the meaning of the word from the context.","t":"你可以根据**上下文**猜出这个词的意思。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+text（编织）→共同编织在一起→上下文","d":"contextual（adj. 根据上下文的）"},
21703:{"w":"entrepreneurial","e":"The provision of small loans to support the entrepreneurial dreams and ambitions of youth can be an effective means to help them change their lives.","t":"小额贷款为年轻人的**创业**梦想与雄心提供支持，可以成为帮助他们改变人生的有效方式。"},
21704:{"w":"dearth","e":"There is a dearth of good young players at the moment.","t":"目前优秀的年轻选手**太少**了。","r":"联想记忆：dear（珍贵的）+th→物以稀为贵→缺乏，短缺","c":"a dearth of water 缺水"},
21705:{"w":"adventurous","e":"The street may be attractive to children as a place to find adventurous play.","t":"这条街应该对孩子们非常具有吸引力，他们可以在这里找到**惊险刺激**的游戏。"},
21706:{"w":"exploitative","e":"It is also a place where some children are exposed, with little or no protection, to exploitative employment.","t":"在这里有的孩子只能得到些许保护或根本没有保护，被雇主**无情压榨**。"},
21707:{"w":"impoverish","e":"Excessive farming had impoverished the soil here.","t":"过度耕种使得这里的土地变得**贫瘠**了。","r":"词根记忆：im（使…）+pover（贫困）+ish（使…）→使进入贫困→使贫困"},
21708:{"w":"convection","e":"The flow, thought to be in the form of convection currents, is powerful enough to fracture the “eggshell” of the crust into plates.","t":"这股水流，人们认为其呈**对流**的形式，其能量足以将地壳表面如“蛋壳”的坚硬物质冲破成板块。"},
21709:{"w":"plateau","e":"In the Deccan Plateau in Western India, there are more than two million cubic kilometers of lava.","t":"在印度西部的德干**高原**，有超过200万立方公里的熔岩。","r":"联想记忆：plat（平）+eau→高出平地的地→高原"},
21710:{"w":"crust","e":"Tectonic plates are the plates which make up the earth's crust and mantle.","t":"构造板块是指构成地球**地壳**及地幔的板块。","r":"联想记忆：可与crush（v. 压碎）一起记","d":"crusty（adj. 有脆皮的；脾气暴躁的）"},
21711:{"w":"overlie","e":"It is recognized by the public that overlying the beach is very comfortable.","t":"大家公认**躺在**海滩上很舒服。","r":"组合词：over（在…上面）+lie（躺；放）→躺在…上面；置于…上面"},
21712:{"w":"brittle","e":"The heritage antiques are brittle with age.","t":"这些古董年代久远，极其**易碎**。","r":"联想记忆：br（看作break，打破）+ittle（看作little，小的）→打破成小块→易碎的","c":"brittle temper 易发怒的脾气，急脾气","d":"brittleness（n. 脆弱）"},
21713:{"w":"collision","e":"These fracture zones, where the collisions occur, are where earthquakes happen.","t":"这些断裂带是**碰撞**发生的地方，也是地震发生区。","r":"来自collide（vi. 冲撞）"},
21714:{"w":"extrusion","e":"Vast bubbles of magma—molten rock from the mantle—inch towards the surface, cooling slowly, to show through as granite extrusion.","t":"岩浆，也就是熔岩，鼓着巨大的泡泡从地幔中涌向表面，慢慢冷却，看上去就像经过**挤压**后的花岗岩。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+trus（推）+ion→挤出"},
21715:{"w":"pumice","e":"Is the pumice light and full of the holes?","t":"**浮岩**是既轻又密布坑洞的吗？"},
21716:{"w":"predictable","e":"But volcanoes are not very predictable.","t":"但是火山爆发很难**预测**。"},
21717:{"w":"geological","e":"A geological survey shows that there will be an earthquake in the south part of the country.","t":"**地质学**调查显示该国南部地区将有一次地震发生。","r":"词根记忆：ge(o)（地）+ological（…学的）→地质学的","c":"geological textbook 地质学教科书"},
21718:{"w":"halve","e":"A development of 194 houses would take up 14 hectares of land above ground and occupy 2.7 hectares below it, while the number of roads would be halved.","t":"建造194栋房子要占用14公顷的地上面积和2.7公顷的地下面积，而道路的数量则会**减半**。"},
21719:{"w":"assimilate","e":"We assimilate some kinds of food more easily than others.","t":"和其他食物相比，有些食物更容易被**吸收**。","r":"词根记忆：as（表加强）+simil（一样）+ate（使…）→使成为一样→使同化","y":"absorb（vt. 吸收）；digest（v. 消化）"},
21720:{"w":"harbour","e":"A port must be distinguished from a harbour.","t":"港口和**港湾**在概念上必须区分开来。","r":"发音记忆：“哈勃”→哈勃望远镜停泊在太空中→停泊"},
21721:{"w":"hybrid","e":"They suggest small low-emission cars for urban use and larger hybrid or lean-burn cars for use elsewhere.","t":"他们建议在城市中使用低排量的小型车，而将那些较大的**混合动力**汽车和稀燃车应用在其他地方。"},
21722:{"w":"inhale","e":"Sometimes people have to inhale secondhand smoke.","t":"有时候，人们不得不**吸入**二手烟。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+hal（呼吸）+e→吸气","c":"inhale the cigarette 吸烟","d":"inhalation（n. 吸入；吸入物）"},
21723:{"w":"decibel","e":"The normal noise threshold for private housing is 55 decibels.","t":"正常情况下私人住宅区的噪音临界点是55**分贝**。","r":"词根记忆：deci（十分之一）+bel（贝尔，为十个分贝）→分贝"},
21724:{"w":"voyage","e":"They made a voyage across the Atlantic.","t":"他们做了一次横越大西洋的**航行**。","r":"词根记忆：voy（道路）+age→旅行，航行","c":"maiden voyage 首航；voyage of discovery 发现之旅；first voyage 第一航程"},
21725:{"w":"contingency","e":"The extra people can cover contingencies, such as when crises take people away from the workplace.","t":"编外人员可以弥补**紧急事件**（所造成的职位空缺），如当危急事件使得人们离开工作岗位时。","r":"词根记忆：con+ting（接触）+ency（表行为）→事情都碰在一起了→意外事件"},
21726:{"w":"relieve","e":"These tablets are used to help relieve hay fever and symptoms due to allergies.","t":"这些药片用于**缓解**花粉热及其他因过敏引发的症状。","d":"relief（n. 救济；缓解）"},
21727:{"w":"stance","e":"Can you feel how much more comfortable a relaxed stance is?","t":"以这样一种放松的**姿势**，你能感觉舒适多了吗？","r":"词根记忆：stan（站）+ce→站姿→姿势"},
21728:{"w":"conduct","e":"Some experiments are conducted by this professor and others are not.","t":"有些实验是这位教授**指导**的，有些不是。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+duct（引导）→指导","c":"conduct oneself（行为）表现"},
21729:{"w":"mate","e":"Many seabirds return to the same island every year to mate and raise their young.","t":"许多海鸟每年都会回到同一个岛上**交配**并养育后代。","r":"联想记忆：配偶（mate）相互为对方铺垫子（mat）","c":"soul mate 灵魂伴侣；性情相投的人"},
21730:{"w":"attack","e":"Passive smoking causes between 30,000 and 60,000 deaths from heart attacks each year in the United States.","t":"在美国，被动吸烟每年导致三到六万人死于心脏病**发作**。","r":"联想记忆：at（表加强）+tack（看作tank，坦克）→用坦克加强进攻→进攻；抨击"},
21731:{"w":"discredit","e":"The ugly gossip would discredit us all.","t":"恶毒的流言蜚语会使我们所有人**丧失信誉**。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+credit（信任）→不信任→使怀疑"},
21732:{"w":"flora","e":"The theme of the meeting is the protection of native flora and fauna.","t":"本次会议以保护当地动**植物**为主题。","r":"联想记忆：希腊神话里的花神名叫弗洛拉（Flora）","c":"flora and fauna 动植物","d":"floral（adj. 花的；有花卉图案的）"},
21733:{"w":"mass","e":"Mass use of motor vehicles has killed or injured millions of people.","t":"机动车的**大量**使用已造成数百万人伤亡。","r":"联想记忆：和less（adj. 少的）一起记","c":"mass production 大规模生产"},
21734:{"w":"anticipate","e":"We need someone who can anticipate and respond to changes in the fashion industry.","t":"我们需要一个能**预见**时装业变化并能应对这些变化的人。","r":"词根记忆：anti（=ante，前面）+cip（拿）+ate（做）→在…之前取得→先于…行动","c":"anticipate doing sth. 期待做某事","d":"anticipation（n. 预料）"},
21735:{"w":"operate","e":"The lift didn't operate.","t":"电梯不**运转**了。","c":"operate a tutorial system 开设一个辅导系统；operating cost 经营费用"},
21736:{"w":"bypass","e":"If we take the bypass, we'll avoid the town centre.","t":"我们走**旁道**的话，就能绕开镇中心。","r":"来自词组pass by（经过）","y":"circumvent（vt. 绕行，避开）"},
21737:{"w":"undetected","e":"The family had managed to live undetected for six years outside the border town of Breda, Holland.","t":"这一家人成功地在荷兰布雷达这个边镇外度过了六年**不为人知**的生活。","r":"联想记忆：un（不）+detect（发现）+ed→未被发现的"},
21738:{"w":"shaft","e":"A small iron was attached to the bamboo shaft as a weapon.","t":"小铁块被固定在竹**竿**上作为一件武器。","r":"联想记忆：变速杆（shaft）用来改变（shift）速度","y":"spindle（n. 轴，杆）；beam〔n.（光线的）束〕"},
21739:{"w":"channel","e":"We're doing some market research for a new television channel starting in two years' time.","t":"我们正在为日后两年内开通一个新的电视**频道**做市场调查。","r":"联想记忆：卫视音乐台就是Channel V","c":"the English Channel 英吉利海峡"},
21740:{"w":"determine","e":"Before enrollment, students must take a test to determine the level of class they enter.","t":"入学前，学生必须参加入学考试来**确定**他们进入何种等级的班级。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+termin（界限）+e→加强界限→决定"},
21741:{"w":"dominate","e":"Cities cease to be port cities when other functions dominate.","t":"当城市的其他功能**占统治地位**时，它就不再是港口城市了。","r":"词根记忆：domin（=dom，控制）+ate→紧紧控制→支配，统治"},
21742:{"w":"instrumental","e":"Doctors have been instrumental in improving living standards in Western society.","t":"在西方社会，医生在提高人们生活质量方面一直发挥着**重要作用**。","r":"来自instrument（n. 手段；器具）"},
21743:{"w":"load","e":"Our camera could be loaded in daylight.","t":"我们的相机可以在日光下**装**胶卷。"},
21744:{"w":"improve","e":"In an English course with Atlas English Language College, you improve your language skills and make friends from all over the world!","t":"在阿特拉斯英语学院的英语课堂，你可以**提高**自己的英语水平，同时结识来自世界各地的朋友！","c":"improve on/upon sth. 改进；做出更好的业绩"},
21745:{"w":"sensitive","e":"The “environmentally sensitive” landscape was threatened by some buildings.","t":"这处“**易受环境影响**的”风景受到了一些建筑物的威胁。","r":"词根记忆：sens（感觉）+itive（有…性质的）→敏感的","d":"sensitivity（n. 敏感，灵敏性）"},
21746:{"w":"abolish","e":"The ancient Olympics were abolished by the Roman Emperor Theodosius in 393 AD, after Greece lost its independence.","t":"在希腊丧失主权之后，罗马皇帝狄奥多西于公元393年**废除**了古代奥林匹克运动会。","y":"annul（vt. 废除，取消）；destroy（vt. 破坏，消灭）"},
21747:{"w":"conception","e":"This book is designed to help Ph.D. students by explaining different conceptions of the research process.","t":"本书旨在通过解释研究过程中出现的不同**概念**来帮助博士生进行学习。","d":"misconception（n. 误解）"},
21748:{"w":"encounter","e":"I encountered a lot of difficulty when I tried to take a rest.","t":"当我打算休息一下时**遇到**了很多麻烦。","r":"联想记忆：en（使…）+counter（相反的）→使从两个相反的方面来→遇到，遭遇","c":"encounter problems 遇到问题"},
21749:{"w":"bubble","e":"The water in the pan was beginning to bubble.","t":"锅里的水开始**冒泡**。","r":"发音记忆：拟声词，指水冒泡的声音","c":"bubble economy 泡沫经济"},
21750:{"w":"sample","e":"The main thing is to make sure we have the right size sample, not too big or too small.","t":"最主要是确保我们有合适的**样本**量，不能太大也不能太小。","r":"联想记忆：简单的（simple）样品（sample）","c":"blood sample 血液样本；size of sample 样本的大小"},
21751:{"w":"qualitative","e":"There is little qualitative improvement in their work.","t":"他们的工作没有什么**实质性**的改进。","r":"联想记忆：qualit(y)（质量）+ative→质量的；定性的"},
21752:{"w":"accountant","e":"The accountant checked the company's financial records carefully before the annual report was published.","t":"在年度报告公布之前，**会计师**仔细核查了公司的财务记录。","r":"联想记忆：account（账目）+ant（表人）→管账的人→会计师","c":"Certified Public Accountant 注册会计师"},
21753:{"w":"storey","e":"To the west of where I'm standing, we can see the construction of a seventeen-storey building.","t":"从我站的地方往西，可以看到一座17**层**的建筑。","r":"联想记忆：可与store（n. 商店）一起记"},
21754:{"w":"gang","e":"A gang of young men attacked the police station with machine guns.","t":"**一群**手持机关枪的年轻人袭击了警察局。"},
21755:{"w":"enterprise","e":"The land can be considered part of the enterprise's assets.","t":"这块土地可以归入该**公司**的资产。","r":"词根记忆：enter（进入）+pris（抓）+e→进入市场，把握先机→企业，公司","c":"backbone enterprise 骨干企业；joint enterprise 合资企业；state enterprise 国有企业"},
21756:{"w":"verify","e":"In some California housing estates, a key alone is insufficient to get someone in the door; his or her voiceprint must also be verified.","t":"在加州的一些住宅区，进入房间仅靠一把钥匙是不够的，还需要**确认**声波纹。","r":"词根记忆：ver（真实）+ify（使…）→使…真实→证明；证实","d":"verification（n. 确认）"},
21757:{"w":"string","e":"When the motor runs, the string will wind up around the shaft.","t":"当发动机开始运转，**细绳**就会绕着把柄卷起来。","r":"联想记忆：st+ring（铃）→一串清脆的铃声→一串","c":"a piece of string 一根带子；shoe string 鞋带"},
21758:{"w":"litter","e":"Cowpats would litter pastures, making grass inedible to cattle and depriving the soil of sunlight.","t":"牛粪会**弄脏**牧草，使草变得不适合牛群食用，也使土壤得不到阳光的照射。","r":"联想记忆：把little的“l”乱丢，错拿成“r”→乱扔","y":"trash（n. 垃圾，废物）；rubbish（n. 垃圾，废物）"},
21759:{"w":"manor","e":"Within the grounds are a Georgian mansion, an Elizabethan dairy and the tower of a medieval manor.","t":"在这片地区，有一所乔治时期的住宅、一个伊丽莎白时期的牛奶场，以及一座中世纪**庄园**的塔楼。","r":"联想记忆：man（人）+or（表物）→人靠自己的力量建立起来的→领地"},
21760:{"w":"location","e":"Which picture shows the correct location of the administration office?","t":"哪一幅图显示的是管理处的正确**位置**？","c":"a good location 一个好地段；the best/golden location 黄金地段"},
21761:{"w":"breakdown","e":"Gloomy people are likely to suffer from a nervous breakdown.","t":"忧郁的人容易精神**崩溃**。","r":"来自词组break down（打破，破坏）","y":"disintegration（n. 瓦解）；classification（n. 分类）"},
21762:{"w":"irresistible","e":"Later the lava cools slowly into a huge, hard, stable plug which blocks any further eruption until the pressure below becomes irresistible.","t":"随后岩浆慢慢冷却，变成巨大、坚硬而稳固的岩颈，阻碍火山进一步喷发，直到喷发的压力变得**势不可挡**。","r":"联想记忆：ir+resistible（可抵抗的）→不可抵抗的→无法抵抗的"},
21763:{"w":"fluency","e":"Fluency in French is required for this job.","t":"这项工作要求能讲一口**流利**的法语。","r":"词根记忆：flu（流动）+ency（表状态）→流动的状态→流利"},
21764:{"w":"transcription","e":"Transcriptions always benefit from any additional commentary provided by an observer.","t":"**手抄本**总是能从阅评者的附加评注中得到完善。"},
21765:{"w":"introspection","e":"These situations are best resolved with the minimum of introspection or self-analysis.","t":"通过最低程度的**自我反省**或自我分析，圆满地解决了这些问题。","r":"词根记忆：intro（向内）+spect（看）+ion→看自己的内心→内省"},
21766:{"w":"elicitation","e":"There are also several direct methods of elicitation, such as asking information to fill in the blanks.","t":"这里也有一些直接的**引导**办法，例如在空格处填上所问的信息。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+lic（引诱）+itation→引诱到外边来→引出，诱出"},
21767:{"w":"informant","e":"The journalist refused to reveal the identity of his informant.","t":"记者拒绝披露**消息提供者**的身份。"},
21768:{"w":"ambiguity","e":"There was an element of ambiguity in the actor's reply.","t":"演员的回答有些**模棱两可**。","r":"词根记忆：amb(i)（周围）+ig（驱使）+uity→向四周驱使，没有明确方向→不明确"},
21769:{"w":"generative","e":"The convenience of this approach makes it widely used, and it is considered the norm in the generative approach to linguistics.","t":"这种方法的便捷性使其被广泛应用，并且被视为语言学**生成**研究的规范。"},
21770:{"w":"recourse","e":"A linguist's personal judgements are often uncertain, or disagree with the judgements of other linguists, at which point recourse is needed to more objective methods of enquiry, using non-linguists as informant.","t":"语言学家的个人判断通常是不可靠的，或者与其他语言学家的判断不一致，这时就需要**求助于**更加客观的调查方法，选择非语言学家作为语料供应人。"},
21771:{"w":"scrupulous","e":"For larger studies, scrupulous attention has been paid to the sampling theory employed, and in all cases, decisions have to be made about the best investigative techniques to use.","t":"对于更大的课题研究，就需要**特别**注意抽样理论的应用，在所有情况下，要注意选择使用最佳的调查方法。","r":"来自scruple（n./vi. 顾忌，顾虑）","c":"be scrupulous in（doing） sth. 小心谨慎对待（做）某事"},
21772:{"w":"utterance","e":"Linguists ask their informants for utterances that describe certain actions, objects or behaviours.","t":"语言学家让他们的语料供应人用**话语**描述某些动作、物体或行为。"},
21773:{"w":"emeritus","e":"Michael Yessis, an emeritus professor of Sports Science at California State University at Fullerton, maintains that genetics only determined about one third of what an athlete can do.","t":"加州州立大学富勒顿分校体育科学系**名誉**教授迈克尔·耶西认为基因对一名运动员的能力来说只起1/3的作用。"},
21774:{"w":"bilingual","e":"She works as a bilingual assistant for an American boss.","t":"她是一位美国老板的**双语**助理。","r":"词根记忆：bi（两）+lingu（语言）+al（…的）→（说）两种语言的","c":"bilingual education 双语教育"},
21775:{"w":"substitution","e":"It seems that the director is going to make a substitution for the old program.","t":"看起来导演准备**替换**掉老节目。"},
21776:{"w":"mundane","e":"Susan busied herself with the mundane task of cleaning the house.","t":"苏珊用打扫房间这样**平常**的工作让自己忙起来。","r":"词根记忆：mund（世界）+ane（…的）→世俗的"},
21777:{"w":"foreseeable","e":"For the foreseeable future, records will be made to be broken.","t":"在**不久**的将来，记录将被打破。"},
21778:{"w":"hurl","e":"Mr. Lee hurled the book across the room while he was in a fury.","t":"李先生暴怒之下将书本从房间一头**扔**向另一头。"},
21779:{"w":"invoke","e":"Police can invoke the law of human rights to regulate the perpetrators.","t":"警察可以**通过**人权法来管理闹事者。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+vok（叫喊）+e→恳求"},
21780:{"w":"duplicate","e":"These methods include strength training that duplicates what they are doing in their running events as well as plyometrics.","t":"这些方法包含力量训练，这与他们在跑步中以及肌肉增强训练中所做的**完全一致**。","r":"词根记忆：du（二）+plic（重叠）+ate（使…）→两种重叠状态→完全相同的；复制品","c":"duplicate copy 副本","d":"duplication（n. 副本；复制）","y":"copy（n. 副本 v. 复印，复制）"},
21781:{"w":"mushroom","e":"The profit of this company is expected to mushroom to $50 million by 2030.","t":"这家公司的利润到2030年有望**猛增**到五千万美金。"},
21782:{"w":"adaptation","e":"The simplicity of Indian ways of life has been judged an evolutionary adaptation to forest ecology.","t":"印第安人的生活方式很简单，这被认为是在进化中**适应**森林生态环境的结果。","r":"联想记忆：adapt（改编；适应）+ation（表动作）→适应；改编"},
21783:{"w":"elite","e":"This country's Internet elite have begun to emerge in recent years.","t":"近年来，该国涌现出一批网络**精英**。","r":"联想记忆：e+lite（看作词根lig，选择）→选出来的都是精英→精英","c":"social elite 社会精英"},
21784:{"w":"up-to-date","e":"The data gave lexicographers access to an up-to-date daily language.","t":"这些资料为词典编纂者提供了**最新**的日常用语。"},
21785:{"w":"bury","e":"Some birds bury their eggs under the ground.","t":"有些鸟将自己的蛋**埋**在地下。","d":"burial（n. 埋葬，埋藏；葬礼）"},
21786:{"w":"moderate","e":"The people can bear moderate price increases in the market.","t":"人们能够忍受市场上**适度**的涨价。","r":"词根记忆：moder（=mod，风度）+ate→做事有风度→适度的"},
21787:{"w":"bold","e":"The International Style was largely characterised by the bold use of new materials and simple, geometric forms.","t":"“国际风格”的特征主要体现在**大胆**使用新材料和简单的几何形状上。","r":"联想记忆：b+old（年长）→年长的人通常不会太鲁莽→鲁莽的"},
21788:{"w":"award","e":"Our experience would suggest that the long-term effects of incentive awards on absenteeism are questionable.","t":"我们的经验表明，以激励**奖**来解决旷课问题的长期效果值得质疑。","c":"award a prize 颁奖；be awarded for 因…而被授奖；get one's award 得奖；award ceremony 颁奖仪式；win/receive an award 获奖"},
21789:{"w":"hassle","e":"Bob didn't want the hassle of commuting to work, so he took a job close to his home.","t":"鲍勃不想每天很**麻烦**地乘车往返于家和公司之间，于是就在离家不远的地方找了份工作。","r":"联想记忆：可能是haste（急忙）+tussle（争执；扭打）的缩合词→分歧，争论"},
21790:{"w":"addict","e":"The most tragical sight of all is the very young addicts.","t":"最悲惨的一幕是目睹那些非常年轻的**吸毒者**。"},
21791:{"w":"restrain","e":"The doctors restrained the patient from hurting himself.","t":"医生**制止**了病人的自残行为。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+strain（拉紧）→阻止；抑制","d":"restraint（n. 抑制；约束措施）"},
21792:{"w":"reproduce","e":"Photographs, postcards and films enable memories to be endlessly reproduced.","t":"照片、明信片和电影让往事在脑海中不断**重现**。","r":"联想记忆：re（一再）+produce（生产）→不断生产→繁殖","d":"reproduction（n. 复制品；繁殖）"},
21793:{"w":"signpost","e":"The Education Centre is signposted at every crossing in the college.","t":"该大学的每个十字路口处都设有通往教育中心的**路标**。","r":"组合词：sign（标志）+post（放置）→在…设置路标"},
21794:{"w":"intent","e":"He came with intent to defraud.","t":"他怀着欺骗的**意图**而来。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+tent（伸展）→向内伸展→意图"},
21795:{"w":"artefact","e":"The museum collections included approximately 300,000 artefacts.","t":"博物馆里收藏了大约30万件**手工艺品**。","r":"词根记忆：art（技巧）+e+fact（制作）→用技巧制作的东西→人工制品"},
21796:{"w":"application","e":"I think this invention has many useful applications.","t":"我认为这项发明非常有用，会被广泛**应用**。","r":"词根记忆：ap（表加强）+plic（折叠）+ation（表行为）→折得很近→申请；应用","c":"application for 申请…；application form 申请表；application process 申请过程；job application 应聘"},
21797:{"w":"acquaintance","e":"It was in the United States that I made the acquaintance of Professor Jones.","t":"我是在美国**结识**琼斯教授的。","r":"联想记忆：acquaint（使熟知）+ance（表名词）→熟人；认识","c":"speaking acquaintance 泛泛之交；nodding acquain-tance 点头之交"},
21798:{"w":"challenge","e":"The greatest challenge in this respect is time.","t":"这一方面面临的最大**挑战**是时间问题。","c":"face a challenge 面对挑战；take up challenges 接受挑战"},
21799:{"w":"guideline","e":"These standards are based on guidelines set out by the major control boards.","t":"这些标准是基于主管委员会拟定的**指导方针**制定的。","r":"组合词：guide（指导）+line（路线）→指导方针"},
21800:{"w":"hemisphere","e":"The left hemisphere of the brain controls the right half of the body.","t":"左**脑**控制身体的右半部分。","r":"词根记忆：hemi（半）+spher（球）+e→半球"},
21801:{"w":"civil","e":"Personality questionnaires were used by the ancient Chinese for picking out civil servants.","t":"古代中国人用性格问卷来挑选**政府文职**人员。"},
21802:{"w":"viable","e":"In order to develop an economically viable hotel organisation model, they decided to implement some new policies.","t":"为了能够开发一种在经济上**切实可行**的酒店管理模式，他们决定采用一些新政策。","r":"词根记忆：vi（道路）+able（能…的）→有路可走→可行的，可实施的","d":"viability（n. 可行性）"},
21803:{"w":"gigantic","e":"A gigantic explosion tore buildings around the bomb to fragments.","t":"**巨大**的爆炸将炸弹周围的建筑物炸得粉碎。","c":"a gigantic sculpture 一座巨大的雕像","y":"colossal（adj. 巨大的，庞大的）；enormous（adj. 巨大的，极大的）","f":"tiny（adj. 极小的，微小的）；microscopic（adj. 极小的）"},
21804:{"w":"venue","e":"This team will play here or at other venues all over the country.","t":"这支队伍将会在这或者国内的其他**赛场**比赛。","r":"联想记忆：ven（来）+ue→大家都来的地方→（聚集、审判、比赛等的）地点","c":"sport venue 运动场馆；outdoor venue 户外场所"},
21805:{"w":"grieve","e":"I grieved very much for what I have done.","t":"我为自己的行为感到非常**痛心**。","y":"lament（v. 哀悼；悲痛）；bemoan（vt. 哀怨；悲叹）；sadden（vt. 使伤心，使悲哀）","f":"cheer（v. 欢呼）；rejoice（v. 感到高兴，充满喜悦）"},
21806:{"w":"studio","e":"On the other side of the reception area is the dance studio.","t":"接待区的另一边是舞蹈**室**。"},
21807:{"w":"inhabitant","e":"The natural history of the Amazon is to a surprising extent tied to the activities of its prehistoric inhabitants.","t":"亚马孙河的自然历史与其史前**居民**的活动有着极为密切的关系。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+habit（居住）+ant（表人）→居民，居住者"},
21808:{"w":"suicidal","e":"A telephone counseling service in this country gets more calls from people with suicidal feelings when it rains.","t":"在这个国家，电话咨询服务在雨天会接到更多有**自杀**情绪的人打来的电话。","r":"词根记忆：sui（自己）+cid（杀）+al（…的）→自杀（性）的"},
21809:{"w":"bilateral","e":"The two countries worked out a bilateral agreement.","t":"两国达成了**双边**协议。","r":"词根记忆：bi（二）+later（边）+al（…的）→双边的"},
21810:{"w":"memorable","e":"The trip to that village was memorable for us.","t":"去那个村庄旅游是我们**难忘**的一次经历。","r":"词根记忆：memor（记忆）+able（可…的）→可记忆的→容易记住的","c":"a memorable experience 一次难忘的经历"},
21811:{"w":"dazzle","e":"Despite a lot of razzle-dazzle, the home basketball team has been beaten by 20 points.","t":"主场篮球队尽管有许多令人**眼花缭乱**的假动作，但仍以20分之差落败。","r":"联想记忆：爵士乐（jazz）使人头晕目眩（dazzle）"},
21812:{"w":"vast","e":"Cutting down forests on a large scale has continued apace over vast areas.","t":"**很多**地区仍在快速地大规模砍伐森林。","r":"联想记忆：古老的东方（east）地大物博，人口众多（vast）","d":"vastly（adv. 巨大地；大量地）"},
21813:{"w":"underground","e":"Water from the underground rivers bubbles to the surface as springs.","t":"**地下**河的水以泉水的形式冒出地表。","r":"组合词：under（在…下）+ground（地面，土地）→地下的；在地（面）下","c":"underground railway 地铁"},
21814:{"w":"scholar","e":"The database is collected not merely for scholars, but for people involved in a whole range of educational and artistic purposes.","t":"收集这些数据库不仅仅是为了给**学者**提供资料，也为所有从事教育和艺术工作的人们提供资料。","r":"联想记忆：schol（看作school，学校）+ar（表人）→学者","d":"scholarship（n. 奖学金；学问）"},
21815:{"w":"compete","e":"A series of tests and interviews eventually left 280 applicants competing for the 120 advertised positions.","t":"经过一系列的测试和面试之后，最终留下280名申请者来**竞争**招聘广告上的120个职位。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+pet（寻求）+e→共同追求（一个目标）→竞争","c":"compete against/with 与…竞争；compete for 为…比赛","d":"competitive（adj. 竞争的）；competitor（n. 竞争者，对"},
21816:{"w":"prescription","e":"This medicine is not available without a prescription.","t":"这种药只能凭**处方**购买。","r":"词根记忆：pre（预先）+script（写）+ion→预先把要抓的药写在方子上→药方","c":"prescription drugs/medication 处方药；fill a prescrip-tion 按方配药；give a prescription 开药方"},
21817:{"w":"crude","e":"The tribesmen still use bows, arrows and crude digging sticks.","t":"该部落成员依然使用弓箭和**粗糙**的挖掘棍。","r":"词根记忆：c+rud（天然的）+e→天然的"},
21818:{"w":"vary","e":"The price of a bed in different hotels always varies so much.","t":"不同旅馆的床位价格总是**大不相同**。","c":"variable（adj. 易变的 n. 变量）；various（adj. 各种各样的）"},
21819:{"w":"compose","e":"All of the subjects which you undertake in the first year are composed of lectures and tutorials.","t":"你第一年所要学习的所有科目都由讲座和辅导课**构成**。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+pos（放）+e→放到一起→组成，构成","c":"be composed of 由…组成"},
21820:{"w":"alley","e":"There are many blind alleys in this town.","t":"这个镇子里有很多死**胡同**。"},
21821:{"w":"bounce","e":"Don't bounce on the bed, you'll break the springs!","t":"别在床上乱**蹦**，你会把弹簧弄断的。","r":"联想记忆：弹跳（bounce）起来掀翻了一盎司（ounce）酒","c":"bounce back 卷土重来，恢复过来"},
21822:{"w":"platform","e":"This 520-hectare island serves as the platform for the new military airport.","t":"这座520公顷的小岛是新军用机场的**起落台**。","r":"联想记忆：plat（平的）+form（形态）→形状是平的→平台"},
21823:{"w":"atmosphere","e":"Uranus' atmosphere consists largely of hydrogen and helium.","t":"天王星的**大气**主要由氢和氦组成。","r":"词根记忆：atmo（空气）+spher（球）+e→围绕地球的空气→大气","c":"atmosphere of …的氛围","d":"atmospheric（adj. 大气的）"},
21824:{"w":"appoint","e":"He is appointed to administer funds.","t":"他被**指派**去管理基金。","r":"联想记忆：ap（表加强）+point（指向，指出）→指定某人做某事→任命，委任","c":"appoint to 任命，委任；an appointed official 一名受委派的官员；appoint sb. to a post 派某人任某职"},
21825:{"w":"characteristic","e":"Many characteristics, such as height and intelligence, result not from the action of genes alone.","t":"诸如身高、智力等这些**特征**并不完全是基因作用的结果。"},
21826:{"w":"identify","e":"In 1986, American researchers identified the genetic defect underlying one type of muscular dystrophy.","t":"1986年，一些美国研究人员**发现**了可导致某种肌肉萎缩症的遗传缺陷。","c":"identify...with... 把…与…视为同一事物","d":"identifiable（adj. 可辨认的；可确认的）","y":"recognize（vt. 认出，识别）；determine（v. 确定）；distinguish（v. 区别，辨别）"},
21827:{"w":"altitude","e":"One common type of coffee bean, called Robusta, is grown at altitudes below 600 metres.","t":"罗布斯塔咖啡豆是常见的一种咖啡豆，生长在**海拔**600米以下的地方。","r":"词根记忆：alt（高）+itude（表状态）→海拔，高度","c":"high/low altitude 高海拔/低海拔"},
21828:{"w":"possess","e":"My professor possessed a surrealistic canvas by Dali.","t":"我的教授**拥有**一幅达利的超现实主义油画。","r":"联想记忆：poss（看作boss，老板）+ess→老板占有很多财产→具有；拥有","c":"possess an interest in 对…感兴趣"},
21829:{"w":"excitement","e":"The excitement died down.","t":"**激动**的情绪已经平息了。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+cit（激起）+e+ment（表行为）→激动；兴奋"},
21830:{"w":"contradiction","e":"It is a contradiction that what you said just now is not consistent with what you said one year before.","t":"你刚说的话与一年前说的话不符，真是**自相矛盾**。","r":"词根记忆：contra（相反）+dict（说）+ion→反着说→否认，反驳"},
21831:{"w":"painstaking","e":"It is a painstaking task of interpretation, so that we come to understand what these things mean for the human story.","t":"诠释工作需要**非常细心**，这样我们才能了解这些事情对人类历史意味着什么。","r":"组合词：pains（痛苦）+taking（花费…的）→煞费苦心的","c":"work with painstaking 尽心地工作"},
21832:{"w":"pursuit","e":"Archaeology is both a physical activity out in the field and an intellectual pursuit in the study or laboratory.","t":"考古学既是一种野外的体力活动，也是研究室或实验室里的知性**探索**。","r":"联想记忆：钱包（purse）被小偷偷去，赶忙追赶（pursuit）","c":"in pursuit of 追求","y":"chase（n. 追逐）；hobby（n. 业余爱好）"},
21833:{"w":"humanistic","e":"The point is to shock the viewer, brushing aside the humanistic nature of classical photography.","t":"似乎一切的重点都是为了震惊观者，而无视经典摄影艺术**人文关怀**的本质。"},
21834:{"w":"coherent","e":"The archaeologist has to develop a picture of the past, just as the scientist has to develop a coherent view of the natural world.","t":"考古学家需要提供一张过去的图片，就如同科学家需要描绘出自然世界的**连贯**图景。","r":"词根记忆：co（共同）+her（黏附）+ent（具有…性质的）→黏附在一起→连贯的","d":"coherently（adv. 条理清楚地；一致地）；coherence（n. 一致；连贯性）","y":"cohesive（adj. 黏着的）；coordinated（adj. 同等的，并列的）；consistent（adj. 一致的）"},
21835:{"w":"outlook","e":"The highly respected old man has a fairly positive outlook on life.","t":"这位德高望重的老人对待生活的**态度**非常乐观。","r":"组合词：out（外面）+look（看）→向外看→展望"},
21836:{"w":"apportion","e":"We apportion the money before valuing the price of the souvenir.","t":"在对纪念品估价之前，我们先**分配**一下花销。","r":"词根记忆：ap（表加强）+port（部分）+ion（表动作）→分成部分→分派，分配"},
21837:{"w":"finitude","e":"It is far beyond human finitude to climb this mountain.","t":"攀登这座山远远超出人类的**极限**。"},
21838:{"w":"exhaustible","e":"Stone, brick, metal and plastic are all derived from exhaustible mineral sources.","t":"石料、砖、金属和塑料都是从**可耗尽**矿产资源中提取的。"},
21839:{"w":"revelation","e":"The revelation of the commercial secrets would bring legal punishment to this multinational enterprise.","t":"**泄露**商业机密将使这家跨国公司受到法律制裁。","r":"联想记忆：revel（=reveal，揭露）+ation（表行为）→揭示，显示","d":"reveal（vt. 揭露，泄露；展现，显示）","y":"disclosure（n. 揭发；败露）；exposure（n. 暴露；曝光）","f":"concealment（n. 隐藏）"},
21840:{"w":"resistance","e":"The defenders put up strong resistance to the demonstrators.","t":"防卫者采取强硬的措施来**阻止**示威游行者。","c":"resistance to chemicals 抵制化学药品"},
21841:{"w":"attainable","e":"The newly set standard is easily attainable by most students.","t":"大部分学生可以轻松地**达到**新标准。"},
21842:{"w":"indispensable","e":"A good reference book is indispensable for learning a classwork.","t":"一本好的参考书对于学习一门功课是**必需**的。","r":"联想记忆：in（不）+dispensable（可有可无的）→不是可有可无的→必不可少的，必需的","y":"essential（adj. 非常重要的，必要的）；vital（adj. 极其重要的，必不可少的）；requisite〔adj.（成功所）必要的〕"},
21843:{"w":"cuisine","e":"I would choose Chinese cuisine compared with French cuisine.","t":"比起法国餐，我更喜欢中**餐**。","r":"发音记忆：“口味新”→烹饪出新口味→烹饪"},
21844:{"w":"reputable","e":"I insured my property and my health with a reputable insurance company.","t":"我在一家**著名**的保险公司购买了财产及健康保险。"},
21845:{"w":"overshadow","e":"News of the severe accident overshadowed the whole day's events.","t":"那场严重的交通事故使得一整天的新闻都**显得无足轻重**了。","r":"联想记忆：over（在…上）+shadow（阴影）→使黯然失色"},
21846:{"w":"unparalleled","e":"It was an unparalleled opportunity for Mary to develop her studies.","t":"这对于玛丽发展学业来说是一个**绝好**的机会。","r":"联想记忆：un（无）+parallel（平行）+ed→没有东西可以与之平行的→无双的，无比的"},
21847:{"w":"opulence","e":"The lecture hall was decorated with stagy opulence.","t":"演讲大厅装点着**丰富**的舞台装饰。"},
21848:{"w":"supersede","e":"The old theory has been superseded by more recent research.","t":"旧的理论已经被较新的研究**取代**了。","r":"词根记忆：super（上）+sed（坐）+e→坐在别人的位置上→代替；取代"},
21849:{"w":"exploitation","e":"There is a report on the exploitation of child workers which attracts broad attention.","t":"有一篇关于**剥削**童工的报道引起广泛的关注。"},
21850:{"w":"passionate","e":"People in the primitive tribe have a passionate nature.","t":"原始部落里的人**富有激情**。","r":"联想记忆：passion（激情）+ate→充满激情的"},
21851:{"w":"poisonous","e":"They ate a species of poisonous mushroom.","t":"他们吃了一种**有毒**的蘑菇。","r":"联想记忆：poison（毒）+ous（有…性质的）→有毒的"},
21852:{"w":"strip","e":"Topsoils are stripped and stockpiled prior to mining for subsequent dispersal over rehabilitated areas.","t":"在采矿前先将地表土层**挖去**并贮存起来，用于之后铺在矿区需要恢复的地区。","r":"联想记忆：s（音似：死）+trip（旅行）→死亡剥夺了人的尘世之旅→剥夺"},
21853:{"w":"exhaust","e":"She was exhausted by her four kids.","t":"四个孩子让她**筋疲力尽**。","c":"be exhausted from 因…而十分疲乏；exhaust pipe 排气管；exhaust emission 尾气排放；intake and exhaust system 进气和排气系统"},
21854:{"w":"mysterious","e":"Writers transport their heroes to mysterious realms beyond the Earth.","t":"作家们将其笔下的英雄带到地球之外的**神秘**地域。","r":"联想记忆：myster（=mystery，神秘）+ious→神秘的"},
21855:{"w":"spite","e":"He put the house up for sale out of spite at his family.","t":"他将房子出售是出于对家人的**怨恨**。","c":"in spite of 不管，尽管"},
21856:{"w":"passport","e":"This country is working to stop the illegal sale of its passports to suspected terrorists.","t":"这一国家正在阻止向有恐怖分子嫌疑的人非法出售该国**护照**。","r":"联想记忆：pass（通过）+port（港口）→通过港口所需的文件→护照"},
21857:{"w":"divert","e":"Out of a country's health budget, a large proportion should be diverted from treatment to health education.","t":"在一个国家的医疗预算中，大部分费用应从治疗**转移**到健康教育上。","r":"词根记忆：di（离开）+vert（转）→转移","d":"diversion（n. 转移；消遣）"},
21858:{"w":"dissemination","e":"Whether the activity is tourism research, business, or data dissemination, the lack of a common language can severely impede progress.","t":"不管是旅游研究、贸易还是资料的**传播**，缺少一种共同的语言都会严重阻碍这些活动的发展。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+semin（种子）+ation→撒种子→散布"},
21859:{"w":"perpetual","e":"Life itself was a perpetual and punishing search for food.","t":"生活本身就是一个**不断**辛苦找寻食物的过程。","r":"词根记忆：per（贯穿）+pet（寻求）+ual（有…性质的）→自始至终追求的→长期的；永久的","y":"eternal（adj. 永恒的，永远的）；permanent（adj. 永久的，持久的）；continuous（adj. 连续的，持续的）","f":"temporary（adj. 暂时的，临时的）"},
21860:{"w":"contradict","e":"The statement contradicts the writer's views.","t":"这一陈述与作者的观点**不符**。","r":"词根记忆：contra（相反）+dict（说）→说反话→反驳","y":"deny（vt. 驳斥，反对）"},
21861:{"w":"organize","e":"Classes are organized according to ability level.","t":"根据能力水平进行**分**班。","c":"organize an activity 组织活动；organized crime 团伙犯罪"},
21862:{"w":"column","e":"My friend has his own column in the magazine.","t":"我朋友在该杂志上有自己的**专栏**。"},
21863:{"w":"source","e":"We understand a port as a centre of land-sea exchange, and as a major source of livelihood and a major force for cultural mixing.","t":"我们把港口看作海陆交换的中心、生计的主要**来源**以及推动文化融合的重要力量。","r":"联想记忆：这些资源（resource）的来源（source）是哪里？"},
21864:{"w":"cater","e":"The role of tourism is to cater to the needs of the tourists in accordance with their class.","t":"旅游业就是一个**满足**各阶层人士旅游需求的行业。","r":"联想记忆：cat（小猫）+er→小猫饿了，喂点猫粮→提供饮食","c":"cater for sb./sth. 迎合…，为…提供饮食及服务；cater to sth.迎合…，满足…的需求","d":"catering（n. 餐饮业）"},
21865:{"w":"lobby","e":"They were lobbying for stronger environmental protection.","t":"他们在为加强环境保护而进行**游说**。"},
21866:{"w":"flexible","e":"Cars easily surpass trains or buses as a flexible and convenient mode of personal transport.","t":"小汽车轻易地超越火车和公共汽车，成为一种**灵活**、便利的个人交通工具。","r":"词根记忆：flex（弯曲）+ible（可…的）→易弯曲的；柔韧的","c":"flexible schedule 可变通的日程表；flexible working hours 弹性工作时间"},
21867:{"w":"penalty","e":"People who work reduced hours pay a huge penalty in career terms.","t":"缩短工作时间的人事业上会遭到严重**损失**。","r":"词根记忆：penal（=pen，惩罚）+ty（表情况）→惩罚；罚金","c":"death penalty 死刑"},
21868:{"w":"comply","e":"The patient was unwilling to comply with the physician's orders.","t":"这位病人不愿意**遵从**医生的嘱咐。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+ply（重叠）→（观点）共同叠在一起→遵从；服从","c":"comply with the law 守法"},
21869:{"w":"capsule","e":"A capsule is long and thin, and you can open it up and take out what's in it.","t":"**胶囊**通常长而薄，你可以把它打开，把里面的东西倒出来。","r":"联想记忆：cap（帽子）+sule（音似：seal，密封）→帽状物→胶囊；密封舱"},
21870:{"w":"aeronautics","e":"The Aeronautics Building is on the left side of the university campus.","t":"**航空学**大楼位于校园的左侧。","r":"词根记忆：aero（空气）+naut（船）+ics（…学）→航空学"},
21871:{"w":"adopt","e":"After becoming independent of the local authority and adopting its new title, our college continued to build on its first class reputation.","t":"自从我们学院脱离当地部门并**改**了新名之后，就一直致力于打造一所一流院校。","r":"联想记忆：这个被收养（adopt）的孩子必须适应（adapt）新的环境","c":"adopt the new policy 通过新政策；adopt a new technique 采用新技术"},
21872:{"w":"lease","e":"Could I ask how long the lease is?","t":"我能问一下**租期**是多久？","r":"联想记忆：l+ease（安心）→有了租约，可以安心了→租约吗？"},
21873:{"w":"bit","e":"Hot coffee is a bit hard to carry.","t":"热咖啡**有点**不好拿。"},
21874:{"w":"conceal","e":"Men were very aware that thieves might be concealed behind the car.","t":"人对窃贼可能**藏**在车后很警觉。","r":"联想记忆：con+ceal（看作seal，密封）→密封起来→隐藏；隐瞒；掩盖"},
21875:{"w":"compromise","e":"This means that the choice you make will probably be determined by the amount of money you want to pay, your own personal needs, what is actually available or a compromise of all three things.","t":"这意味着你所做的选择可能会取决于你想花多少钱、你的个人需要和你实际能买到的（商品），或者你也可以将三者**折中**一下。","r":"联想记忆：com+promise（保证）→相互保证→妥协","c":"reach a compromise over sth. 就某事达成妥协；compromise with sb. on sth. 与某人就某事妥协"},
21876:{"w":"haphazard","e":"There are books piled on shelves in a haphazard fashion.","t":"书架上**无序**地堆放着一些书。","r":"联想记忆：hap（机会，运气）+hazard（冒险）→运气加冒险，就能成功→偶然情况→无计划的"},
21877:{"w":"essential","e":"It is essential that the glass be thicker on the outside than on the inside.","t":"外层的玻璃应该比内层的玻璃厚，这一点**很重要**。","r":"词根记忆：ess（存在）+ential→存在的东西→要素；实质，本质","c":"be essential to/for 对…必不可少","d":"essentially（adv. 本质上，基本上）"},
21878:{"w":"urge","e":"My boss urged me to unfold my market strategy.","t":"老板**鼓励**我详细阐述我的市场策略。","d":"urgent（adj. 紧急的；急切的）；urgency（n. 紧急，迫切）"},
21879:{"w":"feasible","e":"Better integration of transport systems is made more feasible by modern computers.","t":"现代计算机的应用使得交通系统**有可能**得到更好的统筹。","r":"联想记忆：f+easi（看作easy，容易的）+ble→容易做到的→可能的","c":"a feasible plan 一个可行的计划；feasible suggestions 可行的建议"},
21880:{"w":"cereal","e":"The east of the UK is its great cereal-producing region.","t":"英国东部地区是英国最大的产**谷**区。","r":"联想记忆：ce+real（真正的）→真正的健康食品→谷类食物","y":"grain（n. 谷物；谷粒）"},
21881:{"w":"existence","e":"There are no scientists in existence who really wait until they have all the evidence in front of them before they try to work out what it might possibly mean.","t":"**世上**从来没有哪个科学家真的要等到所有的证据都摆在他面前才试图研究可能的规律。","r":"联想记忆：exist（存在）+ence→存在；生活（方式）","c":"come into existence 产生","d":"coexistence（n. 共存，共处）"},
21882:{"w":"apply","e":"If you would like more information on how to apply for a student loan, then you should contact The Student Loans Company.","t":"如果你想获得更多有关**申请**学生贷款的信息，那么你应该和学生贷款公司联系。","r":"联想记忆：这家服务站免费提供（supply）打气筒给行人使用（apply）","c":"apply for 申请；apply to 与…有关；适用；应用；apply to the customs 报关；apply oneself to 致力于"},
21883:{"w":"admission","e":"If you have any questions, please contact the Admissions & Information Office.","t":"如果你有任何问题，请与**招生**信息办公室联系。","r":"词根记忆：ad（表加强）+miss（送）+ion→允许送入→允许进入"},
21884:{"w":"attempt","e":"A series of lectures organised by the Students' Union is part of the union's attempt to help students stay healthy.","t":"学生会举办的一系列讲座是为帮助学生保持健康而**努力**做的事情之一。","r":"词根记忆：at（表加强）+tempt（尝试）→尝试，试图","c":"make attempt 尝试；attempt（doing） sth. 尝试做…；attempt to do sth. 尝试/努力做…"},
21885:{"w":"inference","e":"If the evidence is true then by inference he is guilty.","t":"如果证据确凿，就可以**推断**出他有罪。","r":"联想记忆：从这些参考书（reference）里，你能推断（inference）出什么？"},
21886:{"w":"loop","e":"These tunnels must loop around and connect.","t":"这些隧道一定是**成环状**的，而且是相通的。"},
21887:{"w":"subtract","e":"That event subtracts nothing from his merit.","t":"那件事丝毫没有**减损**他的美德。","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+tract（拉）→拉下来→减去；去掉"},
21888:{"w":"linguistic","e":"Industrial training schemes have promoted an increase in linguistic and cultural awareness.","t":"工业培训计划促进了**语言**和文化认知的进步。","r":"词根记忆：lingu（语言）+istic→语言的","c":"linguistic features 语言特征"},
21889:{"w":"aptitude","e":"Each branch of this company had employees of comparable aptitudes.","t":"该公司的所有分公司都雇用**能力**相当的员工。","r":"联想记忆：感激（gratitude）上苍让你具备这种才能（aptitude）","c":"aptitude for …的能力"},
21890:{"w":"premier","e":"The premier was injured in a bomb attack.","t":"**总理**在一次炸弹袭击中受伤。"},
21891:{"w":"enquiry","e":"The library staff answered every enquiry from new students about borrowing books and using the computers.","t":"图书馆工作人员回答了新生关于借书和使用电脑的每一个**询问**。","r":"联想记忆：enquir（=enquire，询问）+y→询问","c":"Before I continue, is there any enquiry into what I've said? 在我继续讲之前，对我刚才所说的，还有什么想问的吗？"},
21892:{"w":"lawsuit","e":"The lawsuit is very much on the lawyer's mind.","t":"律师的脑子里一直浮想着这起**诉讼**。","r":"组合词：law（法律）+suit（起诉，诉讼）→诉讼"},
21893:{"w":"pack","e":"The canteen was absolutely packed.","t":"餐厅**挤满**了人。","c":"pack up 收拾行装，打点行李；停止，放弃；辞掉"},
21894:{"w":"prescribe","e":"Doctors diagnose before they prescribe a drug.","t":"医生在**开药**前要先对病人进行诊断。","r":"词根记忆：pre（预先）+scrib（写）+e→预先写好→规定；指示","c":"prescribe sb. sth. 为某人开…药"},
21895:{"w":"universe","e":"Not only did the rocket solve a problem that had intrigued man for ages, but, more importantly, it literally opened the door to exploration of the universe.","t":"火箭不仅解决了困扰几代人的一个问题，更重要的是，它开启了探索**宇宙**的大门。","r":"词根记忆：uni（一个）+vers（转）+e→一个旋转着的整体空间→宇宙","d":"universal（adj. 普遍的；通用的）"},
21896:{"w":"skull","e":"The anthropologist unearthed the skull of an ancient human at the site.","t":"人类学家在该遗址挖掘出一个古人类的**头骨**。"},
21897:{"w":"domination","e":"The two companies are fighting for the domination of the market.","t":"这两家公司在争夺对市场的**控制权**。","r":"词根记忆：domin（=dom，控制）+ation（表行为）→控制，统治，支配"},
21898:{"w":"animate","e":"A smile suddenly animated her face through hearing the good news.","t":"听到这个好消息，她突然笑了，脸上顿时**有了生气**。","r":"词根记忆：anim（生命）+ate（使…）→赋予生命"},
21899:{"w":"accountancy","e":"He has worked in accountancy since he graduated from university.","t":"他大学毕业后一直从事**会计工作**。"},
21900:{"w":"availability","e":"Free Water Served is subject to availability.","t":"**视供应情况**提供免费茶水。","r":"来自available（adj. 可用的）"},
21901:{"w":"payable","e":"Our company was asked for a 10% deposit payable in advance.","t":"我们公司需要**预付**10%的定金。","r":"联想记忆：pay（支付，给予）+able（能…的）→可支付的；应支付的"},
21902:{"w":"solicitor","e":"Solicitors in Australia are very popular.","t":"**事务律师**在澳大利亚很受欢迎。","y":"lawyer（n. 律师）；attorney（n. 律师）"},
21903:{"w":"departure","e":"The local people had received no news of him since his departure from hometown.","t":"自从他**离开**家乡之后，乡亲们就没有听到过他的消息。"},
21904:{"w":"audit","e":"It is a busy time for him that he has to audit the accounts of company A.","t":"这段时间他很忙，需要**审计**A公司的账目。","r":"词根记忆：aud（听）+it→听…报告→审计；旁听"},
21905:{"w":"receipt","e":"It is a common rule that goods will be delivered on receipt of payment.","t":"只有在**收到**货款后才可以交货，这是一条普遍的规则。","r":"词根记忆：re（回）+ceipt（拿，取）→拿回来的→收到的款项","c":"receipt invoice 收妥发票，钱货两讫发票","d":"receive（v. 收到；遭到；接待）；receiver〔n.（电话）听筒；接收器〕"},
21906:{"w":"scamper","e":"I shouted for help and the dog scampered off.","t":"我大声喊救命，狗便**跑开**了。","r":"联想记忆：s（音似：嘶）+camper（露营者）→露营者嘶喊着快跑→快跑"},
21907:{"w":"spiral","e":"A spiral of smoke rose from the chimney.","t":"烟囱里的烟**袅袅**升起。","r":"联想记忆：spir（看作spire，螺旋）+al→螺旋形的","c":"spiral staircase 螺旋形楼梯","d":"spire（n. 螺旋）","y":"loop（n. 环；线圈）；twist（n. 扭曲；螺旋状）；coil（v.盘绕，卷）"},
21908:{"w":"encode","e":"Engineers need to encode the message into computer language.","t":"工程师需要将信息**转化**为计算机语言。","r":"联想记忆：en+code（电码，密码）→把…译成电码"},
21909:{"w":"scout","e":"Both my brothers were scouts and I really want to join the scout troop.","t":"我的两个哥哥都曾是**童子军**成员，我也很想加入童子军。","r":"联想记忆：sc+out（外面）→在外面巡逻的人→侦察员"},
21910:{"w":"regurgitate","e":"The cormorant regurgitates half-digested fish to feed its young.","t":"鸬鹚将消化了一半的鱼**回翻**，喂给幼鸟。"},
21911:{"w":"propellant","e":"A rocket motor's \"bullets\" are minute, high-speed particles produced by burning propellants.","t":"火箭发动机的“子弹”是微小的高速粒子，由**推进剂**的燃烧产生。"},
21912:{"w":"ejection","e":"The reaction to the ejection of these small particles inside the rocket causes the rocket to move forwards.","t":"**喷出**这些火箭内部颗粒的反作用力使得火箭向前运动。"},
21913:{"w":"intrigue","e":"A good teacher knows how to intrigue his students to learn.","t":"好老师懂得如何**激发**学生的学习兴趣。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+trig（琐碎）+ue→在里面放入琐碎使复杂→密谋，施诡计","c":"political intrigues 政治阴谋","d":"intriguing（adj. 迷人的，吸引人的）","y":"attract（vt. 吸引）；captivate（vt. 迷住，迷惑，吸引）；appeal（vi. 有吸引力）；plot（v./n. 密谋，阴谋）"},
21914:{"w":"transition","e":"The transition from planned economy to market economy is not an easy one.","t":"从计划经济向市场经济**转变**并非易事。","r":"词根记忆：trans（越过）+it（行走）+ion→穿过一地走到另一地→转变","c":"in transition 转变中","d":"transitional（adj. 变迁的，过渡期的）","y":"transformation（n. 转化）；change（n. 转变，改变）"},
21915:{"w":"stack","e":"Dishes are stacked up in a drying rack.","t":"盘子被**堆放**在一个烘干架上。","r":"联想记忆：库存（stock）就是一堆（stack）商品","c":"reference stacks 书库；stack-pile wood 堆贮木材；stack up把…堆起；a stack of hay 一堆草"},
21916:{"w":"realm","e":"It is strange that the rocket was generally ignored by writers of fiction to transport their heroes to mysterious realms beyond the Earth, even though it had been commonly used in fireworks displays in China since the thirteenth century.","t":"尽管从13世纪起火箭就已经普遍应用在了中国的烟花表演中，奇怪的是，小说作者却很少会用火箭将他们的主人公带到地球以外的神秘**地域**。","r":"联想记忆：real（真正的）+m→真正的艺术是无国界的→领域；王国"},
21917:{"w":"ingredient","e":"Some time in the tenth century, black powder was first compounded from its basic ingredients of saltpeter, charcoal and sulphur.","t":"10世纪的某个时候，黑火药第一次由硝石、木炭和硫磺这些基本**成分**混制而成。","r":"词根记忆：in（内部）+gred（=grad，走）+ient→走入内部的东西→组成部分，成分；原料"},
21918:{"w":"friction","e":"Studies of primitive societies suggest that the earliest method of making fire was through friction.","t":"有关史前社会的研究表明，**摩擦**取火是最早的取火方式。","r":"联想记忆：润滑油的主要功能（function）是减小摩擦力（friction）","y":"discord（n. 不和，纷争）；conflict（n. 冲突，争论）；attrition（n. 磨损；摩擦）","f":"accord（n. 一致，符合）；harmony（n. 一致；和谐）"},
21919:{"w":"astronaut","e":"The rocket transported the astronauts to mysterious realms beyond the Earth.","t":"火箭将**宇航员**运载到地球以外的神秘领域。"},
21920:{"w":"banner","e":"On the wall is the banner welcoming the friends of Italian Opera.","t":"墙上挂着一条欢迎意大利歌剧团的朋友们的**横幅**。","r":"联想记忆：ban（禁止）+ner→禁止悬挂横幅→横幅"},
21921:{"w":"technique","e":"A new style of architecture was made possible by new materials and construction techniques.","t":"新的建筑材料和建筑**技术**使新的建筑风格得以实现。","r":"词根记忆：techn（技艺）+ique→技术"},
21922:{"w":"squeeze","e":"I made the toast and squeezed orange juice every morning.","t":"我每天早上都烤面包、**榨**橙汁。","r":"联想记忆：s+quee（看作queen，女王）+ze→想与女王握手的人很多→挤入，挤过","c":"squeeze toothpaste 挤牙膏；squeeze sth. out 把…挤出来；squeeze your eyes shut 紧紧闭上你的眼睛"},
21923:{"w":"sorrow","e":"Carolyn's eyes filled with sorrow at thinking of how she had treated Kevin and lost him forever.","t":"想到自己那样对待凯文并永远地失去了他，卡罗琳的眼中充满了**悲伤**。","c":"sorrow at/over sth. 为…感到悲伤"},
21924:{"w":"arboreal","e":"Koala is an arboreal animal.","t":"树袋熊是一种**树栖**动物。","r":"词根记忆：arbor（树）+eal（…的）→树木的","c":"arboreal insects 栖树的昆虫"},
21925:{"w":"facade","e":"Preserving historic buildings or keeping only their facades grew common.","t":"对历史建筑或对它们的**正面外观**的保护变得越来越普遍。","r":"联想记忆：fac（看作face，正面）+ade→正面"},
21926:{"w":"post-mortem","e":"When businesses fail, the post-mortem analysis is traditionally undertaken by accountants and market strategists.","t":"生意失败后，通常是由会计师和市场战略家来进行**事后**分析。","c":"do/conduct/carry out a post-mortem on sb. 对某人进行剖尸验证"},
21927:{"w":"disillusionment","e":"Disillusionment at the failure of many poor imitations of Modernist architecture led to interest in various styles and ideas from the past and present.","t":"这种对现代主义建筑风格模仿的失败引起了建筑师们的**觉醒**，继而激发了他们对过去和现在多重风格和理念的兴趣。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+illusion（幻想）+ment→不再幻想→觉醒，醒悟"},
21928:{"w":"subject","e":"I'm giving some thoughts to a new book on a different subject.","t":"我在构思一本不同**题材**的新书。","c":"be subject to 受支配，从属于…","d":"subjective（adj. 主观的）；subjectivism（n. 主观主义，主观论）"},
21929:{"w":"blunt","e":"The bad weather has blunted our enthusiasm for camping.","t":"坏天气**打击**了我们去露营的热情。","r":"发音记忆：“不拦的”→口无遮拦的→率直的"},
21930:{"w":"statistically","e":"If that information is statistically valid, we can find out what the majority of students prefer.","t":"如果**统计**数据可靠的话，我们就可以找出大多数学生所喜欢的（课程）。"},
21931:{"w":"switch","e":"A switch was flipped and the machine began to whirl at 300 revolutions per minute.","t":"按下**开关**，机器开始以每分钟300转的速度旋转。"},
21932:{"w":"stockpile","e":"The owner of the factory intended to build up his stockpile of raw materials.","t":"该厂主打算增加原料**库存**。","r":"组合词：stock（储存）+pile（堆）→成堆地储存→大量贮存"},
21933:{"w":"indicate","e":"Evidence gathered in recent years indicates that the region has supported a series of indigenous cultures for eleven thousand years.","t":"近年来收集到的证据**表明**，这一地区有过持续一万一千多年的土著文明。","r":"词根记忆：in（加以…）+dic（说）+ate→说出→表示，表","d":"indicator（n. 指示器；指示信号）；indication（n. 指示，标示）"},
21934:{"w":"uncertainty","e":"These fluctuations of environment add another degree of uncertainty to the survival of many species.","t":"这些环境变化给很多物种的生存带来了另一种**不确定性**。"},
21935:{"w":"hypothesis","e":"You have to discard or modify your hypothesis if shown not to be correct.","t":"如果被证实不正确，你就必须放弃或修改你的**假设**。","r":"联想记忆：hypo（在…下面）+thesis（论点）→在论点之下，非真正论点→假设；假说","c":"Continental Drift Hypothesis 大陆漂移说；raise a hypothesis提出一个假设","y":"supposition（n. 假定；猜想）；assumption（n. 假定）"},
21936:{"w":"ultraclean","e":"They decided to put superclean coal and ultraclean coal into the production.","t":"他们决定在生产中使用超纯精煤和**超净**煤。"},
21937:{"w":"trim","e":"The top of the can is trimmed and then bent over to secure the lid.","t":"罐子的顶部经过**修整**后微微向上隆起以便固定好盖子。","r":"联想记忆：tri（看作try，试）+m（end）（修理）→试着去修理→修剪","c":"trim one's nails 修剪指甲；trim sth. off/away 把某物去除掉；trim off 修剪；trim with 用…装饰；trim with brass用铜器装饰；trim lawns 齐整的草坪"},
21938:{"w":"steady","e":"The van is making steady progress through the dark night.","t":"货车在黑夜中**平稳**行驶。","r":"联想记忆：st+eady（看作ready，准备好的）→事先有准备，心里就有底→稳的；稳定的","d":"steadily（adv. 平稳地）"},
21939:{"w":"dramatic","e":"The changes in China's Pearl River Delta are more dramatic than these natural fluctuations.","t":"中国珠江三角洲的变化比这些自然界的变化更**巨大**。","r":"词根记忆：dra（表演）+ma+tic→戏剧性的","c":"dramatic irony 戏剧性的讽刺；dramatic effect 戏剧性的效果","d":"dramatically（adv. 引人注目地；戏剧性地）"},
21940:{"w":"amorphous","e":"The Swedish chemist called Pasch discovered amorphous phosphorus.","t":"瑞典化学家帕施发现了**无定形**磷。","r":"词根记忆：a（无）+morph（形状）+ous（…的）→无固定形状的","c":"amorphous state 无定形状态；非晶形状态"},
21941:{"w":"solve","e":"Technology alone cannot solve the problem of vehicle pollution.","t":"仅仅靠技术不可能**解决**机动车辆带来的污染问题。","d":"solution（n. 解决；解决办法）"},
21942:{"w":"blade","e":"The rotating blades can shave away the wax that covers each cell.","t":"旋转的**刀片**可以刮掉附在每个蜂房内壁上的蜂蜡。","r":"联想记忆：电影《刀锋战士》英文为Blade"},
21943:{"w":"glimpse","e":"We glimpsed the profile of the church steeple against the last glow of the sunset.","t":"我们**瞥见**了在最后一抹晚霞映衬下的教堂尖顶的轮廓。","r":"联想记忆：glim（灯光）+pse→像灯光一闪→一瞥"},
21944:{"w":"bulletin","e":"Tom is going for some news bulletins.","t":"汤姆正在寻找一些新闻**简报**。","r":"联想记忆：芝加哥公牛队（Bull）又上新闻（bulletin）了","c":"bulletin board（电子）公告牌；news bulletin 新闻简报"},
21945:{"w":"annoy","e":"The bathroom light which flickered quite badly annoyed me very much.","t":"浴室里的灯闪来闪去，真让我**心烦**。"},
21946:{"w":"chapel","e":"Jack was the organist in the Octagon Chapel in the city of Bath.","t":"杰克是巴斯市八角**教堂**的风琴师。","r":"联想记忆：chap（看作chamber，房间）+el（小）→小房间→小教堂"},
21947:{"w":"subscribe","e":"Which magazines did your father subscribe to?","t":"你父亲**订阅**了哪些杂志？","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+scrib（写）+e→在下面写上名字→签署","d":"subscriber（n. 订阅者；用户）"},
21948:{"w":"foil","e":"The freezer is filled with foil-wrapped packages.","t":"冷藏室里塞满了用**箔纸**包裹着的东西。"},
21949:{"w":"invoice","e":"The manufacturer invoiced me for two computers.","t":"厂商给我开了一张两台电脑的**发票**。","r":"联想记忆：in+voice（声音）→大声把人叫进来开发票→发票；给…开发票"},
21950:{"w":"extra","e":"Today, almost all companies have employees work overtime rather than hire extra personnel.","t":"如今，几乎所有的公司宁愿让员工加班也不愿意雇用**额外**的职员。","r":"本身为词根，意为“额外的；特别的”"},
21951:{"w":"transmute","e":"The alchemist tried to transmute iron into gold.","t":"炼金术士试图将铁**变成**黄金。","r":"词根记忆：trans（变换）+mut（改变）+e→改变"},
21952:{"w":"analyse","e":"The objective of the Human Genome Project is to map and analyse every single gene within the double helix of humanity's DNA.","t":"人类基因工程的目标就是绘制和**分析**人类呈双螺旋状的DNA中的每一个基因。","r":"词根记忆：ana（在旁边）+lys（分解）+e→分析；分解","d":"analysis（n. 分析）；analyst（n. 分析家；化验员）"},
21953:{"w":"acoustic","e":"In the houses near the highway special acoustic seals should be fitted to the doors to reduce noise.","t":"位于公路旁的住房的房门上应该安装专门的**隔音**封条，以降低噪音。"},
21954:{"w":"stall","e":"Remember to visit the souvenir stalls in the car park in front of the main entrance to the stadium.","t":"记得到体育馆正门前停车场内的纪念品**小店**看看。","r":"联想记忆：sta（看作stand，立）+ll（像两根柱子）→两根柱子撑起的狭小空间→货摊；小隔间"},
21955:{"w":"cover","e":"The study covered 500 employees in four large companies.","t":"这次研究的对象**涉及**四家大公司的500名雇员。"},
21956:{"w":"breakthrough","e":"A brilliant intellectual breakthrough does not ensure that the transition is made from theory to practice.","t":"重大的学术**突破**并不能保证从理论到实践的成功转变。","r":"组合词：break（打破）+through（通过）→打破→突破"},
21957:{"w":"spiritual","e":"Human spiritual needs should match material affluence.","t":"人类的**精神**需求应该与物质富足相匹配。","r":"联想记忆：spirit（精神）+ual（有…性质的）→精神的","c":"spiritual damage 精神伤害"},
21958:{"w":"concrete","e":"The old wooden bridge across the river was replaced by a concrete bridge that can carry heavy lorries.","t":"河上的旧木桥被一座能承载重型卡车的**混凝土**桥取代了。","r":"词根记忆：con+cre（产生）+te→产生（事物）→具体存在的事物→实在的；具体的","c":"reinforced concrete 钢筋混凝土"},
21959:{"w":"generalise","e":"It's impossible to generalise about children's books, as they are all different.","t":"儿童读物差别很大，很难**概括**。","r":"联想记忆：general（概括的）+ise→概括","d":"generalisation（n. 概括，归纳；泛论）"},
21960:{"w":"remarkable","e":"More than 4,000 species of these remarkable creatures have evolved and adapted to the world's different climates.","t":"这些**极不平常**的生物中已有4,000多种进化并适应了地球上不同的气候。","c":"remarkable achievements 非凡的成就"},
21961:{"w":"clot","e":"Doctors gave the patient a drug to dissolve the blood clot that had formed in his leg.","t":"医生给病人用了一种药，来溶解他腿部形成的血**凝块**。","c":"blood clot 血液凝块"},
21962:{"w":"prior","e":"This degree course needs no prior qualifications.","t":"这种学位课程不需要**先决**条件。","r":"词根记忆：pri（第一）+or→排在第一的→在前的，优先的","c":"prior to 在…之前；a prior consideration 事先的考虑"},
21963:{"w":"integrate","e":"The researchers don't know how to integrate the two actions.","t":"研究者不知该如何将这两种行为**融为一体**。","r":"词根记忆：integr（完整）+ate→（使）成为一体","c":"integrate theory with practice 使理论与实践相结合","d":"integration（n. 结合，综合）；disintegrate（vt. 使分解，使碎裂）"},
21964:{"w":"exemplify","e":"Robin Hill Park exemplifies the standards in natural zoos.","t":"罗宾山郊野公园是自然动物园的**典范**。","r":"来自example（n. 实例），注意区分a和e","y":"demonstrate（v. 证明，论证）；illustrate（v. 举例说明，阐明）"},
21965:{"w":"formulation","e":"Could you choose another formulation?","t":"你能选择另一种**表达方式**吗？"},
21966:{"w":"exploratory","e":"The patient is having some exploratory tests done to find out what's causing the illness.","t":"病人正在接受**探查性**检查，以找到致病原因。"},
21967:{"w":"pasture","e":"More than 1,000 acre fields were planted with crops several years ago, but now are returned to pasture for the cattle.","t":"数年前，这里是一千多英亩的农田，如今退耕还牧，成为**牧场**。","r":"联想记忆：pas（看作pass, 通过）+ture→牛羊通过的地方→牧场，草原","d":"pasturage（n. 放牧）","y":"meadow（n. 草地，牧场）；grassland（n. 牧草地，草原）"},
21968:{"w":"nutrient","e":"Embryos absorb mineral and other nutrients from their mothers.","t":"胎儿从母体中吸收矿物质和其他**营养物质**。","r":"词根记忆：nutri（滋养）+ent（…药）→滋养物，营养品"},
21969:{"w":"plough","e":"The farmer abandoned his plough and waited by the tree stump, hoping to get another hare.","t":"那个农民荒废了**耕作**，在树桩旁等着，希望能再得到一只兔子。","c":"plough around 试探"},
21970:{"w":"patriotic","e":"Teenagers felt it's patriotic to serve in the army to maintain world peace.","t":"年轻人认为，为维护世界和平而服兵役是**爱国**的表现。","c":"patriotic emotion 爱国感情","d":"patriotism（n. 爱国主义，爱国精神）；patriot（n. 爱国者）"},
21971:{"w":"scrub","e":"When the cleaner scrubbed the building interior, it had a brand-new look.","t":"当清洁工把建筑内部**擦洗**干净后，整个建筑焕然一新。","r":"联想记忆：sc+rub（摩擦）→用力擦洗","y":"scour（v. 冲洗，擦亮）；thicket（n. 灌木丛）"},
21972:{"w":"formality","e":"Juventus are not underestimating anyone and if there is someone who considers this match a pure formality, then they do not belong to this team.","t":"尤文图斯队不会低估任何一个对手，如果哪个队员认为这场比赛只是个**形式**，他就不属于这支球队。","r":"词根记忆：form（形状）+al+ity（表性质）→认真维持形状→认真遵守规范、礼节等"},
21973:{"w":"perquisite","e":"Fringe benefits, perquisites and perks are various non-wage compensations provided to employees in addition to their normal wages or salaries.","t":"额外福利、**补贴**和津贴是除了正常工资之外，提供给雇员的几种非工资补偿形式。","r":"词根记忆：per（自始至终）+quis（获得）+ite→始终获得利益→利益"},
21974:{"w":"simplicity","e":"For the sake of simplicity, the teacher might recommend the student to use this reference book.","t":"为**简便**起见，老师可向学生推荐使用这本参考书。","r":"联想记忆：simpl(e)（简单的）+icity→简单"},
21975:{"w":"heighten","e":"You can heighten the degree of your wisdom with the help of your rivals.","t":"在对手的帮助下，你能够**提高**自己的智慧。","r":"联想记忆：height（高度，海拔）+en（使…）→提高→（使）增强，（使）加剧","y":"intensify〔v.（使）增强，（使）加剧〕","f":"lessen〔v.（使）变少，（使）减轻，（使）减少〕"},
21976:{"w":"assimilation","e":"Language assimilation is the progressive process whereby a speech community of a language shifts to speaking another language.","t":"语言**同化**是指讲话群体由一种语言转向另一种语言的渐进过程。","c":"cultural assimilation 文化同化"},
21977:{"w":"necessity","e":"Out of necessity or out of interest, people return to school for the common goal of self-improvement.","t":"不管是出于**需要**还是兴趣，人们重返学校都是为了一个共同的目标——提高自己。","r":"来自necessary（adj. 必需的；必要的）","d":"necessitous（adj. 贫困的；急需的）"},
21978:{"w":"disposable","e":"In the domestic market, people are increasing their disposable income, which provides China a huge potential market.","t":"在国内市场，民众的**可支配**收入不断增加，为中国提供了一个巨大的潜在市场。","r":"词根记忆：dis（不）+pos（放置）+able（能…的）→不能长久放置的→一次性的","c":"disposable income 可支配收入"},
21979:{"w":"ingenuity","e":"The little girl showed her ingenuity in making handicrafts out of scraps of paper.","t":"小女孩将纸片做成工艺品，展示出她的**心灵手巧**。","r":"词根记忆：in+gen（产生）+uity→能产生很多点子→足智多谋"},
21980:{"w":"luxuriant","e":"WWF predicted early this year that the luxuriant Amazon Forest could become a grassy savannah by the end of this century.","t":"世界野生动物基金会今年年初预测，**茂盛**的亚马孙森林将可能在本世纪末变为大草原。","r":"词根记忆：lux（光）+uri+ant（…的）→光线充足的→丰富的"},
21981:{"w":"consequential","e":"The teacher discusses with his students the consequential matters after the financial crisis.","t":"老师在跟同学们一起讨论金融危机后可能**产生的**一些问题。"},
21982:{"w":"scour","e":"The rainstorm raced down the slope and scoured out the bed of a stream.","t":"暴雨顺着斜坡倾泻而下，**冲刷**着河床。","r":"发音记忆：“四call”→一连四个电话（call）→四处搜寻"},
21983:{"w":"seasonal","e":"Seasonal weather fluctuations depend on factors such as proximity to oceans or other large bodies of water, currents in those oceans, and prevailing winds.","t":"**季节性**的气候变化取决于与海洋或者其他大型水体的临近程度、洋流及季风等因素。"},
21984:{"w":"murky","e":"In early medieval Britain, every castle had a cold murky dungeon for prisoners.","t":"在中世纪早期的英国，每个城堡都有一个冰冷**阴暗**的地牢，用于关押囚犯。"},
21985:{"w":"cue","e":"The actor got his cue from the director.","t":"那位男演员从导演那里得到了一些**提示**。","r":"联想记忆：线索（clue）有提示（cue）作用","c":"on cue 恰好在这个时候"},
21986:{"w":"thermal","e":"A heat pump puts out more thermal energy than it consumes.","t":"热泵产生的**热**能要高于它所消耗的热能。","r":"词根记忆：therm（热）+al（…的）→热的","c":"thermal energy 热能","y":"warm（adj. 暖和的，温暖的）；hot（adj. 热的）"},
21987:{"w":"revolution","e":"Acid rain in fact started around the time of the industrial revolution of the 19th century.","t":"酸雨实际上是在19世纪工业**革命**时期开始出现的。","r":"词根记忆：re+volu（卷）+tion→不断向前席卷而来的→革命","d":"revolutionary（adj. 革命的；革命性的）"},
21988:{"w":"romance","e":"That was nothing but a spicy Hollywood romance.","t":"那简直就是一部粗俗的好莱坞**浪漫故事片**。","r":"发音记忆：“罗曼史”→恋爱；浪漫爱情"},
21989:{"w":"currently","e":"Fingerprint scanners are currently the most widely deployed type of biometric application.","t":"指纹扫描是**目前**生物测定技术中发展最为迅速的应用项目。","r":"联想记忆：current（当前的）+ly（表副词）→当前，现时，目前"},
21990:{"w":"inferential","e":"For young children, the difficulty lies not in the inferential processes which the task demands, but in certain perplexing features of the apparatus and the procedure.","t":"对于小孩子们来说，难点不在于任务所需的**推理**过程，而在于设备和程序的某些特征令人困惑。","r":"联想记忆：infer（推断）+ential→可推断的","c":"inferential capability 推理能力"},
21991:{"w":"persist","e":"If you persist in indifference, do not make me your confidante.","t":"如果你**坚持**这么冷漠，就别让我做你的好朋友。","r":"词根记忆：per（自始至终）+sist（站立）→始终站立着→坚持；持续","d":"persistent（adj. 持久稳固的）；persistence（n. 坚持，持续）"},
21992:{"w":"minimum","e":"The minimum speed on the freeway is 45 km/h.","t":"这条高速公路上的**最低**时速为45公里。","r":"词根记忆：min（小）+imum→最小的"},
21993:{"w":"output","e":"In some countries, subsidies for growing crops and price supports for farm output drive up the price of land.","t":"在某些国家，农作物种植补助金以及针对农业**产量**的价格补贴抬高了地价。","r":"组合词：out（出）+put（放）→输出","c":"farm output 农业生产量；the annual output of steel 钢的年产量"},
21994:{"w":"stash","e":"The bees stash honey to eat later.","t":"蜜蜂将蜂蜜**贮藏**起来供以后食用。","r":"联想记忆：st（看作stay，在）+ash（灰）→放在灰里→藏匿"},
21995:{"w":"species","e":"Between 1968 and 1982, the country imported about 50 different species of dung beetle, from Asia, Europe and Africa.","t":"在1968年到1982年间，该国从亚洲、欧洲和非洲进口了大约50种不同**种类**的蜣螂。","r":"联想记忆：科学家从一些生物物种（species）中选取好的制成标本（specimen）"},
21996:{"w":"subtle","e":"Many characteristics result from subtle interactions between genes and the environment.","t":"许多特征都是通过基因和环境之间**微妙**的相互作用形成的。","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+tle→暗藏于下面的→微妙的；隐约的","y":"delicate（adj. 微妙的）；intricate（adj. 难以理解的）；cunning（adj. 狡猾的）"},
21997:{"w":"competent","e":"This new manager was really competent.","t":"新任经理的确很**能干**。","r":"联想记忆：compet(e)（竞争）+ent（具有…性质的）→能在竞争中取胜的→有能力的","y":"sufficient（adj. 充分的，足够的；能胜任的）","f":"inefficient〔adj.（指人）不能胜任的〕"},
21998:{"w":"select","e":"More and more employers are making use of what are called \"personality questionnaires\" to help them select new staff.","t":"越来越多的雇主正在利用所谓的“性格调查问卷”来帮助自己**挑选**新员工。","r":"词根记忆：se+lect（选择）→选择，挑选","c":"selected poem 诗选","d":"selective（adj. 选择的；选择性的）；selection（n. 选择）"},
21999:{"w":"loose","e":"The soil in which coffee is grown must be rich, moist and sufficiently loose to allow rapid drainage.","t":"种植咖啡的土壤必须肥沃、潮湿且土质十分**疏松**以便迅速排水。","r":"联想记忆：这样散漫（loose）下去，时间都丢（lose）了","d":"loosen（v. 解开，放松）"},
22000:{"w":"available","e":"We hope that ostrich meat will be available soon and before long will be as cheap as beef.","t":"我们希望不久就可以**买到**鸵鸟肉，而且希望它的价格不久就会变得和牛肉一样便宜。","r":"联想记忆：avail（有用）+able（能…的）→可用的","c":"be available to 可用于；available facilities 可用的器械"},
22001:{"w":"illustration","e":"There is virtually no empirical evidence to support the use of illustrations in teaching reading.","t":"事实上没有任何经验证据支持在阅读教学过程中使用**插图**。","r":"联想记忆：illustrat（=illustrate，举例说明；图解）+ion（表名词）→实例；图解"},
22002:{"w":"slice","e":"I brought you a slice of pizza.","t":"我给你带了**一块**比萨。","r":"联想记忆：sl+ice（冰）→把冰块切碎→切片","c":"a slice of 一片；一部分；a slice of bread 一块面包"},
22003:{"w":"waterfront","e":"Those countries still maintain their business centres near the port waterfront.","t":"那些国家的商业中心仍然靠近**码头**。","r":"组合词：water（水）+front（面向，朝向）→滨水路，滨水区，码头区"},
22004:{"w":"generic","e":"The generic term for that plant is difficult to remember.","t":"那种植物的**种类**名称很难记。","r":"词根记忆：gen（产生）+er+ic（…的）→产生不同种属的→种的，属的","c":"generic name 【生物】属名"},
22005:{"w":"cricket","e":"There was precious little about the cricket to animate the crowd.","t":"这场**板球**比赛极少有让观众兴奋的地方。","r":"联想记忆：花钱买票（ticket）去看板球（cricket）比赛"},
22006:{"w":"exhale","e":"Passive smoking, the breathing in of the side-stream smoke from the burning of tobacco or of the smoke exhaled by a smoker, also causes a serious health risk.","t":"被动吸烟，即从燃烧的烟草中吸入侧流烟或吸烟者**呼出**的烟，也会给健康带来严重威胁。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+hal（呼吸）+e→呼出（气）；散发"},
22007:{"w":"creation","e":"The very first fire-creation methods involved the use of friction.","t":"最早的**取**火方法都离不开摩擦。","r":"联想记忆：creat(e)（创造）+ion→创造","d":"recreation（n. 消遣）"},
22008:{"w":"corporate","e":"From uniforms and workwear emerged corporate clothing.","t":"**职业**装是在制服和劳动服的基础上衍生出来的。","r":"词根记忆：corpor（团体）+ate（有…性质的）→团体的","c":"corporate crime 法人犯罪；corporate loan 公司贷款；corporate body 法人团体","d":"corporation（n. 公司；法人）"},
22009:{"w":"swell","e":"It was the pressure inside the mountain that made it swell.","t":"山体内部的压力使它**膨胀**。","r":"联想记忆：那种气味（smell）在增长（swell），越来越难闻"},
22010:{"w":"synthesis","e":"You need to make a synthesis of all the ideas I heard in the lecture.","t":"你需要把我在演讲中听到的全部意见**综合**一下。","r":"联想记忆：syn（共同）+thesis（论题）→将相同的论题综合起来→综合","c":"the synthesis of art 综合艺术"},
22011:{"w":"excreta","e":"Dung is the droppings or excreta of animals.","t":"Dung就是动物的粪便或**排泄物**。"},
22012:{"w":"decapitate","e":"The fisherman decapitated the fish.","t":"渔民把鱼头给**剁**了。","r":"词根记忆：de（去掉）+capit（头）+ate（使…）→把头去掉→斩首"},
22013:{"w":"pepper","e":"Only a dash of pepper is enough for the dish.","t":"这道菜只需放一点儿**胡椒粉**就可以了。"},
22014:{"w":"groan","e":"The roof creaked and groaned under the weight of the snow.","t":"屋顶在雪的重压下嘎吱作响，像在**呻吟**。","r":"联想记忆：受到折磨（groan），发出呻吟（moan）"},
22015:{"w":"diminish","e":"Our farmland was losing topsoil at a rate likely to diminish the soil's productivity.","t":"我们农田的地表土正在流失，照这样下去，很可能会**降低**土壤的生产力。","r":"词根记忆：di+min（小）+ish→减少；降低","y":"curtail〔vt. 缩减，减少（经费等）〕；decrease（v. 减少）","f":"increase（v. 增加，加大）"},
22016:{"w":"naive","e":"The second flaw in the document is the naive faith it places in its 1,000 core zoos.","t":"这一文献的第二个瑕疵就是，它**天真**地信任了所谓的一千家核心动物园。","r":"联想记忆：native（原始的，土著的）去掉t→比土著人还要少一点阅历→天真的，幼稚的，不成熟的","c":"naive attitude 天真的态度","y":"childish（adj. 幼稚的，不成熟的）；puerile（adj. 幼稚的，孩子气的）"},
22017:{"w":"upset","e":"The coming final exam upsets the students a lot.","t":"期末考试即将来临，学生们**心烦意乱**。","r":"联想记忆：up（上）+set（放置）→底朝天放着→颠倒"},
22018:{"w":"appeal","e":"You should read things that appeal to you.","t":"你应该阅读一些让你**感兴趣**的东西。","c":"appeal for 请求；appeal to 诉诸；吸引","y":"accuse（vt. 控告）"},
22019:{"w":"consumption","e":"Fuel consumption and exhaust emissions depend on which cars are preferred and how they are driven.","t":"**耗**油量和排气量取决于用户偏爱的车型及其驾驶方式。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+sumpt（取）+ion→消耗；消费","c":"consumption pattern 消费模式；consumption of electricity 耗电量"},
22020:{"w":"caution","e":"You should exercise extreme caution when driving in fog.","t":"在雾中开车要格外**小心**。","r":"发音记忆：“考生”→考生要谨慎答题→谨慎，小心","d":"cautionary（adj. 警告的，告诫的）"},
22021:{"w":"average","e":"How many hours a day on average do you watch TV?","t":"你**平均**每天看几个小时电视？","c":"average age 平均年龄；average price 平均价格；on average平均"},
22022:{"w":"blonde","e":"He married a blonde last year.","t":"他去年娶了个**金发女郎**。"},
22023:{"w":"burst","e":"Water pipes often burst in cold weather.","t":"水管在寒冷的天气里经常冻**裂**。","c":"burst into 突然爆发；burst out 突然激动地喊叫"},
22024:{"w":"ecology","e":"If the beetles successfully adapt to their new environment, they'll soon become a part of the local ecology.","t":"如果甲虫完全适应了新的环境，它们很快就会成为当地**生态环境**的一部分。","r":"词根记忆：eco（生态）+logy（…学）→生态学"},
22025:{"w":"profession","e":"In this highly competitive world, if a man has no profession, there isn't much choice.","t":"在这个竞争非常激烈的世界里，一个人如果没有**专长**就没有多少选择的机会。","r":"联想记忆：这位教授（professor）从事历史学专业（profession）"},
22026:{"w":"transit","e":"They wish to put mass transit systems into and around cities and promote small low emission cars for urban use.","t":"他们希望将**公共交通**系统用于城市和城际交通，而将排气量低的小汽车用于市区交通。","r":"词根记忆：trans（越过）+it（行走）→从一地走到另一地→运输，运载；通过，经过","d":"transition（n. 过渡；转变）","y":"transportation（n. 运输，运载）；delivery（n. 传送，运"},
22027:{"w":"medieval","e":"The tourists were shut in the tower of a medieval manor by the kidnappers.","t":"游客被绑架者关在一座**中世纪**庄园的塔楼里。","r":"词根记忆：medi（中间）+ev（时代）+al（…的）→中世纪的","c":"medieval Italy 中世纪的意大利"},
22028:{"w":"behave","e":"Managers often behave very differently outside the office.","t":"经理在办公室内外的**举止**经常判若两人。","r":"联想记忆：be+have（有）→表现所拥有的→表现","c":"behave oneself 注意自己的言行"},
22029:{"w":"devastating","e":"The devastating earthquake caused great damage to the city.","t":"那场**毁灭性**的地震给这个城市造成了巨大的损失。","c":"devastating effect 毁灭性的影响"},
22030:{"w":"dredge","e":"Those harbours were expensively improved by enlarging, dredging and building breakwaters.","t":"这些港口的情况通过扩建、**疏浚**及建造防浪堤得以改善，但是花销巨大。","r":"发音记忆：“掘机”→挖掘","c":"dredge up 挖掘；疏浚","d":"dredger（n. 挖泥船，挖泥机）"},
22031:{"w":"launch","e":"They set about developing a new camera model, which was launched in June 1888.","t":"他们着手研发新的相机款式，并于1888年6月**推出**。","r":"联想记忆：在午餐（lunch）会上推出（launch）新产品，真是不错的主意。","c":"launch into sth. 开始…；积极投入…；launch an attack 发动攻击；launch pad 发射台；launch the product 将新产品投放市场","d":"launcher（n. 发射器，发射装置）"},
22032:{"w":"disintegrate","e":"The plane flew into a mountain and disintegrated on impact.","t":"飞机冲向一座山，撞得**粉碎**。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+integrate（一体化，使完整）→使不完整→（使）碎裂，瓦解"},
22033:{"w":"fade","e":"His smile faded as he heard the answer.","t":"听到这个答案，他脸上的笑容**渐渐消失**了。","r":"联想记忆：褪色（fade）的记忆何以面对（face）"},
22034:{"w":"concede","e":"The defeated side had to concede some of their territory to the enemy.","t":"战败的一方不得不把部分领土**割让**给敌人。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+ced（行走）+e→让步"},
22035:{"w":"complaint","e":"My friend told me that he had gotten a kidney complaint.","t":"我朋友对我说他肾**不舒服**。"},
22036:{"w":"irritable","e":"The old man was so irritable that he often jabbed his stick in his servant's face.","t":"那个老人脾气太**暴躁**，经常用手杖戳佣人的脸。","r":"词根记忆：ir（进入）+rit（擦）+able（具有…性质的）→进入摩擦→急躁的"},
22037:{"w":"legislation","e":"The man called for legislation to adopt a unified response to the challenges posed by climate change and for the issue to receive more political support of the government.","t":"此人呼吁通过**立法**，采取一致行动来应对气候变化带来的挑战，还呼吁政府给予该问题更多行政支持。","r":"词根记忆：legis（法律）+lat（拿出）+ion→法律，法规；立法","d":"legislative（adj. 立法的；根据法规执行的；立法机关的 n.立法机关）；legislator（n. 立法者）；legislature（n. 立法机关）"},
22038:{"w":"bouncing","e":"The new invention can put the bouncing person into a trance-like state and provide wonderful relaxation.","t":"这项新发明能将**精力充沛**的人引入一种恍惚状态，给人带来愉悦的放松。"},
22039:{"w":"innovative","e":"Target pricing is an innovative approach used in the initial stages of the new-product development cycle to establish a contract price between a buyer and a seller.","t":"目标定价法是在新产品开发环节的最初阶段，用来在买家和卖家之间建立合同价格的**新**方法。","r":"来自innovation（n. 改革，创新）","c":"innovative spirit 创新精神"},
22040:{"w":"congestion","e":"Alleviation of mass illiteracy on a global scale is essential to that of health, hunger and other major world problems such as traffic congestion, environment pollution, etc.","t":"在全球范围内大规模扫盲是缓解卫生、饥饿及其他重大世界性问题，如交通**堵塞**、环境污染等所不可或缺的条件。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+gest（带来）+ion→带来了一大堆→拥挤，充塞","c":"traffic congestion 交通阻塞；congestion surcharge（港口）拥挤附加费"},
22041:{"w":"particulate","e":"Particulate matter in soils and aquatic systems reacts with and influences the biological activity of pesticides.","t":"土壤和水系统中的**颗粒**物质与农药的生物活动起反应，并给其带来影响。","c":"particulate matter 颗粒物质"},
22042:{"w":"pollutant","e":"There is a tax on all industrial pollutant emissions, not just those over state-prescribed standards.","t":"所有工业**污染**排放物都要征税，而不仅仅是超出国家规定标准范围的污染物。","r":"来自pollute（vt. 污染）"},
22043:{"w":"megacity","e":"For any megacity wishing to remain a sustainable social and economic development, healthy environment is a must.","t":"对于任何一个想保持社会和经济可持续发展状态的**大城市**来说，良好的城市环境都是必不可少的。"},
22044:{"w":"allergic","e":"If you're not sure what's triggering your allergic cough, your doctor can give you a skin test or blood test to pinpoint the allergen.","t":"如果你不能确定是什么引发了**过敏性**咳嗽，医生可以为你进行皮肤测试或验血来确定过敏源。","r":"词根记忆：all+erg（活力）+ic（…的）→过敏的","c":"allergic reaction 过敏性反应；allergic to 对…过敏，厌恶…"},
22045:{"w":"populace","e":"Workers in the nuclear industry are more likely than the general populace to have cancer in accordance with some authoritative inquiry.","t":"根据一些权威调查，从事核能行业的劳动者比普通**民众**更可能患癌症。","r":"词根记忆：popul（人民）+ace→平民，大众"},
22046:{"w":"proclaim","e":"It was the famous speech delivered by the President in which he proclaimed that the country was independent.","t":"正是在那次著名演说中，总统**宣布**该国独立了。","r":"词根记忆：pro（在前）+claim（呼喊）→在前面大叫→宣告，声明；显示","d":"proclamation（n. 公告，布告，声明）","y":"declare（v. 正式宣布；宣称）；announce（v. 宣布，声"},
22047:{"w":"supervision","e":"Students are prohibited from handling these chemicals unless they are under the supervision of a tutor.","t":"学生们禁止接触这些化学药品，除非在老师的**指导**之下。"},
22048:{"w":"comparable","e":"A comparable apartment in the east of this city would cost twice as much.","t":"一套**类似**的房子在城东部就要贵一倍。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+par（相等）+able（可…的）→都是相等的→可比较的","y":"similar（adj. 相似的，类似的）；like（adj. 相似的，同样的）"},
22049:{"w":"habitual","e":"New curricula require teachers to alter not just their teaching concepts but also their habitual teaching methods and behaviors.","t":"新课程要求教师不仅要改变教育理念，还要调整他们**习以为常**的教学方式和教学行为。","r":"联想记忆：habit（习惯）+ual（有…性质的）→惯常的，通常的"},
22050:{"w":"rehabilitate","e":"The prison service should try to rehabilitate prisoners rather than merely imprison them.","t":"监狱服务应该尽力**改造**罪犯而不是单纯地羁押。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+habilit（=abili，能）+ate→重新获得能力→使恢复原状"},
22051:{"w":"picturesque","e":"In addition to enjoying the picturesque scenery, travelers can visit quaint gift shops, country stores and other local attractions.","t":"除了欣赏**如画**的美景，游客也可造访雅致的礼品店、乡村店铺和当地其他名胜。","c":"a picturesque village 一个风景如画的村庄"},
22052:{"w":"afield","e":"The private school enrolls students from Europe, Australia and even further afield.","t":"这所私立学校招收来自欧洲、澳大利亚甚至更**远**地区的学生。"},
22053:{"w":"productive","e":"Without irrigation many productive areas of the country would not be able to be farmed.","t":"如果没有灌溉，这个国家的很多**多产**地区将不能进行农业生产。"},
22054:{"w":"form","e":"You have to fill in a form, but it doesn't take long.","t":"你得填写一张**表格**，但不会耽误太久。","d":"formality（n. 拘谨；礼节）；formability（n. 可成形性）"},
22055:{"w":"temporary","e":"Coal mining makes only temporary use of the land and produces no toxic chemical wastes.","t":"煤矿开采只是**暂时**使用这片土地，不会产生任何有毒的化学废弃物。","c":"temporary employment/work 临时工作","d":"temporarily（adv. 临时地）"},
22056:{"w":"spill","e":"The beer spilled from the glass.","t":"啤酒从玻璃杯里**溢出**来了。","r":"联想记忆：s+pill（药丸）→药丸太满了，洒了一地→溢出"},
22057:{"w":"mediocre","e":"I thought the play was only mediocre.","t":"我认为这部戏剧只是**平庸**之作。","r":"词根记忆：medi（中间）+ocre→中间状态→平庸的，平凡的","c":"a mediocre writer 一位平庸的作家"},
22058:{"w":"lead","e":"The road will lead you into the college grounds.","t":"这条路**通向**学院校区。"},
22059:{"w":"define","e":"Health in the physical sense has been defined as the absence of disease or illness.","t":"就身体而言，健康的**意思是**不受疾病的困扰。","r":"词根记忆：de+fin（范围）+e→划定范围→下定义；限定"},
22060:{"w":"figure","e":"The most recent available figures show that about a quarter of a million people are incapacitated with back pain every day.","t":"最新**数字**显示，每天大约有25万人因受背部疼痛的折磨而无法正常工作与生活。","c":"leading figure 主要人物，领导人物"},
22061:{"w":"respond","e":"Companies should respond to this kind of situation in an honest and open way.","t":"公司应该采取开诚布公的方式来**应对**这类情况。","c":"respond to 回答；对…作出反应；respond by doing sth. 做…进行回应","d":"response（n. 回答；反应）；respondent（n. 回答者 adj. 回答的）"},
22062:{"w":"approval","e":"Mining is subject to stringent controls and approval processes.","t":"采矿要接受严格的管控和**审批**程序。","r":"词根记忆：ap（表加强）+prov（证明）+al（表行为）→向某人进行证明→赞成，同意"},
22063:{"w":"smell","e":"Flowers smell stronger in the late evening.","t":"花**香**在深夜更加浓烈。"},
22064:{"w":"flaw","e":"The worst flaw in this document was the naive faith it embodied.","t":"这份文献最大的**缺点**就是它所表达的思想太天真了。"},
22065:{"w":"multiple","e":"Those devices have multiple purposes.","t":"那些装置具备**多重**功能。","r":"词根记忆：multi（多）+ple（折叠）→多重的；多样的","c":"multiple choice 多项选择；in multiple(s) 成倍地"},
22066:{"w":"adventure","e":"Hypotheses are adventures of the mind.","t":"假定是思想的**冒险**。","c":"spirit of adventure 冒险精神；adventure playground 冒险游乐园；adventure film 惊险电影"},
22067:{"w":"zone","e":"There are many different climatic zones in Australia.","t":"澳大利亚有很多不同的气候**带**。"},
22068:{"w":"diagram","e":"He tossed the diagram of the bridge to Brian.","t":"他把桥的**结构图**扔给了布莱恩。","r":"词根记忆：dia（穿过）+gram（画）→画带有交叉点的图→图解，图表"},
22069:{"w":"slouch","e":"Studies have shown that just one hour sitting in a slouched position can strain ligaments in the back.","t":"研究表明，保持**懒散**的坐姿一小时就会导致背部韧带受损。","r":"发音记忆：“似老去”→懒散地站；低头垂肩地站"},
22070:{"w":"bloom","e":"By the time the flowers bloom, the new queens will be laying eggs.","t":"鲜花**盛开**之时，新的蜂王便会产卵。","r":"联想记忆：杜鹃花开（bloom）鲜红如血（blood）","c":"be in full bloom 盛开"},
22071:{"w":"horizon","e":"It is in technology and commerce that glass has widened its horizons.","t":"玻璃在技术和商业领域扩大了应用**范围**。","r":"联想记忆：ho+riz（音似：rise，升起）+on→太阳从地平线上升起→地平线","c":"expand one's horizons 开阔眼界","d":"horizontal（adj. 水平的）；horizontally（adv. 水平地）"},
22072:{"w":"trick","e":"They used a decoy camera to trick burglars.","t":"他们用一台伪装相机来**哄骗**窃贼。","r":"联想记忆：西方国家的小孩子在万圣节喜欢玩treat or trick的游戏","d":"tricky（adj. 不易处理的，难对付的）"},
22073:{"w":"centigrade","e":"This substance has a relatively high ignition temperature of 182 degrees centigrade.","t":"这种物质的燃点相对较高，达到182**摄氏**度。","r":"联想记忆：centi（一百）+grade（等级）→百分度的"},
22074:{"w":"courageous","e":"The message behind a half handshake is that \"I'm not a strong or courageous person.\"","t":"握手时只握住手指，其暗含的信息是：“我不是强者或**有胆量**的人。”","r":"联想记忆：courage（勇气）+ous（…的）→有勇气的→勇敢的，有胆量的"},
22075:{"w":"academic","e":"Once in higher education, you can apply for a loan at any time in the academic year.","t":"进入高校以后，你就可以在**学**年内的任何时间申请贷款。","c":"academic achievement 学术成就；academic study 学术研究；academic problem 学术问题；academic teaching staff 师资力量","d":"academically（adv. 学术上）；academia（n. 学术界；学术生涯）"},
22076:{"w":"preferable","e":"I'm not sure the cure is preferable to the disease.","t":"我不太确定这种疗法是否比疾病本身**更可取**。","r":"联想记忆：prefer（更喜欢）+able（能…的）→更喜欢就觉得更好→更可取的，更好的"},
22077:{"w":"biometrics","e":"Biometrics is a little-known but fast-growing technology.","t":"**生物测定**是一门鲜为人知但发展迅速的技术。"},
22078:{"w":"reunite","e":"The lost child was reunited with his parents in the police station.","t":"那个走失的孩子和他的父母在警察局**重聚**了。"},
22079:{"w":"minority","e":"Human resources are in the minority as much of the work is done by automated machines controlled by computers.","t":"许多工作被电脑控制的自动化机器完成，人力就占**少数**了。","r":"词根记忆：min（小）+or+ity（表状况）→少数"},
22080:{"w":"clench","e":"The doctor told him to relax and not to clench his hands like that.","t":"医生告诉他放松，别像那样**紧握**拳头。"},
22081:{"w":"corpus","e":"We have an existing written corpus of language learning materials in the library.","t":"图书馆里有现成的关于语言学习的书面**资料**。","r":"词根记忆：corp（身体）+us→知识体→文集，汇编；语料库"},
22082:{"w":"alarm","e":"Every time when you leave your house, make sure the windows and doors are shut, and set the burglar alarm.","t":"每次出门时都应确定门窗已关好，并打开防盗**警铃**。","r":"联想记忆：al+arm（武器）→受了惊吓，拿起武器→惊恐"},
22083:{"w":"beam","e":"The little girl beamed a warm smile at him.","t":"那个小女孩冲他热情地**微笑**。","r":"联想记忆：be+am→做我自己，成为国家的栋梁→梁","c":"a beam of light 一束光"},
22084:{"w":"conjunction","e":"Seat belts are more effective when used in conjunction with air bags.","t":"安全带和安全气囊**一起**使用，效果更好。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+junct（连接）+ion→连接"},
22085:{"w":"height","e":"Many characteristics, such as height and intelligence, result from subtle interactions between genes and the environment.","t":"许多特征，如**身高**和智力，都是基因和环境间相互微妙作用的结果。"},
22086:{"w":"nasty","e":"Many people feel that it's dangerous to ride the subway—there have been some nasty attacks.","t":"很多人认为乘坐地铁很危险，因为地铁上发生过一些**可怕**的袭击。","r":"联想记忆：做事总是草率的（hasty），真是令人讨厌的（nasty）","c":"a nasty person 一个下流的人；nasty weather 恶劣的天气","y":"disgusting（adj. 令人厌恶的，使人反感的）；offensive（adj. 使人不快的，讨厌的）"},
22087:{"w":"monster","e":"The moving van is a monster of a truck.","t":"这辆搬家车是辆**巨型**卡车。","r":"发音记忆：“蒙死他”→怪物把他给吓蒙了→怪物"},
22088:{"w":"continually","e":"The diver was continually fascinated by the beauty of the sea.","t":"潜水者**一直**陶醉于大海的美丽。"},
22089:{"w":"adequate","e":"Good living habits and adequate health care are critical factors of governing health.","t":"良好的生活习惯和**适当**的卫生保健是保持健康的关键因素。","r":"词根记忆：ad（表加强）+equ（平等）+ate→比平等多的→充足的","c":"be adequate for 适合于…","d":"inadequate（adj. 不充足的；不适当的）"},
22090:{"w":"hike","e":"My classmates want to hike through the forest in summer.","t":"我们班同学想在夏天**徒步**穿越森林。","r":"联想记忆：我喜欢（like）徒步旅行（hike）"},
22091:{"w":"grateful","e":"I'd be grateful if you could tell me a little about your time since you've been here in Cambridge.","t":"如果你能够说说来剑桥以后的一些情况，我将不胜**感激**。"},
22092:{"w":"organ","e":"The main organs of communication for the WSPU (Women's Social and Political Union) were its two newspapers.","t":"妇女社会与政治联盟的主要联络**机构**是其创办的两家报纸。"},
22093:{"w":"rely","e":"Most inland farmers rely on underground water for irrigation.","t":"大部分内陆农民都**依靠**地下水灌溉土地。","r":"联想记忆：re（一再）+ly（音似：lie，撒谎）→一再撒谎的人不值得信赖→信赖","c":"rely on/upon 依靠"},
22094:{"w":"incentive","e":"Hypotheses provide the initiative and incentive for the inquiry.","t":"假设**促使**人们主动去调查。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+cent（唱）+ive→把（力量）唱进去→刺激","d":"incentivize（v. 刺激；激励）","y":"motivation（n. 刺激，动机）；impetus（n. 推动，促进，刺激）"},
22095:{"w":"technical","e":"This job requires someone with specialized technical knowledge.","t":"该工作要求从业者具备专门的**技术**知识。","r":"词根记忆：techn（技艺）+ical（…的）→技术的","c":"technical support 技术支持；technical education 技术教育；technical college 工学院；technical hitch 技术故障，机件故障"},
22096:{"w":"chorus","e":"The chorus usually plays a large part in the music festival.","t":"**合唱**在音乐节上通常扮演着重要的角色。","c":"in chorus 异口同声；female/male chorus 女声/男声合唱；mixed chorus 混声合唱；chorus master 合唱队指挥"},
22097:{"w":"scent","e":"Doctors mix light, sounds, breezes and scents to stimulate the patients.","t":"医生同时采用光、声音、微风和**香味**来刺激病人。","r":"联想记忆：绽放的花朵送出（sent）沁人心脾的香气（scent）"},
22098:{"w":"hitherto","e":"Hitherto, virtually all photographers developed and printed their own pictures.","t":"事实上，**到目前为止**，所有的摄影师都亲自冲印自己拍摄的照片。","r":"联想记忆：hit（打）+her+to→迄今为止，他的爱还没有打动她→到目前为止，迄今"},
22099:{"w":"accomplish","e":"We must accomplish the task before noon.","t":"我们必须在中午之前**完成**这项任务。","r":"联想记忆：ac+compl（看作complete，完成）+ish（使…）→完成","c":"accomplish one's object 达到了某人的目的；accomplish one's mission 完成了某人的任务"},
22100:{"w":"bullet","e":"In reaction to the forward discharge of bullets, the gun moves backward.","t":"发射**子弹**所产生的后坐力会使枪向后动一下。","r":"联想记忆：bull（芝加哥公牛队）+et→芝加哥公牛队队员如子弹般在球场中穿梭→枪弹，子弹"},
22101:{"w":"rural","e":"Technological advance will bring about the decline of rural industries and an increase in urban populations at the same time.","t":"科技进步将会导致**农村**产业的衰退，同时会带来城市人口的增长。","r":"词根记忆：rur（乡村）+al（…的）→农村的，乡村的"},
22102:{"w":"enclosure","e":"Overseas trade, colonial plunder and the enclosure movement had accumulated abundant capital for greedy capitalists in Western countries.","t":"海外贸易、殖民掠夺和**圈地**运动为西方贪婪的资本家积累了雄厚的资本。","r":"联想记忆：en（进入…之中）+clos（看作close）+ure→被围在当中→围场"},
22103:{"w":"discontinue","e":"Without first consulting their health care provider, patients shall not discontinue the use of these medications.","t":"在没有咨询过医护人员之前，患者不应该**中断**使用这些药物。"},
22104:{"w":"revegetate","e":"To revegetate is to replant and rebuild the soil of disturbed land.","t":"**再植**是指重新种植植物，复原被破坏的土壤。"},
22105:{"w":"sustainable","e":"As a win-win technology between human and nature, green science and technology is the essential way to sustainable development.","t":"作为一种能使人与自然双赢的科学技术，绿色科技是通向**可持续**发展的必由之路。","r":"来自sustain（v. 维持）","c":"sustainable development 可持续发展"},
22106:{"w":"dispersal","e":"After receiving the fire alarm, the firefighters rushed to the scene and quickly finished the dispersal of the crowd that had gathered.","t":"接到火警后，消防人员迅速赶到现场，紧急**疏散**聚集的人群。"},
22107:{"w":"fabulous","e":"There is a fabulous performance this weekend in accordance with the poster.","t":"海报上说，这周末有一场**很棒**的演出。","r":"联想记忆：fab（看作fable，寓言）+ulous→寓言中的","c":"fabulous heroes 寓言中的英雄"},
22108:{"w":"retailing","e":"With the developing and popularizing of retailing, brand has changed into a symbol of products reputation for these manufacturers.","t":"随着**零售业**的发展和普及，品牌变成制造商产品声誉的象征。"},
22109:{"w":"rental","e":"Having one of these following cases, lessor shall terminate the rental agreement in advance.","t":"如有下列情形之一，出租人可以提前终止房屋**租赁**合同。","c":"rental agreement 租约"},
22110:{"w":"fraught","e":"The earliest operations employing this technique were fraught with dangers.","t":"最早采用这一技术的手术**充满**了危险。","r":"可能来自freight（n. 装运的货物）"},
22111:{"w":"obsession","e":"It is said that General Charles De Gaulle had an obsession with Mona Lisa which is one of the masterpieces of the Renaissance.","t":"据说戴高乐将军对《蒙娜丽莎》这幅文艺复兴时期的名作非常**着迷**。","r":"词根记忆：ob（逆，倒）+sess（坐）+ion→坐立不安→困扰","d":"obsessional（adj. 痴迷的，迷恋的；耿耿于怀的）；obsessive（adj. 迷恋的 n. 强迫症患者）"},
22112:{"w":"ethereal","e":"Entering the resort and breathing the clear and ethereal air, you will find yourself strolling in a haven of peace.","t":"进入度假胜地，呼吸着清新**缥缈**的空气，你就发现自己仿佛进入了世外桃源。","r":"来自ether（n. 太空；苍天）","c":"ethereal beauty 娇柔、飘逸之美"},
22113:{"w":"unobtrusive","e":"Listening to some quiet and unobtrusive music is one of the ways for me to find the inner tranquility after a long day.","t":"漫长的一天过后，听一些轻柔**平和**的音乐是我寻求内心平静的方式之一。","r":"联想记忆：un（表否定）+obtrusive（突出的）→不引人注目的"},
22114:{"w":"underpin","e":"The Copenhagen Conference appeals to all developed countries to reduce emissions by at least 80% in the same period and underpin these efforts through robust and comparable mid-term reductions.","t":"哥本哈根会议呼吁所有发达国家在同一时期内至少减排80%，同时通过中期有力的类似减排措施来**巩固**这一成绩。"},
22115:{"w":"nutritional","e":"This book provides nutritional information on over 3,000 different foods.","t":"这本书介绍了有关三千多种食物的**营养**知识。"},
22116:{"w":"velocity","e":"The parameters involved in this essay include mass ratio, initial relative impact velocity, absolute mass and relative acceleration.","t":"这篇论文涉及的参数有：质量比、初始相对碰撞**速度**、绝对质量和相对加速度。","r":"词根记忆：veloc（快的）+ity（表名词）→速度","c":"gain/lose velocity 加速/减速","y":"speed（n. 迅速；速度，速率）；rapidity（n. 迅速）"},
22117:{"w":"unveil","e":"The municipality decided to unveil its 2020 budget plan finally after several rounds of seminars with lawmakers and economic experts.","t":"经过与立法者和经济学家数回合的研究讨论，市政当局终于决定**公布**2020年的预算方案。","r":"联想记忆：un（解开）+veil（面纱）→揭去面纱"},
22118:{"w":"prototype","e":"Though still in prototype phase, the gloves seem to have impressed the experts.","t":"尽管仍处于**原型**阶段，这种手套似乎给专家们留下了深刻的印象。","r":"词根记忆：proto（第一）+typ（形状）+e→首先的形状→原型","y":"archetype（n. 原型）；original（n. 原物，原作）"},
22119:{"w":"swivel","e":"The old man sat down on a squeaky swivel chair and dozed fitfully.","t":"老人坐在嘎吱作响的**转**椅里，断断续续地打着瞌睡。"},
22120:{"w":"replicate","e":"A new computer virus was reportedly found in the new operating system by replicating itself and passing along from user to user.","t":"据报道，在新的操作系统中发现了一种新型电脑病毒，它通过自我**复制**在电脑用户间传播。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+plic（重叠）+ate→一再重叠→复制"},
22121:{"w":"capsize","e":"Things are always contradictory and interdependent to each other, as water can carry the boat, but it can also capsize it.","t":"事物总是相互对立又相互依存的，正如“水能载舟，亦能**覆**舟”。","r":"联想记忆：cap（帽子）+size（大小）→像帽子一样小的船容易翻→翻，倾覆"},
22122:{"w":"project","e":"I think this project could be adapted to suit any age.","t":"我觉得可以将该**计划**加以改动以适合所有年龄的人群。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+ject（投掷）→向前掷→（使）突出，（使）伸出","c":"draw up a project 制订方案；carry out a project 执行方案"},
22123:{"w":"thorny","e":"This thorny problem on environmental protection floored the new mayor.","t":"这个关于环境保护的**棘手**问题把新市长难住了。","r":"联想记忆：t+horn（角）+y→有角的刺→多刺的"},
22124:{"w":"eligible","e":"You are eligible for a student loan if you are a UK resident.","t":"如果你是英国居民，就**可以申请**学生贷款。","r":"词根记忆：e+lig（选择）+ible（可…的）→能被选择出来的→符合条件的","c":"be eligible to 有资格做…","y":"desirable（adj. 值得要的，合意的）；qualified（adj. 有资格的）；suitable（adj. 适当的，相配的）"},
22125:{"w":"admit","e":"Bill was forced to admit that he had cheated on the test.","t":"比尔被迫**承认**他在考试中作弊了。","r":"词根记忆：ad+mit（送）→能送进去→准许…进入","d":"admission（n. 准许进入；入场费；承认）"},
22126:{"w":"bacterial","e":"Leaving any remaining nonviable tissue may create an environment for bacterial growth.","t":"留下任何残存的死组织都可能为**细菌**生长创造环境。","c":"bacterial infection 细菌感染"},
22127:{"w":"management","e":"Why do you think that some changes have come about in the national revenue management?","t":"你为什么会认为国家税收**管理**发生了改变呢？","r":"联想记忆：man（人）+age（年纪）+ment→到了一定年龄，富有经验的人适合做管理人员→管理（部门、人员）"},
22128:{"w":"enrolment","e":"When you apply for a student loan, most banks ask you to bring your passport and your letter or certificate of enrolment.","t":"申请学生贷款的时候，很多银行会要求你随身携带护照、入学介绍信或**入学**证明。","r":"联想记忆：enrol（登记；入学）+ment→登记；入学","c":"enrolment form 登记表"},
22129:{"w":"strategy","e":"The Ottawa Charter presents fundamental strategies and approaches in achieving health for all.","t":"《渥太华宪章》提出了实现全民健康的基本**策略**和方法。","r":"联想记忆：str（看作strange，奇怪的）+ate（吃）+gy→用奇怪的方法吃掉对手→战略，策略","c":"marketing strategies 营销策略；reading strategy 阅读策略；research strategy 研究策略"},
22130:{"w":"emerge","e":"A new style of architecture emerged to reflect more idealistic notions for the future.","t":"一种新的建筑风格**出现**了，它反映了未来更为理想的建筑理念。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+merg（沉，没）+e→从浸没物之中出来→显露"},
22131:{"w":"submerge","e":"The city was submerged by the flood.","t":"这座城市被洪水**淹没**了。","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+merg（沉，没）+e→浸没；潜入水中"},
22132:{"w":"mantle","e":"Magma surged into the volcano from the Earth's mantle.","t":"岩浆从地球的**地幔**涌入火山。"},
22133:{"w":"overall","e":"The overall absence rate of the company is 3.6 percent in the first year.","t":"公司第一年度的**总**缺勤率为3.6%。","r":"组合词：over（从头到尾）+all（所有的）→全面的；全部的","c":"overall checkup 全面检查"},
22134:{"w":"granite","e":"This provided 7,000 cubic metres of granite to add to the island's foundations.","t":"这为小岛地基的建设提供了7,000立方米的**花岗石**。","r":"词根记忆：gran（=grain，颗粒）+ite→颗粒状石头→花岗岩，花岗石"},
22135:{"w":"approximate","e":"I would like to know the approximate price of this car.","t":"我想了解一下这辆车的**大概**价位。","r":"词根记忆：ap（表加强）+proxim（接近）+ate→接近的→近似的","d":"approximately（adv. 近似地；大约）"},
22136:{"w":"gallery","e":"We'll go to the Picture Gallery with a marvellous collection of paintings all by Australian artists.","t":"我们将前往**美术馆**，那里收藏了一些优秀的画作，它们全部出自澳大利亚画家之手。"},
22137:{"w":"community","e":"Detailed surveys of social and economic trends in the European Community show that Europe's population is falling and getting older.","t":"欧洲**共同体**开展的关于社会经济趋势的详细调查显示，欧洲人口在减少且开始呈现老龄化趋势。","r":"词根记忆：com+mun（公共的）+ity→公共状态→社区","c":"the Asian community 亚洲人聚居的社区；sense of community 社区意识；community spirit 团体精神"},
22138:{"w":"swing","e":"The bus swung sharply to the left.","t":"公共汽车猛地**拐**向左边。","r":"联想记忆：s+wing（翅膀）→摇摆翅膀，在风中盘旋→摇摆"},
22139:{"w":"cite","e":"Studies of the sources cited in publications lead to a conclusion: the use of foreign-language sources is often found to be as low as 10 percent.","t":"对于出版物中**引用**的原始资料的研究得出了一个结论：外语资料的使用通常仅占10％。"},
22140:{"w":"spectrum","e":"Sufferers can fight back by spending a few hours each day under special, full-spectrum lamps.","t":"患者可以通过每天在特制的全**光谱**灯下照射几小时来缓解身体的不适。","r":"词根记忆：spect（看）+rum→能看到光的颜色→光谱","c":"electromagnetic spectrum 电磁光谱","y":"range（n. 范围，幅度）"},
22141:{"w":"drawback","e":"The only drawback to the plan is the expense.","t":"该计划的唯一**缺点**是费用问题。","r":"联想记忆：draw（拉）+back（向后）→拖后腿→缺点；不利条件"},
22142:{"w":"identity","e":"If people want to enter this building, their identities must be authenticated by an electronic scanner.","t":"如果人们想进入这座大楼，需经电子扫描仪进行**身份**验证。","r":"联想记忆：i+dent（牙齿）+ity（表性质）→通过牙齿来确定身份→身份","c":"cultural identity 文化特性"},
22143:{"w":"trend","e":"In your opinion, will this trend continue into the future?","t":"依你看，这种**趋势**在未来还会继续吗？","r":"联想记忆：tend（倾向）加r还是倾向（trend）","c":"downward trend 下跌趋势；upward trend 上升趋势；economic trend 经济趋势；recent trend 最近的趋势；sweeping trends席卷一切的潮流"},
22144:{"w":"extreme","e":"One mistake we often make when stricken with extreme back pain is to go to bed and stay there.","t":"当背部出现**剧**痛时我们经常犯的一个错误就是上床躺着。","r":"联想记忆：extre（看作extra，以外的）+me（我）→在我能忍受的极限以外→极端","c":"in the extreme 极其","d":"extremely（adv. 极端地；非常地）"},
22145:{"w":"skip","e":"She skips the difficult words when she reads English novels.","t":"看英文小说时她经常**跳过**难词。","y":"leap（v. 跳，跳跃；跳过）；overlook（vt. 忽视，略过）"},
22146:{"w":"military","e":"The gizmo is called the Army Flashlight because it was developed initially for military use.","t":"这种小发明被称为“军队闪光灯”，因为它最初是为**军事**目的研制的。","r":"词根记忆：milit（战斗）+ary（…的）→军事的"},
22147:{"w":"vested","e":"The politicians didn't have the courage to confront the vested interest that subsidies create.","t":"政治家们没有勇气去对抗补贴带来的**既得**利益。","r":"联想记忆：到了法律规定的（vested）年龄，就被授予（vest）选举的权利"},
22148:{"w":"symphony","e":"The audience were all enchanted by the engrossing symphony.","t":"**交响乐**美妙绝伦，听众全都陶醉其中。","r":"词根记忆：sym（共同）+phon（声音）+y→奏出共同的声音→交响乐","y":"concord（n. 和谐，一致）；harmony（n. 协调，和谐）","f":"discord（n. 不一致，不和谐）"},
22149:{"w":"locate","e":"The college is located at London Road.","t":"这所大学**位于**伦敦路。","r":"词根记忆：loc（地方）+ate（做）→找到；位于上。","c":"factory located far away 坐落在远处的工厂"},
22150:{"w":"classify","e":"The researcher has classified environmental tobacco smoke in the highest risk category for causing cancer.","t":"研究人员将环境香烟烟雾**归类**于最高风险致癌物。","r":"联想记忆：class（类别）+ify（使…）→把…归类"},
22151:{"w":"enthusiastic","e":"With lights flashing and horns honking, the newly-manufactured vehicles poured into the world like enthusiastic machines from the science-fiction movie.","t":"车灯闪烁，喇叭轰鸣，新生产出来的汽车就像是科幻电影中**充满热情**的机器一样涌入大千世界。","r":"词根记忆：enthusi（=enthuse，热心）+astic→热情的","c":"enthusiastic applause 热烈的掌声；enthusiastic reception 热诚的接待","y":"eager（adj. 热切的，渴望的）；passionate（adj. 充满热情"},
22152:{"w":"alter","e":"We may be able to alter our genetic inheritance if we so choose.","t":"如果愿意，我们可以**改变**自己的基因遗传。","r":"本身为词根，意为“改变状态”"},
22153:{"w":"disqualify","e":"Will this disqualify me from getting a student loan?","t":"这会不会**取消**我获得学生贷款的资格？","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+qualify（具有资格）→使不具有资格→使丧失资格","c":"disqualify sb. from（doing） sth. 使某人丧失（做）某事的资格"},
22154:{"w":"maximum","e":"Students on a visitor visa or work permit may study for a maximum of 3 months.","t":"持旅行签证或工作许可证的学生**最多**可有三个月的学习时间。","r":"词根记忆：max（大）+imum→最大的，最高的"},
22155:{"w":"delivery","e":"The invention of the motor vehicle brought personal mobility to the masses and made rapid freight delivery possible over a much wider area.","t":"机动车的发明带来了人员的大规模流动，同时使得更大区域内的快速货**运**成为可能。"},
22156:{"w":"undergraduate","e":"The Universities of Oxford and Cambridge recently held joint conferences to discuss the noticeably rapid decline in literacy among undergraduates.","t":"牛津大学和剑桥大学近期召开了几次联合会议，讨论**本科生**文化水平显著快速下降的问题。","r":"组合词：under（不足）+graduate（毕业生）→还不是毕业生→大学本科生"},
22157:{"w":"focus","e":"The primary focus of attention in the twentieth century has been on small-scale societies.","t":"在20世纪，小型社会成了人们首要关注的**焦点**。","c":"focus（sth.） on 使聚集，集中；（使）聚焦"},
22158:{"w":"administer","e":"The personnel director administers the attendance policy.","t":"人事经理**负责**考勤。","c":"administer to 有助于；给予"},
22159:{"w":"ash","e":"The volcanic ash caused a lot of damage in the village.","t":"火山**灰**给村庄造成了很大的破坏。","c":"cigar ash 雪茄烟灰"},
22160:{"w":"intensify","e":"The strong wind seemed to intensify the cold.","t":"狂风似乎**加剧**了寒冷。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+tens（伸展）+ify（使…）→使向内伸展→使增强"},
22161:{"w":"inventory","e":"Managing agents can offer a total service from reliable sourcing, managing inventory to budget control and distribution.","t":"运营代理商可以提供从可靠货源、库房**存货**管理到预算控制和商品分销的全套服务。","r":"词根记忆：in+vent（来）+ory（表物）→有关所有进来的货物→目录；存货","y":"checklist（n. 清单）"},
22162:{"w":"event","e":"Your graduation from college is an important event.","t":"你大学毕业了，这是件**大事**。","c":"in the event of 万一，如果"},
22163:{"w":"crucial","e":"The presence of human beings is crucial to the survival of the forest.","t":"人类的存在对森林的存活**至关重要**。","r":"词根记忆：cruc（十字形）+ial（…的）→十字路口→决定性的，至关重要的","c":"crucial to/for 对…至关重要；at a crucial time 在关键时刻；crucial question 关键问题"},
22164:{"w":"stage","e":"The next stage of the project is the design phase.","t":"该项目的下一个**阶段**是设计阶段。","c":"on/off stage 在台上/台下；stage fright 怯场；at this stage of life 处于这个人生阶段"},
22165:{"w":"aeration","e":"The tunnels abandoned by the beetles provide excellent aeration and water channels for root systems of plants.","t":"被甲虫遗弃的地下通道为植物的根系提供了绝佳的**通风**和汲水管道。","r":"词根记忆：aer（空气）+ation（表状态）→能通空气→通风"},
22166:{"w":"profitable","e":"It is profitable for employers to work their existing employees hard.","t":"雇主让他们的雇员努力工作是**有利可图**的。","r":"联想记忆：profit（利益）+able（能…的）→能获利的→有利可图的，赚钱的","c":"highly profitable business 非常有利可图的生意","y":"beneficial（adj. 有益的，有利的）；lucrative（adj. 赚钱的；有利可图的）","f":"unprofitable（adj. 无利益的，不赚钱的）；worthless（adj.无价值的，无益的）"},
22167:{"w":"faith","e":"People have to have faith in their ability to carry out the task their boss has set them.","t":"大家必须**相信**自己有能力完成老板布置的任务。","r":"联想记忆：屡败（fail）屡战，信心（faith）不倦","c":"have faith in 信任…，相信…；lose faith in 不信任…，不相信…；religious faith 宗教信仰"},
22168:{"w":"cafeteria","e":"Bill had lunch in the school cafeteria.","t":"比尔在学校**食堂**吃的午饭。","r":"联想记忆：cafe（咖啡馆）+teria→自助餐馆"},
22169:{"w":"involve","e":"No city can be simply a port but must be involved in a variety of other activities.","t":"没有哪个城市能够单纯作为港口，它必然还**含有**其他多种功能。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+volv（卷）+e→使卷入，牵涉","c":"involve in 卷入，参加；involve sb. in 使某人卷入，使某人陷入","d":"involvement（n. 参与；投入；沉迷）"},
22170:{"w":"dairy","e":"Try using low-lactose dairy foods, such as yogurt, instead of milk.","t":"尝试用一些低乳的**奶制品**，如酸奶，来代替牛奶。","r":"联想记忆：每天（daily）吃乳制品（dairy）强壮骨骼","c":"dairy cattle 乳牛；dairy farm 乳牛场"},
22171:{"w":"confirm","e":"If a prediction based on a hypothesis is fulfilled, then the hypothesis is confirmed.","t":"如果基于某一假设的预测得到实现，那么该假设就被**证实**是正确的。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+firm（坚定）→使更加坚定→证实；肯定","d":"confirmation（n. 证实；批准）"},
22172:{"w":"hinge","e":"The two metal tubes joined at a hinge at one end.","t":"这两根金属管的末端连接在一个**铰链**上。","r":"发音记忆：“很紧”→铰链很紧，转不动→铰链"},
22173:{"w":"subsidise","e":"They actually subsidise the exploitation and consumption of natural resources.","t":"他们实际上为自然资源的开发和消费提供**资助**。","r":"来自subsidy（n. 津贴；补助金）"},
22174:{"w":"stain","e":"The ink stained his shirt blue.","t":"墨水给他的衬衫**染上**了蓝色。","r":"联想记忆：一下雨（rain），到处都是污点（stain）"},
22175:{"w":"unload","e":"Loading and unloading costs can be minimised by refining raw materials or turning them into finished goods.","t":"可以通过对原材料进行加工或将其制成成品来将它们的装**卸**成本降至最低。","r":"联想记忆：un+load（负荷，重担）→从…卸下货物"},
22176:{"w":"conversion","e":"Clean coal is another avenue for improving fuel conversion efficiency.","t":"洁净煤是提高燃烧**转换**效率的另一种途径。","r":"词根记忆：con+vers（转）+ion→转化；转变"},
22177:{"w":"irrelevant","e":"What you wrote is almost irrelevant to the topic.","t":"你写的文章和主题几乎**无关**。","r":"联想记忆：ir（不）+relevant（有关的）→不相关的"},
22178:{"w":"thrill","e":"The traveller thrilled us with his stories of adventure.","t":"这位旅行者的冒险经历令我们**激动不已**。","c":"be thrilled to bits 非常愉快","y":"excite（vt. 使激动，使兴奋）；delight〔v.（使）高兴，（使）欣喜〕"},
22179:{"w":"trial","e":"The trial lasted for three days.","t":"**审讯**持续了三天。","c":"clinical trial 临床试验；trial period 试用期；time trial 计时比赛；on trial（指人）在试用期间；（指物）在试验中"},
22180:{"w":"extol","e":"Weld extolled Kerry's debate skills, saying he has \"the speed of a welter-weight.\"","t":"韦尔德**称赞**了克里的辩论技巧，说他有着“次中量级拳击手的速度”。","r":"词根记忆：ex（使…）+tol（举起）→举起双手，赞美对方→赞美"},
22181:{"w":"albeit","e":"A program for low-carbon energy finally got through this month, albeit in substantially scaled-down form.","t":"一项低碳能源的计划本月最终获得通过，**尽管**其规模大大缩小。"},
22182:{"w":"obstacle","e":"An obstacle, setback or delay means only one thing: it's not time for your goal to be completed yet.","t":"一个**障碍**、挫败或延迟只意味着一件事：现在还不是你实现目标的时候。","r":"词根记忆：ob（逆）+st（站）+acle（表小东西）→反着站的小物体→障碍，妨碍物","c":"obstacle course 障碍赛跑赛场，重重困难；natural obstacles天然障碍"},
22183:{"w":"meagre","e":"His meagre salary couldn't afford the basic consumption in the time of inflation.","t":"通货膨胀期间，他那点**可怜巴巴**的工资不足以维持最基本的开销。"},
22184:{"w":"precipitation","e":"According to the statistics released by the Office of State Flood Control and Drought Relief Headquarters, precipitation in many parts of central China has been 50 to 80 percent above normal.","t":"国家防汛抗旱总指挥部办公室公布的数据显示，华中很多地区的**降水量**比同期正常水平高了50%~80%。"},
22185:{"w":"precarious","e":"The peninsula's peace will face a precarious situation if the negotiation breaks down.","t":"如果谈判破裂，半岛的和平将面临**岌岌可危**的局面。","r":"联想记忆：pre（前）+car（汽车）+ious→坐在汽车前面→不安全的"},
22186:{"w":"autonomy","e":"Each of the area managers enjoys considerable autonomy in the running of his own area.","t":"每一位地区经理在各自主管的区域都享有相当大的**自主权**。","r":"词根记忆：auto（自己）+nomy（某一领域的知识、理论）→自治，自治权","d":"autonomous（adj. 自治的；独立自主的）"},
22187:{"w":"credibility","e":"Credibility is an essential characteristic that is built on the elements of integrity, reliability, veracity, competence and commitment.","t":"**诚信**是一个重要的品质，是建立在正直、可靠、诚实、能力和承诺的基础之上的。","r":"词根记忆：cred（相信）+ibility（可…性）→可信性，可靠性"},
22188:{"w":"onslaught","e":"The onslaught of media attention has brought unnecessary distraction to the boxer who should focus exclusively on his competition.","t":"媒体**铺天盖地**的关注使这个拳击手很分心，他本应该只专注于比赛的。","r":"联想记忆：on+slaught（er）（打击）→猛攻，猛袭"},
22189:{"w":"curtail","e":"The new constitution imposed dogmatic property rules which had severely curtailed people's interest.","t":"新宪法强制推行专断财产法，严重**削减**了民众利益。","r":"词根记忆：cur（=curt，短）+tail（剪）→剪短→缩短，削减","y":"abridge（vt. 缩减，减短）；shorten（v. 缩短）"},
22190:{"w":"correlation","e":"There's a high correlation between trace element selenium insufficiency and functional disease.","t":"微量元素硒不足和官能性疾病有着紧密的**联系**。","r":"联想记忆：cor（共同）+relation（关系）→相互关系"},
22191:{"w":"afflicting","e":"Violent crime is only one of the maladies afflicting modern society.","t":"暴力犯罪仅仅是**困扰**现代社会的严重问题之一。"},
22192:{"w":"simulation","e":"The manager was beforehand with a computer simulation of likely sales performance in advance of the Spring Festival.","t":"经理在春节来临前就事先用计算机**模拟**出了可能的销售业绩。"},
22193:{"w":"incongruous","e":"As incongruous as it may sound, the little frog with big eyes has no lungs and gets all the oxygen it needs through its skin.","t":"听起来可能**不可思议**的是，这种身材小巧、眼睛大大的蛙类居然没有肺，所需氧气均要靠皮肤来获得。"},
22194:{"w":"remuneration","e":"To meet the requirements of public interest, the investment of the investors could be expropriated in compliance with legal procedure with a due remuneration.","t":"为了满足公共利益的需求，可以依照法律程序没收投资者的投资，并给予相应的**报酬**。"},
22195:{"w":"intermix","e":"In an insignificant basis of reality, the imagination spins, weaving new patterns and intermixing with memories, experience, free fancies, incongruities and improvisations.","t":"在微不足道的现实中，想象力织就着新的世界，**混合**着记忆、经历、自由幻想、怪异及随想。"},
22196:{"w":"paramount","e":"We believed that it is of paramount importance to disseminate knowledge, so that patient care will continue to improve across Europe and beyond.","t":"我们相信传播知识是**最重要**的，以使欧洲及其他地方的患者护理得到持续改善。","r":"联想记忆：par+amount（数量）→在量上超过别的→最重要的，决定性的"},
22197:{"w":"hypnotic","e":"Western people believed that being hypnotic could help people remember something happening in life.","t":"西方人相信，**催眠**可以帮助人们记起生活中发生的一些事。"},
22198:{"w":"suffice","e":"No more boring lectures, painful seminars or tiring presentations. A few sentences will suffice.","t":"没有枯燥的说教、痛苦的研讨会或令人厌倦的演讲，几句话就**够**了。","r":"词根记忆：suf（表加强）+fic（做）+e→拼命地做→满足…的需求；足够","c":"suffice（it） to say 只要说…就够了","d":"sufficiency（n. 充足）；sufficient（adj. 足够的，充分的）；sufficiently（adv. 充分地，十分）","f":"lack（vt. 缺乏）"},
22199:{"w":"technician","e":"This looseness in molecular structure of glass allows technicians to tailor it to whatever they need.","t":"玻璃松散的分子结构使**技术人员**可以按照自己的需求对其进行加工。","r":"词根记忆：techn（技艺）+ician（表人）→技术员，技师"},
22200:{"w":"apart","e":"Apart from the Second World War period, the Winter Olympics were held every four years.","t":"**除了**第二次世界大战期间，冬奥会每四年举行一次。","r":"联想记忆：a+part（分开）→分离的"},
22201:{"w":"mainstream","e":"His radical views place him outside the mainstream of American politics.","t":"他的激进观点使他脱离了美国政治的**主流**。","r":"组合词：main（主要的）+stream（溪，流）→主流，主要趋势，主要倾向"},
22202:{"w":"flush","e":"You can flush a wound with iodine to prevent the infection.","t":"可以用碘酒**冲洗**伤口，以防止感染。","r":"联想记忆：在闪烁（flash）的镁光灯下，她的脸通红（flush）","c":"flush away 冲掉，冲去","y":"redden〔v.（使）变红；（脸因羞涩、愤怒等）发红〕；douche（vt. 冲洗，灌洗）"},
22203:{"w":"stir","e":"You'd better give the coffee a stir before you drink it.","t":"喝咖啡之前最好先**搅拌**一下。","r":"本身是词根，意为“刺激”"},
22204:{"w":"odd","e":"We are attracted by the odd behavior of the boy.","t":"男孩**古怪**的行为吸引了我们。","r":"联想记忆：奇奇（odd）相加（add）为偶","d":"oddly（adv. 奇特地）"},
22205:{"w":"inject","e":"By injecting lime into the land around the water and neutralizing the effects of acid, scientists have created conditions in which fish can survive.","t":"通过对水域周围的土地**注入**石灰，中和当地的酸性效应，科学家已经创造出能让鱼存活的环境。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+ject（投掷）→投进去→注入，灌输","d":"injection（n. 注射）","y":"implant（vt. 注入，灌输）；infuse（vt. 注入，灌输）"},
22206:{"w":"demand","e":"Tall buildings were constructed to help meet the demand for more economical use of land.","t":"高层建筑的建造是为了满足节约用地的**需求**。","r":"词根记忆：de（向下）+mand（命令）→向下命令→要求，需求","c":"in great demand 需求量大；demand for 对…（的）需求"},
22207:{"w":"unsatisfactory","e":"Reception of television programmes is unsatisfactory here.","t":"这个地区电视节目的接收情况**不能令人满意**。"},
22208:{"w":"excursion","e":"Our family took a two-week excursion to France.","t":"我们一家人去法国**旅行**了两周。","c":"Saturday excursion 周六短途旅行"},
22209:{"w":"grid","e":"New York is laid out on a grid, which makes it easier to find your way around.","t":"纽约市的布局呈**网格**状，因此你不容易迷路。","c":"power grid 电力网"},
22210:{"w":"controversial","e":"The appearance of individual buildings is often controversial.","t":"私人建筑的外观常常会引起**争议**。","r":"词根记忆：contro（相反）+vers（转）+ial（…的）→反着转的→争论的"},
22211:{"w":"wagon","e":"The horses were harnessed and hooked to the wagon.","t":"这些马被装上挽具，套到**马车**上。","c":"rail wagon 铁路车皮"},
22212:{"w":"reputation","e":"The college has already established a national reputation for its excellence.","t":"该校凭借着自己的卓越表现已经**享誉**全国。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+put（思考）+ation（表状态）→反复思考，名气只是过眼烟云→名誉，名声","c":"have a reputation for 因…而闻名；ruin reputation 损害名声；live up to its reputation 与其名气相符"},
22213:{"w":"tag","e":"If you are going to see the film, would you mind if I tag along?","t":"你要是去看电影，我也**跟着**去行吗？","r":"联想记忆：在包（bag）上贴标签（tag）"},
22214:{"w":"dizzy","e":"He is dizzy and confused and does not want to be here.","t":"他感到**眩晕**迷惑，不想待在这儿。","r":"联想记忆：di（二）+zz（打鼾声）+y→两个室友都打鼾，吵得我头晕→眩晕的","y":"giddy（adj. 眼花缭乱的；头晕的）"},
22215:{"w":"immune","e":"The viruses stimulated the immune system.","t":"病毒刺激了**免疫**系统。","r":"词根记忆：im（没有）+mun（公共的）+e→免疫的；免除的","c":"immune system 免疫系统","d":"autoimmune（adj. 自体免疫的）","y":"resistant（adj. 有抵抗力的）；invulnerable（adj. 无法伤害的）","f":"susceptible（adj. 易受…影响或损害的）；liable（adj. 易于…的）"},
22216:{"w":"carve","e":"At the family dinner, my grandfather always carves the roast turkey into thin slices for everyone at the table.","t":"家庭聚餐时，爷爷总是把烤火鸡**切**成薄片，分给桌上的每个人。","c":"carve in stone（决定、计划）等不能改变的","y":"engrave（vt. 雕刻）；sculpture（v. 雕刻，雕塑）"},
22217:{"w":"geology","e":"The geology varies a good deal from region to region even in one country.","t":"即使是在同一个国家，不同地区的**地况**也极为不同。","r":"词根记忆：geo（地）+logy（…学）→地质学"},
22218:{"w":"directory","e":"For our addresses, just check in your local telephone directory.","t":"你可以在当地的电话**簿**中找到我们的地址。","r":"联想记忆：direct（指引）+ory（表物）→指引人们查询的东西→人名地址录"},
22219:{"w":"vital","e":"The Department has a vital role to play in providing information to visitors and scholars.","t":"该部门在为来访者及学者提供信息方面发挥着**极其重要**的作用。","r":"词根记忆：vit（生命）+al（…的）→事关生命的→生死攸关的","c":"vital to/for sth. 对…极重要的，对…必不可少的；at the vital moment 在关键时刻；a vital error 一个致命的错误；a vital decision一个重要决定"},
22220:{"w":"droplet","e":"Study of atmospheric particles formed from the explosion showed that droplets of sulphuric acid, acting as a screen between the Sun and the Earth's surface, caused a distinct drop in temperature.","t":"对爆炸后形成的大气颗粒的研究显示，硫酸**小液滴**在太阳与地球表面之间形成了一层屏障，使气温明显降低。","r":"联想记忆：drop（看作drip，水滴）+let（表小东西）→小水滴→小滴"},
22221:{"w":"reveal","e":"The Human Genome Project will reveal a new human anatomy—the complete genetic blueprint for a human being.","t":"人类基因工程将**揭开**人类解剖学的新篇章——描绘完整的人类基因蓝图。","r":"联想记忆：re（相反）+veal（看作veil，面纱）→揭开面纱→揭露；展现","c":"reveal secret 泄露秘密"},
22222:{"w":"visible","e":"Comets are only normally visible in the immediate vicinity of the sun.","t":"彗星只有在最接近太阳时才**可见**。","r":"词根记忆：vis（看）+ible（可…的）→可见的，看得见的","d":"invisible（adj. 看不见的，无形的）"},
22223:{"w":"conference","e":"I'm going to a conference in London.","t":"我要去伦敦参加一个**会议**。"},
22224:{"w":"cholesterol","e":"Ostrich meat is much lower in fat and cholesterol than beef.","t":"鸵鸟肉中的脂肪和**胆固醇**含量比牛肉中的低很多。","r":"组合词：chole（胆，胆汁）+sterol（固醇）→胆固醇"},
22225:{"w":"calcium","e":"Calcium is essential for developing healthy bones.","t":"**钙**对骨骼的健康生长至关重要。","r":"词根记忆：calc（石头，石灰）+ium→石灰中含碳酸钙→钙"},
22226:{"w":"construct","e":"This anticipation is constructed through films, TV and literature.","t":"这一预想通过电影、电视和文学得以**构思**成形。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+struct（建立）→建造；构筑","c":"construct a model 制作模型；construct an argument 建立论点","d":"construction（n. 建筑，建造物）"},
22227:{"w":"interval","e":"The discussion was so prolonged and exhausting that at intervals the speakers stopped for refreshment.","t":"讨论冗长又使人疲倦，以至于发言人**不时**要停下来休息。","r":"词根记忆：inter（在…之间）+val→处在两者之间的→间距；间隔"},
22228:{"w":"advent","e":"Sea ports have been transformed by the advent of powered vessels, whose size and draught have increased.","t":"配有引擎的货船体积更加庞大，可以装载更多货物，它们的**出现**改变了海港原有的样子。","r":"词根记忆：ad+vent（来）→到来；出现","c":"the advent of sth. …的到来"},
22229:{"w":"aggressiveness","e":"The message behind a crushing handshake is aggressiveness and a desire to compete.","t":"在和他人握手时如果很用力，它传达的信息是**争斗**或想和对方竞争。"},
22230:{"w":"category","e":"After the final interview, potential recruits were divided into three categories.","t":"经过最后的面试，可能入选的新成员被分成三**类**。"},
22231:{"w":"fault","e":"Any fault should be reported to the local fault repair service.","t":"出现任何**问题**都应报知当地的维修中心。"},
22232:{"w":"confusion","e":"This medicine may cause hair loss, depression or confusion, and yellowing of skin or eyes.","t":"服用该药有可能导致脱发、精神抑郁或**神志不清**，还可能致使肤色或眼睛发黄。","r":"联想记忆：confus(e)（使困惑）+ion→困惑，糊涂"},
22233:{"w":"wrinkle","e":"From where we are in the orchestra, you can see every wrinkle on her face.","t":"从我们所在的剧院位置，你可以看到她脸上的每一条**皱纹**。","r":"联想记忆：眨眼（twinkle）容易起皱纹（wrinkle）"},
22234:{"w":"huddle","e":"There is a huddle of people around the injured man.","t":"一群人**聚**在伤者周围。","r":"联想记忆：大家聚集在一起（huddle）处理（handle）问题"},
22235:{"w":"clash","e":"In the clash between environmentalists and developers, the Native Americans have suffered the most.","t":"在环境保护主义者和开发者之间的**冲突**中，美洲原住民受到的伤害最大。","r":"发音记忆：该词的发音类似物体撞碎的声音","c":"personality clashes 性格冲突"},
22236:{"w":"briefly","e":"He paused briefly before continuing.","t":"他停了**片刻**又继续进行。"},
22237:{"w":"commodity","e":"Nowadays, the airlines are treating their seats like a commodity.","t":"现在，航空公司把客机的席位看作是一种**商品**（进行出售）。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+mod（模式）+ity（表名词）→有共同模式的东西→商品","c":"commodity economy 商品经济；commodities fair 商品交易会；commodity price 商品价格；agricultural commodities 农业产品；commodity inspection 商品检查","y":"goods（n. 货物）"},
22238:{"w":"marble","e":"In this game, you can insert a marble into a small hole to open the door.","t":"在这个游戏中，你可以往一个小洞里塞入一颗**弹珠**来把门打开。","r":"联想记忆：mar（看作March，三月）+ble→大理三月好风光哎→大理石"},
22239:{"w":"booth","e":"In our company, we work in separate booths.","t":"在公司里，我们在**隔间**里工作。","r":"联想记忆：他在公用电话亭（booth）里打电话说他牙（tooth）不好"},
22240:{"w":"imitation","e":"A child learns to talk by imitation.","t":"小孩子通过**模仿**学会说话。","c":"in imitation of 模仿，仿效","y":"fake（n. 假货，赝品）；counterfeit（n. 赝品）"},
22241:{"w":"exceed","e":"World population in the twenty-first century will probably exceed 8 billion.","t":"世界人口总数在21世纪有可能**超过**80亿。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+ceed（行走）→走出→超过，胜过","c":"exceed speed limit 超速"},
22242:{"w":"cohesion","e":"The Women's Social and Political Union (WSPU) brought the suffragette movement the cohesion and focus it had previously lacked.","t":"妇女社会政治同盟为妇女参政运动带来了前所未有的**凝聚力**。","r":"词根记忆：co（共同）+hes（黏附）+ion（表状态）→黏附在一起→结合，团结；凝聚力"},
22243:{"w":"livestock","e":"The country banned the import of all ruminant livestock from Europe.","t":"该国禁止从欧洲进口任何反刍类**家畜**。","r":"组合词：live（活）+stock（东西）→活物→家畜，牲畜"},
22244:{"w":"astound","e":"The eruption in May 1980 of Mount St. Helens, Washington State, astounded the world with its violence.","t":"1980年5月，位于华盛顿的圣海伦斯火山喷发所产生的强大破坏力**震惊**了世界。","r":"联想记忆：as+tound（看作sound，声音）→像被奇怪的声音吓倒→使震惊","d":"astounding（adj. 令人震惊的）"},
22245:{"w":"absorb","e":"Trees can absorb carbon dioxide.","t":"树木可以**吸收**二氧化碳。","r":"词根记忆：ab（离去）+sorb（吸收）→吸收掉→吸收","c":"be absorbed into/in 全神贯注于…","d":"absorption（n. 吸收）"},
22246:{"w":"decrease","e":"Do you think the cinema has increased or decreased in popularity in recent years?","t":"你认为近年来电影受欢迎的程度是提高了还是**降低**了？","r":"词根记忆：de（向下）+creas（增长）+e→负增加→减少","c":"decrease to 减少到"},
22247:{"w":"moral","e":"Altering our genetic inheritance is a moral problem.","t":"改变我们的遗传基因是一个**伦理**问题。","r":"词根记忆：mor（道德）+al（…的）→道德的，伦理的","c":"public morals 社会公德","d":"moralistic（adj. 道学的；说教的）"},
22248:{"w":"weigh","e":"These boxes are heavy with honey and may weigh up to 90 pounds each.","t":"这些装满蜂蜜的盒子非常重，每个都可能**重达**90磅。","c":"weigh advantages and disadvantages 权衡利弊；weigh out 称出"},
22249:{"w":"ceramic","e":"Glass ceramics can serve as nose cones of missiles.","t":"玻璃**瓷**可用来制造导弹的头锥体。","r":"联想记忆：c+era（时代，时期）+mic→古时中国以陶器而闻名→陶瓷器"},
22250:{"w":"acquisition","e":"Tom's newest acquisition is a luxurious sports car.","t":"汤姆新**获得**了一辆豪华跑车。"},
22251:{"w":"character","e":"The interview does give you a bit of information about an applicant's character.","t":"面试确实能给你提供一些和应聘者**性格**有关的信息。","r":"联想记忆：char+acter（看作actor，演员）→演员刻画人物性格，惟妙惟肖→性格","c":"character trait 性格特征；character flaw 性格缺陷；cartoon character 卡通人物；in character 适合，相称；out of character 不适合，不相称"},
22252:{"w":"arrange","e":"The Language Institute activities coordinator can assist students to arrange any sport and leisure activities.","t":"语言学院的活动负责人可以帮助学生**安排**任何体育和休闲活动。","r":"联想记忆：ar（表加强）+range（排列）→有序地排列→安排；排列","c":"arrange for sb. to do sth. 安排…做…；arrange the conference room 布置会议室；arrange the accommodation 安排住宿"},
22253:{"w":"conservation","e":"We just set up a new wildlife conservation programme here.","t":"我们刚刚在这里启动了一个新的野生动物**保护**项目。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+serv（服务）+ation→一再为其服务→保存；保护"},
22254:{"w":"earthworm","e":"The digested dung in these burrows is an excellent food supply for the earthworms.","t":"这些洞里（蜣螂）消化过的粪球给**蚯蚓**提供了极好的食物来源。","r":"组合词：earth（地上）+worm（蠕虫；小人物）→蚯蚓"},
22255:{"w":"entice","e":"With the festivals coming, supermarkets begin to push out all sorts of tricks to entice customers to consume.","t":"随着节日的来临，超市使出各种各样的手段**吸引**顾客消费。","r":"联想记忆：他们全部（entire）被引诱（entice）了"},
22256:{"w":"manipulative","e":"To handle negative experiences, a child learns manipulative techniques that are hard to refrain from later in life or even become set patterns.","t":"为了应对这些负面体验，儿童学会了控制自己和他人，这种**操纵**技巧在日后的生活中很难被戒除，甚至会变成既定的行为模式。"},
22257:{"w":"memorise","e":"Before sailing to the sea, prudent navigators will study the sailing directions, and memorise lighthouse locations to prepare themselves for any conditions they might encounter.","t":"出海前，细心的航海员会研究航海说明并**记住**灯塔的位置，为他们可能会遇到的任何情况做准备。"},
22258:{"w":"retrenchment","e":"Macro-control and retrenchment curbed sizable speculation venture capital in real estate, leading to the reduction of housing market demand.","t":"宏观调控和费用**削减**抑制了大量房地产风险投资，致使住房市场需求有所减少。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+trench（切，割）+ment→一再削减（开支）→节省；削减"},
22259:{"w":"motivational","e":"The science-and-engineering students have motivational, cognitive and emotional barriers in English learning, according to a survey released by the Ministry of Education.","t":"据教育部公布的一项调查结果显示，理工科学生在英语学习中存在着**动机**、认知和情感方面的障碍。"},
22260:{"w":"reinforcement","e":"The Red Cross blasted the authorities' response to the disaster, making an urgent plea for reinforcements and aid.","t":"红十字会严厉抨击当局对灾难的反应，并紧急呼吁要求**增援**和救助。"},
22261:{"w":"intervention","e":"In a decade, more and more governments strengthened health intervention, and introduced a series of new health-care systems.","t":"十年间，越来越多的政府加强对保健的**干预**，引入了一些新的医疗体系。","r":"来自intervene（vi. 干涉，干预，介入）"},
22262:{"w":"infirmity","e":"Pathogen infections are among the leading causes of infirmity and mortality among humans and animals in the world.","t":"病原体感染是世界上导致人和动物**衰弱**和死亡的主要原因之一。","r":"联想记忆：in（不）+firm（坚定）+ity→不坚定→虚弱，衰弱"},
22263:{"w":"glossy","e":"All of a sudden, the sun broke through from the heavy clouds, shining on her glossy hair, giving it a metallic luster.","t":"突然间，太阳冲破阴云，照在她**光滑**的头发上，给头发镀上了一层金属的光泽。","r":"来自gloss（n. 光泽的表面；光彩）"},
22264:{"w":"escalate","e":"Instigated by a small number of people with ulterior motives, the demonstration quickly escalated into a riot.","t":"在少数别有用心的人的煽动教唆下，游行示威很快**升级**演变成了一场暴动。","r":"来自Escalator，原来是自动电梯的商标，后来才出现了动词escalate"},
22265:{"w":"extravagance","e":"He lived in extravagance far beyond his means, which brought his career to a premature end and led to bankruptcy.","t":"他过着超出他收入能力的**奢侈**生活，从而过早结束了自己的职业生涯，走向破产。","r":"词根记忆：extra（超过）+vag（漫游）+ance→漫游过多→奢侈"},
22266:{"w":"victimise","e":"The World Health Organization reported that environmentally related diseases victimise most of the African continent, followed by parts of Southeast Asia.","t":"世界卫生组织称，与环境相关的疾病**危害**着非洲大陆的绝大部分地区，其次是东南亚的部分地区。","r":"联想记忆：victim（受害者）+ise（使…）→（使）成为受害者→（使）受害"},
22267:{"w":"evaluation","e":"Employees should make a copy of their completed Self Evaluation Form for their supervisor in advance of the review meeting.","t":"开评审会之前，雇员应该复印一份填好的自我**评估**表交给主管。","r":"来自evaluate（vt. 评价，评估）"},
22268:{"w":"maternal","e":"Susan's maternal grandmother is still alive.","t":"苏珊的**外**祖母还健在。","r":"词根记忆：matern（母亲）+al→母亲的；母系的","c":"maternal instinct 母性本能"},
22269:{"w":"crusade","e":"He made it his crusade to teach children to love books.","t":"他把教育孩子热爱书籍作为自己的**奋斗目标**。","r":"词根记忆：crus（十字形）+ade→十字军"},
22270:{"w":"recalcitrant","e":"When someone is recalcitrant, he might resist following orders, or going along, even be too stubborn to deal with.","t":"如果一个人很**桀骜不驯**，他可能拒绝服从命令或者与他人合作，甚至固执到无法应付的地步。"},
22271:{"w":"mortality","e":"Although infant mortality varies by ethnicity, deaths among infants with birth defects are similar in all groups.","t":"尽管婴儿的**死亡率**因种族而不同，但是因出生缺陷而导致的儿童死亡在各个群体中却是类似的。","r":"词根记忆：mort（死亡）+ality（表性质）→死亡率","c":"infant mortality 婴儿死亡率"},
22272:{"w":"taunt","e":"People used to tease and taunt him with his cowardice.","t":"过去人们常**嘲讽**他的胆小怕事。"},
22273:{"w":"disseminate","e":"University libraries should aim at disseminating popular culture as well as leading the dissemination of the mainstream culture.","t":"大学图书馆应**传播**大众文化，还要引导主流文化的传播。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+semin（种子）+ate（做）→散布，传播"},
22274:{"w":"sanction","e":"The economic sanctions have long been imposed on the nation due to refusing to sign a multilateral agreement.","t":"由于拒绝签署多边协议，长久以来，这个国家一直遭受着经济**制裁**。","r":"词根记忆：sanct（神圣）+ion→给予神圣的权力→批准，认可","d":"sanctionist（n. 制裁国）"},
22275:{"w":"invert","e":"Should the image formed on the retina be inverted?","t":"在视网膜上形成的图像应该是**颠倒**的吗？","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+vert（转）→（使）倒转，（使）颠倒"},
22276:{"w":"unfortunately","e":"Unfortunately, they cannot come to our party.","t":"很**遗憾**，他们不能来参加我们的聚会了。"},
22277:{"w":"frustration","e":"However, you have to admit that you need him so much when the moment of sadness, fear or an acute sense of frustration descends.","t":"但你不得不承认的是，当悲伤、痛苦或是极度**沮丧**的时候，你如此需要他。"},
22278:{"w":"recipe","e":"Errors in the genetic recipe for haemoglobin give rise to the most common single-gene disorder in the world.","t":"血红蛋白中遗传**密码**出现问题会导致世界上最常见的单基因病变。","r":"词根记忆：re+cip（抓）+e→抓住关键，才是诀窍→秘诀，秘方","y":"secret（n. 秘密；秘诀）；knack（n. 技巧，诀窍）"},
22279:{"w":"condense","e":"This article has been adapted and condensed from the article by William and Slater.","t":"这篇文章改编自威廉姆和斯莱特的文章，并进行了**精简**。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+dens（变浓厚）+e→变得浓厚→（使）压缩"},
22280:{"w":"gather","e":"At the beginning of a new semester, all the new students will gather in the playground to meet the principal and the rest of the faculty.","t":"新学期伊始，所有的新生在操场上**集合**与校长和其他老师见面。","c":"gather in 收割"},
22281:{"w":"advertise","e":"The total number of jobs advertised in the journal was 120.","t":"这本杂志上**刊登**了120个职位。","c":"advertise for 为…做广告","d":"advertiser（n. 广告客户）；advertisement（n. 广告）"},
22282:{"w":"utility","e":"One of many reforms came in the area of public utilities.","t":"众多改革措施中有一条涉及**公用事业**的变革。","r":"词根记忆：util（用）+ity→使用的效果如何→功用，效用","d":"utilitarian（adj. 实用的，功利的）"},
22283:{"w":"exhibit","e":"Some of the exhibits at the museum are very precious.","t":"这个博物馆的一些**展品**非常珍贵。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+hibit（拿）→拿出→陈列，展览","d":"exhibition（n. 展览）"},
22284:{"w":"irrevocable","e":"The powers given to these agents are irrevocable.","t":"下放给这些代理商的权力是**不可改变**的。","r":"联想记忆：ir（不）+revocable（可取消的）→无法取消的"},
22285:{"w":"shelter","e":"Harbour is a physical concept, a shelter for ships, while port is an economic concept, a centre of land-sea exchange.","t":"Harbour是物质概念，即船的“**家**”；而port是经济概念，即海陆货物交换的中心。","r":"联想记忆：shel（看作shell，壳）+ter→像壳一样的地方→掩蔽（处）；住所"},
22286:{"w":"stock","e":"Fish stocks here began to decline in the 1950s in South Scotland.","t":"在苏格兰南部，鱼类**储量**从20世纪50年代开始减少。"},
22287:{"w":"devise","e":"Ford devised the first moving auto assembly line.","t":"福特**发明**了第一条移动的汽车装配线。","r":"联想记忆：科学家发明（devise）出许多现代化的机械设备（device）"},
22288:{"w":"career","e":"The idea of having a single career is becoming old fashioned.","t":"只从事一种**职业**的想法现在已经开始变得落伍了。","r":"发音记忆：和同音词Korea（n. 韩国）一起记","c":"career break 离职期；careers adviser 职业顾问"},
22289:{"w":"humidity","e":"The wooden frame warped in the humidity.","t":"木框因受**潮**而弯曲了。","r":"联想记忆：humid（潮湿的）+ity→湿度；潮湿","c":"relative humidity 相对湿度"},
22290:{"w":"hollow","e":"Dung beetles' homes are hollowed out from within.","t":"蜣螂的家是从里面往外**挖空**的。"},
22291:{"w":"statistic","e":"The writer pointed out that the employment statistic was deceptive.","t":"作者指出这个就业**统计数据**不可信。","r":"联想记忆：stat（看作state，国家）+istic→常听到新闻说：据国家统计数据表明→统计数值"},
22292:{"w":"bark","e":"Our neighbour's dog barks constantly.","t":"邻居家的狗总是**叫**个不停。","r":"发音记忆：“巴克”→巴克是《野性的呼唤》中的狗→犬吠"},
22293:{"w":"burrow","e":"Most dung beetles burrow into the soil and bury dung in tunnels.","t":"大多数蜣螂在地下**挖洞**，并将粪球埋在地下。","r":"联想记忆：用犁（furrow）来挖（burrow）地","c":"burrow into 探查"},
22294:{"w":"equivalent","e":"At that time, the cost of a bulb was equivalent to half a day's pay for the average worker.","t":"那时，一个灯泡的成本**相当于**普通工人半天的工资。","r":"词根记忆：equi（相等）+val（价值）+ent（具有…性质的）→价值相等的→相等的，等量的","c":"equivalent to 相当于"},
22295:{"w":"fatigue","e":"Part-time workers are less likely to succumb to fatigue in stressful jobs.","t":"兼职工人在有压力的工作中不太可能被**疲劳**压垮。"},
22296:{"w":"bibliography","e":"I'm looking for those books which my professor lists in the bibliography.","t":"我正在找教授列在**参考书目**单上的那些书。","r":"词根记忆：biblio（书）+graph（写）+y（表名词）→写作中用的书→参考书目","c":"universal bibliography 世界文献目录；classified bibliography分类书目"},
22297:{"w":"probable","e":"It is probable that, some time in the tenth century, gun powder was first compounded from its basic ingredients of saltpetre, charcoal and sulphur.","t":"火药**很可能**最早在十世纪的某个时间由硝石、木炭和硫磺等基本成分混合而成。"},
22298:{"w":"treadmill","e":"I can't get off the office treadmill.","t":"我无法摆脱**单调**的坐班工作。","r":"联想记忆：tread（踩踏）+mill（磨坊）→在磨坊里踩踏车→乏味繁重的工作"},
22299:{"w":"flavour","e":"Each country's coffee has a different flavour.","t":"各国的咖啡都别具**风味**。","r":"联想记忆：喜欢（favour）加上l（看作love，爱），生活更有味道（flavour）","c":"a flavour of …的味道"},
22300:{"w":"asymmetry","e":"Asymmetry is a common feature of the human body.","t":"**不对称**是人体共同的特点。","r":"联想记忆：a（不）+symmetry（对称，匀称）→不对称","d":"asymmetric（adj. 不对称的；不均匀的）"},
22301:{"w":"lethal","e":"Bugs and weeds become resistant to poisons, so next year's poisons must be more lethal.","t":"臭虫和野草对农药产生了抗药性，所以来年农药的**杀伤力**就需要再强一些。","r":"词根记忆：leth（死亡）+al（…的）→致死的→致命的"},
22302:{"w":"stare","e":"He stared at the word trying to remember what it meant.","t":"他**盯着**这个单词，努力想记住它的意思。","r":"联想记忆：凝视（stare）星（star）空"},
22303:{"w":"colony","e":"Different animals in the colony had different manifestations of the disease.","t":"同一**群体**的不同动物对同一疾病有不同的表现形式。","r":"词根记忆：col（耕种）+ony（表名词）→在某处耕种→将那里变为自己的殖民地→殖民地"},
22304:{"w":"stab","e":"Such a vicious lie could be nothing but a stab in the back.","t":"这样一种恶毒的谎言简直是在背后**捅**刀子。"},
22305:{"w":"fingerprint","e":"Systems using fingerprints, hands, voices and faces are already on the market.","t":"市场上已出现了利用**指纹**、手印、声音和面部进行识别的系统。","r":"组合词：finger（手指）+print（印迹）→指纹，手印"},
22306:{"w":"enthusiasm","e":"She shows great enthusiasm for the movie.","t":"她对这部电影表现出极大的**热情**。"},
22307:{"w":"mixture","e":"Today, scientists continue to experiment with new glass mixtures.","t":"如今，科学家们继续对新型的玻璃**混合物**进行试验。","r":"词根记忆：mix（混合）+ture（表名词）→混合（物）"},
22308:{"w":"tendency","e":"The effort to clean up cars may do little to cut pollution if nothing is done about the tendency to drive them more.","t":"驾驶汽车的人越来越多，如果不采取措施遏制这一**趋势**，那么即使下力气对汽车进行清理整顿，这对减少污染也不会起到什么作用。","r":"词根记忆：tend（伸展）+ency（表名词）→伸展过去→倾向，趋向","c":"tendency to do sth. 做…的趋势；tendency towards sth. …的趋向/趋势"},
22309:{"w":"lane","e":"Vehicles carrying more than one person can use special priority lanes, which means they can travel more quickly.","t":"载有一位以上乘客的车辆可以使用特殊的优先级**车道**，这就意味着它们能行驶得更快。","r":"联想记忆：小巷（lane）可作行车路线（line）"},
22310:{"w":"assess","e":"Core samples are always extracted to assess the quality and quantity of coal at a site before mining.","t":"在开采前，通常会收集选地的矿样来**评估**矿质和储量。","d":"assessment（n. 评定；核定的金额）"},
22311:{"w":"inductive","e":"The myth of scientific method is that it is inductive.","t":"科学方法的神秘之处就在于它的**归纳**性。","c":"inductive reasoning 归纳推理"},
22312:{"w":"session","e":"This course is made up of 15 sessions.","t":"这门课共上15**节**。","r":"联想记忆：ses（看作see，看见）+sion→看见彼此→会面→会议","c":"special session 特别会议；in session 正在开会；training session 培训期；reading session 阅读课"},
22313:{"w":"constrain","e":"The evidence was so compelling that he felt constrained to accept it.","t":"证据是那样的令人折服，他觉得**不得不**接受。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+strain（拉紧）→一再拉紧→约束","d":"constraint（n. 限制，约束）"},
22314:{"w":"negative","e":"This policy had a negative effect on their business.","t":"这一政策给他们的生意带来了**消极**影响。","r":"词根记忆：neg（否定）+ative（…的）→否定的","c":"a negative reply 一个否定的答复；negative number 负数","f":"positive（adj. 正面的；积极的）"},
22315:{"w":"unwrap","e":"I sat on the chair to unwrap the package while he stood behind me.","t":"我坐在椅子上**打开**包裹，当时他就站在我身后。"},
22316:{"w":"punctual","e":"Being punctual shows your clients that you respect their schedule and that you can be counted on.","t":"**守时**会让你的客户觉得，你尊重他们的安排，并且值得信赖。","r":"词根记忆：punct（点）+ual（有…性质的）→卡在点上的→守时的；准时的","d":"punctually（adv. 准时地）；punctuality（n. 准时）"},
22317:{"w":"intake","e":"It is important not to decrease salt intake too much, as sodium is an essential mineral for the body to function.","t":"钠是维持机体运转的重要矿物元素，因此避免过度减少食盐的**摄取量**非常重要。","r":"联想记忆：in（进入）+take（带来）→被带入里面→吸入，纳入","c":"intake of …的摄入"},
22318:{"w":"penetration","e":"The company's successful penetration into the e-business environment survived the depression.","t":"这个公司成功地**进军**电子商务领域，终于挺过了大萧条时期。"},
22319:{"w":"plagiarise","e":"If you compare the two essays side by side, it is obvious that the author of the first has plagiarised.","t":"如果你对比这两篇文章，就会发现很明显第一篇文章的作者**抄袭**了第二篇。","r":"词根记忆：plagiar（=plagiarism，剽窃）+ise（表动词）→做歪事→剽窃，抄袭"},
22320:{"w":"municipal","e":"When those were finished, she concluded the session with a brief restatement of how the new system will improve security and peace of mind in the municipal building.","t":"当那些（工作）完成后，她在会议结束时简短地重申了新系统将如何改善**市政**大楼的安全与安宁。","r":"词根记忆：muni（公共的）+cip（拿）+al（…的）→市政的","c":"municipal council 市政委员会；municipal government 市政府；municipal university 市立大学；municipal affairs 市政事务","d":"municipality（n. 市政当局；自治市或区）"},
22321:{"w":"deficit","e":"The weak dollar plays a significant role in helping the U.S. government to reduce the trade deficit.","t":"疲软的美元在帮助美国政府降低贸易**赤字**上起着重要作用。","r":"词根记忆：de（否定）+fic（做）+it→做得不够的→赤字"},
22322:{"w":"triumphant","e":"The newborn infant is triumphant and joyful at each development taken by each consciousness, and he revels and marks great joy in the slightest creative act of each of his issues.","t":"新生婴儿对自己有意识地取得的每一个进展感到**得意**和高兴，并为他所做出的每一个最轻微的创造性行为而陶醉、喜悦。","r":"联想记忆：triumph（胜利）+ant→得胜的；得意洋洋的"},
22323:{"w":"reptile","e":"There were images of the ancient Maya gods in the form of feathered serpents, crouching reptiles and dozens of human figures.","t":"那里满是古代玛雅人的神明的图像：形似长着羽毛的大毒蛇、缩着的**爬虫**和大量的人形。","r":"词根记忆：rept（爬）+ile（表物）→爬行动物","d":"reptilian（adj. 爬虫类的；卑鄙的）"},
22324:{"w":"circumscribe","e":"The power of the monarchy was severely circumscribed by the newly promulgated laws.","t":"新颁布的法律严格**限制**了君主的权力。","r":"词根记忆：circum（周围）+scrib（画）+e→在…周围画线"},
22325:{"w":"patronage","e":"\"That gave those party bosses handy powers of patronage, but it was deadly for democracy,\" he said angrily.","t":"他愤怒地指出：“那等于给了党派领袖们便利的**任免**大权，却给民主判了死刑。”","r":"联想记忆：patron（赞助人）+age→赞助；支持"},
22326:{"w":"analogy","e":"Most of the time, it is easier for us to illustrate an abstract concept by analogy with something concrete.","t":"大多数情况下，我们更易于通过与具体有形的东西进行**类比**来理解某个抽象的概念。","r":"词根记忆：ana（类似）+log（说话）+y（表名词）→说类似的话→类推；类比","c":"draw an analogy between...and... 把…比作","d":"analogous（adj. 类似的）","y":"likeness（n. 相似）"},
22327:{"w":"precedent","e":"The October Revolution was without precedent in recent history, which had a significant influence in Russia.","t":"十月革命在近代历史上是没有**先例**的，对俄国产生了深远的影响。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+ced（行走）+ent（表名词）→走在前面的→先例；惯例","d":"precedable（adj. 可能被超前的，可能先发生的）","y":"tradition（n. 常例，常规）"},
22328:{"w":"obscurity","e":"This opening chapter tells us how to avoid ambiguity and obscurity of expression.","t":"开篇第一章告诉我们如何避免模糊和**晦涩**的语言表达。","r":"来自obscure（adj. 朦胧的，模糊的）"},
22329:{"w":"ascertain","e":"It must be ascertained whether he is the property owner before you make a down payment.","t":"在交首付之前，你必须**查明**他是否为该房产的业主。","r":"词根记忆：as（表加强）+certain（确定）→弄清，查明；","y":"discover（v. 发现）；clarify（vt. 澄清）","f":"conceal（vt. 隐瞒）；cover（v. 掩盖）"},
22330:{"w":"esteem","e":"We had great esteem for this dedicated and imaginative scientist.","t":"对这位乐于奉献、富于想象力的科学家，我们深表**敬佩**。","r":"联想记忆：e（音似：一）+stee（看作steel, 钢铁）+m（看作man, 人）→一个有钢铁般意志的人值得尊敬→尊重；尊敬","c":"have great esteem for 对…大为敬佩；be held in high esteem by sb. 深受某人敬佩","y":"regard（vt./n. 尊敬；尊重）","f":"disesteem（n./vt. 轻视）"},
22331:{"w":"legitimacy","e":"The young man was accused because the victim's families were in serious doubt about the legitimacy of his so-called self-defence action.","t":"这个年轻人遭到指控，因为受害人家属严重质疑他所谓的正当防卫的**合法性**。"},
22332:{"w":"discrepancy","e":"We noticed the obvious discrepancy between these two agreements signed by the two parties.","t":"我们注意到双方签订的这两份合同有着明显的**不同**之处。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+crep（破裂）+ancy（表名词）→裂开→矛盾","y":"difference（n. 差别，分歧）","f":"accord（n. 一致，符合）"},
22333:{"w":"benevolent","e":"You never know which person is going to show up—the nice, benevolent manager or the insane, angry hophead.","t":"你永远不知道他将以哪种形象出现，是和善**仁慈**的经理还是暴怒的瘾君子。","r":"词根记忆：bene（好）+vol（意愿）+ent（具有…性质的）→好意的→善心的，仁心的","d":"benevolence（n. 善心，仁心）"},
22334:{"w":"malevolent","e":"Stricken by a series of failures, he was malevolent toward those who were successful.","t":"经过一连串失败的打击，他对那些成功人士充满了**敌意**。","r":"词根记忆：male（恶）+vol（意愿）+ent（具有…性质的）→有恶意的；恶毒的"},
22335:{"w":"downsize","e":"Some firms are even downsizing as their profits climb.","t":"一些公司甚至在利润增长的同时也在**裁员**。","r":"组合词：down（往下的）+size（大小，尺寸）→尺寸减少→缩小，紧缩"},
22336:{"w":"lunar","e":"The Human Genome Project will take longer to accomplish than the lunar missions.","t":"完成人类基因组工程的耗时将比人类成功登**月**花费的时间还要长。","c":"lunar eclipse 月蚀"},
22337:{"w":"complicated","e":"The other hat we made was more complicated.","t":"我们制作的另外一顶帽子更加**复杂**。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+plic（重叠）+ated→重叠在一起的→复杂的"},
22338:{"w":"handle","e":"Friction management means handling conflicts in a positive and constructive manner.","t":"摩擦管理是指以积极的、建设性的态度来**处理**各种冲突。","r":"联想记忆：hand（手）+le→用手操作的东西→手柄，把手","c":"door handle 门把手","d":"mishandle（vt. 错误地处理）","y":"manage（v. 操纵，控制；管理）；regulate（v. 管制，控制）"},
22339:{"w":"innovation","e":"The innovation of match-making technology made the waterproof match possible.","t":"火柴制造技术的**革新**使人们生产出防水火柴。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+nov（新的）+ation（表状态）→革新，创新","c":"technological innovation 技术革新","y":"novelty（n. 新奇，新奇的事物）；reformation（n. 改革，革新）"},
22340:{"w":"glitter","e":"Smoothed flat by generations of wind and rain, they glitter in the sun.","t":"它们被一代代的风雨磨平，在阳光下**闪闪发光**。","r":"联想记忆：g+litter（看作little，小）→一闪一闪小星星→闪光","y":"gleam（vi. 闪亮，闪烁 n. 闪光，闪亮）；radiate〔v. 散发出（光或热）〕；sheen（n. 光辉，光泽）"},
22341:{"w":"council","e":"The Council may convoke a formal conference.","t":"**理事会**可能会召开一次正式会议。","r":"Security Council 联合国安理会"},
22342:{"w":"feedback","e":"Employee feedback is reviewed daily and some suggestions will be implemented within 48 hours.","t":"员工**反馈**信息每天都会被查看，一些建议会在48小时之内被采纳实施。","r":"组合词：feed（喂养；提供）+back（反）→反馈","c":"provide feedback 提供反馈信息；feedback on 关于…的反馈信息"},
22343:{"w":"subsequent","e":"This incident was of great importance in the subsequent development of events.","t":"这一事件对**后续**事态的发展影响重大。","r":"词根记忆：sub（接近）+sequ（跟随）+ent（具有…性质的）→继…之后的，随后的","c":"subsequent on 作为…的结果发生；subsequent events 后来发生的事","d":"subsequently（adv. 随后；接着）"},
22344:{"w":"shark","e":"Although many people fear them, sharks rarely attack humans and play an important role in keeping ocean ecosystems healthy.","t":"尽管很多人害怕**鲨鱼**，但它们很少攻击人类，而且在维持海洋生态系统健康方面起着重要作用。","y":"Sharks infest the waters. 这片海域有大批鲨鱼出没。"},
22345:{"w":"venomous","e":"There are some venomous snakes to beware of in the forest.","t":"森林中有一些需要提防的**毒**蛇。","r":"联想记忆：venom（毒液）+ous→有毒的；分泌毒液的","c":"venomous snake 毒蛇"},
22346:{"w":"intellectual","e":"The development of literacy has far-reaching effects on general intellectual development.","t":"文化素质的提高对于人类整体**智力**的发展有着深远的影响。","r":"词根记忆：intel（=inter，在…之间）+lect（选择）+ual（有…性质的）→能从中选择的→有辨别力的→智力的","c":"intellectual test 智力测试"},
22347:{"w":"strain","e":"Tom strained his muscle in the match.","t":"汤姆在比赛中**拉伤**了肌肉。","r":"本身为词根，意为“ 拉紧 ”","y":"tauten〔v.（使）拉紧，绷紧〕；tense〔v./n.（使）紧张〕"},
22348:{"w":"terminology","e":"The terminology of meteorology rises every time the temperature falls.","t":"每当降温时，气象学**术语**的热度都随之升高。","r":"词根记忆：termin（界限）+ology（…学）→仅限于一部分人使用的学术语言→术语","c":"scientific terminology 科学术语"},
22349:{"w":"centennial","e":"Many statesmen attended the centennial celebration of the founding of the republic.","t":"许多政治家出席了该共和国成立**百年**的纪念庆典。","r":"词根记忆：cent（百）+enn（年）+ial（…的）→一百年的"},
22350:{"w":"Mediterranean","e":"We enjoyed such a Mediterranean climate very much.","t":"这种**地中海**式气候让我们很享受。","r":"词根记忆：medi（中间）+terr（土地）+anean→陆地中间的海→地中海"},
22351:{"w":"outdo","e":"The two universities are always trying to outdo each other academically.","t":"这两所大学总是试图在学术上**超过**对方。","r":"组合词：out（超过）+do（做）→超越，胜过"},
22352:{"w":"discipline","e":"Sports Studies as a discipline is still comparatively new.","t":"体育研究仍是一个相对较新的**学科**。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+cip+line（线）→不站成一条线就要受惩罚→必须遵守纪律→纪律"},
22353:{"w":"consequent","e":"There is always confusion consequent to an earthquake.","t":"地震**过后**总是会发生混乱。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+sequ（跟随）+ent（具有…性质的）→随之发生的","d":"consequential（adj. 结果的）；consequently（adv. 因此，因"},
22354:{"w":"fulfil","e":"The prophecy was fulfilled.","t":"预言**应验**了。","r":"联想记忆：ful（看作full，充满的）+fil(l)（装满）→做得圆满，把梦想实现→实现","c":"fulfil oneself 实现某人自己的抱负"},
22355:{"w":"element","e":"Impressed by the element's combustibility, several 17th century chemists used phosphorus to manufacture fire-lighting devices.","t":"磷的燃烧性给17世纪的几位化学家留下了深刻印象，他们开始用这种**元素**制造点火装置。","r":"联想记忆：e+lemen（看作lemon，柠檬）+t→柠檬是水果的一种→要素；元素","d":"elementary（adj. 初步的；基本的）"},
22356:{"w":"segment","e":"He claimed that the essence of reasoning lay in putting together two \"behaviour segments\" in some novel way.","t":"他称推理的本质就是将两个“行为**片段**”以新的方式整合在一起。","r":"词根记忆：seg（切，割）+ment（表具体物）→切开的部分→片段；部分","d":"segmented（adj. 分割的）"},
22357:{"w":"orchestra","e":"Which orchestra do you think is the finest in our country?","t":"你觉得我国最棒的**管弦乐队**是哪一支？","r":"联想记忆：or+chest（胸腔）+ra→管弦乐队的成员大都需借助胸腔的力量吹奏乐器→管弦乐队"},
22358:{"w":"muscle","e":"If your bed doesn't give enough support, back muscles and ligaments will work all night trying to correct spinal alignment.","t":"如果你的床不能提供足够的支撑，那么背部**肌肉**和韧带就会整晚工作来校直脊椎骨。","r":"发音记忆：“马瘦”→瘦马也有肌肉→肌肉","c":"movement of muscles 肌肉运动；leg muscles 腿部肌肉；stomach muscles 腹部肌肉"},
22359:{"w":"function","e":"The dams store water for a variety of functions.","t":"大坝贮存的水**用途**广泛。","c":"vital functions 生命机能；public function 公共职能；公共函数"},
22360:{"w":"metaphor","e":"In literature, the dove is often a metaphor for peace.","t":"在文学作品中鸽子通常是和平的**隐喻**。","r":"词根记忆：meta（变化）+phor（带来）→（语言）改变着说→隐喻","d":"metaphorical（adj. 隐喻的）"},
22361:{"w":"delegate","e":"Negotiation progressed fairly with confidence felt among delegates.","t":"谈判进行得很顺利，**代表**们也都充满信心。","c":"delegate sb. to do sth. 委派某人做某事"},
22362:{"w":"fragile","e":"The fragile boxes arrived intact.","t":"这些**易碎**的箱子被完好无损地运到了目的地。","r":"词根记忆：frag（打碎）+ile（易…的）→容易被打碎的→脆弱的；易碎的","y":"delicate（adj. 易碎的；脆弱的）；brittle（adj. 易碎的，易损坏的；脆弱的）；frail（adj. 体弱的；易破碎的，易损的）","f":"unbreakable（adj. 打不破的，牢不可破的）；sturdy（adj.强壮的，强健的）"},
22363:{"w":"radiate","e":"The scientist said that the heat, light, and energy that were radiated from the sun filled the entire solar system.","t":"那个科学家说太阳**发出**的热、光和能量遍布整个太阳系。","r":"词根记忆：radi（光线）+ate（使…）→发光；发热","d":"radiation（n. 发光；辐射）"},
22364:{"w":"situated","e":"The Newton Park site is situated four miles west of Bath.","t":"牛顿公园**位于**巴斯以西四英里的地方。"},
22365:{"w":"invader","e":"Their way of life was destroyed by invaders.","t":"他们的生活方式遭到了**入侵者**的破坏。","r":"来自invade（v. 侵犯，侵入）"},
22366:{"w":"complete","e":"Some people believe that children's leisure activities must be educational, otherwise they are a complete waste of time.","t":"有些人认为孩子们的休闲活动必须具有教育意义，否则那**完全**就是浪费时间。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+plet（填满）+e→完成；结束","d":"completion（n. 完成；实现）；completely（adv. 十分；完"},
22367:{"w":"kit","e":"The plumber reached into his tool kit for a wrench.","t":"水管工人伸手从他的**成套**工具中拿出一个扳手。","c":"first-aid kit 急救箱"},
22368:{"w":"generate","e":"Compared with ordinary coal, new \"clean coals\" may generate power more efficiently.","t":"和普通煤相比，新型的“高纯度”煤可以提高**发**电效率。","r":"词根记忆：gener（产生）+ate（使…）→产生；引起","c":"generate electricity 发电","d":"generation（n. 产生；一代）；regenerate〔v.（使）再生〕"},
22369:{"w":"remote","e":"His ultimate goal was to discover an earth-like planet in remote galaxies.","t":"他的最终目标是在**遥远**的星系中找到一颗类地行星。","r":"词根记忆：re（相反）+mot（动）+e→向后移动→关系疏远的","c":"remote control 遥控器；remote chance/possibility 机会很小；remote sensing technology 遥感技术；a remote village 一座偏僻的村庄"},
22370:{"w":"avoid","e":"Building big commercial buildings underground can be a way to avoid disfiguring or threatening a beautiful landscape.","t":"在地下建商业大楼可以**避免**破坏或威胁到美丽的风景。","r":"词根记忆：a（表加强）+void（空）→空出来→躲开","c":"avoid doing sth. 避免做…；avoid mistakes 避免犯错误","d":"avoidance（n. 避免）"},
22371:{"w":"dismiss","e":"As sales declined, the manager had to dismiss several workers.","t":"由于销售额下跌，经理不得不**解雇**一些员工。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+miss（放出）→解雇，解散","c":"dismiss sb. for sth. 因某事解雇某人"},
22372:{"w":"absenteeism","e":"In an attempt to reduce the level of absenteeism amongst employees, the company introduced three different strategies.","t":"该公司采用了三种不同的策略，希望以此降低员工的**旷工**率。","r":"联想记忆：absent（缺席）+ee（表人）+ism→旷课；旷工"},
22373:{"w":"apparent","e":"This tendency was apparent in the late 1980s.","t":"这种趋势在20世纪80年代末很**明显**。","r":"联想记忆：ap+parent（父母）→父母对儿女的爱是显而易见的→显然的"},
22374:{"w":"succumb","e":"Since white phosphorus is a deadly poison, match-makers exposed to its fumes often succumbed to necrosis.","t":"因为白磷是一种剧毒物质，暴露在其粉尘中的火柴制作工人常常**死于**坏疽。","r":"词根记忆：suc（下）+cumb（躺）→躺下→屈服"},
22375:{"w":"stretch","e":"His feet are stretched out to an electric heater.","t":"他的脚**伸**到了电暖气上。","c":"at a stretch 一口气地，连续；at full stretch 非常紧张，竭尽全力；stretch out 伸展，伸手"},
22376:{"w":"minister","e":"The Prime Minister has promised to help the drought-stricken farmers in the northern part of the country.","t":"首**相**已经承诺援助本国北部地区遭受旱灾袭击的农民。"},
22377:{"w":"combustion","e":"Combustion and gasification techniques are now at pilot and demonstration stages.","t":"**燃烧**技术和气化技术现在处于试用和验证阶段。","r":"联想记忆：combust（燃烧）+ion（表名词）→燃烧；燃烧过程","c":"combustion chamber 燃烧室","d":"combustibility（n. 燃烧性，可燃性）"},
22378:{"w":"veterinary","e":"This zoo was closed down following a report by a veterinary inspector.","t":"这家动物园因为**兽医**检查员的一份报告而被关闭。","c":"veterinary medicine 兽药"},
22379:{"w":"plausible","e":"The little boy could not find a plausible explanation for the breaking of the beautiful vase.","t":"小男孩找不到任何**说得过去**的理由来解释漂亮的花瓶怎么碎了。","r":"词根记忆：plaus（鼓掌）+ible（可…的）→可给予掌声的→似有道理的","d":"plausibility（n. 似乎有理；善辩）；implausible（adj. 难以置信的，不像真实的）；plausibly（adv. 似真地）","y":"colourable（adj. 似是而非的）","f":"actual（adj. 真实的）"},
22380:{"w":"elucidate","e":"The notes in this book could help you elucidate the confusing and difficult parts.","t":"书中的注释可以帮你**弄清楚**难懂的部分。","r":"联想记忆：e+lucid（清晰的）+ate→弄清晰→阐明，使…清楚"},
22381:{"w":"transient","e":"In recent years, there has been a large transient population flowing into big cities.","t":"近些年来，大量**流动**人口涌入大城市。","r":"词根记忆：trans（转移）+ient（…的）→不断转移的→短暂的","y":"temporary（adj. 暂时的，临时的）；passing（adj. 短暂的）","f":"permanent（adj. 永久的，持久的）"},
22382:{"w":"sanitation","e":"Production enterprises of aquatic products without sanitation registration are forbidden to produce, process or store any export aquatic products.","t":"未获得**卫生**注册登记的水产品生产企业禁止生产、加工或储存任何出境水产品。","r":"词根记忆：sanit（健康的）+ation（表状态）→要想健康，得讲卫生→卫生"},
22383:{"w":"distortion","e":"This novel reflects the struggle and bitterness of people in such a society which is full of distortion.","t":"这篇小说反映出人们在一个**扭曲**的社会里的挣扎和痛苦。"},
22384:{"w":"altruistic","e":"Her motives for donating the money are altruistic? She is probably seeking for publicity.","t":"她这次募捐真的是**毫无私心**吗？恐怕更多的是想为自己做宣传罢了。","c":"altruistic act 无私的行为"},
22385:{"w":"climatic","e":"The proposal of preventing global climatic changes was fiercely discussed in the meeting held in Copenhagen.","t":"预防全球**气候**变化的提议在哥本哈根会议上引发激烈讨论。","c":"climatic phenomenon 气候现象"},
22386:{"w":"pragmatic","e":"The company hired this young man because of his pragmatic attitude towards the problems of work.","t":"公司雇用这个年轻人是因为他能**务实**地对待工作中的问题。","r":"词根记忆：pragm（行为）+atic（…的）→切实去做的→务实的"},
22387:{"w":"dwindle","e":"The lake has dwindled to a third of its former size in the last decade because of global warming.","t":"由于全球气候变暖，十年间，这个湖泊已经**缩减**到了原来的三分之一。","r":"联想记忆：d+wind（风）+le→随风而去，越来越小→（使）缩小","c":"dwindle down to 缩减到…；dwindle out 逐渐消失"},
22388:{"w":"disdain","e":"Paul disdains to join in this leader election with such ignorant persons.","t":"保罗**不屑**于和这些无知的人一同参加领导人的竞选。","r":"词根记忆：dis（不）+dain（=dign，高贵）→不高贵→鄙视，蔑视"},
22389:{"w":"pedigree","e":"He was adopted as a child, so he had no opportunity of learning his own pedigree.","t":"他从小被人收养，没有机会了解自己的**身世**。"},
22390:{"w":"constituent","e":"The language which develops along with nationality's development is a national culture constituent.","t":"随着民族的发展而发展的语言，是民族文化的**组成部分**。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+stitu（=stit，建立）+ent（…的）→共同建立的→组成的","c":"constituent assembly 立宪会议","d":"constituency（n. 选区；选区的选民）","y":"component（adj. 组成的，构成的）"},
22391:{"w":"impetus","e":"According to the insiders, real estate market's impetus first came from the effective demand for the release of China's huge population.","t":"据业内人士分析，房地产市场的**推动力**首先来源于中国巨大人口的有效购房需求。","r":"词根记忆：im（使…）+pet（寻求）+us（表名词）→有追求才有动力→推动力","y":"stimulus〔n. 促进（因素），刺激（物）〕；spur〔n. 刺激（物），激励〕"},
22392:{"w":"malleable","e":"When dropped on the floor, malleable glass would bend rather than shatter into bits.","t":"**韧性**玻璃掉在地上后，只会折弯而不会打碎。","r":"词根记忆：malle（来自拉丁语malleus，锤子）+able（可…的）→可锤打的→易改变的"},
22393:{"w":"renaissance","e":"The significance of the Renaissance lies in rediscovering the world and the human, and bringing the resurgence of politics.","t":"**文艺复兴**的意义在于重新发现了世界，也重新发现了人，并带来了政治学的复兴。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+naiss（=nasc，出生）+ance（表名词）→获得新生→复兴，新生","y":"revival（n. 苏醒，复兴）；renewal（n. 复兴，恢复）","f":"collapse（n. 倒塌；瓦解）；decline（n. 衰败，衰落）"},
22394:{"w":"incongruity","e":"It was such a night that sorrow may come to laugh without causing any great sense of incongruity.","t":"这个夜晚，哀愁毫不**突兀**地转变为狂喜。","r":"联想记忆：in（不）+congruity（一致，和谐）→不和谐，不相称"},
22395:{"w":"instinctual","e":"No one will deny that winking is an instinctual reaction when something appears before your eyes suddenly.","t":"没人会否认，当什么东西突然出现在眼前，眨眼是一种**本能**的反应。"},
22396:{"w":"scuffle","e":"After a scuffle in the stands, the security guards soon dispersed the crowd, and the football match returned to normal.","t":"看台上一阵**混战**之后，保安人员快速疏散了人群，球赛得以正常进行。"},
22397:{"w":"treatise","e":"The teacher said our feedback helped him to improve this treatise, which ultimately helped everybody in the class.","t":"老师说我们的反馈帮他改进了这篇**论文**，这最终也帮助了班里的每个人。"},
22398:{"w":"hypothetical","e":"Many great discoveries are based on putting a hypothetical theory in the laboratory.","t":"许多重大发现都是将**假设**的理论拿到实验室验证后得出的。"},
22399:{"w":"smother","e":"All the towns and settlements in the area were smothered in a coating of ash.","t":"这一地区的所有城镇和居民区都被火山灰**覆盖**了。","r":"联想记忆：s（看作she，她）+mother（母亲）→母亲的溺爱几乎要让她窒息了→（使）窒息"},
22400:{"w":"excess","e":"I am burdened with an excess of public attention.","t":"公众的**过度**关注使我感到不堪重负。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+cess（行走）→走出界限→过量","c":"excess baggage 超重行李","d":"excessive（adj. 过分的，过度的）"},
22401:{"w":"spine","e":"Twisting movements can place unusual force on your spine.","t":"扭转动作会给**脊椎**带来不寻常的压力。","r":"联想记忆：s+pine（松树）→脊柱像松树一样挺直→脊柱","d":"spinal（adj. 脊椎的）","y":"backbone（n. 脊椎）"},
22402:{"w":"stress","e":"Bookstores now abound with manuals describing how to manage time and cope with stress.","t":"现在书店里有很多关于如何安排时间、缓解**压力**的手册。","r":"联想记忆：s+tress（看作dress，穿衣）→穿衣强调个人风格→强调","c":"stress management 压力管理"},
22403:{"w":"smooth","e":"The new bill had a smooth passage through Parliament.","t":"新法案在议会得以**顺利**通过。","c":"smooth transfer of political power 政权的顺利交接"},
22404:{"w":"incur","e":"Overdrafts usually incur charges, though some banks offer interest-free overdrafts to students.","t":"尽管一些银行给学生们提供了免息透支的服务，但一般透支都会**产生**费用。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+cur（发生）→使发生→遭受","c":"incur debt 负债；incur losses 遭受损失"},
22405:{"w":"missile","e":"The guidance systems didn't work and the missile couldn't hit its target.","t":"制导系统失灵了，所以**导弹**没能命中目标。","r":"词根记忆：miss（送）+ile（表物体）→发送出去的东西→发射物"},
22406:{"w":"compulsively","e":"If you do compulsively grind your teeth in your sleep, ask your dentist for a soft mouthguard.","t":"如果你睡觉时**禁不住**磨牙，可以向牙医要一个质地柔软的护牙套。"},
22407:{"w":"wrap","e":"I will wrap all of your birthday gifts.","t":"我会把你所有的生日礼物都**包**起来。","r":"联想记忆：w+rap（使着迷）→被缠绕着→缠绕"},
22408:{"w":"confine","e":"It's important not to confine yourself to reading on your subject.","t":"不要**仅限于**阅读本专业的书籍，这一点很重要。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+fin（范围）+e→规定范围→限","c":"be confined to（局）限于…，（被）限制/封闭在…；between the confines of 在…界线之间；beyond the confine of 超出…的范围；confine oneself to 只涉及…，只限于…"},
22409:{"w":"limitation","e":"There is no limitation in the game, and you can use anything you want.","t":"比赛没有什么**限制**，你可以使用任何你想用的东西。","r":"联想记忆：limit（限制）+ation→限制；局限"},
22410:{"w":"chain","e":"During the show he will be chained and thrown into a sealed aquarium from which he will try to escape.","t":"在表演中他会被**用链条捆**起来，然后被扔到一个密封的养鱼缸里，他要设法从那里逃出来。","c":"food chain 食物链"},
22411:{"w":"sip","e":"As you sip the wine, you'll find something special in it.","t":"当你**小口啜饮**这种酒时，你会发现它的独特之处。"},
22412:{"w":"tedious","e":"The audience became sleepy because of the speaker's tedious story.","t":"演讲者**冗长乏味**的故事使得听众昏昏欲睡。","c":"a tedious story 一个乏味冗长的故事"},
22413:{"w":"pathology","e":"My first class in this term is plant pathology.","t":"这学期我的第一节课是植物**病理学**。","r":"词根记忆：path（病痛）+ology（…学）→病理学"},
22414:{"w":"setting","e":"The Waikato river, the longest river in New Zealand, flows through the center of the city of Hamilton, providing a picturesque and park-like setting of riverside walks and gardens.","t":"怀卡托河是新西兰最长的河流，流经汉密尔顿市中心，两岸的人行道和花园为人们提供了公园般美丽如画的**环境**。","r":"联想记忆：set（布置）+t+ing→布置（新居）→环境；安置"},
22415:{"w":"extinct","e":"A species becomes extinct when the last individual dies.","t":"当最后一个个体死亡后，该物种便**灭绝**了。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+tinct（=stinct，刺）→把刺拔出去→废弃的","c":"extinct volcano 死火山","d":"extinction（n. 灭绝；废止）","f":"thriving（adj. 兴旺的，兴盛的）"},
22416:{"w":"aridity","e":"The most challenging natural problem of Australia is aridity.","t":"**干旱**是澳大利亚面临的最具挑战性的自然问题。","r":"联想记忆：arid（干旱的）+ity→干旱"},
22417:{"w":"vision","e":"This type of tablet may cause problems with your vision.","t":"这类药品可能会给你带来**视力**问题。","d":"visual（adj. 看得见的）"},
22418:{"w":"organism","e":"This insect is on a list of organisms known to be harmful.","t":"这种昆虫属于有害**生物**。","d":"organic（adj. 有机体的，有机物的）"},
22419:{"w":"surveillance","e":"The diplomat was placed under police surveillance.","t":"这名外交官被置于警察的**监视**之下。","r":"联想记忆：survei（看作survey，调查）+llance→通过监视来调查→监视，盯梢"},
22420:{"w":"senior","e":"Women who apply for jobs in the middle or senior management have a higher success rate than men, according to an employment survey.","t":"一项就业情况调查显示，申请从事中级或**高级**管理工作的女性比申请同等职位的男性就业成功率高。","r":"词根记忆：sen（老）+ior（较…的）→年长的","c":"senior citizens 老年人；senior students 高年级学生"},
22421:{"w":"vague","e":"He gave a vague answer and we couldn't understand what he meant.","t":"他的回答太**含糊**了，我们不明白他的意思。","r":"词根记忆：vag（漫游）+ue→思路四处游走→模糊的"},
22422:{"w":"translate","e":"The name of the weapon was directly translated from Chinese.","t":"这种武器的名字是从汉语直接**翻译**过来的。"},
22423:{"w":"poverty","e":"In this country people were experiencing poverty, unemployment and famine.","t":"在这个国家，人们正在经受**贫困**、失业和饥饿的煎熬。","c":"live in poverty 在贫困中成长；poverty line 贫困线；combat poverty 和贫困做斗争"},
22424:{"w":"modify","e":"The construction of the houses has to be somewhat modified from houses in most areas.","t":"这些房屋的结构应该根据大多数地区房屋的样式稍做**修改**。","r":"词根记忆：mod（方式）+ify（使…）→使…调整方式→修改"},
22425:{"w":"clockwise","e":"You should turn the key clockwise to open the door.","t":"你应该按**顺时针方向**转动钥匙来开门。","r":"组合词：clock（时钟）+wise（方向）→指针转动的方向→顺时针方向的（地）"},
22426:{"w":"isolate","e":"Reasons for higher job hunting success rates among women are difficult to isolate.","t":"我们很难把造成女性求职成功率较高的原因**孤立**出来看。","r":"词根记忆：isol（岛）+ate（使…）→使成岛，与陆地隔开→使隔离"},
22427:{"w":"highlight","e":"You'd better underline or highlight new words in this paragraph.","t":"你最好把这个段落中的生词画线或用**高亮标出**。","r":"组合词：high（高的）+light（发光）→高调地发光→强调，突出"},
22428:{"w":"moist","e":"The earthworm lives in moist and warm soil.","t":"蚯蚓生活在**潮湿**温暖的土壤里。","r":"联想记忆：薄雾（mist）中湿润的（moist）城市很美","d":"moisture（n. 潮湿，湿气）"},
22429:{"w":"threaten","e":"Soil erosion threatens the productivity of land in both rich and poor countries.","t":"无论是富国还是穷国，土壤侵蚀都会**危及**土地的生产力。","c":"be threatened with 被…所威胁/吓到","y":"menace（v. 威胁，恐吓）"},
22430:{"w":"underling","e":"Many corporate managers find it difficult to measure the contribution of underlings to a firm's well-being.","t":"许多公司的经理发现很难衡量**下属**对公司正常运转所做的贡献。","r":"联想记忆：under（在…管辖下）+ling→职位低的人"},
22431:{"w":"medium","e":"Mary uses the medium of poetry to make her ideas known.","t":"玛丽使用诗歌这一**媒介**来表达思想。","r":"词根记忆：medi（中间）+um（表名词）→中间物→媒介","c":"medium sized 中等尺寸的"},
22432:{"w":"detail","e":"I'll put up a notice with details of the restaurant and the menu.","t":"我会张贴一份有关饭店和菜单内容的**详细**通知。","r":"联想记忆：de（向下）+tail（切）→向下切开，使露出细节→细节","c":"in detail 详细地；with details of 关于…的细节"},
22433:{"w":"compile","e":"The daily paper is compiled at the editorial headquarters in the heart of the city.","t":"日报是在位于市中心的编辑总部**编纂**的。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+pil（堆）+e→（将材料）堆在一起→汇编；编纂"},
22434:{"w":"induction","e":"This mathematician got the result by means of induction.","t":"这位数学家通过**归纳**得出了结果。","r":"联想记忆：induct（就职）+ion→就职"},
22435:{"w":"link","e":"Benefits and hours spent on the job are not necessarily linked.","t":"工作所得与所付出的时间不是必然**相关**的。","r":"联想记忆：网络上的“链接”就叫link→连接，联系","c":"link A with B 把A与B联系起来；link between air pollution and heart disease空气污染与心脏病之间的联系"},
22436:{"w":"foreland","e":"The south foreland is also open to visitors.","t":"南部**前沿地**也向游客开放。","r":"组合词：fore（前面）+land（土地）→前面的土地→前沿地"},
22437:{"w":"unemployment","e":"The graph shows the unemployment rates in the U.S. and Japan between March 2013 and March 2019.","t":"这张图表显示了从2013年3月至2019年3月六年间美国和日本的**失业**率。","r":"联想记忆：un（不）+employ（雇用）+ment→失业","d":"employment（n. 雇用；使用；工作）"},
22438:{"w":"option","e":"To increase the output of crops per acre, a farmer's easiest option is to use fertilisers and pesticides.","t":"为增加每英亩农作物的产量，农民最简单的**选择**是使用肥料和杀虫剂。","r":"词根记忆：opt（选择）+ion→选择"},
22439:{"w":"slogan","e":"Their slogan is \"Deeds not words\".","t":"他们的**口号**是“要行动不要空话”。","r":"词根记忆：s+log（说）+an→说出口号→口号"},
22440:{"w":"instinct","e":"It is instinct that makes salmon swim upstream to lay eggs.","t":"大马哈鱼洄游产卵是出于**本能**。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+stinct（刺激）→内在的刺激→本能","d":"instinctive（adj. 本能的，直觉的；天生的）"},
22441:{"w":"marsh","e":"When they tried to cross the marsh, their cannons sank into the soft ground.","t":"当他们试图穿过**湿地**时，他们的大炮陷进了松软的地面。","r":"联想记忆：mars（火星）+h→火星上可能会有沼泽→沼泽"},
22442:{"w":"mental","e":"Health is a complete state of physical, mental and social well-being.","t":"健康是生理、**心理**以及交际情况的一种整体良好状态。","r":"词根记忆：ment（智力）+al（…的）→智力的"},
22443:{"w":"hospitality","e":"The hospitality of the host greatly impressed every guest.","t":"主人的**殷勤好客**给每一位客人留下了深刻印象。","r":"词根记忆：hospit（客人）+ality（表名词）→好客","c":"corporate hospitality 企业联谊"},
22444:{"w":"origin","e":"The origins of what is now generally known as modern architecture can be traced back to the social and technological changes of the 18th and 19th centuries.","t":"通常意义上的现代建筑学的**起源**可以追溯到18、19世纪的社会和科技变革。","r":"词根记忆：orig（开始）+in（表名词）→生命的开始→起源","c":"have origins in 源于…"},
22445:{"w":"array","e":"Corso's drink corner is a shelf with an array of bottles and glasses on it.","t":"科尔索的酒水区是一个陈列着**许多**酒瓶和玻璃杯的架子。","r":"联想记忆：ar+ray（光线）→像光线一样整齐排列→陈列","c":"an array of 一批，一系列"},
22446:{"w":"remain","e":"Though rockets have been used for several hundred years, they remained a relatively minor artefact of civilisation until the twentieth century.","t":"尽管火箭的使用已有几百年的历史，但它们**一直**被看作是人类文明中相对次要的发明，直到20世纪才发生了变化。"},
22447:{"w":"comprehension","e":"The teacher's task of improving comprehension is made harder by influences outside the classroom.","t":"老师提高学生**理解力**的工作因为课堂外的影响而变得更加困难。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+prehens（抓住）+ion（表名词）→共同抓住要领→理解"},
22448:{"w":"journal","e":"We are grateful to the author and the Asia Pacific Journal of Human Resources for allowing us to use the material.","t":"我们感激作者及《亚太人力资源》**杂志**允许我们使用这些材料。","r":"词根记忆：journ（日期）+al（表名词）→每日都有的东西→日报","d":"journalese（n. 新闻文体；新闻笔调）"},
22449:{"w":"notorious","e":"Tom was a notorious liar.","t":"汤姆是一个**声名狼藉**的骗子。","d":"notoriously（adv. 出名地，声名狼藉地）","y":"infamous（adj. 声名狼藉的，臭名昭著的）；disreputable（adj. 声名狼藉的）"},
22450:{"w":"cash","e":"You can withdraw cash from a cashpoint machine with a cashcard.","t":"你可以用提款卡在取款机上提取**现金**。"},
22451:{"w":"valid","e":"You don't want to get to your destination only to find you have the wrong visa, or worse, that your passport isn't valid any more.","t":"你不会想要等到了目的地却发现你带的是错误的签证，或者更糟糕的是，你的护照不再**有效**。","r":"词根记忆：val（强壮的）+id（…的）→有力的→具有法律效力的"},
22452:{"w":"enrich","e":"Ports can enrich the life of a city.","t":"港口可以**丰富**一座城市的生活。","r":"联想记忆：en（使…）+rich（富有的）→使富裕","c":"enrich one's experience 丰富…的经历"},
22453:{"w":"equation","e":"The researchers thought that human beings should not be left out of the equation in the rainforest.","t":"研究人员认为，不应该忽略人类在雨林的生态**平衡**中的作用。","c":"identical equation 恒等式"},
22454:{"w":"miracle","e":"The doctor said that Mary's recovery was a miracle.","t":"医生说玛丽能够康复是个**奇迹**。","r":"词根记忆：mir（惊奇）+acle（表物）→奇迹"},
22455:{"w":"worthy","e":"I would praise him, but he is not worthy.","t":"我想表扬他，但他不**值得**。","f":"unworthy（adj. 没有价值的；不值得的）"},
22456:{"w":"irrigation","e":"The sea water is too salty to be used for the irrigation of crops.","t":"海水太咸了，不能用于农作物**灌溉**。","r":"词根记忆：ir（进入）+rig（浇水）+ation（表状态）→把水引入→灌溉"},
22457:{"w":"chief","e":"Paula is the chief counsellor at Liverpool's famous pain clinic.","t":"波拉是利物浦著名的疼痛治疗诊所的**首席**顾问。"},
22458:{"w":"remedy","e":"Without remedies, the two men who ate poisonous mushrooms died within days.","t":"由于没有**药物**，那两个吃了毒蘑菇的人几天后就死了。","r":"词根记忆：re（表加强）+med（治疗）+y（表名词）→治疗","c":"remedy for 对…的治疗法/药物/补救办法"},
22459:{"w":"accelerate","e":"The leader lost ground as the rest of the runners accelerated.","t":"领先者在其余赛跑者**加速**时逐渐失去了优势。","r":"词根记忆：ac（表加强）+celer（快速的）+ate（使…）→加速"},
22460:{"w":"thoughtful","e":"It's so thoughtful of you to offer to drop me off at the train station.","t":"你主动提出开车送我去火车站，真是太**体贴**了。"},
22461:{"w":"brunt","e":"The brunt of a typhoon can be abated by the breakwaters.","t":"防浪堤可以缓解台风的**冲击力**。","r":"联想记忆：b+run（跑）+t→飞奔着冲过去→冲击；冲力"},
22462:{"w":"prominence","e":"Giving prominence to characteristics and increasing innovation is a pillar for enterprise's further development.","t":"**突出**特色和勇于创新是企业进一步发展的支柱。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+min（突出）+ence（表名词）→向前突出→突出"},
22463:{"w":"compass","e":"Nearly two thousand years have passed since the invention of the compass, which is the pride of Chinese people.","t":"**指南针**的发明是中国人的骄傲，距今已有差不多两千年的历史。","r":"联想记忆：com（共同）+pass（走，通过）→共同走过的地方→范围"},
22464:{"w":"inaugurate","e":"The officials said more subway lines would be inaugurated to facilitate the public in the next two years.","t":"政府官员称，在未来两年中，将**建成**更多地铁线路以方便大众出行。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+augur（预兆）+ate（表动词）→进入预测好的未来→开创","d":"inauguration（n. 就职，就职典礼）；inaugural（adj. 就职的；开幕的）","y":"commence（v. 开始）；initiate（vt. 开始，发起）"},
22465:{"w":"suppress","e":"I know life is hard for you, so don't suppress the tears, as tears on the face are better than hurt to heart.","t":"我知道你的生活很艰难，所以不要**强忍**泪水，脸上流泪总好过内心受伤。","r":"联想记忆：sup（向下）+press（压）→压下去→压制，镇压","d":"suppressant（n. 抑制剂）；suppression（n. 镇压，抑制）","y":"squash（v. 镇压，压制）；restrain（vt. 抑制，压制）"},
22466:{"w":"perpetuate","e":"The pressure from the pain, when used correctly, can dispel fear and perpetuate motive power.","t":"源自痛苦的压力，如果运用得当，能驱散恐惧并使动力**持久**。","r":"词根记忆：per（自始至终）+pet（寻求）+uate（使…）→永远追求→使持续"},
22467:{"w":"configuration","e":"This seminar aims to introduce the configuration and composition of the papain and the use in foodstuff, medicine and industry.","t":"本次研讨会旨在介绍木瓜蛋白酶的**结构**、组成，及其在食品、医药和工业中的用途。","r":"联想记忆：con+figur(e)（形状）+ation→轮廓，外形","c":"aircraft configuration 飞机结构","d":"configure（vt. 配置；设定）"},
22468:{"w":"replenish","e":"The plunge of oil is crippling the government's ability to replenish its gold and foreign-currency reserves, just when it needs them most.","t":"油价下跌正在削弱政府**补给**黄金和外汇储备的能力，而现在正是它最需要这些的时候。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+plen（填满）+ish（表动词）→再装满；补充","d":"replenishment（n. 补充；充满）"},
22469:{"w":"encompass","e":"It would not worry trustbusters, because it seems unlikely to encompass advertising area in any deal between the New York Post and the Daily News.","t":"《纽约邮报》和《每日新闻》之间的任何合作似乎都不可能**包含**广告领域，因此反垄断人士不会担心。","r":"联想记忆：en（进入）+compass（范围）→进入范围→包围"},
22470:{"w":"camouflage","e":"Her size was properly camouflaged by the long loose dress she wore in the evening party.","t":"晚宴上，她一席宽松的长裙恰到好处地**掩饰**了自己的体形。","r":"联想记忆：cam（看作came，来）+ou（看作out）+flag（旗帜）+e→扛着旗帜出来，伪装成战士→掩饰，伪装"},
22471:{"w":"encapsulate","e":"The movie encapsulated tens of romantic stories and recomposed them, which grasped many youths' eyes.","t":"这部电影**收纳**了数十个浪漫故事，并将其改编，引起大量年轻人的关注。","r":"来自capsule（n. 胶囊）；en（进入）+capsul(e)+ate（使…）→装入胶囊"},
22472:{"w":"reinvigorate","e":"To reinvigorate the rural economy, the government proposes to exploit more highways to connect villages nationwide.","t":"为促进农村经济**振兴**，政府计划在全国范围内建设更多的乡间公路。"},
22473:{"w":"repatriate","e":"Some western nations were hit hard by the global financial crisis in late 2008, and tried to repatriate migrant workers to their own countries.","t":"一些西方国家在2008下半年受到全球金融危机的重创，因此想方设法将外籍劳工**遣送回国**。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+patr（祖国）+iate（表动词）→重新送回祖国→归国"},
22474:{"w":"tensile","e":"The cables, made of high tensile steel, are the bridge's main support.","t":"这种具有高**抗拉**强度的钢索是这座大桥的主要支撑。","c":"tensile force 张力"},
22475:{"w":"solidify","e":"In either case, make it a habit of solidifying your thoughts in a pattern before you put it into practice.","t":"在任何情况下，都要养成一个习惯：先使想法**固化**成一种模式，再着手实践。"},
22476:{"w":"propagate","e":"Those false television advertisements on medicine, with the famous as their spokesman, had propagated a false image in the public.","t":"那些由名人代言的虚假医药电视广告在公众中**宣传**了一种虚假形象。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+pag（系牢）+ate（表动词）→向前系牢→传播","d":"propagation（n. 繁殖；传播）","y":"produce（vt. 生产；繁殖）；multiply（v. 增加；繁殖）"},
22477:{"w":"germinate","e":"The cat puts many fishes, which she has caught, in the soil in order to germinate them and pray for a good harvest in next year.","t":"小猫把它捉来的很多鱼种到地里，希望它们**发芽**生长，并祈祷来年获得大丰收。","r":"词根记忆：germin（=germ，种子）+ate（使…）→使种子发芽→（使）发芽"},
22478:{"w":"unbeatable","e":"The emerging market, with great curiosity about new things, has unbeatable advantage to grasp the investor's eyes.","t":"新兴市场更容易接受新事物，在吸引投资方面拥有**绝对**优势。"},
22479:{"w":"accredit","e":"Scolded by the boss many times, the young man was accredited as department manager, which is a surprise for everybody.","t":"这个多次被老板训斥的年轻人却**荣升**部门经理，这让所有人都始料不及。","r":"联想记忆：ac（表加强）+credit（相信）→信任，相信"},
22480:{"w":"disorientate","e":"The woman felt shocked and totally disorientated by her mother's crazy behaviour.","t":"这个女人因其母亲的疯狂举动而感到震惊不已，**不知所措**。"},
22481:{"w":"slumber","e":"To enjoy the beauty of cherry blossom, many foreigners visit Mount Fuji which has slumbered for years.","t":"为了一睹樱花盛放之美，很多国外游客前往**休眠**多年的富士山游览。","r":"联想记忆：s+lumber（木材）→睡得很沉，像根木头→安睡"},
22482:{"w":"sufficient","e":"It takes only 10 to 20 minutes of exposure to sunlight a day to ensure sufficient vitamin D production.","t":"一天只需接受10到20分钟的阳光照射便可使身体产生**足够**的维生素D。","c":"be sufficient for 对…来说足够的，充分的","d":"self-sufficient（adj. 自给自足的）","f":"insufficient（adj. 不足的）"},
22483:{"w":"antiquity","e":"No one knows how much antiquity has been stolen or destroyed.","t":"没人知道有多少**古迹**被偷盗或毁坏了。","r":"联想记忆：antiqu（=antique，古代的）+ity→古代","c":"Roman antiquities 罗马古迹"},
22484:{"w":"pretend","e":"Many people pretend that they understand modern art.","t":"很多人都**假装**自己懂得现代艺术。","r":"联想记忆：pre（前）+tend（伸展）→向前伸手，假装去接东西→装作，假装"},
22485:{"w":"dominant","e":"The dominant idea, raised by 64% of the pupils, was that rainforests provide animals with habitats.","t":"64%的学生提出的**主流**观点是，热带雨林为动物提供了栖息地。","r":"词根记忆：domin（=dom，控制）+ant→统治的","c":"dominant power in the world 世界头号强国；dominant position 统治地位"},
22486:{"w":"pilot","e":"They owed their lives to the skill of the pilots.","t":"是**飞行员**的技术挽救了他们的生命。","r":"发音记忆：“派了他”→派他去开飞机→飞行员"},
22487:{"w":"privacy","e":"Biometrics raise thorny questions about privacy and the potential for abuse.","t":"生物测验学会引发一些有关**隐私**的棘手问题，同时它还很可能会被滥用。","r":"词根记忆：priv（单个）+acy（表名词）→个人的事情→隐私","y":"secrecy（n. 秘密，保密）；seclusion（n. 归隐；与世隔","f":"publicity（n. 公开）"},
22488:{"w":"advance","e":"It is essential to reserve a computer three days in advance if you want to use one.","t":"如果你想使用电脑，最好**提前**三天预订。","c":"in advance 预先，提前；book in advance 提前预订"},
22489:{"w":"efficiency","e":"Clean coal is an avenue for improving fuel conversion efficiency.","t":"提高煤的纯度是提高燃料转换**效率**的一个途径。","r":"词根记忆：ef（出）+fic（做）+iency（表名词）→做出东西又快又好→效率"},
22490:{"w":"drainage","e":"Drainage within and off the mining site is carefully designed.","t":"矿井内部及周围的**排水系统**都是经过精心设计的。","r":"词根记忆：drain（排水）+age（表集体名词）→排水（系统）"},
22491:{"w":"credible","e":"This witness presented credible information to convict the defendant.","t":"这个证人提供了**可靠**的证据，证明被告有罪。","r":"词根记忆：cred（相信）+ible（可…的）→可信的","f":"incredible（adj. 难以置信的）"},
22492:{"w":"elaborate","e":"Archaeological traces of far more elaborate cultures have been dismissed in this region.","t":"排除了该地区有更为**复杂**和高级文明存在的考古遗迹的可能。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+labor（工作，劳动）+ate→精细化工作的→精心制作的","c":"elaborate designs 精心的设计"},
22493:{"w":"consult","e":"You do not need to consult your doctor immediately if the tablets give you a side-effect.","t":"如果药片对你产生副作用，不必立即**咨询**医生。","r":"联想记忆：不顾侮辱（insult），不耻请教（consult）","d":"consultation（n. 请教；咨询）"},
22494:{"w":"fare","e":"According to Susan, air fares are the lowest.","t":"据苏珊说，机票**价格**是最便宜的。","r":"联想记忆：若愿与我同行，我不在乎（care）船费（fare）"},
22495:{"w":"foundation","e":"Most of the rocks will become the foundations for the airport's runways and taxiways.","t":"大多数石块将用作铺设机场跑道和飞机滑行道的**地基**。","r":"词根记忆：found（基础）+ation（表状态）→基础；地基"},
22496:{"w":"principal","e":"The Yellow River is one of the principal rivers of Asia.","t":"黄河是亚洲的**主要**河流之一。","r":"词根记忆：prin（第一）+cip（拿）+al（…的）→最先拿的→主要的"},
22497:{"w":"collection","e":"The textile collection of the museum is the largest in the world.","t":"这家博物馆**收藏**的纺织品是全世界最多的。"},
22498:{"w":"comparatively","e":"The standard of living in this city is comparatively high.","t":"这个城市的生活水平**相对**比较高。"},
22499:{"w":"victim","e":"The majority of the victims in this earthquake were children.","t":"这次地震中的主要**受害者**是儿童。","r":"联想记忆：胜利者（victor）的荣耀是牺牲者（victim）的鲜血换来的","c":"fall victim to 成为…的牺牲品；成为…的受害者"},
22500:{"w":"aisle","e":"In the supermarket, the end of an aisle is usually used for promoting special offers.","t":"超市**过道**的尽头常用来促销特价商品。","r":"联想记忆：ai（看作air，空气）+sle→让空气流通的道→通道","c":"an aisle seat 靠过道的座位"},
22501:{"w":"scan","e":"Customers at some banks will have to present their faces for scanning before they can enter the building.","t":"某些银行需要客户经过面部**扫描**才可以进入。","r":"发音记忆：“四看”→眼睛像扫描仪一样四处看→扫描；浏览","d":"scanner（n. 扫描仪）"},
22502:{"w":"sculpture","e":"Tom now has a new commission—making a glass sculpture for the headquarters of a pizza company.","t":"现在汤姆有了新任务：为一家披萨公司总部的建筑制作一个玻璃**雕像**。","r":"联想记忆：sculpt（雕刻）+ure→雕塑品"},
22503:{"w":"rigorous","e":"Once you have arrived at your hypothesis, you then proceed through a strictly logical and rigorous process.","t":"一旦你提出了假设，你就可以进行一个逻辑性极强的**严密**的求证过程。","r":"联想记忆：rig（看作rog，要求）+orous→不断要求→严格的","d":"rigorously（adv. 严格地；严密地）","y":"meticulous（adj. 谨小慎微的）；rigid（adj. 严格的）","f":"careless（adj. 粗心的，疏忽的）"},
22504:{"w":"fragment","e":"The gigantic explosion from eruption of the volcano tore its summit into fragments.","t":"火山喷发引起的强烈爆炸将山顶炸成了**碎片**。","r":"词根记忆：frag（打碎）+ment（表具体物）→碎片"},
22505:{"w":"audio","e":"Teams of typists transcribed the audio tapes to produce a computerised database of ten million words.","t":"一组组打字员把**录音**磁带转录下来，制成包含一千万个单词的电脑数据库。","r":"词根记忆：aud（听）+io→声音的"},
22506:{"w":"landmark","e":"In fact, I'd just like to spend a few minutes pointing out some of the landmarks that can be seen from here.","t":"事实上，我只是想花几分钟时间指出从这里能看到的一些**地标**。","r":"组合词：land（土地）+mark（标志）→路标，地标","c":"landmark decision 里程碑式的决定"},
22507:{"w":"biography","e":"He found a career entirely devoted to biography.","t":"他找了一份专门从事**传记**创作的职业。","r":"词根记忆：bio（生命）+graph（写）+y（表名词）→记录生命的文字→传记"},
22508:{"w":"dubious","e":"The greatly respected American Association of Zoological Parks and Aquariums (AAZPA) has had extremely dubious members, too.","t":"在备受人们尊敬的美国动物园和水族馆协会中，也有一些身份极其**可疑**的成员。","r":"词根记忆：dub（两）+ious（…的）→两种状态的→不确定的","y":"doubtful（adj. 可疑的，不确定的）；questionable（adj. 可疑的）"},
22509:{"w":"boulder","e":"The boulder is too big to put into the cave.","t":"**石头**太大了，塞不进洞里。"},
22510:{"w":"drill","e":"This small hole was drilled with an auger.","t":"这个小洞是用钻孔机**钻**出来的。","r":"联想记忆：dr+ill（生病的）→生病了还坚持训练→训练"},
22511:{"w":"batch","e":"The batch number is printed on the bottom of each jar.","t":"每个罐子的瓶底都印有生产**批**号。","r":"联想记忆：bat（蝙蝠）+ch→蝙蝠都是群居生活→一批，一群","c":"in batch 成批地；a batch of 一批，大量"},
22512:{"w":"shell","e":"Anne removed the oyster from its shell and began to eat.","t":"安妮从**壳**里挖出牡蛎，吃了起来。"},
22513:{"w":"subsidy","e":"In the rich countries, the annual value of farm subsidies is immense—about $250 billion.","t":"在经济发达国家，每年的农业**津贴**都高达约2,500亿美元。","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+sid（坐）+y（表名词）→在台下就坐领津贴→津贴","c":"housing subsidies 住房补贴"},
22514:{"w":"contrived","e":"The story is really touching, but the ending is rather contrived.","t":"这个故事确实感人，但结尾颇有**斧凿**之嫌。","r":"词根记忆：contri（相反）+ve（=vene，走）+d→故意反着走→不自然的"},
22515:{"w":"multiply","e":"Hot weather multiplies bacteria rapidly.","t":"炎热的天气导致细菌迅速**繁殖**。","d":"multiplication（n. 乘法，乘法运算）"},
22516:{"w":"joint","e":"The Universities of Oxford and Cambridge recently held joint conferences to discuss the rapid decline in literacy among their undergraduates.","t":"牛津大学和剑桥大学近日召开**联合**会议，讨论两校大学生文化素养迅速下降的问题。","r":"联想记忆：join（结合，连接）+t→接头；关节","c":"call for joint effort from 需要…的共同努力；joint venture 合资企业"},
22517:{"w":"spray","e":"Farmers are spraying the crops with pesticide.","t":"农民们正在给庄稼**喷洒**杀虫剂。","r":"联想记忆：sp（音似：四泼）+ray（光线）→光线向四面射去→喷射"},
22518:{"w":"meanwhile","e":"Tina's due to arrive on Sunday. Meanwhile, what do we do?","t":"蒂娜定于星期天到，**这期间**我们做什么呢？","r":"组合词：mean（意味）+while（当…时）→就在那个时候→与此同时"},
22519:{"w":"force","e":"She'd like to finish the studies she was forced to give up earlier in life.","t":"她想完成自己早年**被迫**放弃的研究。","c":"bring into force 开始生效，开始实施；the forces of nature 自然力量"},
22520:{"w":"evolve","e":"According to brain researchers, as the brain evolved, one side became specialised for fine control of movement.","t":"根据大脑研究人员的说法，随着大脑的**进化**，一边的脑半球专门用来精确控制动作。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+volv（转）+e→转出来→（使）进化","c":"evolve from 由…进化而来；evolve into 进化成为…"},
22521:{"w":"chew","e":"Rats like to chew on something hard.","t":"老鼠喜欢**咀嚼**硬物。","c":"chew sth. over 深思熟虑，详细讨论；chew up 咀嚼"},
22522:{"w":"speculate","e":"I began to speculate about how she was spending her time.","t":"我开始**猜测**她是如何打发时光的。"},
22523:{"w":"bulge","e":"In early May, the northern flank of the mountain bulged, and the summit rose by 500 feet, which indicated that the volcano would erupt.","t":"五月初，火山的北侧山脊**隆起**，最高峰升高了500英尺，这预示着它即将喷发。"},
22524:{"w":"insignificant","e":"The consequences are insignificant compared to this great idea.","t":"同这种伟大的思想相比，结果并**不重要**。","r":"联想记忆：in（无）+significant（有意义的，重要的）→无关紧要的，无意义的"},
22525:{"w":"revise","e":"Teaching methodology should be constantly revised to keep pace with the times.","t":"教师应该不断**调整**教学方法以跟上时代发展的步伐。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+vis（看）+e→反复看→复习"},
22526:{"w":"deposit","e":"Overseas students must pay a deposit when they apply for a course at the college.","t":"外国学生如果申请这所大学的课程，需要付一定的**押金**。","r":"联想记忆：de+posit（看作position，位置）→将钱放在安全的位置，存入银行→储蓄","c":"savings deposit 储蓄存款；fixed deposit 定期存款；20%deposit 20％押金；bank deposit 银行存款"},
22527:{"w":"professional","e":"Sports psychologists spend time with professional athletes helping them approach competition with a positive mental attitude.","t":"运动心理学家花时间帮助**职业**运动员以一种积极的心态去迎接挑战。","c":"professional misconduct 失职；professional knowledge 专业知识"},
22528:{"w":"rigid","e":"Although glass is comparatively rigid, the atoms are arranged in a random disordered fashion.","t":"虽然玻璃相对较**硬**，但是其分子结构排序杂乱无章。"},
22529:{"w":"solemn","e":"Kit made a solemn vow that he would always stand beside me.","t":"基特**郑重**起誓，说他将永远支持我。","r":"词根记忆：sol（太阳）+emn→古时把太阳看作是神圣庄严的→庄严的","c":"a solemn cathedral 一座庄严肃穆的大教堂"},
22530:{"w":"outsell","e":"This kind of digital camera outsells all others on the market.","t":"这款数码相机在市场上较其他型号**更畅销**。"},
22531:{"w":"forum","e":"The huge development in rocket technology is a good thing, but at the same time, rockets cause devastating results in the forum of war.","t":"火箭研制技术的长足进步是件好事，但同时火箭被用于战争**场合**也带来了惨痛的结果。","r":"联想记忆：for+u（看作you，你）+m（看作me，我）→让你我说话的地方→论坛"},
22532:{"w":"anecdote","e":"In the historical lessons, the teacher quoted many anecdotes to attract students' attention.","t":"在历史课上，老师借用大量的**趣闻轶事**来吸引学生的注意力。","r":"联想记忆：a+nec（看作neck，脖子）+dote（溺爱）→一个人伸着脖子听喜爱的趣闻、轶事→趣闻，轶事","d":"anecdotal（adj. 趣闻的，轶事的）"},
22533:{"w":"conversely","e":"Conversely, achievements in applied science and technology often provide a direct stimulus to the development of pure science.","t":"**相反**，应用科学技术的成果通常可以直接促进纯科学的发展。","r":"词根记忆：con+vers（转）+e+ly→转过去→相反地，颠倒地"},
22534:{"w":"prefabricate","e":"If implanting subcutaneous blood vessel to superficial fascia, thin transferable axial pattern skin flaps can be prefabricated.","t":"如果将皮下组织血管移位至浅筋膜，可**预制**可转换的薄轴型皮瓣。"},
22535:{"w":"paralysis","e":"The doctor injects the patient to paralysis before the medical operation, to lower the pain.","t":"在做手术之前，医生通常会给病人注射**麻醉**剂，来减轻疼痛。","r":"词根记忆：para（半）+lys（裂开）+is（表名词）→身体仿佛裂成两半→瘫痪"},
22536:{"w":"geometric","e":"He indulged in the study on geometric configuration even though he felt tired of math.","t":"他虽然不喜欢数学，但却对研究**几何**构型充满兴趣。","r":"来自geometry（n. 几何学）","c":"geometric configuration 几何构型"},
22537:{"w":"floral","e":"He devoted much time to floral design in his study room, with the inspiration from a cartoon.","t":"他花费了很多时间对书房进行**花饰**设计，创作灵感源于一幅漫画。"},
22538:{"w":"pollinate","e":"A well-known scientist recently reported that air pollution may prevent bees from finding flowers to pollinate.","t":"一位著名科学家最近提出，空气污染可能会妨碍蜜蜂找到花进行**授粉**。","r":"联想记忆：pollin（看作pollen，花粉）+ate→给…授粉"},
22539:{"w":"objectify","e":"It is so pervasive a dimension that it is difficult to objectify in spatial terms and difficult to consider apart from oneself.","t":"作为一个虚无缥缈的维度，很难在空间的范畴内使它**具象化**，也很难脱离它进行思考。"},
22540:{"w":"presuppose","e":"The construction of this project presupposes that flexible money will be available during the following months.","t":"该项目开工的**前提**是在接下来的几个月里要有活动资金。","r":"联想记忆：pre（预先）+suppose（假定）→预先假定…属实"},
22541:{"w":"recapture","e":"Their attempt to recapture the city was foiled by a traitor.","t":"他们**重新夺回**这座城市的企图被一个叛徒毁掉了。"},
22542:{"w":"contrive","e":"She finds it more difficult to contrive to live as prices are rising every month.","t":"物价每月都在上涨，她觉得越来越难**设法**维持生计了。","y":"devise（vt. 设计，发明）；plan（v. 计划；设计）；manage（v. 管理；设法做到）"},
22543:{"w":"anticipation","e":"According to the anticipation of economists, the global economy will get a burst of growth in the second quarter of 2030.","t":"据经济学家**预测**，全球经济在2030年第二季度将会迎来突破性增长。","c":"in anticipation 预先，预料，期待"},
22544:{"w":"provenance","e":"According to the theory of Sigmund Freud, the author of this book searched for some doubtful provenance of jealousy.","t":"根据西格蒙德·弗罗伊德的理论，本书作者寻找产生嫉妒的可能**原因**。","r":"词根记忆：pro（在前）+ven（来）+ance（表名词）→先于…来到的东西→起源"},
22545:{"w":"studious","e":"The belief of \"Learning to be Studious\" drives him to enter China's most famous university.","t":"“**勤学**苦练”这个信仰一直鞭策着他，直到进入中国最好的大学。","r":"来自 study（n./v. 学习）","y":"diligent（adj. 勤勉的，用功的）"},
22546:{"w":"vibrant","e":"Learning memory systems, mental sports and juggling are all wonderful ways to maintain a vibrant, lively mind.","t":"学习记忆系统、脑力运动和杂耍都是保持大脑**活力**的好方法。"},
22547:{"w":"inventive","e":"This experiment aims to explore children's imagination and inventive learning skill.","t":"该实验的目的在于开发孩子们的想象力和**创造性**学习技巧。","r":"联想记忆：invent（创造，发明）+ive→发明的，创造的"},
22548:{"w":"protrude","e":"The climber tried to hang on to a piece of rock protruding from the cliff face.","t":"攀岩者设法抓住悬崖外**突出**的岩石。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+trud（推）+e→向前推出→（使）伸出"},
22549:{"w":"managerial","e":"Such systems emphasize the managerial communications function and can be operated easily.","t":"这些系统强调**管理**通信功能，便于操作。","c":"managerial talent 管理人才"},
22550:{"w":"notoriety","e":"Even though you quit, that kind of notoriety will still follow you from one workplace to another.","t":"即使你辞职了，这样的**恶名**还是一样跟着你，从一个岗位到另一个岗位。","r":"词根记忆：not（知道）+oriety（多）→做了坏事，人人皆知→臭名昭著"},
22551:{"w":"opaque","e":"His paper, with opaque cases, made the tutor dizzy.","t":"他论文中**晦涩难懂**的案例让导师感到头晕目眩。","r":"词根记忆：op（不）+aque（=aqua，水）→不像水一样透明→不透明的","d":"opaquely（adv. 不透明地，无光泽地）；opaqueness（n. 含糊）","y":"obscure（adj. 模糊的；费解的）；vague（adj. 含糊的，不明确的）","f":"transparent（adj. 透明的）"},
22552:{"w":"partial","e":"Parents should not be partial to any one of their children.","t":"父母不该对某个孩子**偏心**。","c":"partial imitation 部分模仿","d":"partially（adv. 部分地）"},
22553:{"w":"ape","e":"It is pretty well agreed that apes and men come from a common ancestor.","t":"人们普遍认为**类人猿**和人类有共同的祖先。","c":"go ape 发疯；变得狂热"},
22554:{"w":"portable","e":"A quiver is a portable case for holding arrows.","t":"箭囊是可以**随身携带**的用来装箭的盒子。","r":"词根记忆：port（拿）+able（可…的）→可以拿的→便于携带的","c":"portable computer 手提电脑，笔记本；portable telephone 移动电话"},
22555:{"w":"depart","e":"Tom departs at sundown to fish.","t":"汤姆黄昏时分**出发**去捕鱼。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+part（分开）→离开"},
22556:{"w":"gauge","e":"These new monitors can gauge the exhaust from a passing vehicle.","t":"这些新的监视器可以**测量**驶过车辆的尾气排放量。","r":"发音记忆：“规矩”→规格","y":"measure（n. 量具；计量单位 v. 测量，度量）；criterion（n. 评判的标准，尺度）；estimate（v. 估计，估量）；evaluate（vt. 评价，估计）"},
22557:{"w":"dialect","e":"The tourists were confused by the unfamiliar dialects in this area.","t":"游客被该地不熟悉的**方言**弄得满头雾水。","r":"词根记忆：dia（二者之间）+lect（讲）→在一部分人之间说的话→方言"},
22558:{"w":"debate","e":"There's a debate in the meeting room about next year's budget.","t":"会议室里（大家）就来年的预算产生了**争论**。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+bat（打）+e→竞选双方在打口水战→辩论","c":"beyond debate 无异议，无可争辩；open the debate 在辩论时首先发言；debate upon/on 讨论（问题）","y":"dispute（v./n. 争论，辩论）"},
22559:{"w":"cosmopolitan","e":"A port will make a city cosmopolitan.","t":"港口会让一座城市**走向世界**。","r":"词根记忆：cosmo（世界）+polit（城市）+an（…的）→世界城的→世界性的"},
22560:{"w":"helix","e":"The DNA molecule is a double helix, resembling a ladder that's been twisted along its height.","t":"DNA分子是双**螺旋**结构，就像是顺其长度螺旋扭转的梯子。","r":"联想记忆：heli（看作helic，螺旋的）+x→螺旋（形）；螺旋状物"},
22561:{"w":"motion","e":"For years Newton had been curious about the cause of the orbital motion of the moon and planets.","t":"多年来，牛顿一直对月球和行星轨道**运动**的成因好奇。","r":"词根记忆：mot（动）+ion（表名词）→运动","c":"set/put sth. in motion 让…动起来，开动…"},
22562:{"w":"understanding","e":"The Human Genome Project will open up new understanding of many ailments that afflict humanity.","t":"人类基因工程将开启人们对于困扰人类的很多疾病的全新**认识**。"},
22563:{"w":"circumstance","e":"In social circumstances, dress has often been used as a sign of professional role.","t":"在社交**场合**中，服装通常被看作是某种职业角色的标志。","r":"词根记忆：circum（周围）+st（站）+ance（表名词）→站在周围的事物→环境","c":"in/under...circumstances 在…情况下；in/under no circumstances 在任何情况下都不"},
22564:{"w":"temper","e":"It is generally believed that tempers grow shorter in hot, muggy weather.","t":"人们普遍认为在闷热的天气里更容易发**脾气**。","r":"联想记忆：情绪（temper）会影响体温（temperature）"},
22565:{"w":"insurance","e":"I'd like to get insurance for the contents of my home.","t":"我想给我家的财物上**保险**。","r":"联想记忆：insur(e)（保险）+ance（表名词）→保险；保险费","c":"unemployment insurance 失业保险；accident insurance 意外伤害保险；life insurance 人寿险"},
22566:{"w":"impress","e":"Those uniforms for the military were originally intended to impress and even terrify the enemy.","t":"最初设计军装是为了给敌人**留下深刻的印象**，甚至威慑敌人。","r":"联想记忆：im（使…）+press（压）→使压住→压印"},
22567:{"w":"maintain","e":"Health promotion programs and policies would help people maintain healthy behaviors and lifestyles.","t":"健康促进计划和方针能够帮助人们**保持**健康的生活习惯和生活方式。","r":"词根记忆：main（逗留）+tain（拿住）→留住→保持","c":"maintain world peace 维护世界和平；maintain one's health 保持健康"},
22568:{"w":"meaningful","e":"Teachers should design meaningful tasks that give students a clear purpose for practising new vocabulary.","t":"教师应设计**有目的的**任务，让学生在练习新词汇时目标明确。","r":"联想记忆：meaning（含义，意义）+ful（…的）→有目的的；有意义的","c":"a meaningful experience 一次有意义的经历"},
22569:{"w":"exist","e":"Two American brain researchers studied the brains of human embryos and discovered that the left-right asymmetry exists before birth.","t":"两名美国大脑研究人员研究了人类胚胎的大脑后发现，大脑的左右半球不对称在婴儿出生前就已**存在**。","d":"existence（n. 存在；生存；生活方式）"},
22570:{"w":"jostle","e":"In a port city, races, cultures, and ideas, as well as goods from a variety of places, jostle, mix and enrich each other.","t":"在港口城市，种族、文化和理念还有那些来自四面八方的货物，互相**推挤**、混合又互为补充。"},
22571:{"w":"version","e":"This scene was cut from the final version of the movie.","t":"那部电影的最终**版本**把这场戏删掉了。","c":"original version 原始版本"},
22572:{"w":"hostility","e":"The hostility of the indigenous population to North American influences is still very strong.","t":"当地人对来自北美的影响仍怀有很深的**敌意**。"},
22573:{"w":"appearance","e":"His sudden appearance surprised me greatly.","t":"他的突然**出现**让我大吃一惊。","r":"联想记忆：appear（出现）+ance（表名词）→出现"},
22574:{"w":"grind","e":"Tension may cause you to chew too forcefully or grind your teeth when you are sleeping.","t":"紧张可能导致你在睡觉时用力咀嚼或是**磨**牙。","r":"联想记忆：将一块大（grand）石头磨碎（grind）","c":"the daily grind 繁重的日常工作"},
22575:{"w":"optimistic","e":"Psychologists have conducted studies showing that people become more optimistic when the weather is sunny.","t":"心理学家已进行的研究表明，人们在阳光灿烂的日子里会更加**乐观**。","r":"词根记忆：optim（最好）+istic（…的）→什么都往最好处想的→乐观的"},
22576:{"w":"tense","e":"When pain strikes, we attempt to keep the back as immobile as possible, which makes the muscles tense up.","t":"当疼痛来袭时，我们尽最大努力保持背部不动，这样会使肌肉**紧绷**。","r":"发音记忆：“弹死”→没有弹性→绷紧的","d":"tension（n. 紧张）","y":"stressed（adj. 紧张的）；strain（v. 绷紧）"},
22577:{"w":"ignore","e":"If you ignore these instructions, this medicine could affect your heart rhythm.","t":"如果你**不顾**说明服药，这种药可能会影响你的心率。","r":"联想记忆：ig+nore（看作nose，鼻子）→翘起鼻子不理人→不顾，不理，忽视","c":"ignore the fact 忽视事实"},
22578:{"w":"extract","e":"You will hear an extract from a BBC television program on acid rain.","t":"你将会听到一段来自BBC电视节目的有关酸雨的**片段**。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+tract（拉）→拉出→取出","c":"extract from 从…中提取","y":"remove（vt. 移开，挪走）；cull（vt. 挑选，精选）；abstract（n. 摘要，梗概）"},
22579:{"w":"therefore","e":"The earth is unique, therefore, we have to attain a sustainable balance between population, economic growth and the environment.","t":"我们只有一个地球，**因此**必须保持人口数量、经济发展与环境之间的长久平衡。"},
22580:{"w":"bar","e":"Architects in the 18th and 19th centuries began to create buildings by using steel, glass and concrete strengthened steel bars.","t":"18、19世纪的建筑师开始使用钢铁、玻璃和混凝土加固的钢**条**来建造房屋。","r":"发音记忆：“吧”→酒吧"},
22581:{"w":"externally","e":"The medicine is used externally only.","t":"这种药只能**外用**。","r":"联想记忆：external（外部的）+ly→外部地"},
22582:{"w":"abound","e":"The mountain streams abound with fish.","t":"山溪里**有许多**鱼。","r":"联想记忆：a（一个）+bound（界限，范围）→所有物品在一个范围内→富于；充满"},
22583:{"w":"subjective","e":"Taste and smell were subjective senses.","t":"味觉和嗅觉都是**主观**感觉。","y":"personal（adj. 个人的）；intuitive（adj. 直觉的）","f":"objective（adj. 客观的）"},
22584:{"w":"particularly","e":"Mary was particularly fond of bananas.","t":"玛丽**特别**爱吃香蕉。","r":"联想记忆：particular（特别的）+ly→特别，尤其"},
22585:{"w":"quiver","e":"The moth quivered its wings in front of the fire.","t":"蛾子在火堆前**抖动**着翅膀。","y":"quake（vi. 震动；颤抖）；shake〔v.（使）颤抖，（使）震动〕"},
22586:{"w":"classification","e":"The classification and analysis of this species occupied scientists for years.","t":"科学家们花费了数年的时间对该物种进行**分类**和分析。","r":"联想记忆：classifi（=classify，把…分类）+cation→分类"},
22587:{"w":"pollution","e":"Air pollution is increasingly becoming the focus of government and citizen concern around the globe.","t":"大气**污染**正逐渐成为全球范围内政府和市民所关注的焦点。"},
22588:{"w":"obtain","e":"Today fibre optics are used to obtain a clearer image of smaller objects.","t":"现在，纤维光学被用于**获取**较小物体的更清晰图像。","r":"词根记忆：ob（表加强）+tain（拿住）→拿到→获得","c":"obtain a degree 获得学位"},
22589:{"w":"mandarin","e":"Which language would you like to learn? We offer French, Italian, Chinese (Mandarin), Spanish and Portuguese.","t":"您想学习哪种语言？我们提供法语、意大利语、中文（**普通话**）、西班牙语和葡萄牙语的学习。","r":"词根记忆：mand（命令）+arin→命令全国都要讲的语言→普通话"},
22590:{"w":"probe","e":"The space probe sent back useful information to us.","t":"太空**探测器**给我们发回了有用的信息。","y":"investigate（v. 调查）；survey（v. 调查；检查）"},
22591:{"w":"panic","e":"In fact I'm starting to panic as the project deadline is in two weeks and I don't seem to be making any progress at all.","t":"事实上，当距课题研究的最后期限只剩两个星期时我开始**惊慌失措**起来，因为我还是一点进展也没有。"},
22592:{"w":"disturb","e":"One of the most concerning elements of acid rain is that it disturbs the natural balance of lakes and rivers.","t":"在酸雨带来的破坏中，最令人担心的是它**破坏**了河流和湖泊的自然平衡。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+turb（搅动）→打乱","c":"disturb the peace 扰乱和平；disturb the balance of environment 破坏环境平衡"},
22593:{"w":"grassy","e":"To the east of us, you'll see no building at all—just trees and flowers and a huge grassy area.","t":"在我们的东面，你根本看不到建筑物，唯有树木、花卉和大片**绿地**。"},
22594:{"w":"glorious","e":"Our country has a glorious past.","t":"我们的祖国有着**辉煌**的历史。","c":"a glorious victory 一场辉煌的胜利"},
22595:{"w":"fertile","e":"The east of this region is flatter and more low-lying, with fertile soils.","t":"这一地区的东部土壤**肥沃**，地势较为平坦，海拔也比较低。","r":"词根记忆：fert（=fer，带来）+ile（…的）→可带来果实的→多产的","c":"fertile land/field/soil 肥沃的土地；fertile eggs 受精卵"},
22596:{"w":"amateur","e":"Only amateur athletes are allowed to compete in this sports games.","t":"这次运动会只允许**业余**运动员参加。","r":"词根记忆：amat（爱）+eur（表人）→业余爱好者","c":"radio amateur 业余无线电爱好者","f":"expert（n. 专家）；professional（adj. 职业的，专业的）"},
22597:{"w":"undisguised","e":"They looked upon the creature with a loathing undisguised.","t":"他们看那动物的眼神流露出**明显**的厌恶。","r":"联想记忆：un（不，无）+disguise（装饰；伪装）+d→无伪装的"},
22598:{"w":"silver","e":"A German alchemist tried to transmute silver into gold.","t":"一位德国的炼金术士试图将**白银**炼成黄金。"},
22599:{"w":"fulfillment","e":"The company gains its reputation from delivering fast and accurate order fulfillment services.","t":"该公司因其快速而准确地**完成**订单而声名远播。"},
22600:{"w":"aspire","e":"The looks on children who aspired to go to school in some poor areas deeply moved me.","t":"在一些贫困地区，孩子们**渴望**上学的眼神深深地打动了我。","r":"词根记忆：a（表加强）+spir（呼吸）+e→看到渴望的东西就呼吸急促→渴望"},
22601:{"w":"recession","e":"During the economic recession, more and more countries begin to take trade protectionist measures, which is a block to the global economic recovery.","t":"经济**衰退**期间，越来越多的国家开始采取贸易保护措施，阻碍了全球经济的复苏。","r":"词根记忆：re（相反）+cess（行走）+ion（表名词）→向后走→衰退","c":"economic recession 经济衰退"},
22602:{"w":"miscellaneous","e":"A little child's pockets are likely to contain a miscellaneous collection of objects.","t":"小孩子的口袋里往往装有**各种各样**的东西。","r":"词根记忆：misc（混淆）+ellan+eous（…的）→混杂的；各种各样的","c":"miscellaneous costs 杂费"},
22603:{"w":"utilization","e":"This research provides the scientific foundation for rational utilization of land.","t":"这项调查为合理**使用**土地提供了科学依据。"},
22604:{"w":"caustic","e":"This paper mainly introduces the test status of filtrating equipment in medicine industry used for diaphragm caustic soda cooling process.","t":"这篇文章主要论述了医药行业用于隔膜**烧**碱冷却工序的过滤装置的试验情况。","r":"联想记忆：caus（看作cause，造成）+tic→造成腐蚀的→腐蚀性的","c":"caustic remarks 讽刺性的言论"},
22605:{"w":"detergent","e":"The auto beauty company often uses the professional cleaning detergent foam, and then wipes the car slightly with a clean soft cloth.","t":"汽车美容公司通常会使用专业泡沫**清洁剂**清洁汽车，然后用干净的软布轻轻擦拭。"},
22606:{"w":"reclaim","e":"As he stopped the payment by installment, the finance company tried to reclaim his house.","t":"在他停止分期付款后，该信贷公司试图**收回**他的房屋。","r":"联想记忆：re（一再）+claim（叫喊）→一再叫喊，要求归还→要求归还","d":"reclamation（n. 开垦；回收）","y":"retrieve（v. 重新得到）；retake（vt. 取回，夺回）；recycle（vt. 使再循环，回收）"},
22607:{"w":"deflect","e":"The bullet hit a wall and then deflected from its course.","t":"子弹击中墙壁后**改变了方向**。","r":"词根记忆：de（向下）+flect（弯曲）→向下弯曲→（使）偏斜"},
22608:{"w":"trench","e":"The next stage of the project involves trench excavation, cable laying, construction backfilling and reinstatement, and landscaping works.","t":"该工程的下一阶段包括**坑道**挖掘、电缆铺设、建筑回填和修复以及景观美化工程。","r":"联想记忆：t+rench（看作bench，长凳）→像长凳一样狭长的地区→沟，壕沟","c":"trench coat 军用防水短上衣；trench warfare 堑壕战","y":"channel（n. 水道）；ditch（n. 沟渠）"},
22609:{"w":"holistically","e":"In the innovation time, the firm must design its innovation process holistically.","t":"在这个创新的时代，企业必须**全面**设计自己的创新流程。"},
22610:{"w":"urbanization","e":"The intervention of government plays an important role in solving the problems in the process of urbanization.","t":"政府干预对解决**城市化**过程中出现的问题起着重要作用。"},
22611:{"w":"insularity","e":"Japan is an insularity and such geographical feature forms its distinctive natural landscape.","t":"日本是一个**岛国**，这一地理特征形成了它独特的自然景观。"},
22612:{"w":"permeate","e":"As a kind of research study, this method is permeated in all the courses as well as all activities of students.","t":"作为一种研究性学习，这种方法**渗透**于学生的所有课程和所有活动中。","r":"词根记忆：per（贯穿）+me（走）+ate（使…）→使来回走动→渗透","d":"permeation（n. 渗透）；permeant（adj. 浸透的，渗透的）","y":"penetrate（v. 穿透，渗透）；saturate（vt. 浸透，使充满）"},
22613:{"w":"repack","e":"He had to repack his case after the customs officers opened it during the security inspection.","t":"在海关人员打开包裹安检后，他必须**重新打包**他的行李。"},
22614:{"w":"disruptive","e":"The school accident preliminarily resulted from some disruptive students in the crowd.","t":"这起校园事故的初步原因是一些学生在人群中**制造混乱**。"},
22615:{"w":"clinical","e":"The experiment results show that the proposed evaluation method has good clinical value, which will be further accepted by more medical workers.","t":"实验结果表明，提出的评价方法具有良好的**临床**价值，将进一步被更多医学工作者所接受。","r":"联想记忆：clinic（诊所）+al→临床的"},
22616:{"w":"momentum","e":"She worked day and night with the momentum of going abroad for further education.","t":"出国深造是她夜以继日辛勤工作的**动力**。","r":"联想记忆：moment（瞬间）+um→冲力在瞬间迸发→冲力","y":"impetus（n. 促进；推动力）"},
22617:{"w":"disempower","e":"You disempower yourself to do anything about it, because you always think it beyond your ability.","t":"你总是觉得这件事超出了你的能力，所以**剥夺**了自己去做些什么的力量。"},
22618:{"w":"depletion","e":"Many western countries have taken measures to prevent the depletion of their dollar reserves.","t":"许多西方国家已经采取措施，防止**损耗**其美元储备。","r":"词根记忆：de（否定）+plet（填满）+ion（表名词）→使不满→削减"},
22619:{"w":"authenticate","e":"There is no way to authenticate the recording at present, but the voice sounds like Lily's.","t":"目前还没有办法**鉴别**这盘录音带的真伪，但是声音听起来像莉莉。","r":"联想记忆：authentic（真的；真正的）+ate→证明…是真的→鉴别，证明"},
22620:{"w":"anatomy","e":"Leon devoted his life to studying the human anatomy.","t":"利昂毕生致力于研究人体**解剖学**。","r":"词根记忆：ana（分开）+tom（切割）+y（表行为）→分开切→解剖（学）","c":"human anatomy 人体解剖（学）；animal anatomy 动物解剖（学）","d":"anatomical（adj. 解剖学的）"},
22621:{"w":"confidence","e":"The message is that you have little confidence.","t":"（反馈出的）信息就是你没什么**自信**。"},
22622:{"w":"commencement","e":"The high school seniors engaged in high jinks after commencement.","t":"**毕业典礼**后，中学毕业生狂欢了一场。"},
22623:{"w":"chemical","e":"The chemicals will contaminate water resources when drained into the river.","t":"这些**化学物质**如果被排放到河里会污染水源。","c":"toxic chemicals 有毒的化学物品；chemical reaction 化学反应；chemical engineering 化学工程"},
22624:{"w":"literal","e":"The literal meaning of the phrase \"say what you like\" is \"feel free to say anything you want\".","t":"这个短语的**字面**意思是“说你想说的，不用拘束”。","r":"词根记忆：liter（文字）+al（…的）→逐字的","d":"literally（adv. 逐字地；实际上）","y":"verbatim（adj. 逐字的，照字面的）"},
22625:{"w":"comprehensive","e":"His account of the meeting was most comprehensive.","t":"他对会议的叙述**面面俱到**。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+prehens（抓）+ive（…的）→全部抓住的→全面的","c":"comprehensive school 综合学校"},
22626:{"w":"glue","e":"I've prepared this so that I don't get glue everywhere.","t":"我已经有所准备，这样就不会把**胶水**弄得到处都是。","r":"联想记忆：用胶水（glue）把那幅蓝色的（blue）画贴上"},
22627:{"w":"bureau","e":"The university's careers bureau is open from nine to five and offers free advice on job applications.","t":"大学的就业指导**办公室**从九点开放到五点，免费为求职申请提供建议。","c":"an employment bureau 一家职业介绍所"},
22628:{"w":"observe","e":"She has observed that if a left-handed person is brain-damaged in the left hemisphere, the recovery of speech is quite often better than that of a right-handed person.","t":"她**观察**到，如果一个左撇子的大脑左半球受损，他的语言恢复能力会比右撇子好很多。","r":"词根记忆：ob（表加强）+serv（维持）+e→遵守"},
22629:{"w":"brood","e":"In the brood chamber, the bees will stash honey to eat later.","t":"蜜蜂在**育雏**箱中贮藏蜂蜜，以供日后食用。","r":"联想记忆：这一窝（brood）小鸡是同一个品种（breed）","y":"meditate（v. 沉思，考虑）；hatch（v. 孵化）"},
22630:{"w":"interdependent","e":"The society, economy and environment are interacting and interdependent.","t":"社会、经济和环境相互作用，**彼此依赖**。","r":"联想记忆：inter（相互）+dependent（依赖的）→互相依赖的"},
22631:{"w":"murder","e":"The murder seemed planned.","t":"这场**谋杀**显然是蓄意策划的。"},
22632:{"w":"prominent","e":"Suzhou is one of the earlier prominent port cities.","t":"苏州是较早的**著名**港口城市之一。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+min（突出）+ent（具有…性质的）→突出的"},
22633:{"w":"conventional","e":"Most people prefer conventional housing now.","t":"现在很多人偏爱**传统**式的住宅。","c":"conventional food 普通食物；conventional value 传统价值观"},
22634:{"w":"productivity","e":"This process enhanced our ability to improve productivity and quality.","t":"这一方法增强了我们提高**生产力**和质量的能力。","r":"联想记忆：product（产品）+ivity→生产力；生产率","y":"output（n. 产量；输出量）；capacity（n. 容量；生产力）"},
22635:{"w":"viscous","e":"Numerous tiny worms were floating in a viscous liquid.","t":"**黏稠**的液体里飘浮着无数的小蠕虫。"},
22636:{"w":"transform","e":"The new genetical anatomy will transform medicine and reduce human suffering in the twenty-first century.","t":"在21世纪，新的基因解剖学将**彻底改变**药品形式并减轻人类的痛苦。","r":"词根记忆：trans（变换）+form（形状）→使改观"},
22637:{"w":"strategist","e":"The Japanese strategist talked about the impact of globalization on nations.","t":"那位日本**战略家**谈到了全球化给各国带来的影响。","r":"联想记忆：strateg(y)（战略）+ist（表人）→战略家"},
22638:{"w":"indulge","e":"Overseas visitors like to come here to indulge in one of Astoria's more famous agricultural products—wine.","t":"外国游客喜欢到这里**尽情**品尝美酒，这是阿斯托里亚较出名的农产品之一。","y":"gratify（vt. 使满意，使高兴）；satisfy〔v. 满足，（使）满意〕；spoil（v. 宠坏，溺爱）；pamper（vt. 纵容，娇惯）"},
22639:{"w":"personality","e":"If you are in a role for long, it eventually becomes part of you, part of your personality.","t":"如果你长久地处于一个角色中，最终它将成为你的一部分，成为你**个性**的一部分。"},
22640:{"w":"definition","e":"The definition of any individual's role in any situation will be a combination of the role expectations.","t":"任何情况下对任何个人角色的**定义**都会是对角色期待的综合。"},
22641:{"w":"host","e":"We will be hosting more than 250 participants for the lectures and workshops.","t":"我们将**接待**250多位参加讲座和讨论会的人员。","c":"a host of 大量的；host country 东道国，主办国"},
22642:{"w":"feminism","e":"We discuss everything from personal experience to future society and feminism.","t":"我们从个人阅历、未来社会或**男女平等主义**的角度来讨论每件事。","r":"词根记忆：femin（来自feminine，女性）+ism（…主义）→女权主义"},
22643:{"w":"abate","e":"After the closedown of the airport, noise pollution abated.","t":"机场关闭后，噪音污染**减轻**了。","r":"词根记忆：a（不）+bat（打，击）+e→不再打击→减轻"},
22644:{"w":"expectation","e":"The company failed to meet shareholders' expectations.","t":"公司没有满足股东的**期望**。","r":"联想记忆：expect（期待）+ation（表名词）→期待，预期","c":"role expectations 角色期待"},
22645:{"w":"excessive","e":"Each month, managers would analyse the pattern of absence of staff with excessive sick leave.","t":"每个月，经理们都会分析请**过多**病假的员工的缺勤模式。"},
22646:{"w":"brilliant","e":"That's a brilliant solution to the problem.","t":"那可真是一个解决问题的**绝妙**办法。","r":"词根记忆：brilli（发光）+ant（…的）→发光的→光辉灿烂的","c":"brilliant sunshine 灿烂的阳光；brilliant idea 极好的想法"},
22647:{"w":"seminar","e":"You should prepare before you attend this seminar.","t":"参加这次**研讨会**之前你应该准备一下。","r":"词根记忆：semin（种子）+ar（表场所）→精神如种子般传播的地方→研讨会"},
22648:{"w":"navigable","e":"The depth of the navigable channel of this river is 40 feet.","t":"这条河**可航行**河段的水深为40英尺。","r":"词根记忆：nav（船）+ig（开动）+able（能…的）→船可以开动的→可通航的"},
22649:{"w":"foul","e":"The football player was penalized for his foul.","t":"那名足球运动员因为**犯规**而被判罚。","r":"联想记忆：邪恶的（foul）心灵（soul）"},
22650:{"w":"contemplate","e":"In order to compete in the world market, we contemplate improving our present product.","t":"为了参与国际市场的竞争，我们**打算**改进现有产品。","r":"联想记忆：con+templ（看作temple，庙）+ate→庙里的和尚常常打坐→思量，沉思","y":"consider（v. 考虑；认为）；ponder（v. 沉思，考虑）"},
22651:{"w":"budget","e":"I'm going to talk about ways of making sure that you eat well while at the same time staying within your budget.","t":"我将会谈到一些方法，让你在不超过**预算**的前提下吃好。","c":"budget deficit 预算赤字；cut down the budget 减少预算；plan a budget 做预算；on a budget 节省费用"},
22652:{"w":"flee","e":"Citizens were forced to flee the besieged city.","t":"居民们被迫**逃离**这座被围困的城市。"},
22653:{"w":"worthwhile","e":"I'm sure you've done many worthwhile things in the last ten years.","t":"我确信在过去的十年里，你做了很多**有意义**的事。","r":"组合词：worth（值得）+while（一段时间）→值得花费时间的","c":"be worthwhile to do sth./doing sth. 值得做…"},
22654:{"w":"clamp","e":"If you do not have a parking sticker, the workers will clamp your car wheel and give you a fine.","t":"如果你没有停车许可证，工作人员会**夹住**你的车轮并对你进行罚款。"},
22655:{"w":"convenience","e":"The newly-built apartment building provides gas, electricity and other modern conveniences.","t":"这幢新盖的公寓大楼提供煤气、电以及其他一些现代化**便利设施**。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+ven（来）+ience（表状态）→共同行动来维护便民设施→便利设施","c":"convenience food/store便利食品/商店；at one's convenience在某人方便时","d":"inconvenience（n. 麻烦，不方便）"},
22656:{"w":"migrant","e":"The migrants fly to the south before winter.","t":"**候鸟**在冬天来临之前飞往南方。","r":"词根记忆：migr（迁移）+ant（表人）→移居者"},
22657:{"w":"specify","e":"It is not necessary to specify quantity when ordering beer.","t":"预定啤酒时无需**指定**数量。","r":"词根记忆：spec（看）+ify（使…）→让人看清楚→详细说"},
22658:{"w":"deviance","e":"The investigation of deviance can reveal interesting and significant aspects of \"normal\" societies.","t":"对**偏常行为**的研究会揭露出“正常”社会中一些有趣且重要的情况。","r":"词根记忆：de（离开）+vi（路）+ance（表名词）→偏离正路→偏常行为","d":"deviant（adj. 不正常的；偏离常规的）"},
22659:{"w":"estimate","e":"The deal is estimated to be worth around £1.5 million.","t":"这笔交易**估计**价值150万英镑左右。","r":"联想记忆：评估（estimate）地产（estate）","c":"estimated time of arrival（ETA） 预计到达时间；estimated time of departure（ETD） 预计出发时间；estimated number of people 预计人数；conservative estimate 保守估计"},
22660:{"w":"livelihood","e":"We understand a port as a centre of land-sea exchange, and as a major source of livelihood and a major force for cultural mixing.","t":"我们把港口理解为一个海陆交流的中心，**生活**的重要资源，文化融合的主要推动力量。"},
22661:{"w":"manufacture","e":"Many automobile makers no longer manufacture cheap models.","t":"很多汽车制造商不再**大量生产**低价位车型。","r":"词根记忆：manu（手）+fact（制作）+ure（表名词）→用手制作→大量制造"},
22662:{"w":"censure","e":"The warden censured the guard for letting the prisoner escape.","t":"监狱长**责骂**狱警让罪犯逃走了。","r":"词根记忆：cens（判断）+ure（表名词）→判断是非→指责"},
22663:{"w":"voltage","e":"The voltage made her hair shoot straight out.","t":"**电压**使得她的头发竖了起来。"},
22664:{"w":"logic","e":"Miranda holds the belief that science and logic will unlock the mysteries of the plague.","t":"米兰达坚信科学和**逻辑**会解开这场瘟疫的未解之谜。","r":"词根记忆：log（说话）+ic（…学）→说话的学问→逻辑学"},
22665:{"w":"enroll","e":"Places are available here even for students enrolled in the minimum length course.","t":"这里甚至为那些**报名**参加最短课时的学生提供上课场所。","r":"联想记忆：en（进入）+roll（名单）→上了名单→登记","c":"enroll on 加入，参加；注册；入学"},
22666:{"w":"civilization","e":"Many important civilizations developed from Asia.","t":"许多重要的**文明**发源于亚洲。","r":"来自civilize（v. 使文明）"},
22667:{"w":"compendium","e":"The human genome is the compendium of all these inherited genetic instructions.","t":"人类基因组是所有这些遗传基因说明的一个**缩影**。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+pend（悬挂）+ium（表名词）→把重要的部分抽出来挂在一起→概略"},
22668:{"w":"embark","e":"Without hesitation Alexander embarked on his new career as a musician.","t":"亚历山大毫不犹豫地**开始**了他的新职业，成为一名音乐家。","c":"embark on/upon 从事，着手，开始工作","y":"board〔v. 上车（或船、飞机等）〕","f":"disembark〔v. 下车（或船、飞机等）〕"},
22669:{"w":"deserve","e":"These poor people deserve our help.","t":"这些可怜的人**值得**我们帮助。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+serv（服务）+e→花钱享受应得的服务→应得"},
22670:{"w":"eject","e":"The quantity of dust ejected by Mount St. Helens amounted to a quarter of a cubic mile.","t":"圣海伦斯火山**喷出**的粉尘多达四分之一立方英里。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+ject（扔）→扔出来→驱逐，逐出","c":"eject from 从…逐出","d":"ejection（n. 喷出；喷出物）","y":"expel（vt. 驱逐；开除）；remove（vt. 开除；移交）；evict（vt. 驱逐，逐出）"},
22671:{"w":"verification","e":"The customs will make a verification of whether there is record filing before the goods are released.","t":"在货物放行之前，海关会先**确认**一下该批货物是否有备案。"},
22672:{"w":"autoimmune","e":"Once this immune tolerance breaks down, the immune system would attack its own tissue, and cause autoimmune diseases.","t":"一旦这种免疫耐受受到损害，免疫系统就会攻击自身的组织，引发**自身免疫**疾病。","r":"联想记忆：auto（自身）+immune（免疫的）→自身免疫的"},
22673:{"w":"inheritance","e":"To get rid of being called \"NEET Group\", he is too stubborn to accept the inheritance from his father.","t":"为了摆脱“啃老族”的称号，他固执地拒绝接受父亲的**遗产**。","c":"historic inheritance 历史遗产"},
22674:{"w":"relentless","e":"Relentless in his pursuit of quality, his technical ability was remarkable.","t":"由于对质量的**坚持不懈**的追求，他的技术能力非同凡响。","r":"联想记忆：relent（变温和）+less（无…的）→缺少温和→无情的，残酷的"},
22675:{"w":"requisite","e":"The keyboard is a requisite hardware device of a computer, also a dialogue tool between a man and a computer.","t":"键盘是计算机**必要**的硬件设备，也是人与计算机对话的工具。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+quis（寻求）+ite（表物）→一再寻求的事物→要素"},
22676:{"w":"dizziness","e":"With a sudden dizziness, he fell down on the floor, which frightened his family.","t":"突然一阵**眩晕**，他跌倒在地上，把他的家人吓坏了。"},
22677:{"w":"periphery","e":"Ideas on this matter are also expressed by some scholars on the periphery of education area.","t":"教育领域**外围**的一些学者也对此发表了看法。","r":"词根记忆：peri（周围）+pher（带来）+y（表名词）→带到周围→外围"},
22678:{"w":"credential","e":"Refused by the enterprise again, she was so upset that she tore up these credential documents by hand.","t":"再次被企业拒之门外，她极其沮丧，随手将这些**资格证书**撕了个粉碎。","r":"词根记忆：cred（相信）+ential→让人相信的东西→证明书"},
22679:{"w":"facsimile","e":"The painting is a facsimile edition that is not so valuable.","t":"这幅画是**复制品**，不是很值钱。","r":"词根记忆：fac（做）+simil（一样）+e→做出一样的东西→复制品；副本"},
22680:{"w":"reel","e":"There are another three new reels of film for use.","t":"还有三**卷**新胶卷可以使用。","r":"联想记忆：喝醉酒步履蹒跚（reel），感觉（feel）眩晕","y":"shamble（vi. 蹒跚）；stagger（v. 踉跄，蹒跚）；spool（vt. 把…缠绕在线轴上）"},
22681:{"w":"churn","e":"The butter churn has two paddles to whip the cream.","t":"黄油**搅乳器**有两根搅棍用来搅打奶油。"},
22682:{"w":"nocturnal","e":"It is probable that the nocturnal traits go way back in the ancestry of all mammals.","t":"**夜间**进行活动可能是所有哺乳动物自祖先时起就有的行为。","r":"词根记忆：noct（夜晚）+urnal（…的）→夜晚的","c":"nocturnal vision 夜视能力；nocturnal animal 夜行性动物"},
22683:{"w":"obstruct","e":"Fish and dolphins that live in extremely muddy water cannot see because, although there is light, it is obstructed and scattered by the dirt in the water.","t":"生活在极其浑浊的水域里的鱼和海豚是看不见东西的，因为尽管有光，但水里的污垢**阻塞**和分散了光线。","r":"词根记忆：ob（逆）+struct（建造）→反着建造→妨碍","c":"obstruct the investigation 阻碍调查；obstruct the highway 阻塞高速公路"},
22684:{"w":"prohibitive","e":"This doesn't require a prohibitive amount of energy.","t":"这并不要求具有**过高**的能量。","r":"词根记忆：pro（在前）+hibit（拿）+ive（…的）→提前拿住→抑制的"},
22685:{"w":"navigation","e":"All the world now knows that bats, or rather natural selection working on bats, had perfected the system tens of millions of years earlier, and their radar achieves feats of detection and navigation that would strike an engineer dumb with admiration.","t":"现在人们意识到，确切地说因为自然选择的作用，蝙蝠早在几千万年前就已经完善了它们的雷达系统，其在探测与**导航**方面的成功让工程师们赞叹不已。","r":"词根记忆：nav（船）+ig（开，驱动）+ation（表状态）→开动船只→航行","d":"navigator（n. 导航者，领航员；早期的航海探险者）"},
22686:{"w":"entwine","e":"The history of human civilization is entwined with the history of the ways we have learned to manipulate water resources.","t":"人类文明的历史与人类学习利用水资源的历程是**相互交织**在一起的。","r":"词根记忆：en（使…）+twin（编织）+e→使编织到一起→使缠住，使盘绕"},
22687:{"w":"monumental","e":"Unprecedented construction of tens of thousands of monumental engineering projects has been done to control floods in the country.","t":"该国史无前例地建造了成千上万的**重要**工程来控制水患。","r":"联想记忆：monument（纪念碑）+al（…的）→纪念碑的；不朽的"},
22688:{"w":"reiterate","e":"As the United Nations report on access to water reiterated in November 2001, more than one billion people lack access to clean drinking water.","t":"2001年11月联合国关于获取水资源的报告**重申**了一个事实，即10亿多人口无法获取纯净的饮用水。","r":"联想记忆：re（一再）+iterate（重复说）→反复地说"},
22689:{"w":"peripheral","e":"If we think of a book we studied months or years ago, we will find it easier to recall peripheral details.","t":"当我们回想几个月或几年前读过的一本书时，我们更容易记起一些**细枝末节**。","r":"词根记忆：peri（周围）+pher（带来）+al（…的）→带到周围的→外围的"},
22690:{"w":"jeopardise","e":"He has never done anything to jeopardise his family.","t":"他从来没有做过任何**伤害**其家庭的事情。"},
22691:{"w":"elusive","e":"Even if these peripheral details are a bit elusive, they come back readily in hypnosis or when we relive the event imaginatively, as in psychodrama.","t":"即使这些细枝末节有点**容易忘却**，但它们也会在我们处于催眠状态下或者重温往事时在脑海里生动地浮现出来，就像在心理剧里那样。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+lus（玩，戏剧）+ive→把人玩出局的→难懂的，难捉摸的"},
22692:{"w":"distinctive","e":"If you require any further information regarding the convention, you can talk to one of the many convention helpers wearing distinctive blue and gold jackets.","t":"如果你想获得更多关于本次会议的信息，可以询问大会工作人员，他们穿着**显眼**的金蓝相间的夹克。","r":"来自distinct（adj. 明显的；有区别的）","y":"characteristic（adj. 特别的，特殊的）"},
22693:{"w":"board","e":"All ceilings will require double-thickness plaster board to be used in the construction.","t":"在建造过程中，所有天花板都需要使用双层厚的灰泥**板**。","c":"board of education 教育委员会"},
22694:{"w":"decompression","e":"A manifestation of decompression sickness that is caused by the formation of nitrogen bubbles in the blood and tissues after a rapid reduction in the surrounding pressure is characterized by pain in the joints and abdomen.","t":"**减压**病是因周围压力急剧减少，在血液和组织中形成氮气泡而引发的一种疾病，其症状表现为关节和腹部疼痛。","r":"联想记忆：de（减）+compress（压缩）+ion→减压"},
22695:{"w":"prevalent","e":"It's no surprise that high-profile athletes can influence children's eating behaviours, but the scientists are able to quantify how prevalent these endorsements are in the children's environment.","t":"高知名度的运动员可以影响儿童的饮食行为，这并不奇怪，但科学家能够量化这些代言在儿童环境中的**流行**程度。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+val（强壮的）+ent（具有…性质的）→有走在前面的强壮的→流行的","y":"widespread（adj. 分布广的，普遍的）；universal（adj. 普遍的，全体的）","f":"rare（adj. 稀有的，罕见的）；uncommon（adj. 不凡的，罕有的）"},
22696:{"w":"twist","e":"Research shows that spasms can cause twisting of the spine.","t":"研究显示，痉挛会导致脊椎**扭曲**。","r":"联想记忆：tw（看作two，两个）+ist（表人）→两个人扭打在一起→缠绕"},
22697:{"w":"rent","e":"This house rents for RMB 5,000 a month.","t":"这房子月**租**5,000人民币。","d":"rental（adj. 租用的 n. 租金）"},
22698:{"w":"eminent","e":"He was then the most eminent architect in England.","t":"他是当时英格兰最**著名**的建筑师。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+min（突出）+ent（具有…性质的）→杰出的"},
22699:{"w":"crescent","e":"The crescent of a new moon hung over the mulberry in the yard.","t":"一**弯**新月高悬于院子里的桑树之上。","r":"联想记忆：cre+scent（香味）→新月长到满月，月饼飘香→新月"},
22700:{"w":"calm","e":"The pilot managed to bring the aircraft and its 50 passengers down safely in the calm waters of the bay.","t":"飞行员成功地将飞机降落在**风平浪静**的海湾中，确保了50名乘客的安全。","r":"联想记忆：她手掌（palm）心出汗，内心很不平静（calm）"},
22701:{"w":"scope","e":"The scope of the environmental problem facing the world's cities is immense.","t":"世界上的许多城市面临着大**范围**的环境问题。","r":"联想记忆：s+cope（对付，处理）→人处理的事情多了，眼界自然就会开阔→眼界"},
22702:{"w":"cooperate","e":"It is meaningful for world nations to cooperate with each other.","t":"对世界各国来说，相互**合作**的意义重大。","r":"词根记忆：co（共同）+oper（工作）+ate（表动词）→一起工作→合作","c":"cooperate with（sb.） in（sth.） 和（某人）合作（某事）","d":"cooperation（n. 合作，协作）；cooperative（adj. 合作的）"},
22703:{"w":"applaud","e":"They applaud their favorite comedienne as she comes on the stage.","t":"当他们最喜欢的女喜剧演员登台时，他们**鼓掌**欢迎。","r":"词根记忆：ap（表加强）+plaud（鼓掌）→鼓掌"},
22704:{"w":"appraisal","e":"Susan's appraisal of the writer's work was favorable.","t":"苏珊对这位作家的作品给予了肯定的**评价**。","r":"词根记忆：ap（表加强）+prais（价格）+al（表行为）→给定价→评价"},
22705:{"w":"allowance","e":"I have a good retirement allowance that will make it easy for me to buy a nice house.","t":"我有一笔丰厚的退休**金**，买一栋好房子没什么经济上的困难。","r":"联想记忆：allow（允许）+ance→允许，容忍","c":"make allowance(s) for 体谅，原谅，为…留余地；at no allowance 无限制，尽情地；financial allowance 财政津贴；daily allowance 日常补贴"},
22706:{"w":"heir","e":"The man murdered the legal heir and disguised himself as his victim.","t":"该男子谋杀了合法**继承人**并冒名顶替。","c":"heir apparent 法定继承人"},
22707:{"w":"exploit","e":"Our company was quick to exploit a money-making opportunity provided by the government.","t":"我们公司很快就**抓住**了政府提供的赚钱机会。","r":"词根记忆：ex（表加强）+ploit（用）→利用","d":"exploitation（n. 利用；开发）"},
22708:{"w":"domestic","e":"The evidence we have suggests that domestic trade was greater than external trade at all periods.","t":"我们掌握的证据表明，无论在哪个时期，**国内**贸易都要比对外贸易发达。","r":"词根记忆：dom（驯服）+estic（…的）→驯养的","c":"domestic appliances 家用器具；gross domestic product（GDP） 国内生产总值；domestic market 国内市场；domestic violence 家庭暴力；domestic animal 家畜","d":"domesticate（vt. 驯养，教化）"},
22709:{"w":"unexpected","e":"Some unexpected difficulties have arisen in his life.","t":"他的生活中出现了一些**意想不到**的困难。"},
22710:{"w":"counsel","e":"Today's Health Counsel is presented by Paula Clayburg.","t":"今天的健康**忠告**由波拉·克莱伯格讲解。"},
22711:{"w":"sticky","e":"My fingers are sticky from that candy bar.","t":"糖块把我的手指弄得**黏糊糊**的。","r":"联想记忆：stick（黏贴）+y→黏性的"},
22712:{"w":"competition","e":"The workers opened small businesses in direct competition with their former employer.","t":"工人们开办了小型公司，直接和他们以前的雇主**竞争**。"},
22713:{"w":"responsible","e":"Smoking, as it is believed, is responsible for 30 percent of all deaths from cancer.","t":"在因癌症导致的死亡中，有30%被认为是由吸烟**引起**的。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+spons（承诺）+ible（能…的）→能一再遵守承诺的→有责任感的","c":"be responsible for 承担…的责任，有责任…","d":"responsibility（n. 责任，职责）"},
22714:{"w":"critic","e":"The coal industry has been targeted by critics as a significant contributor to the greenhouse effect.","t":"煤炭业被**评论家**指责为造成温室效应的主要原因。","r":"词根记忆：crit（判断）+ic（表人）→判断是非的人→批评家","c":"music critic 乐评人"},
22715:{"w":"extensive","e":"Extensive underground water resources are available over more than half of Australia's land area.","t":"在澳大利亚，超过一半的地域中**广泛**分布着可利用的地下水资源。","c":"make extensive use of 广泛应用；extensive knowledge 广博的知识；extensive reading 泛读；extensive efforts 巨大的努力"},
22716:{"w":"corridor","e":"You will notice that at the end of each corridor there is another door, but these are fire doors.","t":"你会注意到在每一条**走廊**的尽头都有另一扇门，但这些是防火门。","c":"in the corridor 在走廊里"},
22717:{"w":"imagine","e":"The children have no need to imagine anything when they read such books.","t":"孩子们阅读这种书时根本不用发挥**想象**力。","d":"imagination（n. 想象，空想）；imaginable（adj. 可想象的，想象得到的）；imaginative（adj. 想象的，虚构的）"},
22718:{"w":"interact","e":"Group work can give employees a chance to interact and to share ideas.","t":"分组工作可以给员工一个**相互协作**和交流的机会。","r":"词根记忆：inter（在…之间）+act（行动）→相互之间有行动→相互作用","c":"interact with 和…相互作用","d":"interaction（n. 相互作用）"},
22719:{"w":"starchy","e":"You eat too much starchy food.","t":"你吃太多**含淀粉**的食物了。","r":"联想记忆：starch（淀粉）+y→含淀粉的"},
22720:{"w":"trivial","e":"They think that tourism is a trivial subject.","t":"他们认为旅行是一个**无关紧要**的主题。","y":"trifling（adj. 不重要的）；petty（adj. 小的，不重要的）","f":"important（adj. 重要的，重大的）；main（adj. 主要的，重要的）"},
22721:{"w":"exorbitant","e":"Glass as instant curtains is available now, but the cost is exorbitant.","t":"现在玻璃可作为即时窗帘用，但成本**过于昂贵**。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+orbit（轨道，常规）+ant→走出常规→过分的，不合理的"},
22722:{"w":"large-scale","e":"They invested much money into large-scale industrial development.","t":"他们投入大量金钱发展**大规模**的工业。"},
22723:{"w":"region","e":"Although the UK is a fairly small country, the geology and climate vary a good deal from region to region.","t":"尽管英国的国土面积很小，但是不同**地区**间的地况和气候却大相径庭。","r":"词根记忆：reg（国王）+ion（表名词）→国王统治的区域→地区","d":"regional（adj. 地区的）"},
22724:{"w":"alternate","e":"Snow and rain alternated, and it was very cold outside.","t":"外面雨雪**交加**，非常寒冷。","r":"词根记忆：altern（改变状态）+ate（表动词）→换着做事→轮流的；交替的"},
22725:{"w":"steer","e":"He steered his car very carefully along the narrow mountain roads.","t":"他非常小心地**驾**车行驶在狭窄的山路上。","r":"联想记忆：当你驾驶（steer）车辆的时候，眼睛一定要盯住（stare）前方"},
22726:{"w":"bargain","e":"The employees and the employer reached a bargain.","t":"雇员和老板达成了一项**协议**。"},
22727:{"w":"infection","e":"Are you taking oral medicines for fungal infections?","t":"你在吃口服药预防真菌**感染**吗？","c":"a severe infection 一种严重的传染病；respiratory infection 呼吸道感染"},
22728:{"w":"conservative","e":"The obstacle to our development has been conservative local authorities.","t":"**保守**的地方当局一直是我们发展的障碍。","c":"Conservative Party（英国的）保守党"},
22729:{"w":"spin","e":"This action spins a series of gears.","t":"这个操作使一连串的齿轮**旋转**起来。"},
22730:{"w":"personnel","e":"All personnel were asked to participate in the meeting.","t":"此次会议要求全体**员工**参加。","r":"联想记忆：员工（personnel）需要有个人（personal）时间"},
22731:{"w":"liver","e":"Some scientists think that the condition of your liver determines how the perfume will smell on you.","t":"一些科学家认为，人体**肝脏**的健康状况决定了香水在人身上的味道。","r":"联想记忆：没有肝脏（liver），人类便无法生存（live）","c":"liver cell 肝细胞"},
22732:{"w":"swear","e":"Before giving evidence, you must swear what you're going to say is true.","t":"作证前，你必须**宣誓**保证所说一切皆属实。"},
22733:{"w":"inflammable","e":"Impressed by the element's combustibility, several 17th century chemists used it to manufacture fire-lighting devices, but the results were dangerously inflammable.","t":"受这种元素可燃性的启发，17世纪的一些化学家用它来制造点火装置，但这些装置却**易燃**，十分危险。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+flamm（燃烧）+able（能…的）→容易着火的→易燃的","c":"inflammable temper 易怒的脾气"},
22734:{"w":"disfigure","e":"Buildings here disfigured such a beautiful landscape.","t":"这里的建筑**破坏**了如此美丽的风景。","r":"联想记忆：dis（离开，分离）+figure（形体）→正常的形体消失了→使毁容"},
22735:{"w":"surf","e":"The rugged west coast beaches were famous for surfing.","t":"蜿蜒曲折的西海岸海滩因适合**冲浪**而闻名。","r":"发音记忆：“舒服”→冲浪很舒服→冲浪"},
22736:{"w":"create","e":"The economic recovery created more jobs.","t":"经济复苏**带来**了更多的工作机会。"},
22737:{"w":"mime","e":"The naughty boy mimed his old grandfather.","t":"这个淘气的孩子**模仿**他年迈的祖父。","r":"联想记忆：模仿（mimic）哑剧演员（mime）"},
22738:{"w":"impose","e":"I imposed certain constraints on them to make things simple.","t":"为了让事情变得简单，我给它们**加**了一些限制。","r":"词根记忆：im（使…）+pos（放置）+e→强行放置→把…强加于"},
22739:{"w":"likelihood","e":"The likelihood that animals living in forests will become extinct is increased when the forests are cut down.","t":"砍伐森林会增加生活在森林中的动物灭绝的**可能性**。","r":"联想记忆：likeli（看作likely，很可能）+hood（名词后缀，表性质）→可能性"},
22740:{"w":"explode","e":"The experts have thought of a way to explode the dynamite below this building.","t":"专家们已经想出了一种方法来**引爆**这幢楼下的炸药。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+plod（爆裂）+e→爆炸","d":"explosion（n. 爆炸）"},
22741:{"w":"spectacular","e":"Tyler and Vanessa are seated near floor-to-ceiling windows affording a spectacular view of the city.","t":"泰勒和瓦尼莎坐在落地窗边，**壮观**市景尽收眼底。","c":"spectacular success 巨大的成功；make a spectacular of oneself（因行为、穿着）出丑，出洋相"},
22742:{"w":"enormous","e":"We grow an enormous number of bananas each year.","t":"我们每年都**大量**种植香蕉。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+norm（规范）+ous（…的）→超出规范的→巨大的","c":"enormous expenditure 巨额开支；an enormous amount of 大量的","d":"enormously（adv. 非常，极其）"},
22743:{"w":"counterproductive","e":"This phenomenon can be partly attributed to the common counterproductive approach to study, but it also simply reflects the way the brain functions.","t":"这种现象可以部分归因于普通**反作用**的研究方法，但它也简单地反映了大脑的活动方式。","r":"联想记忆：counter（相反）+productive（有成效的）→产生相反效果的"},
22744:{"w":"variant","e":"In its most recent variant, the book consists of the reading of vocabulary and text while the class is listening to music.","t":"在这本书的最新**版**中，学生可以边听音乐边阅读词汇与篇章。"},
22745:{"w":"healing","e":"Hypnosis, yoga, religious ceremonies and faith healing are all associated with successful suggestion.","t":"催眠、瑜伽、宗教仪式和信仰**疗法**都与成功的暗示相关。","r":"来自heal（v. 治疗，治愈）"},
22746:{"w":"autocratic","e":"A doctor calls on the full power of autocratic suggestion by insisting that the patient take this white capsule precisely three times a day before meals.","t":"医生坚持要求病人一日三餐前按时服用这种白色胶囊，以此呼吁要遵从医嘱的**绝对**权威。","r":"词根记忆：auto（自己）+crat（统治者）+ic（…的）→独自统治的→独裁的"},
22747:{"w":"emulate","e":"While suggestopedia has gained some reputation through success in the teaching of modern languages, few teachers are able to emulate the spectacular results of Lozanov and his associates.","t":"在现代语言教学所取得的成功中，暗示教学法已经享有一定的声誉，几乎没有教师可以**赶上**洛扎诺夫及其同僚们那样引人注目的成果。","r":"词根记忆：emul（平等）+ate（表动词）→通过模仿达到平等→模仿","d":"emulation（n. 竞争；仿效）"},
22748:{"w":"disastrous","e":"The disastrous Hanshin earthquake in 1995 killed 6,400 people, toppled elevated highways, flattened office blocks and devastated the port area of Kobe.","t":"1995年的阪神大地震极具**灾难性**，致使6,400人丧生，高架公路倒塌，办公大楼夷为平地，神户港口地区变成废墟。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分离）+astr（星星）+ous（…的）→古人认为星位发生偏离就预示有灾难发生→灾难性的"},
22749:{"w":"topple","e":"The old man toppled backwards into the river, but no one came up to give a helping hand.","t":"老人后仰**翻**入河里，但没有人上前伸出援助之手。","r":"联想记忆：top（顶）+ple→使顶向下→打倒，推翻"},
22750:{"w":"resilience","e":"Scientists couldn't explain the great resilience of Japanese pagodas in the earthquake.","t":"科学家无法解释为什么日本宝塔在地震中有强大的**抗震力**。","r":"来自resilient（adj. 有弹性的；适应力强的）"},
22751:{"w":"collateral","e":"The cost is in the collateral damage of the very methods of food production that has made the food cheaper.","t":"某些食品生产方法降低了食物的价格，但代价是带来**附带**性的危害。","r":"词根记忆：col（共同）+later（边）+al（…的）→边挨着边的→并行的"},
22752:{"w":"colossal","e":"The damage that the earthquake has caused has been colossal.","t":"地震带来**极大**的破坏。"},
22753:{"w":"tackle","e":"The disappointing results of many conventional road transport projects in Africa led some experts to rethink the strategy by which rural transport problems were to be tackled at the beginning of the 1990s.","t":"因为非洲许多传统公路运输项目的结果令人失望，一些专家重新思考战略，希望农村交通问题能在20世纪90年代初得到**解决**。","r":"联想记忆：tack（钉）+le→除去眼中钉→对付，处理","c":"block and tackle 滑轮，滑车设备；fishing tackle 钓具；tackle sb. about sth. 与某人就其事进行交涉","d":"tackler〔n.（足球等的）拦截队员〕"},
22754:{"w":"coordinate","e":"The Makete Integrated Rural Transport Project started in 1985 with financial support from the Swiss Development Corporation and was coordinated with the help of the Tanzanian government.","t":"玛科特农村综合交通项目自1985年启动，由瑞士发展公司提供资金支持，在坦桑尼亚政府的**协调**下进行。","r":"词根记忆：co（共同）+ordin（顺序）+ate（使…）→使…顺序一致→协调"},
22755:{"w":"cognition","e":"Child studies center on theories of cognition of two-year-old children.","t":"儿童研究集中研究两岁孩子的**认知**理论。","r":"词根记忆：cogn（知道）+ition（表名词）→认知"},
22756:{"w":"supplementary","e":"The man can clearly tell you the need for supplementary measures if one wants to assist the rural poor.","t":"那个人可以清楚地告诉你扶助农村贫民过程中**配套**措施的必要性。","r":"词根记忆：sup（下）+ple（填满）+ment（表名词）+ary（…的）→在下面填满的→补充的","d":"supplementation（n. 增补，补充）","y":"additional（adj. 另外的，附加的）；extra（adj. 额外的）"},
22757:{"w":"scrutiny","e":"The world of the ant has come in for considerable scrutiny lately, and the idea that ants demonstrate sparks of cognition has not been rejected by those involved in these investigations.","t":"近期有大量针对蚂蚁王国的**详细研究**，参与研究的人员并未否定那种认为蚂蚁能表现出认知迹象的想法。","r":"联想记忆：scru（音似：四顾）+tiny（微小的）→连微小的都要顾到→详细检查，细看","y":"inquiry（n. 调查，审查）；inspection（n. 检查，审查）","f":"neglect（n. 疏忽，忽视）"},
22758:{"w":"repel","e":"Ants store food, repel attackers and use chemical signals to contact one another in case of attack.","t":"蚂蚁储存食物，**击退**进攻者，通过化学信号联系同伴以防御攻击。","r":"词根记忆：re（向后）+pel（推）→向后推→击退","d":"repellent（adj. 令人反感的）","y":"disgust（vt. 使作呕）；repulse（vt. 击退，驱逐）","f":"attract（v. 吸引）；allure（v. 吸引，诱惑）"},
22759:{"w":"domesticate","e":"It seems that ants are continually domesticating new species.","t":"蚂蚁似乎在不断地**驯化**新品种。","r":"联想记忆：domestic（家里的）+ate（使…）→使成为家养的→驯养"},
22760:{"w":"exhaustive","e":"During the course of this exhaustive study, Reznikova has grown so attached to her laboratory ants that she feels she knows them as individuals even without the paint spots used to mark them.","t":"经过**详尽**的学习，热兹尼科娃深深爱上了她实验室里的蚂蚁，她觉得自己甚至不用通过油漆点标记也可以辨认出每一只蚂蚁。"},
22761:{"w":"calibrate","e":"People can establish their genetic \"distance\", which itself can be calibrated to give an indication of the length of time since these populations last interbred.","t":"人们能够确定遗传距离，这一距离的**划定**将表明族群自上一次杂交迄今的时间长度。"},
22762:{"w":"descend","e":"As would have been predicted by Robert Williams's work, all three groups appear to be descended from the same ancestral population.","t":"正如罗伯特·威廉斯的文章所预测的，三组人都是同一祖先的**后裔**。","r":"词根记忆：de（向下）+scend（爬）→往下爬→下降","c":"descend on/upon（结伙）袭击；突然来访"},
22763:{"w":"frontier","e":"The police are closely spread over the frontier between the land of China and that of Nepal.","t":"警力密布于中国与尼泊尔的**边境**上。","r":"联想记忆：front（前方）+ier→一国最前方的地域→边境，边界"},
22764:{"w":"fascinating","e":"The museum has a fascinating collection of Celtic artifacts.","t":"该博物馆藏有**吸引人**的凯尔特手工艺品。","c":"find sth. fascinating 发现…吸引人"},
22765:{"w":"stroke","e":"People who suffer strokes on the left side of the brain usually lose their power of speech.","t":"左脑**中风**的人常常会丧失语言能力。","r":"联想记忆：与strike（v. 打击）一起记"},
22766:{"w":"solar","e":"Of all the planets in our own solar system, the Earth is the only one on which life can survive.","t":"在**太阳**系所有行星中，地球是唯一一颗生命可以存活的行星。","r":"词根记忆：sol（太阳）+ar（…的）→太阳的"},
22767:{"w":"sympathise","e":"Although he pretended to sympathise, I knew he was laughing up his sleeve.","t":"虽然他装作**同情**，但我知道他正暗自偷笑。"},
22768:{"w":"fusion","e":"Singapore culture is a successful fusion of Eastern and Western features.","t":"新加坡文化成功**融合**了东西方文化的特点。","r":"词根记忆：fus（流）+ion（表名词）→流到一起→熔合"},
22769:{"w":"slash","e":"Their habits of hunting, fishing, and slash-and-burn cultivation have been often harmful to the habitat.","t":"他们渔猎和**刀耕**火种的习性通常会破坏其生存环境。","r":"联想记忆：一条斜线（slash）在他脑海里闪闪发光（flash）"},
22770:{"w":"diversity","e":"The study of primitive peoples has discovered a great diversity of customs, values, feelings, and thoughts.","t":"对原始人类的研究发现其在风俗习惯、价值观、 情感以及思想上具有丰富的**多样性**。","r":"词根记忆：di（分开）+vers（转）+ity（表名词）→分开转→多样性","c":"cultural diversity 文化的多样性；diversity of 各种各样的"},
22771:{"w":"decline","e":"Technological advances helped bring about the decline of rural industries and an increase in urban populations.","t":"技术进步加速了乡镇企业的**衰落**和城市人口的增长。","r":"词根记忆：de（向下）+clin（倾斜）+e→向下倾斜→下降","c":"on the decline 在衰退中；in decline 正在下降；rapid decline飞速减少；phase of decline 衰退期"},
22772:{"w":"crisis","e":"In the U.S., energy-efficient homes became popular after the oil crisis.","t":"美国在经历了石油**危机**之后，节能型房屋就开始变得深受欢迎。","r":"联想记忆：cri（看作cry，哭）+sis（看作sos，求救信号）→哭喊着求救→危机"},
22773:{"w":"edible","e":"The seeds of these plants are edible.","t":"这些植物的种子是**可食用**的。","r":"词根记忆：ed（吃）+ible（可…的）→可食用的","d":"inedible（adj. 不可食用的）","y":"eatable（adj. 可以吃的）"},
22774:{"w":"collaboration","e":"Museum staff carried out the anthropological projects in collaboration with a wide variety of national governments.","t":"博物馆工作人员与多国政府**合作**完成了这些人类学工程。","r":"词根记忆：col（共同）+labor（工作）+ation（表状态）→合作","c":"in collaboration with 与…合作；与…勾结"},
22775:{"w":"decouple","e":"Increased production has been almost entirely decoupled from employment.","t":"增加的产量几乎完全与就业**脱钩**了。"},
22776:{"w":"participant","e":"Group tours encourage participants to look at new objects and places.","t":"团体旅游鼓励**参加者**多去看新景点。","r":"联想记忆：parti（看作party，聚会）+cip+ant→参加聚会的人→参与者"},
22777:{"w":"weaken","e":"He weakened as the illness grew worse.","t":"他病情加重，身体日益**衰弱**。"},
22778:{"w":"distract","e":"Researchers claim that when children come to a word they already know, the pictures are unnecessary and distracting.","t":"研究人员称，当孩子们碰到认识的单词时，配图是多余的，会使他们**分心**。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+tract（拉）→（注意力）被拉开→使分心","c":"distract attention from 转移注意力","d":"distraction（n. 使人分心的事物）","y":"divert（v. 转移）","f":"attract（v. 吸引，引起注意）"},
22779:{"w":"frown","e":"Colleges always frown on late nights out.","t":"大学向来**不赞成**深夜外出。","r":"联想记忆：f（音似：翻）+row（看作brow，眉毛）+n→翻眉毛→皱眉","c":"frown on/upon 反对，不赞成"},
22780:{"w":"skew","e":"She says the U.S. market for goods has been skewed by the assumption.","t":"她说美国商品市场已被这种假设**扭曲**了。"},
22781:{"w":"beehive","e":"A beehive is where bees live.","t":"**蜂窝**是蜜蜂居住的地方。","r":"组合词：bee（蜜蜂）+hive（蜂房，蜂箱）→蜂窝；蜂箱"},
22782:{"w":"astray","e":"Follow the guide or you'll go astray in the jungle.","t":"跟着导游，否则你们会在丛林里**迷路**。","r":"联想记忆：as（像）+tray（盘子）→像在盘子里转圈圈→迷路地；误入歧途地"},
22783:{"w":"theory","e":"Tom once put forward an attractive though unlikely theory.","t":"汤姆曾经提出一个具有吸引力但不太可能的**理论**。","d":"theoretical（adj. 理论的）"},
22784:{"w":"weakness","e":"Iridology can help doctors discover any constitutional weakness long before its clinical outbreak.","t":"虹膜学能够帮助医生早在体质**虚弱**症出现临床症状前就发现它。"},
22785:{"w":"portion","e":"The energy system uses the visible portion of the solar spectrum to light buildings.","t":"该能源系统利用太阳光谱中的可见光**部分**来为建筑照明。","r":"联想记忆：port（看作part，部分）+ion→部分"},
22786:{"w":"compound","e":"The problems were compounded by severe food shortages.","t":"严重的食物短缺使问题进一步**恶化**了。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+pound（放置）→放到一起使合成→化合物"},
22787:{"w":"span","e":"The workers completed the building within the span of three months.","t":"工人们在三个月的**时间**内建成了这栋大楼。"},
22788:{"w":"vacancy","e":"We have vacancies for salesmen.","t":"我们销售人员的职位有**空缺**。","r":"来自vacant（adj. 空的，未被占用的）"},
22789:{"w":"locality","e":"A species may have more chances to survive if the individuals do not gather in a single locality.","t":"如果某一物种的个体不集中在某单独**地区**，那么该物种就有了更多的生存机会。","r":"来自local（adj. 地方的）"},
22790:{"w":"circle","e":"What you are doing will start up a vicious circle.","t":"你的所作所为会引起恶性**循环**。","d":"circular（adj. 圆形的；循环的）"},
22791:{"w":"accuracy","e":"The technician placed the machine in the correct spot with complete accuracy.","t":"技术员**分毫不差**地将机器安放在正确的位置。","r":"词根记忆：ac（表加强）+cur（关心）+acy（表名词）→一再关心，使其精确→准确（性）"},
22792:{"w":"tolerate","e":"Younger people tend to tolerate noise better than their elders.","t":"年轻人比年长者更能**承受**噪音。"},
22793:{"w":"afford","e":"They would not be able to afford cars or homes.","t":"他们**负担**不起汽车和房子。","c":"afford to do sth. 负担得起做…；afford to 买得起","d":"affordable（adj. 能负担的，承担得起的）"},
22794:{"w":"excellent","e":"Under several metres of earth, noise is minimal and insulation is excellent.","t":"在地下几米的地方，噪音很小，隔热效果也**很好**。","r":"联想记忆：excel（优于，超过）+lent→杰出的"},
22795:{"w":"connect","e":"What special food and activities are connected with this festival?","t":"有什么特别的食物和活动与这个节日**相关**？","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+nect（连结）→连接","c":"connect with/to 与…连接"},
22796:{"w":"cylinder","e":"The earliest British rocket was encased in a stout, iron cylinder, terminating in a conical head.","t":"英国最老式的火箭装在一个坚固的铁**筒**内，顶部成圆锥形。","c":"gas cylinder 煤气罐"},
22797:{"w":"disadvantage","e":"What are the advantages and disadvantages of making films of real-life events?","t":"根据真实事件拍摄的电影，其优势和**劣势**分别是什么呢？","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+advantage（优点）→不是优点→缺点"},
22798:{"w":"participate","e":"More and more women are participating in politics.","t":"越来越多的女性**投身**政治。","r":"词根记忆：parti（部分）+cip（拿）+ate（表动词）→拿住部分→参加","c":"participate in 参加"},
22799:{"w":"principle","e":"How does the reaction principle work?","t":"反作用**原理**是如何起作用的呢？","r":"词根记忆：prin（第一）+cip（拿）+le（表名词）→须第一位选取的东西→原则"},
22800:{"w":"refreshment","e":"You can use the members' lounge for refreshment when you feel tired.","t":"你感到疲倦时可以在会员休息室**休息**一下。","r":"联想记忆：refresh（使精神振作）+ment→（精力的）恢复","y":"beverage（n. 饮料）"},
22801:{"w":"deteriorate","e":"Air quality in many of the world's major cities has deteriorated.","t":"世界上很多大城市的空气质量**越来越糟糕**。","r":"词根记忆：deterior（更坏）+ate（表动词）→变坏","f":"improve（v. 改善，改进）；ameliorate（v. 改善，改进）"},
22802:{"w":"scorching","e":"The scorching summer left people enervated and listless.","t":"**炎热**的夏天让人虚弱无力，情绪低落。","r":"联想记忆：scorch（烧焦）+ing→能烧焦的→酷热的"},
22803:{"w":"meantime","e":"The country was urgently calling for peace while in the meantime secretly doing nuclear tests.","t":"该国急切呼吁和平，**同时**却又秘密进行核试验。","c":"in the meantime 与此同时"},
22804:{"w":"upper","e":"Helen lived on the upper floor.","t":"海伦住在楼**上**。"},
22805:{"w":"innocent","e":"Seeing these innocent children, I can't help recalling my own childhood.","t":"看到这些**天真无邪**的孩子，我不禁想起了自己的童年。","r":"词根记忆：in（不）+noc（伤害）+ent（具有…性质的）→没受过伤害的→天真的","c":"an innocent child 一个天真无邪的孩子"},
22806:{"w":"emphasis","e":"The President's statement gave emphasis to the crisis.","t":"总统在声明中**强调**了这次危机。","c":"place emphasis on 把重点放在…上面，强调…"},
22807:{"w":"approach","e":"As autumn approaches, the beekeepers pack up their hives and go south.","t":"秋天**来临**，养蜂人收好蜂房前往南方。","c":"approach to 接近；近似","d":"approachable（adj. 易亲近的；友善的）"},
22808:{"w":"duration","e":"The school was used as a hospital for the duration of the war.","t":"整个战争**期间**这所学校都被用作医院。","r":"词根记忆：dur（持久）+ation（表状态）→持续的时间"},
22809:{"w":"primarily","e":"In refineries, caustic is primarily used to remove sulfur compounds.","t":"在精炼厂，腐蚀剂**主要**用于去除硫化物。"},
22810:{"w":"due","e":"The greenhouse effect is a natural phenomenon involving the increase in global surface temperature due to the presence of greenhouse gases.","t":"温室效应是一种自然现象，指**由于**温室气体的出现而导致地球表面温度升高。","r":"发音记忆：“丢”→应有的东西丢了→应有的，应得的","c":"due to 由于；in due course 及时地，在适当的时候"},
22811:{"w":"keen","e":"I'm not very keen on Westerners, although my father likes them.","t":"我不是很**喜欢**西部人，尽管父亲很喜欢他们。","r":"be keen on 渴望，对…喜爱，热衷于；a man of keen perception 一个知觉敏锐的人"},
22812:{"w":"worm","e":"There are two worm gears, one vertical and one horizontal.","t":"有两种**蜗**轮，一种是垂直的，另一种是水平的。"},
22813:{"w":"stiff","e":"We felt stiff after a long walk.","t":"走了很长一段路后，我们感觉腿脚**发僵**。","r":"联想记忆：可与still（adj. 静止的）一起记"},
22814:{"w":"timber","e":"Forests are cut down for timber.","t":"森林被砍伐成**木材**。","r":"timber industry 木材业"},
22815:{"w":"profound","e":"Globalization effects very profound changes in modern lifestyles.","t":"全球化使现代人的生活方式发生了**深刻**的变化。","r":"词根记忆：pro（前面）+found（基础）→有基础在前面→深远的；深奥的","c":"profound sleep 酣睡；profound idea 深刻的理念","y":"abstruse（adj. 深奥的）；recondite（adj. 深奥的，难以理解的）","f":"shallow（adj. 肤浅的，浅薄的）"},
22816:{"w":"unconcerned","e":"Only 22 percent say they are unconcerned about this issue.","t":"只有22％的人称他们**不关心**此事。"},
22817:{"w":"permission","e":"Students living in the dorm do not need permission to park their cars.","t":"住宿生（在宿舍停车场）停车无须得到**许可**。","r":"词根记忆：per（自始至终）+miss（送）+ion（表名词）→始终送出→允许","c":"without permission 未经许可；special permission 特许；planning permission 规划许可"},
22818:{"w":"labour","e":"As a result, 51% of all women aged 14 to 64 are now economically active in the labour market.","t":"结果表明，**劳务**市场上年龄在14到64岁之间的所有女性中，51%的人在经济方面很活跃。","r":"发音记忆：“累伯”→农民伯伯劳动很辛苦，很累→艰苦劳动","c":"labour costs 劳动力成本；labour economics 劳动经济学","d":"laboured（adj. 费力的）"},
22819:{"w":"quota","e":"Your sales are always below quota.","t":"你们的销售量总是低于**定额**。","r":"发音记忆：“阔的”→出手阔绰，没有限额→限额","c":"a quota system for …的配额制度","y":"allotment（n. 分配；份额）"},
22820:{"w":"suspect","e":"Scientists suspected it to be a comet.","t":"科学家**怀疑**它是一颗彗星。","r":"词根记忆：su(s)（在…下面）+spect（看）→在下面看一看→怀疑","c":"suspect of sth./doing sth. 怀疑…","d":"suspicious（adj. 疑心的；可疑的）"},
22821:{"w":"deterioration","e":"There is a serious deterioration in relations between the two countries.","t":"两国的关系严重**恶化**。"},
22822:{"w":"triple","e":"As a whole, European countries see forests as performing a triple function: biological, economic and recreational.","t":"整体来看，欧洲国家认为森林在以下**三方面**起到了作用：生物、经济以及休闲娱乐。","r":"词根记忆：tri（三）+ple→三部分的，三倍的"},
22823:{"w":"condemn","e":"Forests offer those condemned to spend five days a week in an urban environment an unrivalled area of freedom to unwind and take part in a range of leisure activities, such as hunting, riding and hiking.","t":"对那些每周五天**被迫**待在城市环境里的人来说，森林提供了一片无比自由的天地，让他们放松放松，参加诸如打猎、骑马、徒步旅行等一系列休闲活动。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+demn（惩罚）→共同惩罚→谴责","c":"condemn sb. to death 判某人死刑；be condemned to 被宣告…","d":"condemnation（n. 谴责；定罪）"},
22824:{"w":"transcend","e":"The forest policy must transcend national frontiers and generations of people, and it must allow for the inevitable changes that take place in the forests, in needs, and hence in policy.","t":"森林政策必须**超越**国界和世代的界限，必须考虑到森林、需求以及相关政策所发生的不可避免的变化。","r":"词根记忆：trans（越过）+(s)cend（爬）→超越"},
22825:{"w":"cumulative","e":"The condition appears to result from the cumulative effect of a number of factors, with atmospheric pollutants the principal culprits.","t":"这种情况看上去是由大量因素**日积月累**所导致的，其中大气污染物是罪魁祸首。","r":"词根记忆：cumul（堆积）+ative（…的）→累积的，渐增的","c":"cumulative process 积累过程"},
22826:{"w":"horizontal","e":"Gharib and Graff set themselves the task of raising a 4.5-metre stone column from horizontal to vertical, using no source of energy except the wind.","t":"加里卜和格拉夫为自己制定了这样一项任务，除了风以外，不借助其他任何能源，把4.5米高的石柱由**水平**抬高成垂直状态。","r":"来自horizon（n. 地平线）"},
22827:{"w":"certify","e":"The council, which was founded in 1996, certifies fisheries that meet high environmental standards, enabling them to use a label that recognizes their environmental responsibility.","t":"成立于1996年的委员会为达到高环境标准的渔场提供**证明**，准许他们使用一种认可他们所承担的环境责任的标签。","r":"词根记忆：cert（搞清）+ify（使…）→使清楚→证明"},
22828:{"w":"arousal","e":"The physiological arousal declined quickly to the same levels as those of the control subjects.","t":"生理**激发**水平迅速下降到了同受控对象一样的程度。"},
22829:{"w":"addiction","e":"For his severe illness he had to fight his addiction to alcohol.","t":"因为病情严重，他不得不戒酒**瘾**。","c":"television addiction 看电视上瘾"},
22830:{"w":"allege","e":"The police alleged that the man was murdered but they have not given proof yet.","t":"警方**宣称**这个人被谋杀了，但是他们还没有给出证据。","r":"词根记忆：al（表加强）+leg（读）+e→大声读→宣称"},
22831:{"w":"amphibious","e":"The newly built Noah's Ark is a kind of amphibious vehicle.","t":"新建的诺亚方舟是**水陆两用**的运载工具。"},
22832:{"w":"ascend","e":"The air became colder and more rarefied as we ascended.","t":"我们越往上**攀登**，空气就变得越冷越稀薄。","r":"词根记忆：a（表加强）+scend（爬）→不断向上爬→攀登","c":"ascend to 追溯到"},
22833:{"w":"assert","e":"The arrested offender continued to assert that she was innocent.","t":"被捕的罪犯仍然在**强调**她是清白的。","r":"词根记忆：as（表加强）+sert（插入）→强行插入观点→断言","c":"assert oneself 坚持自己的权利，表现自己的权威；assert one's rights 维护自己的权利；assert national independence 维护国家独立","d":"assertive（adj. 坚定自信的；果断的）；assertiveness（n.坚定而自信，果断）；assertion（n. 断言；主张）","y":"declare（v. 断言，宣称）；protest（v. 断言）；avow（v.承认，宣称）"},
22834:{"w":"assure","e":"The young boy assured us of his ability to solve the problem.","t":"那个小男孩向我们**保证**他有能力解决这问题。","r":"词根记忆：as（表加强）+sure（肯定，安全）→一再肯定→使确信，使确保"},
22835:{"w":"baffle","e":"All of us are baffled why she didn't give us the notice.","t":"我们都很**困惑**她为什么没有通知我们。","r":"联想记忆：战役（battle）开始，一向忠诚的tt反戈，令人费解（baffle）→使困惑","d":"bafflement（n. 迷惑不解）","y":"disconcert（vt. 使感到困惑）"},
22836:{"w":"bewilder","e":"His sudden change of mood completely bewildered me.","t":"他情绪突然转变使我完全**摸不着头脑**。","r":"联想记忆：be+wild（荒野的）+er→迷失荒野中→使迷惑","d":"bewilderment（n. 困惑，迷惑）；bewildering（adj. 令人困惑的）","y":"puzzle（vt. 使迷惑）；confuse（vt. 使糊涂）"},
22837:{"w":"biodiversity","e":"The oilfield engineering threatens one of the world's richest areas of biodiversity.","t":"油田工程对世界上一块拥有最丰富**物种多样性**的地域造成了威胁。","c":"loss of biodiversity 生物多样性的丧失"},
22838:{"w":"bud","e":"Jasminum mesnyi has the first buds in spring.","t":"野迎春在春天里长出第一批**花蕾**。","r":"联想记忆：泥土（mud）中发出的芽（bud）","c":"taste bud 味蕾"},
22839:{"w":"celestial","e":"The moon and the galaxy are all celestial bodies.","t":"月亮和银河都是**天体**。","r":"词根记忆：cel（天空）+est+ial（…的）→天体的"},
22840:{"w":"combination","e":"The old man's treatment was a combination of surgery, radiation and drugs.","t":"对那位老人的治疗**结合**了外科手术、放射治疗以及药物治疗。","r":"来自combine（v. 结合）"},
22841:{"w":"impact","e":"Cigarette smoke has the same impact on smokers as it does on non-smokers.","t":"香烟烟雾对吸烟者和不吸烟者的**影响**是一样的。"},
22842:{"w":"renew","e":"The swift increase of population renewed the demand for building houses quickly and cheaply.","t":"人口的迅速增长**再次**要求加快房屋的建造速度并且降低建筑成本。","r":"联想记忆：re（再，又）+new（新的）→重新开始"},
22843:{"w":"bow","e":"When you're introduced to a stranger, you may simply bow to each other.","t":"当你被介绍给一个陌生人的时候，你们可能只是彼此**点一下头**。","r":"联想记忆：彩虹（rainbow）没有了雨（rain）就变成了弓（bow）"},
22844:{"w":"defeat","e":"Now both coaches know semifinal defeat could cost them their jobs.","t":"现在双方的教练都很清楚，半决赛**失败**可能会让他们丢掉工作。","r":"联想记忆：击败（defeat）敌人，战绩（feat）累累"},
22845:{"w":"evoke","e":"This fragrance evokes the memory of a cool, summer evening.","t":"这种香味**唤起**了我对一个清凉夏夜的回忆。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+vok（叫喊）+e→喊出声来→唤起"},
22846:{"w":"flutter","e":"Her heart began to flutter with fear.","t":"她害怕得心**怦怦乱跳**。","r":"联想记忆：fl（看作fly）+utter（看作butter）→蝴蝶（butterfly）振翅而飞→振（翅）"},
22847:{"w":"front-line","e":"Decision-making has been forced down in many cases to front-line employees.","t":"很多时候，决策权被迫下放到**第一线**的雇员手中。"},
22848:{"w":"desperate","e":"Tom was desperate to find friends with common interests.","t":"汤姆**渴望**结交一些志趣相投的朋友。","r":"词根记忆：de（否定）+sper（希望）+ate（…的）→没有希望的→绝望的"},
22849:{"w":"gear","e":"Single-speed cycles are bikes with no gears.","t":"单速自行车就是没有变速**齿轮**的自行车。","c":"bottom gear 最低挡；gear to/towards 调整，使适合；gear the plan 调整计划"},
22850:{"w":"band","e":"The drum band will be appearing on stage in the next show.","t":"下一个节目将是鼓**乐队**表演。","r":"联想记忆：乐队（band）的成员需要用手（hand）来弹吉他和键盘"},
22851:{"w":"breed","e":"Rabbits breed very quickly.","t":"兔子**繁殖**得非常快。","c":"breed fish 养鱼"},
22852:{"w":"intelligible","e":"I have failed to make the sentence intelligible.","t":"我没能把这个句子弄**清楚**。","r":"词根记忆：intel（在…中间）+lig（选择）+ible（能…的）→能在众多选择中做出选择的→可理解的","c":"intelligible speech 清楚的讲话","y":"clear（adj. 清楚的，明白的）；distinct（adj. 清楚的，明显的）","f":"unintelligible（adj. 难解的，无法了解的）；incomprehensible（adj. 不能理解的，难于领悟的）"},
22853:{"w":"essence","e":"Psychologists claimed that the essence of reasoning lies in the putting together of two behaviour segments in some novel way to reach the goal.","t":"心理学家声称，推理的**本质**就在于将两个行为片断用某种全新的方式结合起来，以达到预期的目的。","r":"词根记忆：ess（存在）+ence（表名词）→存在即是本质→本质"},
22854:{"w":"predispose","e":"Exposure to too much noise may predispose you to a headache.","t":"听了太多的噪音会让你**容易**头疼。","r":"联想记忆：pre（预先）+dispose（处理）→预先处理，不然容易感染→易受感染","d":"predisposition（n. 倾向，癖好）"},
22855:{"w":"display","e":"The windows display postcards and greeting cards designed by women artists for New Year.","t":"橱窗**陈列**着女艺术家们为新年设计的明信片和贺卡。","r":"联想记忆：dis（分开）+play（播放，表演）→分开播放→陈列，展览","c":"on display 展示，陈列"},
22856:{"w":"retire","e":"In this hospital, children under 16 don't need to pay, and the same thing goes for people who have retired.","t":"在这家医院，16岁以下的儿童免费就诊，**退休**人员也可享受同等待遇。","r":"联想记忆：re（再，又）+tire（劳累）→不再劳累→退休"},
22857:{"w":"enlarge","e":"The new headmaster enlarged his office and installed expensive carpet.","t":"新校长**扩充**了他的办公室，并铺上了昂贵的地毯。","r":"联想记忆：en（使…）+large（大的）→使…变大→扩大，放大"},
22858:{"w":"occur","e":"Generally, molt occurs at the time of least stress on the birds.","t":"通常，换毛**发生**在小鸟压力最小的时候。","r":"词根记忆：oc（表加强）+cur（发生）→发生","c":"occur to 被想到；（主意）浮现于脑中","d":"occurrence（n. 事故；发生的事件）"},
22859:{"w":"relate","e":"That's the office that deals with all matters related to student welfare.","t":"那间就是负责处理所有**有关**学生福利待遇问题的办公室。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+lat（拿出）+e→再次拿出→有关联","d":"relative（adj. 有关系的；相对的 n. 亲属）；relation（n. 关系；叙述）"},
22860:{"w":"stark","e":"The language barrier presents itself in stark form to firms who wish to market their products in other countries.","t":"对于那些想把自己的产品销售到其他国家的企业来说，语言成了他们**明显**的障碍。","r":"联想记忆：star（星球）+k→许多星球没有大气，没有生命→荒凉的"},
22861:{"w":"inform","e":"Fancy Foods wishes to inform the public that pieces of metal have been found in some jars of Fancy Foods Chicken Curry (Spicy).","t":"美食公司希望**告知**大众，在他们生产的一些咖喱（辣）鸡块罐头中发现有金属碎片。","r":"联想记忆：in（使…）+form（形式）→使（知道）形式→通知"},
22862:{"w":"halt","e":"That country halted most oil exports.","t":"该国**暂停**了大部分的石油出口。","r":"联想记忆：h+alt（高）→高处不胜寒，该停下来了→停住"},
22863:{"w":"nerve","e":"The animal's optic nerves are highly regenerative.","t":"这种动物的视觉**神经**有非常强的再生能力。","r":"词根记忆：nerv（神经）+e→神经"},
22864:{"w":"deadline","e":"If you can't meet a deadline for an essay, you should go and see your lecturers.","t":"如果你不能在**截止日期**前交论文，就应该去找你的老师（说明情况）。","r":"组合词：dead（死）+line（线）→死期→最后期限"},
22865:{"w":"limb","e":"The body is pretty good at self-repair. A strain to a limb, though painful at the time, generally resolves itself.","t":"身体的自我修复功能很强。扭伤**手臂**当时虽然有些疼，但一般都能自我消退。","r":"联想记忆：多喝点维C饮料，手臂（limb）有力就能爬（climb）上高山了"},
22866:{"w":"sphere","e":"Mary's sphere of interests is very limited.","t":"玛丽兴趣**范围**不广。","r":"词根记忆：spher（球）+e→球（体）"},
22867:{"w":"evolution","e":"The scientist has suggested that evolution of speech went with right-handed preference.","t":"科学家认为，语言的**进化**伴随着使用右手的倾向而产生。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+volu（转）+tion（表名词）→人类的进化就是不停向前转变的过程→进化","c":"the evolution of man 人类的进化；Darwin's theory of evolution 达尔文的进化论","d":"evolutionary（adj. 进化的）"},
22868:{"w":"suitable","e":"This medicine is not suitable for children under age 5.","t":"这种药不**适合**五岁以下儿童服用。","r":"组合词：suit（合适）+able（能…的）→合适的→适当的","c":"suitable for 适合于…；suitable time to do sth. 做…的适当时间","d":"suitability（n. 合适；适宜性）"},
22869:{"w":"criminal","e":"The discontent may lead more youths into criminal behaviour.","t":"这种不满情绪可能会导致更多的年轻人走上**犯罪**之路。","c":"criminal acts 犯罪行为"},
22870:{"w":"undoubtedly","e":"The shift of food-production from Europe to regions without farm subsidies will undoubtedly mean more pressure to convert natural habitat into farmland.","t":"**毫无疑问**，粮食生产从欧洲转向没有农业补贴的地区意味着自然栖息地被转为农田的压力日益增大。"},
22871:{"w":"avalanche","e":"An earthquake triggered an avalanche.","t":"地震引起一场**雪崩**。"},
22872:{"w":"alienation","e":"The creation of healthy social environment must address issues such as poverty, pollution, natural resource depletion, social alienation and poor working conditions.","t":"要营造健康的社会环境，必须解决贫困、污染、自然资源枯竭、社会关系**疏离**以及工作环境恶劣等问题。","c":"alienation from 与…疏远；sense of alienation 疏离感","d":"alienate（v. 使疏远；使格格不入）"},
22873:{"w":"accumulate","e":"The debris that accumulated at the foot of the volcano reached a depth, in places, of 200 feet.","t":"**堆积**在火山脚下的岩屑在一些地方有200英尺厚。","r":"词根记忆：ac（表加强）+cumul（堆积）+ate（表动词）→不断堆积→积累","c":"accumulate funds 积累资金","d":"accumulation（n. 积累；堆积物）"},
22874:{"w":"transmit","e":"All the documents have been transmitted electronically to the printing centre.","t":"所有文件已经被以电子方式**传送**至印刷中心。","r":"词根记忆：trans（越过）+mit（送）→越过去输送→传送","d":"transmitter（n. 传送者；发射机）"},
22875:{"w":"identification","e":"Give us the ship's name, its identification number and ocean region.","t":"告诉我们这艘船的名字、它的**识别**号以及所处海域。","r":"词根记忆：ident（相同）+ification（表抽象名词）→查看是否相同→鉴定","c":"identification card 身份证"},
22876:{"w":"wander","e":"They enjoyed wandering in this old town.","t":"他们喜欢在这个古镇上**闲逛**。","r":"联想记忆：在十字路口徘徊（wander），想知道（wonder）下一步该怎么走","c":"wander from/off 偏离…，游离…；wander from the subject/point 离题；wander about/over the world 漫游世界"},
22877:{"w":"classical","e":"Some architects look back to the classical tradition.","t":"一些建筑师追忆起**古典**的建筑风格。","c":"classical music 古典音乐"},
22878:{"w":"abuse","e":"Biometrics may raise thorny questions about privacy and the potential for abuse.","t":"生物测定学可能会引起棘手的隐私问题，也可能导致对此技术的**滥用**。","r":"词根记忆：ab（相反）+us（使用）+e→使用不当→滥用","c":"drug abuse 滥用药物，吸毒；abuse one's authority/office 滥用权威/职权；verbal abuse 口头谩骂"},
22879:{"w":"fake","e":"He's holding the fake credit card, but doesn't dare to use it.","t":"他手里攥着**伪造**的信用卡，却不敢用。","r":"联想记忆：打击造（make）假（fake）"},
22880:{"w":"incorporate","e":"This will depend on when carmakers incorporate the necessary monitoring and control systems into their vehicles.","t":"这将取决于汽车制造商何时将必要的监测控制系统**整合**到汽车上。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+corpor（团体）+ate（使…）→使进入团体成为一部分→把…合并","y":"comprehend（v. 包括；理解）；embody（vt. 包括，包含）"},
22881:{"w":"trace","e":"The origin of modern architecture can be traced back to the social and technological changes of the 18th and 19th centuries.","t":"现代建筑的起源可**追溯**到18、19世纪出现的社会和科技变革。","r":"联想记忆：描绘（trace）车轮的痕迹（track）","c":"without (a) trace 无影无踪；trace element 痕量元素，微量元素","d":"traceable（adj. 可追踪的）"},
22882:{"w":"convey","e":"His poem conveyed a sense of sorrow.","t":"他的诗**表达**了一种悲伤的情感。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+vey（路）→用同一条路运送→运","c":"convey a message 传递信息"},
22883:{"w":"boundary","e":"Mount St. Helens is located along the boundary of two of the moving plates that make up the Earth's crust.","t":"圣海伦斯火山位于组成地壳的两大移动板块的**边界线**上。","r":"联想记忆：bound（bind的过去分词，束缚）+ary（名词后缀，表场所）→分界线；边界","c":"push back the boundary of 扩大…的范围"},
22884:{"w":"frank","e":"Will you be frank with me about this matter?","t":"在这件事上你能不能**坦白**地跟我说？","c":"to be frank 坦白说"},
22885:{"w":"bonus","e":"Scrapping farm-price support and protection for coal-mining offers a two-fold bonus: a cleaner environment and a more efficient economy.","t":"取消农产品价格补贴和煤矿开采保护有双重**好处**：第一，营造了更干净的环境；第二，发展了更高效的经济。","r":"联想记忆：bon（好的）+us（我们）→一发奖金，我们大家都说好!→奖金，红利"},
22886:{"w":"militant","e":"One militant group warned the government to take notice.","t":"一个**激进**的团体警告政府要注意。","r":"词根记忆：milit（战斗）+ant（…的）→好战的","y":"combative（adj. 好斗的）；agitator（n. 鼓动者，煽动者）；firebrand〔n. 引起（社会或政治）动乱的人〕","f":"dove（n. 主和派人物）；pacifist（n. 和平主义者，反战主义者）"},
22887:{"w":"starve","e":"Thousands of people starved during the war.","t":"战争中，成千上万的人**饿死**。","r":"联想记忆：star（明星）+ve→和一些明星养尊处优的生活正相反→挨饿"},
22888:{"w":"refresh","e":"My job is to make sure that you all feel relaxed and refreshed.","t":"我的工作就是保证你们都感觉放松且**精力充沛**。","r":"联想记忆：re（再，又）+fresh（新鲜的）→使（复原）；更新","c":"refresh one's memory 恢复某人的记忆","d":"refreshment（n. 精力恢复）"},
22889:{"w":"dystrophy","e":"In 1986, American researchers identified the genetic defect underlying one type of muscular dystrophy.","t":"1986年，美国研究人员确认了导致一种肌肉**营养不良**症的遗传缺陷。","r":"词根记忆：dys（不良）+troph（营养）+y（表名词）→营养不良","c":"muscular dystrophy 肌肉萎缩症"},
22890:{"w":"conduce","e":"Money, fame and wealth do not always conduce to happiness.","t":"金钱与名利并不一定就能给人们**带来**幸福。","c":"conduce to 导致；有助于"},
22891:{"w":"consulate","e":"Peter's father used to be a consul working in the American consulate in China.","t":"彼得的父亲曾经是一名领事，在美国驻中国**领事馆**工作。"},
22892:{"w":"contaminant","e":"Before shipment we have to make sure that all equipment is clean and free of contaminants.","t":"装船之前我们需要确定所有的设备都是整洁的、未受到**污染**的。","c":"biological contaminant 生物污染物"},
22893:{"w":"demerit","e":"I was asked to discuss my best friend's merits and demerits objectively.","t":"我需要客观地讨论我最好朋友的优**缺点**。"},
22894:{"w":"denomination","e":"Christians of all denominations attended the conference.","t":"各**教派**的基督徒都参加了会议。","r":"来自denominate（vt. 命名，取名）"},
22895:{"w":"disturbance","e":"The construction work is creating constant noise, dust and disturbance.","t":"建筑工程带来持续不断的噪音、灰尘以及**混乱**。","r":"词根记忆：dis（表加强）+turb（搅动）+ance（表名词）→扰乱"},
22896:{"w":"enjoyable","e":"There is going to be a very enjoyable TV programme this evening.","t":"今天晚上将有一期非常**有意思**的电视节目。"},
22897:{"w":"expiry","e":"The expiry date of my credit card is November 12th 2028.","t":"我的信用卡**到期**日是2028年11月12日。","c":"date of expiry 有效期限"},
22898:{"w":"fluctuation","e":"The decision was affected by his fluctuation of mood.","t":"这个决定受到他情绪**波动**的影响。","r":"来自fluctuate（v. 波动）","c":"display a fluctuation 显示波动"},
22899:{"w":"frequency","e":"There is an increasing frequency of attacks in this primitive tribe.","t":"这个原始部落受到越来越**频繁**的袭击。"},
22900:{"w":"hence","e":"People all believe firmly that the true consequences will be known several days hence.","t":"人们都坚信几天**后**真实的结果将公之于众。","r":"发音记忆：“恨死”→“恨死”某人，从此不再联系→从此"},
22901:{"w":"inadequate","e":"Mary rejected the $3 million compensation as totally inadequate.","t":"玛丽拒绝了300万美元的赔偿金，她认为那是完全**不够**的。","r":"联想记忆：in（不）+adequate（适当的，足够的）→不充分的；不适当的"},
22902:{"w":"keystone","e":"Changes to the social welfare system are the keystone of the government's reforms.","t":"社会福利系统的改革是政府改革的**基础**。"},
22903:{"w":"manifest","e":"The symptoms of the disease manifested themselves ten days later.","t":"这种疾病的症状在十天后**表现**了出来。","r":"词根记忆：mani（手）+fest（打）→用手打人，怒意很明显→明显的"},
22904:{"w":"marginally","e":"Mother thought the products were marginally more expensive, so she could not afford it this time.","t":"妈妈认为这些商品**稍有点**贵，因此她这次买不起。"},
22905:{"w":"moderately","e":"Linda did moderately well in the sports competition and she won the third place in the game.","t":"琳达在这次运动会上**适度**发挥，最后取得第三名的成绩。"},
22906:{"w":"noticeable","e":"There has been a noticeable improvement in Tim's learning.","t":"蒂姆的学业有了**明显**的提高。"},
22907:{"w":"optic","e":"The wound hurt his optic nerve so that he could no longer see things.","t":"伤口触及他的**视觉**神经，他再也看不到东西了。","c":"fiber optic cable 光缆"},
22908:{"w":"outweigh","e":"The risks are vastly outweighed by the potential benefits.","t":"潜在的利益要远远**高于**所要承担的风险。","r":"组合词：out（超过）+weigh（称重）→比…更重要"},
22909:{"w":"adverse","e":"Smoking can produce substantial adverse effects on the heart and lungs.","t":"吸烟会对人的心脏和肺造成严重的**危害**。","r":"词根记忆：ad（表加强）+vers（转）+e→转向不希望的一方→不利的","c":"adverse circumstances 逆境","y":"unfavorable（adj. 不利的）；harmful（adj. 有害的）"},
22910:{"w":"finale","e":"No other performer has managed to equal their grand finale.","t":"他们的**压轴大戏**令其他表演者望尘莫及。","r":"联想记忆：final（最后的）+e→终场"},
22911:{"w":"astonish","e":"The news astonished everyone.","t":"这个消息使所有人**大吃一惊**。","r":"联想记忆：a（一个）+ston（看作stone，石头）+ish→一石激起千层浪，怎不叫人惊讶→使惊讶"},
22912:{"w":"charge","e":"Drivers will be charged according to the roads they use.","t":"根据司机行驶的道路对其**收费**。","c":"take charge of 担任，负责；in charge（of） 负责，主管；no charge/free of charge 免费；extra charge 额外费用"},
22913:{"w":"corps","e":"The Marine Corps experience launched my machinist career. It also made me realize that learning how-to-learn is a powerful tool.","t":"海军陆战**队**的经历开启了我的机械师生涯。它也让我意识到学习如何学习是一个强大的工具。","r":"联想记忆：和cops（警察）一起记，两者都是国家的防卫力量"},
22914:{"w":"module","e":"The school offers you 10-week modules of English courses.","t":"该学校为你提供为期10周的英语课程**单元**。","r":"联想记忆：和model（n. 模型）一起记"},
22915:{"w":"petroleum","e":"This newly discovered substance can burn like petroleum.","t":"这种新发现的物质可以像**石油**一样燃烧。","r":"词根记忆：petr（岩石）+ole（油）+um→石油"},
22916:{"w":"stylish","e":"Their uniforms are stylish.","t":"他们的制服很**时髦**。","c":"stylish hairstyle 时髦的发型"},
22917:{"w":"dump","e":"Dredgers suck up clay and mud and dump them in deeper waters.","t":"挖泥船挖出黏土和泥，然后将其**倒**入更深的水域。","r":"发音记忆：“当铺”→到当铺去倾销→倾卸，倾倒","c":"dump on 把…倾倒在…上"},
22918:{"w":"debris","e":"As the sliding ice and snow melted, it touched off devastating torrents of mud and debris, which destroyed all life in their path.","t":"下滑中的冰雪融化后会引发泥**石**流，破坏力极大，摧毁途经的一切生物。","r":"发音记忆：“堆玻璃”→一堆碎玻璃→碎屑，残骸","c":"clear the debris 清理残骸（或废弃物）"},
22919:{"w":"irony","e":"It reveals the power of the pauses and noises we use to play for time, convey emotion, doubt and irony.","t":"这表现出停顿和噪音的力量，我们用它们来拖延时间，表达情感、质疑和**讽刺**。","r":"联想记忆：iron（铁）+y→像铁一样冷冰冰的话→反话，讽刺","d":"ironically（adv. 讽刺地；嘲讽地）"},
22920:{"w":"component","e":"It is often easier to check individual components before assembly takes place in many manufacturing processes.","t":"在许多生产工序中，在组装之前先检查单个**零部件**通常更容易。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+pon（放）+ent（具有…性质的）→构成的，组成的","c":"key component 主要成分；component parts 部件","y":"ingredient（n. 成分）；element（n. 要素，元件）；constituent（adj. 组成的）"},
22921:{"w":"fieldwork","e":"Elinor's fieldwork, followed up by her experimental work, pointed us in exactly the right direction.","t":"埃丽诺的**实地考察**，还有随后进行的实验性工作，给我们指出了正确方向。","r":"组合词：field（场地）+work（工作）→实地调查"},
22922:{"w":"contaminate","e":"Chemical fertilisers and pesticides may contaminate water supplies.","t":"化肥和杀虫剂可能会**污染**水源。","c":"a contaminated river 一条被污染的河流","y":"taint（vt. 污染，玷污）；pollute（vt. 弄脏，污染）；defile（vt. 弄脏，污损）"},
22923:{"w":"applicant","e":"We have interviewed twenty-six applicants and none of them are qualified.","t":"我们已经面试了26个**申请者**，没一人符合条件。"},
22924:{"w":"strap","e":"This strap on my briefcase is broken.","t":"我公文包的这根**带子**断了。","r":"联想记忆：和strip（n. 条，带）一起记","d":"strapless（adj. 无吊带的，无肩带的）；strapped（adj. 缺钱的，手头紧的）"},
22925:{"w":"fundamental","e":"The fundamental conditions and resources for health are peace, education, food, a viable income, and a stable ecosystem.","t":"和平、教育、食物、足以维持生计的收入和稳定的生态系统是健康的**基本**条件和源泉。","r":"词根记忆：funda（=fund，基础）+ment（表名词）+al（…的）→基础的","c":"fundamental innovation 基础性的创新；fundamental process基本过程；fundamental elements 基本元素；fundamental differences根本差异"},
22926:{"w":"conclusion","e":"At the clinic we have come to the conclusion that the major cause of back pain is not with the design of chairs, but in the way we sit in them.","t":"临床试验得出的**结论**是，背痛不是由椅子的设计引起的，而是我们的坐姿造成的。","c":"in conclusion 最后，总之；draw a conclusion 得出结论；at the conclusion of 当…结束时"},
22927:{"w":"intensity","e":"The pulse laser is increasing its intensity.","t":"脉冲激光的**强度**在不断增加。"},
22928:{"w":"notable","e":"The most notable of these activities was the Woman's Exhibition.","t":"在这些活动中，最**引人注目**的是妇女作品展。","r":"词根记忆：not（知道）+able（可…的）→可知道的→值得注意的","c":"a notable person 一位重要人物","d":"notably（adv. 显著地，特别地）","y":"eminent（adj. 杰出的，显赫的）；noteworthy（adj. 显著的，值得注目的）；remarkable（adj. 显著的，值得注意的）"},
22929:{"w":"implement","e":"Policy makers struggle to define and implement appropriate legislation.","t":"政策制定者们致力于阐释和**执行**适当的法规。","r":"词根记忆：im（使…）+ple（填满）+ment→把…填满→实施；执行","d":"implementation（n. 实施；执行）","y":"perform（v. 做，履行）；execute（vt. 执行，履行，实行）；utensil（n. 用具）；instrument（n. 仪器，器械，工具）"},
22930:{"w":"cervical","e":"Smoking is thought to cause about 14 percent of leukemia and cervical cancers.","t":"约14％的白血病和**宫颈**癌被认为是由吸烟引发的。"},
22931:{"w":"plot","e":"The plot of this film was too complicated for me.","t":"这部电影的**情节**对我来讲太复杂了。"},
22932:{"w":"acquaint","e":"Films provide an ideal opportunity to acquaint viewers with something unknown.","t":"电影给观众提供了一个**了解**未知事物的绝佳机会。","y":"inform（v. 通知，告知）"},
22933:{"w":"violence","e":"Capital punishment is essential to controlling violence in society.","t":"死刑对控制社会上的**暴力**事件具有重要意义。"},
22934:{"w":"revolve","e":"Fifteen satellites all revolve about the planet's equator.","t":"15颗卫星都绕着这颗行星的赤道**旋转**。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+volv（转）+e→不断转动→（使）旋转","c":"revolve about/round 围绕…旋转"},
22935:{"w":"vegetarian","e":"The restaurant offers special meals for vegetarians.","t":"这家饭店为**素食者**准备了特别的食物。","c":"vegetarian restaurant 素食餐厅"},
22936:{"w":"ratio","e":"The male to female ratio of volunteers is 4 to 5.","t":"志愿者中男女**比例**为4比5。","r":"词根记忆：rat（计算）+io→比，比率"},
22937:{"w":"scream","e":"The students screamed in excitement.","t":"学生们激动得**尖叫**起来。","r":"联想记忆：孩子们见到冰淇淋（ice-cream），立刻尖叫（scream）起来"},
22938:{"w":"steep","e":"It's very steep here and the surface is a little slippery.","t":"这儿很**陡**，地面还有点滑。","r":"联想记忆：step（阶梯）中又加一个e→更高了→陡峭的"},
22939:{"w":"interior","e":"The secret of the versatility of glass lies in its interior structure.","t":"这种多功能玻璃的奥秘就在于它的**内部**结构。","c":"interior decoration 室内装潢；interior design 室内设计；interior structure 内部结构；in the interior of... 在…内部"},
22940:{"w":"analogous","e":"The task was strictly analogous to the one that we had finished before.","t":"这个任务和我们先前完成的那个极为**相似**。","r":"来自analogy（n. 类似，相似）","c":"be analogous to 与…类似"},
22941:{"w":"high-tech","e":"The architectural style usually referred to as high-tech was emerging.","t":"经常被称为**高科技**的建筑风格涌现了出来。","r":"组合词：high（高的）+tech（科技）→高科技"},
22942:{"w":"aggressive","e":"The incentive for the more aggressive use of rockets came not from within the European continent but from far-away India.","t":"将火箭用作更具**攻击性**武器的动机并非来自欧洲大陆，而是来自遥远的印度。","r":"词根记忆：ag（表加强）+gress（行走）+ive（…的）→不断行走，四处闯荡→有进取心的","c":"aggressive behaviour 挑衅行为","d":"aggressively（adv. 放肆地）","y":"militant（adj. 好战的）；enterprising（adj. 有进取心的）"},
22943:{"w":"process","e":"Reforming the educational system will be a difficult process.","t":"教育制度的改革将是一个艰难的**过程**。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+cess（行走）→向前走→过程","c":"a peaceful process 一个平静的过程；in the process of doing sth. 在做某事的过程中"},
22944:{"w":"hum","e":"The hum of conversation died away as the curtain rose.","t":"幕布升起时，**嗡嗡**的谈话声渐渐消失。","r":"发音记忆：“哼”→蚊子、苍蝇的哼哼声"},
22945:{"w":"sinister","e":"In your remarks you alluded to certain sinister developments.","t":"你的话语中暗示了一些**不祥**的势头。"},
22946:{"w":"refinement","e":"The progress in refinement of machine tools has been substantial in recent years.","t":"近年来，机床的**改进**取得了相当大的进展。"},
22947:{"w":"solidarity","e":"Downtrodden people will never be able to make any effective protest until they achieve solidarity.","t":"被压迫的人们只有**团结一致**才能做出有效的抗议。","r":"词根记忆：solid（坚实的）+arity（表名词）→坚实的状态→团结","y":"unity（n. 团结；一致）；concord（n. 一致；和谐）","f":"split（n. 分裂）"},
22948:{"w":"outline","e":"The guide gave us a brief outline of the museum's history.","t":"导游向我们简要**概述**了这座博物馆的历史。","r":"组合词：out（外部的）+line（线条）→外部线条→轮廓；草图","c":"an outline of a speech 讲话提纲"},
22949:{"w":"blank","e":"Would you mind my asking about your salary? Or we can leave it blank.","t":"你介意我问一下你的薪水吗？或者我们也可以把这一项**空着**。","r":"联想记忆：b（看作be，是）+lank（看作lack，缺乏）→缺乏“是什么”→缺乏内容→空白的"},
22950:{"w":"photocopy","e":"Let's go and photocopy the article.","t":"我们去把这篇文章**复印**一份吧。","r":"组合词：photo（照片，图片）+copy（复制）→复制照片、图片→影印，复印"},
22951:{"w":"accessory","e":"The uniforms for women in the company were white frocks decorated with purple, white and green accessories.","t":"这家公司的女式工作服是配有紫色、白色和绿色**装饰物**的白色裙装。","c":"accessory to …的附件"},
22952:{"w":"dean","e":"At the top of the faculty is a dean.","t":"**院长**是学院里的一把手。","r":"发音记忆：“盯”→院长狠狠地盯着作弊的学生→院长"},
22953:{"w":"compensate","e":"Nothing can compensate for the loss of one's health.","t":"失去的健康是无法**弥补**的。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+pens（花费）+ate（使…）→花费的钱全部（拿回来）→赔偿","c":"compensate（sb.） for sth. 给（某人）赔偿某物","y":"indemnify（vt. 赔偿；补偿）"},
22954:{"w":"chest","e":"At the very bottom of the chest were his carving tools.","t":"在**储物箱**的最底部有他的雕刻工具。","c":"treasure chest 财宝箱；community chest 社区福利基金"},
22955:{"w":"tanker","e":"She looked around for any kind of vehicle and then found an abandoned fuel tanker.","t":"她四处寻找车辆，随后发现了一辆废弃的**油罐车**。","r":"词根记忆：tank（贮放液体的罐）+er（表物）→油罐车","c":"oil tanker 油轮；运油车"},
22956:{"w":"capture","e":"Her beautiful smile was captured through a camera by her husband.","t":"她的动人笑容被她丈夫用照相机**捕捉**了下来。","r":"词根记忆：capt（抓住）+ure（表行为）→捕获"},
22957:{"w":"overestimate","e":"The company overestimated his ability when they employed him.","t":"这家公司在雇用他时**高估**了他的能力。"},
22958:{"w":"overview","e":"Susan usually gives us a brief overview of what this class will involve.","t":"苏珊通常在上课之前会就这节课的内容做一个**概述**。"},
22959:{"w":"pathway","e":"There are new pedestrian pathways being built alongside the road.","t":"这条路周围要修建新的步行**路**。","r":"组合词：path（小路）+way（道路）→路径，途径"},
22960:{"w":"perplex","e":"The leukaemia has continued to perplex doctors on how to heal.","t":"白血病如何治愈的问题始终**困扰**着医生。","r":"词根记忆：per（自始至终）+plex（重叠）→始终重叠→使复杂化","d":"perplexity（n. 困惑）；perplexing（adj. 复杂的）","y":"baffle（vt. 使困惑）；mystify（vt. 使迷惑）；puzzle〔v.（使）迷惑〕"},
22961:{"w":"recognition","e":"The machine detected her briefly, but there was no sign of recognition.","t":"机器对她进行了检测，但是没有一丝**识别**出来的迹象。","r":"来自recognize（vt. 认出；承认）"},
22962:{"w":"reconstruction","e":"There will be a huge project for the post-war reconstruction for the tribe.","t":"这个部落的战后**重建**将是非常巨大的工程。","c":"economic reconstruction 经济重建；facial reconstruction 面貌复原"},
22963:{"w":"render","e":"Thousands of people were rendered homeless by the terrible earthquake.","t":"可怕的地震**使得**成千上万的人们流离失所。","r":"词根记忆：rend（给）+er（表动词，反复动作）→给予","d":"rendering（n. 表演；翻译）"},
22964:{"w":"renewal","e":"There is a renewal of interest in traditional Chinese medicine therapy.","t":"最近传统的中医疗法**重新**开始受到关注。"},
22965:{"w":"requisition","e":"For the terrible civil war, there is a requisition for a large number of guns by the government.","t":"因为可怕的内战，该政府要求**征用**大量枪支。"},
22966:{"w":"reserved","e":"Ellen was a shy, reserved girl who rarely took part in the club activities.","t":"埃伦是一位害羞**内向**的女孩，她很少参加社团活动。","c":"closed reserved 只读不借；非外借图书处"},
22967:{"w":"resolve","e":"Attempts are continually being made to resolve the problem of security in school.","t":"人们不断尝试着**解决**学校的安全问题。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+solv（松开）+e→重新松解（困难） →解决","c":"resolve to do sth. 决定做某事","d":"unresolved〔adj.（问题或困难）未解决的〕"},
22968:{"w":"sack","e":"The corn was stored in large sacks in the barn.","t":"谷物用大**麻袋**装着储存在粮仓里面。","r":"联想记忆：因为缺少（lack）竞争力，公司解雇（sack）员工","c":"get the sack 被解雇，被开除；give sb. the sack 开除 / 解雇某人"},
22969:{"w":"slide","e":"For frequent usage, the drawers slide in and out easily.","t":"由于频繁使用，抽屉很容易**滑**进滑出。","r":"联想记忆：s+lid（盖子）+e→盖子太滑，从桌子上滑了下去→滑动，下滑","c":"slide into 不知不觉地陷入；slide projector 幻灯片放映机；slide ruler 计算尺","d":"sliding（adj. 滑行的）"},
22970:{"w":"slump","e":"Sales of clothing have slumped sharply this year.","t":"今年衣服的销量**大幅下降**。","r":"联想记忆：sl+ump（看作jump，跳下）→突然跳下→暴跌"},
22971:{"w":"surface","e":"It seems like a difficult problem on the surface, but in fact it is easy to solve.","t":"这个问题**表面**上看起来很难，但实际上很容易解决。","r":"词根记忆：sur（上）+fac（脸面）+e→脸的上面→表面"},
22972:{"w":"tickle","e":"I tickled my little brother's feet with a feather.","t":"我用一根羽毛来**挠**弟弟的脚。","r":"联想记忆：买张电影票（ticket）逗她高兴（tickle）"},
22973:{"w":"transportation","e":"There is a need for huge improvement in public transportation.","t":"公共**交通系统**需要大幅度的提高和改善。","c":"preservation and transportation of samples 样品的保存和运输"},
22974:{"w":"unanimous","e":"Unanimous agreement should be reached for this plan to go ahead.","t":"这项计划需要全体人员**一致**通过才能进行。","r":"词根记忆：un（=uni，一个）+anim（精神）+ous（…的）→大家都秉持一种精神→一致同意的","d":"unanimously（adv. 全体一致地，一致同意地）"},
22975:{"w":"underestimate","e":"The statistics show that the number of people affected by the H1N1 has been seriously underestimated.","t":"这项数据显示之前严重**低估**了甲流患者的数量。","r":"组合词：under（不足）+estimate（估计）→估计不足→低估"},
22976:{"w":"understandable","e":"Only when I have put the trial into practice can it be understandable to everyone.","t":"只有我将此试验实现大家才会**理解**。"},
22977:{"w":"transcribe","e":"She transcribed a letter on the typewriter.","t":"她用打字机**打印**了一封信。","r":"词根记忆：trans（转移）+(s)crib（写）+e→转写→抄写"},
22978:{"w":"differ","e":"French differs from English in this respect.","t":"法语在这方面**不同于**英语。"},
22979:{"w":"undertake","e":"Mary undertook the organization of the whole scheme.","t":"玛丽**负责**整个计划的组织工作。","c":"undertake responsibility 承担责任"},
22980:{"w":"plus","e":"The psychologist found a word without a picture was superior to a word plus a picture for children.","t":"心理学家发现，对孩子们而言没有附上图片的词比**加**了图片的词更好一些。","r":"联想记忆：pl（看作play，玩）+us（我们）→加上我们，大家一起玩儿→加上"},
22981:{"w":"recycle","e":"The man collects the waste bins and deposits the waste into a shredder for recycling.","t":"这个人把垃圾箱收集起来，把垃圾倒进搅碎机进行**回收利用**。","r":"联想记忆：re（重新）+cycle（循环）→循环利用→回收利用","y":"reclaim（vt. 回收）"},
22982:{"w":"captive","e":"Today approximately 10 species might be said to have been \"saved\" by captive breeding programmes.","t":"据说现在大约有10个物种在**圈养**繁殖计划中获得了“拯救”。","r":"词根记忆：capt（抓住）+ive（…的）→被抓住的","c":"captive breeding 圈养繁殖；captive market 垄断市场"},
22983:{"w":"unconquerable","e":"This place in their hearts was unconquerable.","t":"这个地方在他们心目中是**不可征服**的。"},
22984:{"w":"respect","e":"I respect you for your honesty.","t":"因为你为人诚实，所以我**尊敬**你。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+spect（看）→一再注视，以示尊敬→尊敬","d":"respectable（adj. 值得尊敬的）"},
22985:{"w":"neutral","e":"The feminist took neutral ground during the first interview.","t":"这名女权主义者在第一次采访中采取了**中立**的态度。"},
22986:{"w":"presentation","e":"We'd better fix the problem before the presentation.","t":"我们最好在做**报告**之前解决这个问题。","r":"联想记忆：present（展现，表达）+ation（表行为）→介绍","c":"make/give a presentation 做报告；on presentation of sth. 展示某物"},
22987:{"w":"residence","e":"Without permission, students may not be allowed to keep motor vehicles at their residence in this university.","t":"未经校方同意，学生不允许在校内的**住宿区**停放机动车辆。","r":"来自resident（adj. 居住的）"},
22988:{"w":"mission","e":"The forces were sent to complete a secret mission in an uncharted place.","t":"这些军队被派遣到一个地图上未标明的地方去执行一项秘密**任务**。","r":"电影《碟中谍》Mission Impossible，可直译为“不可能完成的任务”"},
22989:{"w":"assurance","e":"She answered every question in the job interview with calm assurance, which impressed the whole panel.","t":"她冷静而充满**信心**地回答了面试中的每个问题，给整个面试小组留下了深刻印象。","r":"联想记忆：assur(e)（确信，保证）+ance→保证","c":"quality assurance system 质量保证体系"},
22990:{"w":"content","e":"The meeting leader concerns himself with the content of the meeting.","t":"会议的主办者本人很关心会议的**内容**。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+ten（拿住）+t→拿住时的量→容量，引申为满意的","c":"be content with 对…感到满足、满意；table of contents 目录"},
22991:{"w":"emit","e":"Older trucks, buses and taxis emit excessive levels of smoke and fumes.","t":"老式卡车、公交车和出租车**排放**出过量的烟和废气。","r":"词根记忆：e（向外）+mit（送）→发出","c":"emit light 发光"},
22992:{"w":"pamphlet","e":"The pamphlet was regarded as a masterpiece of wit.","t":"这本**小册子**被看成智慧的杰作。"},
22993:{"w":"equipment","e":"Last week we talked about buying camping equipment.","t":"上周我们讨论了有关购买露营**装备**的事情。"},
22994:{"w":"sensible","e":"This week's lecture is on sensible eating.","t":"本周的讲座是关于**合理**饮食的。","r":"词根记忆：sens（感觉）+ible（可…的）→可感觉到的→能觉察到的","c":"a sensible idea 一个合乎情理的想法"},
22995:{"w":"spacecraft","e":"We've done a lot on the study of spacecraft returning technique.","t":"我们已在**航天器**返回技术上做了很多研究工作。","r":"组合词：space（太空）+craft（技术）→太空技术→航天器，宇宙飞船"},
22996:{"w":"consequence","e":"The consequence of the Human Genome Project goes far beyond a narrow focus on disease.","t":"人类基因工程的**重要意义**远远不止于治愈疾病。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+sequ（跟随）+ence（表名词）→跟随其后→结果","c":"as a consequence 因而，结果"},
22997:{"w":"efficient","e":"The financial analyst found efficient ways for the company to save money.","t":"财务分析师找到了能够**有效**地替公司省钱的方法。","r":"词根记忆：ef（=e，加强）+fici（做）+ent（…的）→能做出来的→有能力的","c":"energy efficient 节能的；efficient methods 有效的方法","d":"efficiently（adv. 有效率地；有效地）"},
22998:{"w":"current","e":"I would like to open a current account.","t":"我想开一个**活期**存款账户。","c":"current situation 当前形势；current affairs 时事；air current气流；ocean current 洋流；alternating current 交流电"},
22999:{"w":"inversion","e":"The inversion of the image on the retina is corrected by the brain, so we see the world the right way up.","t":"视网膜上图像的**倒置**会由大脑加以纠正，所以我们看到的世界是正的。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+vers（转）+ion（表名词） →转进去→颠倒","c":"an inversion of word order 词序颠倒"},
23000:{"w":"elevate","e":"John has been elevated to manager.","t":"约翰已被**提升**为经理。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+lev（举起）+ate（使…）→举起"},
23001:{"w":"loan","e":"Does this mean I'm not eligible for a student loan?","t":"这是不是意味着我不符合学生**贷款**的条件？","r":"发音记忆：“漏”→账本有漏洞，因为把钱借出去了→贷款，借款"},
23002:{"w":"capable","e":"The bridge is capable of carrying 150-tonne trucks.","t":"这座桥**能够**承受载重150公吨的卡车。","r":"词根记忆：cap（抓住）+able（能…的）→能抓得住的→有能力的"},
23003:{"w":"performance","e":"Profits continue to grow, with strong performance in Asia and South America.","t":"利润持续增长，其中亚洲及南美市场**表现**尤为强劲。","c":"live performance 现场表演"},
23004:{"w":"handicapped","e":"Toilets for handicapped people are located on this floor, with a sign of a wheelchair on the door.","t":"**残疾**人厕所就在本楼层，门上有一个轮椅的标志。","r":"联想记忆：hand（手）+i+cap（帽子）+ped→没法用手来戴帽子→残废的，有生理缺陷的","c":"mentally handicapped 心理缺陷"},
23005:{"w":"insulate","e":"The familiar native-style hotels could insulate the tourist from the strangeness of the host environment.","t":"这种似曾相识的本土风格的旅馆能够**避免**让游客在异乡产生陌生感。","r":"词根记忆：insul（岛）+ate（使…）→使成为孤岛→使隔绝","c":"insulate sb. from/against sth. 使某人与（不良影响）隔绝；insulating tape 绝缘胶带；insulated cable 绝缘电线","y":"isolate（vt. 使孤立；使隔离）"},
23006:{"w":"household","e":"I've been investigating four new household gadgets and sorting out their advantages and disadvantages.","t":"我已就四种**家居**新产品做了调查，并将它们的优缺点分门别类。","r":"组合词：house（房屋）+hold（拥有）→有房屋才像个家→","c":"single-parent households 单亲家庭；household appliance 家用电器"},
23007:{"w":"detrimental","e":"Smoking cigarettes is detrimental to your health.","t":"吸烟**有害**健康。","r":"联想记忆：detriment（损害，伤害）+al（…的）→不利的，有害的","c":"be detrimental to 对…有害；detrimental effect 不良影响"},
23008:{"w":"decorate","e":"We moved into our new apartment before it was decorated.","t":"新公寓还没有**装修**，我们就搬进去了。","r":"词根记忆：decor（装饰）+ate（表动词）→装饰","c":"decorate sb. for 因…授予某人奖章等；decorate sth. with sth.用某物装饰…","d":"decoration（n. 装饰，装潢）"},
23009:{"w":"nationality","e":"Can you show any proof of your nationality?","t":"你能出示可以证明你**国籍**的证件吗？","r":"联想记忆：nation（国家）+ality（表名词，状态）→属于哪个国家→国籍"},
23010:{"w":"fleet","e":"Governments assembled the world's largest fleet of dredgers to suck up mud in the ocean.","t":"各国政府共同组建了世界上最大的挖泥**船队**，去挖掘大洋海底的淤泥。","r":"联想记忆：舰队（fleet）遇到问题不能立刻逃跑（flee）"},
23011:{"w":"interfere","e":"Carbon monoxide may interfere with the blood's ability to deliver oxygen to the heart.","t":"一氧化碳会**妨碍**血液向心脏供氧。","r":"词根记忆：inter（在…之间）+fer（带来）+e→带到中间→干涉","c":"interfere with 干涉…"},
23012:{"w":"signal","e":"Serotonin is a chemical substance involved in sending signals in the nervous system.","t":"血清素是一种在神经系统中参与传递**信号**的化学物质。","r":"联想记忆：sign（签名）+al→用签名作为自己的标志→标志"},
23013:{"w":"rescue","e":"Several school children were rescued from the burning building.","t":"几名小学生被从燃烧的大楼里成功**救出**。","c":"rescue sb. from danger 营救某人脱险；rescue work 营救工作"},
23014:{"w":"proof","e":"Can you provide any proof of identity?","t":"你能提供任何身份**证明**吗？","r":"联想记忆：屋顶（roof）有了p（棚）就能防雨→能防…的"},
23015:{"w":"afflict","e":"Financial difficulties afflicted the Smiths.","t":"经济问题**困扰**着史密斯一家。","r":"词根记忆：af（表加强）+flict（打击）→一再打击别人→折磨","c":"be afflicted with/by 被…折磨","y":"torment（vt. 折磨）；torture（vt. 拷问，折磨）"},
23016:{"w":"log","e":"The earliest peoples probably stored fire by keeping slow burning logs alight.","t":"早期的人类很可能是通过让**原木**保持缓慢燃烧的状态来保存火种的。"},
23017:{"w":"maritime","e":"You can call or send a message to someone aboard a ship by using our Maritime Services.","t":"你可以通过我们的**海运**服务给船上的人打电话或发信息。","r":"词根记忆：mari（海）+time（时间）→海上的时间→海上的，海事的"},
23018:{"w":"formula","e":"John Walker, an English pharmacist, borrowed the formula from a military rocket-maker called Congreve.","t":"一名叫约翰·沃克的英国药剂师从一位名叫康格里夫的军用火箭制造商那里借用了**配方**。","r":"联想记忆：form（形式，形态）+ula→使具备形式、形态的方式、过程→公式；配方","c":"mathematical formula 数学公式"},
23019:{"w":"therapy","e":"We are beginning to realise the unique benefits of relaxation therapy in curing back pain.","t":"我们正开始认识到放松**疗法**对背痛具有独特的疗效。","c":"radiation therapy 放射治疗；interferon therapy 干扰素治疗法；recreation therapy 娱乐疗法；be in therapy 接受治疗"},
23020:{"w":"concession","e":"You will get what is called a \"student account\", which is a current account with special concessions for students.","t":"你将获得一个名为“学生账户”的活期账户，这是专为学生开设的，有特殊**优惠**措施。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+cess（前进）+ion（表名词）→要想大家共同进步，必须都做出让步→让步"},
23021:{"w":"whisper","e":"I saw Peter whisper something to Michael.","t":"我看见彼得跟迈克尔**小声说**了些什么。","r":"联想记忆：whi（看作who）+sper（看作speaker）→谁在小声说话→低语"},
23022:{"w":"grant","e":"The loan is intended to supplement the grant for living costs.","t":"这笔贷款是打算用来补充生活费**补助金**的。","r":"联想记忆：授予（grant）显赫的（grand）贵族爵位","c":"take...for granted 想当然，认为…理所当然；grant a request答应请求；award a research grant 得到一笔研究经费"},
23023:{"w":"relevant","e":"You should support your arguments with examples and relevant evidence.","t":"你应该用实例和**相关**证据来支持你的论点。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+lev（提高）+ant（…的）→一再想提高的→（态度）中肯的","c":"relevant to 与…相关的，有关的，相应的；relevant details 相关细节","d":"irrelevant（adj. 不相关的；不切题的）"},
23024:{"w":"unrealistic","e":"It is unrealistic to expect people to give up private cars in favour of mass transit.","t":"期望人们放弃使用私家车转而支持公交系统是**不切实际**的。","r":"联想记忆：un（不）+realistic（现实的）→不现实的，不切实际的","c":"unrealistic ideas 不切实际的想法"},
23025:{"w":"enfranchise","e":"The third Reform Act enfranchised the agricultural labourer.","t":"第三版《改革法案》使农业劳动者**获得了选举权**。","r":"联想记忆：en（使…）+franchise（选举权）→使…有选举权→给予…权利","d":"enfranchisement（n. 给予权利；解放）"},
23026:{"w":"disregard","e":"In his dissertations on tourism, Boorstin said that the mass tourists found pleasure in inauthentic contrived attractions, disregarding the real world outside.","t":"布尔斯廷在关于旅游业的论文中写道，众多游客都在人造景观中找寻乐趣，而对外面的真实世界**无动于衷**。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+regard（关心）→不关心→不理会，漠视"},
23027:{"w":"convert","e":"The original house was converted into a residential college.","t":"原来的房子被**改建**成一所寄宿学院。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+vert（转）→（使）转变","c":"convert to/into 把…转化为…"},
23028:{"w":"grasp","e":"Mary finally grasped the material after reading the textbook very carefully.","t":"在非常仔细地阅读了课本后，玛丽最终**领会**了这段材料的意思。","r":"联想记忆：他见到她宛如抓住（grasp）一根救命稻草（grass）"},
23029:{"w":"wealthy","e":"Some people hold the view that wealthy nations should share their wealth with poorer nations by providing such things as food and education.","t":"有些人认为**富**国应该与穷国分享它们的财富，比如提供食物和教育等。"},
23030:{"w":"object","e":"The importance of these acquisitions extends beyond the objects themselves.","t":"这些收获物的重要性超过了**事物**本身。","r":"词根记忆：ob（逆）+ject（扔）→反着扔→反对"},
23031:{"w":"tariff","e":"Taxi companies are using revenue management to set their tariffs.","t":"出租车公司用收入管理来制定他们的**收费标准**。"},
23032:{"w":"defendant","e":"The judge told the defendant to stand when the verdict was read.","t":"法官要求**被告**在宣读判决结果的时候起立。","r":"联想记忆：defend（辩护）+ant→需要为自己辩护的一方→被告"},
23033:{"w":"bankruptcy","e":"Unwise investment led the firm into bankruptcy.","t":"草率的投资导致了这家公司的**破产**。","r":"联想记忆：bank（柜台）+rupt（看作rupture，破裂）+cy→柜台被打破，无法继续经营→破产"},
23034:{"w":"connection","e":"A link between weather and mood is made believable by the evidence for a connection between behaviour and the length of the daylight hours.","t":"证据显示人的行为与昼长有**关系**，据此我们可以相信气候和情绪之间是有联系的。","c":"in connection with 与…有关，与…相关"},
23035:{"w":"airtight","e":"Bill put the beer in an airtight glass container.","t":"比尔把啤酒装进了一个**密闭**的玻璃容器里。","r":"组合词：air（空气）+tight（紧密的）→密不透气的→密闭的"},
23036:{"w":"unprejudiced","e":"The formation of scientific theory starts with simple, unprejudiced observation.","t":"科学理论的形成始于简单、**无偏见**的观察。"},
23037:{"w":"unregistered","e":"His car is unregistered, so he can not drive it in the street.","t":"他的小汽车还**没有进行注册**，因此不可以在大街上行驶。"},
23038:{"w":"versus","e":"The performance tomorrow is Rockets versus Cavaliers.","t":"明天的表演将是火箭队**对**骑士队。","r":"联想记忆：vers（转）+us（我们）→转向我们→与…相对","y":"against（prep. 与…相反；对）"},
23039:{"w":"wretch","e":"He is really a poor wretch, as he lost his mother when he was five years old.","t":"他五岁的时候就失去了母亲，真是一个**不幸的人**。"},
23040:{"w":"acceptable","e":"The salesman's attitude is simply not acceptable to the customers.","t":"那个售货员的态度是顾客所不能**接受**的。"},
23041:{"w":"antique","e":"There is an antique mahogany desk exhibited in the corner.","t":"拐角处展出的是一张**古老**的红木书桌。","r":"词根记忆：antiq（古老）+ue→古老的","c":"antique shop 古玩店"},
23042:{"w":"autobiography","e":"The TV series was based on the autobiography of the famous writer.","t":"这部电视连续剧是根据那位著名作家的**自传**改编的。","r":"词根记忆：auto（自己）+biography（传记）→自传"},
23043:{"w":"browse","e":"Vera browsed the shelves for something interesting to read.","t":"薇拉**浏览**了一下书架，希望找到一些有意思的读物。","r":"联想记忆：brow（眉毛）+se→像眉毛一样纤细的嫩叶→嫩叶","d":"browser（n. 浏览器；吃嫩叶的动物；浏览图书报刊者）","y":"skim（v. 浏览，略读）；graze（v. 放牧，吃草）"},
23044:{"w":"dot","e":"There are lots of Italian restaurants dotted around London.","t":"伦敦到处都**散布**着意大利餐馆。","r":"联想记忆：和pot（n. 壶）一起记；pot（壶）上有许多可爱的dot（小圆点）"},
23045:{"w":"emotional","e":"Mother is the essential part in a family for which she often provides emotional support.","t":"母亲是一个家庭中非常重要的成员，她常常要为整个家庭提供**情感**支持。","r":"联想记忆：emotion（感情）+al（…的）→感情（上）的","d":"emotionally（adv. 在情绪上）"},
23046:{"w":"extrovert","e":"Most sales people are extroverts that like communicating with others.","t":"大多数的销售人员都很**外向**，喜欢与人交流。","r":"词根记忆：extro（外）+vert（转）→向外转的人→性格外向的人"},
23047:{"w":"favourite","e":"Lucy's favourite colour is pink which her twin sister doesn't like at all.","t":"露西**最喜欢**粉色，而她的双胞胎妹妹却一点儿也不喜欢。"},
23048:{"w":"hang","e":"The waiter did me a favor by hanging my coat up on the hook.","t":"服务员帮我将外衣**挂**在了衣钩上面。","c":"hang out with 与…闲逛"},
23049:{"w":"harmony","e":"All his brothers and sisters are living together in perfect harmony.","t":"他的兄弟姐妹们生活在一起并相处得非常**融洽**。","c":"live in harmony 生活和谐；in harmony（with）（与…）和睦相处，（与…）协调一致","d":"harmonize（v. 彼此协调；和声演唱）；harmonious（adj.和睦的；协调的）；harmoniously（adv. 和谐地，和睦地）"},
23050:{"w":"hospitable","e":"The villagers were very hospitable towards anyone who passed through.","t":"村民们对所有经过村子的路人都十分**热情友好**。"},
23051:{"w":"inflate","e":"This kind of fish inflates itself to twice its size when being attacked.","t":"这种鱼在受到袭击时身体会**膨胀**到原来的两倍。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+flat（吹）+e→往里面吹气→使充气"},
23052:{"w":"influential","e":"The female President is one of the most influential figures in local politics.","t":"这位女总统是当地政坛上最**有影响力**的人物之一。","r":"来自influence（n./vt. 影响）"},
23053:{"w":"advantage","e":"I suppose your survey has the advantage of more detailed information.","t":"我认为你调查的**优势**在于拥有更加详细的资料。"},
23054:{"w":"insane","e":"The prisoner has been slowly going insane and he can not recognize his parents now.","t":"这名犯人在监狱里慢慢变得有些**精神失常**了，现在已经无法认出自己的父母。","r":"词根记忆：in（不）+san（健康的）+e→精神不健康的→精神失常的"},
23055:{"w":"inscribe","e":"Each of the prize winners will receive a golden medal with their names inscribed on it.","t":"这个奖项的得主每人将获得一枚金牌，上面**刻**着他们各自的名字。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+scrib（写）+e→写进去→铭刻"},
23056:{"w":"hostel","e":"Claudia doesn't like youth hostels because there's no privacy.","t":"克劳迪娅不喜欢住青年**旅舍**，因为那里毫无隐私可言。","r":"联想记忆：host（主人）+el→房间临时的主人→招待所；学生宿舍","c":"student hostel 学生宿舍；youth hostel 青年旅舍"},
23057:{"w":"substance","e":"Tobacco contains 43 cancer-causing substances.","t":"烟草中含有43种致癌**物质**。","r":"词根记忆：sub（下）+st（站）+ance（表名词）→站立的根本→实质"},
23058:{"w":"fuse","e":"We have to insert a new fuse because the former one has malfunctioned.","t":"**保险丝**烧断了，我们必须换一根新的。","y":"merge（v. 合并，并入）；meld〔v.（使）混合，（使）合并〕；smelt（v. 熔解，熔炼）","f":"divide（v. 分开，分隔）；separate〔v.（使）分离，（使）分开〕；split〔v.（使）分裂，分离〕"},
23059:{"w":"contemporary","e":"Some contemporary tribes still live among the earthworks of earlier cultures.","t":"**当代**一些部落仍生活于早期文明的建筑之中。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+tempor（时间）+ary（…的）→同时代的","y":"modern（adj. 近代的，现代的）；current（adj. 当前的；现在的）"},
23060:{"w":"continuity","e":"This country took steps to enhance its continuity of government operation.","t":"该国采取了措施来加强政府运作的**连续性**。","r":"联想记忆：continu(e)（连续）+ity→连续（性）","d":"continuum（n. 连续统一体）"},
23061:{"w":"tube","e":"When the tube was broken, air rushed in, causing the phosphorus to combust spontaneously.","t":"当**试管**破裂后，空气涌进造成磷自燃。","r":"联想记忆：立方形（cube）的管道（tube）"},
23062:{"w":"damage","e":"Smoking may be doing you quite serious long-term damage.","t":"吸烟会给你带来长期、严重的**伤害**。"},
23063:{"w":"beneficial","e":"How beneficial do you think it would be to group students according to their level of ability?","t":"你认为把学生按照能力的高低分组的做法有多大**益处**？","r":"词根记忆：bene（好）+fic（做）+ial（…的）→做好事的→有益的","c":"be beneficial to 对…有益、有利；mutually beneficial 互惠的","y":"advantageous（adj. 有利的）","f":"harmful（adj. 有害的）；baleful（adj. 有害的，恶意的）"},
23064:{"w":"inhibit","e":"Studies show that intake of carbon monoxide inhibits the flow of oxygen to the heart.","t":"研究显示，吸入一氧化碳会**抑制**氧气对心脏的供给。","r":"词根记忆：in（不）+hibit（拿）→不让拿→抑制，约束","y":"hinder（v. 阻碍，妨碍）；obstruct（vt. 妨碍，阻止）；impede（vt. 阻碍，妨碍，阻止）","f":"encourage（vt. 激励，促进）"},
23065:{"w":"vibrate","e":"The rattlesnake would swiftly shake and vibrate its tail when it felt threatened.","t":"响尾蛇在感到威胁时会急速地摇晃并**抖动**尾巴。","d":"vibrant（adj. 充满活力的）；vibration（n. 颤动，振动）"},
23066:{"w":"inspire","e":"A leader in a group is very important and his confident attitude will inspire his followers greatly.","t":"一个团队里的领导者是非常重要的，他自信的态度会极大地**鼓舞**团队成员。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+spir（呼吸）+e→吸气→鼓气→鼓舞"},
23067:{"w":"introvert","e":"Mr. King was described as a reserved, introvert man who spoke little.","t":"金先生被描述成一位保守、**内向**的人，话说得非常少。"},
23068:{"w":"pedestrian","e":"Two pedestrians were injured when a car skidded round them.","t":"一辆汽车失控滑向两名**路人**并将其撞伤。","r":"词根记忆：ped（脚）+estrian→用脚走的人→行人"},
23069:{"w":"punch","e":"The robber punched the shopkeeper on his head and stole the cash.","t":"盗贼**重击**了店主的头部而后抢走了现金。","r":"发音记忆：“乓哧”（重击的声音）→重击"},
23070:{"w":"rectangle","e":"Tom's room is in the shape of a rectangle.","t":"汤姆的房间是**长方形**的。","r":"词根记忆：rect（直的）+angl（角）+e→长方形的每个角均为直角→长方形，矩形"},
23071:{"w":"repay","e":"You should repay principal and interest.","t":"你应该**偿还**本金和利息。"},
23072:{"w":"sociable","e":"The girl is such a sociable child that she likes talking to everyone here.","t":"这个女孩非常**友善**，她喜欢跟这里的每个人聊天。","r":"词根记忆：soci（社会）+able（能…的）→善社交的→好交","c":"a sociable child 一个合群的孩子"},
23073:{"w":"relative","e":"They now live in relative comfort.","t":"他们现在过得**比较**舒适。","c":"close/distant relatives 近/远亲","d":"relatively（adv. 相当地；相对地）"},
23074:{"w":"spacious","e":"I never thought that the hotel rooms were so spacious and comfortable.","t":"我从来没有想到这家宾馆的房间是如此**宽敞**而且舒服。","r":"联想记忆：spac（看作space，空间）+ious（多…的）→空间很多的→宽广的，宽敞的"},
23075:{"w":"religion","e":"The speaker explained the relevance of the religion to the local people.","t":"演讲者说明了**宗教**对于当地人的重要意义。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+lig（绑）+ion（表名词）→反复用某种思想约束→宗教","d":"religious（adj. 宗教上的）"},
23076:{"w":"demographic","e":"Early attempts to predict population viability were based on demographic uncertainty.","t":"早期对人口生存能力预测的尝试是以**人口**的不确定性为基础的。","r":"来自demography（n. 人口统计；人口学）"},
23077:{"w":"random","e":"The robots follow their own random paths around the plant busily getting on with their jobs.","t":"机器人在工厂里沿着各自的**随机**路线忙碌地工作着。","r":"联想记忆：ran（跑）+dom（领域）→可以在各种领域跑的→任意的","c":"at random 随机地，任意地；random selection 随机的选择；random sampling 随机取样；random access 随机存取","y":"irregular（adj. 不规则的，无规律的）；arbitrary（adj. 任意的）","f":"designed（adj. 有计划的）；arranged（adj. 安排好的）"},
23078:{"w":"vacuum","e":"The vacuum flask can keep drinks hot.","t":"**真空**保温瓶可以保持饮料的温度。","r":"词根记忆：vacu（空）+um→真空","c":"vacuum desiccator 真空干燥器"},
23079:{"w":"digital","e":"In some respects, digital automation tends to diminish the quality of our lives.","t":"从某些方面来看，**数字**自动化会降低我们的生活质量。","r":"词根记忆：digit（数字）+al（…的）→数字的"},
23080:{"w":"global","e":"Does the media in your country pay more attention to global or national events?","t":"你们国家的媒体更关注**全球**事件还是国内事件？","r":"词根记忆：glob（球体）+al（…的）→全球的","c":"global warming 全球变暖；global village 地球村，世界村"},
23081:{"w":"cluster","e":"Their villages were little more than clusters of thatched huts.","t":"他们的村子比茅草屋**群**强不了多少。","r":"联想记忆：clu（看作clue，线索）+ster→由一条线索贯穿的→串，群","c":"a cluster of 一束…"},
23082:{"w":"handout","e":"You should each have a handout with names and addresses.","t":"你们每个人手里都应该有一张写着名字和地址的**单子**。","r":"组合词：hand（手）+out（向外）→从手里发出去→传单；救济品"},
23083:{"w":"endure","e":"The pain was almost too great to endure.","t":"这种疼痛几乎难以**忍受**。","r":"词根记忆：en（使）+dur（持久）+e→持久"},
23084:{"w":"helicopter","e":"There used to be a big factory manufacturing helicopter engines here.","t":"这里曾经有一家生产**直升飞机**引擎的大工厂。","r":"词根记忆：helic（螺旋）+opter→带螺旋翼的飞机→直升飞机"},
23085:{"w":"sprawl","e":"Urban sprawl means that life without a car is next to impossible.","t":"城市的**无计划扩张**意味着生活中如果没有车几乎寸步难行。","r":"联想记忆：伸展手脚趴在地上（sprawl）潦草地写（scrawl）"},
23086:{"w":"crowded","e":"We live in an increasingly crowded and complicated world.","t":"我们生活在一个日益**拥挤**和复杂的世界里。","r":"联想记忆：crowd（人群）+ed→拥挤的人群→拥挤的"},
23087:{"w":"knob","e":"This machine has lots of knobs on it.","t":"这台机器上有许多**旋钮**。","r":"联想记忆：没有门把手（knob），只能敲门（knock）"},
23088:{"w":"ideal","e":"She is the ideal person for the job.","t":"她是这项工作的**最佳**人选。","r":"联想记忆：idea（思想）+l→心里想看到的→理想的","c":"an ideal companion 一位理想伙伴","d":"idealistic（adj. 唯心论的，空想主义的）；ideally（adv. 理想地，完美地）"},
23089:{"w":"midst","e":"In the midst of the glade were several huts.","t":"森林空地的**中间**有几间小木屋。","r":"词根记忆：mid（中间）+st→中间"},
23090:{"w":"fluctuate","e":"Australia's environment fluctuates enormously from year to year.","t":"澳大利亚的环境每年**变化**都很大。","r":"词根记忆：fluctu（波浪）+ate（使…）→使像波浪一样→（使）涨落","y":"waver（vi. 摇摆，摆动）；vary（v. 变化）"},
23091:{"w":"neglect","e":"After years of neglect, single speed cycles still manage to function, though not always too efficiently.","t":"在被**忽视**多年之后，单速自行车尽管往往效率不高，但依然发挥着作用。","r":"词根记忆：neg（拒绝）+lect（选择）→选择不去做某事→忽视","c":"neglect one's duty 玩忽职守","y":"ignore（vt. 不理，忽视）；overlook（vt. 忽略，未注意"},
23092:{"w":"drought","e":"The government has pledged two hundred and fifty million dollars to help the drought-stricken farmers.","t":"政府承诺发放2.5亿美元的救济金，以帮助遭受**旱灾**侵袭的农民。","r":"联想记忆：dr（看作dry，干燥的）+ought（应该）→干旱时到处都应该很干燥→干旱"},
23093:{"w":"hug","e":"She gave her mother an affectionate hug after winning the prize.","t":"获奖后，她紧紧地**拥抱**了母亲。"},
23094:{"w":"variability","e":"Without genetic variability the species will lose the capacity to evolve.","t":"如果没有基因**变异**，物种就会失去进化能力。","r":"词根记忆：vari（变化）+ability（可…性，易…性）→可变性，易变性"},
23095:{"w":"indication","e":"Their failure to act is the indication of their lack of interest.","t":"他们不行动**表示**他们没兴趣。"},
23096:{"w":"insert","e":"To prevent the queen from crawling up to the top and laying eggs, a screen can be inserted between the brood chamber and the supers.","t":"为了防止蜂王爬到蜂房顶端产卵，可以在育卵室和蜂房上层活动架中间**插入**一块隔板。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+sert（插入）→插入"},
23097:{"w":"certificate","e":"We provide a four-month certificate course, but you should be aware that this is designed for those who are employed.","t":"我们提供为期四个月的**资格认证**课程，但是你要明白这一课程是专为在职人员开设的。","r":"词根记忆：cert（搞清）+ific（产生…的）+ate（表名词）→搞清某人做某事的资格→证书","c":"teaching certificate 执教证书；birth certificate 出生证明；marriage certificate 结婚证；certificate of childcare 儿童保育证书"},
23098:{"w":"severe","e":"The research completed last year found that in the United States soil erosion was almost as severe as in India.","t":"去年完成的调查显示，美国土壤侵蚀的状况和印度的一样**严重**。","c":"severe consequence 严重后果；severe storm 剧烈的暴风雨","d":"severely（adv. 严重地；严格地；激烈地）"},
23099:{"w":"diameter","e":"The diameter of the pipe is three inches.","t":"这根管子的**直径**为三英寸。","r":"词根记忆：dia（穿过）+meter（测量）→穿过圆的中心进行测量→直径"},
23100:{"w":"gesture","e":"Sometimes you may simply bow, or make no gesture at all, when you're introduced to a stranger.","t":"在介绍你和陌生人认识时，你可以微微点头，也可以不做任何**动作**。"},
23101:{"w":"disclose","e":"She didn't disclose the details on tax bills.","t":"她未**透露**那些税收法案的细节。","r":"词根记忆：dis（不）+clos（关闭）+e→不关闭→公开","y":"reveal（vt. 展现，揭示）；uncover（vt. 揭开，揭露）","f":"conceal（vt. 隐藏，隐瞒）；hide（v. 隐藏，掩藏）"},
23102:{"w":"sheer","e":"Mary won the skating competition by sheer luck.","t":"玛丽能在这次滑冰比赛中获胜**纯属**运气好。","r":"联想记忆：she（她）+er（表人）→她是个十足的聪明人→十足的"},
23103:{"w":"successive","e":"China's industrial exports went up for five successive years.","t":"中国的工业出口额**连续**五年呈上升趋势。"},
23104:{"w":"balance","e":"If you have a well-balanced diet, then you should be getting all the vitamins that you need for normal daily activities.","t":"如果你饮食**均衡**合理，就会获得每天正常活动所需的所有维生素。","r":"联想记忆：bal（看作ball，球）+ance→球操选手需要很好的平衡能力→平衡","c":"lose balance 失去平衡；keep balance 保持平衡；balance of payments 国际收支差额"},
23105:{"w":"adjust","e":"Research shows that older readers are having difficulty in adjusting to texts without pictures.","t":"调查显示，年纪较大的读者比较难**适应**不带图画的文章。","r":"词根记忆：ad（表加强）+just（正确）→使正确→校准","c":"adjust a policy 调整政策；adjust expenses to income 量入为出；adjust a watch 调表；adjust to 适应，调节"},
23106:{"w":"require","e":"Every house built near the airport requires the exterior walls to be double-brick to reduce noise.","t":"所有建造在机场附近的住房都**要求**采用双层砖的外墙来降低噪音。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+quir（寻求）+e→一再寻求自己需要的→需要","d":"requirement（n. 需要；要求）"},
23107:{"w":"fairly","e":"I felt she hadn't treated me fairly.","t":"我觉得她没有**公平**地对待我。"},
23108:{"w":"precise","e":"The company serves its clients with professional and precise attitudes.","t":"该公司本着专业和**严谨**的态度为客户服务。","c":"to be precise 准确地说；precise measurement 准确的测量；a very precise man 一个非常严谨的人","d":"precisely（adv. 精确地；正好）"},
23109:{"w":"colour-blind","e":"People who are colour-blind may not be able to see the difference between particular colours.","t":"**色盲**患者无法辨认某些特定的颜色。"},
23110:{"w":"trustworthy","e":"Mr. Yang is an experienced and trustworthy guide.","t":"杨先生是一位经验丰富且**值得信赖**的向导。"},
23111:{"w":"vomit","e":"The strange smell made her want to vomit.","t":"这种奇怪的味道让她很**恶心**。","r":"联想记忆：v+o（形似嘴）+mit（词根mit指“发送”）→张嘴发送→呕吐","c":"vomit up 呕吐"},
23112:{"w":"wrestle","e":"The police officer tackled the man and wrestled him to the ground.","t":"警方制服了那个男人并将他**摔倒**在地。","c":"wrestle with 与…摔跤；与…斗争"},
23113:{"w":"adolescence","e":"Adolescence brings about major changes in a young person's body and mind.","t":"**青春期**给年轻人的身心带来巨大改变。","r":"联想记忆：ado（看作adult，成人）+lescence（看作licence，许可证）→青少年即将拿到成年的许可证→青春，青春期"},
23114:{"w":"captivity","e":"Animals bred in captivity would probably not survive if they were released into the wild.","t":"**圈养**的动物如果被放生野外，它们将很难生存下来。","r":"词根记忆：capt（抓住）+ivity（表名词）→被抓住→拘留"},
23115:{"w":"commerce","e":"In the US, Washington is the seat of government and New York is the chief seat of commerce.","t":"在美国，华盛顿是政府所在地，纽约是主要的**商业**中心。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+merc（交易）+e→贸易"},
23116:{"w":"condensation","e":"The essay was publicly recognized as a readable condensation of the recent scientific literature.","t":"这篇散文被公认为是近期科普读物的**浓缩**通俗版。","r":"来自condense（v. 浓缩；凝结；简缩）"},
23117:{"w":"facial","e":"I can not guess what he means from his facial expressions.","t":"从他的**面部**表情我猜不出他是什么意思。","r":"词根记忆：fac（面）+ial（…的）→面部的","c":"facial expressions 面部表情"},
23118:{"w":"imprecise","e":"The witness's descriptions were too imprecise to be of any real value.","t":"目击者的描述太**不精确**了，没有任何实际价值。","r":"联想记忆：im（不）+precise（精确的，严密的）→不精确的，不严密的"},
23119:{"w":"inactive","e":"The volcano has been inactive for 50 years.","t":"这座火山已经有50年**不活动**了。"},
23120:{"w":"herbal","e":"Herbal medicine is well recognized as a non-toxic treatment.","t":"**草药**被公认为一种无毒害的治疗方法。","c":"herbal medicine 草药；herbal practitioner 草药医生"},
23121:{"w":"hover","e":"It is August 15th in the Chinese lunar calendar and there is a full moon hovering in the sky.","t":"今天是农历八月十五，一轮满月**悬**在夜空中。","r":"联想记忆：爱人（lover）在自己身边徘徊（hover）","y":"linger〔vi.（因不愿离开而）继续逗留，徘徊〕；flutter〔v.（鸟等）振翼，翩然而飞〕"},
23122:{"w":"initiate","e":"The government has initiated a programme of social welfare policy.","t":"政府已经在社会福利政策上**发起**一项新的计划。","r":"词根记忆：init（开始）+iate（表动词）→开始"},
23123:{"w":"longitude","e":"Longitude means the distance of an imaginary line from the top to the bottom of the Earth.","t":"**经线**是人们想象出来的从地球顶部到其底部的距离。","r":"联想记忆：long（长）+itude（表名词）→连接南北两极的长线叫经线→经线"},
23124:{"w":"procrastinate","e":"People were dying of starvation in the disaster area while governments procrastinated.","t":"灾区的人们快要饿死了，而政府行动却**拖拖拉拉**。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+crastin（来自拉丁语crastinus，明天）+ate（表动词）→拖到明天再干→拖延"},
23125:{"w":"rarity","e":"Nowadays, men who do the cooking are something of a rarity.","t":"现在会做饭的男人十分**稀少**。"},
23126:{"w":"seclude","e":"The monks secluded themselves from the rest of society.","t":"僧侣们将自己与世**隔绝**。","r":"词根记忆：se（分离）+clud（关闭）+e→分开过着封闭的生活→使隔离","d":"secluded（adj. 与世隔绝的；僻静的）"},
23127:{"w":"ongoing","e":"Manufacturers usually consider quality control to be an ongoing process.","t":"制造商们通常认为质量管理是一个**不断发展**的过程。","r":"组合词：on（在…中）+going（进行，进展）→进行中的"},
23128:{"w":"feed","e":"To feed an increasingly hungry world, farmers need every incentive to use their soil and water effectively and efficiently.","t":"为了**养活**世界上日益增加的人口，农民需要利用每一个激励措施来有效并且高效地使用他们的土地和水资源。","c":"feed into 向…提供；feed on 以…为食"},
23129:{"w":"scenery","e":"The scenery is as beautiful as a painting.","t":"这里**风景**美丽如画。","r":"联想记忆：scene（景色）+ry（表名词）→景色","c":"natural scenery 自然风景；magnificent scenery 壮丽的风景；impressive scenery 令人难忘的风景"},
23130:{"w":"stagnate","e":"Real wages have stagnated since that year.","t":"实际工资从那一年开始就一直**停滞**不前。"},
23131:{"w":"tap","e":"Water from these subterranean lakes can be pumped to the surface and tapped.","t":"可以将这些地下湖泊中的水抽出地面加以**利用**。"},
23132:{"w":"owe","e":"I owed the bank rather a lot of money a few years ago.","t":"几年前，我**欠**了银行一大笔钱。"},
23133:{"w":"ministry","e":"People can call the Ministry of Justice for free legal advice.","t":"人们可以打电话到司法**部**进行免费的法律咨询。"},
23134:{"w":"individual","e":"The food is served in individual portions.","t":"食物是按**一人**一份供给的。","r":"联想记忆：in+divid(e)（分开）+ual→分开的→个别的，单独的","c":"individual effort 个人的努力；individual interest 个人利益","d":"individually（adv. 各自地；独特地）；individualistic（adj.个人主义的）"},
23135:{"w":"association","e":"Our long association with your company has brought great benefits.","t":"我方和贵公司的长期**合作**已经带来了巨大的利益。"},
23136:{"w":"tempt","e":"Some worry that governments and industries will be tempted to use the technology to monitor individual behaviours.","t":"一些人担心，政府和企业会受**诱惑**而使用这一技术来监控个人行为。","r":"本身为词根，意为“尝试”→受到诱惑而尝试→吸引；引诱","y":"appeal（vi. 有吸引力）；entice（vt. 诱惑，怂恿）"},
23137:{"w":"beneath","e":"Shall we have a rest in the shade beneath these trees?","t":"我们在树阴**下**休息一下好吗？","r":"联想记忆：be（构成介词）+neath（在…之下）→在下方"},
23138:{"w":"naturally","e":"Is extinction a naturally occurring phenomenon?","t":"物种灭绝是一种**自然**发生的现象吗？"},
23139:{"w":"estate","e":"My accountant estimated the value of my estate.","t":"我的会计师评估了我的**个人财产**值。","c":"estate agent 房地产经纪人；real estate 房地产，房地产所有权"},
23140:{"w":"discourage","e":"Tom was discouraged from using the new car because of its bad assembly.","t":"汤姆**打消**了驾驶这辆新车的念头，因为它的配置很差。","r":"联想记忆：dis（剥夺）+courage（勇气）→使失去勇气→使泄气"},
23141:{"w":"candidate","e":"These forms have to be filled out by the candidates.","t":"这些表格需要由**申请者**来填写。","r":"联想记忆：can（能）+did（做）+ate→踏实能干才能当候选人→候选人","c":"a candidate for …的候选人"},
23142:{"w":"melt","e":"Salt helps melt ice.","t":"盐可以使冰**融化**。","d":"melting（adj. 熔化的；融化的）"},
23143:{"w":"shrug","e":"Joey and Monica looked at each other and shrugged.","t":"乔伊和莫妮卡互相对视，**耸了耸肩**。"},
23144:{"w":"frightened","e":"The frightened child spoke in a halting voice.","t":"这个**受了惊吓**的孩子说话结结巴巴。"},
23145:{"w":"relax","e":"Watching TV can help me relax.","t":"看电视可以帮助我**放松**。","r":"词根记忆：re（一再）+lax（松开）→一再放开→（使）放松","d":"relaxation（n. 放松；休息）"},
23146:{"w":"aerospace","e":"This article is mainly about the applications of AI to aerospace.","t":"这篇文章主要论述了人工智能在**航空航天**领域的应用。","r":"联想记忆：aero（空气）+space（太空）→宇宙空间"},
23147:{"w":"suppose","e":"I suppose you're going to tell me the whole history of banana growing now, aren't you?","t":"我**猜**你是打算现在给我讲解香蕉种植的整个历史，对吗？","r":"词根记忆：sup（下面）+pos（放置）+e→私下将某种猜测放在心中→猜想","c":"be supposed to do sth. 应该做…"},
23148:{"w":"tenable","e":"Tom thought his approach was tenable.","t":"汤姆认为他的方法是**站得住脚**的。","r":"词根记忆：ten（拿住）+able（能…的）→能拿住的→可防守的"},
23149:{"w":"sustain","e":"Thousands of lakes are so polluted that they can no longer sustain fish life.","t":"数千个湖泊受到非常严重的污染，已无法再**维持**鱼类的生存。","r":"词根记忆：sus（下）+tain（拿住）→拿住下面→撑住","c":"sustain hardships 忍受艰苦；sustain a person's spirit 使某人振作；sustain growth 维持增长","d":"sustainable（adj. 可持续的）"},
23150:{"w":"straw","e":"Agnes has a wheelbarrow full of straw and manure.","t":"阿格尼丝有满满一推车的**稻草**和肥料。"},
23151:{"w":"border","e":"We passed the border into Mexico.","t":"我们穿越**边境**进入了墨西哥。","r":"联想记忆：b+order（命令）→听从命令不许出边界→边缘；边界"},
23152:{"w":"dispenser","e":"Japan's largest maker of cash dispensers is developing new machines that incorporate iris scanners.","t":"日本最大的**提款机**制造商正在开发配有虹膜扫描仪的新机器。","r":"词根记忆：dis（分开）+pens（称重）+er（表人）→按重量分发的人→分配者"},
23153:{"w":"receiver","e":"He put his hand over the receiver in order to get the signal better.","t":"他将手放到**接收器**上以便收到更清晰的信号。"},
23154:{"w":"monopoly","e":"In some countries, stamps are a government monopoly.","t":"在一些国家，邮票为政府**垄断品**。","r":"词根记忆：mono（单个）+poly（多）→独占某商品绝大多数的市场份额→垄断","c":"capital monopoly 资本垄断"},
23155:{"w":"bureaucracy","e":"Since you hate bureaucracy, you must learn to work with bureaucracy to save it from itself.","t":"既然你们痛恨**官僚主义**，那你们就必须学会与官僚主义共事，只有这样才能将其克服。","r":"词根记忆：bureau（桌子，引申为“政府的局”）+cracy（统治）→官僚机构"},
23156:{"w":"construction","e":"They spent years completing the construction of the new airport.","t":"他们花了数年的时间才**建**成新机场。"},
23157:{"w":"endorse","e":"The socio-ecological view of health was endorsed at the first International Conference of Health Promotion.","t":"关于健康的社会生态学观点在第一届世界健康促进会上得到了**认可**。","c":"endorse a candidate 支持候选人"},
23158:{"w":"membership","e":"You can pay the membership fee by cheque.","t":"你可以用支票交**会员**费。"},
23159:{"w":"embryo","e":"Two American researchers studied the brains of human embryos and discovered that the left-right asymmetry exists before birth.","t":"两位美国研究人员在对人类**胚胎**的大脑进行研究后发现，左右脑不对称的现象在出生前就存在。","r":"词根记忆：em（使…）+bry（发芽）+o（表抽象名词）→事物的萌芽期","c":"in embryo 在胚胎阶段，在萌芽时期","d":"embryonic（adj. 胚胎期的；萌芽期的）"},
23160:{"w":"intelligence","e":"The scientists are using genetics to improve the intelligence of mice.","t":"科学家们正在利用基因技术提高老鼠的**智力**。","r":"词根记忆：intel（在…之间）+lig（选择）+ence（表名词）→在事物间做出明智的选择→智力"},
23161:{"w":"mature","e":"Jane is very mature for her age.","t":"简年龄不大，却很**成熟**。","r":"联想记忆：自然（nature）中的n更换成m就是成熟的（mature）","c":"mature students 成年学生；on mature consideration/reflection经过审慎考虑，经过深思熟虑"},
23162:{"w":"discard","e":"10% of the data was discarded as unreliable.","t":"10%的数据因不可靠而被**废弃**。","r":"联想记忆：dis（离开）+card（纸牌）→出牌，把牌扔出去→丢弃，遗弃"},
23163:{"w":"roast","e":"Roast dinner sounds ordinary but it is really tasty.","t":"**烧烤**大餐听起来很普通，但味道的确很好。","r":"联想记忆：在海岸（coast）边烤（roast）肉"},
23164:{"w":"assault","e":"With the recent increase in sexual assaults, the police have taken action to curb the crime and protect women.","t":"随着近来性**攻击**事件的增加，警方已采取措施遏制犯罪，保护女性。","r":"词根记忆：as（表加强）+sault（=sult，跳）→跳向某人→袭击","c":"assault carrier 航空母舰；assault force 突击部队","y":"attack（n./v. 攻击，抨击）"},
23165:{"w":"predator","e":"To avoid being taken over by their counterpart predator, the company has made great effort and got fully prepared.","t":"为了免遭同行**掠夺者**的接管，公司已经做了充分的准备工作。","r":"词根记忆：pred（掠夺）+ator（表人）→掠夺者"},
23166:{"w":"computerize","e":"It's reported that 80% of sections in the company have been completely computerized.","t":"据报道，该公司80%的部门已经完全**计算机化**了。","r":"来自computer（n. 计算机）","d":"computerization（n. 计算机化）"},
23167:{"w":"popularize","e":"The Internet has an important role to play in popularizing new scientific knowledge and spreading new information.","t":"网络在**普及**新的科学知识以及传播新信息方面起着重要的作用。","r":"词根记忆：popul（人民）+ar（…的）+ize（使…）→使广为人民所知→使普及","d":"popularization（n. 普及）"},
23168:{"w":"devalue","e":"Let's not devalue his work unjustly.","t":"我们不要不公正地**贬低**他的工作。","r":"词根记忆：de（去掉）+val（价值）+ue→去掉价值→使贬值","d":"devaluation（n. 贬值）"},
23169:{"w":"ferry","e":"In Venice, which is famous as the city of water, the children there need to be ferried between school and home every day.","t":"在著名的水城威尼斯，孩子们每天都要**乘船**来往于学校和家之间。","r":"词根记忆：fer（带来）+ry（表地点）→把人从河这边带到河那边→摆渡"},
23170:{"w":"iron","e":"It will take me about half an hour to iron that dress.","t":"**烫平**那条连衣裙，我大概要花上半个小时的时间。","c":"iron sth. out 熨平（衣服等的皱褶）"},
23171:{"w":"bully","e":"When confronted with bullying and threats, some people will choose to give in or keep silent.","t":"当面对**恐吓**和威胁时，一些人选择屈服或沉默。","r":"联想记忆：他仗着自己力大如公牛（bull）欺负（bully）别人","y":"intimidate（vt. 恐吓，威胁）；bluster（n./v. 威吓，吓唬）"},
23172:{"w":"storyline","e":"The pure, innocent love of a young couple became the main storyline of this film.","t":"一对年轻夫妻纯真无瑕的爱情是这部电影的主要**故事情节**。","r":"组合词：story（故事）+line（线条）→故事情节"},
23173:{"w":"orbit","e":"There have been hundreds of satellites put into orbit round the earth this year.","t":"今年数以百计的人造卫星被送入环绕地球的**轨道**。","r":"本身为词根，表示“圆周”，引申为“轨道”"},
23174:{"w":"combat","e":"The state government is spending millions of dollars in its attempt to combat gun abuse.","t":"州政府花费数百万美元试图**防止**滥用枪支。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+bat（打）→战斗","d":"combatant（n. 参战者，战士）；combative（adj. 好斗的）"},
23175:{"w":"slothful","e":"The white-collar workers in big cities tend to suffer from fatigue easily which makes them slothful in the office.","t":"大城市的白领阶层往往容易患上疲劳症，使他们在工作中反应**迟钝**。"},
23176:{"w":"catastrophic","e":"The effects of global warming, while not immediate, are potentially catastrophic.","t":"全球气温上升的后果虽然并非即时发生，但可能潜伏着**大灾难**。"},
23177:{"w":"abide","e":"Anyone can abide by what he or she said, but it doesn't mean all of them are correct.","t":"任何人都可以**坚持**自己所说的话，但这并不意味着他们全都是正确的。","r":"词根记忆：a（表加强）+bide（停留）→停留","c":"abide by 遵守，遵循"},
23178:{"w":"allure","e":"According to the statistics, the allure of the big city has weakened because of high housing prices.","t":"数据显示，高房价降低了大城市的**吸引力**。","d":"alluring（adj. 有吸引力的，迷人的）","y":"charm（n. 魅力）；attract（vt. 吸引）"},
23179:{"w":"oxygen","e":"Oxygen masks are used by the scientists for a shortage of oxygen at the top of the mountain.","t":"由于山顶缺氧，科学家需要戴**氧气**罩。","r":"词根记忆：oxy（酸）+gen（产生）→产生酸的→氧，氧气"},
23180:{"w":"pervasive","e":"Ageism is pervasive and entrenched in our society.","t":"年龄歧视在我们的社会中非常**普遍**，而且根深蒂固。","r":"词根记忆：per（贯穿）+vas（走）+ive（…的）→走遍的→遍布的"},
23181:{"w":"encroach","e":"It has been proved that human activities have encroached upon the survival of the creatures in nature.","t":"经证实，人类的活动已经**侵害**了自然界中生物的生存。","r":"词根记忆：en（进入）+croach（=croch，钩子）→使钩子进入→侵入"},
23182:{"w":"fantastic","e":"Kids like spending a great deal of pocket money on fantastic toys instead of useful books.","t":"孩子们喜欢花大量的零花钱购买**奇特**的玩具，而不是有用的书籍。","d":"fantastically（adv. 极其）","y":"marvelous（adj. 惊人的，奇迹般的）；super（adj. 极好的，上等的）","f":"awful（adj. 极坏的，可怕的）；ordinary（adj. 普通的，平常的）"},
23183:{"w":"abhorrent","e":"As far as I'm concerned, the practice of killing rare wild animals for food and money is utterly abhorrent and should be punished by law.","t":"我认为，为获取食物和金钱而猎杀珍稀野生动物的行径**可恶**至极，应该受到法律的制裁。","r":"词根记忆：ab（表加强）+horr（颤抖）+ent（具有…性质的）→让人发抖的→可恶的"},
23184:{"w":"inflict","e":"Doctors warned parents that daily life could inflict various injuries on children aged two or three.","t":"医生警告父母：日常生活可能会给两三岁的儿童**造成**各种伤害。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+flict（打击）→使受打击→使遭受","c":"inflict oneself on sb. 打搅，搅扰","d":"infliction〔n.（强加于人身的）痛苦，刑罚〕","y":"impose（v. 把…强加于）"},
23185:{"w":"tilt","e":"Government's fiscal policy will be tilting toward agricultural development.","t":"政府的财政政策将**倾向**于农业发展。"},
23186:{"w":"offensive","e":"Every year, BBC receives plenty of complaints from the public about their offensive remarks during the interviews.","t":"BBC每年都会收到公众对采访中出现的**冒犯性**话语的大量投诉。","r":"词根记忆：of（表加强）+fens（打击）+ive（…的）→打击别人的→冒犯的","d":"offensively（adv. 冒犯地）；offensiveness（n. 冒犯；无礼）","f":"inoffensive（adj. 无害的）"},
23187:{"w":"jargon","e":"If you take a presentation on some specific fields, to avoid confusing the audience, you should try to decrease jargon in your speech.","t":"在做有关某一特定领域的报告时，为避免听众产生疑惑和不解，你应该尽量少用**术语**。","c":"legal jargon 法律术语"},
23188:{"w":"extravagant","e":"The majority of people maintain that mass media has no rights to report the extravagant lifestyle and privacy of a star.","t":"绝大多数人认为大众媒体无权报道明星**奢侈**的生活方式以及隐私。","c":"extravagant price 过高的价格；extravagant act 行为放肆","d":"extravagantly（adv. 挥霍无度地）；extravagance（n. 奢侈，铺张）","y":"excessive（adj. 过分的，过多的）；lavish（adj. 过分慷慨的，奢侈的）"},
23189:{"w":"begrimed","e":"In recent years, more and more begrimed articles and videos have spread by means of the Internet and mobile phones.","t":"近年来，越来越多内容**污秽**的文章和视频通过互联网和手机进行传播。"},
23190:{"w":"ruthless","e":"Most of the surveyed citizens argued that the government had shown a ruthless disregard for their basic human rights.","t":"大部分接受调查的公民争论道，政府**残忍**地无视他们的基本人权。","r":"联想记忆：ruth（怜悯）+less（无）→没有怜悯的→无情的，冷酷的，残忍的","d":"ruthlessly（adv. 残忍地）","y":"cruel（adj. 残酷的）"},
23191:{"w":"diverse","e":"Millions of years ago, changes in the Earth's climate gave rise to diverse species in the tropical rain forest.","t":"数百万年前，地球气候的变化导致了这片热带雨林物种的**多样**性。","r":"词根记忆：di（分开）+vers（转）+e→转开了→不同的","c":"diverse cultures 不同的文化","d":"diversity〔n. 差异（性），多样（性）〕"},
23192:{"w":"extinguish","e":"This is non-smoking section. Please extinguish all cigarettes.","t":"这里是非吸烟区，请将所有香烟**熄灭**。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+ting（刺）+uish→把刺拔出→把火苗熄灭→熄灭"},
23193:{"w":"estrange","e":"If the government continues to increase the tax, it will estrange itself from the public in the end.","t":"如果政府继续增加税收，终将**脱离**民众。"},
23194:{"w":"neoclassical","e":"Besides grandeur of scale and simplicity of geometric forms, the use of columns is also the representative feature of neoclassical architecture.","t":"除了规模的宏伟和几何形状的简洁性外，使用圆柱也是**新古典**建筑的标志性特征。"},
23195:{"w":"biased","e":"Mothers might be biased to always think their children are the best in the world.","t":"妈妈们可能有些**偏颇**，她们总是认为自己的孩子是世界上最棒的。"},
23196:{"w":"grimy","e":"The increasingly serious air pollution is threatening the health of people living in the grimy industrial cities.","t":"日益严重的空气污染正威胁着生活于**肮脏**的工业城市中的人们的健康。"},
23197:{"w":"enhancer","e":"Although not all people like the flavour of onion, ginger or garlic, they are good immune system enhancers.","t":"尽管不是所有人都喜欢洋葱、姜、蒜的味道，但它们都具有极佳的**增强**免疫的功能。","c":"flavour enhancers 增味剂"},
23198:{"w":"ulterior","e":"In current society, when one actively supports someone who needs help, he may be suspected of having an ulterior motive by some people.","t":"在当今社会，当一个人积极帮助需要帮助的人时，有些人可能怀疑他**别有**用心。","r":"词根记忆：ulter（超出）+ior（较…的）→较远的"},
23199:{"w":"corrupt","e":"People are usually annoyed by the sudden incident that the data on the hard drive of their computers is corrupted by the power cut.","t":"电脑硬盘驱动器上的数据因断电而**损坏**，这类突发事件常常让人很恼怒。","r":"词根记忆：cor（表加强）+rupt（断）→彻底断裂→腐化"},
23200:{"w":"stringent","e":"A stringent regulation on security has guaranteed the success of the Olympic Games.","t":"**严格**的安保制度确保了奥运会的成功举办。","r":"词根记忆：string（拉紧）+ent（具有…性质的）→不断拉紧的→苛刻的"},
23201:{"w":"novice","e":"Beginners might come out ahead in some cases because the novice is less stressed out about winning.","t":"新手们在某些时候反而会领先，因为**新手**没有那么多必赢的心理压力。","r":"词根记忆：nov（新）+ice（表人）→新手"},
23202:{"w":"hinder","e":"The survey reveals that most of the candidates' job applications have been hindered by their lack of relevant working experience.","t":"调查显示，大部分求职者因缺乏相关的工作经验而导致其工作申请**受阻**。","r":"联想记忆：阻碍（hinder）发展，落在后面（behind）","c":"hinder from 阻碍，妨碍","d":"unhindered（adj. 不受妨碍的，不受阻碍的）；hindrance（n. 阻碍）","y":"impede（vt. 阻碍，妨碍，阻止）；encumber（vt. 阻碍，妨碍）；hamper（vt. 妨碍，阻碍）"},
23203:{"w":"tortoise","e":"People in that tribe used to think that the tortoises and turtles came from hell.","t":"那个部落的人过去常认为**陆龟**和海龟来自地狱。"},
23204:{"w":"impoverished","e":"It is necessary to carry out the project of returning farmland to forests since overfarming has created much impoverished soil.","t":"过度耕作已经造成了大量土地的**贫瘠**，所以必须实行退耕还林。","r":"词根记忆：im（在…里面）+pover（贫困）+ish（使…）+ed（…的）→使处于贫困中的→穷困的"},
23205:{"w":"shallow","e":"To the elephant, the stream is quite shallow, so it is able to walk across it. But to the rabbit, it can be a murderer.","t":"对大象来说，河流很**浅**，能够跨过去；但对兔子来说，就很危险，可能会被淹死。","r":"联想记忆：顾影（shadow）自怜，浅薄（shallow）也"},
23206:{"w":"inundate","e":"Due to the successive heavy rain, the dam of the Nile breaks, which inundates large parts of the town and farmlands.","t":"由于连降大雨，尼罗河大坝溃堤，**淹没**了该镇的大部分地区和农田。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+und（溢出）+ate（使…）→溢出去→淹没"},
23207:{"w":"erode","e":"The sharp increase in food price over the last few months has eroded the public's confidence in the government's policy.","t":"过去几个月食品价格大幅上涨，**削弱**了公众对政府政策的信心。","r":"词根记忆：e（去掉）+rod（咬）+e→咬掉→侵蚀","y":"corrode（v. 腐蚀，侵蚀）"},
23208:{"w":"doom","e":"Some people hold that if this kind of rare animal is not well protected, it will be doomed to extinction.","t":"一些人认为，如果这种珍稀动物得不到很好的保护，它**注定**会灭绝。"},
23209:{"w":"alienate","e":"Very talented people may feel alienated from the public.","t":"天资出众的人可能觉得与大众**格格不入**。","r":"词根记忆：alien（陌生的）+ate（使…）→使变得陌生→使疏远","d":"alienated（adj. 疏远的，被隔开的）；alienation（n. 疏远，离间）","y":"estrange（vt. 使疏远）"},
23210:{"w":"commiserate","e":"We deeply commiserated with job hunters who had lost their jobs.","t":"我们对那些失去工作的求职者深表**同情**。","r":"词根记忆：com（表加强）+miser（可怜的）+ate（表动词）→觉得可怜→同情"},
23211:{"w":"outlaw","e":"So far, the government's attempt to outlaw drunken driving has proved to be unsuccessful.","t":"到目前为止，事实证明该政府试图使酒后驾车**成为非法**行为的努力失败了。","r":"组合词：out（出）+law（法律）→超出法律范围→宣布…为非法，使…成为非法"},
23212:{"w":"pavement","e":"According to the report, 30% of graduates will spend about four months pounding the pavement in search of a job.","t":"据报道，30%的毕业生要花大约四个月的时间奔波**街头**寻找一份工作。"},
23213:{"w":"antiquated","e":"In comparison with modern mass media, ordinary radio looks positively antiquated.","t":"与现代大众媒体相比，普通收音机肯定显得**过时**了。"},
23214:{"w":"coral","e":"According to the research, with a big requirement of decoration, there is a falling number of coral in deep ocean in recent years.","t":"据调查，由于装饰品的大量需求，近几年深海**珊瑚**数量锐减。","c":"coral reefs 珊瑚礁"},
23215:{"w":"incinerate","e":"The villages near the volcano were incinerated by the high temperatures generated by the eruption of magma.","t":"火山附近的村子在岩浆喷发产生的高温中**化为灰烬**。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+ciner（灰）+ate（使…）→使成灰→焚化，焚毁"},
23216:{"w":"renewable","e":"Scientists all over the world have made utmost efforts to develop renewable energy sources such as wind and tide power.","t":"全世界的科学家都竭尽全力开发风能和潮汐能等**可再生**能源。","c":"renewable raw materials 可再生原材料"},
23217:{"w":"shin","e":"This is a very inefficient way of running and a major cause of shin splints and heel pain.","t":"这种跑步方式效率非常低，也是导致**胫骨**和足跟疼痛的主要原因。","c":"shin up/down sth. 爬上/爬下"},
23218:{"w":"enslave","e":"Nowadays, more and more people have realized that they are being enslaved by the credit-card debt.","t":"如今，越来越多的人意识到自己正沦为信用卡债务的**奴隶**。","r":"联想记忆：en（使）+slave（奴隶）→使成为奴隶→奴役，征服，使受控制","d":"enslavement（n. 奴役，征服）"},
23219:{"w":"timid","e":"Generally speaking, animals in the zoo are timid and cautious in comparison with wild animals in the forest.","t":"一般而言，动物园的动物比森林中的野生动物**胆小**谨慎。","r":"词根记忆：tim（害怕）+id（…的）→胆小的","d":"timidity（n. 胆小，羞怯）；timidly（adv. 胆小地，羞怯地）","y":"cowardly（adj. 胆小的，怯懦的）；shy（adj. 害羞的）","f":"bold（adj. 大胆的）"},
23220:{"w":"vile","e":"Study shows that children who live in violent surroundings may use more vile language than ordinary children.","t":"研究表明，与普通孩子相比，生活在暴力环境中的孩子可能会使用更多**肮脏**的语言。","r":"词根记忆：vil（卑劣）+e→恶劣的，卑鄙的","d":"vileness（n. 讨厌；卑劣）"},
23221:{"w":"diesel","e":"Because of the development of new energies, fewer and fewer diesel engines are used in daily life.","t":"由于新能源的开发，**柴油机**在日常生活中的使用日益减少。","c":"diesel engine 柴油机"},
23222:{"w":"guzzle","e":"As its cars guzzle fuel, this car company has decreasing sales figures in recent years.","t":"由于其生产的汽车**耗**油量太大，该汽车公司近几年的销售量一直在下滑。","d":"guzzler（n. 耗油量大的汽车；暴饮暴食者）"},
23223:{"w":"torment","e":"It is hard for the rich to understand that the poor from the remote rural areas are undergoing a torment.","t":"富人很难理解偏远农村地区的穷人正遭受着**苦难**。","r":"词根记忆：tor（=tort，扭曲）+ment（表行为）→扭曲的状态→痛苦","c":"be in torment 在痛苦中"},
23224:{"w":"revive","e":"In recent years, the government has encouraged folk artists to revive traditional skills by funding them.","t":"近年来，政府已通过资金援助鼓励民间艺人**复兴**传统工艺。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+viv（生命）+e→重新获得生命→复活","d":"revival〔n. 复活，复兴；（健康、力量或知觉的）恢复〕","y":"restore（vt. 恢复；使复职）；revitalize（vt. 使恢复生机）","f":"languish（vi. 憔悴，枯萎；变得衰弱）"},
23225:{"w":"inhumane","e":"In sweatshops, skinny men, starved women and small minors are in the same inhumane conditions.","t":"血汗工厂里，骨瘦如柴的男人、食不果腹的女人和瘦小的孩子都在同样**惨无人道**的环境中工作。","d":"inhumanity（n. 残酷的行为，无人性，不人道）"},
23226:{"w":"imperil","e":"Some people think that the government's housing policy now might imperil the whole real estate market.","t":"一些人认为政府的住房政策可能**危及**当下的整个房地产市场。","r":"词根记忆：im（进入）+peril（危险）→使陷于危险"},
23227:{"w":"diverge","e":"They had been living together for ten years, but then their paths diverged.","t":"他们在一起生活了十年，但最后还是**分道扬镳**了。","r":"词根记忆：di（分开）+verg（转）+e→分别转换方向→分开","c":"diverge from the norm 与常态不符","d":"divergence（n. 分歧；偏离）；divergent（adj. 分叉的；分歧的）"},
23228:{"w":"irrational","e":"The theory that the earth revolves around the sun, put forward by Polish astronomer Copernicus, seemed to be somewhat irrational in the 15th century.","t":"15世纪时，波兰天文学家哥白尼提出的地球绕着太阳运转的理论在当时似乎有点**荒谬**。","r":"联想记忆：ir（不）+rational（合理的）→不合理的","c":"irrational fear 无端的恐惧"},
23229:{"w":"verbal","e":"The engineer was too excited to give a verbal description of what the success of moon landing means.","t":"工程师太兴奋了，以至于无法用**言语**表达登月成功意味着什么。","r":"词根记忆：verb（词语）+al（…的）→言辞的","d":"verbalise（v. 用言辞表达）"},
23230:{"w":"saline","e":"In medicine, saline is mainly used to kill bacteria. It is also widely used in cell biology experiments.","t":"在医学中，**盐水**主要用于杀菌，还广泛应用于细胞生物学实验。","r":"词根记忆：sal（盐）+ine（…的）→含盐的","d":"salinity（n. 含盐量，咸度）"},
23231:{"w":"disable","e":"There were so many people disabled and killed in the war.","t":"这场战争造成了太多人的**伤残**和死亡。","r":"词根记忆：dis（剥夺）+able（有能力的）→剥夺能力→使丧失能力，使伤残"},
23232:{"w":"seduce","e":"Customers were seduced into buying such household appliances as the washing machine and fridge by the offer of a free delivery.","t":"顾客受商家免费送货的**利诱**而购买诸如洗衣机和冰箱之类的家电。","r":"词根记忆：se（分开）+duc（引导）+e→引开→引诱"},
23233:{"w":"relocate","e":"The factory is to relocate its headquarters in the coastal area, which would create redundancy of 60 workers.","t":"工厂将把总部**迁往**沿海地区，这将导致60名员工失业。","r":"联想记忆：re（重新）+locate（安置）→重新安置"},
23234:{"w":"angle","e":"When you are stuck by a problem, you should change the angle to find some valid solutions.","t":"当你被一个难题卡住时，应该换一种**角度**去寻找有效的解决方法。","r":"词根记忆：angl（来自拉丁语angulus，角）+e→角","d":"angular（adj. 有角的；尖角的）"},
23235:{"w":"legitimate","e":"The majority of scientists believe it is legitimate to use monkeys in medical research.","t":"大多数科学家认为使用猴子进行医学研究是**合法**的。","r":"词根记忆：legitim（=legis，法律）+ate（使…）→使合法","d":"legitimately（adv. 合情合理地）；legitimacy（n. 合法；正当）","y":"legal（adj. 法定的，合法的）；lawful（adj. 合法的，法定的）"},
23236:{"w":"sedentary","e":"People doing sedentary jobs usually eat less than those who are in more active occupations.","t":"从事**久坐**工作的人通常比那些从事活动量非常大的人吃得少。","r":"词根记忆：sed（坐）+ent（…的）+ary（…的）→与坐着的状态相关联的→需要久坐的","c":"a sedentary lifestyle 长期伏案的生活方式"},
23237:{"w":"water-borne","e":"Cholera, a water-borne disease, could cause severe diarrhea, vomiting and often death.","t":"霍乱是一种由**水传播**的疾病，能引起严重的腹泻和呕吐，往往还导致死亡。","r":"组合词：water（水）+borne（bear的过去分词，携带）→由水带来的→水运的；水传播的"},
23238:{"w":"molten","e":"With the increasing activities of the inner earth, the earth was shaking, the sea was roaring, and the volcano was pouring out molten rock.","t":"由于地球内部活动的不断加剧，地面在晃动，海水在咆哮，火山在不断地向外喷射**熔**岩。","c":"molten lava 熔岩"},
23239:{"w":"processor","e":"A word processor is the basic part of a computer to produce printed documents.","t":"文字**处理器**是电脑制作印刷文件的基本部分。","r":"来自process（vt. 处理）"},
23240:{"w":"saturate","e":"Since some Asian countries' investment markets have now been saturated, western countries are looking for a bigger market.","t":"由于一些亚洲国家的投资市场现在已经**饱和**，西方国家正在寻求一个更大的市场。","r":"词根记忆：satur（饱足）+ate（使…）→使饱和","c":"saturate...with... 用…使…浸透/饱和","y":"drench（vt. 使湿透，使浸透）；soak（v. 浸透，湿透）"},
23241:{"w":"trivialize","e":"There's a serious social problem today that too many films are trivializing the seriousness of violent and sex scenes.","t":"当今有一个严重的社会问题，那就是过多影片都在**淡化**暴力以及情色场面的严重性。"},
23242:{"w":"obscene","e":"The obscene words in the television programs were bleeped out.","t":"电视节目中的**粗鄙**词语已用哔声消除了。","d":"obscenely（adv. 猥亵地，污秽地）；obscenity（n. 淫秽的语言；下流的行为）"},
23243:{"w":"authentic","e":"Scientists have derived authentic data about the age of the skeleton from carbon dating tests.","t":"科学家利用碳定年法得出了这具骨架的**准确**年代。","d":"authenticity（n. 真实性，可靠性）；authenticate（vt. 证明…是真实的）","y":"real（adj. 真的）；genuine（adj. 真实的）","f":"artificial（adj. 人造的，假的）；fake（adj. 假的）"},
23244:{"w":"righteous","e":"No matter how good and righteous one thinks his action is, he shouldn't break the law.","t":"不管一个人认为他的行为多么友善多么**正义**，他都不应该犯法。","r":"联想记忆：right（正确）+eous（有…性质的）→正直的"},
23245:{"w":"purify","e":"As is well-known, one of the main doctrines of this religion is that people should try to purify their mind.","t":"众所周知，该宗教的一条主要教义是人们要**净化**自己的心灵。","r":"词根记忆：pur（变干净）+ify（使…）→使洁净","d":"purification（n. 净化，提纯）；purist（n. 纯粹主义者）","y":"cleanse（vt. 清洗；净化）；refine（vt. 提纯，提炼；改善）","f":"contaminate（vt. 污染，玷污）"},
23246:{"w":"gregarious","e":"Dr. Green, a famous zoologist at Harvard University, claimed that wild goose remains gregarious during the migration.","t":"哈佛大学著名的动物学家格林博士称，大雁在迁徙中保持**群居**。","r":"词根记忆：greg（组，群）+arious（…的）→群体的→群居的"},
23247:{"w":"heartless","e":"In employees' mind, employers are cold and heartless, showing no concern for their welfare.","t":"在员工的心目中，雇主冷酷**无情**，不关心他们的福利。"},
23248:{"w":"instill","e":"Trust and encouragement can instill confidence into a person, which can serve him or her well for life.","t":"信任和鼓励能使人**逐步树立**起信心，让他们终生受益。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+still（小水滴）→滴进去→滴注"},
23249:{"w":"infringe","e":"Some students argued that the new school rule would infringe on their right to read in the morning.","t":"一些学生争论说，这条新校规将**侵犯**他们晨读的权利。","c":"infringe a rule 违反规章；infringe a law 违法"},
23250:{"w":"comic","e":"Henry's accident of slipping on the banana skin brought some comic relief to this boring performance.","t":"亨利意外踩到香蕉皮滑倒给这场沉闷的表演带来了些许**喜剧**色彩，缓和了氛围。","c":"comic strip（常登载于报纸的）连环漫画"},
23251:{"w":"transplant","e":"Every year, tens of thousands of patients are given organ transplants in developed countries.","t":"发达国家每年有数以万计的病人接受器官**移植**。","r":"词根记忆：trans（转移）+plant（种植）→改种到他处→移植","d":"transplantation（n. 移植；迁移）；transplantable（adj. 可移植的）","y":"graft（v. 移植；嫁接）；transfer（v. 转移，调动）"},
23252:{"w":"spur","e":"Whenever the official holidays approach, many supermarkets spur the sales by means of promotion.","t":"每当法定假日临近，许多超市就通过促销活动来**刺激**销售。","r":"联想记忆：NBA的马刺队就是Spur"},
23253:{"w":"barbaric","e":"The animal protectors consider the idea of killing wild animals for pleasure extremely barbaric.","t":"动物保护者认为以猎杀野生动物为乐的想法极其**野蛮**。"},
23254:{"w":"delinquent","e":"Recent research shows that there has been a sharp increase in the rate of juvenile delinquents related to domestic violence.","t":"最近的一项调查显示，与家庭暴力相关的青少年**犯罪**率剧增。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+linqu（离开）+ent（具有…性质的）→一再离开（正道）的→失职的"},
23255:{"w":"sluttish","e":"The landlord complained that the sluttish tenant had left dirty dishes and rubbish piled up in the kitchen for weeks.","t":"房东抱怨那个**邋遢**的租客把脏碗碟和垃圾在厨房里堆了好几周。","r":"来自slut（n. 邋遢女人，懒婆娘）","c":"sluttish behaviour 放荡的行为"},
23256:{"w":"retaliate","e":"If you look down on people and treat them badly, they'll retaliate and appear just as annoying and hostile as you expected.","t":"如果你瞧不起别人，待他们不好，他们就会**回敬**你，就会像你预料的那样显得令人讨厌，充满敌意。","c":"retaliate against his persecutor 报复迫害者；retaliate against an attack 对攻击展开报复"},
23257:{"w":"perpetrate","e":"Nowadays, there is a common phenomenon in society that more and more criminals make use of new scientific technologies to perpetrate crimes.","t":"如今，社会上出现一个普遍的现象，越来越多的犯罪分子利用新的科学技术**从事**犯罪活动。"},
23258:{"w":"prosper","e":"In other words, without languages, there will be no knowledge on which a society relies to prosper.","t":"换句话说，没有语言，就没有一个社会赖以**繁荣**的知识。","r":"词根记忆：pro（在前）+sper（希望）→希望在前→繁荣"},
23259:{"w":"anchor","e":"When a ship anchors, it means sailors can stay in the town for a short time to live as locals.","t":"轮船**抛锚**，意味着船员们可以在小镇稍作停留，过一下当地人的生活。","r":"发音记忆：“安客”→船抛锚，客安心→抛锚"},
23260:{"w":"despoil","e":"If human beings continue to despoil the natural resources crazily, they will be doomed to be punished by nature.","t":"如果人类继续疯狂地**掠夺**自然资源，他们必将遭到自然的惩罚。"},
23261:{"w":"discourteous","e":"It would be discourteous for young people to ignore their parents' basic request for living together.","t":"年轻人无视父母要求住在一起的基本请求是**无礼**的。","r":"联想记忆：dis（无）+courteous（有礼貌的）→无礼的"},
23262:{"w":"lax","e":"Much to our surprise, some companies have been lax in carrying out their social responsibilities.","t":"令我们大为吃惊的是，一些公司在履行其社会职责方面表现得很**懈怠**。"},
23263:{"w":"boost","e":"Apparently, stock prices were boosted by the President's recovery report and supportive policies from the government.","t":"显而易见，股票价格随着总统的经济复苏报告和政府的扶持政策而一路**上扬**。","r":"联想记忆：自吹（boast）自擂，宣扬（boost）自我","d":"booster（n. 升降压器；支持者）"},
23264:{"w":"smear","e":"Tony explained to the police that, the blood which was smeared on the front of his car belonged to a wild cat.","t":"托尼向警方解释说，他车头**蹭到**的血迹是一只野猫的。","r":"联想记忆：遭到诽谤（smear），发誓（swear）报复"},
23265:{"w":"lenient","e":"According to the recent survey, most of the job applicants prefer to work at companies whose rules and regulations are lenient.","t":"最新调查显示，大多数求职者喜欢在规章制度**宽松**的公司工作。","d":"leniency（n. 宽大；仁慈）"},
23266:{"w":"synthetic","e":"Some clothes in the market including natural fibre silk and synthetic ones could not be crushed easily.","t":"市面上一些含天然纤维真丝和**合成**纤维的衣服不易起皱。","r":"词根记忆：syn（共同）+thet（放）+ic（…的）→放到一起的→合成的","c":"synthetic material 合成材料；synthetic dye 合成染料","d":"synthetically（adv. 综合地，合成地）"},
23267:{"w":"enact","e":"Under the new law, Internet bars must enact relevant policies to prevent young people's admission.","t":"新的法律规定，网吧必须**制定**相关政策制止未成年人进入。","r":"联想记忆：en（使）+act（法令）→使成为法令→通过（法律）"},
23268:{"w":"resent","e":"With other audiences you mustn't attempt to cut in with humour as they will resent an outsider making disparaging remarks about their canteen or their chairman.","t":"对于其他听众，你不能试图用幽默来打断他们的谈话，因为他们会**讨厌**一个外人对他们的餐厅或董事长发表轻蔑的评论。","r":"词根记忆：re（反）+sent（感觉）→反感→愤恨"},
23269:{"w":"affluent","e":"Affluent someone may be born, but he is usually uncertain of how to create an admiring life with it or cherish all he has.","t":"有些人可能生于**富裕**之家，但却往往不知道如何利用其先天优势来创造一个令人称羡的生活或是珍惜所拥有的一切。","r":"词根记忆：af（表加强）+flu（流动）+ent（具有…性质的）→不断流出的→富得流油→富裕的","c":"an affluent fountain 丰富的源泉"},
23270:{"w":"trunk","e":"White poplar is always eulogized by writers for its tall and straight trunk.","t":"白杨树总因其高大笔直的**树干**备受作家们的赞美。","r":"联想记忆：卡车（truck）撞向树干（trunk）"},
23271:{"w":"coexist","e":"Many foreigners believe that traditional Chinese medicine cannot coexist with western medicine in the west.","t":"许多外国人认为，在西方，传统的中医很难与西医**共存**。","r":"联想记忆：co（共同）+exist（存在）→共存"},
23272:{"w":"aviation","e":"It can be seen that Yang Liwei's travel in outer space around the earth's orbit is a milestone of China's aviation.","t":"杨利伟在外太空绕地球轨道航行可以说是中国**航空**史上的一座里程碑。","r":"词根记忆：avi（鸟）+ation（表名词）→像鸟一样飞→飞行"},
23273:{"w":"rampant","e":"If one day inflation is rampant, it means that people's increased wage will be worth nothing soon.","t":"如果有一天通货膨胀**泛滥**成灾，那就意味着人们增长的工资很快就会一文不值。"},
23274:{"w":"prolonged","e":"As the recent experiment shows, prolonged use of the new drug might have harmful side effects on patients.","t":"最新的实验表明，**长期**使用这种新药物可能会对病人产生有害的副作用。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+long（长）+ed（…的）→向前拉长的→长期的","d":"prolongable（adj. 可延长的，可拖延的）；prolongation（n.延长，延伸）","y":"elongate（v. 伸长，拉长）；extend（v. 延展，延长）","f":"shorten〔v.（使）缩短，变短〕"},
23275:{"w":"crushing","e":"The shipyard has been dealt another crushing blow with the failure to win this contract.","t":"由于未能赢得这份合同，造船厂又遭到了一次**惨重**的打击。"},
23276:{"w":"futile","e":"Our attempts to improve performance are futile.","t":"我们为提高业绩而进行的努力都**付诸东流**了。","r":"词根记忆：fut（=fus，流）+ile→流走的→无用的"},
23277:{"w":"edify","e":"Good books not only edify but also entertain their readers.","t":"好书不仅可以**陶冶**读者的情操，还可以娱乐读者。","r":"词根记忆：ed（吃）+ify（使…）→使吃下去→陶冶"},
23278:{"w":"vulgar","e":"It seems pretty vulgar to give a woman your business card in public asking for a date or dinner.","t":"当众给女性名片要求约会或共进晚餐似乎非常**粗俗**。","r":"词根记忆：vulg（人群）+ar（…的）→庸俗的","c":"vulgar tastes 低级趣味；vulgar jokes 粗俗的笑话","d":"vulgarity（n. 庸俗，粗俗）；vulgarly（adv. 粗野地；庸俗地）","y":"coarse（adj. 粗鄙的）","f":"exquisite（adj. 优美的，高雅的，精致的）；elegant（adj.雅致的，高雅的）"},
23279:{"w":"core","e":"Any profit company's core is trying to transform its product into capital.","t":"任何营利性公司的**核心**都是要将其产品转化为资本。","r":"词根记忆：cor（=cord，心）+e→核心","c":"to the core 十足，彻底地"},
23280:{"w":"inborn","e":"Many sociologists claim good living habits are not inborn but can be learned by hard work.","t":"许多社会学家声称，好的生活习惯不是**天生**的，而是可以通过努力习得的。","r":"联想记忆：in+born（出生）→天生的，先天的，天赋的"},
23281:{"w":"habitable","e":"Some areas of the earth are not habitable because of extreme climate conditions, such as low temperature.","t":"地球上的一些区域由于低温之类的极端气候条件而不**适合居住**。","r":"词根记忆：habit（居住）+able（能…的）→适于居住的"},
23282:{"w":"ecological","e":"Some scientists claim that the destruction of the rainforests is an ecological disaster that is threatening the survival of life on earth.","t":"一些科学家声称，雨林的破坏是一场**生态**灾难，正威胁着地球上生命的生存。"},
23283:{"w":"stipulate","e":"The new regulation stipulates that every procedure has to comply with the relevant safety production standards.","t":"新制度**规定**每一个步骤都要遵守相关的安全生产标准。","r":"词根记忆：stip（压）+ulate（使…）→使一起按压→规定"},
23284:{"w":"legitimize","e":"Some parents are concerned that a lot of violent films will be legitimized, which will pose a threat to their children's mental health.","t":"一些家长担心，大量的暴力电影被**合法化**会对孩子的心理健康构成威胁。","r":"词根记忆：legitim（法律）+ize（使…）→使被法律认可→使合法"},
23285:{"w":"crystallize","e":"Sometimes, what we suffered in life is not a total mess, which might help us to crystallize pieces of thoughts.","t":"我们生活中所遭遇的并不一定完全是坏事，有时也可以帮我们**总结**出一些想法。"},
23286:{"w":"solar-powered","e":"A solar-powered battery can transform the energy of sunlight into electric energy.","t":"**太阳能**电池能把光能转化为电能。"},
23287:{"w":"cosy","e":"Learning in a warm and cosy classroom is the best dream these children in impoverished mountainous districts have wished.","t":"能够在温暖**舒适**的教室里学习是贫困山区孩子们最大的愿望。"},
23288:{"w":"roller","e":"The huge roller can press melted metal into thin sheets which are the raw material of knives.","t":"大型**滚筒**可以将熔化的金属压成薄片，作为刀具的原材料。","r":"来自roll（v. 滚动）"},
23289:{"w":"unsanitary","e":"Lack of access to safe water, poor housing, and unsanitary conditions all have a strong bearing on the health of the mother and child.","t":"缺乏安全用水、住房条件差以及**不卫生**的环境都对母亲和儿童的健康有很大的影响。"},
23290:{"w":"condone","e":"If the government condones violent conflict between the two parties, the bloodshed will never stop.","t":"如果政府**纵容**两党之间的暴力冲突，流血事件将永远不会停止。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+don（给予）+e→完全给予→纵容"},
23291:{"w":"bereave","e":"Nobody can bereave wild animals and plants of their survival on the blue planet where we live together.","t":"没人能够**剥夺**野生动植物在我们共有的蓝色星球上生存的权利。","r":"词根记忆：be（使…）+reave（抢夺）→剥夺"},
23292:{"w":"faulty","e":"In addition to faulty brakes, this terrible accident which has caused 3 dead and 1 injured, was attributed to drunk driving.","t":"除了刹车**有问题**之外，酒后驾车也是导致这起三死一伤严重事故的原因。","r":"来自fault（n. 过错）"},
23293:{"w":"enigma","e":"Up to now, researchers and scientists cannot explain the whole enigma of Mayan civilization's disappearance.","t":"研究者和科学家至今都无法解释玛雅文明消失这个**谜团**。"},
23294:{"w":"spare","e":"Thank you very much for sparing so much of your time to talk with me.","t":"非常感谢您**抽出**这么长的时间与我谈话。","c":"spare part 备件，配件；spare time 闲暇时光"},
23295:{"w":"nursery","e":"Whether the state should provide free nursery education or not is being discussed on the table.","t":"国家是否应该提供免费的**幼儿**教育这一问题正在讨论之中。","r":"来自nurse（v. 看护）","c":"nursery teacher 幼儿教师"},
23296:{"w":"semantic","e":"It is well-known that the professor is expert in language teaching and semantic analysis.","t":"众所周知，该教授擅长语言教学和**语义**分析。","r":"词根记忆：sem（符号）+ant+ic（…的）→有关符号的→语义的"},
23297:{"w":"barren","e":"Geographers made great efforts to find that millions of years ago the region was a barren desert.","t":"地理学家经过极大的努力发现，数百万年前该地区是一片**荒芜**的沙漠。","r":"联想记忆：bar（=bare，光秃秃的）+ren→荒芜的；不结果实的","c":"barren land 不毛之地；barren effort 无用之功","y":"fruitless（adj. 不结果实的；徒劳的）；devoid（adj. 全无的，缺乏的）；lacking（adj. 缺乏的）","f":"fertile（adj. 肥沃的，富饶的；多产的）；fecund（adj. 多产的，丰饶的）"},
23298:{"w":"conductive","e":"Scientists found that this kind of new material was more conductive at extremely low temperature than at the ordinary temperature.","t":"科学家发现，这种新材料在极端的低温条件下比在常温下**导电**性更好。"},
23299:{"w":"eccentric","e":"Psychologists are trying to find the reason why some children cultivate eccentric behaviour to separate themselves from their peers.","t":"心理学家正致力于为一些孩子远离同伴孤立自己的**古怪**行为找出原因。","r":"词根记忆：ec（=e，出）+centr（中心）+ic（…的）→偏离中心的→古怪的","d":"eccentrically（adv. 古怪地）；eccentricity（n. 古怪；古怪行为）","y":"abnormal（adj. 反常的，变态的）；peculiar（adj. 奇特的）","f":"ordinary（adj. 平常的，普通的）；normal（adj. 正常的）"},
23300:{"w":"inferior","e":"In general, schooling in suburbs is inferior to that in downtown, interior regions to coastal ones.","t":"一般而言，城郊的学校教育**不如**市中心的，内陆的不如沿海的。","c":"inferior goods 劣质商品；an inferior officer 一位下级军官","d":"inferiority（n. 低等，劣等）"},
23301:{"w":"slacken","e":"The pace of export and import slackened during the last quarter due to trade barrier between the two countries.","t":"由于两国间的贸易壁垒，进出口步伐在上一季度有所**放缓**。"},
23302:{"w":"mentor","e":"Every great leader who has created great achievement has a mentor, who can advise, help and point him to success.","t":"每一个创造了巨大成就的伟大领袖都有一个能够给他建议、帮助他并指引他走向成功的**导师**。","r":"词根记忆：ment（头脑）+or（表人）→在头脑上影响他人的人→导师"},
23303:{"w":"pad","e":"The secretary always puts a pad by the telephone for taking notes.","t":"秘书总是在电话机旁放一个**便笺本**以便做记录。"},
23304:{"w":"unblemished","e":"Some states indicated that, it would be legal to get a remission if a prisoner in jail keeps an unblemished record in three years.","t":"一些州政府表示，如果服刑期的囚犯三年内记录**清白**，就可以合法获得减刑。"},
23305:{"w":"lounge","e":"Some students were used to lounging in the dormitory to surf on the Internet at the weekends.","t":"一些学生习惯于周末待在宿舍，**懒洋洋地坐着**，在网上冲浪。"},
23306:{"w":"dietary","e":"For tourists with special dietary requirements, we will offer a variety of delicious food for them to choose.","t":"对于有特殊**饮食**要求的游客，我们会提供各种美食供其选择。","c":"dietary expert 饮食专家；dietary habit 饮食习惯"},
23307:{"w":"hamper","e":"Fierce storms have been hampering rescue work and there is now little chance of finding more survivors.","t":"猛烈的暴风雨**阻碍**了救援工作，现在找到更多幸存者的机会已经很小了。","r":"联想记忆：篮子（hamper）在左手，锤子（hammer）在右手"},
23308:{"w":"disparage","e":"The charitable work, which public figures, especially actors and singers have done, has been disparaged by the press as an attempt to get publicity.","t":"公众人物，尤其是演员和歌手，所做的慈善工作被媒体**贬抑**为自我宣传。","r":"词根记忆：dis（不）+par（相等）+age（表行为）→使不相等→贬抑"},
23309:{"w":"corporal","e":"Some claim that teachers have no rights to treat naughty students with corporal punishment, while others hold an opposite opinion.","t":"一些人声称教师无权**体**罚顽皮的学生，而另一些人持相反观点。","r":"词根记忆：corpor（身体）+al（…的）→身体的"},
23310:{"w":"libel","e":"Recently, that movie star is determined to sue the mass media for their libels, while he chose to keep silent in the past.","t":"最近，那位电影明星决定指控大众媒体**诽谤**，而在过去他选择保持沉默。"},
23311:{"w":"criterion","e":"Success in studying at school is not an appropriate criterion of achievement in life.","t":"在学校里学习好并不是衡量人生成就的一个恰当的**标准**。","r":"词根记忆：crit（判断）+er（表名词）+ion（表名词）→判断的准则→标准"},
23312:{"w":"eco-friendly","e":"The reusable bag is an eco-friendly product which was famous for its slogan \"I am not a plastic bag!\"","t":"可再利用袋是一种**环保**产品，它曾以“我不是塑料袋”的标语而闻名。"},
23313:{"w":"telegraph","e":"With the development of technology, telegraph as a means of communication has been gradually replaced by mobile phones, the Internet and other media means.","t":"随着技术的进步，**电报**这种交流方式已经逐渐被手机、互联网和其他媒介所取代。","r":"词根记忆：tele（远的）+graph（写）→以书写的方式带来远处的东西→电报"},
23314:{"w":"episodic","e":"An episodic format is the writer's favourite, when he tries to relax by writing.","t":"当这个作家想要用写作来放松自己时，他最爱用一种**松散**的形式来创作。","r":"来自episode（n. 片段；插曲）"},
23315:{"w":"trespass","e":"Farmers have barricaded their fields to stop wild elephants from trespassing on the land in the south of Asia.","t":"在南亚地区，农民在田地里设置障碍物来阻止野象**侵犯**他们的土地。","r":"词根记忆：tres（=trans，越过）+pass（走）→越过去走→侵犯"},
23316:{"w":"millennium","e":"The Millennium Bug was really bothering the scientists in the 1990s, when the electronic technology hadn't been developed as fast as today.","t":"20世纪90年代，电子技术的发展没有现在这样迅速，“**千年**虫”问题在当时确实困扰着科学家们。","r":"词根记忆：mill（千）+enn（年）+ium→一千年"},
23317:{"w":"susceptible","e":"A large number of TV advertisements are aimed at susceptible young women who always buy goods they actually don't need.","t":"大量的电视广告瞄准**易受影响**的年轻女性，她们总是购买一些实际上并不需要的东西。","r":"词根记忆：sus（表加强）+cept（抓）+ible（能…的）→容易被抓住的→易受影响的","c":"be susceptible to 易受…影响，对…过敏；be susceptible of 容许…的，可能…的","d":"susceptibility（n. 易感性）","y":"allergic（adj. 过敏的）；vulnerable（adj. 易受攻击的；易受影响的）","f":"immune（adj. 免疫的，不受影响的）"},
23318:{"w":"antiseptic","e":"In old times, the bodies of most of the emperors were dealt with antiseptic for lasting for ever.","t":"在古代，为了死后长存，大多数皇帝的遗体都要做**防腐**处理。","r":"词根记忆：anti（抗）+sept（腐烂）+ic（某种药）→防腐剂"},
23319:{"w":"indolent","e":"Their indolent attitude was the cause of much unnecessary pain and suffering.","t":"他们**懒惰**的态度是引起很多不必要的痛苦和折磨的原因。","r":"词根记忆：in（不）+dol（悲痛）+ent（具有…性质的）→不悲不喜的→倦怠的"},
23320:{"w":"thrifty","e":"In ancient times, Chinese people were usually brought up to be thrifty and hard-working.","t":"在古代，中国人在成长过程中常常受到勤俭**节约**的教育。","r":"来自thrift（n. 节约，节俭）"},
23321:{"w":"nutritious","e":"In addition to a nutritious diet, a healthy body also depends on appropriate exercise.","t":"除了**营养**的饮食之外，健康的身体还需要适当的运动。","r":"词根记忆：nutri（滋养）+tious（…的）→有营养的"},
23322:{"w":"dupe","e":"Most historians reached the conclusion that the Indians were innocent dupes, blameless in the battle.","t":"许多历史学家都得出这样的结论：印第安人是无辜的**受骗者**，他们无需担负这场战争的责任。"},
23323:{"w":"overfill","e":"It's dangerous to overfill liquid storage tanks.","t":"贮罐**过量充装**液体是危险的。","r":"组合词：over（过度）+fill（装满）→装得太多，装到满溢"},
23324:{"w":"inviolable","e":"What a man has experienced in the privacy must necessarily remain inviolable at any time.","t":"一个人的隐私在任何时候都一定是**不可侵犯**的。","r":"联想记忆：in（不）+violable（易受侵犯的）→不可侵犯的","d":"inviolability（n. 不可侵犯；神圣）"},
23325:{"w":"penalize","e":"It's unfair that the whole medical staff should be penalized just because a nurse made a mistake.","t":"仅仅因为一个护士犯错误，就**惩罚**所有的医务人员，这是不公平的。","r":"词根记忆：penal（=pen，惩罚）+ize（使…）→惩罚"},
23326:{"w":"slander","e":"Nowadays, it is not rare that stars sue the news agency for their slanders on their good reputation in the entertainment circle.","t":"如今，在娱乐圈，明星指控新闻机构**诋毁**他们的名誉已屡见不鲜。"},
23327:{"w":"restore","e":"The government has been trying to restore public confidence in its management of the economy since the breakout of economic crisis.","t":"自经济危机爆发以来，该政府就一直试图**重建**公众对其掌控经济能力的信心。","r":"联想记忆：灾后重建（restore），包括商店（store）","d":"restoration（n. 恢复；修复）"},
23328:{"w":"virtuous","e":"Compared with intelligent people, virtuous and hard-working people will be more welcomed in the office.","t":"与聪明的人相比，**品德高尚**、刻苦工作的员工在办公室更受欢迎。","r":"来自virtue（n. 德行；美德）"},
23329:{"w":"superstitious","e":"The majority of people don't believe in the old superstitious saying that the number 13 is unlucky.","t":"大多数人都不相信“数字13不吉利”这一古老的**迷信**说法。","c":"superstitious beliefs 迷信观念"},
23330:{"w":"bead","e":"Don't trifle with that string of purple beads which is worth more than five million dollars.","t":"别小瞧了那串紫色的**珠子**，它价值高达500多万美元。","r":"联想记忆：做面包（bread）的工人汗滴（bead）如雨下"},
23331:{"w":"malt","e":"A bottle of 15-year-old malt whisky is taken out by the hostess to entertain her guests.","t":"女主人拿出一瓶15年陈酿的**麦芽**威士忌招待客人。"},
23332:{"w":"augment","e":"Cities today are competing for the best talent that can augment the productivity of their economy.","t":"今天的各个城市正在争夺可以**提高**经济生产率的最优秀人才。","r":"词根记忆：aug（增加）+ment（表名词）→增加","d":"augmentation（n. 增加）"},
23333:{"w":"agile","e":"Contrary to the traditional idea, many interviewers prefer candidates with agile minds to those with high marks at universities.","t":"与传统观点相反，许多面试官更喜欢思维**敏捷**的求职者，而不是那些在大学取得高分的人。","r":"词根记忆：ag（做）+ile（…的）→做得快的→敏捷的"},
23334:{"w":"tribal","e":"At the first sight of tribal arts and dress on the island, tourists will certainly be attracted.","t":"当游客第一眼看到岛上的**部落**艺术和服饰时，就一定会被其吸引。","r":"来自tribe（n. 部落）"},
23335:{"w":"precede","e":"If people were to precede the comprehensive notion of environmental protection, species would not face the situation of becoming extinct any more.","t":"如果人类**早些**对环境保护有一个全面的概念，就不会有更多物种面临灭绝的危险了。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+ced（行走）+e→向前走→先于"},
23336:{"w":"alleviate","e":"An injection did little to alleviate Jane's pain after operation.","t":"注射药物并没有**缓解**简手术后的疼痛。","r":"词根记忆：al（表加强）+levi（变轻）+ate（表动词）→减轻"},
23337:{"w":"antibiotic","e":"Although an antibiotic can be used against infection, doctors won't persuade their patients to take it for a long time.","t":"虽然**抗菌素**可以用来防止感染，但医生并不建议病人长期服用。","r":"词根记忆：anti（抗）+bio（生命）+tic（…的）→抗菌的","c":"antibiotic medicine 抗菌药"},
23338:{"w":"overexploit","e":"Many valuable natural resources, like coal and oil, are on the verge of exhaustion because people are overexploiting them.","t":"由于人们**过度开采**，像煤和石油之类宝贵的自然资源正濒临枯竭。"},
23339:{"w":"grill","e":"Our leader grilled us about why we were absent from the evening party after the meeting.","t":"我们领导**盘问**我们为什么缺席会议之后的晚会。"},
23340:{"w":"inculcate","e":"Chinese parents try to inculcate a sense of social responsibility in their children when they are still young.","t":"中国的父母在孩子很小的时候就试图向他们**灌输**一种社会责任感。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+culc（踩踏）+ate（表动词）→为进入某人内心而踩踏→反复灌输","c":"inculcate sb. with a sense of responsibility 谆谆教导某人要有责任感"},
23341:{"w":"brutal","e":"It was not the first time to report the brutal treatment towards prisoners by the troops.","t":"这已经不是第一次报道军队**虐**待战俘的情况了。","r":"来自brute（adj. 残忍的）","c":"brutal attack 残忍的攻击","d":"brutality（n. 残酷，兽行）","y":"cruel（adj. 残忍的；兽性的）；bestial（adj. 野兽的，兽性的；残忍的）；feral（adj. 野蛮的，凶猛的）"},
23342:{"w":"avenge","e":"Study shows that some people are likely to avenge society once they are treated unequally.","t":"研究发现，一些人一旦受到不公平的待遇，就很可能**报复**社会。","r":"词根记忆：a（表加强）+venge（报仇）→报仇","y":"revenge（v. 复仇）"},
23343:{"w":"invasive","e":"Ecologists are concerned that the invasive species has spread rapidly through local rivers, threatening native fish and plants.","t":"生态学家担心这种**入侵**物种已在当地河流中迅速蔓延，威胁着本地的鱼类和植物。","r":"词根记忆：in（入内）+vas（走）+ive（…的）→未经许可就进入的→入侵的","c":"invasive cancer 扩散性肿瘤；invasive surgery 开刀手术"},
23344:{"w":"upgrade","e":"With the increase in terrorist attacks, more and more international airports plan to upgrade the safety check systems.","t":"随着恐怖主义袭击的增加，越来越多的国际机场计划**升级**安检系统。","r":"组合词：up（向上）+grade（等级）→使升级，提高；提拔，提升；改善","y":"improve（v. 改善，改进）"},
23345:{"w":"commute","e":"Eventually, it is predicted that many people may be able to work at home instead of commuting to the office in the future.","t":"据预测，在未来许多人最终可以在家办公，而不用乘公交**往返上下班**。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+mut（改变）+e→以一物改变另一物→交换","d":"commuter（n. 上下班往返的人；通勤者）","y":"compensate（v. 偿还，补偿）"},
23346:{"w":"legislative","e":"The United Nations has taken new legislative measures to stem the flow of weapons into the developing countries.","t":"联合国已采取新的**立法**措施来阻止武器流入发展中国家。","c":"legislative assembly 立法议会；legislative powers 立法权；legislative changes 立法变革"},
23347:{"w":"differentiate","e":"The main aim of the management course is to teach us how to differentiate primary work from secondary work in the office.","t":"该管理课程的主要目的是教我们如何**区分**首要工作和次要工作。","r":"词根记忆：dif（分开）+fer（搬运）+ent（…的）+iate（表动词）→分开搬运→差别对待","d":"differentiation（n. 区别，差别）","y":"discriminate（v. 区别；歧视）"},
23348:{"w":"sentient","e":"Because animals are living and sentient beings, they deserve special protection and respect.","t":"动物是活生生、**有知觉**的生物，它们应该受到特殊的保护和尊重。","r":"词根记忆：senti（=sent，感觉）+ent（…的）→有感觉能力的"},
23349:{"w":"pour","e":"Old customers pour out of the shopping centres cheering wildly at the weekends.","t":"周末，老顾客欢欣雀跃地从购物中心**蜂拥**而出。","r":"联想记忆：穷（poor）困潦倒（pour）"},
23350:{"w":"hook","e":"Paul hooked his tractor to the car and pulled it to safety.","t":"保罗把他的拖拉机**挂**在那辆小汽车上，然后把它拖到安全的地方。","r":"联想记忆：书（book）在手，月如钩（hook）","c":"hook up with sb. 与某人来往"},
23351:{"w":"tighten","e":"During that special period, everyone must tighten their belt as a result of national income and foreign trade stagnation.","t":"在那段特殊时期，由于国内收益和国外贸易的停滞，每个人都要**勒紧**腰带过日子。","r":"联想记忆：tight（紧的）+en（使…）→（使）变紧","c":"tighten up 变得更加严格"},
23352:{"w":"humane","e":"A series of campaigns for the humane treatment of wildlife has been launched throughout the world in recent years.","t":"近年来，全世界发起了一连串的宣传**善**待野生生物的活动。","r":"词根记忆：hum（人）+ane（…的）→有人性的→仁慈的"},
23353:{"w":"infiltrate","e":"Many companies want their new employees to quickly adapt themselves to working environment and infiltrate corporate culture.","t":"许多公司希望新员工很快适应工作环境并**融入**企业文化。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+filtr（=filter，过滤）+ate→使过滤→渗透","d":"infiltration（n. 潜入；渗透）；infiltrator（n. 潜入者；渗入"},
23354:{"w":"violate","e":"The legislative should take measures to prevent the mass media from violating the public's privacy.","t":"立法机构应该采取措施制止大众媒体**侵犯**人们的隐私。","d":"violation（n. 违反）"},
23355:{"w":"glacier","e":"Glacier Bay, located in southeast Alaska, United States, is a narrow inlet of the Pacific Ocean which runs from northwest to southeast for about 105 kilometers.","t":"**冰川**湾，位于美国阿拉斯加东南部，是太平洋的一个狭窄入海口，它自西北流向东南，全长约105公里。","r":"词根记忆：glac（冰）+ier（表物）→冰川"},
23356:{"w":"hereditary","e":"Albinism is a hereditary disease, which can be visible when the recessive gene does work.","t":"白化病是一种**遗传性**疾病，当隐性基因表现出来时就会发病，显示症状。","r":"词根记忆：heredit（=hered，继承）+ary（…的）→遗传的","c":"hereditary title 世袭的头衔；hereditary rulers 世袭统治者"},
23357:{"w":"insidious","e":"Hypertension is usually an insidious disease which has few symptoms in the early stage.","t":"高血压通常是一种**潜伏性**疾病，早期几乎没有症状。","r":"词根记忆：in（进入）+sid（坐）+ious（…的）→坐在里面的→潜伏的"},
23358:{"w":"discharge","e":"Thousands of marine organisms were murdered as a result of a discharge of toxic wastes from a nearby chemical factory.","t":"附近一个化工厂**排出**的有毒废料造成数以千计海洋生物的死亡。","r":"联想记忆：dis（分离）+charge（职责；电荷）→解雇；放（电）","c":"discharge one's responsibilities/obligations 履行责任/义务"},
23359:{"w":"refrain","e":"The survey finds that the majority of people can refrain from smoking in public places such as theaters and museums.","t":"调查发现，在剧院和博物馆这类公共场所大多数人能够**克制**住不抽烟。","r":"词根记忆：re（向后）+frain（笼头）→笼头往后→抑制","c":"refrain from 克制","y":"restrain（vt. 抑制，控制）；abstain（vi. 戒除）","f":"indulge（v. 纵容，放纵）"},
23360:{"w":"supportive","e":"Children can often do better at school for they have supportive parents.","t":"有父母的**支持**，孩子们在学校常常会表现得更好。","r":"来自support（vt. 支持，拥护；赞助）"},
23361:{"w":"accustom","e":"If you go abroad for further study, it will take a period of time for you to accustom yourself to the new environment, the new culture and all the new rules and regulations.","t":"如果你出国留学，那么你需要花上一些时间让自己**习惯**新的环境、新的文化和所有新的规则与制度。","r":"词根记忆：ac（表加强）+custom（风俗，习惯）→使成为习惯→使习惯于"},
23362:{"w":"inalienable","e":"From my point of view, childbirth is the inalienable right of female employees who work in private companies.","t":"在我看来，生孩子是在私企工作的女性员工**不可剥夺**的权利。","r":"词根记忆：in（不）+alienable（可转让的）→不可转让的→不可剥夺的"},
23363:{"w":"savour","e":"Every day, people should afford a short moment to savour the gain and loss of the whole day before going to bed.","t":"每天，人们都应该在睡觉前抽出片刻来**品味**一天的得与失。","r":"联想记忆：品尝（savour）喜欢的味道（flavour）"},
23364:{"w":"pump","e":"The villagers were tired of getting water from several miles away, so they invented a machine for pumping groundwater.","t":"村民们厌倦了到几英里之外的地方打水，于是他们发明了一种可以**抽**地下水的机器。","c":"pump sth. into sb. 强行向某人灌输；pump sth. out 大量生产"},
23365:{"w":"astronomy","e":"Astronomy is an extensive science, which can connect with physics, optics and astrology.","t":"**天文学**是一门涉及广泛的科学，可以与物理学、光学和占星学相关联。","r":"词根记忆：astro（星星）+nomy（法则；学科）→研究星星的学科→天文学","d":"astronomical（adj. 天文学的；天文的）；astronomer（n. 天文学家）"},
23366:{"w":"hazardous","e":"The acid rain in big cities can be hazardous to the environment where people live and their health.","t":"大城市中的酸雨会**危害**人们生活的环境以及他们的健康。","r":"联想记忆：hazard（危险）+ous（…的）→危险的","c":"hazardous waste 有害废物"},
23367:{"w":"segregate","e":"It is necessary to segregate two groups of fans in the stadium, in case of unnecessary fights after the game.","t":"为了避免赛后不必要的争斗，将体育场的两部分球迷**隔开**是非常必要的。","r":"词根记忆：se（分开）+greg（组，群）+ate（使…）→使和群体分开→隔离","c":"segregate from 与…隔离","d":"segregated（adj. 隔离的）；segregation（n. 隔离）","y":"isolate（vt. 使隔离，使孤立）；separate（v. 分开，隔离）","f":"unite（v. 联合）"},
23368:{"w":"tillable","e":"Scientists have found that tillable lands have declined sharply in recent years due to global warming.","t":"科学家发现，近年来由于全球变暖，**可耕种**土地骤减。","r":"联想记忆：till（耕作，犁地）+able（能…的）→适宜耕种的，可耕种的"},
23369:{"w":"overgraze","e":"Once the grassland is overgrazed, the vegetation will be damaged and the ground will become liable to erosion.","t":"一旦草地遭到**过度放牧**，就会导致植被受损，土壤易于流失。","r":"组合词：over（过度）+graze（放牧）→过度放牧"},
23370:{"w":"embody","e":"As a rule, if you want to write a good essay, you'd better list some relevant examples embodying the gist.","t":"通常，如果你想写出好文章，你最好列举一些**体现**文章主旨的相关例子。","r":"联想记忆：em（使…）+body（身体）→使身体显现出来→使具体化","y":"contain（vt. 包含，容纳）；incarnate（vt. 使具体化）"},
23371:{"w":"reciprocate","e":"Generally speaking, people will reciprocate the kindness that has been shown to them before.","t":"一般而言，人们会**回报**之前受到的恩惠。"},
23372:{"w":"moribund","e":"There is a big problem for that country at present that how the economy can be revived from its present moribund state.","t":"该国眼下的一个大难题是经济如何从**濒临崩溃**的状态中走向复苏。","r":"词根记忆：mori（死）+bund（=bound，边界）→在死亡边缘的→垂死的"},
23373:{"w":"isolated","e":"Old people could easily become a socially isolated group, so they should keep moving and maintain interaction with the outside world.","t":"老年人很容易变成与社会**脱节**的一个群体，所以他们应该不断前进并保持与外界的互动。","r":"来自isolate（vt. 使分离）","y":"remote（adj. 偏远的）"},
23374:{"w":"modish","e":"Nowadays, there is an interesting phenomenon that some bygone fashions, such as mini-skirt, become modish again.","t":"如今，一个有趣的现象是一些过去的时尚再度**流行**开来，如迷你裙。","r":"词根记忆：mod（模式）+ish（有…性质的）→最新模式的→流行的"},
23375:{"w":"maltreat","e":"It is necessary for the government to make relevant laws to punish people who maltreat domestic animals.","t":"政府有必要制定相关法律来惩罚**虐待**家养动物的人。","r":"词根记忆：mal（坏）+treat（对待）→虐待"},
23376:{"w":"disobey","e":"To question or disobey the law is tantamount to destroying the authority of the law.","t":"质疑或**违抗**法律，等同于摧毁法律的权威。","r":"联想记忆：dis（不）+obey（服从）→不服从，违抗"},
23377:{"w":"versatile","e":"Because honey is versatile and not expensive, it is widely used in every aspect of our daily life.","t":"蜂蜜具有**多种功能**且价格不贵，因此被广泛应用于日常生活的各个方面。","r":"词根记忆：vers（转）+atile→玩得转的→多才多艺的","c":"portable and versatile inspection tool 便携式多功能检测工具","d":"versatility（n. 多才多艺；多功能性）；versatilely（adv. 多才多艺地；多功能地）","y":"all-round（adj. 多方面的，多才多艺的）"},
23378:{"w":"grudge","e":"Owing a grudge against somebody or something consumes one's energies and finally accomplishes nothing at all.","t":"对某个人或某件事记**仇**会耗费一个人的精力，到最后一无所获。","c":"hold grudges 心存怨恨；a grudge match 一场旗鼓相当的比赛"},
23379:{"w":"pretentious","e":"The writer wrote a book review in pretentious language to express his biased criticism.","t":"该作者写了一篇书评，言语间满是**自负**，表达了相当偏执的评论意见。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+tent（伸展）+ious（…的）→向前伸展的→炫耀的"},
23380:{"w":"enlist","e":"At present, tens of thousands of volunteers are being enlisted all over the country to serve the approaching Winter Olympics.","t":"目前，正在全国范围内**招募**成千上万的志愿者，为即将到来的冬奥会服务。","r":"联想记忆：en（进入…之中）+list（名单）→进入（军队）名单→征募；参军"},
23381:{"w":"curb","e":"The effective measure to curb the spread of the virus is keeping the computer off.","t":"**控制**病毒传播最有效的方法就是不开电脑。"},
23382:{"w":"elaboration","e":"After the homework has been discussed, the teacher explains the topic of the lesson, slowly and with a lot of repetition and elaboration.","t":"讨论完作业之后，教师会缓慢地、反复**精细**地讲解这节课的主题。","r":"词根记忆：e（表加强）+labor（工作）+ation（表状态）→精细化工作→精心之作"},
23383:{"w":"snobbish","e":"In current society, some people are very snobbish, who'd like to make friends only with people of wealth and of high social status.","t":"在当今社会，有些人非常**势利**，他们只愿意与有钱和社会地位高的人交朋友。","r":"来自snob（n. 势利小人，谄上欺下者；自命不凡的人）"},
23384:{"w":"magnet","e":"Paris has always played a role of a magnet to attract people to seek romance and true love.","t":"巴黎一直扮演着一个**磁铁**一样的角色，不断吸引着想要寻找浪漫和真爱的人们。"},
23385:{"w":"prevalence","e":"The illness on neck, which used to bother the elderly, is of prevalence among young office workers nowadays.","t":"过去常常烦扰老年人的颈椎病现在**盛行**于年轻的上班族之中。","r":"词根记忆：pre（前）+val（强壮的）+ence（表名词）→在前面发展得很强壮→普及"},
23386:{"w":"bleak","e":"The future looks bleak for the fishing industry.","t":"渔业前景**暗淡**。","r":"联想记忆：寒（bleak）风呼啸而过，打破（break）黑夜的沉寂","c":"bleak wind 寒风；bleak prospect 前景暗淡","y":"cold（adj. 冷淡的）；raw（adj. 阴冷的）；dismal（adj. 阴沉的，凄凉的）"},
23387:{"w":"ecliptic","e":"There is an angle between the ecliptic plane and the equatorial plane which is called the obliquity of the ecliptic.","t":"**黄道**面与赤道面之间有一个夹角被称为黄赤交角。","r":"来自eclipse（n. 日食，月食）"},
23388:{"w":"vicious","e":"A group of tourists suffered a vicious attack by a gang of local people.","t":"一群旅游者遭到一帮当地流氓的**恶意**攻击。","r":"来自vice（n. 罪行；堕落，邪恶）","c":"vicious circle 恶性循环；a vicious criminal 一个残忍的罪犯","d":"viciously（adv. 恶毒地；剧烈地）；viciousness（n. 恶毒；严重）","y":"savage（adj. 野蛮的；凶猛的；残忍的）；malicious（adj.怀恶意的，恶毒的）；spiteful（adj. 怀恨的，恶意的）"},
23389:{"w":"begrudge","e":"The rich, who saw their income slashed, did begrudge sharing their gains with the poor.","t":"那些发现自己的收入大幅减少的富人对与穷人分享收益表示**不满**。"},
23390:{"w":"diffuse","e":"Nowadays, the Internet has become a powerful means of diffusing knowledge and information instead of television.","t":"如今，互联网已取代电视成为**传播**知识和信息的有力媒介。","r":"词根记忆：dif（分开）+fus（流）+e→分开流走→扩散","d":"diffusion（n. 扩散；传播）；diffused（adj. 普及的）；diffuser（n. 扩散器）","y":"wordy（adj. 冗长的）"},
23391:{"w":"compartment","e":"Passengers are advised to keep their luggage in the overhead compartment rather than leaving it in the aisle.","t":"建议乘客把行李放在头顶上方的行李**隔间**里，不要放在过道上。","c":"smoking compartment（火车内的）吸烟室"},
23392:{"w":"apprenticeship","e":"A number of young people leave home to serve an apprenticeship in the factories.","t":"许多年轻人离开家去工厂当**学徒**。","r":"联想记忆：apprentice（学徒）+ship（表身份）→学徒身份"},
23393:{"w":"statutory","e":"When we buy foods we have certain statutory rights.","t":"在购买食物时，我们有一定的**法定**权利。","r":"词根记忆：stat（立）+ut+ory（有…性质的）→设立后不动的→法定的","c":"statutory public holiday 法定假日"},
23394:{"w":"hygienic","e":"It isn't hygienic to let the bird stand on the dining table.","t":"让鸟站在餐桌上是不**卫生**的。","c":"hygienic circumstances 卫生情况"},
23395:{"w":"standstill","e":"Traffic was at a standstill.","t":"交通**停滞**了。","r":"组合词：stand（站立）+still（静止的，不动的）→站着不动→停滞"},
23396:{"w":"erratic","e":"This clock is so erratic that it makes me late for school.","t":"这个闹钟太**不准**了，以至于我上学都迟到了。","r":"词根记忆：err（漫游，走）+atic（属于…的）→在某地徘徊的→反复无常的"},
23397:{"w":"wicked","e":"Of course, at the end of the story, the wicked witch gets killed.","t":"当然，**邪恶**的女巫在故事的最后被杀死了。"},
23398:{"w":"repercussion","e":"The closure of the factory had serious repercussions for the whole town, where many families lost their only income.","t":"工厂倒闭给整个小镇带来了严重的**后果**，那里许多家庭失去了唯一的收入来源。","r":"联想记忆：re（回）+percussion（震动）→震动回来的余震→后果","c":"important repercussions 重要的影响"},
23399:{"w":"geometrical","e":"The geometrical pattern is very beautiful.","t":"这个**几何**图案非常漂亮。","r":"来自geometry（n. 几何）","c":"geometrical construction 几何结构"},
23400:{"w":"conspicuous","e":"One conspicuous feature of Mary's character is her independence.","t":"玛丽性格中一个非常**显著**的特点就是独立。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+spic（看）+uous（…的）→（被人）看了又看的→显眼的"},
23401:{"w":"pivotal","e":"The pivotal decision of the mayor may make a great impact on the whole city.","t":"市长做出的**关键**决策可能对整个城市产生深远的影响。","r":"be pivotal to... …的核心；pivotal figure 关键人物"},
23402:{"w":"recurring","e":"Some scientists believe one can control recurring bad dreams.","t":"一些科学家认为一个人可以控制**反复**做的噩梦。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+curr（=cur，发生）+ing（…的）→重新发生的→再次发生的","c":"a recurring problem 一个反复出现的问题"},
23403:{"w":"morale","e":"Throughout the wilderness, post bands provided entertainment and boosted morale.","t":"四周一片荒芜，哨所乐队提供了娱乐，鼓舞了**士气**。","r":"联想记忆：和moral（n. 道德）一起记","c":"raise morale 提高士气"},
23404:{"w":"retention","e":"Most people are against the retention of the nuclear weapons.","t":"大多数人反对**持有**核武器。","r":"词根记忆：re（重新）+ten（拿住）+tion（表名词）→重新拿住→保留"},
23405:{"w":"allergy","e":"If you're not sure what's triggering your allergic cough, your doctor can give you a skin test or blood test to pinpoint the allergy.","t":"如果你不能确定是什么引发了过敏性咳嗽，你的医师可以为你进行皮肤或血液的测试来确定**过敏**原。","d":"allergic（adj. 过敏的；对…十分反感的）"},
23406:{"w":"conservatory","e":"My grandmother grows tomatoes and orchids in a small conservatory attached to the back of her house.","t":"我奶奶在房子后面连着的一间小**温室**里种番茄和兰花。","r":"联想记忆：conserv(e)（保存）+atory（表场所，地点）→用来保存的地方→温室，玻璃暖房"},
23407:{"w":"sway","e":"For centuries the empire held sway over much of the region, controlling its trade routes and ports.","t":"几个世纪以来，这个帝国**统治**着该地区的大部分地方，控制着那里的贸易路线和港口。","r":"under the sway of 深受…的影响"},
23408:{"w":"animated","e":"He became more animated.","t":"他变得更加**活泼热情**。","r":"词根记忆：anim（生命）+ated→有生命的→生气勃勃的","c":"an animated dog 一只活泼的小狗","y":"lively（adj. 活泼的）"},
23409:{"w":"overrun","e":"His speech was boring and overran the time limit.","t":"他的演讲很枯燥并且**超过**了规定的时间。","r":"联想记忆：over（过度）+run（跑）→跑过了头→超过"},
23410:{"w":"whim","e":"Lisa had a sudden whim to go shopping today.","t":"今天丽莎**一时兴起**，想要去逛街。","c":"be seized by a whim 心血来潮"},
23411:{"w":"rectify","e":"Now we have a chance to rectify it, and we must take action.","t":"现在，我们有机会**改正**它，我们必须行动起来。","r":"词根记忆：rect（直）+ify（使…）→使变直→纠正，矫正"},
23412:{"w":"outskirts","e":"Hours later we reached the outskirts of New York.","t":"几个小时之后，我们到达了纽约的**郊区**。","r":"联想记忆：out（出，外）+skirt（位于…的边缘）+s→城市周边→市郊"},
23413:{"w":"squander","e":"Don't squander your time and money in reading those science fiction books.","t":"不要把你的时间和金钱**浪费**在看那些科幻小说上。","r":"联想记忆：squand（看作squad，军队）+er→军队杜绝浪费→浪费"},
23414:{"w":"sweeping","e":"The Arts and Crafts Movement was responsible for sweeping changes in attitudes toward the decorative arts.","t":"艺术和手工运动使人们对装饰艺术的态度**彻底**改变了。","r":"a sweeping reinvention 一场彻底的重塑"},
23415:{"w":"contend","e":"The executives contend that their products appeal to diverse market segments.","t":"管理人员**称**他们的产品满足了不同的市场需求。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+tend（伸展）→一起伸展（个人观点）→主张"},
23416:{"w":"liability","e":"Since his injury, Jones has become more of a liability than an asset to the team.","t":"琼斯负伤以来，与其说他是全队的骨干，倒不如说他已成为队里的**累赘**。","r":"联想记忆：li（音似：离）+ability（能力）→离开能力，很麻烦→麻烦的人（或事物）"},
23417:{"w":"aliment","e":"Fresh milk was once regarded as the most important aliment for growing children in many farming villages.","t":"在许多农村，新鲜牛奶曾被视为成长中孩子最重要的**滋养品**。","c":"green aliment 绿色食物"},
23418:{"w":"countless","e":"In the face of countless failures, he refused to quit.","t":"面对着**无数**次的失败，他拒绝放弃。","r":"词根记忆：count（计数）+less（不…的）→数不清的"},
23419:{"w":"rhetoric","e":"Students in the writing course learn how to use rhetoric to make their arguments more persuasive.","t":"写作课上的学生学习如何运用**修辞**使论证更有说服力。","r":"联想记忆：rhetor（修辞学大师）+ic（…学，…术）→修辞","c":"empty rhetoric 空洞的花言巧语；the rhetoric of political slogans 政治口号的虚华辞藻"},
23420:{"w":"venerate","e":"They venerate the image of the heroine, which is both a religious and cultural symbol.","t":"他们把那个女英雄的形象作为宗教和文化的象征来**崇拜**。"},
23421:{"w":"rehearse","e":"We rehearse only one night a week.","t":"我们一周只**排练**一晚上。","r":"联想记忆：re（再，又）+hear（听）+se→导演在一旁一遍遍听、看她们排练→排练","d":"rehearsal（n. 排练，排演）"},
23422:{"w":"implicit","e":"The doctor gave an implicit answer.","t":"医生给出了一个**含蓄**的回答。","r":"词根记忆：im（加以）+plic（重叠）+it→（意义）叠在里面→含蓄的"},
23423:{"w":"underlie","e":"Social problems and poverty underlie much of the crime in some big cities.","t":"社会问题和贫穷是一些大城市中很多犯罪行为的**基础**。"},
23424:{"w":"prompt","e":"Bob's dislike for hot weather prompted him to move north.","t":"鲍勃不喜欢炎热的天气，这**促使**他迁往北方。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+mpt（=empt，拿）→向前拿→促进，推动","d":"promptly（adv. 迅速地）"},
23425:{"w":"explicit","e":"The directions Jane gave me to get to her home were very explicit.","t":"简十分**清楚**地给我指路去她家。","r":"词根记忆：ex（出）+plic（重叠）+it→把重叠在一起的都展示出来→清楚的"},
23426:{"w":"molecular","e":"The picture shows a molecular cloud.","t":"这个图片显示的是**分子**云。","r":"联想记忆：molecul(e)（分子）+ar→分子的","c":"molecular structure 分子结构"},
23427:{"w":"looming","e":"Through the thick fog, the climbers could just make out the looming shape of the mountain ahead.","t":"透过浓雾，登山者勉强能看清前方山峰**隐隐约约**的轮廓。","c":"the looming crisis 迫在眉睫的危机"},
23428:{"w":"secrete","e":"This substance is secreted from cells in the intestinal walls.","t":"这种物质是从肠壁的细胞中**分泌**出来的。","r":"联想记忆：他把那封秘密（secret）信件藏（secrete）在角落里","d":"secretion（n. 分泌，分泌物）"},
23429:{"w":"elude","e":"The mice eluded the traps fortunately.","t":"老鼠侥幸地**逃脱**了老鼠夹。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+lud（玩）+e→想出去玩→避开"},
23430:{"w":"stroll","e":"Jenny and her husband were strolling along, laughing and joking.","t":"珍妮和她丈夫在悠闲地**散着步**，开心地说笑着。","y":"saunter（vi. 闲逛）；wander（vi. 漫步）"},
23431:{"w":"refurbishment","e":"The museum will be closed for six months during the refurbishment of its main exhibition hall.","t":"在主展厅**重新装修**期间，博物馆将闭馆六个月。","r":"联想记忆：re（一再）+furbish（磨光）+ment（表名词）→一再磨光→重新装修","c":"closed for refurbishment 停业装修"},
23432:{"w":"observatory","e":"A group of students will pay a visit to the ancient observatory this week.","t":"本周，一群学生将参观这座古老的**天文台**。","r":"联想记忆：observ(e)（观察）+atory（表地点）→可以观察的地点→天文台"},
23433:{"w":"stunning","e":"She looks absolutely stunning!","t":"她看上去**漂亮**极了！"},
23434:{"w":"ceremonial","e":"The mounds served as ceremonial and trading sites, and at times they were used as burial grounds.","t":"这片土丘用来作为举办**典礼**或者进行交易的场地，有时也被用作墓地。"},
23435:{"w":"immortal","e":"Li Bai is an immortal poet.","t":"李白是**流芳百世**的诗人。","r":"词根记忆：im（不）+mort（死）+al（…的）→长生的，不朽的"},
23436:{"w":"neural","e":"Scientists are studying how neural signals travel from the brain to the muscles when we move.","t":"科学家正在研究我们运动时**神经**信号如何从大脑传到肌肉。","r":"词根记忆：neur（神经）+al（…的）→神经的","c":"neural processes 神经系统的作用"},
23437:{"w":"bullying","e":"The school has introduced new rules to stop bullying, and students can now report problems to a teacher anonymously.","t":"学校出台了制止**欺凌**行为的新规定，学生现在可以匿名向老师反映问题。","c":"school bullying 校园霸凌"},
23438:{"w":"ingest","e":"It is known to develop in individuals with peptic disease who ingest large amounts of calcium-carbonate-based antacids.","t":"那些**服用**大量碳酸钙类抗酸药的人会患上消化类疾病。","r":"词根记忆：in（向内）+gest（带来）→带进去→咽下"},
23439:{"w":"bothersome","e":"It may feel a little bothersome in the beginning, but that goes away when you start seeing how this tiny habit can affect your life.","t":"也许这在开始时比较**麻烦**，不过当你开始看到这种小习惯能对你的人生产生影响时就不会有这种感觉了。","r":"联想记忆：bother（麻烦）+some（引起…的）→引起麻烦的"},
23440:{"w":"entangle","e":"I became entangled in a lawsuit.","t":"我**卷入**了一桩诉讼中。","c":"entangle in 卷入…"},
23441:{"w":"cosmetics","e":"Many cosmetics companies now avoid testing their products on animals because customers increasingly object to the practice.","t":"由于顾客越来越反对动物实验，许多**化妆品**公司现在不再用动物测试产品。","c":"cosmetics bag 化妆包"},
23442:{"w":"remnant","e":"Most astronomers agree that comets are primordial remnants from the formation of the solar system.","t":"多数天文学家认为彗星是太阳系形成时产生的原始**残余物**。","r":"词根记忆：remn（留下）+ant（…物）→剩余物"},
23443:{"w":"stranding","e":"Marine biologists are investigating the stranding of over forty whales on a beach in southern Australia last week.","t":"海洋生物学家正在调查上周四十多头鲸在澳大利亚南部一处海滩**搁浅**的事件。","c":"lead to stranding and death 导致搁浅和死亡"},
23444:{"w":"virtual","e":"Customers can design and order clothes directly from the virtual shops now.","t":"现在，顾客可以直接从**虚拟**商店设计和定做服装。","c":"virtual reality 虚拟现实","d":"virtually（adv. 实际上，事实上）"},
23445:{"w":"abject","e":"Millions of families in the region still live in abject poverty, without clean water or basic health care.","t":"该地区数以百万计的家庭仍生活在**悲惨**的贫困之中，没有清洁的饮用水和基本的医疗保健。","c":"abject failure 惨败"},
23446:{"w":"aboriginal","e":"This group of aboriginal people used to live in the tribe.","t":"这些**土著**人过去生活在部落中。","r":"联想记忆：ab（表加强）+original（最初的）→原始的；土著的","c":"aboriginal culture 土著文化"},
23447:{"w":"acclimatize","e":"After a couple of days to acclimatize yourself, you'll start the trek on Day Three walking through the enormous Katiba Forest which will take the whole of the day.","t":"让自己**适应**几天之后，第三天你要开始花费一整天来徒步穿越庞大的卡提巴森林。","c":"acclimatize oneself to 使适应/习惯…"},
23448:{"w":"veteran","e":"As a veteran of twenty years in the newsroom, she trains young reporters to check every fact carefully.","t":"作为在新闻编辑部工作了二十年的**老手**，她培训年轻记者仔细核实每一个事实。","c":"veteran employee 经验丰富的员工"},
23449:{"w":"capability","e":"This work is beyond my capability.","t":"这项工作超出了我的**能力**范围。","r":"词根记忆：cap（拿住）+abil（=able，能…的）+ity（表名词）→有能力拿住→能力","c":"research capability 研究能力"},
23450:{"w":"uptake","e":"Regular exercise can improve the body's uptake of oxygen and help the heart work more efficiently.","t":"经常锻炼可以提高身体对氧气的**吸收**，帮助心脏更高效地工作。","c":"oxygen uptake 耗氧量，摄氧量"},
23451:{"w":"variable","e":"The decision involves a large number of variables with complex relationships.","t":"这个决定涉及很多关系复杂的**变量**。","r":"词根记忆：vari（改变）+able（能…的）→能改变的→可变的","c":"a number of variables 许多变数"},
23452:{"w":"awareness","e":"Your awareness may be powerful enough to control your instincts.","t":"你的**意识**也许足够强，能控制住自己的本能。","r":"来自aware（adj. 知道的，意识到的）","c":"self awareness 自知；heightened awareness 增强的意识"},
23453:{"w":"auditory","e":"The car accident last year hurt the girl's auditory nerves.","t":"去年的那场车祸使女孩的**听觉**神经受损了。","r":"词根记忆：audit（听）+ory（…的）→听觉的","c":"auditory channel 听觉途径；auditory problem 听觉问题"},
23454:{"w":"case","e":"Take an umbrella with you in case of rain.","t":"带把伞吧，**以防**下雨。","c":"in all cases 在所有情况下；in case of 万一，如果"},
23455:{"w":"dissonant","e":"The dissonant noise of car horns and drilling made it impossible to concentrate in the office.","t":"汽车喇叭和钻机发出的**刺耳**噪音让人在办公室里根本无法集中精神。","r":"词根记忆：dis（不）+son（声音）+ant（…的）→不同声音的→不和谐的","c":"dissonant music 刺耳的音乐"},
23456:{"w":"entrench","e":"The man entrenched himself in the business.","t":"这个人在生意上**站住了脚**。","c":"be entrenched in 使处于牢固地位"},
23457:{"w":"artistic","e":"We'll see many artistic works depicting the major events of her life.","t":"我们将看到很多描写她一生主要事件的**艺术**作品。","r":"词根记忆：art（艺术）+istic（属于…的）→富有艺术性的","c":"artistic expression 艺术表现；artistic genres 艺术流派；artistic style 艺术风格"},
23458:{"w":"championship","e":"By a tantalizing quirk of fate, the pair have been drawn to meet in the first round of the championship.","t":"由于命运的捉弄，这对选手被抽中在**锦标赛**的第一轮相遇。","r":"联想记忆：champion（冠军）+ship（表名词）→冠军地位","c":"national championship 全国锦标赛"},
23459:{"w":"financial","e":"The government introduced new rules to protect the financial system after several banks collapsed during the crisis.","t":"在危机中几家银行倒闭后，政府出台了新规来保护**金融**体系。","r":"来自finance（n. 财政，金融）","c":"financial burden 财政负担；financial meltdown 金融危机；financial metrics 财务指标；financial support 财政支持"},
23460:{"w":"historical","e":"Historical linguists study how languages evolve over time.","t":"**历史**语言学家研究的是随着时间的流逝语言是如何演变的。","c":"historical framework 历史构架；historical relics 历史遗迹"},
23461:{"w":"idyllic","e":"They spent an idyllic summer in a small village surrounded by green fields and quiet streams.","t":"他们在一个被绿色田野和静静溪流环绕的小村庄度过了一个**闲适恬静**的夏天。","r":"来自idyll（n. 田园诗）","c":"idyllic blue ocean 平和美丽的蓝色大海"},
23462:{"w":"agricultural","e":"Rising temperatures and long droughts are reducing agricultural production in many parts of Africa.","t":"气温上升和长期干旱正在使非洲许多地区的**农业**生产减少。","r":"来自agriculture（n. 农业）","c":"agricultural crop 农作物；agricultural vehicle 农用车辆"},
23463:{"w":"chronological","e":"Please arrange these books on the shelf in chronological order.","t":"请按照**年代顺序**将书架上的书整理好。","r":"词根记忆：chron（时间）+olog(y)（…学）+ical（…的）→按时间顺序排列的","c":"in chronological order 按时间顺序；chronological development 按时间顺序发展"},
23464:{"w":"immediate","e":"The new manager took immediate action to reduce costs after learning that the company was losing money.","t":"新经理得知公司在亏损后，**立即**采取行动削减成本。","r":"词根记忆：im（无）+medi（中间）+ate（…的）→省去中间过程的→立刻的","c":"in the immediate future 在不远的将来","d":"immediately（adv. 立即，马上；直接地）"},
23465:{"w":"martial","e":"After the riots, the government declared martial law and sent soldiers into the streets of the capital.","t":"骚乱发生后，政府宣布实施**军事**管制，并派士兵进入首都街头。","c":"martial music 军乐"},
23466:{"w":"immerse","e":"Please immerse the vegetables in water for three minutes before washing them.","t":"洗菜之前，先把蔬菜放在水中**浸泡**3分钟。","r":"词根记忆：im（向内）+mers（没）+e→向内浸→使浸没于","c":"immerse in 潜心于某事，专心于某事"},
23467:{"w":"adept","e":"Jack was adept at horse riding and enjoyed other outdoor activities.","t":"杰克非常**精于**骑马，而且也喜欢其他户外运动。","r":"词根记忆：ad（表加强）+ept（能力）→有能力的→精通的","c":"be adept at 擅长…"},
23468:{"w":"cognitive","e":"The study showed that cognitive behavioral therapy has clinical value.","t":"研究表明，**认知**行为疗法具有一定的临床价值。","r":"词根记忆：cogn（知道）+itive（…的）→认识的","c":"cognitive and neurological systems 认知和神经系统；cognitive behaviour 认知行为"},
23469:{"w":"logical","e":"The apartment's room arrangement was not logical.","t":"公寓房间的格局不**合理**。","r":"来自logic（n. 逻辑；逻辑学）","c":"logical consistency 逻辑连贯性；logical thinking 逻辑思维"},
23470:{"w":"unpredictable","e":"Their major discovery illustrated how unpredictable consequences can come from rather modest beginnings.","t":"他们的重要发现表明了貌似平常的初始是如何产生**预想不到**的结果的。","r":"联想记忆：un（不）+predict（预言）+able（能…的）→无法预言的","c":"unpredictable noise 不可预测的噪音"},
23471:{"w":"marvel","e":"Visitors to the ancient temple often marvel at how its builders moved such huge stones without modern machines.","t":"参观这座古庙的游客常常**惊叹**于建造者如何在没有现代机械的情况下搬运如此巨大的石块。","r":"联想记忆：mar（毁坏）+vel（音似：well，好）→遭到彻底的毁坏再重建好→奇迹","c":"architectural marvels 建筑奇迹；marvel at 对…感到惊奇"},
23472:{"w":"rational","e":"The boss made a rational decision in the end.","t":"老板最终做出了**合理**的决定。","c":"rational determination 理性判断","d":"rationale（n. 根本原因；基本原理）"},
23473:{"w":"religious","e":"The festival has deep religious roots, but today it is celebrated by people of all faiths and backgrounds.","t":"这个节日有着深厚的**宗教**根源，但如今各种信仰和背景的人都会庆祝它。","c":"religious chant 圣歌；religious matter 宗教问题"},
23474:{"w":"accustomed","e":"I'm not accustomed to using a gas stove.","t":"我不**习惯**使用煤气炉。","r":"词根记忆：ac（表加强）+custom（习惯）+ed（…的）→惯常的","c":"get accustomed to 习惯于"},
23475:{"w":"collaborate","e":"I hope your department could collaborate with me on the new project.","t":"我希望你们部门能够在新项目上**配合**我工作。","r":"词根记忆：col（共同）+labor（工作）+ate（表动词）→协作，合作","c":"collaborate with... 与…合作"},
23476:{"w":"expenditure","e":"In the face of the inflation, local government is also reducing expenditure.","t":"面对通货膨胀，地方政府也在降低**支出**。","r":"联想记忆：expend（花费）+iture（表名词）→花费","c":"overall tourism expenditure 旅游总支出"},
23477:{"w":"impartial","e":"A judge must be fair and impartial to everybody.","t":"法官必须公平**公正**地对待每一个人。","r":"联想记忆：im（不）+partial（偏爱的）→不偏爱哪一边的→中立的","c":"impartial view 公正的看法"},
23478:{"w":"satisfaction","e":"What he has done is far from satisfaction.","t":"他所做的远不能令人**满意**。","r":"词根记忆：satis（饱足）+faction（表达到的状态）→满足","c":"visitor satisfaction 游客满意度"},
23479:{"w":"operation","e":"The rescue operation continued through the night as firefighters searched the collapsed building for survivors.","t":"救援**行动**持续了一整夜，消防员在倒塌的大楼里搜寻幸存者。","r":"词根记忆：oper（工作）+ation（表名词）→工作的状态→运行","c":"manufacturing operation 生产作业；salvage operation 救助行动"},
23480:{"w":"executive","e":"Kate, a former teacher, is now an executive for a charity.","t":"凯特从前是一位教师，现在是一个慈善团体**管理者**。","c":"marketing executive 市场总监"},
23481:{"w":"increase","e":"The number of students choosing to study abroad has increased sharply over the past ten years.","t":"过去十年里，选择出国留学的学生人数大幅**增长**。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+creas（增长）+e→（使）增长","c":"increase day length artificially 人工增加日照长度；increase smallholder vulnerability 增加小农场主的脆弱性"},
23482:{"w":"package","e":"The packages were delivered to the wrong place.","t":"这些**包裹**被送错地方了。","r":"词根记忆：pack（包装）+age（表名词）→包裹","c":"travel package 包价旅游"},
23483:{"w":"interweave","e":"Do as I told you and interweave these two pieces of cloth together.","t":"按我说的做，把这两块布**编织**在一起。","r":"联想记忆：inter（相互）+weave（编织）→编织在一起→交织","c":"interweave with 与…交织/混杂"},
23484:{"w":"mimic","e":"People have always been fascinated by the parrot's ability to mimic human speech.","t":"人们向来对鹦鹉**模仿**人类说话的能力惊叹不已。","c":"mimic human abilities 模仿人类的能力；mimic one's actions模仿某人的行为"},
23485:{"w":"collective","e":"The decision, made by the board of directors, is the result of collective agreement.","t":"董事会做出的决定是**集体**同意的结果。","r":"词根记忆：col（共同）+lect（收集）+ive（…的）→为生活而一起去收集食物→集体的","c":"collective accomplishment 集体成就；collective agreement 集体协议"},
23486:{"w":"relationship","e":"Researchers have found a close relationship between the amount of sleep students get and their exam results.","t":"研究人员发现，学生的睡眠时间与考试成绩之间有着密切的**关系**。","r":"联想记忆：relation（关系）+ship（表名词，某种关系）→关系","c":"ever-shifting relationship 千变万化的关系；interpersonal relationship 人际关系"},
23487:{"w":"scientific","e":"This morning I want to tell you about a recent scientific discovery dealing with the relation between plants and animals.","t":"今天上午我想告诉你们关于动植物关系的一项新近的**科学**发现。","r":"词根记忆：sci（知道）+ent（…的）+ific（…的）→知道很多的→科学的","c":"scientific progress 科学的进步"},
23488:{"w":"mutate","e":"Scientists warn that the virus could mutate into a much deadlier form.","t":"科学家们警告，该病毒可能**变异**成更致命的形式。","r":"词根记忆：mut（改变）+ate（表动词）→转变","c":"mutate into 转化成"},
23489:{"w":"perceptual","e":"The study shows that people's perceptual and filtering processes will create misunderstandings.","t":"研究显示人们的**感知**和过滤过程会产生误解。","c":"perceptual decision 感知判断；perceptual information 感知信息"},
23490:{"w":"terms","e":"These food species are not just special in terms of appearance or taste.","t":"这些食物品种不仅仅是在外观或味道**方面**有特别之处。","c":"in broad terms 宽泛地说，广义上讲；in terms of 就…而言；在…方面"},
23491:{"w":"regard","e":"The department is reviewing its policy with regard to immunization.","t":"该部门正在重新审查其**有关**免疫注射的政策。","c":"in this regard 在这方面；在这一点上；with regard to 关于，至于；regard...as... 把…认作…，把…当作…；be regarded as 被认为是"},
23492:{"w":"motor","e":"The small boat is powered by an electric motor, so it makes almost no noise on the lake.","t":"这艘小船由电动**马达**驱动，所以在湖上几乎没有噪音。","r":"词根记忆：mot（动）+or（表名词，物）→发动机","c":"motor circuits 发动机电路；motor vehicle 汽车，机动车辆"},
23493:{"w":"prevent","e":"Washing your hands regularly is one of the simplest ways to prevent the spread of infectious diseases.","t":"经常洗手是**阻止**传染病传播最简单的方法之一。","r":"词根记忆：pre（预先）+vent（来）→预先来阻止别人→阻止","c":"prevent desertification 阻止沙漠化；prevent sb. from doing sth. 阻止某人做某事"},
23494:{"w":"master","e":"The exhibition displays more than fifty paintings by Dutch masters of the seventeenth century.","t":"这次展览展出了五十多幅17世纪荷兰**大师**的画作。","c":"master craftsman 工艺大师；master's degree 硕士学位"},
23495:{"w":"convict","e":"The jury convicted the man, and he was sentenced to twenty years in prison.","t":"陪审团给此人**定罪**，他被判入狱20年。","r":"词根记忆：con（表加强）+vict（征服）→完全征服→定罪","c":"convict of... 证明（判定）有…罪"},
23496:{"w":"eradicate","e":"The campaign aims to eradicate illiteracy, which was also a part of basic education.","t":"这个活动旨在**消除**文盲，这也是基础教育工作的一部分。","r":"词根记忆：e（出）+radic（根）+ate（使…）→使连根拔出→根除","c":"eradicate famine 消除饥荒"},
23497:{"w":"ingenious","e":"By such ingenious adaptations to specific pollinators, orchids have avoided the hazards of rampant crossbreeding in the wild.","t":"通过**巧妙**地适应特定的传粉昆虫，兰花避免了在野外杂交泛滥的危险。","r":"词根记忆：in（使…）+gen（产生）+ious（…的）→有产生能力的→善于创造发明的","c":"a truly ingenious invention 一项的确新颖的发明"},
23498:{"w":"department","e":"If you have any questions about your visa, please contact the international students department of the university.","t":"如果你对签证有任何疑问，请联系大学的留学生**部门**。","r":"词根记忆：de（向下）+part（分开）+ment（表组织、机构）→向下分成各个部分→部门","c":"education department 教育部；教育系"},
23499:{"w":"programme","e":"They had a meeting to set up the programme.","t":"他们开会启动了**项目**。","c":"television programmes 电视节目"},
23500:{"w":"instruction","e":"The students must follow all instructions exactly.","t":"学生必须准确遵守所有的**指示**。","r":"联想记忆：instruct（指示）+ion（表名词）→指示","c":"obey instructions 服从命令"},
23501:{"w":"communal","e":"Students living in the hall share a communal kitchen, where they often cook and eat together in the evenings.","t":"住在宿舍楼里的学生共用一个**公共**厨房，晚上他们常在那里一起做饭吃饭。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+mun（公共的）+al（…的）→公共的","c":"communal activity 公共活动；communal decision-making 公共决策"},
23502:{"w":"narrative","e":"The novel's narrative moves back and forth between the present day and the narrator's childhood in Ireland.","t":"这部小说的**叙述**在现今与叙述者在爱尔兰的童年之间来回切换。","r":"来自narrate（v. 叙述）","c":"narrative history 叙述史"},
23503:{"w":"dependent","e":"Many small island nations are heavily dependent on tourism, so a fall in visitors can damage their economies.","t":"许多小岛国严重**依赖**旅游业，因此游客减少会损害它们的经济。","r":"联想记忆：depend（依靠）+ent（…的）→依靠的","c":"be dependent on/upon 依赖，依靠；取决于"},
23504:{"w":"spectacle","e":"The opening ceremony was a magnificent spectacle of music, dance and fireworks watched by millions around the world.","t":"开幕式是一场由音乐、舞蹈和烟火组成的盛大**表演**，全世界有数百万人观看。","r":"词根记忆：spect（看）+acle（表名词）→引人驻足观看→奇观","c":"astronomical spectacle 天文奇观"},
23505:{"w":"psychological","e":"Losing a job can have serious psychological effects, such as anxiety and low self-esteem.","t":"失业可能带来严重的**心理**影响，比如焦虑和自卑。","r":"词根记忆：psycho（心理）+logical（…学的）→心理学的","c":"psychological factor 心理因素；psychological illness 心理疾病；psycholo-gical principle 心理学原理；psychological test 心理测试"},
23506:{"w":"communicate","e":"Good teachers communicate clearly with their students and encourage them to ask questions in class.","t":"好老师会和学生清楚地**沟通**，并鼓励他们在课堂上提问。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+mun（公共的）+icate（表动词）→大家公开交谈→交流","c":"communicate with... 与…联系，与…交流"},
23507:{"w":"motif","e":"The cloth was dyed with abstract plant and animal motifs.","t":"那块布被染上了抽象的动植物**图案**。","c":"animal motif 动物图案；salient motif 重要主题"},
23508:{"w":"outrage","e":"This murder provoked outrage across the country.","t":"这起凶杀案在全国范围内激起了**愤慨**。","r":"词根记忆：out（过分）+rage（疯狂）→过分疯狂→愤慨"},
23509:{"w":"competitive","e":"Tom is very competitive and always wants to finish first, even in friendly games with his classmates.","t":"汤姆很**好胜**，即使是和同学玩友谊游戏也总想拿第一。","r":"词根记忆：com（共同）+pet（力争）+itive（…的）→大家力争的→竞争性的","c":"competitive global market 竞争激烈的全球市场"},
23510:{"w":"protect","e":"Wearing sunglasses can protect your eyes from the harmful ultraviolet rays of the sun.","t":"戴太阳镜可以**保护**你的眼睛免受太阳有害紫外线的伤害。","r":"词根记忆：pro（在前）+tect（盖上）→从前面盖上→保护","c":"protect sb. from sth. 保护某人不受某事物的伤害"},
23511:{"w":"stray","e":"The little girl who strayed from home four days ago has not yet been found.","t":"那个四天前从家**走失**的小女孩还没找到。","c":"stray away 偏离"},
23512:{"w":"spontaneous","e":"When the singer appeared on stage, the crowd burst into spontaneous applause before she had sung a note.","t":"歌手一出现在舞台上，还没开口唱，观众就**自发**地鼓起掌来。","r":"词根记忆：spont（承诺）+aneous（有…特征的）→发自（内心）的承诺→自发的","c":"spontaneous criticism 自发批评"},
23513:{"w":"symbolic","e":"Many paintings are rich in symbolic overtones.","t":"许多画作富有**象征**寓意。","c":"symbolic meaning 象征意义"},
23514:{"w":"means","e":"Plants can defend themselves by using both physical and chemical means.","t":"植物可以通过物理以及化学的**方法**保护自己。","c":"by means of 借助…手段，依靠…方法；by no means 绝不，一点也不；by any means 无论如何"},
23515:{"w":"temptation","e":"You should resist the temptation of the food.","t":"你要抵制住食物的**诱惑**。","r":"词根记忆：tempt（尝试）+ation（表名词）→受到诱惑想要尝试→诱惑","c":"overwhelming temptation 无法抗拒的诱惑力"},
23516:{"w":"struggle","e":"Millions of people are struggling for survival.","t":"数百万人为了生存而**奋斗**。","c":"struggle with... 与…斗争"},
23517:{"w":"devoid","e":"The hot air was devoid of even the slightest amount of moisture.","t":"热空气中**全无**一丝水分。","r":"词根记忆：de（表加强）+void（空）→全无的","c":"devoid of 缺乏，没有"},
23518:{"w":"prospect","e":"Mary is one of the best prospects for this position.","t":"玛丽是这个职位最有希望的**候选人**之一。","r":"词根记忆：pro（向前）+spect（看）→向前看→前景","c":"job prospect 就业前景"},
23519:{"w":"intricate","e":"A city is more intricate than a village.","t":"城市比村庄更加**错综复杂**。","r":"联想记忆：in（在…里面）+tric（妨碍）+ate→里面有障碍的→错综复杂的","c":"intricate decorative sculpture 精雕细刻的装饰性雕塑"},
23520:{"w":"radical","e":"Radical views will burn your fingers.","t":"**激进**的观点会让你吃苦头的。","r":"词根记忆：radic（根）+al（…的）→根本的","c":"radical changes 根本变革"},
23521:{"w":"prone","e":"Ross is prone to lose her temper when people disagree with her.","t":"别人和罗斯意见一有不同，她就**容易**发脾气。","c":"be prone to 倾向于…；易于…的"},
23522:{"w":"strive","e":"We encourage all staff to strive for the highest standards.","t":"我们鼓励所有员工为达到最高标准而**努力**。","c":"strive for 争取"},
23523:{"w":"dictate","e":"The manager dictated a letter to his secretary.","t":"经理向他的秘书**口述**一封信函。","r":"词根记忆：dict（断言）+ate（表动词）→决定","c":"dictate price 定价","d":"dictation（n. 口述；听写）"},
23524:{"w":"prosecute","e":"The man was prosecuted for murder.","t":"这个人因谋杀罪而被**起诉**。","r":"词根记忆：pro（在前）+secut（跟随）+e→跟随法官在他面前告状→控告","c":"prosecute criminal activity 控告犯罪活动"},
23525:{"w":"reflect","e":"They must reflect on their own political interest.","t":"他们必须**仔细考虑**他们的政治利益。","r":"词根记忆：re（向后）+flect（弯曲）→光线向后弯曲→反射","c":"reflect on 认真思考；沉思"},
23526:{"w":"triumph","e":"I learned that courage was not the absence of fear, but the triumph over it.","t":"我认为拥有勇气并不代表没有恐惧，而是**战胜**恐惧。","r":"联想记忆：胜利（triumph）之后吹喇叭（trump）","c":"a sense of triumph 成就感"},
23527:{"w":"regulation","e":"Anyone who violates the regulations must be punished.","t":"任何违反**规定**的人都要受到惩罚。","c":"full-scale regulation 全面管制；traffic regulation 交通规则"},
23528:{"w":"liable","e":"He is liable to be punished as a violator.","t":"他**可能**因为违规而受罚。","r":"词根记忆：li（=lig，捆绑）+able（能…的）→能被捆绑的→有责任的","c":"be liable to... 易于…的；有…倾向的"},
23529:{"w":"sort","e":"David doesn't like the movie which is sort of boring.","t":"大卫不喜欢这部**有点**无聊的电影。","c":"sort out 把…分门别类；sort through 整理"},
23530:{"w":"proposition","e":"The proposition is so clear that it needs no explanation.","t":"这个**论点**很明确，不需要解释。","c":"value proposition 价值主张"},
23531:{"w":"stubborn","e":"Henry was too stubborn to admit what he did was wrong.","t":"亨利太**顽固**，不承认自己做错了。","c":"stubborn question 顽固的问题"},
23532:{"w":"treasure","e":"The man amassed great treasure during these years.","t":"这个人在这些年里积累了大量的**金银财宝**。","c":"treasure trove 无主财宝；宝藏"},
23533:{"w":"confidential","e":"The old man was accused of leaking national confidential information to foreign countries.","t":"这个老头因为向国外泄露国家**机密**而被指控。","c":"confidential matters 保密事项"},
23534:{"w":"contingent","e":"Our plans for the weekend trip are contingent on the weather, so we will decide on Friday.","t":"我们周末出游的计划**取决于**天气，所以星期五再作决定。","r":"词根记忆：con（共同）+ting（接触）+ent（…的）→（根据）大家接触到的情况而定→依情况而定的","c":"be contingent on... 依…而定"},
23535:{"w":"statistical","e":"The company provides reliable statistical information about population and households for all parts of the country.","t":"该公司为全国各个地区提供可靠的人口及家庭**统计**信息。","c":"statistical measurement 统计计量","d":"statistically（adv. 统计上地）"},
23536:{"w":"surrender","e":"I'd rather make the gravest of mistakes than surrender my own judgment.","t":"我宁可酿成大错，也不愿**放弃**自己的判断。","r":"词根记忆：sur（下）+render（递交）→把放在下面的东西交上去→交出","c":"surrender individual properties 上交个人财产"},
23537:{"w":"disabled","e":"He got disabled during the war.","t":"他在战争中落下了**残疾**。","r":"来自disable（v. 使丧失能力）","c":"disabled driver 伤残驾驶者"},
23538:{"w":"masterpiece","e":"The artist contributed all his life to the completion of a great masterpiece.","t":"这位艺术家毕其一生来完成一部伟大的**杰作**。","r":"组合词：master（大师）+piece（一件作品）→杰作","c":"acclaimed masterpiece 受赞誉的杰作"},
23539:{"w":"solitary","e":"After his wife died, the old man led a solitary life in a small cottage at the edge of the forest.","t":"妻子去世后，老人在森林边的一间小屋里过着**孤独**的生活。","r":"词根记忆：sol（单独）+it（走）+ary（…的）→自己单独走的→孤独的","c":"solitary confinement 单独监禁"}
});
